            ['start_time'=>1295.68,'end_time'=>1300.14,'target_text'=>'Now, we\'re going to have uh common mistakes section.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, kita akan ada bahagian kesilapan lazim.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1300.24,'end_time'=>1305.1,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re going to go through some common mistakes English learners usually make.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita akan lihat beberapa kesilapan yang selalu dilakukan oleh pelajar Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1305.2,'end_time'=>1308.1,'target_text'=>'And at the very end, we\'ll have a final shadowing segment.','source_text'=>'Dan di penghujung sekali, kita akan ada segmen bayangan terakhir.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1308.2,'end_time'=>1309.9,'target_text'=>'So, make sure you stick around.','source_text'=>'Jadi, pastikan anda terus menonton.','order'=>356],
