            ['start_time'=>143.76,'end_time'=>144.46,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never seen that.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah nampak macam tu.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>144.56,'end_time'=>147.58,'target_text'=>'But anyway, they were asking for a lot of photos, so yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa-apa pun, mereka minta banyak gambar, jadi ya.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>147.68,'end_time'=>151.62,'target_text'=>'I mean, I don\'t really see a lot of kings or emperors out here in the drip.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, tak selalu nampak raja atau maharaja berkeliaran dengan gaya macam ni.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>151.72,'end_time'=>155.66,'target_text'=>'And a lot of people have been calling me Wang Li or something like that.','source_text'=>'Dan ramai orang panggil saya Wang Li atau panggilan yang seumpamanya.','order'=>53],
