            ['start_time'=>177.8,'end_time'=>183.38,'target_text'=>'Now, this is really uneven and you can easily roll your ankle, I imagine, because it\'s not like it\'s not perfect, you know?','source_text'=>'Lantai ni memang sangat tak rata dan awak boleh terseliuh buku lali dengan mudah, saya rasa, sebab ia tidak sempurna, kan?','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>183.48,'end_time'=>183.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>184.08,'end_time'=>185.9,'target_text'=>'>> So, let\'s describe my outfit a little bit.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi, jom kita huraikan pakaian saya sikit.','order'=>63],
