            ['start_time'=>270.64,'end_time'=>279.98,'target_text'=>'So, now you can start with the 3,000 word PDF, continue with the next 2,000 word PDF, or get both together as the full 5,000','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang anda boleh mulakan dengan PDF 3,000 perkataan, teruskan dengan PDF 2,000 perkataan seterusnya, atau dapatkan kedua-duanya sekali sebagai set lengkap 5,000','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>280.08,'end_time'=>286.42,'target_text'=>'most common English words PDF that will allow you to understand up to 98%','source_text'=>'perkataan Bahasa Inggeris paling lazim dalam PDF yang akan membolehkan anda memahami sehingga 98%','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>286.52,'end_time'=>287.86,'target_text'=>'of spoken English.','source_text'=>'daripada pertuturan Bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>287.96,'end_time'=>295.02,'target_text'=>'And in these new versions, there are now images as well to help you learn even faster.','source_text'=>'Dan dalam versi baharu ini, ada gambar disertakan sekali untuk membantu anda belajar dengan lebih pantas.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>295.12,'end_time'=>305.38,'target_text'=>'Each PDF includes clear definitions, real examples, and simple organization to help you stop studying random words and focus','source_text'=>'Setiap PDF merangkumi definisi yang jelas, contoh sebenar, dan susunan mudah untuk membantu anda berhenti belajar perkataan rawak dan fokus','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>305.48,'end_time'=>308.74,'target_text'=>'on the vocabulary that actually matters.','source_text'=>'pada kosa kata yang benar-benar penting.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>308.84,'end_time'=>313.6,'target_text'=>'You can get them from the link in the description or at volkaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh dapatkannya melalui pautan di ruangan deskripsi atau di volkaenglish.com.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>313.84,'end_time'=>314.5,'target_text'=>'>> We\'ll walk through here.','source_text'=>'>> Kita akan berjalan melalui sini.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>314.6,'end_time'=>320.18,'target_text'=>'There\'ll probably be a lot of people wanting to get photos cuz before filming, there was like a lot of people asking.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada ramai orang yang nak bergambar sebab sebelum merakam tadi, ada ramai orang yang minta.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>320.28,'end_time'=>321.14,'target_text'=>'Like a lot of like young kids.','source_text'=>'Banyak budak-budak muda.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>321.24,'end_time'=>323.06,'target_text'=>'I think it was like a whole field trip.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa macam satu rombongan sekolah penuh.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>323.16,'end_time'=>325.26,'target_text'=>'Like a classroom of kids one after another.','source_text'=>'Macam satu kelas budak-budak, seorang demi seorang.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>325.36,'end_time'=>326.86,'target_text'=>'Photo, photo, photo, photo, photo.','source_text'=>'Gambar, gambar, gambar, gambar, gambar.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>326.96,'end_time'=>328.82,'target_text'=>'>> Do you mind if they ask you for a photo?','source_text'=>'>> Awak kisah tak kalau mereka minta bergambar?','order'=>107],
