            ['start_time'=>815.04,'end_time'=>815.2,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Rasanya lebih sihat dinikmati kecuali kandungan gulanya dan yang ini bukan jenis bebas gula.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>815.2,'end_time'=>819.1,'target_text'=>'It tastes like healthier >> except for the sugar and it\'s not sugar-free.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini sifar kalori.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>819.2,'end_time'=>820.3,'target_text'=>'>> It is zero calorie.','source_text'=>'Minuman botani herba.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>820.4,'end_time'=>821.58,'target_text'=>'Botanical beverage.','source_text'=>'Mak cuba rasa.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>821.68,'end_time'=>823.64,'target_text'=>'Try it.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>824.56,'end_time'=>824.8,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Itu memang rasa teh herba asli.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>824.8,'end_time'=>825.74,'target_text'=>'That\'s just tea.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa herba yang sangat enak.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>825.84,'end_time'=>827.98,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s some good tast.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya ada sedikit aroma herba segar.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>828.08,'end_time'=>830.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it tastes like little herby.','source_text'=>'>> Saya memang sukakannya.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>830.16,'end_time'=>830.56,'target_text'=>'>> I love this.','source_text'=>'Masa pertama kali mereka belanja saya minum, saya terfikir, wah, korang memang minum minuman sedap betul di sini.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>830.64,'end_time'=>834.86,'target_text'=>'The first time they showed me, I was like, damn, y\'all drinking good for real, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya ke?','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>834.96,'end_time'=>835.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, really?','source_text'=>'Maklumlah, rasanya memang sangat sedap.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>835.68,'end_time'=>836.22,'target_text'=>'You know, >> it\'s delicious.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya 10 tin lagi.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>836.32,'end_time'=>837.02,'target_text'=>'Give me 10 more.','source_text'=>'>> Biar saya teka.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>837.12,'end_time'=>837.82,'target_text'=>'>> Let me take a guess.','source_text'=>'Siapa yang pilih air Tropicana ini?','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>837.92,'end_time'=>839.26,'target_text'=>'Who picked a Tropicana?','source_text'=>'>> Adakah awak yang pilih?','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>839.36,'end_time'=>840.38,'target_text'=>'>> Is that you?','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, saya tak pilih air tu.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>840.48,'end_time'=>842.78,'target_text'=>'>> No, >> I didn\'t pick >> that kid.','source_text'=>'Tetapi kita akan buat ujian rasa sebentar lagi.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>842.88,'end_time'=>844.62,'target_text'=>'But we will give it a taste test.','source_text'=>'>> Rupa airnya macam jus oren berkarbonat.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>844.72,'end_time'=>846.7,'target_text'=>'>> It just looks like carbonated orange juice.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>846.8,'end_time'=>848.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ini mungkin jus oren perisa tiruan.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>848.24,'end_time'=>849.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, it\'s probably fake orange juice.','source_text'=>'Ia cuma... oh, gas karbonatnya sangat kuat.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>849.76,'end_time'=>850.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s just >> Oh, it\'s so carbonated.','source_text'=>'>> Ia cuma perisa oren.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>850.96,'end_time'=>851.5,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s just orange.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, ini cuma air manis berperisa oren tiruan.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>851.6,'end_time'=>853.66,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s just sweet fake orange juice.','source_text'=>'>> Kawan, ini sebenarnya cuma air berperisa oren.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>853.76,'end_time'=>854.94,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, it\'s just flavored water.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>855.04,'end_time'=>855.44,'target_text'=>'>> Taste it.','source_text'=>'>> Macam air kosong yang ditambah sedikit perisa jus oren.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>855.52,'end_time'=>856.62,'target_text'=>'>> Like orange juice flavored water.','source_text'=>'Lebih baik beli jus oren perahan sebenar.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>856.72,'end_time'=>858.06,'target_text'=>'You can just buy real orange juice.','source_text'=>'>> Bila anda nampak jenama Tropicana, anda sedar jus oren itu bukan datang daripada buah pokok sebenar.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>858.16,'end_time'=>862.86,'target_text'=>'>> You see Tropicana, you\'re like >> that orange juice does not come from a tree.','source_text'=>'Ini jus yang dihasilkan dari makmal.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>862.96,'end_time'=>863.9,'target_text'=>'This comes from a lab.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa minuman ini memang teruk.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>864,'end_time'=>865.02,'target_text'=>'>> That is terrible.','source_text'=>'Minuman ini langsung tidak... mak bolehlah habiskan kalau mahu.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>865.12,'end_time'=>866.46,'target_text'=>'That does not you can have at it.','source_text'=>'>> Ia sememangnya minuman bergas.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>866.56,'end_time'=>867.66,'target_text'=>'>> It has to be carbonated.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>867.76,'end_time'=>868,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'Jadi air mineral inilah minuman nombor satu yang sepatutnya kita semua minum.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>868,'end_time'=>871.02,'target_text'=>'So, this is the number one beverage we should all be drinking.','source_text'=>'>> Tolong bagi mak minum seteguk nanti ya.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>871.12,'end_time'=>872.54,'target_text'=>'>> Give me a sip after, please.','source_text'=>'>> Maklumlah.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>872.64,'end_time'=>873.18,'target_text'=>'>> I know.','source_text'=>'Sebab itu saya beli botol bersaiz besar.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>873.28,'end_time'=>874.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s why I bought a big one.','source_text'=>'Saya dapati di sini tidak banyak tong sampah disediakan sebab saya terpaksa mencari tong sampah.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>874.64,'end_time'=>878.54,'target_text'=>'I find there\'s not enough garbage cans cuz I have to like look.','source_text'=>'>> Beli kopi dari gerai kereta tolak di sana tu.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>878.64,'end_time'=>880.14,'target_text'=>'>> Get a coffee from that cart right there.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tetapi saya dah minum dua cawan kopi hari ini.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>880.24,'end_time'=>881.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but I\'ve had two coffees already.','source_text'=>'Dan mak tahu peraturan saya.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>881.92,'end_time'=>882.94,'target_text'=>'And you know my rules.','source_text'=>'>> Cawan pertama tadi cuma separuh cawan sahaja.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>883.04,'end_time'=>884.54,'target_text'=>'>> Now, one coffee was half a coffee.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang awak kena minum kopi Vietnam yang sebenar.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>884.64,'end_time'=>886.14,'target_text'=>'So, now you have to >> actually coffee.','source_text'=>'Kopi tradisional Vietnam.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>886.24,'end_time'=>887.18,'target_text'=>'Vietnamese coffee.','source_text'=>'>> Nak beli kopi ke?','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>887.28,'end_time'=>887.68,'target_text'=>'>> Coffee?','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>887.68,'end_time'=>888.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Nak kopi?','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>888.4,'end_time'=>888.86,'target_text'=>'>> Coffee?','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>888.96,'end_time'=>889.36,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Awak pesan kopi apa tadi?','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>889.44,'end_time'=>890.22,'target_text'=>'>> What did you get?','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kopi Robusta bersama susu pekat manis.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>890.32,'end_time'=>894.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s uh condensed milk with uh rausta coffee.','source_text'=>'>> Apa benda tu?','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>894.72,'end_time'=>895.26,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s that?','source_text'=>'>> Adakah itu jenis biji kopi yang mereka gunakan di sini?','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>895.36,'end_time'=>897.1,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a very Is >> that the type of coffee they have here?','source_text'=>'>> Itu adalah jenis biji kopinya.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>897.2,'end_time'=>897.9,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s the bean.','source_text'=>'>> Oh.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>898,'end_time'=>898.46,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'>> Vietnam sangat terkenal dengan pengeluaran biji kopi Robusta.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>898.56,'end_time'=>901.02,'target_text'=>'>> Vietnam is known for its rausta coffee.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah sejenis biji kopi yang mempunyai rasa yang sangat pekat dan kuat.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>901.12,'end_time'=>903.66,'target_text'=>'That is a very strong coffee bean.','source_text'=>'Jauh lebih kuat berbanding biji kopi Arabica di mana kami biasa minum Arabica di Ecuador.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>903.76,'end_time'=>907.26,'target_text'=>'Stronger than Arabica where we have Arabica in Ecuador.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>907.36,'end_time'=>907.6,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu tengok video di TikTok orang melancong ke sini dan bila mereka cuba kopi Vietnam, mata mereka terus membulat segar bertenaga.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>907.6,'end_time'=>912.54,'target_text'=>'I always see like Tik Toks of people traveling and then they try the Vietnamese coffee and they\'re just like wired.','source_text'=>'Mereka rasa degupan jantung mereka berdegup kencang dan mata mereka terbeliak luas menahan kekuatan kafeinnya.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>912.64,'end_time'=>917.66,'target_text'=>'They\'re like >> they do this thing where your heart just >> they\'re just like like eyes like wide open and stuff.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>917.76,'end_time'=>918.08,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Saya sebenarnya tidak berapa gemar minum kopi, jadi saya mungkin kurang meminati rasa kopi ini.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>918.08,'end_time'=>920.14,'target_text'=>'I really don\'t like coffee, so I\'m not going to like this.','source_text'=>'Tetapi bila berada di Vietnam, anda wajib mencuba kopi tempatannya.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>920.24,'end_time'=>924.78,'target_text'=>'But >> I think when you\'re in Vietnam, you have to drink the coffee.','source_text'=>'>> Ada banyak gula di dalamnya.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>924.88,'end_time'=>925.82,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s a lot of sugar on it.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya suka rasanya.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>925.92,'end_time'=>927.02,'target_text'=>'I think I do like it.','source_text'=>'Saya baru sahaja rasa kemanisan gula pekatnya.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>927.12,'end_time'=>928.78,'target_text'=>'I just taste I just tasted pure sugar.','source_text'=>'>> Kopi masin (salted coffee) ini diletakkan satu lapisan krim di bahagian atasnya.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>928.88,'end_time'=>932.54,'target_text'=>'>> So the salted coffee gets a layer of cream on top of it.','source_text'=>'Rasanya memang sangat sedap.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>932.64,'end_time'=>933.94,'target_text'=>'It is so good.','source_text'=>'[ketawa]','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>934.04,'end_time'=>935.66,'target_text'=>'[laughter]','source_text'=>'>> Taklah, rasanya memang sedap.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>935.76,'end_time'=>936.54,'target_text'=>'>> No, it was good.','source_text'=>'Memang sedap.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>936.64,'end_time'=>937.18,'target_text'=>'It was good.','source_text'=>'>> Ia mempunyai profil rasa yang sangat unik dan berbeza.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>937.28,'end_time'=>938.54,'target_text'=>'>> It It just has a different taste.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sungguh lazat.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>938.64,'end_time'=>939.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s delicious.','source_text'=>'Kopi Vietnam memang sangat luar biasa sedap.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>939.36,'end_time'=>940.78,'target_text'=>'Vietnamese coffee is really good.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya sedap, tapi mak bolehlah habiskan cawan ini.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>940.88,'end_time'=>942.7,'target_text'=>'>> It was good, but you could have it.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu mak memang teringin nak minum.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>942.8,'end_time'=>943.9,'target_text'=>'I know you wanted to.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, mak minum sedikit saja lagi dan selebihnya untuk awak.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>944,'end_time'=>945.82,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I was going to take I won\'t take anymore.','source_text'=>'Semua bahagian ini untuk awak.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>945.92,'end_time'=>946.78,'target_text'=>'All yours.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan berjalan ke bawah.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>946.88,'end_time'=>948.14,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep walking down.','source_text'=>'Berjalan menyusuri kawasan French Quarter dan melihat serta meneroka lebih banyak perkara menarik.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>948.24,'end_time'=>952.94,'target_text'=>'Walking down the French Quarter and see and explore more things.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita sedang berjalan di atas laluan pejalan kaki (sidewalk) di sini, tetapi korang boleh nampak sebahagian besar laluan diambil oleh pokok-pokok gergasi ini.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>953.04,'end_time'=>960.7,'target_text'=>'Now we are walking on the sidewalk here, but you can see the majority of the sidewalk is being taken up by these huge trees.','source_text'=>'Batang pokok ini sangat besar dan akar-akarnya juga amat menjalar luas.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>960.8,'end_time'=>964.38,'target_text'=>'This tree truck is very big and the roots are massive as well.','source_text'=>'Korang tengok, betapa sempitnya ruang laluan yang kita ada di sini.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>964.48,'end_time'=>966.38,'target_text'=>'Like look, look how much room we have here.','source_text'=>'Dan apabila anda berjalan lebih jauh ke hadapan, hampir tiada ruang langsung untuk berjalan kaki.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>966.48,'end_time'=>970.54,'target_text'=>'And then once you go further up, there\'s almost no room to walk.','source_text'=>'Bangunan di sebelah sini ialah Bank Negara (State Bank).','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>970.64,'end_time'=>973.42,'target_text'=>'This building right here is the state bank.','source_text'=>'Leon baru sahaja maklumkan kepada kami.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>973.52,'end_time'=>975.02,'target_text'=>'Leon just informed us.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita hampir meneroka sebahagian besar kawasan French Quarter ini.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>975.12,'end_time'=>978.86,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ve pretty much almost explored, you know, the majority of the French Quarter.','source_text'=>'Kawasannya tidaklah terlalu besar sangat, kan?','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>978.96,'end_time'=>980.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s not huge, right?','source_text'=>'>> Tak terlalu besar.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>980.64,'end_time'=>980.96,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Tetapi kawasannya memang sangat cantik.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>980.96,'end_time'=>982.3,'target_text'=>'But it\'s really pretty, though.','source_text'=>'Terdapat banyak kedai kopi dan kafe.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>982.4,'end_time'=>983.74,'target_text'=>'Lots of coffee shops.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>983.84,'end_time'=>984.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Hotel-hotel dan butik barangan mewah.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>984.56,'end_time'=>986.54,'target_text'=>'>> Hotels, high-end stores.','source_text'=>'Ia adalah kawasan yang lebih eksklusif dan selesa, saya akui.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>986.64,'end_time'=>988.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s the nicer area, I have to say.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>988.8,'end_time'=>989.12,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Keluasannya sekitar 20 blok bandar.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>989.12,'end_time'=>991.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s about 20 city blocks.','source_text'=>'Kira-kira begitulah saiz kawasannya.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>991.36,'end_time'=>993.02,'target_text'=>'That\'s about how big it is.','source_text'=>'Sebahagian besarnya dipenuhi dengan bangunan gaya seni bina Perancis seperti muzium, hotel-hotel,','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>993.12,'end_time'=>998.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s mostly filled with like French style buildings like museums, hotels,','source_text'=>'rumah-rumah tinggalan era kolonial lama dan juga banyak butik mewah serta pusat beli-belah mewah.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>998.96,'end_time'=>1005.02,'target_text'=>'like old colonial houses and also a lot of like luxury stores and luxury like malls.','source_text'=>'Jadi jika anda mahu membeli barangan berjenama mewah maka anda boleh datang ke French Quarter, tetapi anda perlu bawa duit yang banyak.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1005.12,'end_time'=>1010.46,'target_text'=>'So if you want to buy like luxury goods then I guess you can come to the French Quarter >> but you need to bring money.','source_text'=>'>> Anda perlu bawa kad kredit yang mencukupi.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1010.56,'end_time'=>1012.46,'target_text'=>'>> You need to bring a credit card.','source_text'=>'Kenapa kawasan ini sangat berdebu dan berhabuk?','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1012.56,'end_time'=>1014.22,'target_text'=>'Why is it so dusty in this area?','source_text'=>'Adakah mereka sedang melakukan kerja-kerja pembinaan di sini?','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1014.32,'end_time'=>1015.98,'target_text'=>'Are they like working here or something?','source_text'=>'Semua kenderaan di tepi jalan ini dipenuhi habuk tebal.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1016.08,'end_time'=>1018.38,'target_text'=>'Like all these vehicles have a lot of dust on them.','source_text'=>'Tengok permukaan jalan raya ini.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1018.48,'end_time'=>1020.3,'target_text'=>'Look at the road.','source_text'=>'Jalannya sedang dikorek dan dibaiki.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1020.4,'end_time'=>1021.34,'target_text'=>'It is torn up.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa itulah punca banyaknya habuk berterbangan.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1021.44,'end_time'=>1023.42,'target_text'=>'So, I guess that\'s creating a lot of dust.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tidak suka habuk, terutamanya bila habuk melekat pada badan kerana ia akan terkena seluruh tubuh dan anda terpaksa','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1023.52,'end_time'=>1029.18,'target_text'=>'I really don\'t like dust, especially like getting dust on you cuz then it gets on your whole body and you have to like wash','source_text'=>'mandi membersihkan diri.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1029.28,'end_time'=>1029.68,'target_text'=>'yourself.','source_text'=>'Anda tidak boleh sekadar mengibasnya begitu sahaja.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1029.76,'end_time'=>1031.66,'target_text'=>'You can\'t just like dust it off, you know?','source_text'=>'Walaupun alangkah baiknya jika boleh dikibas begitu.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1031.76,'end_time'=>1032.94,'target_text'=>'Although that would be ideal.','source_text'=>'Tetapi ya, saya rasa sekarang kita semakin menghampiri kawasan Old Quarter (Kawasan Bandar Lama), kan?','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1033.04,'end_time'=>1036.7,'target_text'=>'But yeah, I think now we\'re getting more towards the old quarter, right?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, nampaknya kita sedang meninggalkan kawasan French Quarter dan semakin menuju ke kawasan Old Quarter.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1036.8,'end_time'=>1040.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it looks like >> we\'re kind of leaving the French Quarter and getting more towards the old quarter.','source_text'=>'Leon baru sahaja beritahu yang kita sebenarnya berada di pertengahan kawasan French Quarter sekarang.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1040.72,'end_time'=>1044.54,'target_text'=>'So, Leon just said we\'re kind of in the middle of the French Quarter right now.','source_text'=>'>> Pada asasnya keluasan French Quarter adalah sepanjang pesisir Tasik Hoan Kiem.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1044.64,'end_time'=>1048.38,'target_text'=>'>> Basically, the French Quarter is the length of the lake on Kim Lake.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1048.48,'end_time'=>1048.8,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi kedudukan kita sekarang berada di pertengahan tasik itu.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1048.8,'end_time'=>1051.42,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re about halfway up the lake right now.','source_text'=>'Maka kita berada di pertengahan kawasan French Quarter.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1051.52,'end_time'=>1053.58,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re about halfway through the French Quarter.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1053.68,'end_time'=>1053.92,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'Jadi apa yang Leon sedang buat sekarang, Mak?','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1053.92,'end_time'=>1056.06,'target_text'=>'So, what\'s Leon doing right now, Mom?','source_text'=>'>> Dia sedang mengeluarkan wang tunai.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1056.16,'end_time'=>1057.5,'target_text'=>'>> He\'s drawing money.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1057.6,'end_time'=>1057.84,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Leon pergi ke bank kerana dia perlukan mesin ATM untuk mengeluarkan wang tunai.','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1057.84,'end_time'=>1061.5,'target_text'=>'So, Leon went to the bank cuz he needed the ATM to withdraw money.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami sedang menunggunya di luar.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1061.6,'end_time'=>1063.02,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re waiting for him outside.','source_text'=>'Ibu saya sedang duduk di atas anak tangga menghabiskan minuman kopinya dan saya pula hanya berdiri kerana kawasan ini sangat berhabuk.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1063.12,'end_time'=>1069.5,'target_text'=>'My mom is just sitting on the step finishing her coffee and I\'m just standing because this area is very dusty.','source_text'=>'Saya tak mahu seluar saya kotor dipenuhi debu jika duduk di lantai.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1069.6,'end_time'=>1072.22,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t want to get my butt full of dust by sitting down.','source_text'=>'>> Awak pakai baju dan seluar hitam jadi habuk akan nampak jelas.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1072.32,'end_time'=>1077.34,'target_text'=>'>> You have black on so >> Yeah, I have black on so it\'ll be very noticeable if it gets dusty.','source_text'=>'Apakah aktiviti kegemaran mak setakat ini sepanjang berada di Hanoi?','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1077.44,'end_time'=>1080.22,'target_text'=>'What was your favorite activity so far in Hanoi?','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin aktiviti paling murah yang boleh dilakukan.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1080.32,'end_time'=>1082.86,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s probably the cheapest activity you can do.','source_text'=>'Iaitu menaiki teksi motosikal Grab Bike.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1082.96,'end_time'=>1086.22,'target_text'=>'It is taking a grab bike.','source_text'=>'Pengalamannya memang sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1086.32,'end_time'=>1087.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s been really fun.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1087.68,'end_time'=>1088.14,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi mak suka membonceng di bahagian belakang motosikal skuter.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1088.24,'end_time'=>1091.02,'target_text'=>'>> So, you like riding on the back of the scooters.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>484],
