            ['start_time'=>1180.64,'end_time'=>1182.14,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to get a grab.','source_text'=>'>> Ini sudah di penghujung video.','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>1182.24,'end_time'=>1183.42,'target_text'=>'>> Well, this is the end of the video.','source_text'=>'Jadi apakah bahagian kegemaran mak setakat ini?','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>1183.52,'end_time'=>1185.98,'target_text'=>'So, what was your favorite part up until now?','source_text'=>'>> Bahagian paling mak suka ialah melihat mak cik tadi membuat donat segar dan berpeluang menikmati donat panas itu.','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>1186.08,'end_time'=>1192.46,'target_text'=>'>> Um, my favorite part was probably watching the lady make the donuts and getting to try the donuts.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>1192.56,'end_time'=>1192.72,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Pengalaman itu memang sangat menyeronokkan.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>1192.72,'end_time'=>1193.9,'target_text'=>'Know, that was actually really nice.','source_text'=>'Dan mak cik peniaga itu sangat peramah.','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>1194,'end_time'=>1195.42,'target_text'=>'And she was like really nice.','source_text'=>'Dia sudi menunjukkan keseluruhan proses penyediaannya kepada kita.','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>1195.52,'end_time'=>1196.62,'target_text'=>'She was showing us all of it.','source_text'=>'Dia tidak boleh bertutur dalam Bahasa Inggeris, tetapi dia tetap cuba menerangkan dengan menunjukkan kepada kita.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>1196.72,'end_time'=>1201.58,'target_text'=>'She couldn\'t speak any English, but she was still trying to explain it by like, you know, >> showing us >> showing us.','source_text'=>'>> Menunjukkan kepada kita bahan-bahannya.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>1201.68,'end_time'=>1202,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>1202,'end_time'=>1205.5,'target_text'=>'>> Showing us the dough, showing us the filling, showing us how she makes it.','source_text'=>'>> Menunjukkan doh adunannya, menunjukkan intinya, dan menunjukkan bagaimana dia memasaknya.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>1205.6,'end_time'=>1206.3,'target_text'=>'So, >> yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya.','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>1206.4,'end_time'=>1207.18,'target_text'=>'No, that was really good.','source_text'=>'Itu memang pengalaman yang sangat menarik.','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>1207.28,'end_time'=>1207.82,'target_text'=>'That was really good.','source_text'=>'Pengalaman yang sungguh bermakna.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>1207.92,'end_time'=>1215.58,'target_text'=>'I like those kind of experiences where it\'s just imprompto ones where you get to hang out with the locals and you learn from','source_text'=>'Saya suka pengalaman spontan seperti itu di mana kita dapat meluangkan masa bersama penduduk tempatan dan belajar sesuatu daripada','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>1215.68,'end_time'=>1216.08,'target_text'=>'them.','source_text'=>'mereka.','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>1216.08,'end_time'=>1216.32,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>1216.32,'end_time'=>1217.34,'target_text'=>'Know that it was good.','source_text'=>'Pengalaman itu memang sangat bagus.','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>1217.44,'end_time'=>1218.54,'target_text'=>'I like that too.','source_text'=>'Saya pun suka perkara yang sama.','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>1218.64,'end_time'=>1219.26,'target_text'=>'What about you?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana dengan awak pula, Leon?','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>1219.36,'end_time'=>1220.38,'target_text'=>'Give that boy a mic.','source_text'=>'Bagi mikrofon ini kepada budak itu.','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>1220.48,'end_time'=>1221.18,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s the question?','source_text'=>'>> Apa soalannya tadi?','order'=>545],
