            ['start_time'=>159.2,'end_time'=>164.3,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ve never seen it in Canada, but also I never drink soda in Canada.','source_text'=>'>> Aku tak pernah nampak di Kanada, tapi aku pun tak pernah minum air bergas di Kanada.','order'=>57],
