            ['start_time'=>365.2,'end_time'=>367.66,'target_text'=>'We\'ll [snorts] just be in Beijing probably for about a week.','source_text'=>'Kami [dengus] hanya akan berada di Beijing mungkin dalam masa seminggu.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>367.76,'end_time'=>372.38,'target_text'=>'So, maybe I\'ll release this video sooner so you guys could give me recommendations on what to see in the comments.','source_text'=>'Jadi, mungkin saya akan siarkan video ini lebih awal supaya korang boleh beri cadangan tempat menarik di ruangan komen.','order'=>115],
