            ['start_time'=>31.24,'end_time'=>34.26,'target_text'=>'But yeah, I have a lot of lot of items in my shopping cart.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, ada banyak sangat barang dalam troli beli-belah saya.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>34.36,'end_time'=>37.86,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to show you all of these in person [music] once I order them.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan tunjukkan semua ini di depan mata bila saya dah pesan nanti.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>37.96,'end_time'=>42.06,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to make sure my address is correct without exposing myself.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya nak pastikan alamat saya betul tanpa mendedahkan maklumat peribadi.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>42.16,'end_time'=>48.66,'target_text'=>'Then I\'ll show you guys once I go and get all the items and bring it here and then fill up my pantry, freezer, and fridge.','source_text'=>'Kemudian saya akan tunjukkan bila saya dah ambil semua barang, bawa ke sini, dan penuhkan pantri, peti beku, serta peti sejuk saya.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>48.76,'end_time'=>53.82,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m going to place my order now and yeah, I\'ll see you guys once I get the food.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan buat pesanan sekarang dan ya, jumpa anda nanti bila makanan dah sampai.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>53.92,'end_time'=>59.34,'target_text'=>'Actually, I\'ll show you guys around a little bit and just show you what I do in a normal day while I\'m waiting for it to come','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya, saya nak bawa anda tengok sekeliling sikit dan tunjuk aktiviti harian saya sementara tunggu barang sampai','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>59.44,'end_time'=>61.38,'target_text'=>'cuz I think it will take a few hours.','source_text'=>'sebab saya rasa ia akan ambil masa beberapa jam.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>61.48,'end_time'=>64.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, start with the words that matter the most.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, mulakan dengan perkataan yang paling penting.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>64.12,'end_time'=>68.42,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF from my website in the description.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling lazim daripada laman web saya di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>68.52,'end_time'=>72.48,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now let\'s make our way to the entrance/kitchen.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang jom kita pergi ke bahagian pintu masuk dan dapur.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>72.72,'end_time'=>75.22,'target_text'=>'You can see this right here is our entrance.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak di sini ialah pintu masuk kami.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>75.32,'end_time'=>78.46,'target_text'=>'This is our door and our lock over here.','source_text'=>'Ini pintu kami dan ini kuncinya di sebelah sini.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>78.56,'end_time'=>85.7,'target_text'=>'If you come this way, you can see a cupboard here or like a storage space and this is just where we put our shoes.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda datang ke arah ini, anda boleh nampak almari atau ruang simpanan dan di sinilah tempat kami letak kasut.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>85.8,'end_time'=>89.18,'target_text'=>'So, you can come a little closer and you can see all of our shoes here.','source_text'=>'Jadi anda boleh datang dekat sikit dan anda boleh nampak semua kasut kami di sini.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>89.28,'end_time'=>90.82,'target_text'=>'These are all our shoes.','source_text'=>'Ini semua kasut-kasut kami.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>90.92,'end_time'=>92.58,'target_text'=>'I\'ll close this up.','source_text'=>'Saya tutup almari ini.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>92.68,'end_time'=>95.78,'target_text'=>'And here is our fridge and also some storage.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini peti sejuk kami serta sedikit ruang simpanan.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>95.88,'end_time'=>100.82,'target_text'=>'You can see it literally all our cupboards are completely and utterly empty.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak memang semua almari kami kosong sama sekali.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>100.92,'end_time'=>102.46,'target_text'=>'But let\'s open up the freezer.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita buka bahagian peti beku.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>102.56,'end_time'=>105.4,'target_text'=>'This top part is the freezer.','source_text'=>'Bahagian atas ini ialah peti beku.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>106.76,'end_time'=>107.82,'target_text'=>'Nothing, right?','source_text'=>'Tiada apa-apa, kan?','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>107.92,'end_time'=>108.66,'target_text'=>'Empty.','source_text'=>'Kosong.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>108.76,'end_time'=>109.74,'target_text'=>'This is empty.','source_text'=>'Ini kosong.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>109.84,'end_time'=>111.74,'target_text'=>'There is nothing in the freezer.','source_text'=>'Tiada apa-apa langsung dalam peti beku.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>111.84,'end_time'=>114.34,'target_text'=>'But how does the freezer feel?','source_text'=>'Tapi apa rasa peti beku ini?','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>114.44,'end_time'=>115.82,'target_text'=>'How does it feel?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana rasanya?','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>115.92,'end_time'=>117.18,'target_text'=>'It feels very cold.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sangat sejuk.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>117.28,'end_time'=>119.46,'target_text'=>'The freezer is cold to the touch.','source_text'=>'Peti beku ini sejuk bila disentuh.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>119.56,'end_time'=>123.02,'target_text'=>'Also, if you put your hand in there, you can feel it\'s cold.','source_text'=>'Selain itu, kalau anda masukkan tangan ke dalam, anda boleh rasa ia memang sejuk.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>123.12,'end_time'=>124.54,'target_text'=>'Let\'s close that up.','source_text'=>'Jom kita tutup semula.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>124.64,'end_time'=>126.22,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s open up the fridge.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita buka bahagian peti sejuk.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>126.32,'end_time'=>131.64,'target_text'=>'But before we open it, can you guys tell me what this is used for?','source_text'=>'Tapi sebelum kita buka, boleh tak anda beritahu apa kegunaan benda ini?','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>132.28,'end_time'=>135.38,'target_text'=>'This is a water dispenser built into the fridge.','source_text'=>'Ini ialah dispenser air yang terbina pada peti sejuk.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>135.48,'end_time'=>138.62,'target_text'=>'So, you can grab a glass and fill up your water here.','source_text'=>'Jadi anda boleh ambil gelas dan isikan air anda di sini.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>138.72,'end_time'=>140.02,'target_text'=>'Let\'s open up the fridge now.','source_text'=>'Jom kita buka peti sejuk sekarang.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>140.12,'end_time'=>142.02,'target_text'=>'Here you can see it\'s empty.','source_text'=>'Di sini anda boleh nampak ia kosong.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>142.12,'end_time'=>143.58,'target_text'=>'The fridge is empty as well.','source_text'=>'Peti sejuk ini pun kosong juga.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>143.68,'end_time'=>148.06,'target_text'=>'There\'s just some sauce packets from the takeout we ordered and a water bottle.','source_text'=>'Cuma ada beberapa paket sos daripada makanan bungkus yang kami pesan dan sebotol air.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>148.16,'end_time'=>149.78,'target_text'=>'But besides that, it\'s empty.','source_text'=>'Tapi selain daripada itu, memang kosong.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>149.88,'end_time'=>151.98,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s why I placed an order.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah saya buat pesanan.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>152.08,'end_time'=>156.46,'target_text'=>'It was around 100 around 100 Canadian dollars total for everything I ordered.','source_text'=>'Jumlahnya kira-kira 100 dolar Kanada untuk semua barang yang saya pesan.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>156.56,'end_time'=>158.98,'target_text'=>'So, you\'ll see how much that can get you here.','source_text'=>'Jadi anda akan tengok berapa banyak barang yang boleh dapat di sini dengan harga itu.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>159.08,'end_time'=>162.82,'target_text'=>'Delivery was free and I think it\'s just more convenient to order online.','source_text'=>'Penghantaran percuma dan saya rasa lebih mudah untuk pesan secara dalam talian.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>162.92,'end_time'=>167.18,'target_text'=>'So, you don\'t have to go to the store cuz it\'s the same price in store as it is online.','source_text'=>'Jadi tak perlu susah-susah pergi kedai sebab harganya sama sahaja di kedai mahupun dalam talian.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>167.28,'end_time'=>167.68,'target_text'=>'>> Is it?','source_text'=>'>> Betul ke?','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>167.76,'end_time'=>168.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it is.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>168.2,'end_time'=>170.94,'target_text'=>'It says same in store price on Grab.','source_text'=>'Ada tertulis harga sama seperti di kedai dalam aplikasi Grab.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>171.04,'end_time'=>175.58,'target_text'=>'But anyways, this is our dining table with four wooden chairs.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa-apa pun, ini meja makan kami dengan empat kerusi kayu.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>175.68,'end_time'=>176.58,'target_text'=>'Our dining table.','source_text'=>'Meja makan kami.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>176.68,'end_time'=>182.54,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if this is like all over Asia, but I know this is like really Korean to use like toilet paper instead of like,','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti kalau ini berlaku di seluruh Asia, tapi saya tahu orang Korea memang suka guna tisu tandas berbanding','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>182.64,'end_time'=>183.66,'target_text'=>'you know, paper towel.','source_text'=>'tisu dapur.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>183.76,'end_time'=>185.1,'target_text'=>'They just use toilet paper.','source_text'=>'Mereka hanya guna tisu tandas.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>185.2,'end_time'=>191.14,'target_text'=>'Which I useful cuz instead of buying toilet paper and paper towel, you could just buy a lot of toilet paper and then use that','source_text'=>'Yang mana bagi saya berguna sebab daripada beli tisu tandas dan tisu dapur berasingan, anda boleh beli banyak tisu tandas dan guna itu','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>191.24,'end_time'=>192.7,'target_text'=>'as your paper towel.','source_text'=>'sebagai tisu dapur anda.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>192.8,'end_time'=>194.5,'target_text'=>'But yeah, that\'s pretty much all I had to say.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, itu sahaja yang saya nak kongsikan.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>194.6,'end_time'=>198.42,'target_text'=>'We\'ll wait till all our groceries get here and then we\'ll show you everything we got.','source_text'=>'Kita tunggu sampai barang dapur kita sampai dan kemudian kita tunjuk semua yang kita beli.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>198.52,'end_time'=>200.3,'target_text'=>'See you guys then.','source_text'=>'Jumpa anda sebentar lagi.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>200.4,'end_time'=>205.54,'target_text'=>'Low key, I know I ordered like a lot of food, but I was not expecting this much.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya tahu saya pesan banyak makanan, tapi saya tak sangka sebanyak ini.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>205.64,'end_time'=>210.74,'target_text'=>'When I went down to pick up the food, the Grab driver first of all brought all of this scooter.','source_text'=>'Masa saya turun ambil makanan, mula-mula pemandu Grab bawa semua ini dengan skuter.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>210.84,'end_time'=>213.06,'target_text'=>'And when I went down to pick it up, he gave me this box.','source_text'=>'Dan bila saya turun ambil, dia bagi kotak ini kepada saya.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>213.16,'end_time'=>213.86,'target_text'=>'So, I thought this was it.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya ingat ini saja barangnya.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>213.96,'end_time'=>215.26,'target_text'=>'So, I took it and I was walking in.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya pun ambil dan mula berjalan masuk.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>215.36,'end_time'=>219.62,'target_text'=>'And then he comes behind me with a bunch more and he brings it in the gate and I\'m like, \"Oh, you could just put it down there.\"','source_text'=>'Lepas tu dia datang dari belakang bawa banyak lagi masuk ke pagar, dan saya kata, \"Oh, letak saja di situ.\"','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>219.72,'end_time'=>222.54,'target_text'=>'And then I put it all on top of the box and I just carried all of this.','source_text'=>'Kemudian saya susun semua atas kotak dan saya angkat kesemuanya sekali.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>222.64,'end_time'=>226.14,'target_text'=>'It wasn\'t heavy, but it was just like really awkward cuz there are eggs here.','source_text'=>'Bukannya berat sangat, cuma agak kekok nak bawa sebab ada telur di sini.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>226.24,'end_time'=>229.46,'target_text'=>'This bread is like really big and there\'s a bunch of frozen stuff here.','source_text'=>'Roti ini pula sangat besar dan ada banyak barang beku di sini.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>229.56,'end_time'=>231.7,'target_text'=>'So, I was like like this in the elevator.','source_text'=>'Jadi gaya saya macam ini dalam lif.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>231.8,'end_time'=>234.38,'target_text'=>'Anyway, yo, what are you working on?','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, yo, kau tengah buat apa tu?','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>234.48,'end_time'=>237.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I\'m working on my channel right now.','source_text'=>'>> Yo, aku tengah uruskan saluran YouTube aku sekarang.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>237.52,'end_time'=>238.26,'target_text'=>'I just started.','source_text'=>'Aku baru saja mula.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>238.36,'end_time'=>240.98,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to be posting once a week if you guys want to check it out.','source_text'=>'Aku akan muat naik seminggu sekali kalau korang nak tengok.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>241.08,'end_time'=>247.3,'target_text'=>'>> So, if you guys want to follow Leon on YouTube, he\'s posting comprehensible input vlogs here, No Matter Pedia.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi kalau korang nak ikuti Leon di YouTube, dia ada muat naik vlog input mudah faham di sini, No Matter Pedia.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>247.4,'end_time'=>248.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>249.08,'end_time'=>251.86,'target_text'=>'This is what we got, four French baguettes.','source_text'=>'Inilah yang kami dapat, empat batang roti baguette Perancis.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>251.96,'end_time'=>257.82,'target_text'=>'And I guess I should explain why I have like so much food here cuz this is just my food.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa saya patut jelaskan kenapa ada banyak sangat makanan di sini sebab ini makanan saya sahaja.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>257.92,'end_time'=>259.58,'target_text'=>'I low-key just ordered this for myself.','source_text'=>'Secara jujurnya saya pesan ini khas untuk diri saya sendiri.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>259.68,'end_time'=>264.78,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think Leon cooks so he\'ll just order takeout, but I bought this for myself cuz now I\'m starting to take the gym','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa Leon tak memasak jadi dia akan pesan makanan bungkus saja, tapi saya beli ini sebab saya nak mula fokus ke gim','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>264.88,'end_time'=>268.26,'target_text'=>'more seriously since I\'ll be staying here for like 3 months.','source_text'=>'dengan lebih serius memandangkan saya akan tinggal di sini selama kira-kira 3 bulan.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>268.36,'end_time'=>274.82,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m like, I should get into a routine, start going to the gym again, start eating well, and like eating the amount of','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa saya patut bina rutin, mula pergi ke gim semula, makan dengan sihat, dan makan dengan jumlah','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>274.92,'end_time'=>279.94,'target_text'=>'food I should be eating cuz low-key I haven\'t really been eating that much lately and when I do it\'s not like the healthiest','source_text'=>'makanan yang sepatutnya sebab sebenarnya kebelakangan ini saya tak makan banyak sangat dan bila saya makan pun bukannya makanan yang paling sihat','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>280.04,'end_time'=>280.44,'target_text'=>'food.','source_text'=>'sangat.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>280.44,'end_time'=>281.58,'target_text'=>'So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ya.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>281.68,'end_time'=>282.94,'target_text'=>'We got carbs.','source_text'=>'Kita ada karbohidrat.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>283.04,'end_time'=>287.3,'target_text'=>'This is mainly like before going to work out or doing any like physical activity.','source_text'=>'Ini terutamanya untuk sebelum pergi bersenam atau buat apa-apa aktiviti fizikal.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>287.4,'end_time'=>289.41,'target_text'=>'Some quick digesting carbs to give me energy.','source_text'=>'Karbohidrat yang cepat dihadam untuk beri saya tenaga.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>289.51,'end_time'=>291.38,'target_text'=>'[snorts] We have 30 eggs.','source_text'=>'[ketawa kecil] Kita ada 30 biji telur.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>291.48,'end_time'=>293.74,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah, and by the way, this is all for 1 week.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, dan apa-apa pun, semua ini untuk bekalan 1 minggu.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>293.84,'end_time'=>297.14,'target_text'=>'I\'ll open this first so I can put it in the freezer.','source_text'=>'Saya akan buka ini dulu supaya boleh masukkan ke dalam peti beku.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>297.24,'end_time'=>307.82,'target_text'=>'So, I got a bag of frozen mixed berries, also a bag of frozen mixed vegetables, also a bag of frozen corn, and I did order','source_text'=>'Jadi saya beli sebungkus campuran beri beku, sebungkus campuran sayur beku, sebungkus jagung beku, dan saya ada pesan','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>307.92,'end_time'=>314.1,'target_text'=>'four things of chicken, but they only had three and they messaged me so they just gave me three packets of chicken breast.','source_text'=>'empat pek ayam tapi mereka cuma ada tiga dan mesej saya, jadi mereka cuma bagi tiga paket dada ayam.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>314.2,'end_time'=>317.22,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll open it up so you can see better.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan buka supaya anda boleh nampak dengan lebih jelas.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>317.32,'end_time'=>318.46,'target_text'=>'So, this right here is chicken breast.','source_text'=>'Jadi yang ini ialah dada ayam.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>318.56,'end_time'=>322.26,'target_text'=>'I believe each packet comes with two chicken breasts.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya setiap paket ada dua keping dada ayam.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>322.36,'end_time'=>328.18,'target_text'=>'And also protein Greek yogurt, no sugar added, uh 0.5% fat.','source_text'=>'Dan juga yogurt Greek berprotein, tanpa gula tambahan, 0.5% lemak.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>328.28,'end_time'=>329.7,'target_text'=>'So, that should be healthy.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini memang sihat.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>329.8,'end_time'=>335.06,'target_text'=>'I wish they had a larger container, but they didn\'t so I just bought two 500 g containers.','source_text'=>'Kalaulah mereka ada bekas yang lebih besar, tapi tak ada jadi saya beli dua bekas 500 gram.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>335.16,'end_time'=>338.14,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let\'s put this in the freezer first','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom masukkan ini ke dalam peti beku dulu','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>338.24,'end_time'=>341.3,'target_text'=>'so I can kind of feel it\'s starting to melt.','source_text'=>'sebab saya rasa ia dah mula mencair.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>341.4,'end_time'=>343.26,'target_text'=>'>> Well, the driver didn\'t have to come that far, did he?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi pemandu tu tak payah datang dari jauh pun, kan?','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>343.36,'end_time'=>344.9,'target_text'=>'>> No, it was really close.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, kedainya dekat sangat.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>345,'end_time'=>350.82,'target_text'=>'Now you can see it\'s starting to fill the freezer up.','source_text'=>'Sekarang anda boleh nampak peti beku dah mula penuh.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>350.92,'end_time'=>353.54,'target_text'=>'We put the stuff that needs to go in the freezer in the freezer.','source_text'=>'Kami dah masukkan barang-barang yang perlu disejukbekukan ke dalam peti beku.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>353.64,'end_time'=>356.98,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s put the chicken Let\'s put the chicken in the fridge.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita masukkan ayam ke dalam peti sejuk.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>357.08,'end_time'=>358.86,'target_text'=>'Remember we talked about this earlier.','source_text'=>'Ingat tak kita ada bincang tentang ini tadi.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>358.96,'end_time'=>361.66,'target_text'=>'This part of the fridge is called the fridge.','source_text'=>'Bahagian peti sejuk ini dipanggil ruang pendingin.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>361.76,'end_time'=>363.46,'target_text'=>'You call this whole thing the refrigerator.','source_text'=>'Keseluruhan peti ini dipanggil refrigerator.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>363.56,'end_time'=>369.9,'target_text'=>'Most people just refer to it as the fridge, but the top part specifically is the freezer section.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan orang panggil peti sejuk saja, tapi bahagian atas khususnya ialah bahagian peti beku.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>370,'end_time'=>372.42,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll put that here.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya letak itu di sini.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>372.52,'end_time'=>373.66,'target_text'=>'I\'ll close that up.','source_text'=>'Saya tutup pintunya.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>373.76,'end_time'=>375.3,'target_text'=>'Actually, I have my Greek yogurt.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya, saya ada yogurt Greek saya.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>375.4,'end_time'=>380.58,'target_text'=>'This Greek yogurt will mainly be for like breakfast or like my last snack of the day.','source_text'=>'Yogurt Greek ini terutamanya untuk sarapan atau snek terakhir saya pada hari ini.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>380.68,'end_time'=>383.9,'target_text'=>'I\'ll make like Greek yogurt with berries and oats.','source_text'=>'Saya akan buat yogurt Greek dengan beri dan oat.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>384,'end_time'=>387.1,'target_text'=>'And I also want to try making overnight oats.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga nak cuba buat \'overnight oats\'.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>387.2,'end_time'=>392.78,'target_text'=>'I always see that on TikTok like people that work out they make a lot of oats especially like overnight oats and stuff like','source_text'=>'Saya selalu tengok di TikTok orang yang bersenam buat banyak oat terutamanya \'overnight oats\' dan benda macam','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>392.88,'end_time'=>393.2,'target_text'=>'this.','source_text'=>'ini.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>393.2,'end_time'=>394.9,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ll start doing that.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya akan mula buat begitu.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>395,'end_time'=>395.9,'target_text'=>'Here we have bread.','source_text'=>'Di sini kita ada roti.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>396,'end_time'=>397.42,'target_text'=>'Loki, I ordered a lot of bread.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya pesan banyak sangat roti.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>397.52,'end_time'=>401.5,'target_text'=>'I probably should have ordered like two and then another two in the middle of the week.','source_text'=>'Sepatutnya saya pesan dua saja dulu dan dua lagi pada pertengahan minggu.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>401.6,'end_time'=>402.82,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s probably going to get stale.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia mungkin akan lemau atau keras.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>402.92,'end_time'=>406.78,'target_text'=>'So, I might just give Leon some of this, but yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya mungkin bagi Leon sebahagian daripadanya, tapi ya.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>406.88,'end_time'=>409.02,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know how to keep bread from getting stale.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu cara nak elak roti daripada lemau.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>409.12,'end_time'=>410.46,'target_text'=>'>> You can freeze it.','source_text'=>'>> Kau boleh bekukan dia.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>410.56,'end_time'=>412.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I guess.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul juga.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>412.12,'end_time'=>414.62,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, this is the whole list of things I got.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, inilah keseluruhan senarai barang yang saya beli.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>414.72,'end_time'=>416.82,'target_text'=>'So, I also got kimchi.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada beli kimchi.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>416.92,'end_time'=>419.74,'target_text'=>'They didn\'t have the one I wanted, but they had an alternative.','source_text'=>'Mereka tiada jenama yang saya nak, tapi ada pilihan alternatif.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>419.84,'end_time'=>424.38,'target_text'=>'So, an alternative isn\'t the one you originally wanted, but it\'s something very very similar.','source_text'=>'Jadi alternatif bukanlah barang asal yang anda nak, tapi sesuatu yang amat serupa.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>424.48,'end_time'=>425.86,'target_text'=>'So, they had an alternative.','source_text'=>'Jadi mereka ada pilihan alternatif.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>425.96,'end_time'=>430.5,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m like, \"Okay, I\'ll just get that one.\" And like I said, they were missing some chicken breast and some tuna.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya kata, \"Baiklah, saya ambil yang itu sajalah.\" Dan macam saya kata, mereka kekurangan sedikit dada ayam dan tuna.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>430.6,'end_time'=>435.7,'target_text'=>'So, I only got three cans of tuna and three packs of chicken breast, but I ordered four.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya cuma dapat tiga tin tuna dan tiga pek dada ayam, walaupun saya pesan empat.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>435.8,'end_time'=>437.7,'target_text'=>'That\'s just the name of the game out here.','source_text'=>'Begitulah adat bila beli barang di sini.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>437.8,'end_time'=>440.22,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m going to get a knife','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan ambil pisau','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>440.32,'end_time'=>444.34,'target_text'=>'so I can cut this big box open.','source_text'=>'supaya saya boleh potong dan buka kotak besar ini.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>444.44,'end_time'=>447.82,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve never actually like seriously dieted before.','source_text'=>'Dan sebelum ini saya tak pernah betul-betul berdiet secara serius.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>447.92,'end_time'=>448.58,'target_text'=>'Dieted?','source_text'=>'Berdiet?','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>448.68,'end_time'=>451.98,'target_text'=>'I usually just like fasted to lose weight.','source_text'=>'Biasanya saya cuma berpuasa untuk turunkan berat badan.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>452.08,'end_time'=>452.4,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>452.4,'end_time'=>455.18,'target_text'=>'Dude, this is like some big spinach, dude.','source_text'=>'Banyak dan besarnya bayam ini.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>455.28,'end_time'=>456.14,'target_text'=>'Holy.','source_text'=>'Fuh.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>456.24,'end_time'=>457.94,'target_text'=>'That looks like bok choy.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam bok choy.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>458.04,'end_time'=>459.38,'target_text'=>'No, here is the bok choy.','source_text'=>'Bukan, yang ini baru bok choy.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>459.48,'end_time'=>460.54,'target_text'=>'So, I got bok choy.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya ada beli bok choy.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>460.64,'end_time'=>464.1,'target_text'=>'I really like bok choy, so I made sure to get that.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat suka bok choy, jadi saya pastikan untuk membelinya.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>464.2,'end_time'=>465.26,'target_text'=>'This is the kimchi.','source_text'=>'Ini kimchinya.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>465.36,'end_time'=>466.9,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you guys know this brand.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kalau anda tahu jenama ini.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>467,'end_time'=>468.78,'target_text'=>'Pretty sure it\'s a Korean brand.','source_text'=>'Cukup yakin ini jenama Korea.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>468.88,'end_time'=>470.82,'target_text'=>'Number one kimchi brand in Korea.','source_text'=>'Jenama kimchi nombor satu di Korea.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>470.92,'end_time'=>473.78,'target_text'=>'I\'m not an expert, but I think it\'s from Korea.','source_text'=>'Saya bukan pakar, tapi saya rasa ia memang dari Korea.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>473.88,'end_time'=>475.54,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s take everything out.','source_text'=>'Jadi jom kita keluarkan semua barang.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>475.64,'end_time'=>477.78,'target_text'=>'Here we have jasmine rice.','source_text'=>'Di sini kita ada beras wangi jasmine.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>477.88,'end_time'=>482.38,'target_text'=>'Well, they call it fragrant rice, but ChatGPT said it\'s pretty much jasmine rice.','source_text'=>'Mereka panggil beras wangi, tapi ChatGPT kata ia hampir sama dengan beras jasmine.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>482.48,'end_time'=>484.38,'target_text'=>'Jasmine rice.','source_text'=>'Beras jasmine.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>484.48,'end_time'=>486.18,'target_text'=>'Here we have my oats.','source_text'=>'Di sini ada oat saya.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>486.28,'end_time'=>488.74,'target_text'=>'And I guess they gave a little bonus pack with the oats.','source_text'=>'Dan nampaknya mereka bagi pek bonus kecil bersama oat ini.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>488.84,'end_time'=>490.18,'target_text'=>'But, yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi, ya.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>490.28,'end_time'=>492.1,'target_text'=>'This is my pack of oats.','source_text'=>'Ini pek oat saya.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>492.2,'end_time'=>498.52,'target_text'=>'I also got soy sauce, extra virgin olive oil,','source_text'=>'Saya juga beli kicap soya, minyak zaitun extra virgin,','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>498.84,'end_time'=>499.94,'target_text'=>'almonds.','source_text'=>'kacang badam.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>500.04,'end_time'=>501.5,'target_text'=>'Also got some spices.','source_text'=>'Juga beli beberapa jenis rempah.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>501.6,'end_time'=>508.34,'target_text'=>'I couldn\'t find like there wasn\'t any onion powder and stuff like that available, but I got garlic powder, paprika, cinnamon,','source_text'=>'Saya tak jumpa serbuk bawang dan sebagainya, tapi saya dapat serbuk bawang putih, paprika, kayu manis,','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>508.44,'end_time'=>509.7,'target_text'=>'and uh black pepper.','source_text'=>'dan lada hitam.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>509.8,'end_time'=>511.98,'target_text'=>'Oh, I forgot to get salt.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya terlupa beli garam.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>512.08,'end_time'=>513.62,'target_text'=>'That\'s like the most important one.','source_text'=>'Itulah benda yang paling penting sekali.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>513.72,'end_time'=>515.02,'target_text'=>'I also got kiwi.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada beli kiwi.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>515.12,'end_time'=>520.94,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t buy really much fresh fruit as you can see here because I can go just buy that outside on the street.','source_text'=>'Saya tak beli banyak buah segar seperti yang anda nampak di sini sebab saya boleh beli saja di tepi jalan.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>521.04,'end_time'=>525.82,'target_text'=>'So, all I got was kiwi and then a couple cans of tuna.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya cuma beli kiwi dan beberapa tin tuna.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>525.92,'end_time'=>528.98,'target_text'=>'As you can see here, some baby carrots.','source_text'=>'Seperti yang anda nampak di sini, sedikit lobak merah mini.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>529.08,'end_time'=>532.7,'target_text'=>'And last but not least, two packets of potatoes.','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali, dua paket ubi kentang.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>532.8,'end_time'=>533.62,'target_text'=>'So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ya.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>533.72,'end_time'=>535.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s everything I bought.','source_text'=>'Itulah semua yang saya beli.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>535.2,'end_time'=>539.1,'target_text'=>'Don\'t just watch this lesson, practice it with the workbooks on my website.','source_text'=>'Jangan sekadar tonton pelajaran ini, praktikkannya dengan buku kerja di laman web saya.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>539.2,'end_time'=>542.82,'target_text'=>'It includes exercises to help you remember what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi latihan untuk membantu anda mengingati apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>542.92,'end_time'=>545.66,'target_text'=>'You can really see there is a lot of stuff here.','source_text'=>'Anda memang boleh nampak ada banyak sangat barang di sini.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>545.76,'end_time'=>548.06,'target_text'=>'And this will last about a week.','source_text'=>'Dan ini akan bertahan selama kira-kira seminggu.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>548.16,'end_time'=>555.06,'target_text'=>'Obviously, the stuff like the spices will last longer than a week, but pretty much everything else will just last a week.','source_text'=>'Sudah tentu barang seperti rempah-ratus akan tahan lebih seminggu, tapi hampir semua barang lain akan bertahan seminggu saja.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>555.16,'end_time'=>558.22,'target_text'=>'Rice, I think will probably last longer than a week, pretty sure.','source_text'=>'Beras pula saya rasa akan tahan lebih seminggu, saya agak yakin.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>558.32,'end_time'=>562.26,'target_text'=>'But, everything else like the kiwi, the fruit, the oats, the vegetables, the eggs.','source_text'=>'Tapi barang lain seperti kiwi, buah-buahan, oat, sayur-sayuran, dan telur.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>562.36,'end_time'=>564.1,'target_text'=>'Oh, this will last longer than a week, too.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini pun akan tahan lebih seminggu juga.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>564.2,'end_time'=>566.62,'target_text'=>'Maybe not this, but everything else about a week.','source_text'=>'Mungkin bukan yang ini, tapi yang lain kira-kira seminggu.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>566.72,'end_time'=>569.58,'target_text'=>'And yeah, honestly, it\'s like I don\'t know if it\'s expensive or not.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, sejujurnya saya tak pasti sama ada ia mahal atau tidak.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>569.68,'end_time'=>571.58,'target_text'=>'Like it was around $100 for all this.','source_text'=>'Harganya kira-kira $100 untuk semua ini.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>571.68,'end_time'=>573.14,'target_text'=>'This is like a lot of food.','source_text'=>'Ini makanan yang sangat banyak.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>573.24,'end_time'=>574.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s like enough food for a week.','source_text'=>'Ia cukup untuk bekalan makanan selama seminggu.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>574.8,'end_time'=>577.1,'target_text'=>'But, maybe for Vietnam, it\'s pricier.','source_text'=>'Tapi mungkin untuk taraf di Vietnam, harganya agak mahal.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>577.2,'end_time'=>580.26,'target_text'=>'But, I bought it from like a really popular like grocery store.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya beli dari sebuah pasar raya yang agak terkenal.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>580.36,'end_time'=>586.34,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, I\'m not really sure about that, but anyway, this is all the stuff I got and now I\'ll start packing it in the cupboards.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, saya tak pasti sangat pasal itu, tapi apa-apa pun inilah barang yang saya beli dan sekarang saya mula simpan dalam almari.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>586.44,'end_time'=>592.38,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now let\'s have the pronunciation and accent training segment.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang jom kita masuk ke segmen latihan sebutan dan loghat.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>592.48,'end_time'=>594.54,'target_text'=>'Read the text on screen.','source_text'=>'Baca teks pada skrin.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>594.64,'end_time'=>602.74,'target_text'=>'This is a cozy dining area with a dark wooden table covered in groceries and cooking ingredients.','source_text'=>'Ini ialah ruang makan yang selesa dengan meja kayu gelap yang dipenuhi barang dapur dan bahan memasak.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>602.84,'end_time'=>611.62,'target_text'=>'As you look at the table, you can see bags of vegetables, canned food, spices, sauces, and other kitchen items spread across','source_text'=>'Apabila anda melihat meja itu, anda dapat melihat beg-beg sayur, makanan dalam tin, rempah-ratus, sos, dan barang dapur lain berselerak di atas','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>611.72,'end_time'=>613.26,'target_text'=>'the surface.','source_text'=>'permukaan meja.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>613.36,'end_time'=>621.54,'target_text'=>'Some plastic bags and packaging are still lying around making it feel like someone just came back from grocery shopping and','source_text'=>'Beberapa beg plastik dan pembungkusan masih bersepah membuatkannya terasa seperti seseorang baru pulang membeli-belah barang dapur dan','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>621.64,'end_time'=>624.22,'target_text'=>'started unpacking everything.','source_text'=>'mula memunggah semua barang.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>624.32,'end_time'=>632.26,'target_text'=>'The room feels warm and homey because of the wooden furniture and soft natural light coming through the large white curtains','source_text'=>'Bilik ini terasa hangat dan selesa kerana perabot kayu serta cahaya semula jadi lembut yang masuk menerusi langsir putih besar','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>632.36,'end_time'=>633.86,'target_text'=>'in the background.','source_text'=>'di bahagian latar belakang.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>633.96,'end_time'=>640.38,'target_text'=>'Around the table, there are several wooden chairs neatly placed on the smooth tiled floor.','source_text'=>'Di sekeliling meja, terdapat beberapa kerusi kayu yang disusun kemas di atas lantai berjubin licin.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>640.48,'end_time'=>646.82,'target_text'=>'The lighting is soft and slightly dim, which gives the space a calm and relaxed atmosphere.','source_text'=>'Pencahayaannya lembut dan sedikit malap, memberikan ruang itu suasana yang tenang dan santai.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>646.92,'end_time'=>655.26,'target_text'=>'On the table, you can notice fresh green vegetables, lemons, carrots, seasonings, bottles of sauce, and containers of food','source_text'=>'Di atas meja, anda boleh nampak sayur-sayuran hijau segar, lemon, lobak merah, perasa, botol sos, dan bekas makanan','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>655.36,'end_time'=>657.3,'target_text'=>'placed in different spots.','source_text'=>'yang diletakkan di sudut-sudut berbeza.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>657.4,'end_time'=>664.82,'target_text'=>'The groceries are a little messy and unorganized, but it makes the scene feel realistic and lived in.','source_text'=>'Barang dapur agak berselerak dan tidak tersusun, tetapi ia menjadikan pemandangan itu terasa realistik dan hidup.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>664.92,'end_time'=>673.42,'target_text'=>'Overall, this looks like a quiet kitchen or dining room right before someone starts cooking a big homemade meal.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhan, ini kelihatan seperti dapur atau ruang makan yang sunyi sejurus sebelum seseorang mula memasak hidangan buatan sendiri yang enak.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>673.52,'end_time'=>677.5,'target_text'=>'Hopefully you guys like that pronunciation and accent training segment.','source_text'=>'Semoga anda semua sukakan segmen latihan sebutan dan loghat tadi.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>677.6,'end_time'=>680.74,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s kind of try to find a place to put all the items.','source_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita cari tempat untuk simpan semua barang ini.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>680.84,'end_time'=>682.78,'target_text'=>'And I have an announcement for you guys.','source_text'=>'Dan saya ada satu pengumuman untuk anda semua.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>682.88,'end_time'=>688.02,'target_text'=>'I\'ll be posting my shadowing stories on my second channel, Volka.','source_text'=>'Saya akan muat naik cerita \'shadowing\' saya di saluran kedua saya, Volka.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>688.12,'end_time'=>693.7,'target_text'=>'The link to my channel will be in the description, so make sure to subscribe and watch the videos there.','source_text'=>'Pautan ke saluran saya ada di ruangan penerangan, jadi pastikan anda langgan dan tonton video di sana.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>693.8,'end_time'=>695.3,'target_text'=>'>> Where do you think I should put the rice?','source_text'=>'>> Kau rasa aku patut letak beras ni kat mana?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>695.4,'end_time'=>696.42,'target_text'=>'>> You could just leave it on the counter.','source_text'=>'>> Kau boleh letak saja atas kaunter tu.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>696.52,'end_time'=>698.06,'target_text'=>'You\'re probably going to use that every day.','source_text'=>'Kau mesti akan guna benda tu setiap hari.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>698.16,'end_time'=>701.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, most likely cuz you we don\'t have a rice cooker, do we?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kemungkinan besar sebab kita tak ada periuk nasi, kan?','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>701.28,'end_time'=>706.58,'target_text'=>'>> You might have to check the cupboards, but it\'s pretty easy to cook rice just in a pot, I think.','source_text'=>'>> Kau kena periksa almari dulu, tapi masak nasi dalam periuk biasa pun senang saja aku rasa.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>706.68,'end_time'=>712.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but I was just asking about a rice cooker cuz usually you can just like leave rice always on in a rice cooker.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi aku tanya pasal periuk nasi sebab biasanya kita boleh biarkan nasi sentiasa panas dalam periuk elektrik.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>712.68,'end_time'=>713.62,'target_text'=>'Like just always there.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya sentiasa ada di situ.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>713.72,'end_time'=>717.58,'target_text'=>'Like always ready cuz it like keeps it warm instead of like having like stale rice, you know?','source_text'=>'Sentiasa siap sedia dan kekal hangat daripada dapat nasi yang sejuk atau basi, faham kan?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>717.68,'end_time'=>718.08,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>718.16,'end_time'=>722.54,'target_text'=>'>> In some places I lived, they just always have like fresh rice or like, you know, some restaurants that just always have','source_text'=>'>> Di beberapa tempat yang pernah aku duduk, mereka sentiasa ada nasi panas atau macam sesetengah restoran yang sentiasa ada','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>722.64,'end_time'=>725.5,'target_text'=>'like that rice cooker with warm like steamed rice.','source_text'=>'periuk nasi yang berisi nasi kukus panas.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>725.6,'end_time'=>726,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>726.04,'end_time'=>727.78,'target_text'=>'>> keeps it like easy and ready to eat.','source_text'=>'>> Senang dan sedia untuk terus dimakan.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>727.88,'end_time'=>730.38,'target_text'=>'The vegetables, I\'m going to put in the fridge.','source_text'=>'Sayur-sayuran ini saya akan masukkan ke dalam peti sejuk.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>730.48,'end_time'=>732.94,'target_text'=>'Give me I\'ve never seen spinach this big.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah tengok bayam sebesar ini.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>733.04,'end_time'=>734.18,'target_text'=>'Low-key kind of crazy.','source_text'=>'Agak mengejutkan juga.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>734.28,'end_time'=>735.46,'target_text'=>'Organic spinach.','source_text'=>'Bayam organik.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>735.56,'end_time'=>736.62,'target_text'=>'I\'m healthy, bro.','source_text'=>'Aku amalkan hidup sihat, bro.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>736.72,'end_time'=>738.66,'target_text'=>'Talk about healthy living, bro.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah gaya hidup sihat ni, bro.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>738.76,'end_time'=>740.66,'target_text'=>'>> Who would have guessed?','source_text'=>'>> Siapa sangka, kan?','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>740.76,'end_time'=>742.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t even know if you like spinach.','source_text'=>'Aku pun tak tahu kau suka makan bayam ke tak.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>742.84,'end_time'=>747.14,'target_text'=>'>> I hate wasting stuff, so I\'m going to actually have to eat healthy even if it\'s for a week.','source_text'=>'>> Aku tak suka membazir barang, jadi aku kena makan secara sihat walaupun hanya untuk seminggu.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>747.24,'end_time'=>749.04,'target_text'=>'Oats.','source_text'=>'Oat.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>749.24,'end_time'=>749.9,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, crap.','source_text'=>'>> Alamak.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>750,'end_time'=>750.42,'target_text'=>'>> Who dropped that?','source_text'=>'>> Siapa yang jatuhkan tu?','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>750.52,'end_time'=>751.58,'target_text'=>'>> Is that the chicken?','source_text'=>'>> Tu ayam ke?','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>751.68,'end_time'=>753.14,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s [snorts] the tuna in water.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, ini [ketawa kecil] tin tuna dalam air.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>753.24,'end_time'=>759.3,'target_text'=>'You always have to get tuna in water if you\'re like trying to lose weight or something because if it\'s in oil, it\'ll have','source_text'=>'Anda kena sentiasa pilih tuna dalam air kalau tengah cuba turunkan berat badan sebab kalau dalam minyak, ia mengandungi','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>759.4,'end_time'=>760.54,'target_text'=>'just a lot more calories.','source_text'=>'jauh lebih banyak kalori.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>760.64,'end_time'=>761.9,'target_text'=>'So, we have tuna.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita ada tuna.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>762,'end_time'=>767.9,'target_text'=>'I guess this stuff I\'ll also put on the counter and maybe this can stuff.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa barang-barang ini saya akan letak atas kaunter juga dan mungkin makanan dalam tin ini.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>768,'end_time'=>769.62,'target_text'=>'Literally','source_text'=>'Memang','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>769.72,'end_time'=>772.34,'target_text'=>'nothing in these cupboards, so I\'ll just put it in there.','source_text'=>'tiada apa-apa dalam almari ini, jadi saya letak saja di dalamnya.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>772.44,'end_time'=>776.1,'target_text'=>'Do you have to put soy sauce in the fridge after you open it?','source_text'=>'Kena simpan kicap soya dalam peti sejuk ke lepas dah buka?','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>776.2,'end_time'=>780.66,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think so, but usually on bottles it tells you if it needs to be refrigerated.','source_text'=>'>> Aku rasa tak perlu, tapi biasanya pada botol ada beritahu jika perlu disimpan dalam peti sejuk.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>780.76,'end_time'=>783.5,'target_text'=>'It\'ll say something like refrigerate after opening.','source_text'=>'Ia akan tulis macam \'simpan di tempat sejuk selepas dibuka\'.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>783.6,'end_time'=>786.58,'target_text'=>'>> Well, it\'s going in there for now.','source_text'=>'>> Tak apalah, buat masa ni kita simpan dalam ni dulu.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>786.68,'end_time'=>789.46,'target_text'=>'This olive oil can stay right there.','source_text'=>'Minyak zaitun ini boleh kekal di situ.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>789.56,'end_time'=>791.34,'target_text'=>'Potatoes','source_text'=>'Kentang','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>791.44,'end_time'=>794.48,'target_text'=>'I\'ll probably just put on the counter as well.','source_text'=>'mungkin saya akan letak di atas kaunter juga.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>794.8,'end_time'=>797.9,'target_text'=>'Let me put this over here.','source_text'=>'Biar saya letak ini di sebelah sini.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>798,'end_time'=>800.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I\'ll put this in here, too.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya akan letak ini ke dalam sini juga.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>800.68,'end_time'=>803.18,'target_text'=>'Last couple things are my bread.','source_text'=>'Beberapa barang terakhir ialah roti saya.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>803.28,'end_time'=>804.78,'target_text'=>'These were like 25 cents each.','source_text'=>'Harga roti ini cuma kira-kira 25 sen setiap satu.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>804.88,'end_time'=>805.3,'target_text'=>'>> Were they?','source_text'=>'>> Murahnya, betul ke?','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>805.4,'end_time'=>806.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>806.4,'end_time'=>808.86,'target_text'=>'It was like 6,000, literally.','source_text'=>'Harganya cuma lebih kurang 6,000 Dong.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>808.96,'end_time'=>809.9,'target_text'=>'>> Super cheap.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat murah.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>810,'end_time'=>811.46,'target_text'=>'No, even cheaper.','source_text'=>'Tak, lebih murah lagi.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>811.56,'end_time'=>812.46,'target_text'=>'3,800.','source_text'=>'3,800 Dong.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>812.56,'end_time'=>814.82,'target_text'=>'All of these were 75 cents.','source_text'=>'Semua roti ini cuma 75 sen saja.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>814.92,'end_time'=>816.26,'target_text'=>'75 cents for all this.','source_text'=>'75 sen untuk semua roti ini.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>816.36,'end_time'=>817.34,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a pretty good deal.','source_text'=>'>> Memang harga yang sangat berbaloi.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>817.44,'end_time'=>817.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>818,'end_time'=>819.78,'target_text'=>'And I love baguettes, bro.','source_text'=>'Dan aku memang suka roti baguette, bro.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>819.88,'end_time'=>821.98,'target_text'=>'>> Well, Vietnam makes some really good baguettes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya lah, Vietnam memang buat roti baguette yang sangat sedap.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>822.08,'end_time'=>825.1,'target_text'=>'>> they got that French bakery on lock, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Mereka memang mahir betul buat roti ala Perancis.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>825.2,'end_time'=>829.86,'target_text'=>'I\'m just trying to untie this bag, but I don\'t really have patience, so I\'ll just rip it.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah cuba buka ikatan beg ini, tapi saya kurang sabar jadi saya koyakkan saja.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>829.96,'end_time'=>831.02,'target_text'=>'Put that in there.','source_text'=>'Masukkan itu ke dalam sana.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>831.12,'end_time'=>833.16,'target_text'=>'This one.','source_text'=>'Yang ini pula.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>834.52,'end_time'=>837.52,'target_text'=>'Lastly, the eggs.','source_text'=>'Akhir sekali, telur.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>837.92,'end_time'=>839.18,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, they fit.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, muat pun semuanya.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>839.28,'end_time'=>840.94,'target_text'=>'I just unpacked all the groceries.','source_text'=>'Saya baru saja selesai memunggah semua barang dapur.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>841.04,'end_time'=>847.02,'target_text'=>'I\'m not exactly sure what I\'m going to make tonight for dinner, but I do have to order like a scale off Lazada.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sangat apa yang nak dimasak untuk makan malam nanti, tapi saya kena pesan penimbang dari Lazada.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>847.12,'end_time'=>849.82,'target_text'=>'You know, want to know how much a scale is like a to weigh yourself?','source_text'=>'Korang nak tahu tak berapa harga penimbang berat badan?','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>849.92,'end_time'=>850.5,'target_text'=>'>> A dollar?','source_text'=>'>> Satu dolar?','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>850.6,'end_time'=>851.5,'target_text'=>'>> $5.','source_text'=>'>> $5 dolar.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>851.6,'end_time'=>852.02,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>852.12,'end_time'=>854.62,'target_text'=>'>> And a scale to weigh food is more, it\'s like $6.','source_text'=>'>> Dan penimbang untuk makanan lebih mahal sikit, kira-kira $6 dolar.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>854.72,'end_time'=>857.78,'target_text'=>'But then creatine is like $30.','source_text'=>'Tapi kreatin pula harganya kira-kira $30 dolar.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>857.88,'end_time'=>862.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I paid 50 ringgit for that creatine.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, aku bayar 50 ringgit untuk kreatin tu.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>862.4,'end_time'=>863.7,'target_text'=>'>> 300 g.','source_text'=>'>> 300 gram.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>863.8,'end_time'=>865.74,'target_text'=>'I got 500 g creatine.','source_text'=>'Saya beli 500 gram kreatin.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>865.84,'end_time'=>867.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s just like a gym supplement you take.','source_text'=>'Itu cuma suplemen gim yang biasa diambil.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>868,'end_time'=>869.02,'target_text'=>'I guess it\'s just good for you.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia memang bagus untuk badan.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>869.12,'end_time'=>872.78,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know, it\'s like the most researched supplement in the world, so we\'ll just say to take it.','source_text'=>'Entahlah, ia suplemen yang paling banyak dikaji di dunia, jadi orang kata elok ambil.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>872.88,'end_time'=>874.98,'target_text'=>'Anyway, we unpacked everything.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kita dah punggah semua barang.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>875.08,'end_time'=>880.06,'target_text'=>'Look at you, I am a chef, so I might have to bless your eyes with my cooking later today.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah, saya kan tukang masak, jadi mungkin saya kena jamu mata korang dengan masakan saya nanti.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>880.16,'end_time'=>881.66,'target_text'=>'>> Well, name three things you can cook.','source_text'=>'>> Cuba sebut tiga benda yang kau reti masak.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>881.76,'end_time'=>884.54,'target_text'=>'>> Eggs, toast, [clears throat] eggs with toast.','source_text'=>'>> Telur, roti bakar, [berdehem] telur dengan roti bakar.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>884.64,'end_time'=>885.98,'target_text'=>'>> Are you going to make toast here?','source_text'=>'>> Kau nak buat roti bakar kat sini ke?','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>886.08,'end_time'=>887.62,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s that right there?','source_text'=>'>> Apa benda kat sebelah tu?','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>887.72,'end_time'=>888.5,'target_text'=>'>> Microwave.','source_text'=>'>> Ketuhar gelombang mikro.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>888.6,'end_time'=>889.26,'target_text'=>'>> Exactly.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>889.36,'end_time'=>892.38,'target_text'=>'I like my toast nice and like like soggy.','source_text'=>'Aku suka roti bakar aku lembap dan sedikit lembik.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>892.48,'end_time'=>897.58,'target_text'=>'Last thing I want to show you before we jump into like some cooking stuff is this right here.','source_text'=>'Benda terakhir yang saya nak tunjuk sebelum kita mula memasak ialah yang ini.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>897.68,'end_time'=>900.7,'target_text'=>'This is a 5-gallon jug of water.','source_text'=>'Ini tong air bersaiz 5 gelen.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>900.8,'end_time'=>907.14,'target_text'=>'So, you can see right here, you just push this down and then water will come out and I think we\'ll probably go through each','source_text'=>'Jadi anda boleh nampak di sini, tekan saja ini ke bawah dan air akan keluar, dan saya rasa kami berdua akan habiskan','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>907.24,'end_time'=>907.94,'target_text'=>'one of these a week.','source_text'=>'satu tong ini setiap minggu.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>908.04,'end_time'=>908.94,'target_text'=>'I have one in my room.','source_text'=>'Saya ada satu di dalam bilik saya.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>909.04,'end_time'=>911.66,'target_text'=>'This is Leon\'s here, so we should drink a lot of water.','source_text'=>'Yang ini kepunyaan Leon, jadi kami memang patut minum banyak air.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>911.76,'end_time'=>915.42,'target_text'=>'I have found myself being a lot more thirsty lately.','source_text'=>'Kebelakangan ini saya rasa diri saya kerap dahaga.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>915.52,'end_time'=>917.42,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this is our kitchen.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, inilah dapur kami.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>917.52,'end_time'=>918.42,'target_text'=>'This is a knife.','source_text'=>'Ini sebilah pisau.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>918.52,'end_time'=>920.86,'target_text'=>'I just unpacked all my groceries.','source_text'=>'Saya baru saja memunggah semua barang dapur saya.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>920.96,'end_time'=>926.22,'target_text'=>'I put stuff in the cupboards, on the counter, in the freezer, and in the fridge.','source_text'=>'Saya simpan barang dalam almari, atas kaunter, dalam peti beku, dan dalam peti sejuk.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>926.32,'end_time'=>927.42,'target_text'=>'Low-key it was a lot.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya barang tadi memang banyak.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>927.52,'end_time'=>930.46,'target_text'=>'When you order online, you can\'t really tell how big the package is.','source_text'=>'Bila pesan secara dalam talian, kita tak dapat bayangkan sebesar mana bungkusannya.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>930.56,'end_time'=>935.38,'target_text'=>'You can just look at the weight, but once it\'s here, it looks like a lot more, especially the baguettes.','source_text'=>'Kita cuma boleh tengok beratnya, tapi bila dah sampai, nampak jauh lebih banyak terutamanya roti baguette itu.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>935.48,'end_time'=>937.9,'target_text'=>'I was like, for that cheap, I thought it\'d be like really small.','source_text'=>'Saya ingat dengan harga semurah itu, saiznya mesti kecil saja.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>938,'end_time'=>939.06,'target_text'=>'I guess it doesn\'t weigh a lot.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya ia tak berat sangat.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>939.16,'end_time'=>940.9,'target_text'=>'Each of them are like 200 g.','source_text'=>'Setiap satunya kira-kira 200 gram.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>941,'end_time'=>942.5,'target_text'=>'Like, honestly, it\'s not that much.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya sejujurnya ia tak seberapa pun.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>942.6,'end_time'=>947.02,'target_text'=>'Anyways, I\'ll put this knife back here, and we\'ll see you guys later tonight.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, saya letak pisau ini semula di sini, dan kita jumpa malam nanti.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>947.12,'end_time'=>949.94,'target_text'=>'Okay, so um','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi emm','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>950.04,'end_time'=>953.78,'target_text'=>'And I\'ve also started posting these videos as podcasts.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga dah mula muat naik video ini dalam bentuk podcast.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>953.88,'end_time'=>956.62,'target_text'=>'You can find them here or in the description.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh carinya di sini atau di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>956.72,'end_time'=>958.34,'target_text'=>'Bulka English.','source_text'=>'Bulka English.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>958.44,'end_time'=>961.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, as you can see, we didn\'t end up cooking tonight, did we?','source_text'=>'Ya, seperti yang anda nampak, akhirnya kami tak memasak pun malam ini, kan?','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>961.68,'end_time'=>962.62,'target_text'=>'>> We did not.','source_text'=>'>> Memang tak pun.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>962.72,'end_time'=>963.86,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>963.96,'end_time'=>967.58,'target_text'=>'>> Right here you can see, we got takeout from Pizza Hut.','source_text'=>'>> Di sini anda boleh nampak, kami bungkus makanan dari Pizza Hut.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>967.68,'end_time'=>969.02,'target_text'=>'Buy one, get one free.','source_text'=>'Beli satu, percuma satu.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>969.12,'end_time'=>972.06,'target_text'=>'So, you buy one pizza and you get the second one free.','source_text'=>'Jadi bila anda beli satu piza, anda dapat piza kedua percuma.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>972.16,'end_time'=>977.66,'target_text'=>'I got Hawaiian, Leon got meat lovers, and uh it also came with a drink, as well.','source_text'=>'Saya ambil Hawaiian, Leon ambil Meat Lovers, dan ia juga didatangkan dengan minuman sekali.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>977.76,'end_time'=>981.7,'target_text'=>'The pizza was delivered in this big plastic bag.','source_text'=>'Piza ini dihantar dalam beg plastik besar ini.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>981.8,'end_time'=>983.82,'target_text'=>'You can hear, this can is empty.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh dengar, tin ini sudah kosong.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>983.92,'end_time'=>985.78,'target_text'=>'This can is empty.','source_text'=>'Tin ini kosong.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>985.88,'end_time'=>987.22,'target_text'=>'And we finished our pizza.','source_text'=>'Dan kami dah habiskan piza kami.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>987.32,'end_time'=>988.26,'target_text'=>'This one\'s mine.','source_text'=>'Yang ini saya punya.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>988.36,'end_time'=>996.1,'target_text'=>'I still have some crust left, some crust, but uh yeah, now we\'re going to put the pizza boxes back into this bag and throw','source_text'=>'Masih ada sedikit baki kerak piza, tapi ya, sekarang kami akan masukkan semula kotak piza ke dalam beg ini dan buang','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>996.2,'end_time'=>996.62,'target_text'=>'it out.','source_text'=>'ke tong sampah.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>996.72,'end_time'=>1001.74,'target_text'=>'But, tomorrow tomorrow is when we will, or I will uh start using this.','source_text'=>'Tapi esok, esoklah waktu kami atau saya akan mula guna semua bahan ini.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1001.84,'end_time'=>1008.62,'target_text'=>'I think for breakfast I\'ll have some Greek yogurt with fruit, and then for lunch I\'ll definitely eat some meat.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa untuk sarapan saya akan makan yogurt Greek dengan buah, dan untuk makan tengah hari saya pasti akan makan daging.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1008.72,'end_time'=>1009.98,'target_text'=>'>> Well, this is my breakfast.','source_text'=>'>> Inilah sarapan aku.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1010.08,'end_time'=>1011.02,'target_text'=>'Black coffee.','source_text'=>'Kopi hitam \'o\'.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1011.12,'end_time'=>1012.86,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s all you\'re going to have for breakfast?','source_text'=>'>> Itu saja sarapan kau?','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1012.96,'end_time'=>1014.34,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s all you need.','source_text'=>'>> Tu saja yang kau perlukan.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1014.44,'end_time'=>1016.3,'target_text'=>'>> That looks very strong.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak pekat sangat tu.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1016.4,'end_time'=>1019.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, [snorts] it\'s Vietnamese coffee, that\'s why.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, [ketawa kecil] ni kopi Vietnam, sebab tu pekat.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1019.2,'end_time'=>1020.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it looks really strong.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, nampak sangat pekat dan \'kaw\'.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1020.68,'end_time'=>1021.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we\'re done now.','source_text'=>'Ya, kami dah siap makan.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1022.04,'end_time'=>1023.42,'target_text'=>'This is just garbage.','source_text'=>'Ini cuma sampah.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1023.52,'end_time'=>1025.58,'target_text'=>'We\'ll put it in the bag so we can throw it out.','source_text'=>'Kita masukkan ke dalam beg supaya boleh terus dibuang.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1025.68,'end_time'=>1029.22,'target_text'=>'So, this up here, that is the ceiling, the ceiling.','source_text'=>'Jadi di atas ini ialah siling, siling rumah.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1029.32,'end_time'=>1035.02,'target_text'=>'That right there is an AC, air conditioning, an air conditioning unit.','source_text'=>'Yang di sana itu ialah penyaman udara, unit penyaman udara.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1035.12,'end_time'=>1038.74,'target_text'=>'On the wall there, you can see a painting that is a painting.','source_text'=>'Pada dinding di sana, anda boleh nampak lukisan, itu sebuah lukisan.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1038.84,'end_time'=>1040.34,'target_text'=>'Here you have the TV.','source_text'=>'Di sini ada televisyen.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1040.44,'end_time'=>1045.86,'target_text'=>'So now I\'m going to close this pizza box and I\'m going to put it in this bag.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya akan tutup kotak piza ini dan masukkan ke dalam beg ini.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1045.96,'end_time'=>1048.1,'target_text'=>'Did you want to keep these sauces?','source_text'=>'Kau nak simpan sos-sos ni ke?','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1048.2,'end_time'=>1051.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think they\'re all chili sauce, so it\'s up to you.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, aku rasa semuanya sos cili, jadi terpulanglah pada kau.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1051.4,'end_time'=>1052.74,'target_text'=>'>> I think there\'s some ketchup.','source_text'=>'>> Aku rasa ada sos tomato juga.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1052.84,'end_time'=>1055.06,'target_text'=>'Might as well keep it since we\'re staying here.','source_text'=>'Elok simpan saja alang-alang kita menginap di sini.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1055.16,'end_time'=>1056.02,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1056.12,'end_time'=>1057.78,'target_text'=>'I guess we could keep the napkins, too.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita boleh simpan tisu ini juga.','order'=>360],
