            ['start_time'=>207.36,'end_time'=>208.86,'target_text'=>'objects and other things.','source_text'=>'serta bahaya-bahaya lain.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>208.96,'end_time'=>210.58,'target_text'=>'So what do you think this is?','source_text'=>'Jadi pada fikiran anda apakah ini?','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>210.68,'end_time'=>214.86,'target_text'=>'I think this is the entrance to the tower, but then now they\'re renovating it.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini pintu masuk ke menara, tapi sekarang mereka sedang mengubah suainya.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>214.96,'end_time'=>216.94,'target_text'=>'Unless it just was never finished.','source_text'=>'Atau mungkin ia memang belum pernah siap sepenuhnya.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>217.04,'end_time'=>218.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of hard to tell.','source_text'=>'Agak susah nak dipastikan.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>218.4,'end_time'=>219.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m not too sure.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, aku pun tak pasti sangat.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>219.84,'end_time'=>221.9,'target_text'=>'There might be multiple ways to get in.','source_text'=>'Mungkin ada beberapa laluan untuk masuk.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>222,'end_time'=>222.82,'target_text'=>'>> Most likely.','source_text'=>'>> Besar kemungkinan.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>222.92,'end_time'=>226.22,'target_text'=>'Okay guys, what do you notice right here?','source_text'=>'Baiklah semua, apa yang anda perhatikan di sini?','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>226.32,'end_time'=>227.86,'target_text'=>'What is this part right here?','source_text'=>'Apakah nama bahagian ini di sini?','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>227.96,'end_time'=>229.02,'target_text'=>'>> That is the curb.','source_text'=>'>> Itu ialah bendul jalan (*curb*).','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>229.12,'end_time'=>229.66,'target_text'=>'>> Correct.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>229.76,'end_time'=>230.74,'target_text'=>'That is the curb.','source_text'=>'Itu ialah bendul jalan.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>230.84,'end_time'=>233.46,'target_text'=>'And what is the part I\'m walking on right now?','source_text'=>'Dan bahagian manakah yang sedang saya pijak dan lalui sekarang?','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>233.56,'end_time'=>234.82,'target_text'=>'What is this part?','source_text'=>'Apakah bahagian ini?','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>234.92,'end_time'=>236.42,'target_text'=>'>> That is the sidewalk.','source_text'=>'>> Itu ialah laluan pejalan kaki (*sidewalk*).','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>236.52,'end_time'=>237.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, this is the sidewalk.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ini ialah laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>238.08,'end_time'=>242.3,'target_text'=>'And what is that part right there where the vehicles are driving on?','source_text'=>'Dan apakah bahagian di sebelah sana tempat kenderaan sedang lalu-lalang?','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>242.4,'end_time'=>243.82,'target_text'=>'>> That is the road.','source_text'=>'>> Itu ialah jalan raya.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>243.92,'end_time'=>244.46,'target_text'=>'>> The road.','source_text'=>'>> Jalan raya.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>244.56,'end_time'=>246.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s the road or you could also call it the street.','source_text'=>'Ia ialah \'road\' atau anda juga boleh panggil \'street\'.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>247.04,'end_time'=>248.1,'target_text'=>'The road or the street.','source_text'=>'Jalan raya.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>248.2,'end_time'=>250.9,'target_text'=>'And what part of the road are the vehicles parked on?','source_text'=>'Dan di bahagian jalan raya yang manakah kenderaan-kenderaan itu diletakkan?','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>251,'end_time'=>253.58,'target_text'=>'>> That is the shoulder of the road.','source_text'=>'>> Itu ialah bahu jalan (*shoulder of the road*).','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>253.68,'end_time'=>254.26,'target_text'=>'>> Correct.','source_text'=>'>> Tepat sekali.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>254.36,'end_time'=>256.5,'target_text'=>'They are parked on the shoulder of the road.','source_text'=>'Kenderaan itu diparkir di atas bahu jalan.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>256.6,'end_time'=>259.94,'target_text'=>'The shoulder of the road is from the yellow line inwards.','source_text'=>'Bahu jalan ialah kawasan dari garisan kuning ke arah dalam.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>260.04,'end_time'=>265.82,'target_text'=>'As you can see, the vehicles are too big to fit within the shoulder, so they are parked a little bit on the road.','source_text'=>'Seperti yang anda lihat, kenderaan terlalu besar untuk muat dalam bahu jalan, jadi ia diparkir sedikit memakan jalan.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>265.92,'end_time'=>267.82,'target_text'=>'But, I guess that\'s legal here.','source_text'=>'Tapi nampaknya perkara itu dibenarkan di sini.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>267.92,'end_time'=>271.66,'target_text'=>'In Canada, I\'m pretty sure they would get fined for parking here.','source_text'=>'Di Kanada, saya cukup yakin mereka akan disaman kalau parkir macam ini.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>271.76,'end_time'=>273.58,'target_text'=>'What am I doing right now?','source_text'=>'Apa yang sedang saya buat sekarang?','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>273.68,'end_time'=>275.42,'target_text'=>'>> You\'re fanning your face.','source_text'=>'>> Kau tengah mengipas muka kau.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>275.52,'end_time'=>277.18,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m fanning my face.','source_text'=>'>> Saya sedang mengipas muka saya.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>277.28,'end_time'=>280.3,'target_text'=>'Why am I fanning my face?','source_text'=>'Kenapa saya mengipas muka saya?','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>280.4,'end_time'=>281.74,'target_text'=>'>> Is that it\'s hot out here?','source_text'=>'>> Sebab cuaca panas di luar ni ke?','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>281.84,'end_time'=>282.86,'target_text'=>'>> It is very hot.','source_text'=>'>> Memang sangat panas.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>282.96,'end_time'=>283.54,'target_text'=>'That is correct.','source_text'=>'Jawapan itu betul.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>283.64,'end_time'=>287.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m fanning my face because it is very very hot today.','source_text'=>'Saya mengipas muka sebab cuaca hari ini memang tersangat panas.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>288.04,'end_time'=>292.62,'target_text'=>'This right here is the entrance to the MRT station.','source_text'=>'Di sini ialah pintu masuk ke stesen MRT.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>292.72,'end_time'=>294.94,'target_text'=>'And that over there, you can see another tower.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah sana pula, anda boleh nampak sebuah lagi menara.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>295.04,'end_time'=>297.34,'target_text'=>'That is the KL Tower.','source_text'=>'Itu ialah Menara KL.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>297.44,'end_time'=>301.42,'target_text'=>'Okay, that was a short comprehensible input lesson.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, itu tadi pelajaran input mudah faham yang ringkas.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>301.52,'end_time'=>304.18,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s learn about directions.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita belajar tentang panduan arah.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>304.28,'end_time'=>308.38,'target_text'=>'How to give directions and how to ask for directions.','source_text'=>'Cara memberi arah dan cara bertanyakan arah.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>308.48,'end_time'=>309.66,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>309.76,'end_time'=>311.5,'target_text'=>'Yo, what are you working on?','source_text'=>'Yo, kau tengah buat apa tu?','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>311.6,'end_time'=>314.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I\'m working on my channel right now.','source_text'=>'>> Yo, aku tengah uruskan saluran aku sekarang.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>314.64,'end_time'=>315.34,'target_text'=>'Okay, I just started.','source_text'=>'Aku baru saja mula.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>315.44,'end_time'=>318.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to be posting once a week if you guys want to check it out.','source_text'=>'Aku akan muat naik seminggu sekali kalau korang nak tengok.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>318.2,'end_time'=>324.42,'target_text'=>'>> So, if you guys want to follow Leon on YouTube, he\'s posting comprehensible input vlogs here, Noma Media.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi kalau korang nak ikuti Leon di YouTube, dia muat naik vlog input mudah faham di sini, Noma Media.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>324.52,'end_time'=>325.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Pautannya ada di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>325.96,'end_time'=>332.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, we just finished the slow English comprehensible input vlog part.','source_text'=>'Baiklah semua, kita baru saja selesai bahagian vlog input mudah faham bahasa Inggeris yang santai.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>332.16,'end_time'=>333.62,'target_text'=>'Hopefully, you guys enjoyed that.','source_text'=>'Semoga anda semua seronok menontonnya.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>333.72,'end_time'=>340.06,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s talk about how to ask for directions and how to give directions.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita bincangkan cara bertanya arah dan memberi arah.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>340.16,'end_time'=>346.02,'target_text'=>'So, we\'ll just be following these three simple steps: ask, confirm, and follow.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita cuma perlu ikut tiga langkah mudah ini: tanya, sahkan, dan ikut.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>346.12,'end_time'=>351.14,'target_text'=>'Here are some sentences you can use to ask for directions.','source_text'=>'Berikut ialah beberapa ayat yang boleh anda gunakan untuk bertanyakan arah.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>351.24,'end_time'=>355.26,'target_text'=>'Excuse me, where is this place?','source_text'=>'Tumpang tanya, di manakah tempat ini?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>355.36,'end_time'=>357.86,'target_text'=>'Excuse me, where is the mall?','source_text'=>'Tumpang tanya, di manakah pusat beli-belah?','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>357.96,'end_time'=>359.34,'target_text'=>'Where is the park?','source_text'=>'Di manakah taman itu?','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>359.44,'end_time'=>361.3,'target_text'=>'Where is the university?','source_text'=>'Di manakah universiti itu?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>361.4,'end_time'=>366.34,'target_text'=>'Another way to ask that is how do I get to blank?','source_text'=>'Satu lagi cara untuk bertanya ialah \'how do I get to\' (bagaimanakah cara untuk saya ke tempat itu)?','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>366.44,'end_time'=>368.18,'target_text'=>'How do I get to the mall?','source_text'=>'Bagaimanakah cara untuk saya pergi ke pusat beli-belah?','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>368.28,'end_time'=>374.5,'target_text'=>'And the final way to ask for directions is is blank near here?','source_text'=>'Dan cara terakhir untuk bertanyakan arah ialah dengan bertanya adakah tempat itu dekat dari sini?','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>374.6,'end_time'=>377.78,'target_text'=>'Is the university near here?','source_text'=>'Adakah universiti itu dekat dari sini?','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>377.88,'end_time'=>380.78,'target_text'=>'Is the station near here?','source_text'=>'Adakah stesen itu berdekatan dari sini?','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>380.88,'end_time'=>389.66,'target_text'=>'So, after you go up to someone and ask them for directions and they tell you the directions, you want to confirm the directions','source_text'=>'Jadi selepas anda pergi bertanya arah kepada seseorang dan mereka menerangkannya, anda perlu sahkan semula arah tersebut','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>389.76,'end_time'=>391.58,'target_text'=>'so you know where you\'re going.','source_text'=>'supaya anda tahu hala tuju anda.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>391.68,'end_time'=>397.62,'target_text'=>'A couple ways to confirm the directions are, so I go insert directions.','source_text'=>'Beberapa cara untuk mengesahkan arah ialah dengan menyebut semula panduan arah yang diberikan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>397.72,'end_time'=>401.34,'target_text'=>'So, I go left at the traffic light and then straight for 10 minutes.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya saya perlu belok kiri di lampu isyarat dan kemudian terus selama 10 minit.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>401.44,'end_time'=>404.18,'target_text'=>'You can also ask, is it far?','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh bertanya, adakah ia jauh?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>404.28,'end_time'=>407.94,'target_text'=>'About how long will it take to walk there?','source_text'=>'Kira-kira berapa lama masa yang diambil untuk berjalan kaki ke sana?','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>408.04,'end_time'=>414.46,'target_text'=>'And finally, can I walk there or do I need to drive or take public transit?','source_text'=>'Dan akhir sekali, bolehkah saya berjalan kaki ke sana atau saya perlu memandu atau naik pengangkutan awam?','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>414.56,'end_time'=>417.82,'target_text'=>'And the third step is to follow the directions.','source_text'=>'Dan langkah ketiga ialah mengikut panduan arah tersebut.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>417.92,'end_time'=>424.02,'target_text'=>'Go straight, turn right at the corner, go past the entrance, and it\'ll be on your left.','source_text'=>'Jalan terus, belok kanan di selekoh, jalan melepasi pintu masuk, dan ia akan berada di sebelah kiri anda.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>424.12,'end_time'=>426.82,'target_text'=>'Now, how can you give someone directions?','source_text'=>'Sekarang, bagaimana pula cara anda memberikan panduan arah kepada orang lain?','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>426.92,'end_time'=>430.54,'target_text'=>'So, if someone asks you, oh, where is the mall?','source_text'=>'Jadi jika seseorang bertanya kepada anda, di manakah pusat beli-belah?','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>430.64,'end_time'=>434.58,'target_text'=>'You need to know how to give them directions so that you can help them.','source_text'=>'Anda perlu tahu cara memberikan panduan arah supaya dapat membantu mereka.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>434.68,'end_time'=>437.46,'target_text'=>'Here are some words you can use to give directions.','source_text'=>'Berikut ialah beberapa perkataan yang boleh anda gunakan untuk memberi panduan arah.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>437.56,'end_time'=>441.18,'target_text'=>'Go, then, after that, finally.','source_text'=>'Pergi, kemudian, selepas itu, akhir sekali.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>441.28,'end_time'=>443.5,'target_text'=>'So, here is an example sentence.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini ialah contoh ayat.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>443.6,'end_time'=>450.66,'target_text'=>'Go straight, then turn left, after that go past the cafe, finally, it\'s on your right.','source_text'=>'Jalan terus, kemudian belok kiri, selepas itu jalan melepasi kafe, akhir sekali ia berada di sebelah kanan anda.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>450.76,'end_time'=>451.9,'target_text'=>'Now, it\'s your turn.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, giliran anda pula.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>452,'end_time'=>456.4,'target_text'=>'Practice saying this line here on the bottom.','source_text'=>'Latih menyebut ayat yang tertera di bahagian bawah ini.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>459.88,'end_time'=>460.62,'target_text'=>'Good job.','source_text'=>'Bagus.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>460.72,'end_time'=>465.26,'target_text'=>'The line reads, go straight, turn right at the corner.','source_text'=>'Ayat itu berbunyi: jalan terus, belok kanan di selekoh.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>465.36,'end_time'=>467.26,'target_text'=>'After that, cross the street.','source_text'=>'Selepas itu, seberang jalan.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>467.36,'end_time'=>469.54,'target_text'=>'Finally, it\'s on your left.','source_text'=>'Akhir sekali, ia berada di sebelah kiri anda.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>469.64,'end_time'=>475.5,'target_text'=>'Now, we\'ll have three scenarios to practice your speaking and pronunciation.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, kita ada tiga situasi untuk melatih pertuturan dan sebutan anda.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>475.6,'end_time'=>482.36,'target_text'=>'The first one, my brother will answer, and the second two, you will answer.','source_text'=>'Situasi pertama abang saya akan jawab, dan dua situasi seterusnya anda yang akan jawab.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>482.56,'end_time'=>485.46,'target_text'=>'Excuse me, where is the entrance?','source_text'=>'Tumpang tanya, di manakah pintu masuk?','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>485.56,'end_time'=>488.3,'target_text'=>'>> Go straight, then turn left at the corner.','source_text'=>'>> Jalan terus, kemudian belok kiri di selekoh.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>488.4,'end_time'=>489.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s on your right.','source_text'=>'Ia berada di sebelah kanan anda.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>489.76,'end_time'=>494.22,'target_text'=>'>> So, I go straight, then I turn left at the corner, right?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi saya jalan terus, kemudian belok kiri di selekoh, betul kan?','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>494.32,'end_time'=>495.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>495.2,'end_time'=>496.02,'target_text'=>'>> Is it far?','source_text'=>'>> Adakah ia jauh?','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>496.12,'end_time'=>498.46,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s about 5 minutes.','source_text'=>'>> Tidak, lebih kurang 5 minit saja.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>498.56,'end_time'=>499.62,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, perfect.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, terbaik.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>499.72,'end_time'=>500.42,'target_text'=>'Thank you very much.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih banyak-banyak.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>500.52,'end_time'=>501.38,'target_text'=>'Bye.','source_text'=>'Selamat tinggal.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>501.48,'end_time'=>503.98,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s go on to the second scenario.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita beralih ke situasi kedua.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>504.08,'end_time'=>509.3,'target_text'=>'I want you guys to read the yellow caption on the bottom of the screen.','source_text'=>'Saya mahu anda baca kapsyen kuning di bahagian bawah skrin.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>509.4,'end_time'=>511.2,'target_text'=>'Go.','source_text'=>'Mula.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>513.24,'end_time'=>516.34,'target_text'=>'Go straight to the intersection, then turn right.','source_text'=>'Jalan terus ke persimpangan jalan, kemudian belok kanan.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>516.44,'end_time'=>521.24,'target_text'=>'Go past the cafe, and it\'ll be on your left.','source_text'=>'Jalan melepasi kafe, dan ia akan berada di sebelah kiri anda.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>523.44,'end_time'=>524.42,'target_text'=>'Exactly.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>524.52,'end_time'=>529.04,'target_text'=>'Third scenario, is the entrance near here?','source_text'=>'Situasi ketiga, adakah pintu masuk dekat dari sini?','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>532.28,'end_time'=>535.62,'target_text'=>'Across the parking area between the two buildings, got it.','source_text'=>'Melintasi kawasan tempat letak kereta di antara dua bangunan itu, faham.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>535.72,'end_time'=>536.3,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>536.4,'end_time'=>539.1,'target_text'=>'Get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku kerja untuk video ini di laman web saya.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>539.2,'end_time'=>543.34,'target_text'=>'Buy five or more and get 30% off automatically at checkout.','source_text'=>'Beli lima atau lebih dan dapatkan diskaun 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>543.44,'end_time'=>546.74,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s talk about some common mistakes.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita bincangkan beberapa kesilapan lazim.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>546.84,'end_time'=>549.5,'target_text'=>'Where is it versus where it is.','source_text'=>'Penggunaan \'where is it\' berbanding \'where it is\'.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>549.6,'end_time'=>554.06,'target_text'=>'Use where is it when you\'re asking a question.','source_text'=>'Gunakan \'where is it\' apabila anda bertanyakan soalan.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>554.16,'end_time'=>557.78,'target_text'=>'For example, where is the entrance?','source_text'=>'Sebagai contoh, \'where is the entrance?\'','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>557.88,'end_time'=>559.22,'target_text'=>'That is correct.','source_text'=>'Itu yang betul.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>559.32,'end_time'=>562.78,'target_text'=>'Where the entrance is, that is wrong.','source_text'=>'\'Where the entrance is\', yang itu salah.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>562.88,'end_time'=>568.42,'target_text'=>'But, where the entrance is is still correct inside a longer sentence.','source_text'=>'Tetapi, \'where the entrance is\' masih betul jika berada di dalam ayat yang lebih panjang.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>568.52,'end_time'=>573.38,'target_text'=>'For example, can you tell me where the entrance is?','source_text'=>'Contohnya, \'can you tell me where the entrance is?\'','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>573.48,'end_time'=>579.58,'target_text'=>'Common mistake number two, on the left side and in the left side.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan lazim nombor dua: \'on the left side\' dan \'in the left side\'.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>579.68,'end_time'=>583.62,'target_text'=>'So, we use the word on when talking about sides.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita gunakan perkataan \'on\' apabila bercakap tentang bahagian sisi.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>583.72,'end_time'=>587.78,'target_text'=>'So, on the right side or on the left side.','source_text'=>'Contohnya, \'on the right side\' atau \'on the left side\'.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>587.88,'end_time'=>589.5,'target_text'=>'We don\'t use in.','source_text'=>'Kita tidak gunakan perkataan \'in\'.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>589.6,'end_time'=>596.18,'target_text'=>'In is for inside a space, like in the mall, in your car, in your house.','source_text'=>'\'In\' digunakan untuk bahagian dalam ruang, seperti di dalam pusat beli-belah, kereta, atau rumah anda.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>596.28,'end_time'=>598.94,'target_text'=>'Correct, it\'s on your left.','source_text'=>'Yang betul, \'it\'s on your left\'.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>599.04,'end_time'=>601.82,'target_text'=>'Wrong, it\'s in your left.','source_text'=>'Yang salah, \'it\'s in your left\'.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>601.92,'end_time'=>606.98,'target_text'=>'The third common mistake is go straight verse go straightly.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan lazim ketiga ialah \'go straight\' berbanding \'go straightly\'.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>607.08,'end_time'=>613.5,'target_text'=>'Straight is already an adverb here, so you don\'t add l y, straightly.','source_text'=>'\'Straight\' di sini sudah bertindak sebagai kata keterangan, jadi jangan tambah -ly menjadikannya \'straightly\'.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>613.6,'end_time'=>615.94,'target_text'=>'You don\'t say go straightly.','source_text'=>'Jangan sebut \'go straightly\'.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>616.04,'end_time'=>617.94,'target_text'=>'You say go straight.','source_text'=>'Sebutlah \'go straight\'.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>618.04,'end_time'=>623.82,'target_text'=>'And you can also say go straight ahead, but you can never say go straightly ahead.','source_text'=>'Dan anda juga boleh sebut \'go straight ahead\', tetapi jangan sekali-kali sebut \'go straightly ahead\'.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>623.92,'end_time'=>629.26,'target_text'=>'And the final common mistake is turn left verse turn to left.','source_text'=>'Dan kesilapan lazim terakhir ialah \'turn left\' berbanding \'turn to left\'.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>629.36,'end_time'=>636.3,'target_text'=>'When we\'re giving directions, we don\'t say turn to left, we just say turn left or turn right.','source_text'=>'Bila kita memberi panduan arah, kita tak sebut \'turn to left\', kita hanya sebut \'turn left\' atau \'turn right\'.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>636.4,'end_time'=>640.22,'target_text'=>'So, the correct way to say it would be turn left at the corner.','source_text'=>'Jadi cara yang betul untuk menyebutnya ialah \'turn left at the corner\'.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>640.32,'end_time'=>644.34,'target_text'=>'The wrong way would be turn to left at the corner.','source_text'=>'Cara yang salah ialah \'turn to left at the corner\'.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>644.44,'end_time'=>648.26,'target_text'=>'You see how turn to left kind of sounds off?','source_text'=>'Nampak tak kenapa \'turn to left\' bunyi agak janggal?','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>648.36,'end_time'=>650.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s because we don\'t say two.','source_text'=>'Ia kerana kita tidak menggunakan perkataan \'to\'.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>650.32,'end_time'=>653.26,'target_text'=>'You just say turn left at the corner.','source_text'=>'Anda cuma perlu sebut \'turn left at the corner\'.','order'=>202],
