            ['start_time'=>883.32,'end_time'=>884.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, those are the eye jackets.','source_text'=>'Oh, itu model Eye Jacket.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>884.48,'end_time'=>886.86,'target_text'=>'I almost got those, but they did not fit me.','source_text'=>'Saya hampir beli yang itu dulu, tapi tak padan dengan muka saya.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>886.96,'end_time'=>888.46,'target_text'=>'>> But this mall is not too busy today.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi pusat beli-belah ini tak terlalu sesak hari ini.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>888.56,'end_time'=>889.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty empty.','source_text'=>'Keadaannya agak lengang.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>889.64,'end_time'=>891.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s not busy because it\'s Monday.','source_text'=>'Tak ramai orang sebab hari Isnin.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>891.52,'end_time'=>892.58,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s also kind of far out.','source_text'=>'>> Lokasinya pun agak jauh ke pedalaman.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>892.68,'end_time'=>894.58,'target_text'=>'Like this town is like it feels small.','source_text'=>'Pekan ini terasa seperti pekan kecil.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>894.68,'end_time'=>897.86,'target_text'=>'>> People make a trip to an outlet mall for like the whole day.','source_text'=>'>> Orang biasanya luangkan masa seharian kalau datang ke outlet mall macam ni.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>897.96,'end_time'=>898.36,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>898.36,'end_time'=>903.14,'target_text'=>'>> This outlet mall doesn\'t have much stuff, though, if I am being honest.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya outlet mall ini tak banyak sangat barang menarik.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>903.24,'end_time'=>907.42,'target_text'=>'>> The last big outlet mall I went to was in Busan, and it was like way out of the city.','source_text'=>'>> Outlet mall besar terakhir yang aku pergi ialah di Busan, lokasinya pun jauh di luar bandar.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>907.52,'end_time'=>911.46,'target_text'=>'Like you had to take a bus to get there, but it was massive like this one, too.','source_text'=>'Kena naik bas untuk sampai, tapi saiznya tersangat besar macam yang ini juga.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>911.56,'end_time'=>913.1,'target_text'=>'>> It is massive, just not busy.','source_text'=>'>> Memang sangat besar, cuma tak ramai orang.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>913.2,'end_time'=>915.66,'target_text'=>'I think over here is the passageway.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa laluan jejantas ada di sebelah sini.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>915.76,'end_time'=>916.12,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Baiklah semua.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>916.12,'end_time'=>922.26,'target_text'=>'Now we\'re in the Sport Hill, and we\'re going down to the men\'s and adults section and area.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di Sportsville, dan kita turun ke bahagian pakaian lelaki dan dewasa.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>922.36,'end_time'=>923.74,'target_text'=>'And right there is the Nike store.','source_text'=>'Dan di sana ialah kedai Nike.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>923.84,'end_time'=>927.86,'target_text'=>'This is a huge store, but I don\'t really need anything sports-wise.','source_text'=>'Kedainya sangat besar, tapi saya tak perlukan apa-apa barangan sukan buat masa ini.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>927.96,'end_time'=>931.46,'target_text'=>'I already looked for my rain jacket and I couldn\'t find it, unfortunately.','source_text'=>'Saya dah cari jaket kalis hujan tapi malangnya tak jumpa yang sesuai.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>931.56,'end_time'=>933.66,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, Nike is right here.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kedai Nike ada di sini.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>933.76,'end_time'=>935.34,'target_text'=>'Maybe let\'s go check out the Nike tech.','source_text'=>'Mungkin jom kita tengok koleksi Nike Tech.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>935.44,'end_time'=>942.7,'target_text'=>'Last time I was at the Nike outlet I bought my shorts that I wear to Okay, guys, we just went through that It was kind of','source_text'=>'Kali terakhir saya ke outlet Nike saya beli seluar pendek yang saya pakai Baiklah semua, kami baru saja pusing di situ,','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>942.8,'end_time'=>949.34,'target_text'=>'like nothing in the sports section, so we just decided to come out and we actually have to catch a bus very soon.','source_text'=>'tiada apa-apa yang menarik di bahagian sukan, jadi kami buat keputusan untuk keluar dan kami perlu kejar bas sebentar lagi.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>949.44,'end_time'=>952.18,'target_text'=>'So, we decided that let\'s quickly go through the Sports field.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami buat keputusan untuk tengok sepintas lalu di zon sukan ini.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>952.28,'end_time'=>958.82,'target_text'=>'That was the last area and then let\'s run and get that bus because if not we\'re going to have to wait 30 minutes cuz like','source_text'=>'Itulah bahagian terakhir dan sekarang jom kita lari kejar bas sebab kalau terlepas kita kena tunggu 30 minit lagi seperti','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>958.92,'end_time'=>960.66,'target_text'=>'I told you guys 30-minute intervals.','source_text'=>'yang saya beritahu tadi sela masa 30 minit.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>960.76,'end_time'=>961.78,'target_text'=>'So, Run.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom lari.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>961.88,'end_time'=>964.88,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll leave Leon and I\'ll go.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tinggalkan Leon dan saya lari dulu.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>965.44,'end_time'=>966.82,'target_text'=>'Bro, I just gave up.','source_text'=>'Bro, aku pasrah sajalah.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>966.92,'end_time'=>968.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, is this a pipe?','source_text'=>'>> Yo, ini paip ke?','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>968.16,'end_time'=>969.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, oil pipe.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, paip minyak.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>969.48,'end_time'=>971.78,'target_text'=>'>> But this outlet mall is Premium Outlet Mall is huge.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi Premium Outlet Mall ini memang sangat luas.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>971.88,'end_time'=>973.42,'target_text'=>'Like I said there were six, but I was wrong.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula saya kata ada enam bangunan, tapi saya silap.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>973.52,'end_time'=>978.42,'target_text'=>'Four main buildings, Sports Ville, Luxury Ville, Fashion Ville, and Youth Culture Ville.','source_text'=>'Ada empat bangunan utama: Sportsville, Luxuryville, Fashionville, dan Youth Cultureville.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>978.52,'end_time'=>979.5,'target_text'=>'But we saw the mall.','source_text'=>'Tapi kami dah tengok keseluruhan kompleks ini.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>979.6,'end_time'=>982.74,'target_text'=>'I think I preferred just a normal department store, to be honest.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya rasa saya lebih suka gedung beli-belah biasa.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>982.84,'end_time'=>984.3,'target_text'=>'>> What about the buildings were cold?','source_text'=>'>> Bangunan di sini pun sejuk sangat.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>984.4,'end_time'=>985.74,'target_text'=>'>> What about the deals?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana pula dengan tawaran diskaun?','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>985.84,'end_time'=>987.62,'target_text'=>'>> I didn\'t really see any deals that good.','source_text'=>'>> Aku tak nampak banyak tawaran yang betul-betul menarik.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>987.72,'end_time'=>988.74,'target_text'=>'So, I didn\'t buy anything today.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak beli apa-apa pun hari ini.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>988.84,'end_time'=>989.9,'target_text'=>'Like I don\'t have anything on me.','source_text'=>'Tak ada sebarang beg barangan pada saya.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>990,'end_time'=>995.62,'target_text'=>'I like that Uniqlo cashmere thing, but I can buy that at any Uniqlo, so I decided not to buy it here.','source_text'=>'Saya suka baju kasmir Uniqlo tadi, tapi saya boleh beli di mana-mana cawangan Uniqlo jadi saya tangguhkan.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>995.72,'end_time'=>998.98,'target_text'=>'I decided to buy it close to where I live, just in case I want to return it.','source_text'=>'Lebih baik saya beli berhampiran tempat tinggal saya sekiranya saya nak pulangkan semula.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>999.08,'end_time'=>1000.94,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t have to come all the way back here.','source_text'=>'Supaya tak perlu datang jauh-jauh ke sini lagi.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1001.04,'end_time'=>1003.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, besides that I didn\'t see a sweater or a hoodie I liked.','source_text'=>'Selain daripada itu saya tak nampak baju sejuk atau hoodie yang saya berkenan.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1003.84,'end_time'=>1007.06,'target_text'=>'But now we\'re going to go catch that bus and we\'ll see you guys on the bus.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang kami nak kejar bas itu dan jumpa anda semua di dalam bas nanti.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1007.16,'end_time'=>1008.58,'target_text'=>'Want more English practice?','source_text'=>'Inginkan lebih banyak latihan bahasa Inggeris?','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1008.68,'end_time'=>1014.58,'target_text'=>'Join my Patreon for extra lessons, speaking practice, and more ways to improve every week.','source_text'=>'Sertai Patreon saya untuk pelajaran tambahan, latihan bertutur, dan pelbagai bimbingan setiap minggu.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1014.68,'end_time'=>1018.78,'target_text'=>'>> The Premium Outlet Mall is where it tells you how many seats are available.','source_text'=>'>> Di Premium Outlet Mall tempat di mana dipaparkan bilangan tempat duduk kosong.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1018.88,'end_time'=>1020.66,'target_text'=>'And this one says there are It\'s pretty good.','source_text'=>'Dan bas ini memaparkan tempat duduknya cukup selesa.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1020.76,'end_time'=>1021.16,'target_text'=>'It\'s cheap.','source_text'=>'Tambangnya murah.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1021.2,'end_time'=>1022.18,'target_text'=>'This is a long bus.','source_text'=>'Ini bas perjalanan jauh.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1022.28,'end_time'=>1022.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1022.8,'end_time'=>1025.34,'target_text'=>'>> Or a motor coach, depending on where you are.','source_text'=>'>> Atau bas persiaran, bergantung pada tempat anda.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1025.44,'end_time'=>1027.46,'target_text'=>'You Oh, it\'s indoors and outdoors.','source_text'=>'Ada kawasan dalam dan luar bangunan.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1027.56,'end_time'=>1030.5,'target_text'=>'So, when we walk in there first since it\'s right here, might as well.','source_text'=>'Bila kita masuk alang-alang kedainya di sini, elok kita singgah.','order'=>433],
