            ['start_time'=>1527.48,'end_time'=>1533.66,'target_text'=>'I think we\'ve tried like a lot of Vietnamese food, but maybe there\'s like some niche hidden secret food that we don\'t know','source_text'=>'Rasanya kami dah cuba banyak makanan Vietnam, tapi mungkin ada juadah tersembunyi (*hidden gems*) yang kami belum pernah rasa','order'=>465],
