            ['start_time'=>340.2,'end_time'=>342.9,'target_text'=>'Over there you can see it is very sunny.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana anda boleh nampak panas matahari sangat terik.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>343,'end_time'=>345.14,'target_text'=>'But here it\'s nice and shady.','source_text'=>'Tapi di sini suasananya redup dan nyaman.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>345.24,'end_time'=>349.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, so I just met up with my brother and my mom here and now we\'re going to go eat lunch.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, saya baru sahaja berjumpa abang dan emak saya di sini dan sekarang kami akan pergi makan tengah hari.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>349.68,'end_time'=>351.42,'target_text'=>'So, lead the way.','source_text'=>'Bolehlah tunjukkan jalannya.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>351.52,'end_time'=>354.18,'target_text'=>'So, everyone here is eating lunch right now.','source_text'=>'Semua orang di sini sedang makan tengah hari sekarang.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>354.28,'end_time'=>358.02,'target_text'=>'This is like a lunch spot for office workers by the looks of it.','source_text'=>'Kelihatannya tempat ini macam port makan tengah hari bagi pekerja pejabat.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>358.12,'end_time'=>360.06,'target_text'=>'And they have like a set meal there.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka ada hidangan set makanan di situ.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>360.16,'end_time'=>364.14,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re at Circle K and we\'re going to go get a drink.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami berada di kedai Circle K dan kami akan beli minuman.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>364.24,'end_time'=>365.62,'target_text'=>'We\'re all going to go get a drink.','source_text'=>'Kami semua nak beli minuman.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>365.72,'end_time'=>366.78,'target_text'=>'I\'m kind of thirsty.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa agak dahaga.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>366.88,'end_time'=>370.14,'target_text'=>'Okay, so I\'ll go and get Leona drink.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, saya akan belikan minuman untuk Leon.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>370.24,'end_time'=>377.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we got the drinks from Circle K It was two plus one, so we got two diet Cokes and they gave one free.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kami dah beli air dari Circle K. Ada promosi beli dua percuma satu, jadi kami beli dua tin Coca-Cola Diet dan dapat satu percuma.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>377.72,'end_time'=>382.06,'target_text'=>'So, three in total and my mom got Pocari Sweat electrolytes.','source_text'=>'Semuanya tiga tin, dan emak saya beli minuman elektrolit Pocari Sweat.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>382.16,'end_time'=>384.34,'target_text'=>'That is my favorite electrolyte drink.','source_text'=>'Itu minuman elektrolit kegemaran saya.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>384.44,'end_time'=>385.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Rasanya memang sangat sedap.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>385.44,'end_time'=>387.46,'target_text'=>'And now we\'re walking to the restaurant.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang kami sedang berjalan ke restoran.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>387.56,'end_time'=>390.14,'target_text'=>'You can see a lot of scooters parked on the side here.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak banyak skuter diparkir di tepi jalan di sini.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>390.24,'end_time'=>395.42,'target_text'=>'So, you can see there are a lot of restaurants serving people here because it\'s lunch time right now.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak ada banyak kedai makan melayan pelanggan sebab sekarang waktu makan tengah hari.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>395.52,'end_time'=>399.42,'target_text'=>'So, everyone\'s eating and these scooters are literally right in the way.','source_text'=>'Semua orang tengah makan dan skuter-skuter ni diparkir betul-betul menghalang laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>399.52,'end_time'=>402.36,'target_text'=>'So, we have to go around here.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami terpaksa mencelah dan berpusing ikut sini.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>409,'end_time'=>409.5,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Baiklah kawan-kawan.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>409.6,'end_time'=>411.26,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re having lunch now.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami sedang menikmati makan tengah hari.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>411.36,'end_time'=>412.18,'target_text'=>'Do you have the menu?','source_text'=>'Ada menu ke?','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>412.28,'end_time'=>417.3,'target_text'=>'We don\'t have the menu, but this is the Bun Cha restaurant that Barack Obama came to eat at.','source_text'=>'Kami tak ada menu, tapi inilah restoran Bun Cha yang pernah dikunjungi oleh Barack Obama untuk makan.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>417.4,'end_time'=>418.42,'target_text'=>'Barack Obama.','source_text'=>'Barack Obama.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>418.52,'end_time'=>420.54,'target_text'=>'So, here this is called Bun Cha.','source_text'=>'Hidangan ini dipanggil Bun Cha.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>420.64,'end_time'=>422.02,'target_text'=>'There\'s like meat in here.','source_text'=>'Ada hirisan daging di dalam ini.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>422.12,'end_time'=>426.46,'target_text'=>'This right here is some noodles and then you have some greens here.','source_text'=>'Yang ini mee bihun dan ada pelbagai sayur ulaman hijau di sini.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>426.56,'end_time'=>428.42,'target_text'=>'Lettuce and other leaves.','source_text'=>'Salad dan dedaun herba lain.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>428.52,'end_time'=>435.02,'target_text'=>'This right here is a bowl of diced garlic and that is a bowl of chilies.','source_text'=>'Di sini ada semangkuk bawang putih cincang dan itu pula semangkuk cili potong.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>435.12,'end_time'=>436.02,'target_text'=>'But, yeah.','source_text'=>'Begitulah hidangannya.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>436.12,'end_time'=>437.06,'target_text'=>'This is what I\'m going to eat.','source_text'=>'Inilah yang saya akan makan.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>437.16,'end_time'=>439.7,'target_text'=>'I believe this is fish sauce in here.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya kuah ini menggunakan sos ikan.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>439.8,'end_time'=>440.5,'target_text'=>'Looks really good.','source_text'=>'Nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>440.6,'end_time'=>442.34,'target_text'=>'Okay, so let\'s try this food now.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, mari kita cuba makanan ini sekarang.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>442.44,'end_time'=>446.7,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to put my glasses on my head like this to keep my hair out of my face.','source_text'=>'Saya letak cermin mata di atas kepala macam ni supaya rambut tak tutup muka.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>446.8,'end_time'=>447.42,'target_text'=>'So.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>447.52,'end_time'=>449.18,'target_text'=>'We try this.','source_text'=>'Mari kita rasa.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>449.28,'end_time'=>451.4,'target_text'=>'Got some meat.','source_text'=>'Ambil sedikit daging.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>455.44,'end_time'=>457.38,'target_text'=>'Noodles here.','source_text'=>'Mee bihun di sini.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>457.48,'end_time'=>458.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Sedap betul rasanya.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>458.68,'end_time'=>460.48,'target_text'=>'Noodles.','source_text'=>'Mee.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>462.56,'end_time'=>463.78,'target_text'=>'And we have these spring rolls.','source_text'=>'Dan kami ada popia goreng (*spring rolls*) ini.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>463.88,'end_time'=>466.64,'target_text'=>'I\'m me to one of these spring rolls.','source_text'=>'Saya akan ambil satu popia goreng ini.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>470.16,'end_time'=>475.32,'target_text'=>'I\'m dunking the spring roll in the soup base here.','source_text'=>'Saya celupkan popia goreng ke dalam mangkuk kuah sup di sini.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>476.84,'end_time'=>485.7,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just finished our lunch and we went to go get dessert, that fried banana, but unfortunately they were sold out.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kami baru selesai makan tengah hari dan kami pergi cari pencuci mulut iaitu pisang goreng, tapi malangnya dah habis dijual.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>485.8,'end_time'=>487.1,'target_text'=>'You really wanted that though, right?','source_text'=>'Tapi mak teringin sangat nak makan pisang goreng tu, kan?','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>487.2,'end_time'=>493.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, I really want to try that still, but we still have some time, so we\'ll do it >> another day.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, mak teringin sangat nak cuba, tapi kita masih ada masa di sini, jadi kita boleh cuba >> hari lain nanti.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>493.16,'end_time'=>495.54,'target_text'=>'And what did you think of lunch?','source_text'=>'Dan apa pendapat mak tentang hidangan makan tengah hari tadi?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>495.64,'end_time'=>501.82,'target_text'=>'>> I had bun cha the other day as well and I like the other day\'s more because it wasn\'t as sweet.','source_text'=>'>> Mak ada makan bun cha kelmarin juga dan mak lebih suka yang kelmarin sebab kuahnya tak semanis hari ini.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>501.92,'end_time'=>503.38,'target_text'=>'I think you like this one more.','source_text'=>'Rasanya kamu lebih suka yang kedai hari ini.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>503.48,'end_time'=>508.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this one was better in my opinion because the fish sauce was sweeter.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pada pendapat saya kedai ini lebih sedap sebab sos ikannya lebih manis sedikit.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>508.72,'end_time'=>511.22,'target_text'=>'What did you think of lunch, Leon?','source_text'=>'Kau rasa macam mana makan tengah hari tadi, Leon?','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>511.32,'end_time'=>512.06,'target_text'=>'>> It was good.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap juga.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>512.16,'end_time'=>516.7,'target_text'=>'We didn\'t have fried spring rolls in the other restaurant cuz we weren\'t that hungry, but we tried them this time and they','source_text'=>'Kedai sebelum ni kita tak pesan popia goreng sebab tak lapar sangat, tapi kali ni kita cuba dan popianya','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>516.8,'end_time'=>517.46,'target_text'=>'were really good.','source_text'=>'memang sangat sedap.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>517.56,'end_time'=>520.42,'target_text'=>'But we got the crab one and I didn\'t really taste much crab.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita pesan popia ketam dan aku tak berapa rasa sangat isi ketamnya.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>520.52,'end_time'=>521.66,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you did either.','source_text'=>'Aku tak tahu kalau kau rasa benda sama.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>521.76,'end_time'=>522.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, that was the crab one we got?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, popia ketam ke yang kita makan tadi?','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>522.92,'end_time'=>524.14,'target_text'=>'I thought that was the other one.','source_text'=>'Aku ingatkan jenis popia yang satu lagi.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>524.24,'end_time'=>529.82,'target_text'=>'>> The big one was a seafood one, but that was like four times the price and that one had like all the meat in it.','source_text'=>'>> Yang saiz besar tu popia makanan laut, tapi harga dia empat kali ganda lebih mahal dan yang tu isi padat.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>529.92,'end_time'=>532.7,'target_text'=>'Shrimp, crab, fish, all the seafood.','source_text'=>'Udang, ketam, ikan, semua makanan laut ada.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>532.8,'end_time'=>533.9,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, okay.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, macam tu.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>534,'end_time'=>535.02,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I did not know that.','source_text'=>'Ya, aku langsung tak perasan pasal tu.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>535.12,'end_time'=>536.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I don\'t know if you saw it.','source_text'=>'>> Kau perasan tak tadi.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>536.28,'end_time'=>539.06,'target_text'=>'They had it on the other table and it was like the size of my fist.','source_text'=>'Meja sebelah ada pesan dan saiz popia tu besar penumbuk aku.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>539.16,'end_time'=>539.98,'target_text'=>'It was huge.','source_text'=>'Besar gila.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>540.08,'end_time'=>542.9,'target_text'=>'>> How much was that one and then how much was the one we got?','source_text'=>'>> Berapa harga yang besar tu dan berapa harga yang kita makan tadi?','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>543,'end_time'=>549.46,'target_text'=>'>> The one we got was 10,000 and then the other one was 40,000, but it was definitely four times bigger, so it was probably','source_text'=>'>> Yang kita makan tadi 10,000 dong dan yang besar tu 40,000 dong, tapi memang empat kali ganda lebih besar, jadi rasanya','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>549.56,'end_time'=>550.06,'target_text'=>'worth it.','source_text'=>'berbaloi juga.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>550.16,'end_time'=>551.02,'target_text'=>'>> That was like a fist size.','source_text'=>'>> Saiz dia sebesar penumbuk.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>551.12,'end_time'=>553.98,'target_text'=>'I was wondering why did he order us the small one and not the big one?','source_text'=>'Aku pun tertanya-tanya kenapa pelayan tu bagi kita yang kecil, bukannya yang besar?','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>554.08,'end_time'=>557.42,'target_text'=>'>> Well, we told him to just get the small one, but I didn\'t know it would be that much different.','source_text'=>'>> Kita sendiri yang cakap nak yang kecil, tapi aku tak sangka saiznya beza jauh macam tu.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>557.52,'end_time'=>559.62,'target_text'=>'I think next time we should go for the bigger one.','source_text'=>'Rasanya lain kali kita patut cuba yang saiz besar tu.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>559.72,'end_time'=>563.86,'target_text'=>'>> We could have ordered four of those and it would have been the same price and it would have probably been more cuz they','source_text'=>'>> Kalau kita pesan empat ketul kecil pun sama je harga dia dengan seketul besar tu sebab','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>563.96,'end_time'=>566.54,'target_text'=>'were 40,000 each for all of us.','source_text'=>'yang besar tu 40,000 setiap satu untuk kita bertiga.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>566.64,'end_time'=>573.62,'target_text'=>'>> Now my professional review, I did like this one better because the fish sauce was a little bit sweeter, so I did like this','source_text'=>'>> Dari segi ulasan ikhlas saya pula, saya lebih suka kedai ini sebab sos ikannya manis sikit, jadi bagi saya','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>573.72,'end_time'=>574.34,'target_text'=>'one more.','source_text'=>'kedai ini lebih sedap.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>574.44,'end_time'=>576.82,'target_text'=>'So if I had to go again, I would come back to this place.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau diberi pilihan lagi, saya pasti akan datang makan di kedai ini semula.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>576.92,'end_time'=>581.14,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster, get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin belajar lebih cepat, dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>581.24,'end_time'=>587.94,'target_text'=>'It includes deeper explanations and exercises to help you remember and master what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi penerangan mendalam dan latihan praktikal untuk membantu anda mengingati dan menguasai apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>588.04,'end_time'=>593.9,'target_text'=>'And if you get five or more workbooks, you\'ll get 30% off automatically at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan jika anda membeli lima atau lebih buku latihan, anda akan dapat diskaun 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>594,'end_time'=>597.94,'target_text'=>'So go to the description or my website vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jadi layari pautan di ruangan penerangan atau laman web saya di vocaenglish.com.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>598.04,'end_time'=>600.42,'target_text'=>'Okay guys, so now we are eating dessert.','source_text'=>'Baiklah kawan-kawan, sekarang kami sedang menikmati pencuci mulut.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>600.52,'end_time'=>603.38,'target_text'=>'You can see they gave us like a mini spoon.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat mereka sediakan sudu yang sangat comel.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>603.48,'end_time'=>604.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s a very small spoon.','source_text'=>'Sudunya bersaiz sangat kecil.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>604.76,'end_time'=>605.74,'target_text'=>'Like a teaspoon.','source_text'=>'Macam sudu teh.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>605.84,'end_time'=>607.66,'target_text'=>'They gave us our dessert in this tray.','source_text'=>'Mereka hidangkan pencuci mulut kami di atas dulang ini.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>607.76,'end_time'=>608.66,'target_text'=>'They came out with this tray.','source_text'=>'Dihidangkan bersama dulang ini.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>608.76,'end_time'=>612.06,'target_text'=>'You can see the tray is kind of dirty and uh pretty scratched up.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak dulangnya ada kesan calar-balar dan nampak lusuh.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>612.16,'end_time'=>614.26,'target_text'=>'You can see a lot of scratches on the tray.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak banyak kesan calar di atas dulang itu.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>614.36,'end_time'=>615.34,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think it\'s dirty.','source_text'=>'>> Mak rasa bukan kotor.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>615.44,'end_time'=>618.22,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s a clean tray, but just well used.','source_text'=>'Dulang tu bersih cuma dah lama dan kerap digunakan.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>618.32,'end_time'=>619.18,'target_text'=>'>> Well used.','source_text'=>'>> Kerap diguna pakai.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>619.28,'end_time'=>619.7,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>619.8,'end_time'=>620.38,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>620.48,'end_time'=>621.78,'target_text'=>'Let\'s see your dessert.','source_text'=>'Mari tengok pencuci mulut mak.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>621.88,'end_time'=>622.54,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know what it is.','source_text'=>'>> Mak pun tak tahu nama hidangan ni apa.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>622.64,'end_time'=>623.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Tapi sedap sangat.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>623.32,'end_time'=>626.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s got fruit yogurt jello and then some boba.','source_text'=>'Ada buah-buahan, yogurt, jeli, dan manik boba.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>626.28,'end_time'=>627.26,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s the white liquid?','source_text'=>'>> Cecair putih tu apa mak?','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>627.36,'end_time'=>629.58,'target_text'=>'Is that milk or >> it\'s it\'s like milk.','source_text'=>'Itu susu ke atau... >> Macam rasa susu.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>629.68,'end_time'=>631.78,'target_text'=>'Like a yogurty kind of soury milk.','source_text'=>'Macam susu yang ada rasa masam-masam manis yogurt.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>631.88,'end_time'=>632.78,'target_text'=>'So it must be yogurt.','source_text'=>'Jadi mestilah ia yogurt.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>632.88,'end_time'=>633.38,'target_text'=>'>> It looks really good.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak sangat menyelerakan.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>633.48,'end_time'=>634.66,'target_text'=>'I think next time I\'ll get that.','source_text'=>'Lain kali saya rasa nak pesan menu yang itu pula.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>634.76,'end_time'=>636.66,'target_text'=>'Looks good.','source_text'=>'Nampak sedap.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>636.76,'end_time'=>639.62,'target_text'=>'>> And then they put ice on top of it to keep it cold.','source_text'=>'>> Dan mereka letakkan ais di bahagian atas supaya kekal sejuk.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>639.72,'end_time'=>641.1,'target_text'=>'>> Wow, that looks really good.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, nampak sedap betul.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>641.2,'end_time'=>644.34,'target_text'=>'So yeah, this is just a dessert in a small bowl.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, ini hidangan pencuci mulut di dalam mangkuk kecil.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>644.44,'end_time'=>651.06,'target_text'=>'My hand is like bigger than this bowl and it\'s just filled with fruit, ice, milk or yogurt >> and boba.','source_text'=>'Tangan saya lebih besar daripada mangkuk ini dan ia dipenuhi buah-buahan, ais, susu atau yogurt >> dan boba.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>651.16,'end_time'=>652.1,'target_text'=>'>> and uh jelly.','source_text'=>'>> dan jeli.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>652.2,'end_time'=>653.02,'target_text'=>'This is what I got.','source_text'=>'Ini pula yang saya pesan.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>653.12,'end_time'=>655.58,'target_text'=>'I got ice cream with sticky rice.','source_text'=>'Saya pesan aiskrim bersama pulut manis.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>655.68,'end_time'=>662.22,'target_text'=>'You can see the rice is this like kind of faded green color and you can see the ice cream has started to melt.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak pulutnya berwarna hijau lembut dan aiskrimnya sudah mula cair.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>662.32,'end_time'=>667.86,'target_text'=>'And this on top is coconut and it\'s very very sweet and Leon got the same thing.','source_text'=>'Dan taburan di atasnya ialah kelapa parut manis dan Leon pun pesan menu yang sama.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>667.96,'end_time'=>668.82,'target_text'=>'This is our view.','source_text'=>'Inilah suasana tempat kami duduk.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>668.92,'end_time'=>670.62,'target_text'=>'First of all, we have a really tiny table.','source_text'=>'Pertamanya, meja kami sangat kecil.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>670.72,'end_time'=>673.14,'target_text'=>'You can see me and Leon are right beside each other.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh lihat saya dan Leon duduk rapat betul bersebelahan.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>673.24,'end_time'=>676.5,'target_text'=>'I feel like it would have been better if maybe I sat there or maybe Leon sat there.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam lebih elok kalau saya duduk di sana atau Leon duduk di sebelah sana.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>676.6,'end_time'=>677.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that would have been better.','source_text'=>'Ya, susunan macam tu lebih selesa.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>677.68,'end_time'=>679.18,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this is the menu right here.','source_text'=>'Dan ini buku menunya di sini.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>679.28,'end_time'=>681.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of like a nice like a nice vibe.','source_text'=>'Suasana di kedai ini terasa sangat santai dan tenang.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>681.36,'end_time'=>682.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, I got two spoons.','source_text'=>'>> Eh, aku dapat dua sudu.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>682.88,'end_time'=>683.74,'target_text'=>'Look at this.','source_text'=>'Tengok ni.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>683.84,'end_time'=>684.5,'target_text'=>'I just noticed this.','source_text'=>'Aku baru perasan.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>684.6,'end_time'=>685.66,'target_text'=>'I got two spoons.','source_text'=>'Aku dapat dua batang sudu.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>685.76,'end_time'=>687.26,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, they were just so close together.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, sudu tu melekat rapat sangat tadi kot.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>687.36,'end_time'=>689.54,'target_text'=>'But anyway, this is our spot here.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, di sinilah tempat kami melepak.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>689.64,'end_time'=>692.1,'target_text'=>'>> I want to mention too that it\'s very hot.','source_text'=>'>> Mak nak beritahu juga cuaca hari ni memang panas terik.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>692.2,'end_time'=>695.22,'target_text'=>'>> It is really hot, but it\'s not too bad cuz we are in the shade.','source_text'=>'>> Cuaca memang panas, tapi tak terasa sangat sebab kami duduk di tempat teduh.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>695.32,'end_time'=>696.22,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a hot day.','source_text'=>'>> Hari yang agak panas.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>696.32,'end_time'=>698.78,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ve already tried it and it is quite good.','source_text'=>'>> Saya dah rasa dan memang sedap.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>698.88,'end_time'=>702.3,'target_text'=>'I like this dessert, but next time I will try that.','source_text'=>'Saya suka pencuci mulut ini, tapi lain kali saya nak cuba menu emak pula.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>702.4,'end_time'=>703.86,'target_text'=>'So, what did you think of dessert, Mom?','source_text'=>'Jadi apa pendapat mak tentang pencuci mulut tadi?','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>703.96,'end_time'=>705.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, it was so delicious.','source_text'=>'>> Sedap sangat rasanya.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>705.32,'end_time'=>707.42,'target_text'=>'I think I made the best choice for once.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa kali ni pilihan mak yang paling tepat.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>707.52,'end_time'=>708.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, yours was actually I think the best.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pilihan mak memang paling sedap rasanya.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>708.92,'end_time'=>709.78,'target_text'=>'Yours was really good.','source_text'=>'Menu mak memang sangat memuaskan.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>709.88,'end_time'=>712.38,'target_text'=>'Mine was good, but yours was yours was great.','source_text'=>'Pilihan saya sedap juga, tapi menu mak lagi padu.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>712.48,'end_time'=>714.98,'target_text'=>'>> Mine was refreshing because it\'s such a hot day.','source_text'=>'>> Menu mak rasa menyegarkan sangat sesuai dengan cuaca panas hari ni.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>715.08,'end_time'=>715.4,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul tu.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>715.4,'end_time'=>716.06,'target_text'=>'I really like yours.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka rasa makanan mak tu.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>716.16,'end_time'=>718.58,'target_text'=>'I think next time we\'ll get it because that place >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Lain kali kita beli lagi sebab kedai tu... >> Ya.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>718.68,'end_time'=>722.66,'target_text'=>'>> is very close to where we\'re staying, so we can just easily go back and get another one.','source_text'=>'>> sangat dekat dengan tempat penginapan kita, jadi kita boleh singgah beli bila-bila masa.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>722.76,'end_time'=>726.62,'target_text'=>'But yeah, today is actually a beautiful beautiful day.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, hari ini memang hari yang sangat indah.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>726.72,'end_time'=>730.86,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we are heading out to go have dinner.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami sedang bersiap untuk keluar makan malam.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>730.96,'end_time'=>734.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s 5:45, so we\'re going to go have dinner.','source_text'=>'Sekarang pukul 5:45 petang, jadi kami akan pergi makan malam.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>734.68,'end_time'=>736.7,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to put my shoes on.','source_text'=>'Saya akan memakai kasut saya.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>736.8,'end_time'=>740.06,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to slide them on here and go.','source_text'=>'Saya menyarungkan kasut dan bersedia untuk gerak.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>740.16,'end_time'=>742.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re walking.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami sedang berjalan.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>742.4,'end_time'=>745.1,'target_text'=>'We just left the Airbnb we\'re staying at.','source_text'=>'Kami baru sahaja keluar dari penginapan Airbnb kami.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>745.2,'end_time'=>745.9,'target_text'=>'What did you forget?','source_text'=>'Mak tertinggal apa?','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>746,'end_time'=>748.98,'target_text'=>'She thought she forgot something, but she didn\'t forget it.','source_text'=>'Emak ingatkan ada barang tertinggal, tapi sebenarnya tiada.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>749.08,'end_time'=>752.18,'target_text'=>'But now we\'re walking to first get her glasses.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berjalan untuk pergi ambil cermin mata emak dahulu.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>752.28,'end_time'=>754.9,'target_text'=>'Yeah, she got the lenses changed, but no prescriptions.','source_text'=>'Emak cuma tukar kanta biasa tanpa sebarang darjah rabun (*power*).','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>755,'end_time'=>759.06,'target_text'=>'Just normal like plastic lenses, so no prescription cuz she doesn\'t need them.','source_text'=>'Kanta plastik biasa sahaja tanpa kuasa rabun sebab emak tak perlukan kanta rabun.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>759.16,'end_time'=>760.14,'target_text'=>'She\'s not blind like me.','source_text'=>'Mata emak tak rabun macam mata saya.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>760.24,'end_time'=>762.02,'target_text'=>'I need prescription lenses.','source_text'=>'Saya perlukan cermin mata rabun.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>762.12,'end_time'=>764.29,'target_text'=>'She took the good eyes and gave me bad eyes, bro.','source_text'=>'Emak dapat mata yang sihat dan saya dapat mata yang rabun.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>764.39,'end_time'=>765.9,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> What the hell?','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Kelakar betul.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>766,'end_time'=>769.54,'target_text'=>'But yeah, now we\'re walking there and then after that we\'ll go eat something.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, sekarang kami berjalan ke sana dan selepas itu baru kami cari makanan.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>769.64,'end_time'=>773.26,'target_text'=>'Looks like these guys are playing some sort of sport.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya ada sekumpulan orang sedang bermain sesuatu sukan di situ.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>773.36,'end_time'=>775.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re in this park.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami berada di taman ini.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>775.16,'end_time'=>776.58,'target_text'=>'What are we actually doing here?','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya apa yang kita buat di sini?','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>776.68,'end_time'=>780.1,'target_text'=>'>> We\'re just walking to go and get my sunglasses.','source_text'=>'>> Kita lalu sini jalan kaki nak pergi ambil cermin mata hitam mak.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>780.2,'end_time'=>782.86,'target_text'=>'We\'re in the French Quarter and it\'s so beautiful, the buildings.','source_text'=>'Kita berada di French Quarter dan bangunan-bangunan di sini tersangatlah indah.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>782.96,'end_time'=>785.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the buildings are really beautiful here.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, seni bina bangunan di sini memang sangat mempesonakan.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>785.44,'end_time'=>786.58,'target_text'=>'And we\'re in this like park.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang kami berada di kawasan taman ini.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>786.68,'end_time'=>788.26,'target_text'=>'This is like a big fountain.','source_text'=>'Ini sebuah kolam pancutan air yang besar.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>788.36,'end_time'=>793.46,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, there is no water coming out of these frog statues.','source_text'=>'Malangnya tiada air yang memancut keluar daripada patung katak ini.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>793.56,'end_time'=>795.06,'target_text'=>'They look a little dirty, don\'t they?','source_text'=>'Patung-patung tu nampak agak berlumut dan kotor sikit, kan?','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>795.16,'end_time'=>801.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, but I want to point out that I don\'t know what game the locals are playing here, but look, they keep on kicking that','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi mak nak tunjuk permainan yang penduduk tempatan tengah main tu, tengok mereka asyik timbang bulu tangkis tu','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>801.48,'end_time'=>801.98,'target_text'=>'>> really good.','source_text'=>'>> hebat sungguh kecekapan mereka.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>802.08,'end_time'=>803.14,'target_text'=>'This game looks hard.','source_text'=>'Permainan ini nampak susah.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>803.24,'end_time'=>805.74,'target_text'=>'Like you can only kick it with your with your feet.','source_text'=>'Kena timbang dan sepak guna kaki sahaja.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>805.84,'end_time'=>807.02,'target_text'=>'Like look look at this guy.','source_text'=>'Cuba tengok lelaki yang ini.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>807.12,'end_time'=>809.82,'target_text'=>'>> Looks like a brush with a weight on on the end.','source_text'=>'>> Bulu tangkis tu nampak macam berus yang ada pemberat di hujungnya.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>809.92,'end_time'=>813.7,'target_text'=>'The guy to this side is also >> Yeah, this guy\'s practicing.','source_text'=>'Lelaki sebelah sini pun sama... >> Ya, lelaki ni tengah berlatih.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>813.8,'end_time'=>818.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, honestly, that looks like it takes skill, being able to like kick stuff constantly on your feet, but I don\'t know if','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya memang nampak perlukan kemahiran tinggi untuk timbang benda tu tanpa henti guna kaki, tapi saya tak tahu kalau','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>818.88,'end_time'=>819.78,'target_text'=>'I\'d be able to do that.','source_text'=>'saya mampu buat macam tu.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>819.88,'end_time'=>822.9,'target_text'=>'And I don\'t even know if I\'m that flexible, cuz some of them like go like this and hit.','source_text'=>'Saya pun tak rasa badan saya selentur tu, sebab ada yang pusing badan lentur kaki macam ni untuk sambut.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>823,'end_time'=>825.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m like, \"Dude, I\'ll break my whole hip, man.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa, \"Boleh patah pinggang saya kalau buat macam tu.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>825.56,'end_time'=>830.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m not flexible at all.\" Yeah, now we\'re going to go get your glasses, so let\'s head over there.','source_text'=>'Badan saya memang tak fleksibel langsung.\" Sekarang jom kita pergi ambil cermin mata mak ke kedai tu.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>830.76,'end_time'=>832.42,'target_text'=>'Look at this nice building.','source_text'=>'Lihat bangunan yang indah ini.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>832.52,'end_time'=>833.5,'target_text'=>'This is beautiful.','source_text'=>'Bangunan ini sangat cantik.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>833.6,'end_time'=>835.98,'target_text'=>'The flowers are actually gorgeous.','source_text'=>'Bunga-bunga hiasannya sungguh menawan.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>836.08,'end_time'=>838.22,'target_text'=>'Yellow and red contrast.','source_text'=>'Gabungan kontras warna kuning dan merah.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>838.32,'end_time'=>840.06,'target_text'=>'I think it looks really nice together.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa gabungan dua warna ini sangat serasi.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>840.16,'end_time'=>843.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, I guess yeah, it matches the Vietnamese flag, yellow and red.','source_text'=>'Oh, mungkin ia sengaja dipadankan dengan warna bendera Vietnam iaitu kuning dan merah.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>843.48,'end_time'=>844.98,'target_text'=>'I wonder what this building is.','source_text'=>'Tertanya-tanya juga bangunan apa sebenarnya ini.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>845.08,'end_time'=>845.74,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Mak pun tak pasti.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>845.84,'end_time'=>847.22,'target_text'=>'Does it say in English there?','source_text'=>'Ada papan tanda bahasa Inggeris tak di situ?','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>847.32,'end_time'=>847.82,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tiada.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>847.92,'end_time'=>849.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya pun tak tahu.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>849.2,'end_time'=>850.74,'target_text'=>'>> But, absolutely beautiful.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi memang sangat cantik.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>850.84,'end_time'=>851.78,'target_text'=>'>> Vietnamese.','source_text'=>'>> Bahasa Vietnam.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>851.88,'end_time'=>852.78,'target_text'=>'This is a nice building.','source_text'=>'Bangunan yang sangat tersergam indah.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>852.88,'end_time'=>855.06,'target_text'=>'Feel like it\'s some sort of government building or something.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam bangunan jabatan kerajaan atau sesuatu yang rasmi.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>855.16,'end_time'=>860.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, most of them are, the well-maintained >> flowers are like the color of the Vietnamese flag, so.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kebanyakannya begitu, dijaga rapi >> bunganya pula ikut warna bendera Vietnam.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>860.48,'end_time'=>861.22,'target_text'=>'>> So pretty.','source_text'=>'>> Cantik sangat.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>861.32,'end_time'=>861.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>862.04,'end_time'=>863.86,'target_text'=>'Oh, over there, I wonder what that building is.','source_text'=>'Bangunan di seberang sana tu pula apa agaknya.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>863.96,'end_time'=>865.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s a nice big building, too.','source_text'=>'Itu pun sebuah bangunan besar yang cantik.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>865.96,'end_time'=>866.36,'target_text'=>'>> I know.','source_text'=>'>> Mak pun nampak.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>866.4,'end_time'=>871.06,'target_text'=>'>> see all those beautiful like pillars and columns supporting the structure.','source_text'=>'>> boleh nampak tiang-tiang bulat yang kukuh dan indah menyokong binaan itu.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>871.16,'end_time'=>873.02,'target_text'=>'>> Architecture sure is beautiful here.','source_text'=>'>> Seni bina di sini memang sangat mengagumkan.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>873.12,'end_time'=>876.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s like the French-inspired Vietnamese architecture.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia gabungan seni bina Vietnam dengan pengaruh kolonial Perancis.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>876.16,'end_time'=>877.82,'target_text'=>'And there\'s Leon.','source_text'=>'Dan itu Leon di hadapan.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>877.92,'end_time'=>879.14,'target_text'=>'Way up ahead.','source_text'=>'Jauh di depan berjalan.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>879.24,'end_time'=>880.58,'target_text'=>'Should I get a Vietnamese hat?','source_text'=>'Patut ke saya beli topi kon tradisional Vietnam ni?','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>880.68,'end_time'=>881.5,'target_text'=>'What do you call this?','source_text'=>'Apa nama topi ni?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>881.6,'end_time'=>882.5,'target_text'=>'>> It has a name.','source_text'=>'>> Ada nama khasnya.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>882.6,'end_time'=>883.7,'target_text'=>'You can ask this gentleman.','source_text'=>'Boleh tanya pak cik penjual ni.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>883.8,'end_time'=>884.26,'target_text'=>'Hi.','source_text'=>'Hai.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>884.36,'end_time'=>885.46,'target_text'=>'>> Low-key, does it look good, though?','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya nampak elok tak saya pakai?','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>885.56,'end_time'=>885.96,'target_text'=>'Kind of nice.','source_text'=>'Nampak menarik juga.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>886.04,'end_time'=>887.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s only 40 It\'s $2.','source_text'=>'Harganya cuma dua dolar.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>887.6,'end_time'=>888.14,'target_text'=>'>> $2?','source_text'=>'>> Dua dolar je?','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>888.24,'end_time'=>888.7,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Murahnya.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>888.8,'end_time'=>889.22,'target_text'=>'>> $2.','source_text'=>'>> Dua dolar.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>889.32,'end_time'=>892.14,'target_text'=>'Oh, yo, low-key,','source_text'=>'Wah, tengok ni,','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>892.24,'end_time'=>893.86,'target_text'=>'low-key, these fans are nice.','source_text'=>'kipas tangan ni pun cantik juga.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>893.96,'end_time'=>895.22,'target_text'=>'What do you think of these fans?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak tentang kipas tangan ni?','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>895.32,'end_time'=>897.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I like a bigger one, though.','source_text'=>'>> Mak suka jenis yang saiz lebih besar sikit.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>897.32,'end_time'=>898.42,'target_text'=>'>> I wonder how much they are.','source_text'=>'>> Agak-agak berapa harga kipas ni.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>898.52,'end_time'=>899.22,'target_text'=>'Kind of like them.','source_text'=>'Macam berkenan pula.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>899.32,'end_time'=>900.62,'target_text'=>'No, the black one isn\'t wood.','source_text'=>'Kipas warna hitam tu bukan kayu.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>900.72,'end_time'=>901.98,'target_text'=>'The black one\'s plastic.','source_text'=>'Yang hitam tu diperbuat daripada plastik.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>902.08,'end_time'=>902.48,'target_text'=>'This one\'s wood.','source_text'=>'Yang ini daripada kayu.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>902.56,'end_time'=>903.26,'target_text'=>'Look at this.','source_text'=>'Tengok yang ni.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>903.36,'end_time'=>904.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s really nice.','source_text'=>'Yang ini memang cantik buatannya.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>904.64,'end_time'=>906.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I like a bigger one, and a black one.','source_text'=>'>> Mak suka yang saiz besar dan warna hitam.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>906.56,'end_time'=>907.54,'target_text'=>'>> is a good size.','source_text'=>'>> saiz yang elok.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>907.64,'end_time'=>909.46,'target_text'=>'>> No, no, no, a longer one.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, nak bilah yang lebih panjang.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>909.56,'end_time'=>911.1,'target_text'=>'How much are the hats?','source_text'=>'Berapa harga topi ni?','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>911.2,'end_time'=>911.98,'target_text'=>'>> Uh $2.','source_text'=>'>> Dua dolar.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>912.08,'end_time'=>913.42,'target_text'=>'>> Can you put it on again?','source_text'=>'>> Boleh kamu pakai semula topi tu?','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>913.52,'end_time'=>914.38,'target_text'=>'Please.','source_text'=>'Tolonglah pakai balik.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>914.48,'end_time'=>916.3,'target_text'=>'>> I think this might be a woman\'s version.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa ini versi topi untuk wanita kot.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>916.4,'end_time'=>920.86,'target_text'=>'But yeah, yeah, I guess Leon is right, you have to wear this in the airplane, cuz unless you carry it, yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya betul kata Leon, kalau beli kena pakai atas kapal terbang sebab susah nak simpan dalam beg melainkan pegang tangan.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>920.96,'end_time'=>922.1,'target_text'=>'But why not wear it?','source_text'=>'Tapi apa salahnya kalau pakai terus?','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>922.2,'end_time'=>923.62,'target_text'=>'And we\'re looking at souvenirs?','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang kami sedang melihat cenderamata.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>923.72,'end_time'=>924.78,'target_text'=>'>> I should buy something.','source_text'=>'>> Mak patut beli sesuatu untuk kenang-kenangan.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>924.88,'end_time'=>926.22,'target_text'=>'>> Make art, not war.','source_text'=>'>> Cipta seni, bukan perang.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>926.32,'end_time'=>927.66,'target_text'=>'Oh, these are magnets.','source_text'=>'Oh, ini pelekat magnet peti sejuk.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>927.76,'end_time'=>929.98,'target_text'=>'>> I like the fact that they put prices on things.','source_text'=>'>> Mak suka bila kedai letak tanda harga siap-siap pada barang.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>930.08,'end_time'=>931.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, look at these coconuts.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tengok mangkuk tempurung kelapa ni.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>931.48,'end_time'=>933.42,'target_text'=>'These are what I bought you last time.','source_text'=>'Ini yang saya belikan untuk mak masa trip dulu.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>933.52,'end_time'=>934.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I still have it.','source_text'=>'>> Mak masih simpan sampai sekarang.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>934.76,'end_time'=>935.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s really nice.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat cantik.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>935.52,'end_time'=>936.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s so pretty.','source_text'=>'Cantik sungguh buatannya.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>936.2,'end_time'=>937.26,'target_text'=>'How much are they?','source_text'=>'Berapa harga sebiji?','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>937.36,'end_time'=>938.58,'target_text'=>'>> 75.','source_text'=>'>> 75 ribu dong.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>938.68,'end_time'=>939.5,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s really nice.','source_text'=>'>> Memang cantik sangat.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>939.6,'end_time'=>940.18,'target_text'=>'>> T-shirts.','source_text'=>'>> Baju kemeja-T.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>940.28,'end_time'=>941.34,'target_text'=>'A bong.','source_text'=>'Paip air.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>941.44,'end_time'=>943.42,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s not a bong, it\'s a vase.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan paip air lah, itu pasu bunga hiasan.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>943.52,'end_time'=>945.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, these are nice cups.','source_text'=>'>> Cawan-cawan ini pun cantik.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>945.2,'end_time'=>946.02,'target_text'=>'Nicely painted.','source_text'=>'Lukisan coraknya kemas.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>946.12,'end_time'=>950.7,'target_text'=>'But I feel like if you wash these, the paint\'s going to come off cuz they just hand-painted those.','source_text'=>'Tapi rasanya kalau kerap basuh, catnya boleh tanggal sebab dilukis menggunakan tangan.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>950.8,'end_time'=>958.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re in the souvenir shop and I really like all these like small little trinkets and stuff, but definitely my favorite','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kami berada di kedai cenderamata dan saya suka barangan kraf kecil begini, tetapi tarikan paling saya gemari','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>958.16,'end_time'=>960.54,'target_text'=>'has got to be the Vietnamese hats.','source_text'=>'sudah tentulah topi tradisional Vietnam (*Non La*).','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>960.64,'end_time'=>962.62,'target_text'=>'I really like them, but I don\'t know if I can bring them.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka topi tu, cuma tak pasti sama ada muat nak bawa balik.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>962.72,'end_time'=>967.66,'target_text'=>'So, what I want to get is like a very, very small one, a very small version, and have it as a keychain.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya nak cari versi mini yang kecil untuk dijadikan gantungan kunci.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>967.76,'end_time'=>971.46,'target_text'=>'There are some over here, but they\'re made out of wood, not the straw.','source_text'=>'Ada beberapa di sebelah sini, tapi diperbuat daripada kayu, bukannya anyaman jerami.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>971.56,'end_time'=>972.42,'target_text'=>'Let me show you.','source_text'=>'Biar saya tunjukkan pada anda.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>972.52,'end_time'=>972.98,'target_text'=>'Like these.','source_text'=>'Macam yang ini.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>973.08,'end_time'=>976.62,'target_text'=>'I want one this size, but these ones are made out of wood.','source_text'=>'Saya nak saiz comel macam ni, tapi yang ini ukiran kayu.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>976.72,'end_time'=>978.5,'target_text'=>'You can see they\'re wood.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak ia daripada kayu.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>978.6,'end_time'=>979.34,'target_text'=>'I want straw.','source_text'=>'Saya nak yang anyaman daun jerami.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>979.44,'end_time'=>979.94,'target_text'=>'>> I want straw.','source_text'=>'>> Mak pun nak yang anyaman daun.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>980.04,'end_time'=>982,'target_text'=>'>> Like this.','source_text'=>'>> Macam yang ini.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>982.48,'end_time'=>987.9,'target_text'=>'So, my mom bought some souvenirs for my brother and dad back home.','source_text'=>'Emak saya dah beli beberapa cenderamata untuk abang dan ayah di rumah.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>988,'end_time'=>989.22,'target_text'=>'Just a couple things.','source_text'=>'Cuma beberapa barang kenangan.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>989.32,'end_time'=>990.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, just some souvenirs.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, cuma sedikit cenderahati.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>990.92,'end_time'=>994.38,'target_text'=>'>> And now we\'re heading to get your glasses and then eat.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang kami pergi ambil cermin mata mak dan lepas tu pergi makan.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>994.48,'end_time'=>995.5,'target_text'=>'Do you know where we\'re going to eat?','source_text'=>'Mak tahu nak makan kat mana?','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>995.6,'end_time'=>997.18,'target_text'=>'>> No, surprise me.','source_text'=>'>> Tak tahu, bawa mak ke mana-mana yang sedap.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>997.28,'end_time'=>998.13,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I don\'t know either.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pun tak tahu nak makan apa.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>998.23,'end_time'=>999.7,'target_text'=>'[laughter] That\'s what I was asking.','source_text'=>'[ketawa] Sebab tu lah saya tanya mak tadi.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>999.8,'end_time'=>1001.22,'target_text'=>'>> I know what I want for dessert though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi mak tahu apa yang mak nak untuk pencuci mulut.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1001.32,'end_time'=>1002.58,'target_text'=>'I still want that banana.','source_text'=>'Mak masih teringin pisang goreng tadi.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1002.68,'end_time'=>1003.34,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, do you?','source_text'=>'>> Masih nak pisang goreng tu ke?','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1003.44,'end_time'=>1004.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, deep-fried banana.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pisang goreng rangup.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1005.08,'end_time'=>1006.26,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah, I want that, too.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pun teringin nak rasa juga.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1006.36,'end_time'=>1009.1,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re buying a little bit of Korean skin care here.','source_text'=>'Di sini kami singgah membeli sedikit produk penjagaan kulit dari Korea.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1009.2,'end_time'=>1013.62,'target_text'=>'My brother got the cleanser and my mom got this sunscreen.','source_text'=>'Abang saya beli pencuci muka dan emak saya beli krim pelindung matahari ini.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1013.72,'end_time'=>1014.78,'target_text'=>'I got nothing.','source_text'=>'Saya tak beli apa-apa.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1014.88,'end_time'=>1019.82,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re heading up these like stairs in this area to get my mom\'s glasses.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami menaiki tangga di celah bangunan ini untuk mengambil cermin mata emak.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1019.92,'end_time'=>1021.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s literally a random place.','source_text'=>'Lokasinya di tempat yang agak tersorok.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1022,'end_time'=>1026.26,'target_text'=>'We literally had to go through a bar down there just to get here.','source_text'=>'Kami kena lalu celah sebuah bar di tingkat bawah untuk naik ke sini.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1026.36,'end_time'=>1028.6,'target_text'=>'This is the store.','source_text'=>'Inilah kedainya.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1029.96,'end_time'=>1032.42,'target_text'=>'This is a wall of glasses, dude.','source_text'=>'Satu dinding penuh dengan deretan cermin mata.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1032.52,'end_time'=>1034.22,'target_text'=>'A wall of sunglasses.','source_text'=>'Dinding yang dipenuhi cermin mata hitam.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1034.32,'end_time'=>1035.3,'target_text'=>'Try them on.','source_text'=>'Cuba pakai tengok.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1035.4,'end_time'=>1037.06,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s lighter.','source_text'=>'>> Kanta dia lebih cerah.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1037.16,'end_time'=>1037.86,'target_text'=>'But I like it.','source_text'=>'Tapi mak suka.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1037.96,'end_time'=>1039.22,'target_text'=>'I like it lighter.','source_text'=>'Mak lebih suka kanta yang cerah sedikit.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1039.32,'end_time'=>1040.62,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m going to see how much these are.','source_text'=>'>> Biar saya tengok berapa harga cermin mata ni.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1040.72,'end_time'=>1041.34,'target_text'=>'>> mil.','source_text'=>'>> Juta dong.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1041.44,'end_time'=>1041.98,'target_text'=>'>> Really?','source_text'=>'>> Biar betul?','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1042.08,'end_time'=>1042.62,'target_text'=>'That\'s crazy.','source_text'=>'Mahal gila.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1042.72,'end_time'=>1046.82,'target_text'=>'>> Well, one of these I I don\'t know if this is the exact model, but they go for a thousand US dollars.','source_text'=>'>> Ada satu model macam ni harganya boleh mencecah sehingga seribu dolar Amerika.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1046.92,'end_time'=>1048.14,'target_text'=>'>> A thousand for glasses?','source_text'=>'>> Seribu dolar untuk sepasang cermin mata?','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1048.24,'end_time'=>1053.7,'target_text'=>'>> I actually really like those uh Oakley\'s ones, the ones that had uh like no bottoms.','source_text'=>'>> Saya sebenarnya berkenan sangat dengan cermin mata Oakley tu, yang bahagian bingkai bawah dia terdedah.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1053.8,'end_time'=>1060.74,'target_text'=>'And they are 100 Canadian dollars, which is not too bad if you think about the prices of them in Canada.','source_text'=>'Dan harganya cuma 100 dolar Kanada, kira tak mahal sangat kalau bandingkan dengan harga pasaran di Kanada.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1060.84,'end_time'=>1063.38,'target_text'=>'So, they\'re called the Oakley Half Wire 1.0s.','source_text'=>'Model cermin mata tu dinamakan Oakley Half Wire 1.0.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1063.48,'end_time'=>1064.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s them, right?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, yang itu kan modelnya?','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1064.64,'end_time'=>1068.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but the lenses are a little bit different, but they look pretty similar to that.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi warna kantanya lain sikit, cuma bentuk bingkainya hampir serupa.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1068.48,'end_time'=>1069.3,'target_text'=>'Not original.','source_text'=>'Bukan yang asli.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1069.4,'end_time'=>1071.22,'target_text'=>'The original ones look bluer.','source_text'=>'Kanta yang asli nampak lebih kebiruan.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1071.32,'end_time'=>1074.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the original ones look a lot more >> black and silver.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, yang asli nampak lebih... >> hitam dan perak.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1074.68,'end_time'=>1075.1,'target_text'=>'These are old.','source_text'=>'Ini model lama.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1075.2,'end_time'=>1075.86,'target_text'=>'>> I like the silver.','source_text'=>'>> Mak suka warna perak.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1075.96,'end_time'=>1076.62,'target_text'=>'They look good.','source_text'=>'Nampak kemas dan segak.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1076.72,'end_time'=>1077.94,'target_text'=>'And they feel like metal.','source_text'=>'Dan rasa macam logam padu.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1078.04,'end_time'=>1078.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, no, they\'re metal.','source_text'=>'>> Memang diperbuat daripada logam.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1078.92,'end_time'=>1079.28,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1079.28,'end_time'=>1080.34,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re something >> They\'re strong.','source_text'=>'>> Bahannya berkualiti... >> Bingkainya sangat kukuh.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1080.44,'end_time'=>1083.14,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re out of something called X metal, which is a Oakley thing.','source_text'=>'>> Ia diperbuat daripada bahan yang dinamakan X Metal, iaitu teknologi khas Oakley.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1083.24,'end_time'=>1085.82,'target_text'=>'The rubber on my Oakleys are called Unobtainium.','source_text'=>'Getah pelindung pada cermin mata Oakley saya pula dipanggil Unobtainium.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1085.92,'end_time'=>1086.74,'target_text'=>'>> Unobtainium?','source_text'=>'>> Unobtainium?','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1086.84,'end_time'=>1087.42,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s rubber.','source_text'=>'>> Sejenis getah khas.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1087.52,'end_time'=>1088.1,'target_text'=>'>> The rubber.','source_text'=>'>> Bahagian getahnya.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1088.2,'end_time'=>1088.6,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1088.68,'end_time'=>1090.58,'target_text'=>'>> Why don\'t they call it rubbertanium?','source_text'=>'>> Kenapa mereka tak namakan saja \'rubbertanium\'?','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1090.68,'end_time'=>1094.34,'target_text'=>'They call the metal X metal and the rubber unobtainium.','source_text'=>'Logamnya dipanggil X Metal dan getahnya dipanggil Unobtainium.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1094.44,'end_time'=>1096.1,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, what did you get, Mom?','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, mak pesan air apa?','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1096.2,'end_time'=>1097.54,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ve got a Saigon beer.','source_text'=>'>> Mak pesan bir Saigon.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1097.64,'end_time'=>1098.04,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1098.12,'end_time'=>1099.98,'target_text'=>'>> A beer, I believe they call it.','source_text'=>'>> Bir, rasanya itu nama minumannya.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1100.08,'end_time'=>1101.14,'target_text'=>'>> What do they call it?','source_text'=>'>> Apa panggilan orang tempatan?','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1101.24,'end_time'=>1102.02,'target_text'=>'>> Bia.','source_text'=>'>> Bia.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1102.12,'end_time'=>1102.98,'target_text'=>'>> Bia?','source_text'=>'>> Bia?','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1103.08,'end_time'=>1104.06,'target_text'=>'I\'ve got a bia.','source_text'=>'Saya ada sebotol \'bia\'.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1104.16,'end_time'=>1106.54,'target_text'=>'>> Saigon beer, Leon got a Hanoi beer.','source_text'=>'>> Bir Saigon, dan Leon pula pesan bir Hanoi.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1106.64,'end_time'=>1107.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1107.16,'end_time'=>1108.86,'target_text'=>'Mine is better than his, though.','source_text'=>'Tapi pilihan mak lebih sedap daripada pilihan dia.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1108.96,'end_time'=>1112.02,'target_text'=>'>> Leon got a Hanoi beer, and I got no beer cuz I don\'t drink.','source_text'=>'>> Leon ambil bir Hanoi, dan saya tak minum bir sebab saya tak minum alkohol.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1112.12,'end_time'=>1116.66,'target_text'=>'Right now we\'re in a restaurant, and uh we\'ve already ordered our food, and we\'re going to eat.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami berada di sebuah restoran, kami dah siap pesan makanan dan kami akan mula makan.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1116.76,'end_time'=>1119.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of like a little bit of a nicer restaurant.','source_text'=>'Restoran ini suasananya agak mewah sedikit.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1119.32,'end_time'=>1125.98,'target_text'=>'Although I do prefer eating on the street, but since it\'s dinner and one of our last days in Hanoi before we go to Inle Lake,','source_text'=>'Walaupun saya lebih gemar makan di gerai tepi jalan, tapi memandangkan ini makan malam terakhir kami di Hanoi sebelum ke Tasik Inle,','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1126.08,'end_time'=>1127.54,'target_text'=>'we decided to eat here.','source_text'=>'kami buat keputusan untuk makan di restoran ini.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1127.64,'end_time'=>1128.78,'target_text'=>'What did you think of the dinner?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat mak tentang makan malam tadi?','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1128.88,'end_time'=>1129.7,'target_text'=>'>> It was very good.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat sedap dan memuaskan.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1129.8,'end_time'=>1132.54,'target_text'=>'Thank you very much, Woka, for treating me again.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih banyak-banyak Volkan sebab belanja mak makan lagi.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1132.64,'end_time'=>1133.22,'target_text'=>'>> No problem.','source_text'=>'>> Sama-sama, tiada masalah.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1133.32,'end_time'=>1134.54,'target_text'=>'>> Thank you for treating me again.','source_text'=>'>> Terima kasih sebab belanja makan lagi.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1134.64,'end_time'=>1135.58,'target_text'=>'>> No problem.','source_text'=>'>> Sama-sama.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1135.68,'end_time'=>1136.08,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1136.12,'end_time'=>1138.3,'target_text'=>'>> Actually, it\'s a pleasure.','source_text'=>'>> Sukacita saya dapat belanja mak.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1138.4,'end_time'=>1139.62,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> It\'s good.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Memang seronok.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1139.72,'end_time'=>1140.7,'target_text'=>'>> Well, we just finished dinner.','source_text'=>'>> Baiklah, kami baru sahaja selesai makan malam.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1140.8,'end_time'=>1146.02,'target_text'=>'It was like a little bit more expensive than normal, but still compared to Canada, it was really cheap.','source_text'=>'Harganya agak mahal sikit berbanding biasa, tapi kalau dibandingkan dengan harga di Kanada, ia masih sangat murah.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1146.12,'end_time'=>1146.9,'target_text'=>'Compared to Canada.','source_text'=>'Bila dibandingkan dengan Kanada.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1147,'end_time'=>1150.86,'target_text'=>'>> Actually, you can\'t get junk food in Canada even for this price.','source_text'=>'>> Sebenarnya dekat Kanada nak beli makanan segera pun tak lepas dengan harga ni.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1150.96,'end_time'=>1152.18,'target_text'=>'It was a good cooked meal.','source_text'=>'Ini hidangan masakan penuh yang berkualiti.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1152.28,'end_time'=>1153.9,'target_text'=>'>> It was like $30 total.','source_text'=>'>> Jumlahnya kira-kira 30 dolar sahaja.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1154,'end_time'=>1154.54,'target_text'=>'>> Canadian.','source_text'=>'>> Dolar Kanada.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1154.64,'end_time'=>1154.84,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1154.84,'end_time'=>1155.42,'target_text'=>'>> Canadian, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Dolar Kanada, ya.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1155.52,'end_time'=>1158.58,'target_text'=>'So, compared to Canada, it was a good deal.','source_text'=>'Jadi berbanding Kanada, memang tawaran yang sangat murah.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1158.68,'end_time'=>1163.34,'target_text'=>'>> And in Korea, I think when we were vacationing there, we ate for like $15 per person per meal.','source_text'=>'>> Masa kita bercuti di Korea dulu, belanja makan kita sekitar 15 dolar setiap orang bagi setiap hidangan.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1163.44,'end_time'=>1165.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s kind of what we budgeted for.','source_text'=>'Itulah anggaran bajet kita masa tu.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1165.36,'end_time'=>1165.98,'target_text'=>'>> to 20.','source_text'=>'>> hingga 20 dolar.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1166.08,'end_time'=>1168.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, 15 to 20 for depending on the meal.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, 15 hingga 20 dolar bergantung pada jenis makanan.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1168.28,'end_time'=>1169.5,'target_text'=>'>> Now, what are we going to go do?','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang kita nak buat apa pula?','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1169.6,'end_time'=>1171.34,'target_text'=>'>> We\'re going to go look for banana dessert.','source_text'=>'>> Kita nak pergi cari pencuci mulut pisang goreng tu.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1171.44,'end_time'=>1171.9,'target_text'=>'>> Night market.','source_text'=>'>> Dekat pasar malam.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1172,'end_time'=>1173.06,'target_text'=>'>> Banana dessert?','source_text'=>'>> Pencuci mulut pisang?','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1173.16,'end_time'=>1173.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1173.88,'end_time'=>1180.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so we wanted to go eat those fried bananas earlier today with ice cream, but unfortunately, we couldn\'t find them.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kami teringin nak makan pisang goreng rangup bersama aiskrim dari siang tadi, tapi malangnya kami tak jumpa.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1180.4,'end_time'=>1184.7,'target_text'=>'I mean, I guess we did find them, but they were sold out by the time we went, so we couldn\'t get them.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, tadi kami jumpa kedainya tapi dah habis dijual masa kami sampai, jadi tak dapat beli.','order'=>460],
