            ['start_time'=>42.2,'end_time'=>44.74,'target_text'=>'That\'s Barricaded light in the middle of Delicious.','source_text'=>'Itu Lampu penghadang di tengah-tengah Lazat (Delicious).','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>44.84,'end_time'=>45.38,'target_text'=>'Correct.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>45.48,'end_time'=>46.7,'target_text'=>'>> Specialty is [music] >> Place.','source_text'=>'>> Keistimewaannya ialah [muzik] >> Tempat.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>46.8,'end_time'=>47.54,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>47.64,'end_time'=>48.42,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'>> Jom pergi.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>48.52,'end_time'=>50.74,'target_text'=>'Where are we heading to right now, Mom?','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita tengah menuju ke mana, Mak?','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>50.84,'end_time'=>53.5,'target_text'=>'We\'re heading to Hoan Kiem Lake.','source_text'=>'Kita sedang menuju ke Tasik Hoan Kiem.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>53.6,'end_time'=>55.38,'target_text'=>'We\'re heading to a lake.','source_text'=>'Kita sedang menuju ke sebuah tasik.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>55.48,'end_time'=>57.78,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s the most famous lake here, no?','source_text'=>'Rasa saya ini tasik paling terkenal kat sini, kan?','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>57.88,'end_time'=>60.1,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s called Hoan Kiem Lake.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa namanya Tasik Hoan Kiem.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>60.2,'end_time'=>63.54,'target_text'=>'Maybe I\'m pronouncing it wrong, but >> I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'Mungkin sebutan saya salah, tapi >> Mak pun tak pasti.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>63.64,'end_time'=>66.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m just going to call it the lake in the like historic center.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma panggil ia tasik di kawasan pusat bersejarah.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>66.84,'end_time'=>68.38,'target_text'=>'Okay, I got the names.','source_text'=>'Okey, saya dah tahu namanya.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>68.48,'end_time'=>75.34,'target_text'=>'So, right now we are staying in the French Quarter, which is on the east side of the lake, but right now we\'re just walking','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang kita menginap di French Quarter, iaitu di sebelah timur tasik, tapi sekarang kita cuma berjalan kaki','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>75.44,'end_time'=>77.78,'target_text'=>'to the lake because it\'s very beautiful.','source_text'=>'menuju ke tasik kerana pemandangannya sangat cantik.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>77.88,'end_time'=>79.3,'target_text'=>'We\'ve already been here for 1 day.','source_text'=>'Kita dah berada di sini selama 1 hari.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>79.4,'end_time'=>85.38,'target_text'=>'So, yesterday we walked around a bit, we saw things, but now we\'re going to go and show you guys and explore even more.','source_text'=>'Jadi, semalam kita jalan-jalan sekejap, tengok kawasan sekitar, tapi sekarang kita nak tunjuk kepada korang dan teroka dengan lebih banyak lagi.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>85.48,'end_time'=>95.3,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and start learning the words that will allow you to understand up to 95% of everyday','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya dan mula belajar perkataan yang membolehkan korang faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>95.4,'end_time'=>96.06,'target_text'=>'English.','source_text'=>'bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>96.16,'end_time'=>104.42,'target_text'=>'It includes clear definitions, real examples, and simple organization by topic and CEFR','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi definisi yang jelas, contoh sebenar, dan susunan mudah mengikut topik serta tahap CEFR','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>104.52,'end_time'=>105.3,'target_text'=>'level.','source_text'=>'tahap penguasaan.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>105.4,'end_time'=>109.06,'target_text'=>'Get it in the description or at vocaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Dapatkannya di ruangan deskripsi atau di vocaenglish.com.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>109.16,'end_time'=>111.02,'target_text'=>'So, Mom, when did you arrive?','source_text'=>'Jadi, Mak, bila Mak sampai?','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>111.12,'end_time'=>117.54,'target_text'=>'I arrived on Thursday evening after a 17-18 hour flight.','source_text'=>'Mak sampai petang hari Khamis selepas penerbangan selama 17 hingga 18 jam.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>117.64,'end_time'=>118.7,'target_text'=>'And how was that flight?','source_text'=>'Dan macam mana penerbangan tu?','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>118.8,'end_time'=>120.54,'target_text'=>'Whoa, did that guy just started backing?','source_text'=>'Wah, orang tu baru nak undur kereta ke?','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>120.64,'end_time'=>122.26,'target_text'=>'Did you see that?','source_text'=>'Mak nampak tak tu?','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>122.36,'end_time'=>124.1,'target_text'=>'>> Whoa, that guy just started backing up.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, lelaki tu baru nak mengundur.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>124.2,'end_time'=>128.38,'target_text'=>'>> The flight was longer than last time when I went to South Korea.','source_text'=>'>> Penerbangan kali ni lebih lama berbanding masa Mak pergi ke Korea Selatan dulu.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>128.48,'end_time'=>133.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty far to come to see you guys, so >> Yeah, it was a pretty long flight, but it wasn\'t too bad.','source_text'=>'Jauh juga nak datang jumpa kamu berdua, jadi >> Ya, penerbangan agak lama, tapi taklah teruk sangat.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>133.96,'end_time'=>135.46,'target_text'=>'You\'re not like very jet lagged.','source_text'=>'Mak nampak macam tak kena \'jet lag\' sangat.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>135.56,'end_time'=>140.18,'target_text'=>'>> I was fine yesterday because I drank lots of water, electrolytes.','source_text'=>'>> Semalam Mak rasa okey je sebab Mak minum banyak air dan elektrolit.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>140.28,'end_time'=>141.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I know, that\'s good.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul tu, baguslah.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>141.2,'end_time'=>145.9,'target_text'=>'I know that flight is long and I really hate flying now for like extended periods of time.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu penerbangan tu lama dan saya memang tak suka terbang sekarang kalau untuk tempoh masa yang panjang.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>146,'end_time'=>151.42,'target_text'=>'Even if it\'s just an hour, just doing everything like going through the airport, going through immigration, security, customs.','source_text'=>'Walaupun cuma satu jam, kena buat macam-macam urusan seperti di lapangan terbang, lalu imigresen, pemeriksaan keselamatan, kastam.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>151.52,'end_time'=>152.7,'target_text'=>'>> Takes a lot of time.','source_text'=>'>> Ambil banyak masa.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>152.8,'end_time'=>153.5,'target_text'=>'>> so much time.','source_text'=>'>> banyak sangat masa.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>153.6,'end_time'=>158.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s like I would rather just stay in one place now and just like explore that place, you know?','source_text'=>'Rasa macam saya lebih suka duduk di satu tempat sekarang dan teroka tempat tu je, faham kan?','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>158.44,'end_time'=>166.86,'target_text'=>'But I I have to say they\'re pretty organized in Asia compared to Canada and North America, it\'s way cleaner and organized.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya perlu akui lapangan terbang di Asia cukup teratur berbanding Kanada dan Amerika Utara, ia jauh lebih bersih dan teratur.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>166.96,'end_time'=>169.38,'target_text'=>'I just feel that they care at the airports.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa staf lapangan terbang kat sini lebih prihatin.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>169.48,'end_time'=>171.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s a nightmare flying in North America.','source_text'=>'Penerbangan di Amerika Utara ibarat mimpi ngeri.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>172,'end_time'=>177.3,'target_text'=>'Yeah, one thing I will say like every time I\'ve been to the States, the United States, man, terrible service.','source_text'=>'Ya, satu benda yang saya boleh katakan, setiap kali saya ke Amerika Syarikat, perkhidmatannya memang teruk betul.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>177.4,'end_time'=>180.38,'target_text'=>'I feel like everyone there is just really rude, low key rude.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa semua orang di sana agak biadab dan kurang mesra.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>180.48,'end_time'=>181.94,'target_text'=>'>> Everybody there is in a bad mood.','source_text'=>'>> Semua orang di sana macam tengah bad mood.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>182.04,'end_time'=>184.1,'target_text'=>'>> know if it\'s everywhere, but that\'s been my experience.','source_text'=>'>> tak tahu kalau semua tempat macam tu, tapi itulah pengalaman saya.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>184.2,'end_time'=>188.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just stopped at [music] this store right here, and do you know what they sell?','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi kita baru je singgah di kedai ini [muzik], dan Mak tahu apa yang diorang jual?','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>188.68,'end_time'=>189.38,'target_text'=>'They sell ice cream.','source_text'=>'Diorang jual aiskrim.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>189.48,'end_time'=>190.58,'target_text'=>'Should we go and see what it is?','source_text'=>'Patut ke kita pergi tengok aiskrim apa?','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>190.68,'end_time'=>191.08,'target_text'=>'>> we\'re not sure.','source_text'=>'>> kita tak berapa pasti.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>191.16,'end_time'=>195.38,'target_text'=>'We\'ve been passing by this place and that place over there a lot.','source_text'=>'Kita dah banyak kali lalu-lalang depan kedai ni dan kedai sebelah sana tu.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>195.48,'end_time'=>197.7,'target_text'=>'So I think we\'re going to go ask now what they actually sell.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa kita nak pergi tanya sekarang apa sebenarnya yang diorang jual.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>197.8,'end_time'=>202.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m pretty sure it\'s ice cream, but one thing you can also see here is this road is closed.','source_text'=>'Saya yakin ia aiskrim, tapi satu benda yang korang boleh nampak kat sini ialah jalan raya ini ditutup.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>202.52,'end_time'=>208.26,'target_text'=>'So you can see there are police officers somewhere up there, but they barricaded this road so that you can just walk here','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh nampak ada polis kat arah depan sana, tapi diorang pasang penghadang jalan supaya orang boleh jalan kaki je kat sini','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>208.36,'end_time'=>211.54,'target_text'=>'and there are no vehicles or cars or scooters.','source_text'=>'dan tiada sebarang kenderaan, kereta atau skuter dibenarkan lalu.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>211.64,'end_time'=>217.46,'target_text'=>'Because normally this is a normal road where vehicles can drive, but on the weekend you can\'t as you can see here.','source_text'=>'Sebab biasanya ini jalan raya biasa untuk kenderaan lalu, tapi pada hujung minggu tak boleh, macam yang korang nampak kat sini.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>217.56,'end_time'=>218.98,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let\'s go try.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita cuba.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>219.08,'end_time'=>222.94,'target_text'=>'Hello, what\'s the original ice cream, the most popular one?','source_text'=>'Helo, apa aiskrim asli yang paling popular kat sini?','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>223.04,'end_time'=>223.82,'target_text'=>'We got the ice cream.','source_text'=>'Kita dah dapat aiskrimnya.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>223.92,'end_time'=>224.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m really not sure.','source_text'=>'Saya betul-betul tak pasti.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>225,'end_time'=>226.7,'target_text'=>'Rice flakes ice cream, okay.','source_text'=>'Aiskrim emping beras (rice flakes), okey.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>226.8,'end_time'=>227.46,'target_text'=>'I guess that\'s a flavor.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu salah satu perisanya.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>227.56,'end_time'=>228.82,'target_text'=>'That one I\'m sure will be good.','source_text'=>'Yang tu saya yakin mesti sedap.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>228.92,'end_time'=>229.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s like mochi.','source_text'=>'Teksturnya macam mochi.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>229.92,'end_time'=>230.66,'target_text'=>'>> I I mochi.','source_text'=>'>> Mak suka mochi.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>230.76,'end_time'=>235.94,'target_text'=>'So, this right here is an ice cream and it is wrapped in this plastic wrap.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini aiskrim dan ia dibalut dengan bungkusan plastik ini.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>236.04,'end_time'=>240.64,'target_text'=>'And right now, can you guys tell me what I\'m going to do?','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang, boleh tak korang beritahu apa yang saya nak buat?','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>241.28,'end_time'=>242.38,'target_text'=>'So, what did I just do?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa yang baru saya buat tadi?','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>242.48,'end_time'=>246.82,'target_text'=>'I just tore the ice cream open and now I\'m pulling the wrapper off.','source_text'=>'Saya baru saja koyakkan bungkusan aiskrim dan sekarang saya tanggalkan pembalutnya.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>246.92,'end_time'=>247.98,'target_text'=>'So, this is the ice cream.','source_text'=>'Jadi, inilah aiskrimnya.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>248.08,'end_time'=>250.7,'target_text'=>'This ice cream is like a lime green.','source_text'=>'Aiskrim ni warnanya macam hijau limau nipis.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>250.8,'end_time'=>252.14,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this?','source_text'=>'Macam mana Mak nak gambarkan rupa benda ni?','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>252.24,'end_time'=>253.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s round.','source_text'=>'Bentuknya bulat.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>253.4,'end_time'=>254.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s round.','source_text'=>'Ya, bentuknya bulat.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>254.2,'end_time'=>255.58,'target_text'=>'There\'s like some powder on it.','source_text'=>'Macam ada sedikit serbuk tepung kat atasnya.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>255.68,'end_time'=>256.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, mochi.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, macam mochi.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>256.76,'end_time'=>259.5,'target_text'=>'>> This one is like lime lime green.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini warnanya macam hijau limau.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>259.6,'end_time'=>261.6,'target_text'=>'That\'s right.','source_text'=>'Betul tu.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>264.88,'end_time'=>265.5,'target_text'=>'Is it good?','source_text'=>'Sedap tak?','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>265.6,'end_time'=>266.1,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>266.2,'end_time'=>269.82,'target_text'=>'I like it when they\'re a little softer, but I\'ll still try it like this.','source_text'=>'Mak lebih suka kalau teksturnya lembut sikit, tapi Mak cuba rasa macam ni dulu.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>269.92,'end_time'=>271.72,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>272.08,'end_time'=>273.58,'target_text'=>'Oh, that\'s hard.','source_text'=>'Oh, keras juga.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>273.68,'end_time'=>274.7,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like matcha.','source_text'=>'Saya tak suka matcha.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>274.8,'end_time'=>275.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s yummy.','source_text'=>'Sedap rasanya.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>276,'end_time'=>277.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s not a lot of matcha in it.','source_text'=>'Rasa matchanya tak terlalu kuat pun.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>278.04,'end_time'=>278.7,'target_text'=>'That\'s a lot.','source_text'=>'Banyak juga rasanya.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>278.8,'end_time'=>279.42,'target_text'=>'I love matcha.','source_text'=>'Mak suka sangat matcha.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>279.52,'end_time'=>280.46,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like matcha.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tak suka matcha.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>280.56,'end_time'=>282.62,'target_text'=>'To me, matcha just tastes like grass.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, rasa matcha ni macam rasa rumput je.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>282.72,'end_time'=>285.18,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let\'s try this one.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita cuba yang ini pula.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>285.28,'end_time'=>286.14,'target_text'=>'Wrap.','source_text'=>'Buka balutan.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>286.24,'end_time'=>288.1,'target_text'=>'Oh, it\'s really like milky, no?','source_text'=>'Oh, rasa susunya pekat betul, kan?','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>288.2,'end_time'=>288.74,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>288.84,'end_time'=>289.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually quite nice.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya sedap juga.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>289.64,'end_time'=>290.62,'target_text'=>'I do like this one.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka perisa yang ini.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>290.72,'end_time'=>293.02,'target_text'=>'So, now we are in the middle of the street here.','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang kita berada di tengah-tengah jalan raya kat sini.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>293.12,'end_time'=>299.78,'target_text'=>'These are all actually brands across here and over there, you can see that is the lake.','source_text'=>'Ini semua deretan kedai jenama di seberang sana dan kat sebelah situ, korang boleh nampak tasik.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>299.88,'end_time'=>303.82,'target_text'=>'And like I was saying, these roads here, like around the lake, are closed on the weekend.','source_text'=>'Dan seperti yang saya katakan tadi, jalan-jalan di sekitar tasik ini ditutup pada hujung minggu.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>303.92,'end_time'=>306.98,'target_text'=>'So, today is Saturday and we\'re standing in the middle of the road.','source_text'=>'Jadi, hari ini hari Sabtu dan kita berdiri tepat di tengah jalan raya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>307.08,'end_time'=>307.94,'target_text'=>'What do you think of that?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat Mak pasal hal tu?','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>308.04,'end_time'=>310.86,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s great because it\'s very busy here.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa bagus sangat sebab kawasan sini sibuk gila.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>310.96,'end_time'=>314.5,'target_text'=>'It was super busy yesterday with all the bikes and the cars.','source_text'=>'Semalam jalan ni sesak teruk dengan motosikal dan kereta.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>314.6,'end_time'=>316.26,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s kind of nice.','source_text'=>'Jadi rasa seronok dan tenang sikit.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>316.36,'end_time'=>317.14,'target_text'=>'>> so loud.','source_text'=>'>> bising sangat.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>317.24,'end_time'=>317.64,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>317.68,'end_time'=>323.18,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s so loud with all like the sounds of like honking, people driving, scooters, loud exhaust.','source_text'=>'Bising sangat dengan bunyi hon bertalu-talu, bunyi orang memandu, skuter, dan ekzos bising.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>323.28,'end_time'=>325.62,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s nice to have uh this street closed.','source_text'=>'Jadi memang seronok bila jalan ini ditutup untuk kenderaan.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>325.72,'end_time'=>327.78,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s just quiet and you can just hear people.','source_text'=>'Kawasan jadi sunyi dan kita cuma dengar suara orang berbual je.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>327.88,'end_time'=>329.74,'target_text'=>'Okay, so where are we now, Mom?','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita kat mana pula, Mak?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>329.84,'end_time'=>330.94,'target_text'=>'We\'re at the lake.','source_text'=>'Kita dah sampai di tasik.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>331.04,'end_time'=>331.7,'target_text'=>'Correct.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>331.8,'end_time'=>332.46,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re at the lake.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita dah berada di tasik.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>332.56,'end_time'=>336.26,'target_text'=>'Here you can see we\'re both standing at the edge here.','source_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak kami berdua berdiri tepat di tepi tebing ni.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>336.36,'end_time'=>339.34,'target_text'=>'And if we take another step forward, we will fall into the lake.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau kita melangkah setapak lagi ke depan, kita akan terjatuh ke dalam tasik.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>339.44,'end_time'=>340.62,'target_text'=>'Do you want to fall into the lake?','source_text'=>'Mak nak jatuh dalam tasik ke?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>340.72,'end_time'=>341.14,'target_text'=>'I would assume no.','source_text'=>'Saya anggap mestilah tak nak.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>341.24,'end_time'=>342.14,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe later.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin kemudian.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>342.24,'end_time'=>343.7,'target_text'=>'This water is very green.','source_text'=>'Air tasik ni warna hijau pekat.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>343.8,'end_time'=>345.38,'target_text'=>'I would not want to fall in there.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tak ingin nak terjatuh ke dalam tu.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>345.48,'end_time'=>347.7,'target_text'=>'Anyways, your shoes look very new.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kasut Mak nampak baru sangat.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>347.8,'end_time'=>348.42,'target_text'=>'Are they?','source_text'=>'Kasut baru ke?','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>348.52,'end_time'=>352.94,'target_text'=>'Yes, there\'s too much snow in Canada, so I couldn\'t break them in.','source_text'=>'Ya, kat Kanada salji tebal sangat, jadi Mak tak sempat nak pakai bagi selesa.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>353.04,'end_time'=>354.26,'target_text'=>'So, new shoes.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kasut barulah ni.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>354.36,'end_time'=>355.26,'target_text'=>'>> Are they comfortable?','source_text'=>'>> Selesa tak pakai?','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>355.36,'end_time'=>357.66,'target_text'=>'Yes, this is my second pair, actually.','source_text'=>'Selesa, sebenarnya ni sepasang yang kedua Mak beli.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>357.76,'end_time'=>358.16,'target_text'=>'Oh, really?','source_text'=>'Oh, ya ke?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>358.24,'end_time'=>359.38,'target_text'=>'Of the exact same shoes?','source_text'=>'Kasut yang sama jenis betul-betul?','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>359.48,'end_time'=>360.9,'target_text'=>'>> Of the exact same shoes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, jenis dan model yang sama persis.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>361,'end_time'=>361.46,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>361.56,'end_time'=>362.66,'target_text'=>'They must be comfortable then.','source_text'=>'Mestilah sangat selesa kalau macam tu.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>362.76,'end_time'=>363.46,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>363.56,'end_time'=>365.9,'target_text'=>'Anyways, you guys can see the lake here.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, korang boleh nampak tasik kat sini.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>366,'end_time'=>368.22,'target_text'=>'The sky today isn\'t very blue.','source_text'=>'Langit hari ini tak berapa biru.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>368.32,'end_time'=>371.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s pretty much almost just pure white, right?','source_text'=>'Hampir keseluruhan langit warna putih mendung je, kan?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>371.84,'end_time'=>372.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s not blue.','source_text'=>'Langit tak nampak biru langsung.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>372.68,'end_time'=>373.7,'target_text'=>'Super bright.','source_text'=>'Terang dan silau sangat.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>373.8,'end_time'=>374.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it is really bright.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang silau dan cerah betul.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>375.08,'end_time'=>378.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s the one thing, when the sky is white like this, it feels very bright on your eyes.','source_text'=>'Itulah satu halnya, bila langit putih macam ni, mata kita rasa silau sangat.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>379.04,'end_time'=>381.94,'target_text'=>'Like, my eyes are kind of like half closed all the time.','source_text'=>'Sampai mata saya terpaksa sepet separuh pejam sepanjang masa.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>382.04,'end_time'=>383.14,'target_text'=>'But, you have sunglasses on.','source_text'=>'Tapi, Mak pakai cermin mata hitam.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>383.24,'end_time'=>386.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, I think sunglasses comes in handy.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, Mak rasa cermin mata hitam memang sangat berguna.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>386.92,'end_time'=>387.58,'target_text'=>'For real.','source_text'=>'Betul sangat.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>387.68,'end_time'=>388.86,'target_text'=>'You have sunglasses on, too.','source_text'=>'Mak pun memang pakai cermin mata hitam juga.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>388.96,'end_time'=>390.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, I do.','source_text'=>'Oh, haah Mak pakai.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>390.48,'end_time'=>393.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m the only one without sunglasses, so I\'m low-key cooked.','source_text'=>'Saya seorang je yang tak pakai cermin mata hitam, jadi memang rasa nak terbakar mata.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>393.84,'end_time'=>395.5,'target_text'=>'But, I don\'t like the way sunglasses look.','source_text'=>'Tapi, saya tak suka rupa saya bila pakai cermin mata hitam.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>395.6,'end_time'=>400.66,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, I am blind, so I need glasses or contacts, but I don\'t have either of those on.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, mata saya rabun teruk, saya patut pakai cermin mata atau kanta lekap, tapi dua-dua pun saya tak pakai sekarang.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>400.76,'end_time'=>401.22,'target_text'=>'Blind?','source_text'=>'Buta?','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>401.32,'end_time'=>402.74,'target_text'=>'I wouldn\'t describe it as blind.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa takdelah sampai tahap buta.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>402.84,'end_time'=>404.5,'target_text'=>'I would I\'m blind.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, saya macam buta.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>404.6,'end_time'=>405.74,'target_text'=>'That\'s very dramatic.','source_text'=>'Dramatik sangatlah kamu ni.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>405.84,'end_time'=>407.22,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go and get coffee.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi beli kopi.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>407.32,'end_time'=>412.1,'target_text'=>'>> to go now to get coffee at this really popular and famous coffee shop that my mom wants to go to.','source_text'=>'>> kita nak pergi beli kopi sekarang di sebuah kafe kopi yang sangat popular dan terkenal yang mak saya nak sangat pergi.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>412.2,'end_time'=>412.66,'target_text'=>'What is it?','source_text'=>'Kopi apa tu?','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>412.76,'end_time'=>413.34,'target_text'=>'What kind of coffee?','source_text'=>'Kopi jenis macam mana?','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>413.44,'end_time'=>414.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s coconut coffee.','source_text'=>'Ia kopi kelapa (coconut coffee).','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>414.64,'end_time'=>418.14,'target_text'=>'Their specialty is coconut coffee, so I haven\'t tried that yet.','source_text'=>'Keistimewaan kedai tu ialah kopi kelapa, jadi Mak belum pernah rasa lagi.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>418.24,'end_time'=>421.26,'target_text'=>'I had two coffees yesterday, but not a coconut coffee.','source_text'=>'Semalam Mak dah minum dua cawan kopi, tapi bukan kopi kelapa.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>421.36,'end_time'=>423.69,'target_text'=>'Coconut specialty that we need to try.','source_text'=>'Menu istimewa kelapa yang wajib kita cuba.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>423.79,'end_time'=>425.78,'target_text'=>'>> [laughter] >> We need to try coconut coffee.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa] >> Kita kena cuba kopi kelapa tu.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>425.88,'end_time'=>426.46,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>426.56,'end_time'=>430.06,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re walking to the cafe, right?','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita tengah berjalan kaki menuju ke kafe, kan?','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>430.16,'end_time'=>432.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yes, we\'re going to go to the cafe.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kita sedang menuju ke kafe.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>432.32,'end_time'=>433.3,'target_text'=>'Let me see.','source_text'=>'Biar Mak tengok.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>433.4,'end_time'=>434.74,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re walking to the cafe here.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita tengah berjalan ke kafe kat sini.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>434.84,'end_time'=>436.78,'target_text'=>'We\'re walking on the sidewalk.','source_text'=>'Kita berjalan di laluan pejalan kaki (sidewalk).','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>436.88,'end_time'=>438.26,'target_text'=>'This street is not closed.','source_text'=>'Jalan raya ni tak ditutup.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>438.36,'end_time'=>440.94,'target_text'=>'There are just no vehicles, but the street is open.','source_text'=>'Cuma kebetulan tiada kenderaan lalu, tapi jalan sebenarnya dibuka.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>441.04,'end_time'=>445.42,'target_text'=>'And I really like the way the buildings and sidewalk looks in Vietnam, don\'t you?','source_text'=>'Dan saya memang suka tengok reka bentuk bangunan dan laluan pejalan kaki di Vietnam, Mak suka tak?','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>445.52,'end_time'=>450.9,'target_text'=>'Like, I like how they have their flag out and like all these buildings in the old quarter look really nice.','source_text'=>'Macam, saya suka tengok bendera dipasang dan bangunan-bangunan di kawasan lama (old quarter) nampak klasik dan cantik.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>451,'end_time'=>452.82,'target_text'=>'And they have like cafes and everything.','source_text'=>'Dan ada banyak kafe dan macam-macam lagi.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>452.92,'end_time'=>457.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s historical buildings that with their French French influence.','source_text'=>'Ia bangunan bersejarah dengan pengaruh seni bina Perancis.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>457.24,'end_time'=>459.7,'target_text'=>'That\'s just absolutely beautiful.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat indah dan memukau.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>459.8,'end_time'=>460.9,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it It really nice.','source_text'=>'Ya, ia memang sangat cantik.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>461,'end_time'=>467.78,'target_text'=>'Also, like unique boutique shops and like small little stores that sell like really niche things.','source_text'=>'Juga ada kedai butik unik dan kedai-kedai kecil yang menjual barangan khas yang sangat menarik.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>467.88,'end_time'=>468.54,'target_text'=>'I like it.','source_text'=>'Saya suka suasana macam ni.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>468.64,'end_time'=>472.54,'target_text'=>'Right now we\'re crossing the street and you can see it\'s very hectic and busy.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita tengah melintas jalan dan korang boleh nampak lalu lintas sangat sibuk dan huru-hara.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>472.64,'end_time'=>475.3,'target_text'=>'Like although we have the green light to pass, it\'s still busy.','source_text'=>'Walaupun lampu isyarat pejalan kaki hijau untuk kita melintas, jalan tetap sesak.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>475.4,'end_time'=>479.14,'target_text'=>'And a lot of the times it feels like those scooters are just going to hit us, right mom?','source_text'=>'Dan kerap kali rasa macam skuter-skuter tu nak langgar kita je, kan Mak?','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>479.24,'end_time'=>481.54,'target_text'=>'They\'re just coming from all directions.','source_text'=>'Skuter datang meluru dari semua arah.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>481.64,'end_time'=>486.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, because we have like the light that says we can walk, but then scooters are coming to the side, so.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab walaupun lampu kata kita boleh jalan, skuter tetap menyelit dari tepi, jadi...','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>486.32,'end_time'=>486.64,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>486.64,'end_time'=>487.58,'target_text'=>'And they don\'t stop.','source_text'=>'Dan diorang langsung tak berhenti.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>487.68,'end_time'=>488.1,'target_text'=>'They don\'t stop.','source_text'=>'Diorang takkan berhenti.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>488.2,'end_time'=>494.42,'target_text'=>'Usually, you know, in Canada and other countries the vehicle has to wait until the person crosses and then they can go, but','source_text'=>'Biasanya, Mak tahu kan, di Kanada dan negara lain kenderaan kena tunggu pejalan kaki melintas dulu baru boleh jalan, tapi','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>494.52,'end_time'=>495.66,'target_text'=>'here No, here no.','source_text'=>'kat sini? Langsung tak macam tu.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>495.76,'end_time'=>501.46,'target_text'=>'Here I try to line up with you or Leon that I if they hit somebody they can go to hit you guys first.','source_text'=>'Kat sini Mak cuba jalan sebaris belakang kamu atau Leon, supaya kalau kena langgar biar kena korang berdua dulu.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>501.56,'end_time'=>502.06,'target_text'=>'Fair enough.','source_text'=>'Boleh diterima juga logik tu.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>502.16,'end_time'=>503.46,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s not for the weak.','source_text'=>'Ya, melintas jalan kat sini bukan untuk orang yang lemah semangat.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>503.56,'end_time'=>504.26,'target_text'=>'No, definitely not.','source_text'=>'Memang sah bukan.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>504.36,'end_time'=>506.74,'target_text'=>'[music] And the vehicles park on the sidewalk here.','source_text'=>'[muzik] Dan kenderaan diparkir di atas laluan pejalan kaki kat sini.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>506.84,'end_time'=>509.5,'target_text'=>'Like look at all these vehicles parked along the sidewalk.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah semua motosikal dan kereta yang diletakkan sepanjang laluan pejalan kaki ni.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>509.6,'end_time'=>510.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of crazy.','source_text'=>'Agak gila juga keadaannya.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>510.28,'end_time'=>514.22,'target_text'=>'But I do really like this style, like all these shops with their signs up top.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya memang suka gaya suasana ni, kedai-kedai dengan papan tanda kat bahagian atas.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>514.32,'end_time'=>518.46,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster, get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih cepat, dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>518.56,'end_time'=>525.3,'target_text'=>'It includes deeper explanations and exercises to help you remember and master what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi penerangan mendalam serta latihan untuk bantu korang ingat dan kuasai apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>525.4,'end_time'=>531.26,'target_text'=>'And if you get five or more workbooks, you\'ll get 30% off automatically at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau korang beli lima atau lebih buku latihan, korang akan dapat potongan 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>531.36,'end_time'=>535.34,'target_text'=>'So go to the description or my website vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jadi layari pautan di ruangan deskripsi atau laman web saya di vulcaenglish.com.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>535.44,'end_time'=>536.54,'target_text'=>'I really like this style.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka gaya jalanan macam ni.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>536.64,'end_time'=>537.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s a nice vibe.','source_text'=>'Suasananya sangat santai dan menarik.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>537.6,'end_time'=>540.18,'target_text'=>'They have very beautiful tall trees here, too.','source_text'=>'Kat sini juga ada pokok-pokok tinggi yang sangat cantik.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>540.28,'end_time'=>540.94,'target_text'=>'I like it.','source_text'=>'Saya suka.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>541.04,'end_time'=>542.7,'target_text'=>'>> tropical kind of climate.','source_text'=>'>> cuaca iklim tropika macam ni.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>542.8,'end_time'=>550.42,'target_text'=>'I wonder if the whole city it looks like this when you walk, like nice shops on the side, beautiful trees, clean.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya adakah seluruh bandar nampak macam ni bila kita jalan, deretan kedai menarik di tepi, pokok-pokok indah, bersih.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>550.52,'end_time'=>551.1,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat Mak?','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>551.2,'end_time'=>555.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'ve seen some parts of the city that does not look like that.','source_text'=>'>> Mak dah tengok beberapa kawasan bandar ni yang tak nampak macam ni pun.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>555.52,'end_time'=>558.74,'target_text'=>'Well, I\'m sure not every part looks like that, but the majority?','source_text'=>'Memanglah bukan semua kawasan nampak macam ni, tapi sebahagian besarnya?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>558.84,'end_time'=>561.78,'target_text'=>'>> overall, I think it\'s a really beautiful city, Hanoi.','source_text'=>'>> secara keseluruhan, Mak rasa Hanoi memang sebuah bandar yang sangat cantik.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>561.88,'end_time'=>562.62,'target_text'=>'So far, yeah.','source_text'=>'Setakat ni, ya memang betul.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>562.72,'end_time'=>567.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s just the buildings and the greenery and everything combined, it\'s beautiful.','source_text'=>'Gabungan seni bina bangunan dan kehijauan alam sekitar jadikan semuanya indah.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>567.4,'end_time'=>570.14,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s my second time in Hanoi.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini kali kedua saya datang ke Hanoi.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>570.24,'end_time'=>574.54,'target_text'=>'The first time I ever came to Vietnam was 3 years ago.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya jejak kaki ke Vietnam adalah 3 tahun lepas.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>574.64,'end_time'=>576.9,'target_text'=>'And I saw the whole country, but this is my second time.','source_text'=>'Masa tu saya jelajah seluruh negara, tapi ini kali kedua saya ke sini.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>577,'end_time'=>578.94,'target_text'=>'>> My first time and this was my choice.','source_text'=>'>> Ini kali pertama Mak dan ini pilihan Mak sendiri.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>579.04,'end_time'=>580.54,'target_text'=>'I wanted to come to Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Mak yang nak datang ke Vietnam.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>580.64,'end_time'=>583.02,'target_text'=>'What other countries do you want to go to in Asia?','source_text'=>'Negara mana lagi di Asia yang Mak teringin nak pergi?','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>583.12,'end_time'=>583.82,'target_text'=>'China.','source_text'=>'China.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>583.92,'end_time'=>584.32,'target_text'=>'China?','source_text'=>'Negara China?','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>584.36,'end_time'=>585.58,'target_text'=>'I want to go to China.','source_text'=>'Mak nak pergi ke China.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>585.68,'end_time'=>586.46,'target_text'=>'Where else?','source_text'=>'Mana lagi?','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>586.56,'end_time'=>589.06,'target_text'=>'Um I think everybody goes to Thailand.','source_text'=>'Hmm Mak rasa semua orang pergi ke Thailand.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>589.16,'end_time'=>590.82,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if I want to go to Thailand.','source_text'=>'Mak tak tahu sama ada Mak nak pergi ke Thailand atau tak.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>590.92,'end_time'=>591.82,'target_text'=>'Haven\'t you been?','source_text'=>'Mak belum pernah pergi ke?','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>591.92,'end_time'=>593.38,'target_text'=>'Many, many years ago.','source_text'=>'Bertahun-tahun yang lalu dah.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>593.48,'end_time'=>594.26,'target_text'=>'How long ago?','source_text'=>'Berapa lama dah?','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>594.36,'end_time'=>595.58,'target_text'=>'Maybe 30 years ago.','source_text'=>'Mungkin 30 tahun yang lepas.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>595.68,'end_time'=>597.18,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s a long time ago.','source_text'=>'Dah lama sangat dah.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>597.28,'end_time'=>597.74,'target_text'=>'>> Wait, for what?','source_text'=>'>> Tunggu, pergi untuk apa?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>597.84,'end_time'=>598.58,'target_text'=>'Just to travel?','source_text'=>'Pergi melancong je ke?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>598.68,'end_time'=>599.04,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>599.04,'end_time'=>604.38,'target_text'=>'I did Singapore, Hong Kong, and I did Bangkok and some surrounding areas.','source_text'=>'Dulu Mak pergi Singapura, Hong Kong, dan pergi Bangkok serta beberapa kawasan sekitarnya.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>604.48,'end_time'=>605.82,'target_text'=>'I love Singapore.','source_text'=>'Mak suka sangat Singapura.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>605.92,'end_time'=>607.5,'target_text'=>'I really like Singapore, yeah.','source_text'=>'Saya pun memang suka Singapura, ya.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>607.6,'end_time'=>608.5,'target_text'=>'But it\'s expensive.','source_text'=>'Tapi kos di sana mahal.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>608.6,'end_time'=>609.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s very expensive.','source_text'=>'Ya, kos di sana sangat mahal.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>609.84,'end_time'=>611.34,'target_text'=>'I mean, if you\'re from Singapore, let me know.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, kalau korang berasal dari Singapura, beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>611.44,'end_time'=>615.02,'target_text'=>'You\'re probably not from Singapore because I know people in Singapore speak very good English.','source_text'=>'Mungkin korang bukan dari Singapura sebab saya tahu orang di Singapura bertutur bahasa Inggeris dengan sangat baik.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>615.12,'end_time'=>617.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the first language, so but if you\'ve been, let me know.','source_text'=>'Ia seperti bahasa utama di sana, tapi kalau korang pernah pergi melawat, beritahu saya.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>617.72,'end_time'=>618.18,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been too.','source_text'=>'Saya pun pernah pergi.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>618.28,'end_time'=>620.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s really nice, but I\'ve only been for like 1 day.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat seronok, tapi saya cuma sempat singgah selama 1 hari je.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>620.92,'end_time'=>626.62,'target_text'=>'I was just there for 1 day because I had a stopover when I was flying to Greece from Japan.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma transit 1 hari di sana sebab ada penerbangan sambungan semasa dalam perjalanan dari Jepun ke Greece.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>626.72,'end_time'=>630.18,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we\'re almost at the coffee shop and we\'ll see you guys there.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita dah nak sampai ke kedai kopi dan jumpa korang di sana nanti.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>630.28,'end_time'=>631.1,'target_text'=>'So, where are we, Mom?','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang kita berada di mana, Mak?','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>631.2,'end_time'=>635.46,'target_text'=>'We\'re at the coffee shop that I wanted to come and try the coconut iced coffee.','source_text'=>'Kita dah sampai di kedai kopi tempat Mak nak cuba kopi ais kelapa tu.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>635.56,'end_time'=>639.24,'target_text'=>'This is the coffee shop name right here.','source_text'=>'Ini nama kedai kopinya kat sini.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>639.76,'end_time'=>644.14,'target_text'=>'This is like a really popular chain in Vietnam, so I know it\'s I know you guys know this food.','source_text'=>'Ini rangkaian kedai kopi yang sangat popular di Vietnam, jadi saya tahu korang mesti kenal jenama ni.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>644.24,'end_time'=>645.38,'target_text'=>'This This chain is everywhere.','source_text'=>'Rangkaian kedai ni ada di mana-mana.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>645.48,'end_time'=>646.5,'target_text'=>'I\'ve seen it a lot.','source_text'=>'Saya dah banyak kali nampak cawangannya.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>646.6,'end_time'=>648.18,'target_text'=>'It comes from their history.','source_text'=>'Ia ada kaitan dengan sejarah negara ini.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>648.28,'end_time'=>650.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of historical.','source_text'=>'Ia berkonsepkan sejarah dan nostalgia.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>650.12,'end_time'=>650.86,'target_text'=>'What is this one?','source_text'=>'Yang ini apa pula?','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>650.96,'end_time'=>651.36,'target_text'=>'It\'s a rice.','source_text'=>'Ini pulut/beras.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>651.4,'end_time'=>653.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the ice cream you had earlier.','source_text'=>'Teksturnya macam aiskrim emping beras yang kita makan tadi.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>653.16,'end_time'=>654.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s really good though.','source_text'=>'Tapi sedap sangat rasanya.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>654.2,'end_time'=>654.78,'target_text'=>'What is it called?','source_text'=>'Apa nama menu ni?','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>654.88,'end_time'=>656.58,'target_text'=>'Literally rice something.','source_text'=>'Nama dia berkaitan beras/pulut.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>656.68,'end_time'=>659.82,'target_text'=>'Okay, this is called rice something and we\'re going to try it.','source_text'=>'Okey, nama dia menu beras sesuatu dan kita nak cuba rasanya sekarang.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>659.92,'end_time'=>661.26,'target_text'=>'You can see it\'s white.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak warnanya putih.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>661.36,'end_time'=>663.58,'target_text'=>'What I got is coconut and cacao.','source_text'=>'Minuman yang saya pesan ialah kelapa dan koko (cacao).','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>663.68,'end_time'=>664.74,'target_text'=>'This one is brown.','source_text'=>'Yang ini warnanya coklat.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>664.84,'end_time'=>667.36,'target_text'=>'Let\'s try Leon\'s first.','source_text'=>'Jom kita cuba rasa air Leon dulu.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>668.36,'end_time'=>669.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s good.','source_text'=>'Sedap.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>669.32,'end_time'=>669.98,'target_text'=>'Like jelly try it.','source_text'=>'Macam ada tekstur jeli, cubalah rasa.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>670.08,'end_time'=>670.58,'target_text'=>'I did try it.','source_text'=>'Saya dah cuba tadi.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>670.68,'end_time'=>671.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually really good.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya memang sedap gila.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>671.6,'end_time'=>672.58,'target_text'=>'That\'s really good actually.','source_text'=>'Rasa dia betul-betul memuaskan.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>672.68,'end_time'=>673.66,'target_text'=>'That\'s my favorite one.','source_text'=>'Itu minuman kegemaran saya.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>673.76,'end_time'=>674.86,'target_text'=>'>> rice pudding.','source_text'=>'>> macam puding beras.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>674.96,'end_time'=>675.5,'target_text'=>'What\'s this one?','source_text'=>'Yang ini pula apa?','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>675.6,'end_time'=>677.14,'target_text'=>'This is coconut iced coffee.','source_text'=>'Ini kopi ais kelapa.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>677.24,'end_time'=>678.5,'target_text'=>'Coconut iced coffee.','source_text'=>'Kopi ais kelapa (coconut iced coffee).','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>678.6,'end_time'=>680.46,'target_text'=>'And I love coffee.','source_text'=>'Dan Mak memang peminat setia kopi.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>680.56,'end_time'=>681.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s good.','source_text'=>'Sedap rasanya.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>681.88,'end_time'=>684.02,'target_text'=>'I like it cuz the coffee isn\'t overbearing.','source_text'=>'Mak suka sebab rasa pahit kopinya tak terlalu menyengat.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>684.12,'end_time'=>684.66,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Betul, tak pahit sangat.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>684.76,'end_time'=>686.9,'target_text'=>'And then my one, cacao and coconut.','source_text'=>'Dan minuman saya pula, campuran koko dan kelapa.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>687,'end_time'=>688.3,'target_text'=>'And these are all frappes.','source_text'=>'Dan semua minuman ini jenis frappe.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>688.4,'end_time'=>690.82,'target_text'=>'That just means it\'s all blended up, the ice and everything together.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya semuanya dikisar halus bersama ais dan bahan-bahannya sekali.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>690.92,'end_time'=>692.54,'target_text'=>'They don\'t leave the ice in big chunks.','source_text'=>'Aisnya tak dibiarkan dalam ketulan besar.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>692.64,'end_time'=>694.06,'target_text'=>'Why do they call it an ice cap?','source_text'=>'Kenapa diorang panggil ia ice cap?','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>694.16,'end_time'=>696.54,'target_text'=>'Yeah, think it\'s just a term, like just a branding term.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasa saya itu cuma istilah jenama sahaja.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>696.64,'end_time'=>697.98,'target_text'=>'In Canada That\'s very good taste.','source_text'=>'Kat Kanada... Rasa dia memang sangat sedap.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>698.08,'end_time'=>702.86,'target_text'=>'>> at Tim Hortons, which is like the biggest coffee chain in Canada, they call drinks like these, like frappés, they call','source_text'=>'>> di Tim Hortons, iaitu rangkaian kedai kopi terbesar di Kanada, minuman kisar macam frappe ni diorang panggil','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>702.96,'end_time'=>704.02,'target_text'=>'them ice caps.','source_text'=>'sebagai ice caps.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>704.12,'end_time'=>705.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s very relaxing, huh?','source_text'=>'Suasana kat sini sangat mendamaikan, kan?','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>705.6,'end_time'=>706.54,'target_text'=>'Really relaxing.','source_text'=>'Betul-betul menenangkan.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>706.64,'end_time'=>707.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s a such a nice vibe.','source_text'=>'Vibes dia memang sangat santai.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>707.56,'end_time'=>712.94,'target_text'=>'We\'ll show you our view in a second here, but they also gave us water in these metal metal cups.','source_text'=>'Sekejap lagi kami tunjukkan pemandangan dari sini, dan diorang ada bagi air kosong dalam cawan logam ini.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>713.04,'end_time'=>716.42,'target_text'=>'Can you tell me the difference between these two?','source_text'=>'Boleh korang beritahu perbezaan antara dua bekas ini?','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>716.52,'end_time'=>717.62,'target_text'=>'This right here is a cup.','source_text'=>'Yang ini dipanggil \'cup\' (cawan).','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>717.72,'end_time'=>720.7,'target_text'=>'Cups could also be made out of like any type of material.','source_text'=>'Cawan boleh diperbuat daripada pelbagai jenis bahan.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>720.8,'end_time'=>723.02,'target_text'=>'When it\'s made out of glass, you call it a glass.','source_text'=>'Bila ia diperbuat daripada kaca, kita panggil \'glass\' (gelas).','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>723.12,'end_time'=>724.14,'target_text'=>'So, this is a glass.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini gelas kaca (glass).','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>724.24,'end_time'=>725.06,'target_text'=>'This is a cup.','source_text'=>'Yang ini cawan (cup).','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>725.16,'end_time'=>727.9,'target_text'=>'And now, let\'s show you guys the view.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang, jom kita tunjukkan pemandangan luar kepada korang.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>728,'end_time'=>731.1,'target_text'=>'So, this is our view here at Cộng Cà Phê.','source_text'=>'Jadi, inilah pemandangan kami dari kedai Cộng Cà Phê.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>731.2,'end_time'=>732.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s really nice, actually.','source_text'=>'Pemandangannya sebenarnya sangat cantik.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>732.56,'end_time'=>737.86,'target_text'=>'You get to see all the scooters and vehicles, and we get to sit here enjoying our coffee.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh lihat deretan skuter dan kenderaan lalu, dan kita boleh duduk santai sambil nikmati kopi.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>737.96,'end_time'=>739.74,'target_text'=>'Wording that coffee, but enjoying our drink.','source_text'=>'Bukan sekadar kopi, tapi menikmati minuman kita.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>739.84,'end_time'=>744.66,'target_text'=>'>> The coconut coffee is really delicious, but this is not really a first cup of coffee in the morning.','source_text'=>'>> Kopi kelapa ni memang sangat sedap, tapi ia tak sesuai dijadikan cawan kopi pertama di awal pagi.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>744.76,'end_time'=>747.7,'target_text'=>'This is more like a dessert, so >> Yeah, that\'s why I like it.','source_text'=>'Ia lebih kepada pencuci mulut (dessert), jadi >> Ya, sebab itulah saya suka.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>747.8,'end_time'=>749.42,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like coffee, but I like this.','source_text'=>'Saya tak suka kopi biasa, tapi minuman manis macam ni saya suka.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>749.52,'end_time'=>751.26,'target_text'=>'My drink is amazing.','source_text'=>'Minuman saya memang luar biasa sedap.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>751.36,'end_time'=>753.98,'target_text'=>'I give it like a 7.7 out of 10.','source_text'=>'Saya bagi skor 7.7 daripada 10.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>754.08,'end_time'=>755.14,'target_text'=>'What about your drink?','source_text'=>'Macam mana dengan minuman Mak?','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>755.24,'end_time'=>756.82,'target_text'=>'What do you give it?','source_text'=>'Berapa markah Mak bagi?','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>756.92,'end_time'=>757.66,'target_text'=>'10?','source_text'=>'10 markah?','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>757.76,'end_time'=>759.1,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang sedap sangat.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>759.2,'end_time'=>763.62,'target_text'=>'So far, my favorite coffee has been the salted coffee in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Setakat ini, kopi kegemaran saya di Vietnam ialah kopi garam (salted coffee).','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>763.72,'end_time'=>766.02,'target_text'=>'Vietnamese coffee is like really really strong.','source_text'=>'Kopi Vietnam rasa dia memang pekat dan kuat gila.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>766.12,'end_time'=>768.3,'target_text'=>'We had egg coffee yesterday, and we didn\'t record it.','source_text'=>'Semalam kami minum kopi telur (egg coffee), dan kami tak rakam video.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>768.4,'end_time'=>772.54,'target_text'=>'We were just chilling, but man, I could just eat the like that whipped egg on top.','source_text'=>'Kami cuma lepak santai, tapi krim telur yang dipukul gebu kat atas tu sedap sangat.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>772.64,'end_time'=>777.02,'target_text'=>'That\'s delicious, but the coffee man is so strong.','source_text'=>'Krimnya memang sedap, tapi rasa kopinya sangat pekat dan pahit kuat.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>777.12,'end_time'=>777.94,'target_text'=>'So strong, dude.','source_text'=>'Pekat gila, weh.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>778.04,'end_time'=>778.7,'target_text'=>'I cannot.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tak tahan.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>778.8,'end_time'=>780.22,'target_text'=>'I\'m not a coffee person.','source_text'=>'Saya bukan jenis orang yang tahan minum kopi pekat.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>780.32,'end_time'=>783.54,'target_text'=>'I don\'t like coffee, but there are a lot of people that love coffee.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa gemar kopi, tapi ramai orang memang sukakan kopi.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>783.64,'end_time'=>785.9,'target_text'=>'I think next time I\'ll definitely get what Leon had.','source_text'=>'Rasanya lain kali saya pasti akan pesan minuman yang Leon minum tu.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>786,'end_time'=>787.46,'target_text'=>'Let\'s learn a couple words here.','source_text'=>'Jom kita belajar beberapa perkataan di sini.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>787.56,'end_time'=>788.62,'target_text'=>'This is a glass.','source_text'=>'Ini gelas kaca (glass).','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>788.72,'end_time'=>790.34,'target_text'=>'This is a spoon.','source_text'=>'Ini sudu (spoon).','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>790.44,'end_time'=>792.06,'target_text'=>'This is a paper straw.','source_text'=>'Ini penyedut minuman kertas (paper straw).','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>792.16,'end_time'=>794.98,'target_text'=>'Leon has a plastic straw, a plastic straw.','source_text'=>'Leon pula guna penyedut minuman plastik (plastic straw).','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>795.08,'end_time'=>796.38,'target_text'=>'This is a paper straw.','source_text'=>'Yang ini straw kertas.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>796.48,'end_time'=>797.66,'target_text'=>'Here, we have a mug.','source_text'=>'Di sini, kita ada cawan bertangkai (mug).','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>797.76,'end_time'=>799.78,'target_text'=>'This is a mug because it has a handle.','source_text'=>'Ini dipanggil mug sebab ia mempunyai pemegang.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>799.88,'end_time'=>801.9,'target_text'=>'This is a cup because it doesn\'t have a handle.','source_text'=>'Ini cawan biasa (cup) sebab ia tiada pemegang.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>802,'end_time'=>804.46,'target_text'=>'And there are napkins in the mug.','source_text'=>'Dan ada serbet/tisu kertas di dalam mug ini.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>804.56,'end_time'=>808.62,'target_text'=>'This is for your cigarette ash, so it\'s an ashtray.','source_text'=>'Ini tempat abu rokok, jadi ia dipanggil bekas abu rokok (ashtray).','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>808.72,'end_time'=>809.46,'target_text'=>'This is a cup.','source_text'=>'Ini cawan (cup).','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>809.56,'end_time'=>814.68,'target_text'=>'The cup is filled with water, not to the brim, but it is filled.','source_text'=>'Cawan ini diisi air, tak penuh sampai ke bibir cawan, tapi ia terisi.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>815.88,'end_time'=>819.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m sitting on a small balcony, looking down at the road below.','source_text'=>'Saya duduk di balkoni kecil, memandang ke arah jalan raya di bawah.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>819.76,'end_time'=>823.98,'target_text'=>'In front of me, there are many motorbikes parked along the sidewalk.','source_text'=>'Di hadapan saya, terdapat banyak motosikal diletakkan di sepanjang kaki lima.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>824.08,'end_time'=>829.98,'target_text'=>'Across the street, people are moving around, riding scooters, walking, and going about their day.','source_text'=>'Di seberang jalan, orang ramai sibuk bergerak, menunggang skuter, berjalan kaki, dan menjalankan urusan harian.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>830.08,'end_time'=>835.42,'target_text'=>'The tall green trees stretch over the road, creating a soft natural canopy.','source_text'=>'Pokok-pokok hijau yang tinggi merentasi jalan, membentuk kanopi teduhan semula jadi yang indah.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>835.52,'end_time'=>841.86,'target_text'=>'Their branches hang above the street, and the leaves make the area feel cooler and more peaceful.','source_text'=>'Dahan-dahannya melitupi ruang atas jalan, dan dedaunannya menjadikan kawasan ini terasa lebih sejuk dan damai.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>841.96,'end_time'=>846.54,'target_text'=>'Behind the trees, there are buildings, cafes, and small shops.','source_text'=>'Di sebalik pepohon itu, terdapat deretan bangunan, kafe, dan kedai-kedai kecil.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>846.64,'end_time'=>849.22,'target_text'=>'Everything feels peaceful, but alive.','source_text'=>'Segala-galanya terasa tenang, namun penuh dengan kehidupan.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>849.32,'end_time'=>854.42,'target_text'=>'You can see movement, [music] hear the traffic, and feel the rhythm of everyday life.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh melihat pergerakan, [muzik] mendengar bunyi kenderaan, dan merasai rentak kehidupan harian.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>854.52,'end_time'=>859.06,'target_text'=>'It is not too loud or too chaotic, but steady and real.','source_text'=>'Suasananya tidak terlalu bising atau terlalu huru-hara, sebaliknya tenang dan bersahaja.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>859.16,'end_time'=>865.26,'target_text'=>'I am just sitting here, quietly observing, enjoying the moment, and taking it all in.','source_text'=>'Saya hanya duduk di sini, memerhati dalam keheningan, menikmati suasana, dan menghayati keindahan ini.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>865.36,'end_time'=>866.94,'target_text'=>'We\'re in this ceramics shop.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di dalam kedai seramik ini.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>867.04,'end_time'=>870.7,'target_text'=>'I was wondering what this is, and it\'s a chopstick rest.','source_text'=>'Tadi saya tertanya-tanya apa benda ni, rupanya ia tempat letak penyepit makanan (chopstick rest).','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>870.8,'end_time'=>871.34,'target_text'=>'>> Chopstick rest.','source_text'=>'>> Tempat letak penyepit makanan.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>871.44,'end_time'=>875.54,'target_text'=>'This one is in the shape of a fish, and this one is in the shape of a cat.','source_text'=>'Yang ini berbentuk ikan, dan yang satu lagi berbentuk kucing.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>875.64,'end_time'=>876.14,'target_text'=>'So cute.','source_text'=>'Comel sangat.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>876.24,'end_time'=>877.58,'target_text'=>'>> is like a nice little shop.','source_text'=>'>> kedai kecil yang sangat menarik.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>877.68,'end_time'=>878.78,'target_text'=>'This is what I was talking about.','source_text'=>'Inilah yang saya maksudkan tadi.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>878.88,'end_time'=>884.62,'target_text'=>'Like, I just love the vibe because there are so many of these like small little hole-in-the-wall shops that are really unique','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka suasananya sebab ada banyak kedai-kedai kecil unik tersembunyi macam ni','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>884.72,'end_time'=>885.9,'target_text'=>'and just focus on one thing.','source_text'=>'dan mereka hanya fokus pada satu jenis barangan sahaja.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>886,'end_time'=>887.58,'target_text'=>'These are very light.','source_text'=>'Barang-barang seramik ni sangat ringan.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>887.68,'end_time'=>888.3,'target_text'=>'They\'re light.','source_text'=>'Ringan betul.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>888.4,'end_time'=>889.3,'target_text'=>'They\'re not heavy.','source_text'=>'Ia tak berat langsung.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>889.4,'end_time'=>889.9,'target_text'=>'They\'re light.','source_text'=>'Memang ringan.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>890,'end_time'=>890.98,'target_text'=>'And they\'re pretty nice.','source_text'=>'Dan rekaannya agak cantik.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>891.08,'end_time'=>893.82,'target_text'=>'I mean, the inside is really dirty, but you can just clean that.','source_text'=>'Bahagian dalamnya memang nampak berhabuk sikit, tapi boleh dibasuh bersih.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>893.92,'end_time'=>898.14,'target_text'=>'And each of these mugs have uh like some sort of drawing on them.','source_text'=>'Dan setiap mug ini mempunyai lukisan corak tertentu padanya.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>898.24,'end_time'=>899.18,'target_text'=>'Wait, is this a frog?','source_text'=>'Tunggu, adakah ini gambar katak?','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>899.28,'end_time'=>900.06,'target_text'=>'Is that a frog?','source_text'=>'Itu gambar katak ke?','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>900.16,'end_time'=>900.98,'target_text'=>'This is the price.','source_text'=>'Ini harganya.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>901.08,'end_time'=>902.88,'target_text'=>'175,000','source_text'=>'175,000','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>903.12,'end_time'=>903.98,'target_text'=>'Vietnamese dong.','source_text'=>'Dong Vietnam.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>904.08,'end_time'=>905.34,'target_text'=>'Wait, this is actually funny.','source_text'=>'Tunggu, yang ini kelakar betul.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>905.44,'end_time'=>907.86,'target_text'=>'This looks like some Adventure Time stuff.','source_text'=>'Rupa dia macam watak dalam siri Adventure Time.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>907.96,'end_time'=>908.58,'target_text'=>'Does it not?','source_text'=>'Kan, nampak serupa kan?','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>908.68,'end_time'=>910.3,'target_text'=>'This is like reminding me of Adventure Time.','source_text'=>'Benda ni betul-betul ingatkan saya pada Adventure Time.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>910.4,'end_time'=>911.94,'target_text'=>'Have you guys seen Adventure Time?','source_text'=>'Korang pernah tengok kartun Adventure Time tak?','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>912.04,'end_time'=>918.3,'target_text'=>'We are now in one of the back rooms of this pottery shop, and this place is actually huge.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di salah satu bilik bahagian belakang kedai tembikar ini, dan tempat ini sebenarnya luas gila.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>918.4,'end_time'=>921.62,'target_text'=>'We\'ve been through a couple of rooms now, and look, there\'s still more.','source_text'=>'Kita dah lalui beberapa bilik tadi, dan tengok, ada banyak bilik lagi kat depan.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>921.72,'end_time'=>928.78,'target_text'=>'Like, there are just walls of mugs, small plates, big plates, bowls, and everything.','source_text'=>'Dinding dipenuhi dengan susunan cawan mug, pinggan kecil, pinggan besar, mangkuk, dan macam-macam lagi.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>928.88,'end_time'=>930.54,'target_text'=>'There is just a lot to see.','source_text'=>'Banyak sangat barang untuk dilihat.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>930.64,'end_time'=>932.54,'target_text'=>'You have these like very small cups.','source_text'=>'Ada cawan-cawan kecil comel macam ni.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>932.64,'end_time'=>934.22,'target_text'=>'This costs 65,000.','source_text'=>'Yang ini berharga 65,000 dong.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>934.32,'end_time'=>936.98,'target_text'=>'Now, I like how every cup has a design.','source_text'=>'Saya suka bila setiap cawan ada corak lukisan tersendiri.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>937.08,'end_time'=>938.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s really very cute.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat comel.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>938.56,'end_time'=>940.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, here are some proper mugs.','source_text'=>'Oh, kat sini ada cawan mug bertangkai yang elok.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>940.72,'end_time'=>941.3,'target_text'=>'Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>941.4,'end_time'=>942.1,'target_text'=>'Some mugs.','source_text'=>'Beberapa cawan mug.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>942.2,'end_time'=>944.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s really nice.','source_text'=>'Cantik sangat buatannya.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>944.32,'end_time'=>950.26,'target_text'=>'These ones are nice, but they\'re more heavy duty, thicker compared to those ones there that\'s Let me grab one.','source_text'=>'Yang ni cantik, tapi buatannya lebih lasak dan tebal berbanding yang kat sana... Biar saya ambil satu.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>950.36,'end_time'=>951.46,'target_text'=>'That\'s more delicate.','source_text'=>'Yang itu lebih nipis dan halus.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>951.56,'end_time'=>956.02,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this right here is quite thin, but this one is a lot thicker and heavy duty.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ini agak nipis, tapi yang satu ni jauh lebih tebal dan tahan lasak.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>956.12,'end_time'=>958.06,'target_text'=>'This one doesn\'t have any like handle.','source_text'=>'Yang ini langsung takde tangkai pemegang.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>958.16,'end_time'=>959.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s just like a cup.','source_text'=>'Ia macam cawan biasa (cup).','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>959.48,'end_time'=>959.68,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>959.68,'end_time'=>960.74,'target_text'=>'But they do have mugs, too.','source_text'=>'Tapi diorang ada jual mug bertangkai juga.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>960.84,'end_time'=>962.18,'target_text'=>'Do you like this store?','source_text'=>'Mak suka kedai ni?','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>962.28,'end_time'=>962.7,'target_text'=>'I like it.','source_text'=>'Mak suka.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>962.8,'end_time'=>968.86,'target_text'=>'I wish it was easier to transport ceramics, but it\'s it\'s a hard souvenir to buy and to take with.','source_text'=>'Kalaulah barang seramik ni senang nak bawa balik, tapi seramik ni cenderahati yang susah nak beli dan bawa dalam beg.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>968.96,'end_time'=>970.74,'target_text'=>'>> Because it\'s very fragile.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab ia sangat mudah pecah (fragile).','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>970.84,'end_time'=>971.78,'target_text'=>'Very fragile.','source_text'=>'Sangat rapuh dan mudah pecah.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>971.88,'end_time'=>974.42,'target_text'=>'Like, these plates can easily break.','source_text'=>'Macam pinggan-pinggan ni boleh pecah dengan mudah.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>974.52,'end_time'=>975.14,'target_text'=>'I can feel them.','source_text'=>'Bila pegang memang boleh rasa.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>975.24,'end_time'=>980.34,'target_text'=>'They are quite thin and they just feel very fragile, so they can break easily, right?','source_text'=>'Pinggannya agak nipis dan rasa sangat rapuh, jadi ia senang pecah kan?','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>980.44,'end_time'=>981.02,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>981.12,'end_time'=>982.3,'target_text'=>'So, you can\'t travel with them.','source_text'=>'Jadi susah nak bawa melancong jauh.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>982.4,'end_time'=>983.22,'target_text'=>'This one\'s nice, too.','source_text'=>'Yang ini pun cantik juga.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>983.32,'end_time'=>984.22,'target_text'=>'I wonder if they made this.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya diorang buat sendiri ke benda ni.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>984.32,'end_time'=>984.86,'target_text'=>'Probably.','source_text'=>'Kemungkinan besar ya.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>984.96,'end_time'=>986.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, you can also go upstairs.','source_text'=>'Oh, kita boleh naik ke tingkat atas juga.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>986.28,'end_time'=>987.78,'target_text'=>'I see someone going up the stairs there.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak ada orang naik tangga ke atas tu.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>987.88,'end_time'=>988.38,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita naik.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>988.48,'end_time'=>989.06,'target_text'=>'Go and have a look.','source_text'=>'Pergi tengok apa ada kat atas.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>989.16,'end_time'=>992.46,'target_text'=>'>> they have just a sofa for you to chill after looking at all of this.','source_text'=>'>> diorang sediakan sofa untuk korang rehat santai lepas puas tengok semua barang ni.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>992.56,'end_time'=>993.86,'target_text'=>'I like this one.','source_text'=>'Saya suka yang ini.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>993.96,'end_time'=>994.74,'target_text'=>'This one\'s pretty cool.','source_text'=>'Yang ini nampak sangat menarik.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>994.84,'end_time'=>999.3,'target_text'=>'But they just have shelves and shelves and walls of these.','source_text'=>'Tapi rak dan dinding kedai ni memang penuh dengan barang-barang ni.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>999.4,'end_time'=>1002.14,'target_text'=>'So, these are really uh good souvenirs to buy.','source_text'=>'Benda-benda ni memang cenderahati yang sangat bagus untuk dibeli.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1002.24,'end_time'=>1006.02,'target_text'=>'They\'re coasters and these ones would be easier to to transport.','source_text'=>'Ini pelapik cawan (coasters) dan yang ni lebih mudah untuk dibawa pulang.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1006.12,'end_time'=>1007.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, cuz they\'re flat, right?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab bentuknya leper, kan?','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1007.36,'end_time'=>1007.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1007.88,'end_time'=>1008.98,'target_text'=>'They are flat.','source_text'=>'Bentuknya leper dan rata.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1009.08,'end_time'=>1010.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go upstairs.','source_text'=>'Jom kita naik ke tingkat atas.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1010.16,'end_time'=>1011.18,'target_text'=>'Yes, let\'s do it.','source_text'=>'Jom, mari kita naik.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1011.28,'end_time'=>1013.86,'target_text'=>'And you can see here, it just goes keeps on going.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh lihat kat sini, ruang kedainya bersambung-sambung tak habis-habis.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1013.96,'end_time'=>1015.06,'target_text'=>'And there\'s another room over there.','source_text'=>'Dan ada satu lagi bilik kat sebelah sana.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1015.16,'end_time'=>1016.94,'target_text'=>'There\'s just so much.','source_text'=>'Banyak sangat pilihan barang.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1017.04,'end_time'=>1017.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s got chickens on it.','source_text'=>'Ada gambar corak ayam padanya.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1017.96,'end_time'=>1018.32,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1018.32,'end_time'=>1020.06,'target_text'=>'This is huge.','source_text'=>'Besar betul bekas ni.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1020.16,'end_time'=>1020.9,'target_text'=>'So big.','source_text'=>'Besar sangat.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1021,'end_time'=>1021.78,'target_text'=>'You should take that one.','source_text'=>'Mak patut beli yang itu.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1021.88,'end_time'=>1022.62,'target_text'=>'I like that.','source_text'=>'Mak suka yang tu.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1022.72,'end_time'=>1023.58,'target_text'=>'I like it big.','source_text'=>'Mak suka saiz besar.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1023.68,'end_time'=>1025.34,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think it\'ll fit in your suitcase.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tak muat nak masuk dalam beg pakaian Mak.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1025.44,'end_time'=>1027.34,'target_text'=>'No, probably have to wear it as a hat.','source_text'=>'Memang tak muat, silap-silap kena pakai atas kepala jadi topi.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1027.44,'end_time'=>1027.94,'target_text'=>'And let\'s go up.','source_text'=>'Dan jom kita naik ke atas.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1028.04,'end_time'=>1028.86,'target_text'=>'>> upstairs.','source_text'=>'>> ke tingkat atas.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1028.96,'end_time'=>1032.42,'target_text'=>'So, now we\'re on the second floor and there\'s just a lot more.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di tingkat dua dan ada lebih banyak lagi barangan di sini.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1032.52,'end_time'=>1036.06,'target_text'=>'Dude, I wonder how many years it took to make all of this.','source_text'=>'Weh, aku tertanya-tanya berapa tahun masa diambil untuk buat semua tembikar ni.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1036.16,'end_time'=>1038.46,'target_text'=>'This probably took like dozens of years, no?','source_text'=>'Mungkin ambil masa berpuluh tahun kan?','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1038.56,'end_time'=>1040.06,'target_text'=>'You You can show here in the back.','source_text'=>'Kamu boleh tunjuk cop di bahagian belakang ni.','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1040.16,'end_time'=>1042.5,'target_text'=>'It does say it\'s made in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Tertulis jelas ia buatan Vietnam (made in Vietnam).','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1042.6,'end_time'=>1043.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, that\'s nice.','source_text'=>'Oh, baguslah macam tu.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1043.36,'end_time'=>1044.38,'target_text'=>'Yeah, on all of them.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada pada setiap satu barang.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1044.48,'end_time'=>1047.02,'target_text'=>'Anyway, this shop is absolutely massive.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kedai ni memang sangat luas dan besar.','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1047.12,'end_time'=>1052.18,'target_text'=>'So, the material all the stuff here is made out of is called ceramic.','source_text'=>'Jadi, bahan yang digunakan untuk buat semua barang ini dipanggil seramik.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1052.28,'end_time'=>1054.9,'target_text'=>'So, the material is called ceramic.','source_text'=>'Bahan buatannya dipanggil seramik (ceramic).','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1055,'end_time'=>1057.7,'target_text'=>'So, these are all ceramic mugs.','source_text'=>'Jadi, semua ini adalah mug seramik.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1057.8,'end_time'=>1058.7,'target_text'=>'I want to show you this.','source_text'=>'Saya nak tunjuk benda ni kepada korang.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1058.8,'end_time'=>1061.5,'target_text'=>'So, here I found this one in Spanish.','source_text'=>'Kat sini saya jumpa satu perkataan dalam bahasa Sepanyol.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1061.6,'end_time'=>1066.9,'target_text'=>'It says, \"Una dulce manera de cambiar el mundo.\" A sweet way to change the world.','source_text'=>'Tertulis, \"Una dulce manera de cambiar el mundo,\" maksudnya satu cara yang manis untuk mengubah dunia.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1067,'end_time'=>1067.5,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1067.6,'end_time'=>1068.26,'target_text'=>'Isn\'t that weird?','source_text'=>'Pelik juga kan ada bahasa Sepanyol kat sini?','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1068.36,'end_time'=>1072.42,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I guess you put like some sort of sweet snack on there or your tea or something.','source_text'=>'Ya, rasanya pinggan ni untuk letak manisan atau hidangan teh korang.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1072.52,'end_time'=>1073.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this really cute.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, yang ini sangat comel.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1073.76,'end_time'=>1081.46,'target_text'=>'>> If you want to speak English more clearly and naturally, then join my speaking and pronunciation course.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau korang nak bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih jelas dan semula jadi, sertailah kursus sebutan dan pertuturan saya.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1081.56,'end_time'=>1091.22,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to almost 100 video lessons with two new lessons every week, a clear step-by-step practice system,','source_text'=>'Korang dapat akses terus kepada hampir 100 pelajaran video dengan dua pelajaran baharu setiap minggu, sistem latihan langkah demi langkah yang jelas,','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1091.32,'end_time'=>1097.34,'target_text'=>'and an exclusive prompt to help you master the pronunciation of any word.','source_text'=>'serta prompt eksklusif untuk bantu korang kuasai sebutan apa jua perkataan.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1097.44,'end_time'=>1103.3,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Dalam kursus ini, kita akan asah sebutan, aksen, ritma, dan gaya pertuturan secara santai dan semula jadi.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1103.4,'end_time'=>1108.1,'target_text'=>'So, you can stop hesitating and speak with more confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya korang tak ragu-ragu lagi dan boleh bercakap dengan lebih yakin.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1108.2,'end_time'=>1111.9,'target_text'=>'So, everything we\'ve seen here has been made of ceramic.','source_text'=>'Jadi, semua yang kita lihat di sini diperbuat daripada seramik.','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1112,'end_time'=>1117.06,'target_text'=>'This is a ceramic store and they make everything here or at least almost everything.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kedai seramik dan mereka hasilkan semua barang di sini, atau sekurang-kurangnya hampir segalanya.','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1117.16,'end_time'=>1117.78,'target_text'=>'Really beautiful.','source_text'=>'Sangat cantik buatannya.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1117.88,'end_time'=>1120.58,'target_text'=>'I really want to buy one of these mugs before I leave Hanoi.','source_text'=>'Saya teringin sangat nak beli salah satu mug ni sebelum saya tinggalkan Hanoi.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1120.68,'end_time'=>1121.86,'target_text'=>'I think I definitely will.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa saya pasti akan beli satu nanti.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1121.96,'end_time'=>1123.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, Mom, you ready to go?','source_text'=>'Okey, Mak, dah sedia nak gerak?','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1123.12,'end_time'=>1123.86,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1123.96,'end_time'=>1125.02,'target_text'=>'Yes, I\'m ready.','source_text'=>'Ya, Mak dah bersedia.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1125.12,'end_time'=>1128.7,'target_text'=>'So, what do you think of your first full day exploring Vietnam?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa pendapat Mak tentang hari pertama penuh Mak meneroka Vietnam?','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1128.8,'end_time'=>1129.58,'target_text'=>'I loved it.','source_text'=>'Mak suka sangat.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1129.68,'end_time'=>1130.86,'target_text'=>'I think I could live here.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa Mak boleh menetap terus di sini.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1130.96,'end_time'=>1132.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s cheap.','source_text'=>'Kos hidup murah.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1132.72,'end_time'=>1133.54,'target_text'=>'It is cheap.','source_text'=>'Memang murah harganya.','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1133.64,'end_time'=>1135.78,'target_text'=>'I should say cheaper than Canada.','source_text'=>'Mak patut kata jauh lebih murah berbanding Kanada.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1135.88,'end_time'=>1138.98,'target_text'=>'So, your dollar goes further and the food is great.','source_text'=>'Jadi nilai mata wang lebih berbaloi dan makanannya sangat sedap.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1139.08,'end_time'=>1139.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s fresh.','source_text'=>'Bahan-bahannya segar.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1139.92,'end_time'=>1141.7,'target_text'=>'The coffee is excellent.','source_text'=>'Kopinya luar biasa sedap.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1141.8,'end_time'=>1142.78,'target_text'=>'>> Food is amazing.','source_text'=>'>> Makanannya memang luar biasa.','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1142.88,'end_time'=>1146.02,'target_text'=>'I don\'t really drink coffee, but I know like people like you love coffee.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa minum kopi, tapi saya tahu orang macam Mak memang gilakan kopi.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1146.12,'end_time'=>1146.74,'target_text'=>'>> coffee.','source_text'=>'>> sangat sukakan kopi.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1146.84,'end_time'=>1147.7,'target_text'=>'They love coffee.','source_text'=>'Mereka sukakan kopi.','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1147.8,'end_time'=>1148.16,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1148.16,'end_time'=>1148.58,'target_text'=>'What else?','source_text'=>'Apa lagi yang menarik?','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1148.68,'end_time'=>1153.9,'target_text'=>'I think the people are really um humble and kind and genuine.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa penduduk di sini sangat merendah diri, baik hati, dan ikhlas.','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1154,'end_time'=>1155.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s true.','source_text'=>'Itu memang betul.','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1155.36,'end_time'=>1155.9,'target_text'=>'So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya.','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1156,'end_time'=>1158.38,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s a great destination to come and visit.','source_text'=>'Mak rasa ini destinasi yang sangat hebat untuk datang melancong.','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>1158.48,'end_time'=>1161.34,'target_text'=>'Price, food, {slash} coffee, and people.','source_text'=>'Dari segi harga, makanan, kopi, dan layanan orangnya.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>1161.44,'end_time'=>1162.98,'target_text'=>'I really like Vietnam, too.','source_text'=>'Saya pun memang sangat sukakan Vietnam.','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>1163.08,'end_time'=>1164.86,'target_text'=>'We will be filming [music] a lot more videos here.','source_text'=>'Kita akan rakam [muzik] lebih banyak lagi video di sini.','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>1164.96,'end_time'=>1168.7,'target_text'=>'So, if you guys want to see those videos, make sure to subscribe and check out the next videos.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau korang nak tonton video-video tu, pastikan tekan butang subscribe dan tonton video seterusnya.','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>1168.8,'end_time'=>1176.1,'target_text'=>'We\'ll be spending a couple days in Hanoi and then we\'re going to Halong Bay, Ninh Binh, and a bunch of other places, including','source_text'=>'Kami akan luangkan masa beberapa hari di Hanoi dan kemudian pergi ke Halong Bay, Ninh Binh, dan banyak lagi tempat lain, termasuklah','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>1176.2,'end_time'=>1177.58,'target_text'=>'Saigon again.','source_text'=>'bandar Saigon sekali lagi.','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>1177.68,'end_time'=>1178.58,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s get going.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>501],
