        foreach ([
            ['start_time'=>0,'end_time'=>1.38,'target_text'=>'Welcome back to new video, guys.','source_text'=>'Selamat kembali ke video baharu, semua.','order'=>1],
            ['start_time'=>1.48,'end_time'=>7.86,'target_text'=>'Today, I\'m with my friend from Canada and we\'re going to be learning English using comprehensible input here at the Chiang','source_text'=>'Hari ini, saya bersama rakan saya dari Kanada dan kita akan belajar bahasa Inggeris menggunakan kaedah \'comprehensible input\' di Chiang','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>7.96,'end_time'=>10.04,'target_text'=>'Mai Zoo.','source_text'=>'Mai Zoo.','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>19.24,'end_time'=>20.78,'target_text'=>'>> Hey guys, my name is Apton.','source_text'=>'>> Hai semua, nama saya Apton.','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>20.88,'end_time'=>22.7,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m friends with Walker through university.','source_text'=>'Saya berkawan dengan Walker sejak zaman universiti.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>22.8,'end_time'=>25.22,'target_text'=>'We both studied business at UVA.','source_text'=>'Kami berdua belajar jurusan perniagaan di UVA.','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>25.32,'end_time'=>26.82,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m just traveling Thailand right now.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya sedang melancong di Thailand.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>26.92,'end_time'=>33.06,'target_text'=>'Just recently graduated, so traveling Asia for a little bit and then we decided to link up here and we\'ve been traveling together','source_text'=>'Baru saja tamat pengajian, jadi saya jelajah Asia sekejap lepas tu kami buat keputusan untuk berjumpa di sini dan melancong bersama','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>33.16,'end_time'=>37.2,'target_text'=>'for a week, but sadly this is the last day.','source_text'=>'selama seminggu, tapi sayangnya hari ini hari terakhir.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>39.6,'end_time'=>42.9,'target_text'=>'So, I think the zoo is going to be our last stop, but yeah, we\'ll see how it goes.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa zoo ni akan jadi hentian terakhir kami, apa-apa pun tengoklah macam mana nanti.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>43,'end_time'=>44.02,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to check it out now.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teroka zoo ni sekarang.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>44.12,'end_time'=>45.26,'target_text'=>'>> Where are you from, Apton?','source_text'=>'>> Awak asal dari mana, Apton?','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>45.36,'end_time'=>49.58,'target_text'=>'>> So, I was born in Iran, went to school there, but then moved to Canada for university.','source_text'=>'>> Saya dilahirkan di Iran, bersekolah di sana, tapi berpindah ke Kanada untuk sambung universiti.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>49.68,'end_time'=>52.1,'target_text'=>'So, I\'ve been living there for maybe 7 years now.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya dah menetap di sana lebih kurang 7 tahun sekarang.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>52.2,'end_time'=>55.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I met Apton second year of uni is when I met Apton.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya kenal Apton masa tahun kedua universiti.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>55.52,'end_time'=>58.02,'target_text'=>'That was like 5 6 years ago.','source_text'=>'Itu sekitar 5 atau 6 tahun yang lalu.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>58.12,'end_time'=>60.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, and then we\'ve been friends ever since.','source_text'=>'Ya, dan kami berkawan rapat sejak dari hari itu.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>60.16,'end_time'=>62.38,'target_text'=>'And now he came to Thailand, so we met up here.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang dia datang ke Thailand, jadi kami berjumpa di sini.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>62.48,'end_time'=>69.22,'target_text'=>'Also, you guys know I was an exchange student at Yonsei in Korea and he was also an exchange student after I went.','source_text'=>'Korang pun tahu saya pernah jadi pelajar pertukaran di Universiti Yonsei di Korea dan dia pun jadi pelajar pertukaran kat sana lepas saya.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>69.32,'end_time'=>70.46,'target_text'=>'What was your experience like?','source_text'=>'Macam mana pengalaman awak kat sana?','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>70.56,'end_time'=>71.82,'target_text'=>'>> I loved it.','source_text'=>'>> Saya suka sangat pengalaman kat sana.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>71.92,'end_time'=>78.54,'target_text'=>'I did one exchange before that in France to experience Europe, but the one I did in Seoul at Yonsei was just a thousand times','source_text'=>'Sebelum tu saya pernah buat program pertukaran di Perancis untuk merasa hidup di Eropah, tapi program di Seoul di Yonsei seribu kali ganda','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>78.64,'end_time'=>80.94,'target_text'=>'better than the experience I had in France.','source_text'=>'jauh lebih baik berbanding pengalaman saya di Perancis.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>81.04,'end_time'=>87.62,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, if anyone out there is looking to do any exchanges, I would definitely recommend somewhere in Asia, especially Korea','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, kalau ada sesiapa di luar sana nak sertai program pertukaran pelajar, saya sangat syorkan tempat di Asia, terutamanya Korea','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>87.72,'end_time'=>89.5,'target_text'=>'if you\'re looking at different options right now.','source_text'=>'kalau korang tengah cari pelbagai pilihan sekarang.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>89.6,'end_time'=>90.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul sangat.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>90.36,'end_time'=>97.34,'target_text'=>'We both went to Yonsei and we both love South Korea and it was just a lot of fun, but now let\'s go and head into the zoo and','source_text'=>'Kami berdua pernah ke Yonsei dan kami berdua cintakan Korea Selatan dan kenangannya sangat seronok, tapi sekarang jom kita masuk ke zoo dan','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>97.44,'end_time'=>98.18,'target_text'=>'explore.','source_text'=>'mula meneroka.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>98.28,'end_time'=>98.82,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>98.92,'end_time'=>104.86,'target_text'=>'You can see here with the Chiang Mai Zoo and they have a panda there as their kind of like entrance logo, but they don\'t have','source_text'=>'Korang boleh lihat di sini Chiang Mai Zoo dan ada gambar panda sebagai logo di pintu masuk, tapi diorang takde','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>104.96,'end_time'=>105.86,'target_text'=>'pandas here today.','source_text'=>'belaan panda di sini hari ini.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>105.96,'end_time'=>113.3,'target_text'=>'The lady at the front where we bought our tickets, she told us that they don\'t have pandas because the panda died, unfortunately.','source_text'=>'Pekerja wanita di kaunter tiket tadi beritahu kami diorang takde panda sebab pandanya dah mati, sayangnya.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>113.4,'end_time'=>115.66,'target_text'=>'It was a mother panda, a female.','source_text'=>'Ia seekor ibu panda, panda betina.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>115.76,'end_time'=>121.66,'target_text'=>'So, the mom died and then they sent the baby back to China, Chengdu, with the other pandas cuz I guess it was here alone.','source_text'=>'Bila ibunya mati, diorang hantar anaknya pulang ke Chengdu di China bersama panda-panda lain sebab ia tinggal sendirian kat sini.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>121.76,'end_time'=>125.98,'target_text'=>'So, unfortunately, today no pandas, but everything else is here, so let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jadi sayangnya hari ini takde panda, tapi haiwan lain semuanya ada, jom kita gerak.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>126.08,'end_time'=>127.62,'target_text'=>'I got a question for you, Apton.','source_text'=>'Saya ada soalan untuk awak, Apton.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>127.72,'end_time'=>131.06,'target_text'=>'What animal are you most excited to see today?','source_text'=>'Haiwan apa yang awak paling teruja nak tengok hari ini?','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>131.16,'end_time'=>141.02,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and start learning the words that will allow you to understand up to 95% of everyday','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya dan mula belajar perkataan yang membolehkan korang faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>141.12,'end_time'=>141.78,'target_text'=>'English.','source_text'=>'bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>141.88,'end_time'=>150.14,'target_text'=>'It includes clear definitions, real examples, and simple organization by topic and CEFR','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi maksud yang jelas, contoh sebenar, dan susunan mudah mengikut topik serta tahap CEFR','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>150.24,'end_time'=>150.98,'target_text'=>'level.','source_text'=>'tahap penguasaan.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>151.08,'end_time'=>154.7,'target_text'=>'Get it in the description or at vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Dapatkannya di ruangan deskripsi atau di vulcaenglish.com.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>154.8,'end_time'=>157.86,'target_text'=>'>> I would say I\'m most excited to see the polar bears.','source_text'=>'>> Saya paling teruja nak tengok beruang kutub (polar bear).','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>157.96,'end_time'=>160.66,'target_text'=>'>> The animal I\'m most excited to see is definitely the rhino.','source_text'=>'>> Haiwan yang saya paling teruja nak tengok sudah semestinya badak sumbu (rhino).','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>160.76,'end_time'=>163.58,'target_text'=>'Like, I know I\'ve seen it already, but it\'s just such a cool animal.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu saya dah pernah tengok, tapi ia haiwan yang sangat gempak.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>163.68,'end_time'=>165.46,'target_text'=>'When you see it, you\'ll know what I mean.','source_text'=>'Bila awak nampak sendiri nanti, baru awak faham maksud saya.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>165.56,'end_time'=>170.46,'target_text'=>'But, apparently, this zoo is like super big, so it\'s kind of going to be a little bit of a hike today, a little bit of a workout,','source_text'=>'Tapi nampaknya zoo ni luas gila, jadi kita macam kena mendaki sikit hari ini dan bersenam sikit,','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>170.56,'end_time'=>171.82,'target_text'=>'but that\'s okay.','source_text'=>'tapi takpe.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>171.92,'end_time'=>173.18,'target_text'=>'You need some exercise, don\'t you?','source_text'=>'Awak pun perlukan senaman juga, kan?','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>173.28,'end_time'=>176.9,'target_text'=>'>> I definitely need all that cookies that you\'ve been feeding me.','source_text'=>'>> Saya memang perlukan senaman lepas semua biskut yang awak suruh saya makan tu.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>177,'end_time'=>182,'target_text'=>'But, no, I think the guy who\'s most excited to walk is the guy with the camera.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebenarnya orang yang paling teruja nak berjalan ialah orang yang pegang kamera tu.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>182.28,'end_time'=>184.1,'target_text'=>'>> Looks like there are baby hippos, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Nampaknya ada anak badak air (baby hippo), weh.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>184.2,'end_time'=>185.22,'target_text'=>'150 m.','source_text'=>'Lagi 150 meter.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>185.32,'end_time'=>187.26,'target_text'=>'>> Do you remember that hippo that went viral?','source_text'=>'>> Awak ingat tak badak air yang viral tempoh hari?','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>187.36,'end_time'=>187.9,'target_text'=>'>> Which one?','source_text'=>'>> Yang mana satu?','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>188,'end_time'=>189.18,'target_text'=>'>> The Thai Tik Tok.','source_text'=>'>> Yang kat TikTok Thailand tu.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>189.28,'end_time'=>190.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s called Moodeng.','source_text'=>'Nama dia Moo Deng.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>190.4,'end_time'=>192.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a baby hippo, like it\'s one of those pygmy hippos.','source_text'=>'Anak badak air comel, jenis badak air kerdil (pygmy hippo).','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>192.84,'end_time'=>194.22,'target_text'=>'>> I I\'ve never seen that.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak pernah tengok pula.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>194.32,'end_time'=>197.02,'target_text'=>'>> The only famous animal I remember is Harambe.','source_text'=>'>> Satu-satunya haiwan terkenal yang saya ingat adalah Harambe.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>197.12,'end_time'=>198.54,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah, Harambe.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya, Harambe.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>198.64,'end_time'=>200.58,'target_text'=>'Harambe was like this gorilla.','source_text'=>'Harambe tu gorila jantan yang terkenal dulu.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>200.68,'end_time'=>204.82,'target_text'=>'I believe Harambe was a silverback gorilla in like 2015, 2016.','source_text'=>'Rasa saya Harambe tu gorila \'silverback\' sekitar tahun 2015 atau 2016.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>204.92,'end_time'=>206.54,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually a pretty sad story about Harambe.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya kisah Harambe tu agak menyedihkan.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>206.64,'end_time'=>207.78,'target_text'=>'I\'ll just tell it to you quickly.','source_text'=>'Biar saya ceritakan seringkasnya kepada awak.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>207.88,'end_time'=>214.7,'target_text'=>'There was a little kid that fell into the gorilla enclosure, and then Harambe, which was the silverback gorilla\'s name, took','source_text'=>'Ada seorang budak kecil terjatuh ke dalam kandang gorila, lepas tu Harambe, iaitu nama gorila silverback tu, mendekati','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>214.8,'end_time'=>217.98,'target_text'=>'the little kid and was like kind of like petting him, playing with him, I believe.','source_text'=>'budak kecil tu dan macam usap-usap serta main dengannya, rasa saya.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>218.08,'end_time'=>220.46,'target_text'=>'And yeah, like the kid wasn\'t really hurt bad.','source_text'=>'Dan budak tu sebenarnya tak cedera parah pun.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>220.56,'end_time'=>224.26,'target_text'=>'The kid didn\'t die, but they ended up putting down the silverback gorilla.','source_text'=>'Budak tu tak mati, tapi akhirnya pihak zoo tembak mati gorila silverback tu.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>224.36,'end_time'=>227.82,'target_text'=>'That just means they ended up the silverback gorilla because of that.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya diorang hapuskan gorila silverback tu disebabkan insiden berkenaan.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>227.92,'end_time'=>229.62,'target_text'=>'And a lot of people were mad and upset.','source_text'=>'Dan ramai orang berasa sangat marah dan kecewa.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>229.72,'end_time'=>231.78,'target_text'=>'They were mad at the parents for not watching their kid.','source_text'=>'Diorang marah kat ibu bapa sebab tak pantau anak diorang.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>231.88,'end_time'=>234.42,'target_text'=>'They were mad at the zoo for, you know, killing this animal.','source_text'=>'Diorang marah kat pihak zoo sebab bunuh haiwan yang tak bersalah tu.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>234.52,'end_time'=>236.82,'target_text'=>'So, it was pretty sad, but RIP Harambe.','source_text'=>'Jadi kisahnya memang sedih, tapi moga tenanglah Harambe.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>236.92,'end_time'=>239.78,'target_text'=>'It was a huge It became like a huge meme and huge everything.','source_text'=>'Ia jadi fenomena besar, jadi meme yang sangat terkenal di seluruh dunia.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>239.88,'end_time'=>241.78,'target_text'=>'But, here we have uh flamingos.','source_text'=>'Tapi, kat sini kita ada burung flamingo.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>241.88,'end_time'=>242.86,'target_text'=>'They\'re supposed to be pink.','source_text'=>'Bulu diorang sepatutnya warna merah jambu (pink).','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>242.96,'end_time'=>245.3,'target_text'=>'I learned this when I was in uh the Galapagos Islands.','source_text'=>'Saya belajar fakta ni masa saya pergi ke Kepulauan Galapagos.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>245.4,'end_time'=>249.06,'target_text'=>'You want to know why they\'re pink and why these ones currently aren\'t pink?','source_text'=>'Awak nak tahu kenapa flamingo berwarna merah jambu dan kenapa yang kat sini tak berapa merah jambu sekarang?','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>249.16,'end_time'=>250.1,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, I have no idea.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya, saya tak tahu langsung.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>250.2,'end_time'=>250.66,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tak tahu.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>250.76,'end_time'=>255.82,'target_text'=>'>> These ones are like kind of pink, but the reason pink flamingos get so pink is because of their diet.','source_text'=>'>> Yang kat sini warna pink pudar, tapi sebab flamingo jadi merah jambu pekat adalah kerana diet makanan mereka.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>255.92,'end_time'=>262.62,'target_text'=>'They eat like these very tiny like shrimp that have this like certain uh certain thing in them like the certain type of pigmentation','source_text'=>'Diorang makan udang kecil halus yang mengandungi sejenis bahan tertentu iaitu pigmen khas','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>262.72,'end_time'=>263.7,'target_text'=>'that I forget what it\'s called.','source_text'=>'yang saya lupa apa namanya.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>263.8,'end_time'=>268.02,'target_text'=>'Like if I get the actual name, I\'ll put it on screen, but they eat that and it turns them like pink.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya dapat nama saintifiknya, saya akan letak kat skrin, tapi diorang makan udang tu dan bulu bertukar jadi merah jambu.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>268.12,'end_time'=>269.94,'target_text'=>'And the more they eat it, it turns them pink.','source_text'=>'Dan makin banyak diorang makan, makin merah jambulah bulu diorang.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>270.04,'end_time'=>271.18,'target_text'=>'And uh that\'s why they\'re pink.','source_text'=>'Dan itulah sebabnya warna diorang merah jambu.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>271.28,'end_time'=>274.42,'target_text'=>'And that\'s why these ones probably aren\'t too pink because they don\'t have the same diet.','source_text'=>'Dan sebab itulah yang kat sini tak berapa merah jambu sebab diet makanannya berbeza.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>274.52,'end_time'=>278.46,'target_text'=>'And those shrimp live in like the shallow water that they swim in.','source_text'=>'Dan udang-udang tu hidup di perairan cetek tempat diorang berenang.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>278.56,'end_time'=>279.94,'target_text'=>'And in the mud, that\'s why they get it.','source_text'=>'Dan di dalam lumpur, sebab tulah flamingo mudah dapat udang tu.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>280.04,'end_time'=>283.94,'target_text'=>'And uh when I was in Galapagos, our guide >> Maybe you should say where where that island is.','source_text'=>'Dan masa saya di Galapagos, jurupandu kami... >> Mungkin awak patut beritahu kat mana pulau tu berada.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>284.04,'end_time'=>287.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the the Galapagos is like a archipelago, uh part of uh Ecuador.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, Galapagos tu adalah kepulauan arkipelaga, sebahagian daripada negara Ecuador.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>288.04,'end_time'=>289.3,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s off the coast of Ecuador.','source_text'=>'Terletak di luar pesisir pantai Ecuador.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>289.4,'end_time'=>293.18,'target_text'=>'And it\'s like people say one of the most like beautiful and natural places in the world.','source_text'=>'Dan ramai orang anggap ia salah satu tempat paling indah dan alami di dunia.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>293.28,'end_time'=>294.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s really like preserved in time.','source_text'=>'Alam sekitarnya terpelihara asli sejak zaman purba.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>295,'end_time'=>299.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s a really cool place to see because the islands are like so young and still getting formed.','source_text'=>'Tempat yang sangat hebat untuk dilawati sebab pulau-pulaunya masih muda dan proses pembentukannya berterusan.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>299.44,'end_time'=>302.26,'target_text'=>'So, a lot of the islands are just like volcanic rock.','source_text'=>'Jadi banyak pulau di sana hanya dipenuhi batu gunung berapi.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>302.36,'end_time'=>306.02,'target_text'=>'Like I saw some islands that the whole island is just like volcanic rock.','source_text'=>'Saya tengok ada pulau yang keseluruhannya cuma batu lava gunung berapi.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>306.12,'end_time'=>306.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s crazy.','source_text'=>'Luar biasa unik.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>306.84,'end_time'=>310.1,'target_text'=>'But, let\'s continue on to the baby hippos.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita teruskan perjalanan ke kandang anak badak air.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>310.2,'end_time'=>313.18,'target_text'=>'If you can be any animal for a day, what would you be?','source_text'=>'Kalau awak boleh jadi seekor haiwan selama sehari, awak nak jadi haiwan apa?','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>313.28,'end_time'=>314.02,'target_text'=>'Which animal?','source_text'=>'Haiwan mana satu?','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>314.12,'end_time'=>315.5,'target_text'=>'>> I would be a panda.','source_text'=>'>> Saya nak jadi panda.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>315.6,'end_time'=>317.22,'target_text'=>'No, honestly, probably a bird.','source_text'=>'Taklah, sejujurnya mungkin seekor burung.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>317.32,'end_time'=>318.14,'target_text'=>'I love flying.','source_text'=>'Saya suka terbang.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>318.24,'end_time'=>319.26,'target_text'=>'I love being in the skies.','source_text'=>'Saya suka berada di angkasa.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>319.36,'end_time'=>321.66,'target_text'=>'When I see an airplane, I just go like that.','source_text'=>'Bila saya nampak kapal terbang, saya terpegun tengok ke langit.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>321.76,'end_time'=>326.1,'target_text'=>'Maybe an eagle, so I could fly off the mountains, the lakes, get that feeling.','source_text'=>'Mungkin helang, jadi saya boleh terbang melintasi gunung-ganang, tasik, dan rasa kebebasan tu.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>326.2,'end_time'=>327.7,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, I would choose that.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, saya akan pilih burung helang.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>327.8,'end_time'=>328.94,'target_text'=>'>> I was going to say something similar.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pun baru nak jawab benda yang serupa.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>329.04,'end_time'=>330.9,'target_text'=>'I would either be a bird or a fish.','source_text'=>'Saya sama ada nak jadi burung atau seekor ikan.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>331,'end_time'=>331.7,'target_text'=>'>> Why a fish?','source_text'=>'>> Kenapa ikan?','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>331.8,'end_time'=>332.9,'target_text'=>'>> Cuz a fish is like the same thing.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab ikan pun konsepnya sama.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>333,'end_time'=>337.5,'target_text'=>'Like any land animal is kind of boring cuz you can experience that as a human.','source_text'=>'Haiwan darat ni macam bosan sikit sebab kita dah boleh rasa pengalaman di darat sebagai manusia.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>337.6,'end_time'=>341.42,'target_text'=>'But, a fish, like imagine being like a deep underwater fish and just swimming.','source_text'=>'Tapi ikan, bayangkan hidup di dasar laut dalam dan berenang bebas.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>341.52,'end_time'=>344.82,'target_text'=>'But, also, you could kind of swim as a human and you could go scuba diving.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebagai manusia kita boleh juga berenang dan buat aktiviti selam skuba.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>344.92,'end_time'=>348.74,'target_text'=>'But, flying, I think flying is like Yeah, you could paragliding or paraskiing.','source_text'=>'Tapi terbang, saya rasa terbang ni lain macam... Ya, manusia boleh luncur udara atau ski payung terjun.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>348.84,'end_time'=>350.94,'target_text'=>'>> you\'re a Red Bull guy, you can\'t really do that, so.','source_text'=>'>> Melainkan awak atlet Red Bull, awak tak boleh buat benda tu setiap hari.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>351.04,'end_time'=>356.98,'target_text'=>'>> so I think I would also be a bird, and I would just be whatever the bird is that could fly the highest, fastest, and strongest,','source_text'=>'>> Jadi saya rasa saya pun nak jadi burung, dan saya nak jadi burung yang boleh terbang paling tinggi, paling laju, dan paling kuat,','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>357.08,'end_time'=>357.94,'target_text'=>'which I think is an eagle.','source_text'=>'yang mana saya rasa burung helang.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>358.04,'end_time'=>359.1,'target_text'=>'>> the Canadian Rockies.','source_text'=>'>> helang di pergunungan Canadian Rockies.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>359.2,'end_time'=>360.5,'target_text'=>'>> No, it\'s the falcon.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, burung falkon (falcon).','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>360.6,'end_time'=>361,'target_text'=>'>> Falcon?','source_text'=>'>> Falkon?','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>361.08,'end_time'=>362.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, falcon.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, burung falkon.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>362.24,'end_time'=>365.22,'target_text'=>'>> What would you guys be if you could be any animal for a day?','source_text'=>'>> Korang pula nak jadi haiwan apa kalau boleh jadi haiwan selama sehari?','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>365.32,'end_time'=>366.38,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>366.48,'end_time'=>367.5,'target_text'=>'>> Now, let\'s go see the hippo.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang jom kita pergi tengok badak air.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>367.6,'end_time'=>369.7,'target_text'=>'Hopefully we can see the baby hippo from here.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap kita boleh nampak anak badak air tu dari sini.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>369.8,'end_time'=>373.42,'target_text'=>'This the full name is hippopotamus, as you can see over there.','source_text'=>'Nama penuhnya ialah hippopotamus, macam yang korang boleh baca kat papan tanda sana.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>373.52,'end_time'=>377.06,'target_text'=>'But we normally just say hippo just for short.','source_text'=>'Tapi biasanya kita cuma sebut \'hippo\' je sebagai singkatan.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>377.16,'end_time'=>380.78,'target_text'=>'>> You know hippos are some of the most dangerous animals in the world.','source_text'=>'>> Awak tahu tak badak air adalah antara haiwan paling berbahaya di dunia.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>380.88,'end_time'=>381.38,'target_text'=>'Did you know that?','source_text'=>'Awak tahu tak pasal tu?','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>381.48,'end_time'=>384.34,'target_text'=>'Have you ever seen like videos >> No, this is the first time I see a hippo.','source_text'=>'Awak pernah tengok video... >> Tak pernah, ini kali pertama saya tengok badak air secara berdepan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>384.44,'end_time'=>385.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, man.','source_text'=>'>> Alamak, biar betul.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>385.2,'end_time'=>386.86,'target_text'=>'Dude, look at Oh, my gosh.','source_text'=>'Weh, tengoklah... Ya ampun.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>386.96,'end_time'=>388.18,'target_text'=>'>> more.','source_text'=>'>> ada lagi.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>388.28,'end_time'=>389.46,'target_text'=>'They kind of smell like dookie though.','source_text'=>'Tapi bau badan diorang macam bau tahi sikit.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>389.56,'end_time'=>392.22,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, its face is so weird, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'>> Weh, muka badak air ni pelik betul kan?','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>392.32,'end_time'=>395.06,'target_text'=>'>> Have you ever seen that video of like a hippo skeleton?','source_text'=>'>> Awak pernah tengok tak video pasal rangka tulang badak air?','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>395.16,'end_time'=>395.56,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak pernah.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>395.56,'end_time'=>396.66,'target_text'=>'>> Like it looks so crazy.','source_text'=>'>> Rupa bentuknya nampak sangat menggerunkan.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>396.76,'end_time'=>402.66,'target_text'=>'There\'s this video of it where they recreate a hippo from its skeleton like they would a dinosaur, and it looks like the craziest','source_text'=>'Ada satu video di mana diorang lakarkan rupa badak air berdasarkan bentuk tulangnya macam diorang buat pada dinosour, dan rupanya macam raksasa paling dahsyat','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>402.76,'end_time'=>403.34,'target_text'=>'animal you\'ve ever seen.','source_text'=>'yang awak pernah tengok.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>403.44,'end_time'=>404.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s got giant fangs and stuff.','source_text'=>'Rangka tu ada taring raksasa dan macam-macam lagi.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>405,'end_time'=>408.78,'target_text'=>'>> But when you actually look at it, it\'s just like a round, almost like pig-like creature.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi bila tengok haiwan yang hidup sebenar, rupanya bulat gempal macam babi je.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>408.88,'end_time'=>415.78,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, no, but these things are apparently one of the most dangerous animals in Africa or in the world because they can run','source_text'=>'>> Jangan main-main, haiwan ni sebenarnya antara yang paling berbahaya di Afrika atau di dunia sebab boleh lari','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>415.88,'end_time'=>419.1,'target_text'=>'really fast, they can swim incredibly Actually, they don\'t swim.','source_text'=>'laju gila, dan boleh berenang dengan sangat... Sebenarnya diorang tak berenang.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>419.2,'end_time'=>423.34,'target_text'=>'I could be wrong, but apparently they go to the bottom of the water, and they run along the water.','source_text'=>'Mungkin saya silap, tapi rupanya diorang tenggelam ke dasar air dan berlari atas dasar sungai.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>423.44,'end_time'=>426.14,'target_text'=>'Like they run along the bottom, and then they\'re like fast though.','source_text'=>'Diorang berlari di dasar air, dan pergerakan diorang sangat laju.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>426.24,'end_time'=>426.74,'target_text'=>'They\'re super fast.','source_text'=>'Diorang memang laju gila.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>426.84,'end_time'=>432.3,'target_text'=>'They probably swim too, but if you could see their feet, their feet don\'t really look webbed like they\'re meant to swim, but','source_text'=>'Mungkin diorang berenang juga, tapi kalau tengok kaki diorang, kakinya tak berselaput macam kaki haiwan perenang, cuma','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>432.4,'end_time'=>434.3,'target_text'=>'uh >> You would think they would float, no?','source_text'=>'>> Mesti kita ingat badan diorang akan timbul kan?','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>434.4,'end_time'=>436.66,'target_text'=>'They\'re kind of >> Yeah, well, I guess that\'s what I heard.','source_text'=>'Badan diorang kan macam... >> Ya, itulah apa yang saya dengar.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>436.76,'end_time'=>442.58,'target_text'=>'Pretty sure they go down and then run along the water, and then they come up, but they do float obviously, but uh they are','source_text'=>'Saya cukup yakin diorang tenggelam dan berlari di dasar kemudian timbul semula, memang badannya boleh terapung juga, tapi diorang','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>442.68,'end_time'=>447.7,'target_text'=>'just like crazy animals, and their bite force is so strong, and they look so like peaceful and calm.','source_text'=>'memang haiwan yang luar biasa ganas, daya gigitan diorang sangat kuat, walaupun rupa nampak macam tenang dan santai.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>447.8,'end_time'=>448.38,'target_text'=>'Like look at them, dude.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah diorang tu, weh.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>448.48,'end_time'=>452.3,'target_text'=>'They\'re just like chilling in the water, but dude, they could actually kill you.','source_text'=>'Diorang lepak santai je dalam air, tapi sebenarnya diorang boleh bunuh manusia dengan mudah.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>452.4,'end_time'=>453.7,'target_text'=>'Like crazy.','source_text'=>'Gila betul bahaya.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>453.8,'end_time'=>455.26,'target_text'=>'So that hippo just Look at that one.','source_text'=>'Badak air tu baru je... Tengok yang tu.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>455.36,'end_time'=>455.72,'target_text'=>'Look.','source_text'=>'Tengok tu.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>455.72,'end_time'=>456.78,'target_text'=>'Look at it.','source_text'=>'Cuba tengok.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>456.88,'end_time'=>457.78,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they want to be fed.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, diorang nak minta makanan tu.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>457.88,'end_time'=>458.08,'target_text'=>'>> bro.','source_text'=>'>> Weh.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>458.08,'end_time'=>458.4,'target_text'=>'Look.','source_text'=>'Tengok.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>458.4,'end_time'=>459.42,'target_text'=>'Right here.','source_text'=>'Tepat kat sini.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>459.52,'end_time'=>461.82,'target_text'=>'Oh, I think they\'re asking for food, man.','source_text'=>'Oh, rasanya diorang tengah mengemis makananlah, weh.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>461.92,'end_time'=>462.98,'target_text'=>'>> you you can buy food right there.','source_text'=>'>> Awak boleh beli makanan kat sebelah sana tu.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>463.08,'end_time'=>463.86,'target_text'=>'You see they got bananas?','source_text'=>'Nampak tak diorang ada jual pisang?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>463.96,'end_time'=>466.34,'target_text'=>'>> Look at Look at the size of those teeth, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Tengoklah saiz gigi dia tu, weh.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>466.44,'end_time'=>467.38,'target_text'=>'Those are insane.','source_text'=>'Gigi dia besar gila.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>467.48,'end_time'=>469.78,'target_text'=>'>> them crush like watermelon in like one bite.','source_text'=>'>> Diorang boleh hancurkan sebiji tembikai dengan sekali gigit je.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>469.88,'end_time'=>471.18,'target_text'=>'>> definitely a scary animal.','source_text'=>'>> Memang haiwan yang menakutkan betul.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>471.28,'end_time'=>476.1,'target_text'=>'What is your most irrational animal or insect fear?','source_text'=>'Apa ketakutan haiwan atau serangga paling tak munasabah yang awak ada?','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>476.2,'end_time'=>480.1,'target_text'=>'>> I have to go with insects, and the insect I\'m going to go with is cockroaches.','source_text'=>'>> Saya paling takut serangga, dan serangga tu adalah lipas.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>480.2,'end_time'=>486.26,'target_text'=>'I know they\'re not going to do any damage or anything, but I don\'t know, for some reason, if I see them, I\'m like, I can\'t','source_text'=>'Saya tahu lipas takkan cederakan kita pun, tapi entahlah, kalau saya nampak lipas, saya rasa macam tak boleh','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>486.36,'end_time'=>487.02,'target_text'=>'be here anymore.','source_text'=>'duduk dalam bilik tu lagi.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>487.12,'end_time'=>489.06,'target_text'=>'But it\'s only when I see them in my room.','source_text'=>'Tapi perasaan tu datang bila nampak lipas dalam bilik tidur je.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>489.16,'end_time'=>493.3,'target_text'=>'If I see them there\'s no way out cuz they could come get you anywhere.','source_text'=>'Kalau nampak lipas dalam bilik rasa macam tiada jalan keluar sebab dia boleh merayap ke mana-mana.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>493.4,'end_time'=>494.06,'target_text'=>'>> Literally.','source_text'=>'>> Memang betul.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>494.16,'end_time'=>494.7,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s yours?','source_text'=>'>> Awak pula takut apa?','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>494.8,'end_time'=>495.2,'target_text'=>'>> I agree.','source_text'=>'>> Saya setuju dengan awak.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>495.28,'end_time'=>501.78,'target_text'=>'Like for me, I associate cockroaches with just like dirty, like filth, and like also like infection and diseases.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, saya kaitkan lipas dengan kotor, jijik, serta kuman penyakit dan jangkitan.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>501.88,'end_time'=>507.06,'target_text'=>'Like so when you see one on the streets, like by the sewage, it\'s like, \"Okay, yeah.\" But when you see one in your room, it\'s','source_text'=>'Bila nampak lipas kat jalan raya dekat longkang, kita rasa macam \'biasalah\', tapi bila nampak dalam bilik sendiri, rasa','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>507.16,'end_time'=>511.86,'target_text'=>'like, \"No.\" Especially if it\'s like a hotel room, and you\'re staying there for like a night, and then a cockroach comes out,','source_text'=>'macam \'tolonglah jangan\'. Lebih-lebih lagi dalam bilik hotel bila kita nak menginap semalam tiba-tiba lipas keluar,','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>511.96,'end_time'=>514.06,'target_text'=>'it\'s like, \"Oh.\" >> I don\'t like cockroaches.','source_text'=>'rasa geli geleman. >> Saya memang tak suka lipas.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>514.16,'end_time'=>520.34,'target_text'=>'>> For me, I\'ll choose an animal, like similar to what you said, kind of like that filthy, gross, kind of that type of animal.','source_text'=>'>> Bagi saya, saya pilih haiwan, sama macam yang awak kata, jenis haiwan yang kotor, jijik dan kotor macam tu.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>520.44,'end_time'=>521.46,'target_text'=>'And for me, it\'s a rat.','source_text'=>'Dan bagi saya, haiwan tu adalah tikus.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>521.56,'end_time'=>526.14,'target_text'=>'I just think they\'re like like dirty, like I feel like they bite you one time, and like you\'re going to get a disease and','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tikus ni sangat kotor, macam kalau kena gigit sekali je, terus berjangkit penyakit berbahaya dan','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>526.24,'end_time'=>527.18,'target_text'=>'just die the next day.','source_text'=>'mati keesokan harinya.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>527.28,'end_time'=>528.9,'target_text'=>'Specifically the rats in New York City, dude.','source_text'=>'Terutamanya tikus di bandar New York tu, weh.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>529,'end_time'=>530.42,'target_text'=>'But those rats I think are different.','source_text'=>'Tapi tikus New York tu saya rasa lain macam.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>530.52,'end_time'=>532.7,'target_text'=>'Those are like some like steroid rats.','source_text'=>'Tikus kat sana macam telan steroid, besar semacam.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>532.8,'end_time'=>534.06,'target_text'=>'>> Steroid rats.','source_text'=>'>> Tikus sado main steroid.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>534.16,'end_time'=>535.42,'target_text'=>'>> For me, dude, rats.','source_text'=>'>> Bagi saya weh, memang tikus.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>535.52,'end_time'=>540.3,'target_text'=>'Cuz we live in Alberta, which is one of the only places in the world with no rats.','source_text'=>'Sebab kita tinggal di Alberta, salah satu wilayah di dunia yang langsung tiada tikus.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>540.4,'end_time'=>542.62,'target_text'=>'You just put like mouse traps out, and then it\'s fine.','source_text'=>'Orang cuma pasang perangkap tikus biasa, lepas tu keadaan terkawal.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>542.72,'end_time'=>544.18,'target_text'=>'But literally look right here, dude.','source_text'=>'Tapi cuba tengok tepat kat sini, weh.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>544.28,'end_time'=>545.5,'target_text'=>'We found the giraffes.','source_text'=>'Kita dah jumpa zirafah.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>545.6,'end_time'=>549.82,'target_text'=>'Dude, seeing these animals up close, I don\'t think I\'ve ever seen a giraffe >> No.','source_text'=>'Weh, bila tengok haiwan ni depan mata, saya rasa saya tak pernah tengok zirafah >> Tak pernah.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>549.92,'end_time'=>550.46,'target_text'=>'>> in my life.','source_text'=>'>> seumur hidup saya.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>550.56,'end_time'=>550.92,'target_text'=>'Have you?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah tengok?','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>550.92,'end_time'=>551.86,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think so.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa saya tak pernah juga.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>551.96,'end_time'=>554.82,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, seeing this animal up close, they don\'t even look like real.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, bila tengok zirafah dekat-dekat macam ni, nampak macam bukan haiwan betul.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>554.92,'end_time'=>556.1,'target_text'=>'>> But I thought they\'d be bigger.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi saya ingatkan saiz dia lagi besar.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>556.2,'end_time'=>557.58,'target_text'=>'>> Like how does this even evolve?','source_text'=>'>> Macam manalah haiwan macam ni boleh berevolusi?','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>557.68,'end_time'=>560.1,'target_text'=>'>> There\'s a baby over there, like a baby giraffe.','source_text'=>'>> Ada anak zirafah kat sebelah sana tu.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>560.2,'end_time'=>563.42,'target_text'=>'>> But like just think about how interesting this animal is.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi cuba fikir betapa unik dan menariknya haiwan ni.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>563.52,'end_time'=>569.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a horse that grew a really long neck and really long legs, and then like two horns.','source_text'=>'Rupa dia macam kuda yang ada leher panjang gila, kaki panjang kurus, lepas tu ada dua tanduk kecil.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>569.32,'end_time'=>571.74,'target_text'=>'>> Is that a fact or are you just >> I\'m just like comparing it.','source_text'=>'>> Tu fakta sains ke awak sengaja... >> Saya cuma buat perbandingan je.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>571.84,'end_time'=>577.42,'target_text'=>'Like I guess we live in Canada where you don\'t have any of like of these exotic animals, but just seeing them is honestly','source_text'=>'Maklumlah kita tinggal di Kanada yang tiada langsung haiwan eksotik macam ni, jadi bila tengok depan mata sejujurnya','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>577.52,'end_time'=>578.3,'target_text'=>'like wow.','source_text'=>'rasa sangat kagum.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>578.4,'end_time'=>579.82,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, they\'re embarrassing.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya, gaya zirafah ni kelakar juga.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>579.92,'end_time'=>582.22,'target_text'=>'>> it\'s not even that long, right?','source_text'=>'>> Leher dia takdelah panjang sangat kan?','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>582.32,'end_time'=>586.98,'target_text'=>'>> No, this one I think it\'s not too tall, but usually >> or like long like >> Oh, long guy, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ni rasanya tak berapa tinggi, tapi biasanya >> leher panjang menjulang >> Haah, leher panjang tinggi.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>587.08,'end_time'=>587.9,'target_text'=>'>> like lengthwise.','source_text'=>'>> dari segi kepanjangan leher.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>588,'end_time'=>590.46,'target_text'=>'>> So, start blowing at it and see if it moves.','source_text'=>'>> Cuba tiup arah dia tengok dia bergerak ke tak.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>590.56,'end_time'=>592.3,'target_text'=>'>> Wow, that\'s honestly so cool.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, sejujurnya memang sangat menarik.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>592.4,'end_time'=>593.9,'target_text'=>'Honestly, this is super cool.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya memang gempak habis.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>594,'end_time'=>595.74,'target_text'=>'And we have zebras over here.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sebelah sini pula kita ada kuda belang (zebras).','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>595.84,'end_time'=>596.54,'target_text'=>'Come check it out.','source_text'=>'Jom mari tengok.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>596.64,'end_time'=>598.5,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, what\'s the >> What\'s the Madagascar?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, apa nama... watak dalam filem Madagascar tu?','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>598.6,'end_time'=>599.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, Madagascar.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, filem Madagascar.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>599.44,'end_time'=>599.86,'target_text'=>'What\'s his name?','source_text'=>'Apa nama watak tu?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>599.96,'end_time'=>600.36,'target_text'=>'Marty.','source_text'=>'Marty.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>600.36,'end_time'=>601.02,'target_text'=>'There you go.','source_text'=>'Haa betul, Marty.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>601.12,'end_time'=>603.1,'target_text'=>'You think one of them knows Marty?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa salah seekor kuda belang ni kenal Marty tak?','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>603.2,'end_time'=>603.86,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin kenal.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>603.96,'end_time'=>604.24,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'>> Wah.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>604.24,'end_time'=>605.66,'target_text'=>'Oh, and look at the baby giraffe.','source_text'=>'Oh, tengok anak zirafah tu.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>605.76,'end_time'=>610.14,'target_text'=>'>> But like overall, you can see how they\'re all kind of separated like >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi secara keseluruhannya, awak boleh nampak macam mana diorang duduk berasingan kelompok >> Ya.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>610.24,'end_time'=>611.38,'target_text'=>'>> Zebras together.','source_text'=>'>> Kuda belang berkumpul sesama sendiri.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>611.48,'end_time'=>614.26,'target_text'=>'>> Cuz I mean, the zebras can\'t reach that food.','source_text'=>'>> Sebab kuda belang tak dapat capai makanan kat atas tu.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>614.36,'end_time'=>616.5,'target_text'=>'And I guess they eat different type of food.','source_text'=>'Dan rasanya diorang makan jenis makanan yang berbeza.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>616.6,'end_time'=>620.86,'target_text'=>'But the pronghorn, we\'ll call them, is eating the food that the giraffe is dropping.','source_text'=>'Tapi antelop kat bawah tu makan sisa makanan yang zirafah jatuhkan.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>620.96,'end_time'=>622.86,'target_text'=>'>> But these guys are probably used to living together.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi haiwan-haiwan ni mungkin dah biasa hidup bersama.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>622.96,'end_time'=>629.06,'target_text'=>'Like I guess even in nature, you get the zebras and then those guys living together like by nature, so.','source_text'=>'Rasa saya di alam liar pun kuda belang dan antelop memang hidup berdampingan secara semula jadi.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>629.16,'end_time'=>635.3,'target_text'=>'>> It\'d be interesting to know what these animals think or if they even think or all they think is just eat, sleep, drink.','source_text'=>'>> Mesti menarik kalau kita tahu apa yang haiwan-haiwan ni fikirkan, atau diorang cuma fikir makan, tidur, minum je.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>635.4,'end_time'=>637.22,'target_text'=>'>> Well, they probably haven\'t seen much in life.','source_text'=>'>> Diorang mungkin tak pernah tengok banyak perkara dalam hidup.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>637.32,'end_time'=>638.5,'target_text'=>'They\'ve just been here, so.','source_text'=>'Diorang cuma membesar dalam zoo ni je.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>638.6,'end_time'=>642.5,'target_text'=>'But do you think they learned to coexist by nature or nurture?','source_text'=>'Tapi awak rasa diorang belajar hidup bersama sebab naluri semula jadi atau didikan persekitaran?','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>642.6,'end_time'=>643.06,'target_text'=>'>> Here?','source_text'=>'>> Kat sini ke?','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>643.16,'end_time'=>643.56,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>643.6,'end_time'=>648.74,'target_text'=>'>> Probably both because they\'re all herbivores and like really not violent and they\'re not predators.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin dua-dua sekali sebab semuanya haiwan herbivor, tak ganas, dan bukan pemangsa.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>648.84,'end_time'=>649.78,'target_text'=>'These are like prey.','source_text'=>'Haiwan-haiwan ni spesis mangsa buruan.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>649.88,'end_time'=>652.82,'target_text'=>'They could live peacefully and not like fear getting eaten.','source_text'=>'Diorang boleh hidup aman damai tanpa rasa takut kena makan.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>652.92,'end_time'=>654.02,'target_text'=>'I mean, it is a zoo.','source_text'=>'Maklumlah, ini kan kawasan zoo.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>654.12,'end_time'=>654.62,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita teruskan berjalan.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>654.72,'end_time'=>656.22,'target_text'=>'We still have to see the rhino.','source_text'=>'Kita belum tengok badak sumbu lagi.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>656.32,'end_time'=>657.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s going to be my favorite.','source_text'=>'Itu pasti jadi haiwan kegemaran saya.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>657.28,'end_time'=>662.5,'target_text'=>'>> I feel like these animals here are on average smaller than what you would see them in like real nature.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa purata saiz haiwan dalam zoo ni lebih kecil berbanding yang hidup di alam liar sebenar.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>662.6,'end_time'=>663.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, most likely.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kemungkinan besar betul.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>664.08,'end_time'=>665.46,'target_text'=>'>> Or >> Hmm.','source_text'=>'>> Atau... >> Hmm.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>665.56,'end_time'=>669.54,'target_text'=>'>> Like here, they could really grow with like non-stop without like fear of predators.','source_text'=>'>> Kat sini diorang boleh membesar tanpa henti tanpa rasa takut pada pemangsa.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>669.64,'end_time'=>671.02,'target_text'=>'So, they could just eat all day.','source_text'=>'Jadi diorang boleh makan sepanjang hari.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>671.12,'end_time'=>673.94,'target_text'=>'So, maybe here they\'d be I don\'t know if they\'d be bigger or just fatter.','source_text'=>'Jadi mungkin kat sini diorang jadi... saya tak pasti sama ada makin besar atau makin gemuk je.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>674.04,'end_time'=>677.3,'target_text'=>'I guess it also depends on like their genes how big they\'re going to get.','source_text'=>'Rasanya bergantung juga pada faktor genetik sejauh mana saiz diorang boleh membesar.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>677.4,'end_time'=>678.98,'target_text'=>'>> Is this going to tell us what was in there?','source_text'=>'>> Papan tanda ni ada beritahu tak haiwan apa kat dalam tu?','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>679.08,'end_time'=>680.98,'target_text'=>'No, just a zebra and a giraffe.','source_text'=>'Takde, cuma kuda belang dan zirafah.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>681.08,'end_time'=>681.9,'target_text'=>'>> Low-key kind of heavy.','source_text'=>'>> Boleh tahan berat juga badannya.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>682,'end_time'=>682.98,'target_text'=>'>> Low-key though.','source_text'=>'>> Boleh tahan berat betul.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>683.08,'end_time'=>684.78,'target_text'=>'So, this is the name.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini nama haiwan tu.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>684.88,'end_time'=>686.22,'target_text'=>'So, none of us had that right.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya tekaan kita berdua tadi salah belaka.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>686.32,'end_time'=>687.86,'target_text'=>'Holy man, they could get heavy.','source_text'=>'Mak aih, berat gila rupa-rupanya.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>687.96,'end_time'=>690.22,'target_text'=>'900 kg and they\'re big.','source_text'=>'Berat boleh cecah 900 kg dan saiznya sangat besar.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>690.32,'end_time'=>691.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'Oh, wah.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>691.28,'end_time'=>692.26,'target_text'=>'Look at their horns.','source_text'=>'Tengok tanduk dia tu.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>692.36,'end_time'=>693.66,'target_text'=>'I was not expecting that, dude.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak sangka seberat tu, weh.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>693.76,'end_time'=>695.18,'target_text'=>'900 kg.','source_text'=>'900 kilogram.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>695.28,'end_time'=>697.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s more than the more than the zebra.','source_text'=>'Itu jauh lebih berat daripada kuda belang.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>697.36,'end_time'=>700.1,'target_text'=>'>> But an elephant is like a ton or something, right?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi berat gajah dalam satu tan atau lebih kan?','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>700.2,'end_time'=>701.26,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, elephants are more.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, gajah jauh lebih berat lagi.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>701.36,'end_time'=>704.34,'target_text'=>'If that thing is 900, elephants are way more easily.','source_text'=>'Kalau antelop ni pun dah 900 kg, berat gajah berkali ganda lebih mudah-mudah je.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>704.44,'end_time'=>710.62,'target_text'=>'If you had to choose one animal that\'s like, you know, relatively big, so we\'ll say like one animal that\'s at least to your','source_text'=>'Kalau awak terpaksa pilih seekor haiwan yang bersaiz agak besar, katakanlah paras pinggang awak','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>710.72,'end_time'=>713.22,'target_text'=>'waist and at least like this wide or this long.','source_text'=>'dan sekurang-kurangnya selebar atau sepanjang saiz macam ni.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>713.32,'end_time'=>717.58,'target_text'=>'If you had to choose one animal of those dimensions that you would win in a fight, which animal would it be?','source_text'=>'Kalau kena pilih seekor haiwan saiz macam tu yang awak yakin boleh menang bila bertarung, haiwan apa awak akan pilih?','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>717.68,'end_time'=>721.82,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster, get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih cepat, dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>721.92,'end_time'=>728.7,'target_text'=>'It includes deeper explanations and exercises to help you remember and master what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi penerangan mendalam dan latihan praktikal untuk bantu korang ingat dan kuasai apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>728.8,'end_time'=>734.62,'target_text'=>'And if you get five or more workbooks, you\'ll get 30% off automatically at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan jika beli lima atau lebih buku latihan, korang akan nikmati potongan 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>734.72,'end_time'=>738.82,'target_text'=>'So, go to the description or my website volkaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jadi layari pautan di ruangan deskripsi atau laman web saya di volkaenglish.com.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>738.92,'end_time'=>741.22,'target_text'=>'>> that you think you would you would win if you had to fight it.','source_text'=>'>> haiwan yang awak yakin boleh menang kalau terpaksa berlawan dengannya.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>741.32,'end_time'=>742.66,'target_text'=>'>> Do you guys know what a coyote is?','source_text'=>'>> Korang tahu tak apa itu coyote (anjing hutan koyote)?','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>742.76,'end_time'=>749.1,'target_text'=>'So, in Edmonton, where we\'re from, we have a lot of coyotes there, which is actually a problem now cuz they eat our dogs and','source_text'=>'Di tempat asal kami di Edmonton, ada banyak anjing koyote kat sana, yang sekarang jadi masalah besar sebab makan anjing peliharaan dan','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>749.2,'end_time'=>750.78,'target_text'=>'cats or any pets that we have.','source_text'=>'kucing atau apa-apa haiwan peliharaan orang ramai.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>750.88,'end_time'=>752.3,'target_text'=>'>> And any like small farm animals, too.','source_text'=>'>> Dan haiwan ternakan kecil di ladang juga.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>752.4,'end_time'=>755.82,'target_text'=>'Like chickens, even like maybe sheep and goats, they\'ll eat them, too.','source_text'=>'Macam ayam, malah mungkin biri-biri dan kambing pun diorang makan sekali.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>755.92,'end_time'=>758.38,'target_text'=>'Especially like they hunt in packs, so >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Lebih-lebih lagi koyote ni memburu secara berkumpulan, jadi... >> Ya betul.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>758.48,'end_time'=>758.88,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>758.92,'end_time'=>762.94,'target_text'=>'>> So, a lot of the times you see them at night or just in the streets anytime, honestly.','source_text'=>'>> Kerap kali kita boleh nampak koyote pada waktu malam atau berkeliaran di jalanan pada bila-bila masa.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>763.04,'end_time'=>763.54,'target_text'=>'>> In the city?','source_text'=>'>> Di tengah bandar?','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>763.64,'end_time'=>764.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, in Edmonton.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, di bandar Edmonton.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>764.44,'end_time'=>767.42,'target_text'=>'I\'d see them outside my house, like when I\'m walking my dog, yeah.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu nampak di luar rumah masa bawa anjing saya bersiar-siar, ya.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>767.52,'end_time'=>772.1,'target_text'=>'You just >> No, I thought you were talking about like in general like >> I\'ve seen them outside my house, I\'ve seen them in','source_text'=>'Awak cuma... >> Saya ingatkan awak cerita secara umum... >> Saya pernah nampak kat luar rumah, nampak di kawasan','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>772.2,'end_time'=>772.9,'target_text'=>'Kinsmen.','source_text'=>'taman Kinsmen.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>773,'end_time'=>778.5,'target_text'=>'Usually you see just one on the street, but if you\'re like in the trails, then you see like multiple of them.','source_text'=>'Biasanya nampak seekor je kat jalan, tapi kalau masuk laluan hutan simpan, nampak berkawan-kawan.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>778.6,'end_time'=>779.58,'target_text'=>'>> Have they attacked people?','source_text'=>'>> Koyote pernah serang manusia ke?','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>779.68,'end_time'=>782.62,'target_text'=>'>> Not people, but they have attacked dogs.','source_text'=>'>> Manusia tak pernah, tapi anjing peliharaan pernah diserang.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>782.72,'end_time'=>787.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, cuz I know like Edmonton has like a lot of like like forest and also like the river the river valley.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab Edmonton ada banyak hutan tebal dan kawasan lembah sungai (river valley).','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>787.64,'end_time'=>791.94,'target_text'=>'Like the trails are like kind of in the woods, so >> But I feel like I could beat them in a fight.','source_text'=>'Laluan pejalan kaki banyak dalam kawasan belukar, jadi... >> Tapi saya rasa saya boleh tewaskan koyote kalau bertumbuk.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>792.04,'end_time'=>792.44,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Boleh jadi.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>792.48,'end_time'=>795.82,'target_text'=>'This is what a coyote looks like, but it is really like kind of like at the knees.','source_text'=>'Macam nilah rupa anjing koyote, paras ketinggiannya lebih kurang paras lutut kita.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>795.92,'end_time'=>801.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s like a small Some of them get bigger, but some of them do get bigger, but they\'re like a small like scruffy dog.','source_text'=>'Saiznya macam anjing kecil... Ada yang membesar sikit, tapi rupanya macam anjing comot berbulu kusut.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>802,'end_time'=>803.14,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I know, I\'ll give you that one.','source_text'=>'Ya, logik juga, saya setuju awak boleh menang lawan koyote.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>803.24,'end_time'=>807.98,'target_text'=>'>> Unless it bites you, then then you\'re in >> Cuz then it might give you like rabies, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Melainkan kalau dia gigit awak, masa tu susah... >> Sebab silap-silap boleh kena penyakit anjing gila (rabies).','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>808.08,'end_time'=>813.5,'target_text'=>'I would never fight this animal, but if I had to choose one to beat in a fight, it would be a giant tortoise.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan lawan haiwan ni, tapi kalau kena pilih seekor untuk saya menang dalam pertarungan, saya pilih kura-kura gergasi.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>813.6,'end_time'=>814.9,'target_text'=>'>> A giant what?','source_text'=>'>> Kura-kura apa?','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>815,'end_time'=>815.94,'target_text'=>'>> Giant tortoise.','source_text'=>'>> Kura-kura gergasi (giant tortoise).','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>816.04,'end_time'=>818.02,'target_text'=>'Cuz those things get like this big or bigger.','source_text'=>'Sebab kura-kura tu saiznya sebesar ni atau lebih besar lagi.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>818.12,'end_time'=>819.1,'target_text'=>'Huge.','source_text'=>'Sangat besar.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>819.2,'end_time'=>824.14,'target_text'=>'Hundreds of pounds, but they move so slow and they\'re also like herbivores and non-aggressive.','source_text'=>'Berat beratus kilogram, tapi jalannya sangat lambat, makan tumbuhan dan langsung tak agresif.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>824.24,'end_time'=>828.66,'target_text'=>'They\'re from the Galapagos Islands or there there are a lot of species in the Galapagos Islands.','source_text'=>'Spesis ini berasal dari Kepulauan Galapagos atau banyak dijumpai di sana.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>828.76,'end_time'=>829.46,'target_text'=>'>> That one easily.','source_text'=>'>> Lawan kura-kura gergasi memang senang menang.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>829.56,'end_time'=>832.14,'target_text'=>'>> So would you just run away or like do you actually fight?','source_text'=>'>> Jadi awak akan lari je ke atau betul-betul bertarung?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>832.24,'end_time'=>833.34,'target_text'=>'>> it was like a fight to the death.','source_text'=>'>> Macam pertarungan hidup atau mati.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>833.44,'end_time'=>836.18,'target_text'=>'Like Like I don\'t want to, but we\'re just talking hypothetically.','source_text'=>'Bukanlah nak betul-betul, kita cuma sembang secara andaian je.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>836.28,'end_time'=>838.06,'target_text'=>'>> That one I feel like easy easy win.','source_text'=>'>> Yang tu memang gerenti menang mudah.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>838.16,'end_time'=>838.62,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya memang betul.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>838.72,'end_time'=>842.42,'target_text'=>'But there I can see the panda sign, but unfortunately, no pandas today.','source_text'=>'Tapi kat sana saya nampak papan tanda panda, sayangnya hari ini tiada panda.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>842.52,'end_time'=>844.82,'target_text'=>'But you can see the map over here of this whole thing.','source_text'=>'Tapi korang boleh tengok peta keseluruhan kawasan zoo ni kat sini.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>844.92,'end_time'=>846.22,'target_text'=>'So we\'ll go up to the map.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi tengok peta.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>846.32,'end_time'=>848.74,'target_text'=>'We\'ll see where we\'ve gone and what we need to do.','source_text'=>'Kita tengok tempat mana yang kita dah lalui dan apa lagi yang belum tengok.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>848.84,'end_time'=>849.78,'target_text'=>'Oh, kangaroo.','source_text'=>'Oh, kanggaru.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>849.88,'end_time'=>850.7,'target_text'=>'Feel like we missed that.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam kita terlepas tengok kanggaru tadi.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>850.8,'end_time'=>851.78,'target_text'=>'>> Africa zone.','source_text'=>'>> Zon Afrika.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>851.88,'end_time'=>854.5,'target_text'=>'>> So far we\'ve just hit the hippopotamus and African animals.','source_text'=>'>> Setakat ini kita baru tengok badak air dan haiwan-haiwan benua Afrika.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>854.6,'end_time'=>856.14,'target_text'=>'Dude, this thing is huge.','source_text'=>'Weh, zoo ni memang luas gila.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>856.24,'end_time'=>858.38,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we still got a lot to see.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi ada banyak lagi tempat kita belum tengok.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>858.48,'end_time'=>868.42,'target_text'=>'So this animal here is an ostrich and it is the biggest bird in the world, but it can\'t fly because I guess it evolved to','source_text'=>'Haiwan di sini adalah burung unta (ostrich) dan ia merupakan burung terbesar di dunia, tapi tak boleh terbang sebab ia berevolusi untuk','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>868.52,'end_time'=>872.14,'target_text'=>'not need to fly because I it could just get all its food from the ground.','source_text'=>'tak perlu terbang kerana ia boleh dapatkan semua makanannya dari atas tanah.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>872.24,'end_time'=>879.34,'target_text'=>'It is the biggest bird, but it can\'t fly and actually I\'ve tried ostrich meat in South Africa because there are so many ostriches','source_text'=>'Ia burung terbesar tapi tak boleh terbang dan sebenarnya saya pernah rasa daging burung unta di Afrika Selatan sebab ada banyak sangat burung unta','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>879.44,'end_time'=>885.42,'target_text'=>'in South Africa and they have ostrich farms and it\'s like the meat is like really like dry in my opinion.','source_text'=>'di Afrika Selatan dan ada ladang ternakan burung unta, pada pandangan saya dagingnya agak kering.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>885.52,'end_time'=>886.98,'target_text'=>'Like dry and sandy.','source_text'=>'Kering dan teksturnya agak berpasir.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>887.08,'end_time'=>891.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s not really a good meat in my opinion, but I mean if you want to try it, you can try it.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya dagingnya tak berapa sedap, tapi kalau korang nak cuba, bolehlah rasa sendiri.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>891.16,'end_time'=>893.62,'target_text'=>'In my opinion, it does not taste like chicken.','source_text'=>'Pada pandangan saya, rasanya langsung tak macam daging ayam.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>893.72,'end_time'=>894.18,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s go with tiger.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita tengok bahagian harimau.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>894.28,'end_time'=>896.54,'target_text'=>'If you were a tiger, which one would you be?','source_text'=>'Kalau awak seekor harimau, bentuk badan mana awak pilih?','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>896.64,'end_time'=>899.62,'target_text'=>'Very thin, underweight, ideal, overweight, or obese?','source_text'=>'Sangat kurus, kurang berat, ideal, lebih berat, atau obesiti?','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>899.72,'end_time'=>902.58,'target_text'=>'>> Can I take a video of this and then take a video of this?','source_text'=>'>> Boleh saya rakam video carta ni lepas tu rakam video awak?','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>902.68,'end_time'=>905.4,'target_text'=>'You guys put it in the comments.','source_text'=>'Korang tentukan jawapannya di ruangan komen.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>905.52,'end_time'=>907.42,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so you would be ideal.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, jadi awak berada di tahap ideal.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>907.52,'end_time'=>909.46,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, where would you put Leon?','source_text'=>'>> Okey, tahap mana awak letakkan Leon?','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>909.56,'end_time'=>911.06,'target_text'=>'>> I\'d say jacked.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa Leon jenis sado berotot.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>911.16,'end_time'=>914.82,'target_text'=>'>> If I put myself here, feel like I would go ideal too.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau saya nilai diri sendiri, saya rasa saya pun di tahap ideal juga.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>914.92,'end_time'=>916.82,'target_text'=>'Like maybe a little bit more here.','source_text'=>'Mungkin lebih sikit ke arah sini.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>916.92,'end_time'=>919.74,'target_text'=>'Not really ideal, but like more ideal than not.','source_text'=>'Taklah ideal sempurna, tapi lebih dekat ke arah ideal.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>919.84,'end_time'=>921.06,'target_text'=>'>> And And okay.','source_text'=>'>> Dan... okeylah tu.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>921.16,'end_time'=>921.82,'target_text'=>'>> That is okay.','source_text'=>'>> Okeylah tu.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>921.92,'end_time'=>923.46,'target_text'=>'Leon, where would you put yourself?','source_text'=>'Leon, awak letak diri awak kat tahap mana?','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>923.56,'end_time'=>925.26,'target_text'=>'>> For this guy goes Leon.','source_text'=>'>> Untuk Leon, dia pilih yang ini.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>925.36,'end_time'=>926.9,'target_text'=>'>> I would put myself as a lion.','source_text'=>'>> Saya anggap diri saya macam singa.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>927,'end_time'=>927.36,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Entahlah.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>927.36,'end_time'=>929.14,'target_text'=>'Like, where would you put yourself?','source_text'=>'Awak pula letakkan diri awak di mana?','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>929.24,'end_time'=>930.82,'target_text'=>'>> I\'d call myself a tiger.','source_text'=>'>> Saya gelar diri saya seekor harimau.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>930.92,'end_time'=>933.62,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so I think we all know the answer to that.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, saya rasa kita semua dah tahu jawapannya.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>933.72,'end_time'=>935.74,'target_text'=>'Anyways, oh, it says I\'m here.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, oh, tertulis \'Saya berada di sini\'.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>935.84,'end_time'=>936.34,'target_text'=>'Look at the pictures.','source_text'=>'Tengok gambar-gambar tu.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>936.44,'end_time'=>937.26,'target_text'=>'This guy is good at hiding.','source_text'=>'Harimau ni pandai betul menyorok.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>937.36,'end_time'=>938.26,'target_text'=>'There\'s a tiger in here.','source_text'=>'Ada harimau di dalam kandang ni.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>938.36,'end_time'=>941.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, well, the glass is super dirty, so >> Yeah, and there\'s like a reflection.','source_text'=>'>> Cermin kacanya kotor sangat, jadi... >> Ya, dan ada pantulan cahaya.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>941.48,'end_time'=>944.62,'target_text'=>'>> like the only place it could be is over there.','source_text'=>'>> satu-satunya tempat dia boleh berada mungkin di sebelah sana.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>944.72,'end_time'=>946.62,'target_text'=>'>> I literally don\'t see the tiger at all.','source_text'=>'>> Saya langsung tak nampak bayang harimau tu.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>946.72,'end_time'=>948.1,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, no tiger today.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, nampaknya takde rezeki tengok harimau hari ini.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>948.2,'end_time'=>952.14,'target_text'=>'This is I think is one of the worst animals >> to encounter, a hyena.','source_text'=>'Ini saya rasa antara haiwan paling ngeri >> kalau terserempak, iaitu dubuk (hyena).','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>952.24,'end_time'=>958.22,'target_text'=>'Cuz usually they\'re in packs, and imagine being hunted by an animal in a pack, and then they\'re all just laughing.','source_text'=>'Sebab biasanya dubuk memburu berkumpulan, bayangkan diburu sekawan haiwan dan semuanya berbunyi ketawa mengilai.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>958.32,'end_time'=>958.86,'target_text'=>'>> Like, hee hee hee.','source_text'=>'>> Bunyi ketawa \'hee hee hee\'.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>958.96,'end_time'=>959.9,'target_text'=>'>> You know how they laugh?','source_text'=>'>> Awak tahu kan macam mana bunyi mengilai dubuk?','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>960,'end_time'=>962.94,'target_text'=>'They\'re found in Africa, but specifically this area.','source_text'=>'Haiwan ni berasal dari Afrika, khususnya kawasan padang savana.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>963.04,'end_time'=>963.66,'target_text'=>'What\'s in here?','source_text'=>'Apa yang ada kat dalam kandang ni?','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>963.76,'end_time'=>964.7,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s the another tiger.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa saya ada seekor lagi harimau.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>964.8,'end_time'=>965.7,'target_text'=>'>> Ah, it\'s over there.','source_text'=>'>> Ah, dia ada kat sebelah sana.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>965.8,'end_time'=>966.2,'target_text'=>'>> Is it?','source_text'=>'>> Betul ke tu?','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>966.28,'end_time'=>966.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>967,'end_time'=>967.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah, I see it.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya, saya nampak dah.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>967.76,'end_time'=>968.86,'target_text'=>'Oh, there\'s a hyena.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada dubuk kat situ.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>968.96,'end_time'=>969.78,'target_text'=>'>> hyena.','source_text'=>'>> dubuk.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>969.88,'end_time'=>971.26,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, that\'s a sad life, though.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, tapi sedih juga tengok hidup dia macam tu.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>971.36,'end_time'=>973.54,'target_text'=>'This guy\'s just living alone in this.','source_text'=>'Dubuk ni hidup seekor diri je dalam sangkar ni.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>973.64,'end_time'=>975.5,'target_text'=>'>> I doubt he\'s going to attack anyone.','source_text'=>'>> Tak rasa dia ada tenaga nak serang orang pun.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>975.6,'end_time'=>978.94,'target_text'=>'>> Do you think there are lazy animals just like there are lazy humans?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa wujud tak haiwan yang pemalas sama macam manusia pemalas?','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>979.04,'end_time'=>983.86,'target_text'=>'Imagine if they if you\'re a lazy animal and they put you here and you could just be lazy all day, not having to hunt.','source_text'=>'Bayangkan kalau awak haiwan pemalas lepas tu orang letak dalam zoo, boleh goyang kaki sepanjang hari tanpa perlu memburu.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>983.96,'end_time'=>987.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but I feel like they put you here and then you become lazy.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi saya rasa bila kena kurung dalam zoo nilah yang buat haiwan jadi malas.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>987.84,'end_time'=>989.82,'target_text'=>'>> This guy probably wasn\'t lazy when he was born.','source_text'=>'>> Dubuk ni mungkin tak malas masa dia lahir dulu.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>989.92,'end_time'=>990.58,'target_text'=>'He just moved.','source_text'=>'Tengok, dia baru bergerak.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>990.68,'end_time'=>992.34,'target_text'=>'>> Well, that guy\'s sleeping right now.','source_text'=>'>> Dia tengah tidur sekarang.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>992.44,'end_time'=>992.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>993.04,'end_time'=>996.98,'target_text'=>'Do you think these animals are bored or >> Yeah, 100%.','source_text'=>'Awak rasa haiwan-haiwan ni bosan ke... >> Ya, 100% pasti bosan.','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>997.08,'end_time'=>998.3,'target_text'=>'You don\'t think so?','source_text'=>'Awak tak rasa macam tu ke?','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>998.4,'end_time'=>998.94,'target_text'=>'>> I agree.','source_text'=>'>> Saya setuju.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>999.04,'end_time'=>1000.1,'target_text'=>'Do you think they\'re happy?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa diorang gembira tak?','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1000.2,'end_time'=>1001.22,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak gembira.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1001.32,'end_time'=>1001.78,'target_text'=>'>> No?','source_text'=>'>> Tak?','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1001.88,'end_time'=>1007.46,'target_text'=>'>> Well, what do you think about supporting the zoos, buying tickets and then going to a zoo?','source_text'=>'>> Apa pendapat awak tentang menyokong zoo, beli tiket dan datang melawat zoo?','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1007.56,'end_time'=>1007.96,'target_text'=>'Huh?','source_text'=>'Kan?','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1007.96,'end_time'=>1009.34,'target_text'=>'Would you be supporting them?','source_text'=>'Adakah awak rasa wajar kita sokong zoo?','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1009.44,'end_time'=>1015.18,'target_text'=>'>> It depends cuz sometimes zoos get these animals that can\'t survive on their own in the wild because they\'re injured, they\'re','source_text'=>'>> Bergantung, sebab kadang-kadang zoo selamatkan haiwan yang tak mampu hidup sendiri di alam liar sebab cedera,','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1015.28,'end_time'=>1017.78,'target_text'=>'hurt, or they lost their parents, so they had to raise it.','source_text'=>'sakit, atau kehilangan ibu bapa, jadi pihak zoo kena pelihara haiwan tu.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1017.88,'end_time'=>1021.62,'target_text'=>'And then once you\'re raised in a zoo, you can\'t be put back into the wild easily.','source_text'=>'Dan bila haiwan dah dibesarkan dalam jagaan manusia, bukan mudah nak lepaskan semula ke hutan rimba.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1021.72,'end_time'=>1022.74,'target_text'=>'They just keep them in a zoo.','source_text'=>'Jadi diorang jaga terus dalam zoo.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1022.84,'end_time'=>1027.82,'target_text'=>'It could be good, but if they take animals that can\'t survive alone and that don\'t really need to be in a zoo, and they take','source_text'=>'Itu tujuan yang baik, tapi kalau zoo tangkap haiwan yang sihat yang tak perlukan kurungan zoo, dan ambil','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1027.92,'end_time'=>1031.54,'target_text'=>'it and just put it like put them on a show just for people just to make money.','source_text'=>'semata-mata untuk jadikan tontonan orang ramai demi buat duit keuntungan,','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1031.64,'end_time'=>1032.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s not good.','source_text'=>'itu memang tak bagus.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1032.36,'end_time'=>1035.98,'target_text'=>'But, I believe this zoo does take care of animals, and that\'s why it\'s good.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya percaya zoo ini menjaga kebajikan haiwan dengan baik, dan itu perkara positif.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1036.08,'end_time'=>1037.02,'target_text'=>'What\'s your thoughts on that?','source_text'=>'Apa pandangan awak tentang hal tu?','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1037.12,'end_time'=>1038.1,'target_text'=>'You you have a different opinion?','source_text'=>'Awak ada pandangan berbeza ke?','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1038.2,'end_time'=>1041.74,'target_text'=>'>> No, I I think Walker covered the the amazing points.','source_text'=>'>> Takde, saya rasa Walker dah huraikan hujah yang sangat bernas.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1041.84,'end_time'=>1046.1,'target_text'=>'As the great guy he is, he always comes up with great ideas.','source_text'=>'Macam biasa, dia seorang yang hebat dan selalu beri pandangan bernas.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1046.2,'end_time'=>1048.66,'target_text'=>'>> You see, I don\'t know if that\'s sarcasm or not.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak tak, saya tak tahu sama ada itu sindiran sarkastik atau pujian ikhlas.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1048.76,'end_time'=>1049.9,'target_text'=>'But I\'ll take the compliment.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya terima je pujian tu.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1050,'end_time'=>1050.54,'target_text'=>'>> He\'s a good guy.','source_text'=>'>> Dia seorang kawan yang baik.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1050.64,'end_time'=>1051.78,'target_text'=>'He supports animals.','source_text'=>'Dia menyokong kebajikan haiwan.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1051.88,'end_time'=>1053.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, you can see better from this angle.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, dari sudut sini kita boleh nampak dengan lebih jelas.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1053.4,'end_time'=>1055.26,'target_text'=>'>> I support animal rights.','source_text'=>'>> Saya sokong hak asasi haiwan.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1055.36,'end_time'=>1057.46,'target_text'=>'>> I That That guy doesn\'t look happy, man.','source_text'=>'>> Dubuk tu langsung tak nampak gembira, weh.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1057.56,'end_time'=>1059.38,'target_text'=>'>> Well, he just looks like he\'s sleeping.','source_text'=>'>> Alah, dia cuma nampak macam tengah tidur je.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1059.48,'end_time'=>1060.9,'target_text'=>'>> What does he do to be tired?','source_text'=>'>> Apa je yang dia buat sampai letih sangat?','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1061,'end_time'=>1061.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s the question.','source_text'=>'Itu persoalannya.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1062.04,'end_time'=>1062.74,'target_text'=>'>> that ball there?','source_text'=>'>> bola kat sana tu?','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1062.84,'end_time'=>1064.18,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, what does my dog do to be tired?','source_text'=>'>> Weh, anjing saya pun buat apa sampai letih? Dia tidur sepanjang hari juga.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1064.28,'end_time'=>1065.5,'target_text'=>'He sleeps all day.','source_text'=>'Dia tidur sepanjang hari.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1065.6,'end_time'=>1067.14,'target_text'=>'>> You see that You see that bully there?','source_text'=>'>> Awak nampak tak bola mainan kat situ?','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1067.24,'end_time'=>1068.34,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, he plays with that?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, dia main dengan bola tu ke?','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1068.44,'end_time'=>1069.5,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s like his punching bag.','source_text'=>'>> Tu macam beg latihan tinju dia.','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1069.6,'end_time'=>1070.46,'target_text'=>'And you see this?','source_text'=>'Dan awak nampak ni?','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1070.56,'end_time'=>1074.9,'target_text'=>'He has like a dock, like a ramp, and he jumps into the empty pool.','source_text'=>'Ada tebing macam laluan landai, dan dia boleh melompat ke dalam kolam kering tu.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1075,'end_time'=>1076.06,'target_text'=>'And it\'s also the middle of the day.','source_text'=>'Lagipun sekarang tengah hari tegak.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1076.16,'end_time'=>1077.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s like right now, yeah.','source_text'=>'Memang waktu sekarang ni panas terik.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1077.2,'end_time'=>1079.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s almost noon, so that\'s about to be the hottest time of day.','source_text'=>'Dah hampir tengah hari, waktu paling panas membakar.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1079.36,'end_time'=>1081.74,'target_text'=>'So, I think animals usually rest during this time.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa kebiasaannya haiwan memang berehat masa cuaca panas macam ni.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1081.84,'end_time'=>1083.7,'target_text'=>'Okay, maybe here we have lions.','source_text'=>'Okey, mungkin kat bahagian sini ada singa.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1083.8,'end_time'=>1084.3,'target_text'=>'Let\'s check it.','source_text'=>'Jom kita periksa.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1084.4,'end_time'=>1088.26,'target_text'=>'You guys answer this too in the comments, or take a video of yourself answering this.','source_text'=>'Korang pun jawab juga soalan ni di ruangan komen, atau rakam video korang menjawab soalan ini.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1088.36,'end_time'=>1091.06,'target_text'=>'Which animal would be the best bodyguard?','source_text'=>'Haiwan mana yang paling sesuai jadi pengawal peribadi (bodyguard) terbaik?','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1091.16,'end_time'=>1091.56,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wait.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, kejap.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1091.64,'end_time'=>1092.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, look at that.','source_text'=>'Okey, tengok kat sana tu.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1092.4,'end_time'=>1093.66,'target_text'=>'The black What is it?','source_text'=>'Warna hitam... Haiwan apa tu?','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1093.76,'end_time'=>1094.78,'target_text'=>'Black tiger?','source_text'=>'Harimau hitam ke?','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1094.88,'end_time'=>1095.58,'target_text'=>'>> Did you see it?','source_text'=>'>> Awak nampak tak?','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1095.68,'end_time'=>1096.58,'target_text'=>'>> Black panther?','source_text'=>'>> Harimau kumbang (black panther)?','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1096.68,'end_time'=>1097.74,'target_text'=>'>> Black panther, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, harimau kumbang.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1097.84,'end_time'=>1098.38,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, wah.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1098.48,'end_time'=>1099.18,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, hebatnya.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1099.28,'end_time'=>1101.14,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, that looks like a good bodyguard.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya, haiwan ni memang nampak macam bodyguard yang mantap.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1101.24,'end_time'=>1101.66,'target_text'=>'Look at it.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah badan dia.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1101.76,'end_time'=>1103.86,'target_text'=>'Just >> It just kind of looks like a big cat.','source_text'=>'Cuma... >> Rupa dia macam kucing gergasi je.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1103.96,'end_time'=>1106.66,'target_text'=>'So, which animal would be the best bodyguard?','source_text'=>'Jadi, haiwan apa yang paling sesuai jadi pengawal peribadi?','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1106.76,'end_time'=>1107.66,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe a bear?','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin beruang?','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1107.76,'end_time'=>1108.18,'target_text'=>'>> Which bear?','source_text'=>'>> Beruang spesis mana?','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1108.28,'end_time'=>1109.06,'target_text'=>'>> Grizzly bear.','source_text'=>'>> Beruang grizzly.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1109.16,'end_time'=>1109.66,'target_text'=>'>> Grizzly bear?','source_text'=>'>> Beruang grizzly?','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1109.76,'end_time'=>1110.22,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s big.','source_text'=>'>> Badan dia besar.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1110.32,'end_time'=>1111.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s fast.','source_text'=>'Lari pun laju.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1111.32,'end_time'=>1113.46,'target_text'=>'>> You can see his like the print on him.','source_text'=>'>> Awak boleh nampak corak tompok pada bulu dia.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1113.56,'end_time'=>1115.22,'target_text'=>'Oh, that looks like a female, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Oh, nampak macam betina kan?','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1115.32,'end_time'=>1115.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1115.92,'end_time'=>1117.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, wow.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, wah.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1117.4,'end_time'=>1119.02,'target_text'=>'>> It kind of has that like pattern on it.','source_text'=>'>> Ada corak tompok bunga kat bulunya.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1119.12,'end_time'=>1120.54,'target_text'=>'I thought it would just be pure black.','source_text'=>'Saya ingatkan bulunya hitam legam kosong je.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1120.64,'end_time'=>1122.14,'target_text'=>'Wow, that\'s actually super cool.','source_text'=>'Wah, memang sangat unik dan menarik.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1122.24,'end_time'=>1124.34,'target_text'=>'>> Well, you think this guy came to check us out?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa dia datang dekat sebab nak tengok kita ke?','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1124.44,'end_time'=>1125.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1125.4,'end_time'=>1127.06,'target_text'=>'>> I think that\'s a girl, but >> Maybe she\'s pregnant.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa tu betina, tapi... >> Mungkin dia tengah bunting.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1127.16,'end_time'=>1129.58,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, that literally just looks like a fat cat, man.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, rupa dia sebiji macam kucing gemuk yang gebu.','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1129.68,'end_time'=>1130.98,'target_text'=>'Like a big fat cat.','source_text'=>'Macam kucing gergasi yang tembam.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1131.08,'end_time'=>1131.7,'target_text'=>'Okay, let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Okey, jom kita teruskan jalan.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1131.8,'end_time'=>1133.5,'target_text'=>'It looks like it wants to rest over there.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya dia nak pergi berehat kat sebelah sana.','order'=>464],
            ['start_time'=>1133.6,'end_time'=>1136.54,'target_text'=>'Dude, you would pet that like it\'s a cat, and then it would just start attacking you.','source_text'=>'Weh, kalau awak belai dia macam kucing jinak, silap haribulan kena baham terus.','order'=>465],
            ['start_time'=>1136.64,'end_time'=>1137.7,'target_text'=>'>> Well, acts like a cat.','source_text'=>'>> Perangai memang sebiji macam kucing.','order'=>466],
            ['start_time'=>1137.8,'end_time'=>1138.2,'target_text'=>'That\'s the thing.','source_text'=>'Itulah masalahnya.','order'=>467],
            ['start_time'=>1138.2,'end_time'=>1140.26,'target_text'=>'>> It literally Well, I mean, it is.','source_text'=>'>> Memang sah, sebab hakikatnya...','order'=>468],
            ['start_time'=>1140.36,'end_time'=>1142.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the same family, like felines, right?','source_text'=>'Kan satu keluarga haiwan felin (kucing) juga kan?','order'=>469],
            ['start_time'=>1142.88,'end_time'=>1143.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, panther.','source_text'=>'Ya, spesis panther.','order'=>470],
            ['start_time'=>1143.72,'end_time'=>1145.74,'target_text'=>'Panthera Oh, a leopard.','source_text'=>'Panthera... Oh, harimau bintang (leopard) rupanya.','order'=>471],
            ['start_time'=>1145.84,'end_time'=>1146.46,'target_text'=>'We were tripping, dude.','source_text'=>'Kita berdua tersalah teka tadi, weh.','order'=>472],
            ['start_time'=>1146.56,'end_time'=>1148.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s a leopard, a black leopard.','source_text'=>'Ia harimau bintang hitam (black leopard).','order'=>473],
            ['start_time'=>1148.36,'end_time'=>1149.98,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, it had the leopard print.','source_text'=>'Sebab tulah ada corak tompok harimau bintang pada bulunya.','order'=>474],
            ['start_time'=>1150.08,'end_time'=>1150.7,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>475],
            ['start_time'=>1150.8,'end_time'=>1153.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, cuz it had this pattern on, but it was black.','source_text'=>'Ya, sebab ada corak tompok tapi bulunya warna hitam.','order'=>476],
            ['start_time'=>1153.68,'end_time'=>1154.22,'target_text'=>'Hm.','source_text'=>'Hmm.','order'=>477],
            ['start_time'=>1154.32,'end_time'=>1156.22,'target_text'=>'Anyways, back to answering the question.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, berbalik kepada menjawab soalan tadi.','order'=>478],
            ['start_time'=>1156.32,'end_time'=>1162.58,'target_text'=>'So, Apton said a bear would be the best bodyguard, and me, I would choose an eagle, straight up.','source_text'=>'Apton pilih beruang sebagai pengawal peribadi terbaik, dan saya pula terus pilih helang.','order'=>479],
            ['start_time'=>1162.68,'end_time'=>1164.66,'target_text'=>'Or is there a third option that\'s even better?','source_text'=>'Atau ada pilihan ketiga yang jauh lebih mantap?','order'=>480],
            ['start_time'=>1164.76,'end_time'=>1166.84,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually >> A shark.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya... >> Ikan jerung.','order'=>481],
            ['start_time'=>1167.2,'end_time'=>1168.46,'target_text'=>'>> No, a gorilla.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, gorila.','order'=>482],
            ['start_time'=>1168.56,'end_time'=>1169.86,'target_text'=>'>> Actually, I feel like, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Sebenarnya saya rasa... ya betul juga.','order'=>483],
            ['start_time'=>1169.96,'end_time'=>1170.94,'target_text'=>'I would go with a gorilla, man.','source_text'=>'Saya pilih gorila lah, weh.','order'=>484],
            ['start_time'=>1171.04,'end_time'=>1172.66,'target_text'=>'I could just sit on the gorilla\'s back.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh duduk atas belakang gorila tu.','order'=>485],
            ['start_time'=>1172.76,'end_time'=>1173.9,'target_text'=>'It\'d be like a piggyback, dude.','source_text'=>'Dia boleh dukung saya kat belakang dia, weh.','order'=>486],
            ['start_time'=>1174,'end_time'=>1175.26,'target_text'=>'New choice, gorilla.','source_text'=>'Pilihan baharu saya: gorila.','order'=>487],
            ['start_time'=>1175.36,'end_time'=>1177.02,'target_text'=>'Would you stay with your bear or go with a gorilla?','source_text'=>'Awak nak kekal dengan beruang atau tukar kepada gorila?','order'=>488],
            ['start_time'=>1177.12,'end_time'=>1179.82,'target_text'=>'>> Well, if the gorilla is stronger, yeah, then I\'m going with the gorilla.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau gorila lebih kuat, ya saya pun pilih gorila.','order'=>489],
            ['start_time'=>1179.92,'end_time'=>1181.18,'target_text'=>'>> A silverback gorilla, though.','source_text'=>'>> Gorila jenis \'silverback\' pulak tu.','order'=>490],
            ['start_time'=>1181.28,'end_time'=>1182.06,'target_text'=>'What do you guys think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat korang semua?','order'=>491],
            ['start_time'=>1182.16,'end_time'=>1183.26,'target_text'=>'Which would win in a fight?','source_text'=>'Antara beruang dan gorila, mana yang akan menang dalam pertarungan?','order'=>492],
            ['start_time'=>1183.36,'end_time'=>1186.22,'target_text'=>'A grizzly bear or a silverback gorilla?','source_text'=>'Antara beruang grizzly atau gorila silverback?','order'=>493],
            ['start_time'=>1186.32,'end_time'=>1187.3,'target_text'=>'Which one of the two?','source_text'=>'Yang mana satu antara dua tu?','order'=>494],
            ['start_time'=>1187.4,'end_time'=>1188.38,'target_text'=>'>> We just will never know.','source_text'=>'>> Kita memang takkan tahu jawapannya.','order'=>495],
            ['start_time'=>1188.48,'end_time'=>1194.18,'target_text'=>'>> I feel like this is like a tale of like King Kong versus Godzilla, minus like the atomic power.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa macam kisah pertarungan King Kong lawan Godzilla, cuma tolak kuasa atomik jelah.','order'=>496],
            ['start_time'=>1194.28,'end_time'=>1201.22,'target_text'=>'I honestly think a gorilla would win, cuz I do think a gorilla is stronger, and also it has like movement, like hand movement.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya saya rasa gorila akan menang, sebab saya rasa gorila lebih kuat dan ada ketangkasan hayunan tangan.','order'=>497],
            ['start_time'=>1201.32,'end_time'=>1206.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I think maybe a bear can run faster, but imagine being a bear and getting like hit in the face by a right hook from','source_text'=>'Ya, mungkin beruang lari lebih laju, tapi bayangkan muka beruang kena tumbukan \'right hook\' padu daripada','order'=>498],
            ['start_time'=>1206.72,'end_time'=>1208.98,'target_text'=>'a like thousand kilogram silverback gorilla.','source_text'=>'seekor gorila silverback seberat ratusan kilogram.','order'=>499],
            ['start_time'=>1209.08,'end_time'=>1210.42,'target_text'=>'I think we have to give it to the gorilla.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kemenangan patut diberi kepada gorila.','order'=>500],
            ['start_time'=>1210.52,'end_time'=>1215.9,'target_text'=>'If gorillas are stronger, bite harder, and have better movement in close range, then it has to be.','source_text'=>'Kalau gorila lebih kuat, gigitan lebih padu, dan lebih lincah berlawan jarak dekat, memang gorilalah menang.','order'=>501],
            ['start_time'=>1216,'end_time'=>1217.42,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s a fat squirrel.','source_text'=>'>> Gemuk betul tupai tu.','order'=>502],
            ['start_time'=>1217.52,'end_time'=>1218.74,'target_text'=>'>> Black giant squirrel.','source_text'=>'>> Tupai gergasi hitam (black giant squirrel).','order'=>503],
            ['start_time'=>1218.84,'end_time'=>1219.74,'target_text'=>'Holy moly.','source_text'=>'Mak aih, besarnya.','order'=>504],
            ['start_time'=>1219.84,'end_time'=>1220.26,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'>> Oh.','order'=>505],
            ['start_time'=>1220.36,'end_time'=>1221.78,'target_text'=>'>> Are these flying squirrels?','source_text'=>'>> Ni tupai terbang ke?','order'=>506],
            ['start_time'=>1221.88,'end_time'=>1223.1,'target_text'=>'>> It says right there in that picture.','source_text'=>'>> Tertulis kat papan tanda gambar tu.','order'=>507],
            ['start_time'=>1223.2,'end_time'=>1225.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s bigger than the ones they have in Edmonton, that\'s for sure.','source_text'=>'Saiznya jauh lebih besar daripada tupai di Edmonton, memang sah.','order'=>508],
            ['start_time'=>1225.6,'end_time'=>1226.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, squirrel.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, tupai.','order'=>509],
            ['start_time'=>1226.72,'end_time'=>1228.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s the size of a cat.','source_text'=>'Saiz dia sebesar seekor kucing.','order'=>510],
            ['start_time'=>1228.32,'end_time'=>1229.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>511],
            ['start_time'=>1229.16,'end_time'=>1231.02,'target_text'=>'A squirrel.','source_text'=>'Seekor tupai.','order'=>512],
            ['start_time'=>1231.12,'end_time'=>1233.18,'target_text'=>'Okay, we found the tiger.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita dah jumpa harimau.','order'=>513],
            ['start_time'=>1233.28,'end_time'=>1238.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s like it\'s so hard to see cuz of the glare, but it\'s way at the back corner there, behind the bamboo.','source_text'=>'Susah nak nampak sebab silau cermin, tapi harimau tu ada nun jauh di sudut belakang sana, di sebalik pokok buluh.','order'=>514],
            ['start_time'=>1238.32,'end_time'=>1242.62,'target_text'=>'Dude, and it\'s just like staring >> And that thing looks like a painting on the wall.','source_text'=>'Weh, dia tengah tenung kita... >> Rupa dia nampak macam lukisan kat dinding je.','order'=>515],
            ['start_time'=>1242.72,'end_time'=>1243.82,'target_text'=>'>> Literally.','source_text'=>'>> Memang sebiji macam lukisan.','order'=>516],
            ['start_time'=>1243.92,'end_time'=>1246.86,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, let\'s try to see if we could see it better from this side.','source_text'=>'>> Jom cuba tengok dari sebelah sini kalau boleh nampak lebih jelas.','order'=>517],
            ['start_time'=>1246.96,'end_time'=>1251.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, it was kind of hard to see the tiger, but at least we got to see its face a little bit, but dude, that thing is like','source_text'=>'Okey, agak susah nak nampak harimau tadi, tapi sekurang-kurangnya kita dapat tengok mukanya sikit, tapi weh, haiwan tu','order'=>518],
            ['start_time'=>1251.72,'end_time'=>1252.08,'target_text'=>'scary.','source_text'=>'menakutkan betul.','order'=>519],
            ['start_time'=>1252.08,'end_time'=>1256.54,'target_text'=>'I know tigers are definitely one of like the scarier big cats, but that thing, wow.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu harimau antara kucing besar paling digeruni, tapi bila tengok depan mata, fuh.','order'=>520],
            ['start_time'=>1256.64,'end_time'=>1257.74,'target_text'=>'At least we saw it, honestly.','source_text'=>'Sekurang-kurangnya kita sempat tengok tadi, sejujurnya.','order'=>521],
            ['start_time'=>1257.84,'end_time'=>1259.62,'target_text'=>'Now, I just want to see the lion, and I\'ll be happy.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya cuma nak tengok singa, lepas tu barulah rasa puas hati.','order'=>522],
            ['start_time'=>1259.72,'end_time'=>1260.3,'target_text'=>'We found the lion.','source_text'=>'Kita dah jumpa singa.','order'=>523],
            ['start_time'=>1260.4,'end_time'=>1262.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s literally right in the open now.','source_text'=>'Dia tengah baring di kawasan lapang terbuka sekarang.','order'=>524],
            ['start_time'=>1262.12,'end_time'=>1264.26,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, it doesn\'t look that big in person.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya, bila tengok depan mata saiz dia takdelah nampak besar sangat.','order'=>525],
            ['start_time'=>1264.36,'end_time'=>1267.14,'target_text'=>'>> No, I\'m telling you, I think the animals here are smaller.','source_text'=>'>> Kan saya dah kata, saiz haiwan dalam zoo ni memang nampak lebih kecil.','order'=>526],
            ['start_time'=>1267.24,'end_time'=>1270.22,'target_text'=>'>> I think tigers are more dangerous than lions, though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi saya rasa harimau lebih berbahaya berbanding singa.','order'=>527],
            ['start_time'=>1270.32,'end_time'=>1273.38,'target_text'=>'But yeah, that\'s a lion, the king of the jungle.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, itulah singa, raja rimba.','order'=>528],
            ['start_time'=>1273.48,'end_time'=>1274.06,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>529],
            ['start_time'=>1274.16,'end_time'=>1276.5,'target_text'=>'>> So yeah, here you can see the white lion.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi kat sini korang boleh nampak singa putih.','order'=>530],
            ['start_time'=>1276.6,'end_time'=>1279.66,'target_text'=>'He really looks like like a not really like a good lion.','source_text'=>'Rupa dia nampak macam singa yang kurang terurus.','order'=>531],
            ['start_time'=>1279.76,'end_time'=>1283.82,'target_text'=>'Usually they have like the huge like lion\'s mane, but here he doesn\'t.','source_text'=>'Biasanya singa jantan ada surai bulu leher yang lebat mengembang, tapi yang ni takde.','order'=>532],
            ['start_time'=>1283.92,'end_time'=>1286.1,'target_text'=>'And he kind of has like some scars on his face.','source_text'=>'Dan muka dia macam ada beberapa kesan parut luka.','order'=>533],
            ['start_time'=>1286.2,'end_time'=>1292.06,'target_text'=>'>> No, but you know, I think the difference is like eating Asian food in Europe versus eating Asian food in Asia.','source_text'=>'>> Taklah, tapi awak tahu perbezaannya macam makan makanan Asia di Eropah berbanding makan makanan Asia di benua Asia sendiri.','order'=>534],
            ['start_time'=>1292.16,'end_time'=>1295.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the lions in Africa are obviously going to be more of a lion then.','source_text'=>'Mestilah singa di benua Afrika jauh lebih nampak gagah macam singa sebenar.','order'=>535],
            ['start_time'=>1295.84,'end_time'=>1297.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, like if you go on a safari.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, macam kalau pergi lawatan safari liar.','order'=>536],
            ['start_time'=>1297.48,'end_time'=>1301.58,'target_text'=>'But I like how the whole continent of Africa has lions except for like here.','source_text'=>'Tapi uniknya seluruh benua Afrika ada singa kecuali habitat asal tempat macam ni.','order'=>537],
            ['start_time'=>1301.68,'end_time'=>1302.78,'target_text'=>'>> Here\'s the female lion.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ini pula singa betina.','order'=>538],
            ['start_time'=>1302.88,'end_time'=>1304.38,'target_text'=>'She\'s also just resting.','source_text'=>'Dia pun tengah berehat santai juga.','order'=>539],
            ['start_time'=>1304.48,'end_time'=>1306.22,'target_text'=>'But honestly, this looks like a good setup.','source_text'=>'Tapi sejujurnya kandang ni nampak selesa.','order'=>540],
            ['start_time'=>1306.32,'end_time'=>1308.02,'target_text'=>'>> This setup is a lot better than the guys.','source_text'=>'>> Tempat tinggal singa betina ni jauh lebih elok daripada singa jantan tadi.','order'=>541],
            ['start_time'=>1308.12,'end_time'=>1310.26,'target_text'=>'Like here she has white noise >> There\'s three of them.','source_text'=>'Kandang dia ada bunyi air tenang... >> Ada tiga ekor singa semuanya.','order'=>542],
            ['start_time'=>1310.36,'end_time'=>1311.06,'target_text'=>'Three of them.','source_text'=>'Tiga ekor kesemuanya.','order'=>543],
            ['start_time'=>1311.16,'end_time'=>1312.1,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya.','order'=>544],
            ['start_time'=>1312.2,'end_time'=>1314.1,'target_text'=>'>> You think they\'re all married to the same lion?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa ketiga-tiga singa betina ni berkahwin dengan singa jantan yang sama ke?','order'=>545],
            ['start_time'=>1314.2,'end_time'=>1314.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, mestilah.','order'=>546],
            ['start_time'=>1314.72,'end_time'=>1318.18,'target_text'=>'Usually it\'s like a pack like that, like one male for a bunch of females.','source_text'=>'Biasanya kawanan singa memang macam tu, seekor singa jantan untuk sekumpulan singa betina.','order'=>547],
            ['start_time'=>1318.28,'end_time'=>1321.74,'target_text'=>'That\'s why they have to fight other males off, and that\'s why they need their energy.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu singa jantan kena bertarung usir jantan lain, dan perlukan banyak tenaga.','order'=>548],
            ['start_time'=>1321.84,'end_time'=>1322.46,'target_text'=>'Female lion.','source_text'=>'Singa betina.','order'=>549],
            ['start_time'=>1322.56,'end_time'=>1323.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom gerak.','order'=>550],
            ['start_time'=>1323.16,'end_time'=>1325.7,'target_text'=>'>> If you had to choose, where would you live?','source_text'=>'>> Kalau awak diberi pilihan, awak nak tinggal di mana?','order'=>551],
            ['start_time'=>1325.8,'end_time'=>1331.94,'target_text'=>'>> In the city, you know, city life, urban, metropolis, or would you rather live in nature?','source_text'=>'>> Di bandar besar yang serba moden, metropolitan, atau awak lebih suka tinggal di kawasan alam semula jadi?','order'=>552],
            ['start_time'=>1332.04,'end_time'=>1334.14,'target_text'=>'With the animals, or like on a farm.','source_text'=>'Bersama haiwan-haiwan, atau di kawasan ladang ternakan.','order'=>553],
            ['start_time'=>1334.24,'end_time'=>1335.02,'target_text'=>'What would you prefer?','source_text'=>'Mana satu pilihan hati awak?','order'=>554],
            ['start_time'=>1335.12,'end_time'=>1341.46,'target_text'=>'>> I would probably choose the nature, but a more realistic answer I would probably just say a mix.','source_text'=>'>> Saya mungkin pilih alam semula jadi, tapi jawapan yang lebih realistik ialah gabungan kedua-duanya.','order'=>555],
            ['start_time'=>1341.56,'end_time'=>1344.78,'target_text'=>'Some city like Vancouver, maybe even Calgary.','source_text'=>'Bandar seperti Vancouver, atau mungkin Calgary.','order'=>556],
            ['start_time'=>1344.88,'end_time'=>1349.02,'target_text'=>'So close to the mountains, or if it\'s Vancouver just by the ocean, by the mountains.','source_text'=>'Dekat dengan pergunungan, atau macam Vancouver dekat dengan laut dan gunung.','order'=>557],
            ['start_time'=>1349.12,'end_time'=>1351.22,'target_text'=>'So something like that would be very ideal.','source_text'=>'Jadi suasana macam tu paling ideal untuk saya.','order'=>558],
            ['start_time'=>1351.32,'end_time'=>1354.3,'target_text'=>'I think that would be the ideal scenario for me.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu senario kehidupan paling sempurna bagi saya.','order'=>559],
            ['start_time'=>1354.4,'end_time'=>1356.3,'target_text'=>'>> I do agree with Calgary.','source_text'=>'>> Saya pun setuju tentang bandar Calgary.','order'=>560],
            ['start_time'=>1356.4,'end_time'=>1361.66,'target_text'=>'I would not live in Vancouver just cuz so expensive, taxes are high, and the ocean is freezing cold anyways.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan tinggal di Vancouver sebab kos hidup mahal gila, cukai tinggi, dan air lautnya sejuk beku.','order'=>561],
            ['start_time'=>1361.76,'end_time'=>1364.3,'target_text'=>'If I had to live in any city in Canada, I would live in Calgary.','source_text'=>'Kalau kena tinggal di mana-mana bandar di Kanada, saya akan pilih Calgary.','order'=>562],
            ['start_time'=>1364.4,'end_time'=>1369.5,'target_text'=>'If I had to choose between city life or nature life, I lived on a farm my whole life.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau kena pilih antara kehidupan bandar atau alam semula jadi, saya dah hidup di ladang sepanjang hayat saya.','order'=>563],
            ['start_time'=>1369.6,'end_time'=>1373.54,'target_text'=>'So I think I\'ve had enough nature living for my entire life.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa saya dah cukup puas tinggal di kawasan luar bandar.','order'=>564],
            ['start_time'=>1373.64,'end_time'=>1374.78,'target_text'=>'So I would choose city life.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu saya akan pilih kehidupan di bandar.','order'=>565],
            ['start_time'=>1374.88,'end_time'=>1380.02,'target_text'=>'I like like the fast-paced, so many people, a lot of like different people you can meet every day.','source_text'=>'Saya suka rentak hidup pantas, ramai orang, dan boleh jumpa pelbagai jenis individu setiap hari.','order'=>566],
            ['start_time'=>1380.12,'end_time'=>1384.26,'target_text'=>'You could go around the city and see something new all the time, so it\'s me, city life for sure.','source_text'=>'Boleh pusing keliling bandar tengok benda baharu sepanjang masa, jadi bagi saya tentulah kehidupan bandar.','order'=>567],
            ['start_time'=>1384.36,'end_time'=>1389.34,'target_text'=>'And like a giant giant metropolis city like Seoul, Bangkok, Shanghai.','source_text'=>'Terutamanya bandar raya metropolitan gergasi macam Seoul, Bangkok, atau Shanghai.','order'=>568],
            ['start_time'=>1389.44,'end_time'=>1391.18,'target_text'=>'Like where would you guys prefer to live?','source_text'=>'Korang semua pula lebih suka tinggal di mana?','order'=>569],
            ['start_time'=>1391.28,'end_time'=>1394.06,'target_text'=>'In the city or on a farm in nature?','source_text'=>'Di bandar atau di kawasan ladang alam semula jadi?','order'=>570],
            ['start_time'=>1394.16,'end_time'=>1394.9,'target_text'=>'What do you prefer?','source_text'=>'Mana yang korang lebih suka?','order'=>571],
            ['start_time'=>1395,'end_time'=>1397.78,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t have to be on a farm, but in nature or in a city?','source_text'=>'Tak semestinya di ladang, tapi sama ada di alam hijau atau di bandar raya?','order'=>572],
            ['start_time'=>1397.88,'end_time'=>1399.02,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>573],
            ['start_time'=>1399.12,'end_time'=>1400.7,'target_text'=>'Okay, so here are the tortoises.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita sampai di tempat kura-kura gergasi.','order'=>574],
            ['start_time'=>1400.8,'end_time'=>1403.26,'target_text'=>'What are those two tortoises doing over there?','source_text'=>'Apa yang dua ekor kura-kura kat sana tu tengah buat?','order'=>575],
            ['start_time'=>1403.36,'end_time'=>1404.34,'target_text'=>'Any guesses?','source_text'=>'Ada sesiapa boleh teka?','order'=>576],
            ['start_time'=>1404.44,'end_time'=>1408.82,'target_text'=>'Apton, would you say you\'re faster than a tortoise or slower than a tortoise?','source_text'=>'Apton, awak rasa awak lebih laju daripada kura-kura atau lebih lambat?','order'=>577],
            ['start_time'=>1408.92,'end_time'=>1410.82,'target_text'=>'>> I would say faster.','source_text'=>'>> Mestilah saya lebih laju.','order'=>578],
            ['start_time'=>1410.92,'end_time'=>1411.78,'target_text'=>'100%.','source_text'=>'100% gerenti laju.','order'=>579],
            ['start_time'=>1411.88,'end_time'=>1414.34,'target_text'=>'>> Would you say you\'re faster or slower than a hare?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa awak lebih laju atau lebih lambat berbanding arnab (hare)?','order'=>580],
            ['start_time'=>1414.44,'end_time'=>1415.42,'target_text'=>'>> Than a hare?','source_text'=>'>> Berbanding arnab?','order'=>581],
            ['start_time'=>1415.52,'end_time'=>1416.62,'target_text'=>'>> Like a like a rabbit.','source_text'=>'>> Macam arnab hutan.','order'=>582],
            ['start_time'=>1416.72,'end_time'=>1418.58,'target_text'=>'You know the tortoise and the hare when they race.','source_text'=>'Kan ada kisah perlumbaan kura-kura dengan arnab tu.','order'=>583],
            ['start_time'=>1418.68,'end_time'=>1420.9,'target_text'=>'>> Uh honestly, rabbits are pretty fast.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya arnab memang laju gila.','order'=>584],
            ['start_time'=>1421,'end_time'=>1424.1,'target_text'=>'I would say yeah, slower than a rabbit, faster than a turtle.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ya, saya lebih lambat daripada arnab, tapi lebih laju daripada kura-kura.','order'=>585],
            ['start_time'=>1424.2,'end_time'=>1427.9,'target_text'=>'Feel like you expected a different answer, but I\'m very logical.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam awak jangkakan jawapan lain, tapi saya berfikir secara logik.','order'=>586],
            ['start_time'=>1428,'end_time'=>1431.02,'target_text'=>'I only >> He is he is like >> I don\'t do ifs, buts, or maybes.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma... >> Dia seorang yang... >> Saya tak layan andaian atau alasan.','order'=>587],
            ['start_time'=>1431.12,'end_time'=>1432.98,'target_text'=>'>> He\'s only He\'s only black or white.','source_text'=>'>> Bagi dia semuanya hitam atau putih je.','order'=>588],
            ['start_time'=>1433.08,'end_time'=>1434.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s good or it\'s bad.','source_text'=>'Sama ada elok atau buruk.','order'=>589],
            ['start_time'=>1435.08,'end_time'=>1435.66,'target_text'=>'Yes or no.','source_text'=>'Ya atau tidak.','order'=>590],
            ['start_time'=>1435.76,'end_time'=>1436.42,'target_text'=>'No maybe.','source_text'=>'Tiada istilah mungkin.','order'=>591],
            ['start_time'=>1436.52,'end_time'=>1436.92,'target_text'=>'That\'s good.','source_text'=>'Baguslah macam tu.','order'=>592],
            ['start_time'=>1436.96,'end_time'=>1438.38,'target_text'=>'He\'s Is he faster than a hare?','source_text'=>'Adakah dia lebih laju daripada arnab?','order'=>593],
            ['start_time'=>1438.48,'end_time'=>1438.9,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tidak.','order'=>594],
            ['start_time'=>1439,'end_time'=>1440.26,'target_text'=>'Is he faster than a tortoise?','source_text'=>'Adakah dia lebih laju daripada kura-kura?','order'=>595],
            ['start_time'=>1440.36,'end_time'=>1440.86,'target_text'=>'Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>596],
            ['start_time'=>1440.96,'end_time'=>1445.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m faster than you, so I\'m faster than all of them, so yes.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih laju daripada awak, jadi saya lebih laju daripada semua haiwan tu, jadi ya.','order'=>597],
            ['start_time'=>1445.56,'end_time'=>1446.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>598],
            ['start_time'=>1446.16,'end_time'=>1449.9,'target_text'=>'We only have a few more animals to see here and then we\'ll be done.','source_text'=>'Tinggal beberapa ekor haiwan lagi untuk kita tengok kat sini sebelum habis.','order'=>599],
            ['start_time'=>1450,'end_time'=>1452.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s just this last section over here.','source_text'=>'Cuma bahagian terakhir di sebelah sini.','order'=>600],
            ['start_time'=>1452.2,'end_time'=>1452.98,'target_text'=>'I swam with these.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah berenang bersama haiwan ni.','order'=>601],
            ['start_time'=>1453.08,'end_time'=>1453.54,'target_text'=>'It was so nice.','source_text'=>'Pengalaman tu sangat seronok.','order'=>602],
            ['start_time'=>1453.64,'end_time'=>1457.42,'target_text'=>'They like swim super fast and they just zoom right by you and then they swim with each other.','source_text'=>'Diorang berenang sangat laju dan meluncur tepat di sebelah kita, lepas tu berenang sesama sendiri.','order'=>603],
            ['start_time'=>1457.52,'end_time'=>1458.74,'target_text'=>'Also sea lions.','source_text'=>'Singa laut (sea lions) pun ada juga.','order'=>604],
            ['start_time'=>1458.84,'end_time'=>1459.3,'target_text'=>'Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>605],
            ['start_time'=>1459.4,'end_time'=>1460.3,'target_text'=>'These guys look happy.','source_text'=>'Haiwan-haiwan ni nampak gembira.','order'=>606],
            ['start_time'=>1460.4,'end_time'=>1461.42,'target_text'=>'That guy kind of looks lost.','source_text'=>'Yang seekor tu nampak macam keliru dan sesat.','order'=>607],
            ['start_time'=>1461.52,'end_time'=>1463.54,'target_text'=>'Those guys up there kind of look like they\'re lost.','source_text'=>'Yang kat bahagian atas tu nampak macam bingung.','order'=>608],
            ['start_time'=>1463.64,'end_time'=>1465.58,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, low-key they got the AC running for them.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, siap ada pendingin hawa (aircond) dipasang untuk diorang.','order'=>609],
            ['start_time'=>1465.68,'end_time'=>1466.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul.','order'=>610],
            ['start_time'=>1466.4,'end_time'=>1468.54,'target_text'=>'Oh no, that guy looks like he\'s having a good time.','source_text'=>'Oh takdelah, yang seekor tu nampak tengah berseronok berenang.','order'=>611],
            ['start_time'=>1468.64,'end_time'=>1469.1,'target_text'=>'Penguins.','source_text'=>'Burung penguin.','order'=>612],
            ['start_time'=>1469.2,'end_time'=>1471.14,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, you think they\'re going to jump and they could jump out?','source_text'=>'>> Awak rasa diorang boleh melompat keluar dari kandang tu ke?','order'=>613],
            ['start_time'=>1471.24,'end_time'=>1473.3,'target_text'=>'>> Did you know, fun fact, oh they\'re fighting.','source_text'=>'>> Awak tahu tak fakta menarik... eh tengok diorang tengah bergaduh.','order'=>614],
            ['start_time'=>1473.4,'end_time'=>1478.38,'target_text'=>'Did you know that penguins only ever mate in their entire lifetime with one partner?','source_text'=>'Awak tahu tak yang penguin hanya mengawan dengan satu pasangan sahaja sepanjang hayat mereka?','order'=>615],
            ['start_time'=>1478.48,'end_time'=>1484.14,'target_text'=>'So if they die, then they\'ll they\'ll never ever get another partner again, so penguins mate for life, which is different than','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau pasangan dia mati, dia takkan sesekali cari pasangan lain lagi, penguin setia seumur hidup, berbeza daripada','order'=>616],
            ['start_time'=>1484.24,'end_time'=>1485.58,'target_text'=>'a lot of other animals.','source_text'=>'kebanyakan haiwan-haiwan lain.','order'=>617],
            ['start_time'=>1485.68,'end_time'=>1486.94,'target_text'=>'Guess someone\'s jealous.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya ada penguin yang cemburu tu.','order'=>618],
            ['start_time'=>1487.04,'end_time'=>1488.86,'target_text'=>'>> But smells like fish though.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi bau hanyir ikan kuat sangat kat sini.','order'=>619],
            ['start_time'=>1488.96,'end_time'=>1489.86,'target_text'=>'>> Well, what do you think they eat?','source_text'=>'>> Dah tu, awak rasa diorang makan apa?','order'=>620],
            ['start_time'=>1489.96,'end_time'=>1490.82,'target_text'=>'>> They eat fish.','source_text'=>'>> Diorang makan ikan.','order'=>621],
            ['start_time'=>1490.92,'end_time'=>1493.42,'target_text'=>'>> Oh yeah, a leopard seal, killer whale.','source_text'=>'>> Oh ya, anjing laut leopard, paus pembunuh (killer whale).','order'=>622],
            ['start_time'=>1493.52,'end_time'=>1498.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, leopard seals are like a big, you know, killer of penguins.','source_text'=>'Ya, anjing laut leopard adalah antara pemangsa utama penguin.','order'=>623],
            ['start_time'=>1498.16,'end_time'=>1500.18,'target_text'=>'And I know that from uh what\'s that movie?','source_text'=>'Dan saya tahu fakta tu daripada... cerita apa tu eh?','order'=>624],
            ['start_time'=>1500.28,'end_time'=>1500.74,'target_text'=>'Happy Feet.','source_text'=>'Filem Happy Feet.','order'=>625],
            ['start_time'=>1500.84,'end_time'=>1501.42,'target_text'=>'Have you watched that?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah tengok tak?','order'=>626],
            ['start_time'=>1501.52,'end_time'=>1501.92,'target_text'=>'>> Happy Feet?','source_text'=>'>> Filem Happy Feet?','order'=>627],
            ['start_time'=>1502,'end_time'=>1502.54,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>628],
            ['start_time'=>1502.64,'end_time'=>1503.26,'target_text'=>'>> Leopard seal.','source_text'=>'>> Anjing laut leopard.','order'=>629],
            ['start_time'=>1503.36,'end_time'=>1504.3,'target_text'=>'Killer whales as well.','source_text'=>'Paus pembunuh (orcas) pun sama juga.','order'=>630],
            ['start_time'=>1504.4,'end_time'=>1508.14,'target_text'=>'>> Didn\'t Happy Feet have a song that was famous?','source_text'=>'>> Happy Feet tu kan ada lagu yang sangat terkenal?','order'=>631],
            ['start_time'=>1508.24,'end_time'=>1509.78,'target_text'=>'Uh uh >> No idea.','source_text'=>'Uh uh... >> Tak tahu pula saya.','order'=>632],
            ['start_time'=>1509.88,'end_time'=>1513.06,'target_text'=>'Happy Feet, happy seat, happy meat.','source_text'=>'Happy Feet, happy seat, happy meat.','order'=>633],
            ['start_time'=>1513.16,'end_time'=>1517.42,'target_text'=>'So, we found the Asiatic black bears, or black bear cuz there\'s only one.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita dah jumpa beruang hitam Asia, atau beruang hitam tunggal sebab ada seekor je.','order'=>634],
            ['start_time'=>1517.52,'end_time'=>1519.74,'target_text'=>'And you can see he\'s just sunbathing over there on that rock.','source_text'=>'Dan korang boleh nampak dia tengah berjemur santai atas batu kat sana.','order'=>635],
            ['start_time'=>1519.84,'end_time'=>1520.78,'target_text'=>'What do you think of that, Apton?','source_text'=>'Apa pandangan awak pasal beruang tu, Apton?','order'=>636],
            ['start_time'=>1520.88,'end_time'=>1522.86,'target_text'=>'>> I wonder if you could leave that bear in nature.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tertanya-tanya kalau beruang ni dilepaskan ke alam liar boleh hidup ke tak.','order'=>637],
            ['start_time'=>1522.96,'end_time'=>1523.82,'target_text'=>'>> Bro, look at that thing.','source_text'=>'>> Weh, tengoklah gaya dia tu.','order'=>638],
            ['start_time'=>1523.92,'end_time'=>1524.94,'target_text'=>'That thing ain\'t surviving nothing.','source_text'=>'Gaya lembik macam tu sah-sah takkan dapat bertahan hidup di hutan.','order'=>639],
            ['start_time'=>1525.04,'end_time'=>1528.22,'target_text'=>'But I see a sign up here that says elephants.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya nampak papan tanda arah ke kandang gajah kat depan.','order'=>640],
            ['start_time'=>1528.32,'end_time'=>1528.86,'target_text'=>'Oh, no.','source_text'=>'Oh, bukan.','order'=>641],
            ['start_time'=>1528.96,'end_time'=>1531.46,'target_text'=>'This one is the Malaysian sunbear.','source_text'=>'Yang ini beruang matahari Malaysia (Malayan sun bear).','order'=>642],
            ['start_time'=>1531.56,'end_time'=>1532.42,'target_text'=>'There you go.','source_text'=>'Haa betul tu.','order'=>643],
            ['start_time'=>1532.52,'end_time'=>1533.5,'target_text'=>'Oh, Malayan.','source_text'=>'Oh, Malayan.','order'=>644],
            ['start_time'=>1533.6,'end_time'=>1534.62,'target_text'=>'Malayan sunbear.','source_text'=>'Beruang matahari Malaya.','order'=>645],
            ['start_time'=>1534.72,'end_time'=>1538.06,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe that\'s why it likes to sunbathe cuz it\'s a sunbear.','source_text'=>'>> Patutlah dia suka berjemur matahari, nama pun beruang matahari (sun bear).','order'=>646],
            ['start_time'=>1538.16,'end_time'=>1539.9,'target_text'=>'>> That is a good observation, actually.','source_text'=>'>> Pemerhatian yang sangat bernas, sebenarnya.','order'=>647],
            ['start_time'=>1540,'end_time'=>1541.3,'target_text'=>'Oh, here are the goats.','source_text'=>'Oh, kat sini ada kambing gunung.','order'=>648],
            ['start_time'=>1541.4,'end_time'=>1543.42,'target_text'=>'>> These are the ones we got in >> in Canada.','source_text'=>'>> Yang ni macam yang ada kat... >> kat Kanada.','order'=>649],
            ['start_time'=>1543.52,'end_time'=>1544.74,'target_text'=>'>> These are like mountain sheep.','source_text'=>'>> Macam biri-biri gunung (mountain sheep).','order'=>650],
            ['start_time'=>1544.84,'end_time'=>1545.46,'target_text'=>'Look at them, dude.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah diorang tu, weh.','order'=>651],
            ['start_time'=>1545.56,'end_time'=>1547.78,'target_text'=>'They could literally climb like cliffs, bro.','source_text'=>'Diorang boleh panjat tebing batu yang curam gila, weh.','order'=>652],
            ['start_time'=>1547.88,'end_time'=>1550.06,'target_text'=>'>> But have you seen the videos of them falling?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi awak pernah tengok tak video diorang jatuh gaung?','order'=>653],
            ['start_time'=>1550.16,'end_time'=>1550.4,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Pernah tengok.','order'=>654],
            ['start_time'=>1550.4,'end_time'=>1551.7,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like that\'s the craziest thing.','source_text'=>'>> Itu detik yang paling ngeri.','order'=>655],
            ['start_time'=>1551.8,'end_time'=>1554.26,'target_text'=>'They just >> Yeah, but don\'t we don\'t focus on the falling.','source_text'=>'Diorang cuma... >> Ya, tapi kita jangan fokus bab jatuh tu.','order'=>656],
            ['start_time'=>1554.36,'end_time'=>1555.5,'target_text'=>'We just focus on the climbing.','source_text'=>'Kita fokus pada kehebatan diorang memanjat.','order'=>657],
            ['start_time'=>1555.6,'end_time'=>1557.5,'target_text'=>'These things could climb like any cliff, dude.','source_text'=>'Haiwan ni boleh panjat mana-mana cerun tebing, weh.','order'=>658],
            ['start_time'=>1557.6,'end_time'=>1558.62,'target_text'=>'It could be like the tiniest ledge.','source_text'=>'Walaupun cuma ada ruang pijak yang kecil halus.','order'=>659],
            ['start_time'=>1558.72,'end_time'=>1562.26,'target_text'=>'These are the world\'s best rock climbers, best boulderers, you can say.','source_text'=>'Diorang ni pemanjat tebing batu terbaik di dunia, boleh dikatakan juara bouldering alam semula jadi.','order'=>660],
            ['start_time'=>1562.36,'end_time'=>1566.98,'target_text'=>'So, this is the last thing we\'re going to see, the Asian elephant, 1 km away.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini hentian terakhir yang kita akan tengok, gajah Asia, lagi 1 km perjalanan.','order'=>661],
            ['start_time'=>1567.08,'end_time'=>1568.9,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s start walking there.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mula berjalan ke sana.','order'=>662],
            ['start_time'=>1569,'end_time'=>1575.38,'target_text'=>'You know that elephants, I\'m pretty sure, look at people the way you look at like a baby like, \"Oh, so cute.\" >> Yeah, I actually','source_text'=>'Awak tahu tak gajah pandang manusia macam kita tengok bayi comel, macam \'Alololo comelnya\'. >> Ya, saya sebenarnya','order'=>663],
            ['start_time'=>1575.48,'end_time'=>1576.18,'target_text'=>'did know that.','source_text'=>'pernah dengar fakta tu.','order'=>664],
            ['start_time'=>1576.28,'end_time'=>1578.42,'target_text'=>'>> I think that\'s like a super common fact.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa saya tu fakta sains yang sangat popular.','order'=>665],
            ['start_time'=>1578.52,'end_time'=>1580.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know where I heard that, but I\'ve definitely heard it somewhere.','source_text'=>'Saya tak ingat kat mana saya dengar, tapi memang pernah terbaca somewhere.','order'=>666],
            ['start_time'=>1581.04,'end_time'=>1583.62,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this is an elephant, an Asian elephant.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, inilah gajah, seekor gajah Asia.','order'=>667],
            ['start_time'=>1583.72,'end_time'=>1584.82,'target_text'=>'>> elephant eating, though?','source_text'=>'>> Tapi gajah tu tengah makan apa?','order'=>668],
            ['start_time'=>1584.92,'end_time'=>1588.18,'target_text'=>'>> Kind of looks like sugarcane, like really young sugarcane.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak macam batang tebu, jenis tebu muda.','order'=>669],
            ['start_time'=>1588.28,'end_time'=>1594.82,'target_text'=>'>> And what would you call an animal who survives on greens and vegetables versus one that eats meat?','source_text'=>'>> Dan apa panggilan untuk haiwan yang hidup makan tumbuhan berbanding haiwan yang makan daging?','order'=>670],
            ['start_time'=>1594.92,'end_time'=>1601.7,'target_text'=>'>> So, an elephant that just eats like, you know, plants and stuff is called a herbivore, or an herbivore, depending on how','source_text'=>'>> Gajah yang hanya makan tumbuh-tumbuhan dipanggil \'herbivor\' (herbivore), bergantung cara','order'=>671],
            ['start_time'=>1601.8,'end_time'=>1602.58,'target_text'=>'you pronounce it.','source_text'=>'sebutan korang.','order'=>672],
            ['start_time'=>1602.68,'end_time'=>1607.18,'target_text'=>'And an animal that eats just meat, like a lion, is called a carnivore.','source_text'=>'Dan haiwan yang hanya makan daging, macam singa, dipanggil \'karnivor\' (carnivore).','order'=>673],
            ['start_time'=>1607.28,'end_time'=>1610.94,'target_text'=>'But then us, humans, that eat both are called omnivores.','source_text'=>'Manakala kita manusia yang makan kedua-duanya dipanggil \'omnivor\' (omnivore).','order'=>674],
            ['start_time'=>1611.04,'end_time'=>1613.38,'target_text'=>'But yeah, that one looks like a baby, a little bit younger.','source_text'=>'Tapi gajah yang tu nampak macam anak gajah, usia masih muda.','order'=>675],
            ['start_time'=>1613.48,'end_time'=>1616.54,'target_text'=>'I saw elephants in uh South Africa and we walked with them.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah tengok gajah di Afrika Selatan dan kami berjalan di sebelah diorang.','order'=>676],
            ['start_time'=>1616.64,'end_time'=>1618.26,'target_text'=>'They\'re way taller than this.','source_text'=>'Gajah Afrika jauh lebih tinggi daripada gajah kat sini.','order'=>677],
            ['start_time'=>1618.36,'end_time'=>1619.94,'target_text'=>'Those elephants are super tall.','source_text'=>'Gajah Afrika tinggi menjulang.','order'=>678],
            ['start_time'=>1620.04,'end_time'=>1621.46,'target_text'=>'But, they\'re just like friendly giants, man.','source_text'=>'Tapi gajah ni ibarat gergasi yang peramah dan baik hati, weh.','order'=>679],
            ['start_time'=>1621.56,'end_time'=>1622.18,'target_text'=>'They\'re so nice.','source_text'=>'Diorang sangat jinak dan lembut.','order'=>680],
            ['start_time'=>1622.28,'end_time'=>1627.5,'target_text'=>'>> But, it\'s it\'s funny how you say they look at humans as their babies >> But, like a baby, yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi kelakar bila awak kata gajah pandang manusia macam bayi... >> Macam bayi comel, ya.','order'=>681],
            ['start_time'=>1627.6,'end_time'=>1632.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but the thing is, for example, in places like this, it\'s the humans taking care of it of them.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi masalahnya contohnya di tempat macam zoo ni, manusialah yang jaga makan minum diorang.','order'=>682],
            ['start_time'=>1633,'end_time'=>1637.78,'target_text'=>'So, you think the elephants don\'t see it that way that they\'re being taken care of by humans?','source_text'=>'Jadi awak rasa gajah tak perasan ke yang diorang sebenarnya dijaga oleh manusia?','order'=>683],
            ['start_time'=>1637.88,'end_time'=>1643.34,'target_text'=>'Well, I think it\'s more like they see them like cute, like you would see a baby puppy or like, \"Oh, so cute.\" But, then the','source_text'=>'Rasa saya gajah anggap manusia comel, macam kita tengok anak anjing comel, tapi si comel tu pula','order'=>684],
            ['start_time'=>1643.44,'end_time'=>1644.66,'target_text'=>'really cute thing takes care of you.','source_text'=>'yang tolong bagi makan dan jaga kita.','order'=>685],
            ['start_time'=>1644.76,'end_time'=>1646.54,'target_text'=>'So, it is like kind of a weird dynamic.','source_text'=>'Jadi hubungannya memang agak unik dan pelik.','order'=>686],
            ['start_time'=>1646.64,'end_time'=>1647.42,'target_text'=>'They just eat nuts.','source_text'=>'Gajah makan kacang dan makanan lain.','order'=>687],
            ['start_time'=>1647.52,'end_time'=>1651.82,'target_text'=>'Well, let\'s continue on to the very end cuz I think this is one of the last stops.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan jalan sampai ke penghujung sebab ini salah satu hentian terakhir kita.','order'=>688],
            ['start_time'=>1651.92,'end_time'=>1660.66,'target_text'=>'If you could have one of these characteristics, so either the intelligence of that monkey over there or the strength of a','source_text'=>'Kalau awak boleh miliki salah satu kelebihan ini, sama ada kepintaran monyet kat sana tu atau kekuatan fizikal seekor','order'=>689],
            ['start_time'=>1660.76,'end_time'=>1662.22,'target_text'=>'silverback gorilla.','source_text'=>'gorila silverback.','order'=>690],
            ['start_time'=>1662.32,'end_time'=>1669.02,'target_text'=>'But, one thing you need to consider is that the intelligence of that monkey over there is the highest of any monkey out there.','source_text'=>'Tapi satu benda yang awak kena tahu, monyet spesis tu adalah yang paling pintar dalam kalangan spesis monyet.','order'=>691],
            ['start_time'=>1669.12,'end_time'=>1671.22,'target_text'=>'And monkeys are known to be intelligent.','source_text'=>'Dan monyet memang terkenal dengan kecerdikan otaknya.','order'=>692],
            ['start_time'=>1671.32,'end_time'=>1675.22,'target_text'=>'So, would you choose that or would you choose the strength of the silverback?','source_text'=>'Jadi awak akan pilih kepintaran tu atau kekuatan fizikal gorila silverback?','order'=>693],
            ['start_time'=>1675.32,'end_time'=>1683.02,'target_text'=>'>> If you want to speak English more clearly and naturally, then join my speaking and pronunciation course.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau korang nak bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih jelas dan semula jadi, jom sertai kursus pertuturan dan sebutan saya.','order'=>694],
            ['start_time'=>1683.12,'end_time'=>1692.78,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to almost 100 video lessons with two new lessons every week, a clear step-by-step practice system,','source_text'=>'Korang dapat akses terus kepada hampir 100 modul video dengan dua pelajaran baharu setiap minggu, sistem latihan tersusun,','order'=>695],
            ['start_time'=>1692.88,'end_time'=>1698.9,'target_text'=>'and an exclusive prompt to help you master the pronunciation of any word.','source_text'=>'serta prompt khas untuk bantu korang kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan.','order'=>696],
            ['start_time'=>1699,'end_time'=>1704.86,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Dalam kursus ini, kita fokus pada sebutan, aksen, ritma, dan kelancaran bertutur secara santai.','order'=>697],
            ['start_time'=>1704.96,'end_time'=>1709.58,'target_text'=>'So, you can stop hesitating and speak with more confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya korang tak ragu-ragu lagi dan boleh bercakap dengan lebih yakin.','order'=>698],
            ['start_time'=>1709.68,'end_time'=>1711.98,'target_text'=>'Look at this alpaca real quick.','source_text'=>'Tengok alpaca ni sekejap.','order'=>699],
            ['start_time'=>1712.08,'end_time'=>1712.9,'target_text'=>'>> I was going to spit on you.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak macam dia nak ludah kat awak je.','order'=>700],
            ['start_time'=>1713,'end_time'=>1714.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yo, chill.','source_text'=>'>> Sabar weh, bertenang.','order'=>701],
            ['start_time'=>1714.36,'end_time'=>1716.22,'target_text'=>'I would choose the strength of a silverback gorilla.','source_text'=>'Saya akan pilih kekuatan fizikal gorila silverback.','order'=>702],
            ['start_time'=>1716.32,'end_time'=>1722.26,'target_text'=>'And then, I would go join the UFC, beat everyone, get a couple hundred million dollars like Conor McGregor, beat everyone','source_text'=>'Lepas tu saya pergi sertai kejohanan UFC, kalahkan semua peninju, kaut ratusan juta dolar macam Conor McGregor, belasah semua orang,','order'=>703],
            ['start_time'=>1722.36,'end_time'=>1726.18,'target_text'=>'up, and then with that money hire the smartest people in the world to do whatever I wanted.','source_text'=>'lepas tu guna duit tu untuk upah orang paling pintar di dunia buat apa saja projek yang saya nak.','order'=>704],
            ['start_time'=>1726.28,'end_time'=>1727.58,'target_text'=>'I think we found a good answer.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu jawapan yang paling bijak.','order'=>705],
            ['start_time'=>1727.68,'end_time'=>1733.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, strength of a silverback gorilla, join the UFC, fight people, get a couple hundred million dollars, hire smart people.','source_text'=>'Kekuatan gorila silverback, masuk UFC bertarung, dapat ratusan juta dolar, lepas tu upah orang bijak pandai.','order'=>706],
            ['start_time'=>1733.84,'end_time'=>1735.3,'target_text'=>'>> Now, repeat that five times.','source_text'=>'>> Sekarang cuba ulang ayat tu lima kali.','order'=>707],
            ['start_time'=>1735.4,'end_time'=>1736.14,'target_text'=>'>> Backwards?','source_text'=>'>> Ulang secara terbalik?','order'=>708],
            ['start_time'=>1736.24,'end_time'=>1737.06,'target_text'=>'>> Backwards.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, secara terbalik.','order'=>709],
            ['start_time'=>1737.16,'end_time'=>1738.62,'target_text'=>'>> Double that and give it to the next person.','source_text'=>'>> Gandakan cabaran tu dan beri kepada orang seterusnya.','order'=>710],
            ['start_time'=>1738.72,'end_time'=>1740.14,'target_text'=>'Repeat that five times backwards.','source_text'=>'Ulang ayat tu lima kali secara terbalik.','order'=>711],
            ['start_time'=>1740.24,'end_time'=>1741.74,'target_text'=>'>> Put it in the comments.','source_text'=>'>> Tulis di ruangan komen.','order'=>712],
            ['start_time'=>1741.84,'end_time'=>1742.24,'target_text'=>'>> Facts.','source_text'=>'>> Fakta betul tu.','order'=>713],
            ['start_time'=>1742.24,'end_time'=>1747.1,'target_text'=>'But yeah, I think now we reached the end of it, so what was your favorite animal you saw?','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, sekarang kita dah sampai ke penghujung, jadi haiwan apa yang paling awak suka tengok hari ini?','order'=>714],
            ['start_time'=>1747.2,'end_time'=>1747.78,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh.','order'=>715],
            ['start_time'=>1747.88,'end_time'=>1752.34,'target_text'=>'I think the hippopotamus was probably the most interesting cuz I had never seen any.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa badak air paling menarik sebab saya tak pernah tengok depan mata sebelum ni.','order'=>716],
            ['start_time'=>1752.44,'end_time'=>1754.62,'target_text'=>'Second, I would put the black panther.','source_text'=>'Tempat kedua, saya pilih harimau kumbang.','order'=>717],
            ['start_time'=>1754.72,'end_time'=>1756.22,'target_text'=>'>> I think it was a leopard.','source_text'=>'>> Rasa saya tu harimau bintang (leopard).','order'=>718],
            ['start_time'=>1756.32,'end_time'=>1759.62,'target_text'=>'>> Leopard, I would put that cuz it just looked very interesting.','source_text'=>'>> Harimau bintang, saya letak tempat kedua sebab rupa dia sangat menarik.','order'=>719],
            ['start_time'=>1759.72,'end_time'=>1760.12,'target_text'=>'>> True.','source_text'=>'>> Betul.','order'=>720],
            ['start_time'=>1760.16,'end_time'=>1762.74,'target_text'=>'>> And then number three, the bear was kind of funny.','source_text'=>'>> Dan tempat ketiga, beruang matahari tadi agak kelakar.','order'=>721],
            ['start_time'=>1762.84,'end_time'=>1763.24,'target_text'=>'>> It was.','source_text'=>'>> Memang kelakar.','order'=>722],
