        foreach ([
            ['start_time'=>0,'end_time'=>5.79,'target_text'=>'If you don\'t know modern slang, native English can feel very hard to understand.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang tak tahu slanga moden, bahasa Inggeris penutur jati akan terasa sangat susah untuk difahami.','order'=>1],
            ['start_time'=>5.89,'end_time'=>7.98,'target_text'=>'[music] One second, you\'re confident.','source_text'=>'[muzik] Mula-mula, korang rasa yakin.','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>8.08,'end_time'=>13.18,'target_text'=>'The next, somebody says, \"You\'re cooked.\" and you still think they\'re talking about food.','source_text'=>'Tiba-tiba ada orang sebut, \"You\'re cooked,\" dan korang masih ingat diorang tengah cakap pasal makanan.','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>13.28,'end_time'=>23.06,'target_text'=>'In this video, I\'m going to teach you 21 of the most popular and relevant slang words and phrases of 2026 with simple meanings,','source_text'=>'Dalam video ini, saya akan ajar 21 perkataan dan frasa slanga paling popular dan relevan bagi tahun 2026 dengan maksud mudah,','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>23.16,'end_time'=>26.66,'target_text'=>'real examples, and exactly when to use them.','source_text'=>'contoh sebenar, dan bila waktu yang tepat untuk menggunakannya.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>26.76,'end_time'=>37.7,'target_text'=>'So, by the end of this lesson, when you hear words like rizz, glaze, green flag, slay, bussing, cooked, or bet, you\'ll actually','source_text'=>'Jadi pada akhir pembelajaran ini, bila korang dengar perkataan seperti rizz, glaze, green flag, slay, bussing, cooked, atau bet, korang akan betul-betul','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>37.8,'end_time'=>38.7,'target_text'=>'understand them.','source_text'=>'faham maksudnya.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>38.8,'end_time'=>42.62,'target_text'=>'And more importantly, you\'ll know when to use them naturally.','source_text'=>'Dan yang lebih penting, korang tahu bila nak gunakannya secara santai dan semula jadi.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>42.72,'end_time'=>50.86,'target_text'=>'And I\'ll also show you which slang is good for learners to say and which slang is better to just understand because yes, there','source_text'=>'Saya juga akan tunjukkan slanga mana yang sesuai untuk korang sebut dan slanga mana yang lebih elok untuk sekadar faham sahaja sebab ya, ada','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>50.96,'end_time'=>52.74,'target_text'=>'is a difference.','source_text'=>'perbezaan antara kedua-duanya.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>52.84,'end_time'=>55.14,'target_text'=>'Let him cook.','source_text'=>'Biar dia tunjuk bakat dia (Let him cook).','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>55.24,'end_time'=>57.5,'target_text'=>'Me, flex, [music] rizz.','source_text'=>'Saya, menunjuk (flex), [muzik] ayat pikat (rizz).','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>57.6,'end_time'=>58.98,'target_text'=>'Let\'s meet at 7:00.','source_text'=>'Jom jumpa pukul 7:00.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>59.08,'end_time'=>59.48,'target_text'=>'Bet.','source_text'=>'Beres / Setuju (Bet).','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>59.56,'end_time'=>62.78,'target_text'=>'Or a points, game aura, unprofessional, depending.','source_text'=>'Aura points, aura dalam pergaulan, tak profesional, bergantung keadaan.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>62.88,'end_time'=>65.42,'target_text'=>'[music] Without further ado, let\'s get into it.','source_text'=>'[muzik] Tanpa membuang masa lagi, jom kita mulakan.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>65.52,'end_time'=>70.1,'target_text'=>'So, the first slang word we are going to learn is rizz.','source_text'=>'Jadi, perkataan slanga pertama yang kita akan belajar adalah \'rizz\'.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>70.2,'end_time'=>77.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure you guys have heard this word if you\'ve ever been on North American Tik Tok or really any English-speaking side of','source_text'=>'Saya pasti korang pernah dengar perkataan ini kalau pernah layari TikTok Amerika Utara atau mana-mana bahagian berbahasa Inggeris di','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>77.2,'end_time'=>81.18,'target_text'=>'Tik Tok or social media, you have heard this word, rizz.','source_text'=>'TikTok atau media sosial, korang pasti pernah dengar perkataan \'rizz\'.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>81.28,'end_time'=>85.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s been around for many years now, but it\'s still very popular.','source_text'=>'Ia dah wujud bertahun-tahun, tapi masih sangat popular sampai sekarang.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>85.32,'end_time'=>86.46,'target_text'=>'So, what does it mean?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa maksudnya?','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>86.56,'end_time'=>91.5,'target_text'=>'It means charm, especially romantic charm or flirting skills.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya daya penarik atau karisma, terutamanya kemahiran memikat (flirting) atau mengurat.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>91.6,'end_time'=>98.54,'target_text'=>'Rizz is short for charisma, but we shorten it down to rizz, and that\'s the slang word, rizz.','source_text'=>'\'Rizz\' adalah singkatan bagi perkataan \'charisma\' (karisma), tapi disingkatkan jadi \'rizz\', dan itulah slanga perkataan rizz.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>98.64,'end_time'=>105.46,'target_text'=>'So, if someone says you have good rizz, it just means like you\'re good at flirting or talking to the opposite gender or the','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau orang kata korang ada \'good rizz\', maksudnya korang pandai mengurat atau pandai berbual memikat pasangan atau','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>105.56,'end_time'=>106.98,'target_text'=>'people you\'re attracted to.','source_text'=>'orang yang korang minati.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>107.08,'end_time'=>107.98,'target_text'=>'Oh, he has rizz.','source_text'=>'Oh, dia ada daya penarik (rizz).','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>108.08,'end_time'=>108.78,'target_text'=>'He has good rizz.','source_text'=>'Dia pandai memikat (good rizz).','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>108.88,'end_time'=>117.94,'target_text'=>'Some example sentences are, \"He has so much rizz when he talks to new people.\" She rizz\'d up the waiter as a joke.','source_text'=>'Contoh ayatnya, \"Dia pandai memikat sangat bila bercakap dengan orang baharu.\" Dia cuba mengurat pelayan tu sekadar gurauan.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>118.04,'end_time'=>120.06,'target_text'=>'So, when should you use this word?','source_text'=>'Jadi, bila waktu sesuai untuk guna perkataan ini?','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>120.16,'end_time'=>126.78,'target_text'=>'Use it when you\'re talking about flirting, confidence, or someone\'s social charm, their charisma.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila bercakap tentang mengurat, keyakinan diri, atau daya penarik karisma seseorang.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>126.88,'end_time'=>128.1,'target_text'=>'And when not to use it?','source_text'=>'Dan bila pula tak patut guna?','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>128.2,'end_time'=>135.94,'target_text'=>'Do not use this when talking formally or with people that might not understand internet culture, usually older people.','source_text'=>'Jangan guna masa bercakap secara formal atau dengan orang yang tak faham budaya internet, biasanya orang yang lebih berumur.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>136.04,'end_time'=>143.94,'target_text'=>'They probably won\'t understand this, and if they do, they might just think you\'re unprofessional depending on the scenario.','source_text'=>'Diorang mungkin takkan faham, dan kalau faham pun, diorang mungkin anggap korang tak profesional bergantung kepada situasi.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>144.04,'end_time'=>150.34,'target_text'=>'And also, a quick disclaimer, all of these slang words should be only used, you know, with your friends or on the internet','source_text'=>'Dan juga peringatan ringkas, semua perkataan slanga ini hanya patut digunakan bersama rakan-rakan korang atau di internet','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>150.44,'end_time'=>153.5,'target_text'=>'or informally with people that, you know, are used to them.','source_text'=>'atau secara santai dengan orang yang dah biasa mendengarnya.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>153.6,'end_time'=>158.98,'target_text'=>'You shouldn\'t use these words when you\'re trying to talk formally or when you\'re writing emails or when you\'re talking to','source_text'=>'Korang tak patut guna perkataan ini bila bertutur secara rasmi atau bila menulis emel atau bila bercakap dengan','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>159.08,'end_time'=>161.58,'target_text'=>'a boss or someone older than you.','source_text'=>'majikan atau orang yang lebih tua daripada korang.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>161.68,'end_time'=>165.42,'target_text'=>'This is just like informal speaking and internet talk.','source_text'=>'Ini hanyalah bahasa basahan tidak formal dan bahasa percakapan di internet.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>165.52,'end_time'=>175.38,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and start learning the words that will allow you to understand up to 95% of everyday','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya dan mula belajar perkataan yang membolehkan korang faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>175.48,'end_time'=>176.18,'target_text'=>'English.','source_text'=>'bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>176.28,'end_time'=>184.5,'target_text'=>'It includes clear definitions, real examples, and simple organization by topic and CEFR','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi maksud yang jelas, contoh sebenar, dan susunan mudah mengikut topik serta tahap CEFR','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>184.6,'end_time'=>185.34,'target_text'=>'level.','source_text'=>'tahap penguasaan.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>185.44,'end_time'=>189.02,'target_text'=>'Get it in the description or at vocaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Dapatkannya di ruangan deskripsi atau di vocaenglish.com.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>189.12,'end_time'=>191.66,'target_text'=>'The second slang phrase is no cap.','source_text'=>'Frasa slanga kedua ialah \'no cap\'.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>191.76,'end_time'=>192.26,'target_text'=>'No cap.','source_text'=>'Tak tipu / Sumpah betul (No cap).','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>192.36,'end_time'=>194.02,'target_text'=>'I use this one so much.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu sangat guna frasa ni.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>194.12,'end_time'=>194.94,'target_text'=>'I use this one a lot.','source_text'=>'Saya kerap guna ungkapan ni.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>195.04,'end_time'=>196.5,'target_text'=>'No cap or just cap.','source_text'=>'\'No cap\' atau sekadar sebut \'cap\'.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>196.6,'end_time'=>200.94,'target_text'=>'So, no cap means honestly, serious, or no lie.','source_text'=>'Jadi, \'no cap\' bermaksud sejujurnya, serius, atau tak tipu langsung.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>201.04,'end_time'=>203.62,'target_text'=>'So, when you use it, you\'re implying that you are not lying.','source_text'=>'Jadi bila korang gunakannya, korang menegaskan yang korang tak mereka-reka cerita.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>203.72,'end_time'=>207.14,'target_text'=>'So, you can say no cap or I\'m not lying.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh sebut \'no cap\' atau \'aku tak tipu\'.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>207.24,'end_time'=>208.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s very It\'s interchangeable.','source_text'=>'Maksud kedua-duanya boleh saling bertukar ganti.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>208.88,'end_time'=>214.02,'target_text'=>'You can also just use the word cap alone when you think someone is lying or not telling the truth.','source_text'=>'Korang juga boleh sebut perkataan \'cap\' sahaja bila korang rasa seseorang tu tengah menipu atau tak cakap benar.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>214.12,'end_time'=>219.62,'target_text'=>'For example, if someone says, \"Oh, the sky is green.\" You can say, \"Cap.\" Cap.','source_text'=>'Contohnya, kalau orang kata, \"Langit warna hijau,\" korang boleh balas, \"Cap! (Menipu je tu).\" Cap.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>219.72,'end_time'=>220.38,'target_text'=>'Just cap.','source_text'=>'Sebut \'cap\' je.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>220.48,'end_time'=>225.98,'target_text'=>'If you say no cap, then it\'s like, \"Oh, you\'re not lying.\" But if you say cap, it\'s like, \"No, you are lying.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang kata \'no cap\', maksudnya \'aku tak tipu\'. Tapi kalau sebut \'cap\', maksudnya \'eh kau menipu.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>226.08,'end_time'=>230.5,'target_text'=>'I don\'t believe you.\" Like, \"Oh, cap.\" So, no cap is usually the speaker uses it.','source_text'=>'Aku tak percaya cakap kau.\' Macam \'Ah, menipu (cap).\' Jadi \'no cap\' biasanya diguna oleh orang yang bercakap.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>230.6,'end_time'=>235.46,'target_text'=>'\"Oh, that\'s my favorite, no cap.\" That\'s my favorite, I\'m not lying, no cap.','source_text'=>'\"Itu makanan kegemaran aku, tak tipu (no cap).\" Itu kegemaran saya, saya tak berbohong, no cap.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>235.56,'end_time'=>242.34,'target_text'=>'But if you just use cap, it usually is in a response to someone else to mean you don\'t think they\'re telling the truth.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau korang cuma sebut \'cap\', ia biasanya respon kepada kata-kata orang lain bila korang rasa dia tengah menipu.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>242.44,'end_time'=>242.84,'target_text'=>'Cap.','source_text'=>'Cap (Menipu).','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>242.88,'end_time'=>247.62,'target_text'=>'Some example sentences are, that street food was amazing, no cap.','source_text'=>'Contoh ayat, makanan jalanan tu sedap gila, sumpah tak tipu (no cap).','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>247.72,'end_time'=>252.22,'target_text'=>'No cap, this has been the best lesson on this channel, no cap.','source_text'=>'Tak tipu (no cap), ini pembelajaran paling bermanfaat dalam saluran ini, no cap.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>252.32,'end_time'=>254.06,'target_text'=>'So, when should you use this?','source_text'=>'Jadi, bila korang patut guna ungkapan ni?','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>254.16,'end_time'=>259.94,'target_text'=>'Use this when you want to emphasize you are telling the truth in like a casual, chill, cool way.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila korang nak tegaskan yang korang bercakap benar secara santai dan bersahaja.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>260.04,'end_time'=>266.1,'target_text'=>'Once again, do not use this word or any of these words when talking to your boss, your teachers, or clients.','source_text'=>'Sekali lagi diingatkan, jangan guna perkataan ini bila bercakap dengan majikan, guru, atau klien korang.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>266.2,'end_time'=>270.62,'target_text'=>'So, cap means a lie or exaggeration, and no cap means the opposite.','source_text'=>'Jadi, \'cap\' bermaksud bohong atau cakap melebih-lebih, manakala \'no cap\' bermaksud sebaliknya.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>270.72,'end_time'=>273.18,'target_text'=>'Third slang word is low-key.','source_text'=>'Perkataan slanga ketiga ialah \'low-key\'.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>273.28,'end_time'=>274.18,'target_text'=>'Low-key.','source_text'=>'Secara diam-diam / Agak / Sikit-sikit (Low-key).','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>274.28,'end_time'=>280.1,'target_text'=>'Low-key means slightly, secretly, quietly, or in an understated way.','source_text'=>'\'Low-key\' bermaksud secara diam-diam, sedikit sebanyak, atau tak ditunjuk secara ketara.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>280.2,'end_time'=>280.94,'target_text'=>'Low-key.','source_text'=>'Low-key.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>281.04,'end_time'=>285.66,'target_text'=>'Some example sentences are, I low-key want to stay home tonight.','source_text'=>'Contoh ayat, aku sebenarnya agak teringin nak duduk rumah je malam ni (low-key).','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>285.76,'end_time'=>286.46,'target_text'=>'Low-key.','source_text'=>'Low-key.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>286.56,'end_time'=>289.9,'target_text'=>'Or, she\'s low-key the funniest person in the group.','source_text'=>'Atau, dia sebenarnya diam-diam orang paling kelakar dalam kumpulan kita.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>290,'end_time'=>293.06,'target_text'=>'I low-key use this word all the time.','source_text'=>'Saya memang kerap guna perkataan \'low-key\' ni sepanjang masa.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>293.16,'end_time'=>293.82,'target_text'=>'Low-key.','source_text'=>'Low-key.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>293.92,'end_time'=>300.86,'target_text'=>'And this is really one of the most like versatile and useful slang phrases because you can really use it in almost any sentence.','source_text'=>'Dan ini memang antara frasa slanga paling berguna dan serba boleh sebab korang boleh gunakannya dalam hampir semua ayat.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>300.96,'end_time'=>301.7,'target_text'=>'Low-key.','source_text'=>'Low-key.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>301.8,'end_time'=>307.34,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you want to like soften your opinion or show a feeling that is not like super strong.','source_text'=>'Jadi gunakan bila korang nak lembutkan pandangan atau tunjukkan perasaan yang tak terlalu ketara melampau.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>307.44,'end_time'=>310.06,'target_text'=>'Fourth slang word, high-key.','source_text'=>'Perkataan slanga keempat, \'high-key\'.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>310.16,'end_time'=>310.9,'target_text'=>'High-key.','source_text'=>'Terang-terangan / Sangat jelas (High-key).','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>311,'end_time'=>316.02,'target_text'=>'So, high-key means openly, strongly, very, or intensely.','source_text'=>'Jadi, \'high-key\' bermaksud secara terang-terangan, sangat kuat, atau secara ketara.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>316.12,'end_time'=>318.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m high-key excited for this trip.','source_text'=>'Aku memang terang-terang teruja gila untuk percutian ni (high-key).','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>319,'end_time'=>321.54,'target_text'=>'I was high-key annoyed by that comment.','source_text'=>'Aku betul-betul rasa geram gila dengan komen tu.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>321.64,'end_time'=>328.42,'target_text'=>'I don\'t find myself using this word in particular that much because I would rather just use words like, oh, I\'m really excited.','source_text'=>'Saya sendiri jarang guna perkataan ini sebab saya lebih selesa guna perkataan biasa macam \'saya sangat teruja\'.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>328.52,'end_time'=>329.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, I\'m so excited.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya teruja sangat.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>329.48,'end_time'=>331.7,'target_text'=>'I\'m very excited, rather than high-key.','source_text'=>'Saya sebut \'sangat teruja\' berbanding guna \'high-key\'.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>331.8,'end_time'=>336.78,'target_text'=>'I personally don\'t use it as much, and I don\'t think a lot of people really use it that that much.','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi saya jarang guna, dan saya rasa tak ramai orang pun guna sekerap itu.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>336.88,'end_time'=>340.5,'target_text'=>'Low-key on the other hand is so so so popular.','source_text'=>'Sebaliknya \'low-key\' pula teramat sangatlah popular.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>340.6,'end_time'=>343.98,'target_text'=>'High-key, not as popular, but it\'s still widely used.','source_text'=>'\'High-key\' tak sepopular itu, tapi masih digunakan secara meluas.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>344.08,'end_time'=>345.9,'target_text'=>'Fifth slang phrase, bet.','source_text'=>'Frasa slanga kelima, \'bet\'.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>346,'end_time'=>349.1,'target_text'=>'I actually think this is the slang phrase I use the most.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya saya rasa inilah frasa slanga yang paling kerap saya sebut.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>349.2,'end_time'=>349.6,'target_text'=>'Bet.','source_text'=>'Beres / On / Janji (Bet).','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>349.64,'end_time'=>354.86,'target_text'=>'This is my favorite slang phrase of 2025 and probably of 2026 as well.','source_text'=>'Ini ungkapan slanga kegemaran saya bagi tahun 2025 dan mungkin untuk 2026 juga.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>354.96,'end_time'=>355.36,'target_text'=>'Bet.','source_text'=>'Bet.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>355.4,'end_time'=>359.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s just so simple, elegant, useful, and it just rolls off the tongue.','source_text'=>'Ungkapan ni sangat ringkas, padat, berguna, dan senang meluncur keluar dari mulut.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>359.72,'end_time'=>361.02,'target_text'=>'I like this slang word.','source_text'=>'Saya suka perkataan slanga ini.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>361.12,'end_time'=>365.14,'target_text'=>'So, it just means okay, sure, sounds good, agreed.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya senang je: okey, boleh, setuju, beres, orait.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>365.24,'end_time'=>365.64,'target_text'=>'Bet.','source_text'=>'Bet (Beres/On).','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>365.72,'end_time'=>368.42,'target_text'=>'Example sentence, let\'s meet at 7:00.','source_text'=>'Contoh ayat, jom kita jumpa pukul 7:00.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>368.52,'end_time'=>369.02,'target_text'=>'Bet.','source_text'=>'Beres (Bet).','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>369.12,'end_time'=>371.46,'target_text'=>'You bring the camera, I\'ll bring the mic.','source_text'=>'Kau bawa kamera, aku bawa mikrofon.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>371.56,'end_time'=>372.14,'target_text'=>'Bet.','source_text'=>'On (Bet).','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>372.24,'end_time'=>378.46,'target_text'=>'So, you can use it when you\'re accepting a plan, agreeing with something, or saying yes casually.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh guna bila bersetuju dengan rancangan, setuju dengan sesuatu, atau cakap ya secara santai.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>378.56,'end_time'=>381.38,'target_text'=>'Sixth slang word, mid.','source_text'=>'Perkataan slanga keenam, \'mid\'.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>381.48,'end_time'=>386.62,'target_text'=>'Mid means mediocre, underwhelming, or not impressive.','source_text'=>'\'Mid\' bermaksud biasa-biasa je, hambar, atau tak memuaskan.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>386.72,'end_time'=>387.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s mid.','source_text'=>'Biasa-biasa je (It\'s mid).','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>387.88,'end_time'=>388.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s average.','source_text'=>'Tahap sederhana biasa je.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>388.92,'end_time'=>391.54,'target_text'=>'The movie looked cool, but it was mid.','source_text'=>'Filem tu nampak gempak, tapi bila tengok rasa biasa-biasa je (mid).','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>391.64,'end_time'=>393.5,'target_text'=>'The burger was mid, honestly.','source_text'=>'Burger tu rasa hambar biasa je sebenarnya (mid).','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>393.6,'end_time'=>398.06,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you want to give a casual negative opinion about something.','source_text'=>'Jadi gunakan bila korang nak beri kritikan negatif santai tentang sesuatu benda.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>398.16,'end_time'=>403.06,'target_text'=>'For example, food, media, clothes, or a performance.','source_text'=>'Contohnya makanan, rancangan tv, pakaian, atau sesuatu persembahan.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>403.16,'end_time'=>404.46,'target_text'=>'Uh it was mid.','source_text'=>'Hmm rasa biasa-biasa je (mid).','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>404.56,'end_time'=>406.5,'target_text'=>'Number seven, cooked.','source_text'=>'Nombor tujuh, \'cooked\'.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>406.6,'end_time'=>410.78,'target_text'=>'This means doomed, in trouble, or in a bad situation.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya habislah, dalam masalah besar, atau nasib malang.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>410.88,'end_time'=>411.78,'target_text'=>'I\'m cooked.','source_text'=>'Habislah aku (I\'m cooked).','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>411.88,'end_time'=>415.46,'target_text'=>'Chat, am I cooked if I don\'t study tonight?','source_text'=>'Korang, habislah aku ke kalau aku tak mengulang kaji malam ni?','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>415.56,'end_time'=>416.34,'target_text'=>'I\'m cooked.','source_text'=>'Habislah aku.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>416.44,'end_time'=>419.98,'target_text'=>'We\'re cooked if the train gets delayed again.','source_text'=>'Habislah kita kalau tren ni terlewat lagi sekali.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>420.08,'end_time'=>426.62,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you want to joke about being in trouble or when a situation is going badly and you just want to add some humor.','source_text'=>'Jadi gunakan bila korang nak bergurau tentang nasib malang atau bila keadaan jadi huru-hara dan korang nak selitkan unsur jenaka.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>426.72,'end_time'=>428.14,'target_text'=>'Ah, I\'m cooked.','source_text'=>'Aduh, habislah aku (I\'m cooked).','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>428.24,'end_time'=>432.42,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster, get the workbook for this video on my website.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih cepat, dapatkan buku latihan untuk video ini di laman web saya.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>432.52,'end_time'=>439.26,'target_text'=>'It includes deeper explanations and exercises to help you remember and master what you learned.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi penerangan lebih terperinci dan latihan untuk bantu korang ingat dan kuasai apa yang dipelajari.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>439.36,'end_time'=>445.22,'target_text'=>'And if you get five or more workbooks, you\'ll get 30% off automatically at checkout.','source_text'=>'Dan jika beli lima atau lebih buku latihan, korang akan dapat diskaun 30% secara automatik semasa pembayaran.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>445.32,'end_time'=>449.34,'target_text'=>'So, go to the description or my website volkaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jadi layari ruangan deskripsi atau laman web saya di volkaenglish.com.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>449.44,'end_time'=>451.62,'target_text'=>'Number eight, lock in.','source_text'=>'Nombor lapan, \'lock in\'.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>451.72,'end_time'=>452.5,'target_text'=>'Lock in.','source_text'=>'Fokus penuh / Khusyuk (Lock in).','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>452.6,'end_time'=>456.46,'target_text'=>'It means to enter a state of deep focus.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya masuk ke fasa fokus yang mendalam tanpa sebarang gangguan.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>456.56,'end_time'=>459.78,'target_text'=>'I need to lock in and finish my homework.','source_text'=>'Aku kena fokus betul-betul (lock in) untuk siapkan kerja sekolah ni.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>459.88,'end_time'=>461.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s exam week.','source_text'=>'Sekarang minggu peperiksaan.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>461.32,'end_time'=>463.18,'target_text'=>'Everybody has to lock in.','source_text'=>'Semua orang kena fokus habis-habisan (lock in).','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>463.28,'end_time'=>468.86,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you want to talk about focusing hard on something and achieving a certain result.','source_text'=>'Jadi gunakan bila korang nak tekankan tentang fokus bersungguh-sungguh pada sesuatu tugasan demi capai sasaran.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>468.96,'end_time'=>471.5,'target_text'=>'Number nine, delulu.','source_text'=>'Nombor sembilan, \'delulu\'.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>471.6,'end_time'=>472.38,'target_text'=>'Delulu.','source_text'=>'Khayal / Angan-angan kosong (Delulu).','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>472.48,'end_time'=>474.18,'target_text'=>'So, this means delusional.','source_text'=>'Perkataan ini singkatan daripada \'delusional\' (berkhayal / syok sendiri).','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>474.28,'end_time'=>479.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s often used jokingly for unrealistic confidence or fantasy thinking.','source_text'=>'Ia selalu diguna sebagai gurauan bagi keyakinan tak berpijak di bumi nyata atau angan-angan mat jenin.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>479.92,'end_time'=>482.38,'target_text'=>'This word is also mainly used by women.','source_text'=>'Perkataan ini kebanyakannya digunakan oleh golongan wanita.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>482.48,'end_time'=>489.1,'target_text'=>'I personally never use this word and none of my male friends use this word, but a lot of my friends that are women, they use','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi saya dan kawan-kawan lelaki saya tak pernah guna, tapi ramai kawan perempuan saya guna','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>489.2,'end_time'=>490.26,'target_text'=>'this word a lot.','source_text'=>'perkataan ini selalu sangat.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>490.36,'end_time'=>491.02,'target_text'=>'Delulu.','source_text'=>'Delulu.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>491.12,'end_time'=>496.02,'target_text'=>'I know it\'s delulu, but I think I can become fluent in 6 months.','source_text'=>'Aku tahu ini macam angan-angan kosong (delulu), tapi aku rasa aku boleh fasih dalam 6 bulan.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>496.12,'end_time'=>498.7,'target_text'=>'He thinks one text means they\'re getting married.','source_text'=>'Dia ingat bila perempuan tu balas mesej sepatah maknanya diorang nak kahwin.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>498.8,'end_time'=>499.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s delulu.','source_text'=>'Itu memang syok sendiri melampau (delulu).','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>499.92,'end_time'=>506.9,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you\'re joking about unrealistic hopes, especially in dating, fandom, or ambition.','source_text'=>'Jadi gunakan bila bergurau tentang harapan tak realistik, terutamanya bab cinta, minat artis (fandom), atau cita-cita.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>507,'end_time'=>509.26,'target_text'=>'Number 10, the ick.','source_text'=>'Nombor 10, \'the ick\'.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>509.36,'end_time'=>513.34,'target_text'=>'A sudden feeling of disgust or loss of attraction.','source_text'=>'Perasaan tiba-tiba rasa turn-off, loya, atau hilang rasa minat terhadap seseorang.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>513.44,'end_time'=>516.7,'target_text'=>'Seeing him be rude to the staff gave me the ick.','source_text'=>'Tengok perangai dia yang biadab dengan pekerja restoran buat aku rasa turn-off habis (the ick).','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>516.8,'end_time'=>519.82,'target_text'=>'She got the ick after the first date.','source_text'=>'Dia terus hilang minat (got the ick) lepas keluar \'first date\' pertama.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>519.92,'end_time'=>525.3,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you\'re talking about dating, attraction, or social turn-offs.','source_text'=>'Jadi gunakan bila berbual pasal temu janji, daya tarikan, atau perkara yang buat korang hilang selera pada seseorang.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>525.4,'end_time'=>527.58,'target_text'=>'Number 11, touch grass.','source_text'=>'Nombor 11, \'touch grass\'.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>527.68,'end_time'=>532.42,'target_text'=>'Go outside, reconnect with life, and spend less time online.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya keluarlah hirup udara segar di luar rumah, sedar realiti, dan kurangkan masa melayari internet.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>532.52,'end_time'=>535.3,'target_text'=>'You\'ve been arguing in the comments for 3 hours.','source_text'=>'Kau dah bertekak dalam ruangan komen selama 3 jam.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>535.4,'end_time'=>536.5,'target_text'=>'Go touch grass.','source_text'=>'Keluarlah tengok dunia luar / \'touch grass\'.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>536.6,'end_time'=>539.78,'target_text'=>'After watching TikTok all day, I need to touch grass.','source_text'=>'Lepas hadap TikTok sepanjang hari, aku rasa aku kena keluar hirup udara segar (touch grass).','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>539.88,'end_time'=>546.18,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you\'re talking to someone that is online too much or needs a break from all their screen time.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila korang bercakap dengan orang yang terlalu taksub di alam maya atau perlu rehat daripada skrin telefon.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>546.28,'end_time'=>547.22,'target_text'=>'Touch grass.','source_text'=>'Touch grass (Keluarlah tengok dunia luar).','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>547.32,'end_time'=>550.1,'target_text'=>'And it\'s often used as like a mild insult.','source_text'=>'Ia juga sering digunakan sebagai sindiran halus.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>550.2,'end_time'=>551.9,'target_text'=>'Like, oh, go touch grass.','source_text'=>'Macam ungkapan, \'Alah pergilah keluar hirup udara segar sikit\'.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>552,'end_time'=>553.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s a mild a mild insult.','source_text'=>'Ia sekadar sindiran manja yang tidak terlalu kasar.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>554,'end_time'=>556.42,'target_text'=>'12, let him cook.','source_text'=>'Nombor 12, \'let him cook\'.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>556.52,'end_time'=>557.58,'target_text'=>'Let him cook.','source_text'=>'Biar dia tunjuk bakat / Bagi dia ruang (Let him cook).','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>557.68,'end_time'=>563.18,'target_text'=>'Let that person continue because they may be doing something smart or impressive.','source_text'=>'Biarkan orang itu teruskan apa yang dia buat sebab mungkin dia sedang rancang sesuatu yang hebat atau luar biasa.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>563.28,'end_time'=>565.62,'target_text'=>'Don\'t stop her, let her cook.','source_text'=>'Jangan halang dia, biar dia tunjuk kehebatan dia (let her cook).','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>565.72,'end_time'=>569.5,'target_text'=>'Or, I\'m sure you guys have all heard that viral sound, let him cook now.','source_text'=>'Atau saya yakin korang pernah dengar audio tular, \'let him cook now\'.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>569.6,'end_time'=>570.5,'target_text'=>'Let him cook.','source_text'=>'Biar dia buat hal dia (Let him cook).','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>570.6,'end_time'=>572.98,'target_text'=>'Let him cook.','source_text'=>'Bagi dia masa buktikan (Let him cook).','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>573.08,'end_time'=>575.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure you guys have heard that all over TikTok.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti korang dah kerap dengar ungkapan ni merata tempat di TikTok.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>575.52,'end_time'=>578.38,'target_text'=>'His idea sounds weird, but let him cook.','source_text'=>'Idea dia bunyi macam pelik sikit, tapi bagi dia terangkan dulu (let him cook).','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>578.48,'end_time'=>584.22,'target_text'=>'So, you use it when someone is building towards a result and you want others not to interrupt.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila seseorang sedang berusaha mencapai hasil dan korang tak nak orang lain mengganggu prosesnya.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>584.32,'end_time'=>588.5,'target_text'=>'13, ate or ate and left no crumbs.','source_text'=>'Nombor 13, \'ate\' atau \'ate and left no crumbs\'.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>588.6,'end_time'=>592.58,'target_text'=>'Did extremely well, flawlessly, or impressively.','source_text'=>'Melakukan sesuatu dengan cemerlang tanpa cela, sempurna, atau memukau.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>592.68,'end_time'=>595.06,'target_text'=>'She ate with that performance.','source_text'=>'Persembahan dia memang mantap gila (she ate).','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>595.16,'end_time'=>598.58,'target_text'=>'That outfit ate and left no crumbs.','source_text'=>'Pakaian yang dia pakai tu memang meletup habis sempurna (left no crumbs).','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>598.68,'end_time'=>605.46,'target_text'=>'So, use it when you want to praise someone\'s style, performance, speech, or confident execution.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila korang nak puji gaya fesyen seseorang, persembahan, ucapan, atau aksi yang penuh keyakinan.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>605.56,'end_time'=>612.26,'target_text'=>'And you should know ate here or ate and left no crumbs has nothing to do with food at all.','source_text'=>'Dan korang kena tahu ungkapan \'ate\' di sini langsung tiada kaitan dengan bab makanan sebenar.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>612.36,'end_time'=>614.16,'target_text'=>'Glaze/Glazing.','source_text'=>'Glaze / Glazing (Memuji melambung-lambung).','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>614.84,'end_time'=>618.98,'target_text'=>'It means to praise someone too much or excessively.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya memuji atau mengampu seseorang secara keterlaluan.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>619.08,'end_time'=>621.3,'target_text'=>'You\'re glazing him way too hard.','source_text'=>'Kau ampu puji dia melambung tinggi sangat ni (glazing).','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>621.4,'end_time'=>623.62,'target_text'=>'The comments were just pure glazing.','source_text'=>'Ruangan komen tu semuanya puji-pujian mengampu semata-mata (glazing).','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>623.72,'end_time'=>629.94,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s used when you want to call out over the top praise in sports, fandoms, or comment sections.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila korang nak tegur pujian berlebihan dalam sukan, peminat tegar selebriti, atau ruangan komen.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>630.04,'end_time'=>632.46,'target_text'=>'Number 15, green flag.','source_text'=>'Nombor 15, \'green flag\'.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>632.56,'end_time'=>636.1,'target_text'=>'Green flag, positive sign or a good trait.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya petanda positif atau sifat keperibadian yang sangat baik.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>636.2,'end_time'=>640.02,'target_text'=>'The fact that she listens carefully is a green flag.','source_text'=>'Sikap dia yang sudi mendengar dengan teliti adalah ciri yang sangat baik (green flag).','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>640.12,'end_time'=>643.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s a green flag when someone is kind to waiters.','source_text'=>'Sikap melayan pelayan restoran dengan sopan adalah petanda orang yang baik (green flag).','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>643.4,'end_time'=>645.9,'target_text'=>'And you should learn this one with red flag.','source_text'=>'Dan korang patut pelajari ungkapan ini bersama pasangannya iaitu \'red flag\'.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>646,'end_time'=>649.02,'target_text'=>'Red flag is just the opposite of green flag.','source_text'=>'\'Red flag\' adalah lawan kepada \'green flag\'.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>649.12,'end_time'=>651.34,'target_text'=>'So, red flags are like bad traits.','source_text'=>'Jadi \'red flag\' merujuk kepada sifat buruk atau petanda bahaya.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>651.44,'end_time'=>655.9,'target_text'=>'Bad traits usually when you\'re thinking about dating someone in that type of context.','source_text'=>'Sifat negatif terutamanya dalam konteks menilai pasangan ketika bercinta.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>656,'end_time'=>657.9,'target_text'=>'Oh, red flag, green flag.','source_text'=>'Ungkapan red flag dan green flag.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>658,'end_time'=>659.78,'target_text'=>'Number 16, aura.','source_text'=>'Nombor 16, \'aura\'.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>659.88,'end_time'=>666.86,'target_text'=>'This means someone or something has a cool factor, star power, or just like swag.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya seseorang yang ada karisma hebat, pesona bintang, atau gaya bergaya tersendiri (swag).','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>666.96,'end_time'=>669.46,'target_text'=>'He walked in with so much aura.','source_text'=>'Dia melangkah masuk dengan aura karisma yang sangat kuat.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>669.56,'end_time'=>672.54,'target_text'=>'The goal gave her a thousand aura points.','source_text'=>'Jaringan gol tu naikkan mata aura dia sebanyak seribu mata (aura points).','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>672.64,'end_time'=>678.74,'target_text'=>'Use it when describing charisma, coolness, confidence, or impressive presence.','source_text'=>'Gunakan untuk menggambarkan karisma, gaya hebat, keyakinan tinggi, atau kehadiran yang memukau.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>678.84,'end_time'=>683.86,'target_text'=>'Some variations of that are aura points, gain aura, lose aura.','source_text'=>'Beberapa variasinya adalah \'aura points\', \'gain aura\' (tambah aura), atau \'lose aura\' (hilang aura).','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>683.96,'end_time'=>686.22,'target_text'=>'All of that means the same thing, aura.','source_text'=>'Semua variasi itu membawa maksud yang sama tentang aura.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>686.32,'end_time'=>688.42,'target_text'=>'17, glow up.','source_text'=>'Nombor 17, \'glow up\'.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>688.52,'end_time'=>694.58,'target_text'=>'A strong positive transformation, especially in appearance or overall presentation.','source_text'=>'Perubahan diri yang sangat positif, terutamanya dari segi rupa paras, penampilan, atau gaya hidup.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>694.68,'end_time'=>697.22,'target_text'=>'His English had a real glow up this year.','source_text'=>'Penguasaan bahasa Inggeris dia meningkat naik dengan ketara tahun ini (glow up).','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>697.32,'end_time'=>699.86,'target_text'=>'He had a glow up last year.','source_text'=>'Penampilan dia berubah jadi makin bergaya tahun lepas (glow up).','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>699.96,'end_time'=>703.54,'target_text'=>'The apartment had a huge glow up after the redesign.','source_text'=>'Apartmen tu berubah wajah jadi sangat cantik selepas dihias semula (glow up).','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>703.64,'end_time'=>708.86,'target_text'=>'So, use it when it talking about improvement in looks, style, or confidence.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila bercakap tentang peningkatan dari segi rupa paras, gaya, atau keyakinan.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>708.96,'end_time'=>711.22,'target_text'=>'Number 18, brain rot.','source_text'=>'Nombor 18, \'brain rot\'.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>711.32,'end_time'=>717.34,'target_text'=>'Low-quality addictive content online or the mentally numbing effect of too much of it.','source_text'=>'Kandungan internet yang tidak berfaedah dan melalaikan, atau kesan lesu otak akibat terlalu lama menatap skrin.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>717.44,'end_time'=>720.22,'target_text'=>'My feed is just brain rot at this point.','source_text'=>'Laman suapan media sosial aku sekarang penuh dengan benda merepek je (brain rot).','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>720.32,'end_time'=>721.82,'target_text'=>'I need a break from Tik Tok.','source_text'=>'Aku kena berehat sekejap daripada TikTok.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>721.92,'end_time'=>723.82,'target_text'=>'The brain rot is getting bad.','source_text'=>'Kelesuan otak akibat video merepek ni dah makin teruk (brain rot).','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>723.92,'end_time'=>729.78,'target_text'=>'Use it when joking about useless internet content or unhealthy doom scrolling.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila bergurau tentang video internet yang sia-sia atau tabiat ketagih skrol telefon.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>729.88,'end_time'=>732.1,'target_text'=>'Number 19, crash out.','source_text'=>'Nombor 19, \'crash out\'.','order'=>208],
