            ['start_time'=>755.52,'end_time'=>758.7,'target_text'=>'Posting that first class seat felt like a flex.','source_text'=>'Muat naik gambar tempat duduk kelas pertama rasa macam sengaja nak menunjuk (flex).','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>758.8,'end_time'=>762.54,'target_text'=>'He wasn\'t trying to flex, but the camera setup was crazy.','source_text'=>'Dia bukan sengaja nak riak, tapi set peralatan kamera dia memang gempak habis.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>762.64,'end_time'=>768.06,'target_text'=>'So, use it when talking about showing off possessions, achievements, or status.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila bercakap tentang mempamerkan harta benda, pencapaian, atau status kemewahan.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>768.16,'end_time'=>771.14,'target_text'=>'Last but not least, 21, slay.','source_text'=>'Dan yang terakhir, nombor 21, \'slay\'.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>771.24,'end_time'=>778.98,'target_text'=>'If you want to speak English more clearly and naturally, then join my speaking and pronunciation course.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih jelas dan semula jadi, sertailah kursus sebutan dan pertuturan saya.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>779.08,'end_time'=>788.78,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to almost 100 video lessons with two new lessons every week, a clear step-by-step practice system,','source_text'=>'Korang dapat akses terus kepada hampir 100 pelajaran video dengan dua modul baharu setiap minggu, sistem latihan tersusun,','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>788.88,'end_time'=>794.9,'target_text'=>'and an exclusive prompt to help you master the pronunciation of any word.','source_text'=>'dan prompt eksklusif untuk bantu korang kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>795,'end_time'=>800.86,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Dalam kursus ini, kita akan fokus pada sebutan, aksen, ritma, dan kelancaran bertutur secara santai.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>800.96,'end_time'=>805.74,'target_text'=>'So, you can stop hesitating and speak with more confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya korang tak ragu-ragu lagi dan boleh bercakap dengan penuh keyakinan.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>805.84,'end_time'=>810.98,'target_text'=>'Do something extremely well, look amazing, or be impressive.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya melakukan sesuatu dengan sangat hebat, kelihatan memukau, atau bergaya luar biasa.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>811.08,'end_time'=>811.86,'target_text'=>'Slay.','source_text'=>'Memukau / Menawan (Slay).','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>811.96,'end_time'=>813.9,'target_text'=>'You slayed that presentation.','source_text'=>'Pembentangan awak tadi memang hebat memukau (you slayed).','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>814,'end_time'=>816.46,'target_text'=>'Her outfit absolutely slays.','source_text'=>'Gaya pakaian dia memang meletup menawan habis (absolutely slays).','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>816.56,'end_time'=>819.78,'target_text'=>'Or you\'ll hear a lot slay queen.','source_text'=>'Atau korang selalu dengar ungkapan \'slay queen\'.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>819.88,'end_time'=>820.94,'target_text'=>'That\'s really common.','source_text'=>'Ungkapan tu sangat kerap diguna.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>821.04,'end_time'=>822.46,'target_text'=>'Slay queen.','source_text'=>'Slay queen (Gaya hebat ratu).','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>822.56,'end_time'=>828.02,'target_text'=>'So use it when complimenting style, performance, confidence, or execution.','source_text'=>'Gunakan bila memuji gaya, persembahan, keyakinan diri, atau sesuatu kejayaan.','order'=>232],
