        VideoSubtitle::where('video_id', $vid__a0wUa0sF3w->id)->delete();
        foreach ([
            ['start_time'=>0,'end_time'=>6.14,'target_text'=>'Do you want to start thinking in English faster instead of just translating everything in your head?','source_text'=>'Korang nak mula berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih pantas berbanding asyik menterjemah semuanya dalam kepala?','order'=>1],
            ['start_time'=>6.24,'end_time'=>13.58,'target_text'=>'In this video, you are going to shadow a real story written the way native English speakers actually talk.','source_text'=>'Dalam video ini, korang akan buat teknik shadowing menggunakan kisah sebenar yang ditulis mengikut cara penutur asli bercakap.','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>13.68,'end_time'=>21.58,'target_text'=>'This helps you connect directly to meaning, so your brain starts processing English faster and more naturally.','source_text'=>'Ini membantu korang faham maksud secara terus, jadi otak korang mula memproses bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih cepat dan bersahaja.','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>21.68,'end_time'=>24.9,'target_text'=>'At the same time, you improve your pronunciation,','source_text'=>'Pada masa yang sama, korang dapat perbaiki sebutan,','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>25,'end_time'=>29.9,'target_text'=>'rhythm, listening, and speaking by copying real English.','source_text'=>'ritma, pendengaran, dan pertuturan dengan meniru bahasa Inggeris yang sebenar.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>30,'end_time'=>35.66,'target_text'=>'So, read with me, shadow out loud, and train your brain to think in English.','source_text'=>'Jadi, baca bersama saya, sebut kuat-kuat secara shadowing, dan latih otak korang untuk berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>35.76,'end_time'=>44.78,'target_text'=>'This video is part of my 3,000 most common English words series designed to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Video ini adalah sebahagian daripada siri 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan untuk bantu korang faham sehingga 95% perbualan Inggeris.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>44.88,'end_time'=>50.38,'target_text'=>'If you want to get the 3,000 most common English words PDF, it\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling lazim itu, pautannya ada di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>50.48,'end_time'=>51.46,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>51.56,'end_time'=>57.74,'target_text'=>'My brother and sister-in-law planned their baby shower on the same day as my wedding.','source_text'=>'Abang dan kakak ipar saya rancang majlis baby shower dorang pada hari yang sama dengan majlis perkahwinan saya.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>57.84,'end_time'=>62.3,'target_text'=>'So, to start off, guys, do you know what a baby shower is?','source_text'=>'Jadi sebagai permulaan semua, korang tahu tak apa itu baby shower?','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>62.4,'end_time'=>64.22,'target_text'=>'Do you know what a baby shower is?','source_text'=>'Korang tahu tak apa itu baby shower?','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>64.32,'end_time'=>67.1,'target_text'=>'If you know what it is, let me know in the comments right now.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang tahu apa bendanya, beritahu saya kat ruangan komen sekarang.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>67.2,'end_time'=>73.18,'target_text'=>'So, a baby shower is a celebratory party held for parents that are expecting a baby.','source_text'=>'Jadi, baby shower ialah majlis keraian yang diadakan untuk bakal ibu bapa yang menantikan kelahiran bayi.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>73.28,'end_time'=>78.38,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s kind of to celebrate the upcoming birth of your child, a baby shower.','source_text'=>'Kiranya macam menyambut bakal kelahiran anak korang, itulah baby shower.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>78.48,'end_time'=>85.58,'target_text'=>'So, the child isn\'t born yet, but the woman is pregnant, so they celebrate the upcoming birth of that child.','source_text'=>'Bayi tu belum lahir lagi tapi si ibu sedang mengandung, jadi dorang raikan bakal kelahiran anak itu.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>85.68,'end_time'=>86.62,'target_text'=>'A baby shower.','source_text'=>'Majlis baby shower.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>86.72,'end_time'=>90.34,'target_text'=>'And remember, guys, to read on the right-hand side and shadow me.','source_text'=>'Dan ingat kawan-kawan, baca teks di sebelah kanan dan ikut sebutan saya.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>90.44,'end_time'=>97.62,'target_text'=>'I, 25 male, met my beautiful fiance, 25 female, in September 2024.','source_text'=>'Saya, lelaki 25 tahun, berkenalan dengan tunang saya yang cantik, wanita 25 tahun, pada September 2024.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>97.72,'end_time'=>103.86,'target_text'=>'I moved from my state to her state 3 months after we met so I could be closer to her.','source_text'=>'Saya berpindah dari negeri saya ke negerinya 3 bulan selepas kami kenal supaya dapat lebih dekat dengannya.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>103.96,'end_time'=>113.34,'target_text'=>'We got engaged in July 2025, exactly 10 months after we met, and we set the wedding date for March 14th.','source_text'=>'Kami bertunang pada Julai 2025, genap 10 bulan selepas berkenalan, dan kami tetapkan tarikh perkahwinan pada 14 Mac.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>113.44,'end_time'=>119.14,'target_text'=>'No offense, but you think the women would be the ones bringing all the drama to our wedding, right?','source_text'=>'Bukan nak kata apalah, tapi korang mesti ingat pihak perempuan yang akan buat drama dalam perkahwinan kami, kan?','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>119.24,'end_time'=>120.7,'target_text'=>'Not in this case.','source_text'=>'Bukan dalam kes kali ini.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>120.8,'end_time'=>131.06,'target_text'=>'My two older brothers, let\'s call them dumb, aka J, 36 male, and dumber, aka Pat, 33 male, have brought nothing but drama','source_text'=>'Dua orang abang saya, kita namakan je si dungu, iaitu J, 36 tahun, dan lebih dungu, iaitu Pat, 33 tahun, tak habis-habis bawa drama','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>131.16,'end_time'=>132.02,'target_text'=>'to my wedding.','source_text'=>'ke majlis perkahwinan saya.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>132.12,'end_time'=>134.58,'target_text'=>'So, his brothers are a lot older than him.','source_text'=>'Jadi abang-abang dia memang jauh lebih tua daripada dia.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>134.68,'end_time'=>139.06,'target_text'=>'He\'s 25 and his other siblings are 33 and 36.','source_text'=>'Dia berumur 25 tahun dan adik-beradiknya yang lain berumur 33 dan 36 tahun.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>139.16,'end_time'=>141.78,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s an 8 and 11-year difference.','source_text'=>'Jadi jurang umurnya adalah 8 dan 11 tahun.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>141.88,'end_time'=>149.18,'target_text'=>'I asked both of my brothers to be groomsmen since I was the best man in Pat\'s wedding and also in Jay\'s wedding.','source_text'=>'Saya ajak kedua-dua abang saya jadi pengapit pengantin lelaki memandangkan saya pernah jadi pengapit utama masa perkahwinan Pat dan juga Jay.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>149.28,'end_time'=>153.94,'target_text'=>'They both said yes, and that\'s where the drama begins.','source_text'=>'Dua-dua setuju, dan dari situlah mulanya drama.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>154.04,'end_time'=>162.18,'target_text'=>'A month later, Pat calls me and says he won\'t be able to make it to my wedding because his wife is pregnant and her due date','source_text'=>'Sebulan kemudian, Pat telefon saya dan cakap dia tak dapat hadir ke majlis perkahwinan saya sebab isterinya mengandung dan tarikh jangka bersalin','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>162.28,'end_time'=>163.9,'target_text'=>'is in late April.','source_text'=>'adalah pada hujung bulan April.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>164,'end_time'=>171.58,'target_text'=>'Mind you, my wedding is 5 to 6 weeks before her due date and it\'s only about a 4-hour drive.','source_text'=>'Sedangkan majlis saya 5 hingga 6 minggu sebelum tarikh bersalin isterinya dan jarak pemanduan cuma sekitar 4 jam perjalanan.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>171.68,'end_time'=>178.74,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and go deeper than the video, then get the workbook on my website, vocaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih pantas dan mendalam berbanding video ini, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>178.84,'end_time'=>187.62,'target_text'=>'The workbook explains everything in greater detail and comes with exercises to help you learn new vocabulary, grammar, tenses,','source_text'=>'Buku latihan ini menerangkan segalanya dengan lebih terperinci dan dilengkapi latihan untuk bantu korang kuasai kosa kata baru, tatabahasa, tenses,','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>187.72,'end_time'=>193.42,'target_text'=>'sentence patterns, comprehension, and real English you can actually use.','source_text'=>'pola ayat, pemahaman, dan bahasa Inggeris praktikal yang korang boleh gunakan.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>193.52,'end_time'=>199.9,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos so you can keep practicing and improving every lesson.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada buku latihan untuk video sebelum ini supaya korang boleh terus berlatih dan berkembang dalam setiap pembelajaran.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>200,'end_time'=>203.1,'target_text'=>'Click the link in my description to get the workbooks.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk dapatkan buku-buku latihan tersebut.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>203.2,'end_time'=>208.14,'target_text'=>'I brushed it off, congratulated him on the pregnancy, and moved on.','source_text'=>'Saya abaikan saja hal itu, ucapkan tahniah atas kehamilan isterinya, dan teruskan hidup.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>208.24,'end_time'=>216.14,'target_text'=>'I then asked another friend of mine who\'s also out of state, let\'s call him Steve, if he would take Pat\'s place, and he said','source_text'=>'Kemudian saya tanya seorang lagi rakan dari luar negeri, kita panggil dia Steve, kalau dia sudi gantikan tempat Pat, dan dia kata','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>216.24,'end_time'=>216.9,'target_text'=>'yes.','source_text'=>'ya.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>217,'end_time'=>221.78,'target_text'=>'Come Black Friday, I decided to rent our suits since that\'s normally cheaper.','source_text'=>'Bila tiba jualan Black Friday, saya buat keputusan untuk sewa sut kami sebab biasanya lebih murah.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>221.88,'end_time'=>224.02,'target_text'=>'It was $175','source_text'=>'Harganya $175','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>224.12,'end_time'=>230.58,'target_text'=>'on sale because of Black Friday for the suit, shoes, shirt, belt, and pants.','source_text'=>'harga promosi sempena Black Friday lengkap dengan sut, kasut, kemeja, tali pinggang, dan seluar.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>230.68,'end_time'=>237.34,'target_text'=>'Steve and Jay complained that it was too much money, that it was Black Friday, and that since they have kids, they wouldn\'t','source_text'=>'Steve dan Jay merungut kata harga tu terlalu mahal, masa tu kan Black Friday, dan memandangkan dorang ada anak, dorang takkan','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>237.44,'end_time'=>240.54,'target_text'=>'be able to spend that much on renting a suit.','source_text'=>'mampu berbelanja sebanyak itu semata-mata untuk sewa sut.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>240.64,'end_time'=>247.02,'target_text'=>'They then reached out to me separately and asked if we could buy instead since that would be cheaper.','source_text'=>'Dorang kemudian hubungi saya secara berasingan dan tanya kalau boleh beli je sebab kononnya lebih jimat.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>247.12,'end_time'=>254.62,'target_text'=>'So, I gave in and the suits, shoes, belts, shirts, and pants came out to a total of $250.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya pun beralah, dan akhirnya sut, kasut, tali pinggang, kemeja, dan seluar mencecah jumlah keseluruhan $250.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>254.72,'end_time'=>256.98,'target_text'=>'So much for buying being cheaper.','source_text'=>'Kononnya beli lebih murah, hampeh.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>257.08,'end_time'=>265.82,'target_text'=>'Fast forward to January, my fiance and I decided to have a joint bachelor bachelorette trip in the mountains since we figured','source_text'=>'Masa berganjak ke bulan Januari, saya dan tunang buat keputusan untuk adakan percutian bujang bersama di kawasan pergunungan sebab kami rasa','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>265.92,'end_time'=>268.74,'target_text'=>'it would be more fun with more people.','source_text'=>'ia akan jadi lebih seronok bila ada ramai orang.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>268.84,'end_time'=>275.02,'target_text'=>'The girls would do their own thing during the day, the guys would do their own thing, and we\'d all do a group activity together','source_text'=>'Pihak perempuan buat aktiviti sendiri waktu siang, lelaki buat aktiviti sendiri, dan kami semua akan buat aktiviti berkumpulan bersama-sama','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>275.12,'end_time'=>276.06,'target_text'=>'in the evening.','source_text'=>'pada waktu petang.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>276.16,'end_time'=>282.98,'target_text'=>'We decided to do it in January since Jay is an accountant and wouldn\'t have been able to do it sooner.','source_text'=>'Kami putuskan untuk buat pada bulan Januari sebab Jay seorang akauntan dan tak sempat nak sertai lebih awal.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>283.08,'end_time'=>289.62,'target_text'=>'After my fiance sent out all the details, Jay and Steve declined the invitation to the batch trip.','source_text'=>'Selepas tunang saya hantar semua butiran, Jay dan Steve tolak jemputan ke percutian bujang itu.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>289.72,'end_time'=>292.1,'target_text'=>'Batch is just short for bachelor.','source_text'=>'Batch tu singkatan bagi bachelor (bujang).','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>292.2,'end_time'=>293.14,'target_text'=>'A bachelor trip.','source_text'=>'Percutian bujang.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>293.24,'end_time'=>300.34,'target_text'=>'Without my knowledge, my fiance had also included a question in the questionnaire she sent out asking whether the guys would','source_text'=>'Tanpa pengetahuan saya, tunang saya juga masukkan satu soalan dalam borang soal selidik bertanyakan sama ada pihak lelaki','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>300.44,'end_time'=>305.22,'target_text'=>'want to save money and share a bed or pay extra to have their own bed.','source_text'=>'nak jimat duit dan berkongsi katil atau bayar lebih untuk dapat katil sendiri.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>305.32,'end_time'=>313.74,'target_text'=>'Jay and Steve saw this and started complaining behind my back, and my brothers and my dad then proceeded to call me gay for','source_text'=>'Jay dan Steve nampak soalan tu lalu mula mengumpat di belakang saya, kemudian abang-abang dan ayah saya menggelar saya gay semata-mata sebab','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>313.84,'end_time'=>317.22,'target_text'=>'asking if the guys wanted to share a bed.','source_text'=>'tanya sama ada lelaki-lelaki tu nak kongsi katil.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>317.32,'end_time'=>322.34,'target_text'=>'The batch trip was absolutely incredible and so much fun.','source_text'=>'Percutian bujang tu berlangsung dengan sangat hebat dan amat menyeronokkan.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>322.44,'end_time'=>328.38,'target_text'=>'A couple of weeks after the batch trip, my fiance gets a text from my sister-in-law, Pat\'s wife.','source_text'=>'Beberapa minggu selepas percutian bujang itu, tunang saya terima mesej daripada kakak ipar saya, iaitu isteri Pat.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>328.48,'end_time'=>335.5,'target_text'=>'She sent us a save-the-date for her baby shower, and wouldn\'t you know it, the baby shower is on March 14th.','source_text'=>'Dia hantar peringatan tarikh untuk majlis baby shower dia, dan korang tahu tak, majlis baby shower tu jatuh pada 14 Mac.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>335.6,'end_time'=>339.38,'target_text'=>'Yep, the same day as my wedding.','source_text'=>'Ya, tepat pada hari perkahwinan saya.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>339.48,'end_time'=>347.34,'target_text'=>'A week later, they had the absolute audacity to send my fiance an invitation to the baby shower with a message that said,','source_text'=>'Seminggu kemudian, dorang sanggup tebalkan muka hantar jemputan majlis baby shower kepada tunang saya dengan mesej bertulis,','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>347.44,'end_time'=>350.98,'target_text'=>'\"We know y\'all are far away, but we\'d love it if you could come.','source_text'=>'\"Kami tahu korang tinggal jauh, tapi kami berbesar hati kalau korang dapat hadir.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>351.08,'end_time'=>359.42,'target_text'=>'And what, miss our wedding?\" The reason they\'re having the baby shower on my wedding day, in my opinion, is because my sister-in-law','source_text'=>'Dan apa, suruh kami ponteng majlis kahwin sendiri?\" Alasan dorang buat baby shower pada hari perkahwinan saya, pada pendapat saya, adalah kerana kakak ipar saya','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>359.52,'end_time'=>361.5,'target_text'=>'can\'t stand my family.','source_text'=>'langsung tak boleh bertolak ansur dengan keluarga saya.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>361.6,'end_time'=>369.46,'target_text'=>'So, she chose our wedding day knowing none of my family would be able to attend, meaning only her family would be there.','source_text'=>'Jadi, dia pilih tarikh perkahwinan kami kerana tahu tiada keluarga saya yang boleh hadir, bermakna hanya keluarganya sahaja yang ada di sana.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>369.56,'end_time'=>374.02,'target_text'=>'If you\'ve seen The Help, my sister-in-law is Hilly Walters.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang pernah tengok filem The Help, perangai kakak ipar saya sebiji macam Hilly Walters.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>374.12,'end_time'=>375.78,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you guys have seen that movie.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya kalau korang pernah tengok filem tu.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>375.88,'end_time'=>377.58,'target_text'=>'I personally have not.','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi saya sendiri belum pernah tengok.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>377.68,'end_time'=>378.54,'target_text'=>'Update.','source_text'=>'Perkembangan terkini.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>378.64,'end_time'=>384.7,'target_text'=>'A lot of people keep asking about my family and whether Pat is making them choose sides.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang asyik bertanya tentang keluarga saya dan sama ada Pat paksa dorang pilih pihak.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>384.8,'end_time'=>385.62,'target_text'=>'No.','source_text'=>'Tidak.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>385.72,'end_time'=>388.54,'target_text'=>'My family can\'t stand Pat and Hilly.','source_text'=>'Keluarga saya memang tak tahan dengan perangai Pat dan Hilly.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>388.64,'end_time'=>395.3,'target_text'=>'So, even if they tried to pull that card, my family would still choose to come to my wedding without a second thought.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau dorang cuba main taktik tu sekalipun, keluarga saya tetap akan pilih hadir ke majlis perkahwinan saya tanpa berfikir dua kali.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>395.4,'end_time'=>397.66,'target_text'=>'My siblings and my dad will be there.','source_text'=>'Adik-beradik dan ayah saya akan hadir di sana.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>397.76,'end_time'=>402.34,'target_text'=>'My mom will not be attending as she passed away 3 years ago.','source_text'=>'Ibu saya tidak dapat hadir kerana beliau telah meninggal dunia 3 tahun yang lalu.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>402.44,'end_time'=>405.58,'target_text'=>'Now, for the part they\'d probably prefer I leave out.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, bahagian yang dorang mesti harap saya tak ceritakan.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>405.68,'end_time'=>408.54,'target_text'=>'This is not Pat and Hilly\'s first child.','source_text'=>'Ini bukan anak pertama Pat dan Hilly.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>408.64,'end_time'=>410.3,'target_text'=>'This is their third child.','source_text'=>'Ini anak ketiga dorang.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>410.4,'end_time'=>414.62,'target_text'=>'They already have two daughters and another girl on the way.','source_text'=>'Dorang dah ada dua anak perempuan dan seorang lagi bakal lahir.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>414.72,'end_time'=>420.54,'target_text'=>'Hilly has had zero complications with any of her pregnancies or deliveries.','source_text'=>'Hilly langsung tiada sebarang komplikasi sepanjang kehamilan mahupun proses bersalin sebelum ini.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>420.64,'end_time'=>425.98,'target_text'=>'This is not an emergency, not a crisis, and not some tragic circumstance.','source_text'=>'Ini bukan situasi kecemasan, bukan krisis, dan bukan keadaan yang tragis.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>426.08,'end_time'=>433.38,'target_text'=>'It is a conscious decision to hijack attention, and yes, it\'s exactly as selfish as it sounds.','source_text'=>'Ia satu keputusan sengaja untuk mencuri perhatian orang ramai, dan ya, memang perangai pentingkan diri sendiri.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>433.48,'end_time'=>440.9,'target_text'=>'And just when you think it can\'t get any worse, the person who contacted my fiance was Hilly\'s best friend.','source_text'=>'Dan bila korang rasa keadaan tak boleh jadi lebih teruk lagi, orang yang hubungi tunang saya rupa-rupanya kawan baik Hilly.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>441,'end_time'=>446.26,'target_text'=>'For clarity, none of Hilly\'s friends have any relationship with my fiance or me.','source_text'=>'Untuk makluman, kawan-kawan Hilly langsung tiada sebarang hubungan dengan tunang saya ataupun saya.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>446.36,'end_time'=>454.7,'target_text'=>'My fiance was intentionally included to make sure we knew that instead of celebrating our wedding, they\'d be celebrating themselves.','source_text'=>'Tunang saya sengaja dijemput semata-mata untuk pastikan kami tahu daripada raikan perkahwinan kami, dorang pilih raikan diri sendiri.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>454.8,'end_time'=>460.62,'target_text'=>'This was calculated, unnecessary, and dripping with main character syndrome.','source_text'=>'Tindakan ni memang berunsur niat tersembunyi, tak perlu, dan penuh dengan sindrom nak jadi watak utama.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>460.72,'end_time'=>463.46,'target_text'=>'So, no, this isn\'t a misunderstanding.','source_text'=>'Jadi tidak, ini bukan salah faham.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>463.56,'end_time'=>465.26,'target_text'=>'This isn\'t bad timing.','source_text'=>'Ini bukan kebetulan waktu yang salah.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>465.36,'end_time'=>470.22,'target_text'=>'This is two people repeatedly showing everyone exactly who they are.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah dua orang yang berulang kali tunjukkan kepada semua orang belang sebenar diri dorang.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>470.32,'end_time'=>471.38,'target_text'=>'Update two.','source_text'=>'Perkembangan kedua.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>471.48,'end_time'=>477.14,'target_text'=>'I was talking to my dad last night and shockingly the baby shower fiasco came up again.','source_text'=>'Saya berbual dengan ayah saya malam tadi dan mengejutkan sekali isu kekecohan baby shower itu timbul lagi.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>477.24,'end_time'=>481.74,'target_text'=>'It turns out Pat and Hilly went over to my dad\'s house on Saturday.','source_text'=>'Rupa-rupanya Pat dan Hilly ada pergi ke rumah ayah saya pada hari Sabtu.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>481.84,'end_time'=>483.1,'target_text'=>'My condolences.','source_text'=>'Turut bersimpati pada ayah.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>483.2,'end_time'=>489.14,'target_text'=>'And he confronted them about why the baby shower was scheduled on my literal wedding day.','source_text'=>'Dan ayah menegur dorang tentang kenapa majlis baby shower itu dijadualkan tepat pada hari perkahwinan saya.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>489.24,'end_time'=>494.62,'target_text'=>'Pat immediately played dumb and claimed he had no idea it was on my wedding day.','source_text'=>'Pat serta-merta buat-buat bodoh dan dakwa dia langsung tak tahu tarikh tu sama dengan hari perkahwinan saya.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>494.72,'end_time'=>501.58,'target_text'=>'He then proceeded to claim that it was the only day they could host the shower, which is hilarious considering he knew the','source_text'=>'Dia kemudiannya mendakwa kononnya itulah satu-satunya hari dorang boleh buat majlis baby shower tu, satu alasan yang kelakar memandangkan dia tahu','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>501.68,'end_time'=>504.7,'target_text'=>'date when I asked him to be a groomsman.','source_text'=>'tarikh perkahwinan saya masa saya ajak dia jadi pengapit lagi.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>504.8,'end_time'=>510.58,'target_text'=>'And when we got the save the date, Hilly openly admitted she knew it was the same day as our wedding.','source_text'=>'Malah masa kami dapat kad peringatan tarikh tu, Hilly mengaku terus-terang yang dia memang tahu tarikh tu sama dengan hari perkahwinan kami.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>510.68,'end_time'=>511.46,'target_text'=>'So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Jadi, begitulah.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>511.56,'end_time'=>513.02,'target_text'=>'That was a lie.','source_text'=>'Semuanya memang pembohongan semata-mata.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>513.12,'end_time'=>517.46,'target_text'=>'For some background because this behavior didn\'t come out of nowhere.','source_text'=>'Sebagai sedikit latar belakang cerita, perangai dorang ni bukan tiba-tiba muncul macam tu je.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>517.56,'end_time'=>524.3,'target_text'=>'Back in August 2025, when I asked Pat and Jay to be my groomsman, we were on a family vacation.','source_text'=>'Pada Ogos 2025 yang lalu, masa saya ajak Pat dan Jay jadi pengapit saya, kami sekeluarga sedang bercuti bersama.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>524.4,'end_time'=>531.38,'target_text'=>'Normally, my dad buys the groceries for these trips and doesn\'t expect anyone to pay him back.','source_text'=>'Kebiasaannya, ayah saya yang beli semua barang dapur untuk percutian macam ni dan tak pernah minta sesiapa bayar balik pun.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>531.48,'end_time'=>539.98,'target_text'=>'This time, before we even arrived, Pat and Hilly decided to go rogue, bought groceries for everyone without telling us, and','source_text'=>'Kali ni, belum sempat kami sampai lagi, Pat dan Hilly buat keputusan pandai-pandai sendiri, beli barang dapur untuk semua orang tanpa beritahu kami, dan','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>540.08,'end_time'=>545.16,'target_text'=>'then informed us we owed them $70 per person/couple.','source_text'=>'kemudian maklumkan yang kami berhutang $70 setiap orang/pasangan dengan dorang.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>545.28,'end_time'=>549.62,'target_text'=>'No discussion, no heads-up, just a Venmo request.','source_text'=>'Tiada perbincangan, tiada makluman awal, terus hantar tuntutan bayaran Venmo.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>549.72,'end_time'=>553.02,'target_text'=>'At the time, my fiance and I had just gotten engaged.','source_text'=>'Masa tu, saya dan tunang baru sahaja bertunang.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>553.12,'end_time'=>560.1,'target_text'=>'I genuinely couldn\'t afford it, especially since I had already paid my dad $450','source_text'=>'Saya sejujurnya tak mampu nak bayar, tambahan pula saya dah bayar ayah saya $450','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>560.2,'end_time'=>567.5,'target_text'=>'for our share of the Airbnb, which is normal in my family and something we had planned for months in advance.','source_text'=>'sebagai bahagian kami untuk sewa Airbnb, benda yang memang biasa dalam keluarga kami dan dah dirancang berbulan-bulan lebih awal.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>567.6,'end_time'=>576.02,'target_text'=>'What I did not plan for was a surprise $70 grocery bill for food I didn\'t ask for and didn\'t know existed.','source_text'=>'Benda yang saya tak bajet langsung ialah bil mengejut $70 untuk barang dapur yang saya tak minta pun dan langsung tak tahu kewujudannya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>576.12,'end_time'=>584.78,'target_text'=>'However, I refused to pay it considering I couldn\'t afford it and their lack of communication was not about to cost me $70.','source_text'=>'Namun, saya enggan bayar memandangkan saya tak mampu dan sikap dorang yang tak reti berbincang tak patut bebankan saya dengan kos $70 tu.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>584.88,'end_time'=>593.42,'target_text'=>'My refusal apparently caused too much drama, so my dad paid Pat the $70 on our behalf just to make it stop.','source_text'=>'Keengganan saya tu nampaknya cetuskan drama besar, jadi ayah saya tolong bayarkan $70 kepada Pat bagi pihak kami semata-mata nak redakan keadaan.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>593.52,'end_time'=>601.62,'target_text'=>'Fast forward to this weekend, while visiting my dad, Pat mentioned that his wedding gift to me would be the $70 I never paid','source_text'=>'Masa berganjak ke hujung minggu ini, masa melawat ayah, Pat boleh pula sebut hadiah kahwin dia untuk saya ialah hutang $70 yang saya tak pernah bayar','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>601.72,'end_time'=>602.34,'target_text'=>'him.','source_text'=>'pada dia.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>602.44,'end_time'=>605.7,'target_text'=>'My dad snapped and told him he had already paid it.','source_text'=>'Ayah saya terus naik angin dan beritahu dia yang ayah dah jelaskan bayaran tu dulu.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>605.8,'end_time'=>613.78,'target_text'=>'Pat then denied ever receiving the money confidently until Haley finally corrected him and confirmed that yes, my dad did','source_text'=>'Pat dengan yakinnya nafi pernah terima duit tu sehinggalah Hilly akhirnya betulkan dia dan sahkan yang ya, ayah memang dah','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>613.88,'end_time'=>614.46,'target_text'=>'pay him.','source_text'=>'bayar duit tu.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>614.56,'end_time'=>622.58,'target_text'=>'And because why not pile it on, Pat also complained about how expensive our wedding registry is before purchasing the cheapest','source_text'=>'Dan alang-alang nak buat hal lagi, Pat merungut pula betapa mahalnya senarai hajat hadiah kahwin kami sebelum beli barang yang paling murah','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>622.68,'end_time'=>623.82,'target_text'=>'item on it.','source_text'=>'dalam senarai tu.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>623.92,'end_time'=>630.9,'target_text'=>'This is from the same man who proudly put a $70 Yeti cooler on his registry a few years ago.','source_text'=>'Ini daripada lelaki yang sama yang tanpa segan silu letak peti sejuk Yeti berharga $70 dalam senarai hajat kahwin dia beberapa tahun lepas.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>631,'end_time'=>639.46,'target_text'=>'So to recap, lies about the date, selective amnesia about money that was already paid, and complains about how expensive my','source_text'=>'Jadi kesimpulannya, menipu pasal tarikh, pura-pura hilang ingatan pasal duit yang dah dibayar, dan merungut pasal hadiah perkahwinan saya yang','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>639.56,'end_time'=>641.46,'target_text'=>'wedding registry is.','source_text'=>'kononnya terlalu mahal.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>641.56,'end_time'=>643.94,'target_text'=>'I hope you guys are enjoying the shadowing lesson.','source_text'=>'Saya harap korang seronok dengan sesi latihan shadowing ini.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>644.04,'end_time'=>651.54,'target_text'=>'One tip I would like to give you guys is if you\'re watching this on your laptop or the TV or another phone, I would recommend','source_text'=>'Satu tip yang saya nak kongsikan ialah kalau korang tonton video ini di komputer riba, televisyen, atau telefon lain, saya sarankan','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>651.64,'end_time'=>654.86,'target_text'=>'recording yourself reading one of these paragraphs.','source_text'=>'rakam suara korang membaca salah satu perenggan ini.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>654.96,'end_time'=>661.18,'target_text'=>'Read it out loud so that you can hear your pronunciation and accent and you as you watch the video back.','source_text'=>'Baca dengan suara yang kuat supaya korang boleh dengar sebutan dan loghat korang bila tonton balik rakaman tu nanti.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>661.28,'end_time'=>667.3,'target_text'=>'Then in a few months, once you\'ve practiced your accent and your pronunciation more, you can go back and watch these videos','source_text'=>'Kemudian dalam beberapa bulan lagi, bila korang dah banyak berlatih sebutan dan loghat, korang boleh buka balik video-video ini','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>667.4,'end_time'=>669.62,'target_text'=>'to see how much you have improved.','source_text'=>'untuk tengok sejauh mana peningkatan yang korang dah capai.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>669.72,'end_time'=>675.74,'target_text'=>'So make sure to keep track of your progress by recording yourself talking out loud in English.','source_text'=>'Jadi pastikan korang pantau kemajuan diri dengan merakam diri sendiri bercakap bahasa Inggeris dengan lantang.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>675.84,'end_time'=>677.58,'target_text'=>'Next story.','source_text'=>'Kisah seterusnya.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>677.68,'end_time'=>685.9,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for asking my grieving boyfriend to set boundaries with his mom after she wears my bathing suit?','source_text'=>'Adakah saya yang bersalah kerana minta teman lelaki saya yang sedang berduka untuk letak sempadan peribadi dengan ibunya selepas wanita itu pakai baju renang saya?','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>686,'end_time'=>696.06,'target_text'=>'I, 39 female, was dating Mark, 38 male, for almost 5 months when his dad sadly passed away from cancer.','source_text'=>'Saya, wanita 39 tahun, dah bercinta dengan Mark, lelaki 38 tahun, selama hampir 5 bulan apabila ayahnya meninggal dunia akibat kanser.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>696.16,'end_time'=>698.38,'target_text'=>'It was awful, obviously.','source_text'=>'Sudah tentu ia detik yang amat menyedihkan.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>698.48,'end_time'=>702.54,'target_text'=>'His dad was awesome and Mark and he were very close.','source_text'=>'Ayahnya seorang yang sangat baik dan Mark memang sangat rapat dengan mendiang ayahnya.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>702.64,'end_time'=>707.14,'target_text'=>'I try to be supportive, respectful, and give him space.','source_text'=>'Saya cuba beri sokongan, hormat perasaannya, dan beri dia ruang.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>707.24,'end_time'=>708.38,'target_text'=>'All of it.','source_text'=>'Segala-galanya.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>708.48,'end_time'=>710.74,'target_text'=>'But here\'s the thing, his mom.','source_text'=>'Tapi masalahnya sekarang ialah ibunya.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>710.84,'end_time'=>715.06,'target_text'=>'Before his dad passed, she was already a lot.','source_text'=>'Sebelum ayahnya meninggal pun, perangai ibunya dah memang melampau.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>715.16,'end_time'=>721.74,'target_text'=>'She FaceTimed my boyfriend two to three times a day every single day.','source_text'=>'Dia buat panggilan FaceTime dengan teman lelaki saya dua hingga tiga kali sehari setiap hari.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>721.84,'end_time'=>725.58,'target_text'=>'She showed up unannounced three to four times a week.','source_text'=>'Dia datang terjah rumah tanpa beritahu tiga hingga empat kali seminggu.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>725.68,'end_time'=>729.1,'target_text'=>'She lives 45 minutes away.','source_text'=>'Padahal rumah dia 45 minit jauhnya.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>729.2,'end_time'=>737.5,'target_text'=>'She did his laundry, she cleaned his house, she cooked for him, she rearranged his furniture, she decorated his entire house.','source_text'=>'Dia basuhkan baju, bersihkan rumah, masakkan makanan, susun semula perabot, dan hiaskan seluruh rumah anaknya.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>737.6,'end_time'=>739.38,'target_text'=>'This man is 38.','source_text'=>'Lelaki ni dah umur 38 tahun.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>739.48,'end_time'=>747.3,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly','source_text'=>'Kalau korang serius nak fasih bertutur bahasa Inggeris, saya dah sediakan kursus pertuturan dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan kepada korang secara tepat','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>747.4,'end_time'=>749.42,'target_text'=>'what to do step by step.','source_text'=>'apa yang perlu dilakukan langkah demi langkah.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>749.52,'end_time'=>757.46,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to 80 plus video lessons right away, and I add three to five brand new lessons every week so you can','source_text'=>'Korang akan dapat akses serta-merta kepada lebih 80 video pembelajaran, dan saya tambah tiga hingga lima video baru setiap minggu supaya korang boleh','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>757.56,'end_time'=>759.7,'target_text'=>'keep improving consistently.','source_text'=>'terus berkembang secara konsisten.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>759.8,'end_time'=>763.18,'target_text'=>'And this is not just a course full of random videos.','source_text'=>'Dan ini bukan sekadar kursus yang dipenuhi video rambang.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>763.28,'end_time'=>771.9,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get an exclusive ChatGPT prompt that allows you to master the pronunciation of any word, plus a clear practice structure','source_text'=>'Korang akan dapat prompt ChatGPT eksklusif yang bantu kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan, beserta struktur latihan yang jelas','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>772,'end_time'=>778.1,'target_text'=>'so you always know exactly how to study, what to focus on, and how to make real progress.','source_text'=>'supaya korang sentiasa tahu cara belajar yang betul, apa yang perlu difokuskan, dan cara capai kemajuan sebenar.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>778.2,'end_time'=>787.1,'target_text'=>'Inside we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking so you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya kita fokus pada sebutan, loghat, ritma, dan pertuturan semulajadi supaya korang tak lagi teragak-agak, bertutur lebih bersahaja, dan','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>787.2,'end_time'=>790.02,'target_text'=>'speak English with real confidence.','source_text'=>'bercakap bahasa Inggeris dengan penuh keyakinan.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>790.12,'end_time'=>791.86,'target_text'=>'Join today in the description.','source_text'=>'Sertai hari ini melalui pautan di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>791.96,'end_time'=>800.98,'target_text'=>'Every weekend she would just appear at his house where I also was and sit there badmouthing his ex for hours in front of me,','source_text'=>'Setiap hujung minggu dia akan muncul di rumah anaknya masa saya ada di situ dan duduk mengutuk bekas kekasih anaknya berjam-jam depan saya,','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>801.08,'end_time'=>804.38,'target_text'=>'which felt less like bonding and more like an audition.','source_text'=>'yang terasa lebih kepada sesi uji bakat daripada nak bermesra.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>804.48,'end_time'=>806.5,'target_text'=>'Look how much I hated the last one.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah betapa bencinya mak dengan bekas kekasih yang dulu.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>806.6,'end_time'=>812.82,'target_text'=>'Meanwhile, she was syrupy sweet to my face in a way that made my skin itch.','source_text'=>'Dalam masa yang sama, dia berlagak manis terlebih di depan saya sampai buat saya rasa meremang dan rimas.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>812.92,'end_time'=>815.34,'target_text'=>'Fast forward, his dad passes away.','source_text'=>'Masa berlalu, ayahnya pun meninggal dunia.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>815.44,'end_time'=>820.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m walking on eggshells because grief is brutal and I\'m not a monster.','source_text'=>'Saya terpaksa menjaga setiap langkah dan kata-kata sebab faham kesedihan itu perit dan saya bukannya orang yang kejam.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>820.52,'end_time'=>827.1,'target_text'=>'Then one day, while I\'m not there, she goes to his house and wears my bathing suit in the spa.','source_text'=>'Kemudian pada suatu hari, masa saya tiada di situ, dia pergi ke rumah anaknya dan pakai baju renang saya untuk mandi di spa.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>827.2,'end_time'=>830.46,'target_text'=>'Not a random spare, my bathing suit.','source_text'=>'Bukan baju renang lebihan, tapi baju renang peribadi saya.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>830.56,'end_time'=>835.26,'target_text'=>'I only found out because she took it home with her to wash it.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma dapat tahu sebab dia bawa baju renang tu balik ke rumahnya untuk dicuci.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>835.36,'end_time'=>836.46,'target_text'=>'Let me repeat that.','source_text'=>'Biar saya ulang sekali lagi.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>836.56,'end_time'=>845.54,'target_text'=>'She drove 45 minutes home with my used bathing suit to wash it, even though she usually does her son\'s laundry at her place.','source_text'=>'Dia memandu 45 minit balik ke rumahnya dengan membawa baju renang yang saya dah pakai untuk dicuci, walaupun biasanya dia basuh baju anaknya di situ.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>845.64,'end_time'=>850.42,'target_text'=>'After the bathing suit incident, I stayed quiet because she had just lost her husband.','source_text'=>'Selepas insiden baju renang tu, saya diamkan diri sebab dia baru sahaja kehilangan suami.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>850.52,'end_time'=>854.06,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t want to be the villain over swimwear.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak nampak macam orang jahat semata-mata sebab isu baju renang.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>854.16,'end_time'=>862.02,'target_text'=>'The next day, my boyfriend casually told me he was turning his basement into an apartment for his mom so she can move in.','source_text'=>'Keesokan harinya, teman lelaki saya bersahaja beritahu yang dia nak ubah suai ruang bawah tanah jadi apartmen untuk ibunya berpindah masuk.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>862.12,'end_time'=>864.78,'target_text'=>'Not a discussion, a decision.','source_text'=>'Bukan perbincangan, tapi satu ketetapan.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>864.88,'end_time'=>869.98,'target_text'=>'I took a few days to process everything, then asked to talk calmly.','source_text'=>'Saya ambil masa beberapa hari untuk hadam semua perkara, kemudian ajak berbincang secara tenang.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>870.08,'end_time'=>875.74,'target_text'=>'I said I understood she was grieving, but before she moved in, he needed to set boundaries.','source_text'=>'Saya beritahu saya faham ibunya sedang bersedih, tapi sebelum ibunya pindah masuk, dia perlu tetapkan sempadan peribadi.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>875.84,'end_time'=>884.46,'target_text'=>'I mentioned how intense things already were and that her wearing my bathing suit without asking made me uncomfortable.','source_text'=>'Saya ingatkan betapa melampaunya keadaan sebelum ini dan tindakan ibunya pakai baju renang saya tanpa izin buat saya rasa tak selesa.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>884.56,'end_time'=>890.42,'target_text'=>'He got defensive immediately, took her side and told me to leave.','source_text'=>'Dia serta-merta mula pertahankan diri, menangkan ibunya dan suruh saya berambus.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>890.52,'end_time'=>894.78,'target_text'=>'Then he gave me the silent treatment for two days.','source_text'=>'Kemudian dia langsung tak bercakap dengan saya selama dua hari.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>894.88,'end_time'=>898.06,'target_text'=>'After that, he dumped me by text.','source_text'=>'Selepas itu, dia putuskan hubungan dengan saya melalui mesej teks.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>898.16,'end_time'=>899.38,'target_text'=>'Hold on, hold on, hold on.','source_text'=>'Tunggu kejap, tunggu sekejap.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>899.48,'end_time'=>906.1,'target_text'=>'He dumped you by text because you didn\'t want his crazy mom to move in with you guys.','source_text'=>'Dia putuskan hubungan menerusi mesej teks sebab awak tak nak mak dia yang pelik tu tinggal sekali dengan korang.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>906.2,'end_time'=>908.66,'target_text'=>'I feel like he did you a favor, I\'m not going to lie.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, saya rasa dia sebenarnya dah buat kebaikan untuk awak dengan lepaskan awak.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>908.76,'end_time'=>909.7,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Mari kita sambung.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>909.8,'end_time'=>918.78,'target_text'=>'It hurts, but honestly, if asking for basic boundaries ends a relationship, it probably wasn\'t much of one to begin with.','source_text'=>'Memang sakit hati, tapi sejujurnya kalau sekadar minta sempadan privasi asas pun boleh hancurkan hubungan, mungkin dari awal lagi hubungan tu memang tak bermakna.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>918.88,'end_time'=>919.46,'target_text'=>'Facts.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>919.56,'end_time'=>924.14,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s the end of that story and overall, that is kind of insane.','source_text'=>'Jadi, itulah penghujung kisah itu dan secara keseluruhannya, situasi tu memang agak gila.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>924.24,'end_time'=>926.26,'target_text'=>'So, I definitely don\'t think you\'re in the wrong.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya memang rasa pihak perempuan langsung tak bersalah.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>926.36,'end_time'=>932.02,'target_text'=>'You are your own person and you\'re allowed to set boundaries with other people and if they don\'t respect those boundaries','source_text'=>'Awak ada hak peribadi sendiri dan berhak letak batasan dengan orang lain, dan kalau dorang tak hormat batasan itu','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>932.12,'end_time'=>937.3,'target_text'=>'or they cross them, then you can step away or they can break up with you if they don\'t like that boundary.','source_text'=>'atau melampaui batas, awak boleh undur diri atau dorang boleh putuskan hubungan kalau tak suka dengan sempadan tu.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>937.4,'end_time'=>942.98,'target_text'=>'Clearly, your boyfriend did not like that boundary you were setting with him and his mom and he broke up with you.','source_text'=>'Jelas sekali teman lelaki awak tak suka batasan yang awak tetapkan antara dia dan ibunya lalu bertindak putuskan hubungan.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>943.08,'end_time'=>945.34,'target_text'=>'I mean, I don\'t think he did anything wrong either.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, dari satu sudut lelaki tu pun rasa dia tak salah.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>945.44,'end_time'=>951.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s his mom, so obviously, he\'s going to prioritize her naturally, but you felt like she was really controlling and she crossed','source_text'=>'Itu ibu dia, jadi tentulah dia akan utamakan ibunya, tapi awak rasa ibunya terlalu mengongkong dan dah melampaui batas','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>951.72,'end_time'=>957.06,'target_text'=>'a boundary by wearing your bathing suit, but you didn\'t want to bring it up because she just lost her husband.','source_text'=>'bila pakai baju renang peribadi awak, cuma awak tak nak bangkitkan isu tu sebab dia baru kehilangan suami.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>957.16,'end_time'=>962.7,'target_text'=>'And honestly, if the relationship is that fragile that after setting this boundary, he wants to break up with you, then I','source_text'=>'Dan sejujurnya, kalau hubungan tu serapuh itu sampaikan bila letak batas sikit je dia nak putus, maka saya','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>962.8,'end_time'=>964.9,'target_text'=>'think that\'s for the better in all honesty.','source_text'=>'rasa itu sebenarnya jalan yang terbaik untuk diri awak.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>965,'end_time'=>966.14,'target_text'=>'What do you guys think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat korang semua?','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>966.24,'end_time'=>967.34,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya kat ruangan komen.','order'=>197],
