            ['start_time'=>151.6,'end_time'=>154.86,'target_text'=>'They go like for like you can have like a kilometer-long escalator.','source_text'=>'Panjangnya macam ada eskalator sepanjang satu kilometer.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>154.96,'end_time'=>158.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, cuz Seoul is also built on a city on on a mountain, sorry.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab Seoul pun sebuah bandar yang dibina di atas bukit.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>158.92,'end_time'=>163.06,'target_text'=>'And I think Chongqing is even more so built on a mountain.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa Chongqing lagilah dibina di atas kawasan pergunungan.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>163.16,'end_time'=>165.42,'target_text'=>'But, we\'re going to the right-hand side.','source_text'=>'Tapi, kami nak pergi ke sebelah kanan.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>165.52,'end_time'=>168.22,'target_text'=>'Oh, this escalator is not working, so we have to walk.','source_text'=>'Alamak, eskalator ni rosak, jadi kami kena berjalan kaki.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>168.32,'end_time'=>171.06,'target_text'=>'But, another escalator, but a broken one.','source_text'=>'Lagi satu eskalator, tapi yang ni rosak pula.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>171.16,'end_time'=>174.66,'target_text'=>'>> These are always trippy, cuz the lines look like distorted.','source_text'=>'>> Jalan atas eskalator mati ni rasa pelik, sebab garis-garis dia nampak berpusing.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>174.76,'end_time'=>175.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul tu.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>175.32,'end_time'=>176.66,'target_text'=>'You could just like fall.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam nak tersadung jatuh.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>176.76,'end_time'=>177.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, they are they are trippy.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang rasa mengelirukan pandangan.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>178.08,'end_time'=>180.86,'target_text'=>'So, you just got to kind of just got to walk.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kena teruskan berjalan je.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>180.96,'end_time'=>181.94,'target_text'=>'>> You survived that.','source_text'=>'>> Lepas pun kau jalan tadi.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>182.04,'end_time'=>183.26,'target_text'=>'>> But, here we go.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, jom kita teruskan.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>183.36,'end_time'=>184.1,'target_text'=>'Sinsa.','source_text'=>'Stesen Sinsa.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>184.2,'end_time'=>186.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, our fast transfer is 4-2.','source_text'=>'Ya, pertukaran pantas kita kat pintu 4-2.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>186.68,'end_time'=>188.5,'target_text'=>'4-2 or 3-2.','source_text'=>'Pintu 4-2 atau 3-2.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>188.6,'end_time'=>190.62,'target_text'=>'Now, we\'re waiting for the train.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami sedang menunggu kereta api.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>190.72,'end_time'=>193.9,'target_text'=>'Should be here in a couple minutes, 4 minutes, 3 minutes.','source_text'=>'Sepatutnya sampai dalam beberapa minit lagi, 4 minit, 3 minit.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>194,'end_time'=>196.26,'target_text'=>'Okay, now the train is stopping, so we\'re getting on.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang tren sedang berhenti, jadi kami naik.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>196.36,'end_time'=>199.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just got off at I really am not sure.','source_text'=>'Okey, kami baru je turun kat stesen yang saya tak berapa pasti namanya.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>199.72,'end_time'=>202.3,'target_text'=>'The station names are all all super difficult for me.','source_text'=>'Nama-nama stesen kat sini semuanya sangat susah untuk saya sebut.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>202.4,'end_time'=>208.06,'target_text'=>'But, we\'re going to exit 8, and uh This is actually a really interesting area we\'re about to show you, so let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Tapi kami nak keluar ikut pintu keluar 8, dan ini kawasan yang sangat menarik untuk kami tunjukkan pada korang, jom.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>208.16,'end_time'=>214.5,'target_text'=>'And this is somewhere I\'ve only been one time at night for like 5 minutes, so it\'s cool to explore it again during the daytime,','source_text'=>'Dan tempat ni saya pernah singgah sekali je waktu malam selama 5 minit, jadi seronok dapat teroka lagi waktu siang,','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>214.6,'end_time'=>215.98,'target_text'=>'when you know, stuff is actually open.','source_text'=>'bila kedai-kedai memang tengah buka.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>216.08,'end_time'=>219.38,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s find the exit, exit number 8.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jom kita cari pintu keluar nombor 8.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>219.48,'end_time'=>220.58,'target_text'=>'>> We\'re going to 8.','source_text'=>'>> Kita nak pergi ke pintu 8.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>220.68,'end_time'=>222.3,'target_text'=>'>> There are a bunch of shops here on the side.','source_text'=>'>> Ada banyak kedai kat tepi ni.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>222.4,'end_time'=>225.38,'target_text'=>'One was selling food, but this guy\'s selling like electronics and stuff.','source_text'=>'Satu tadi jual makanan, tapi kedai ni jual barangan elektronik.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>225.48,'end_time'=>229.14,'target_text'=>'And of course, there\'s an arcade where you can use the claw machine.','source_text'=>'Dan mestilah ada arked permainan mesin cakar anak patung.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>229.24,'end_time'=>232.74,'target_text'=>'I always uh, fail at the claw machines.','source_text'=>'Saya selalu gagal bila main mesin cakar ni.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>232.84,'end_time'=>234.88,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll be surprised.','source_text'=>'>> Tak terkejut pun.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>236.4,'end_time'=>237.5,'target_text'=>'>> Weighing me down.','source_text'=>'>> Bebankan saya.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>237.6,'end_time'=>242.38,'target_text'=>'I have a friend that\'s really, really good at claw machines, but me personally, I\'m not good at claw machines, so I can\'t','source_text'=>'Saya ada kawan yang memang hebat main mesin cakar, tapi saya sendiri tak pandai main, jadi saya tak boleh','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>242.48,'end_time'=>245.54,'target_text'=>'do that, but now there\'s like some clothing stores along here.','source_text'=>'buat macam tu, tapi sekarang ada beberapa kedai pakaian sepanjang laluan ni.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>245.64,'end_time'=>246.9,'target_text'=>'I wonder how busy they are.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya sejauh mana kedai-kedai ni sibuk.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>247,'end_time'=>248.9,'target_text'=>'I wonder if a lot of people shop here.','source_text'=>'Ramai orang beli-belah kat sini ke agaknya.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>249,'end_time'=>251.06,'target_text'=>'I mean, I guess they they must because they\'re stores.','source_text'=>'Mestilah ada orang beli sebab kedai-kedai ni masih beroperasi.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>251.16,'end_time'=>254.34,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe you rip your pants on the way to work and you can just grab a quick one right here.','source_text'=>'>> Mungkin seluar kau terkoyak masa dalam perjalanan pergi kerja, boleh terus beli sehelai kat sini.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>254.44,'end_time'=>254.72,'target_text'=>'>> You know what?','source_text'=>'>> Tahu tak?','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>254.72,'end_time'=>255.22,'target_text'=>'That is true.','source_text'=>'Ada betulnya juga.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>255.32,'end_time'=>257.82,'target_text'=>'And also if it\'s cold, just grab a quick scarf.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau cuaca sejuk, boleh terus capai selendang.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>257.92,'end_time'=>259.18,'target_text'=>'>> You need an umbrella or something.','source_text'=>'>> Beli payung ke apa ke.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>259.28,'end_time'=>260.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>260.2,'end_time'=>262.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, here\'s eight this way.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, pintu lapan ikut jalan ni.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>262.28,'end_time'=>263.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, and and you can just get some food.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, dan korang boleh beli makanan terus.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>263.72,'end_time'=>267.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s That\'s like really typical street food, like the most typical.','source_text'=>'Itu makanan jalanan yang memang biasa sangat dijumpai kat sini.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>267.64,'end_time'=>268.7,'target_text'=>'Oh, plastic surgeon?','source_text'=>'Oh, pakar bedah plastik?','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>268.8,'end_time'=>269.98,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, this guy looks plastic.','source_text'=>'>> Muka orang ni nampak macam plastik gila.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>270.08,'end_time'=>272.7,'target_text'=>'>> The plastic surgeon advertisement is crazy.','source_text'=>'>> Iklan pembedahan plastik ni memang luar biasa.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>272.8,'end_time'=>273.9,'target_text'=>'But let\'s go up.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita naik ke atas.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>274,'end_time'=>275.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s a forklift driver.','source_text'=>'Itu pemandu forklift.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>275.52,'end_time'=>277.1,'target_text'=>'Are you forklift certified?','source_text'=>'Kau ada lesen pemandu forklift ke?','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>277.2,'end_time'=>277.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s so funny.','source_text'=>'Kelakar betullah.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>277.92,'end_time'=>279.62,'target_text'=>'That\'s like a super huge meme.','source_text'=>'Itu meme yang sangat popular.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>279.72,'end_time'=>281.66,'target_text'=>'Was it last year or a year ago, 2 years ago?','source_text'=>'Meme tu tahun lepas ke, setahun lepas, atau 2 tahun lepas?','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>281.76,'end_time'=>282.38,'target_text'=>'>> 5 years ago.','source_text'=>'>> 5 tahun lepas.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>282.48,'end_time'=>284.54,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, 5 years ago was like the forklift driver meme.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, 5 tahun lepas rupa-rupanya meme pemandu forklift tu.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>284.64,'end_time'=>286.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s like, are you forklift certified?','source_text'=>'Macam ungkapan, kau ada lesen forklift ke?','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>287.04,'end_time'=>287.5,'target_text'=>'Super funny.','source_text'=>'Memang kelakar habis.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>287.6,'end_time'=>288.1,'target_text'=>'>> I know this street.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tahu jalan ni.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>288.2,'end_time'=>291.98,'target_text'=>'This street\'s the Gangnam street and there\'s a Tim Hortons along this street somewhere.','source_text'=>'Ini jalan kawasan Gangnam dan ada cawangan Tim Hortons kat sepanjang jalan ni.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>292.08,'end_time'=>292.5,'target_text'=>'>> real?','source_text'=>'>> Betul ke?','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>292.6,'end_time'=>293,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>293.08,'end_time'=>295.82,'target_text'=>'Like when I was here 2 years ago, they were just building it.','source_text'=>'Masa saya kat sini 2 tahun lepas, dorang baru tengah bina kedai tu.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>295.92,'end_time'=>302.34,'target_text'=>'>> That would actually be nice to go there, but I\'ll I\'ll put in a a video of the forklift meme like right here.','source_text'=>'>> Seronok juga kalau singgah sana, tapi saya akan selitkan klip video meme forklift tu kat sini.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>302.44,'end_time'=>304.34,'target_text'=>'>> You\'re too late, Sonic.','source_text'=>'>> Kau dah terlambat, Sonic.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>304.44,'end_time'=>308,'target_text'=>'I am now FORKLIFT CERTIFIED.','source_text'=>'Aku sekarang dah ADA LESEN FORKLIFT.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>310.28,'end_time'=>312.22,'target_text'=>'OH MY GOD.','source_text'=>'YA TUHAN.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>312.32,'end_time'=>315.54,'target_text'=>'>> IT WAS PRETTY popular like, what are you forklift certified?','source_text'=>'>> Meme tu memang agak popular macam soalan, apa kau ada lesen forklift?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>315.64,'end_time'=>316.42,'target_text'=>'>> Nah.','source_text'=>'>> Tak adalah.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>316.52,'end_time'=>318.62,'target_text'=>'>> Look, it even says Canadian coffee house.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok, tertulis kedai kopi Kanada.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>318.72,'end_time'=>321.38,'target_text'=>'They knew I was coming here, so they opened up a Tim Hortons just for me.','source_text'=>'Dorang tahu saya nak datang sini, jadi dorang buka Tim Hortons khas untuk saya.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>321.48,'end_time'=>324.5,'target_text'=>'So now we\'re going to go in and have some Canadian Tim Hortons.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami nak masuk dan nikmati kopi Tim Hortons Kanada.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>324.6,'end_time'=>326.9,'target_text'=>'I haven\'t had Tim Hortons in like a year or something.','source_text'=>'Dah dekat setahun rasanya saya tak minum kopi Tim Hortons.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>327,'end_time'=>328.3,'target_text'=>'Okay, let\'s go into Timmies.','source_text'=>'Okey, jom kita masuk ke Timmies.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>328.4,'end_time'=>330.46,'target_text'=>'Timmies is Canadian say.','source_text'=>'Timmies tu panggilan orang Kanada.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>330.56,'end_time'=>331.94,'target_text'=>'Always fresh.','source_text'=>'Sentiasa segar.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>332.04,'end_time'=>333.46,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know about that one.','source_text'=>'>> Yang tu saya tak pastilah.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>333.56,'end_time'=>334.54,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so these are the donuts.','source_text'=>'>> Okey, jadi ini pilihan donat yang ada.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>334.64,'end_time'=>337.02,'target_text'=>'There\'s not the classic Canadian donuts.','source_text'=>'Kat sini tak ada donat klasik Kanada.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>337.12,'end_time'=>344.18,'target_text'=>'In Canada, there\'s like a donut called the Canadian, which is just like a fully round donut with the maple syrup like topping','source_text'=>'Kat Kanada, ada sejenis donat nama Canadian, bentuknya bulat penuh dengan limpahan sirap mapel kat atas','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>344.28,'end_time'=>347.86,'target_text'=>'and the inside is custard and that\'s my favorite one, but they don\'t have that one here.','source_text'=>'dan berinti kastard kat dalam, itu donat kegemaran saya tapi dorang tak jual kat sini.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>347.96,'end_time'=>349.66,'target_text'=>'>> Please select your drink.','source_text'=>'>> Sila pilih minuman anda.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>349.76,'end_time'=>350.54,'target_text'=>'>> Double-double.','source_text'=>'>> Double-double.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>350.64,'end_time'=>351.9,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that\'s what I was saying the other day.','source_text'=>'Ya, itulah yang saya sebut hari tu.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>352,'end_time'=>352.54,'target_text'=>'Double-double.','source_text'=>'Double-double.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>352.64,'end_time'=>353.9,'target_text'=>'Two creams, two sugars.','source_text'=>'Dua krimer, dua gula.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>354,'end_time'=>354.74,'target_text'=>'What do you want?','source_text'=>'Kau nak apa?','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>354.84,'end_time'=>355.82,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m going to get a double-double.','source_text'=>'>> Saya nak beli double-double.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>355.92,'end_time'=>357.82,'target_text'=>'>> Timbits are coming soon, bro.','source_text'=>'>> Timbits akan datang tak lama lagi, bro.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>357.92,'end_time'=>360.06,'target_text'=>'Timbits are like >> Timbits are right there.','source_text'=>'Timbits tu macam >> Timbits ada kat situ tu.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>360.16,'end_time'=>360.56,'target_text'=>'Bro.','source_text'=>'Bro.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>360.56,'end_time'=>361.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, they do have Timbits.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, memang ada Timbits rupanya.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>361.92,'end_time'=>362.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>362.76,'end_time'=>365.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, Timbits are like the small donuts that are really popular.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, Timbits tu donat bulat kecil yang sangat popular.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>365.68,'end_time'=>366.3,'target_text'=>'>> Donut holes.','source_text'=>'>> Bebola donat.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>366.4,'end_time'=>367.66,'target_text'=>'>> The donut holes are the Timbits.','source_text'=>'>> Bebola donat tu dipanggil Timbits.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>367.76,'end_time'=>368.94,'target_text'=>'Those are super popular.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat popular.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>369.04,'end_time'=>371.14,'target_text'=>'They are said they are coming soon, but they are over there in the window.','source_text'=>'Kat skrin tulis akan datang, tapi kat rak cermin tu dah ada.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>371.24,'end_time'=>373.46,'target_text'=>'But, I don\'t really want any Timbits right now.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya tak berapa teringin nak makan Timbits sekarang.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>373.56,'end_time'=>374.66,'target_text'=>'See what they got.','source_text'=>'Tengok apa lagi yang ada.','order'=>163],
