            ['start_time'=>1339.4,'end_time'=>1348.26,'target_text'=>'Inside we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking, so you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya kita fokus pada sebutan, loghat, ritma, dan pertuturan semulajadi supaya korang tak lagi teragak-agak, bertutur lebih bersahaja, dan','order'=>613],
