            ['start_time'=>44.84,'end_time'=>53.18,'target_text'=>'And because this is a real conversation, it can also help you start thinking in English instead of translating everything','source_text'=>'Dan kerana ini perbualan sebenar, ia juga membantu korang mula berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris daripada asyik menterjemah semuanya','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>53.28,'end_time'=>54.22,'target_text'=>'in your head.','source_text'=>'dalam kepala.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>54.32,'end_time'=>62.7,'target_text'=>'So sit back, listen carefully, and enjoy this slow English podcast about our trip to Malaysia.','source_text'=>'Jadi duduk dengan tenang, dengar baik-baik, dan nikmati podcast bahasa Inggeris perlahan tentang percutian kami ke Malaysia ini.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>62.8,'end_time'=>66.62,'target_text'=>'And if you want to get the 3,000 words PDF, it\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau korang nak dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan, pautannya ada di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>66.72,'end_time'=>71.54,'target_text'=>'JetBridge or the JetWay, healthier airport with vegetation behind them.','source_text'=>'Jejantas udara (jet bridge), lapangan terbang lebih segar dengan kehijauan di belakang.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>71.64,'end_time'=>76.58,'target_text'=>'Change accommodation, Karmichael Bickley, antidote is low cost.','source_text'=>'Tukar penginapan, tambang murah.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>76.68,'end_time'=>77.82,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>77.92,'end_time'=>81.58,'target_text'=>'So where did we fly from when we arrived in Malaysia?','source_text'=>'Dari mana kita berlepas masa kita sampai di Malaysia hari tu?','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>81.68,'end_time'=>84.94,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so this was January, right?','source_text'=>'>> Okey, masa tu bulan Januari, kan?','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>85.04,'end_time'=>86.74,'target_text'=>'We flew or was it February?','source_text'=>'Kita terbang bulan tu atau bulan Februari?','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>86.84,'end_time'=>88.7,'target_text'=>'>> Let me get the exact date for you.','source_text'=>'>> Biar saya periksa tarikh yang tepat.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>88.8,'end_time'=>91.42,'target_text'=>'It was January 30th.','source_text'=>'Masa tu 30 Januari.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>91.52,'end_time'=>101.54,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so end of January, we flew from Thailand, specifically in Bangkok from Don Mueang Airport, which is the smaller international','source_text'=>'>> Okey, jadi hujung Januari, kami terbang dari Thailand, tepatnya di Bangkok dari Lapangan Terbang Don Mueang, iaitu lapangan terbang antarabangsa yang lebih kecil','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>101.64,'end_time'=>103.3,'target_text'=>'airport in Bangkok.','source_text'=>'di Bangkok.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>103.4,'end_time'=>109.9,'target_text'=>'And then from there we flew to Penang International Airport, which was not very far.','source_text'=>'Dan dari situ kami terbang ke Lapangan Terbang Antarabangsa Pulau Pinang, jaraknya tak berapa jauh.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>110,'end_time'=>112.78,'target_text'=>'I think the flight was maybe an hour.','source_text'=>'Penerbangan tu rasanya dalam sejam je.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>112.88,'end_time'=>116.5,'target_text'=>'>> I think yeah, hour or [music] less because it\'s very very close.','source_text'=>'>> Ya rasanya sejam atau [muzik] kurang daripada tu sebab jaraknya dekat sangat.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>116.6,'end_time'=>121.1,'target_text'=>'Like if you look at it on the map, Bangkok is here and uh Penang is right here.','source_text'=>'Kalau tengok atas peta, Bangkok kat sini dan Pulau Pinang kat sebelah sini je.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>121.2,'end_time'=>122.5,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s very close.','source_text'=>'Jadi memang sangat dekat.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>122.6,'end_time'=>124.46,'target_text'=>'It wasn\'t a very long flight.','source_text'=>'Bukan penerbangan yang lama.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>124.56,'end_time'=>126.54,'target_text'=>'The flight time was very short.','source_text'=>'Masa penerbangannya sangat singkat.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>126.64,'end_time'=>132.3,'target_text'=>'So, it kind of just felt like uh taking a bus across the city or something like that.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam naik bas pusing bandar je.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>132.4,'end_time'=>133.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it wasn\'t long.','source_text'=>'Ya, tak lama pun.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>133.36,'end_time'=>142.98,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95% of everyday English.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling lazim saya dan pelajari perkataan yang membantu anda faham hingga 95% bahasa Inggeris harian.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>143.08,'end_time'=>153.38,'target_text'=>'It includes real definitions, real example sentences for every meaning, and everything is organized by CEFR level and topic.','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi definisi sebenar, contoh ayat harian untuk setiap makna, dan disusun mengikut tahap CEFR serta topik.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>153.48,'end_time'=>155.46,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk dapatkannya.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>155.56,'end_time'=>159.42,'target_text'=>'Here you can see in the video, we are about to board the plane.','source_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak dalam video, kami sedang bersedia untuk naik ke pesawat.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>159.52,'end_time'=>161.46,'target_text'=>'So, Leon is in front of me.','source_text'=>'Leon ada kat depan saya.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>161.56,'end_time'=>167.78,'target_text'=>'He has his backpack on and he is pushing his carry-on suitcase on the side.','source_text'=>'Dia galas beg sandang dan tolak beg bagasi kabin kat sebelahnya.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>167.88,'end_time'=>170.66,'target_text'=>'So, he is in front of me and he is walking.','source_text'=>'Jadi dia jalan kat depan saya.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>170.76,'end_time'=>175.22,'target_text'=>'Leon is walking and I am walking behind him.','source_text'=>'Leon berjalan di depan dan saya berjalan di belakang dia.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>175.32,'end_time'=>177.58,'target_text'=>'So, like we were saying, the flight was very short.','source_text'=>'Macam yang kami sebut tadi, penerbangan tu sangat singkat.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>177.68,'end_time'=>181.38,'target_text'=>'So, we landed in Penang about an hour later.','source_text'=>'Kira-kira sejam kemudian kami pun mendarat di Pulau Pinang.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>181.48,'end_time'=>185.06,'target_text'=>'It did not connect to the jet bridge or the jetway.','source_text'=>'Pesawat tak disambungkan ke jejantas udara (jet bridge).','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>185.16,'end_time'=>190.14,'target_text'=>'That is just a structure that is movable and connects to the door of the airplane.','source_text'=>'Jet bridge tu jejantas boleh alih yang bersambung terus ke pintu kapal terbang.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>190.24,'end_time'=>193.86,'target_text'=>'But, as you can see here, we were not connected to a jet bridge.','source_text'=>'Tapi macam korang nampak kat sini, pesawat kami tak guna jet bridge.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>193.96,'end_time'=>195.78,'target_text'=>'>> And do you know why they do that?','source_text'=>'>> Dan kau tahu tak kenapa dorang buat macam tu?','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>195.88,'end_time'=>196.82,'target_text'=>'>> Actually, I\'m not sure.','source_text'=>'>> Sebenarnya saya tak pasti.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>196.92,'end_time'=>198.3,'target_text'=>'>> Or why they don\'t do that.','source_text'=>'>> Atau kenapa dorang tak guna jet bridge.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>198.4,'end_time'=>204.26,'target_text'=>'Because it saves them fees from connecting to the jet bridge.','source_text'=>'Sebab ia menjimatkan kos caj sambungan ke jet bridge.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>204.36,'end_time'=>206.58,'target_text'=>'They have to pay to be able to use that.','source_text'=>'Syarikat penerbangan kena bayar yuran kalau nak guna jejantas tu.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>206.68,'end_time'=>214.3,'target_text'=>'So, without using it and just disembarking directly onto the tarmac, they can avoid those fees and then lower the fees [snorts]','source_text'=>'Jadi bila tak guna dan penumpang turun terus ke landasan tarmac, dorang dapat elak caj tu lalu kurangkan tambang','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>214.4,'end_time'=>215.62,'target_text'=>'of the flight as well.','source_text'=>'penerbangan untuk penumpang.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>215.72,'end_time'=>224.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, because uh AirAsia and a lot of other carriers in Asia that we use are low-cost carriers.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab AirAsia dan banyak lagi syarikat penerbangan di Asia yang kami naik ialah syarikat tambang murah.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>224.2,'end_time'=>230.78,'target_text'=>'That means that uh you usually just get like your airplane ticket and maybe one personal item and everything else you have','source_text'=>'Maksudnya korang biasanya dapat tiket penerbangan dan mungkin satu beg peribadi je, dan yang lain-lain korang kena','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>230.88,'end_time'=>231.46,'target_text'=>'to purchase.','source_text'=>'beli sendiri.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>231.56,'end_time'=>237.78,'target_text'=>'So, you have to purchase your checked bags and you have to purchase more weight and usually like in this case right here,','source_text'=>'Korang kena bayar untuk bagasi daftar masuk dan tambah berat muatan, dan dalam kes macam ni,','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>237.88,'end_time'=>241.3,'target_text'=>'you park on the tarmac, you don\'t connect to the jet bridge.','source_text'=>'kapal terbang parkir atas landasan tarmac dan tak sambung ke jet bridge.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>241.4,'end_time'=>245.74,'target_text'=>'Another word for the jet bridge is passenger boarding bridge.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi istilah untuk jet bridge ialah jambatan laluan penumpang.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>245.84,'end_time'=>250.7,'target_text'=>'So that just saves fees and makes the airplane ticket cheaper which I don\'t mind.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu menjimatkan kos dan buat tiket jadi lebih murah, saya tak kisah pun.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>250.8,'end_time'=>257.02,'target_text'=>'So what was the first thing we did when we landed in Penang, Malaysia?','source_text'=>'Jadi apa benda pertama yang kita buat masa mendarat di Pulau Pinang, Malaysia?','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>257.12,'end_time'=>265.9,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so the first thing we did was first we dropped off our bags, we checked in to our accommodation and then it was about','source_text'=>'>> Benda pertama kami buat ialah letak beg, daftar masuk ke tempat penginapan, dan masa tu dah sekitar','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>266,'end_time'=>266.9,'target_text'=>'4:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'pukul 4:00 petang.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>267,'end_time'=>269.86,'target_text'=>'and I don\'t think we ate that much in the morning.','source_text'=>'dan rasanya kami tak makan banyak pun pagi tu.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>269.96,'end_time'=>271.38,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think we ate anything at all.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa kita langsung tak makan apa-apa pun.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>271.48,'end_time'=>280.14,'target_text'=>'>> No, so we were >> we just like left Bangkok, got on our flight, flew to Penang and then we took the Grab which is the like','source_text'=>'>> Tak ada, kami terus bertolak dari Bangkok, naik kapal terbang ke Pulau Pinang dan kemudian kami tempah Grab, iaitu','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>280.24,'end_time'=>282.62,'target_text'=>'taxi service in Asia.','source_text'=>'perkhidmatan e-hailing macam teksi di Asia.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>282.72,'end_time'=>287.94,'target_text'=>'In North America, we use Uber mainly but in Asia, Grab is the go-to.','source_text'=>'Kat Amerika Utara kami banyak guna Uber, tapi kat Asia, Grab ialah pilihan utama.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>288.04,'end_time'=>293.02,'target_text'=>'We used Grab to call a taxi and then we went from the airport all the way to Georgetown.','source_text'=>'Kami tempah teksi Grab dari lapangan terbang terus menuju ke Georgetown.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>293.12,'end_time'=>294.62,'target_text'=>'We stayed in Georgetown, right?','source_text'=>'Kita menginap kat Georgetown kan?','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>294.72,'end_time'=>295.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>295.28,'end_time'=>299.34,'target_text'=>'>> Georgetown is like the most like popular place to stay in Penang, right?','source_text'=>'>> Georgetown tempat paling popular untuk menginap di Pulau Pinang kan?','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>299.44,'end_time'=>302.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s the main town on the island.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu bandar utama di pulau tersebut.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>302.2,'end_time'=>304.7,'target_text'=>'>> And what\'s like special about Georgetown?','source_text'=>'>> Dan apa yang istimewa sangat pasal Georgetown?','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>304.8,'end_time'=>313.26,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s special about Georgetown is most of the town or most of the center of the town is actually a UNESCO World Heritage','source_text'=>'>> Keistimewaan Georgetown ialah kebanyakan kawasan pusat bandarnya diiktiraf sebagai Tapak Warisan Dunia UNESCO','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>313.36,'end_time'=>314.3,'target_text'=>'Site >> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>314.4,'end_time'=>315.54,'target_text'=>'>> which is really interesting.','source_text'=>'>> yang memang sangat menarik.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>315.64,'end_time'=>321.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, because I remember when we were there it was like really beautiful and there were a lot of like old buildings like','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab saya ingat masa kami kat sana pemandangannya sangat cantik dan banyak bangunan lama berunsur klasik','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>321.84,'end_time'=>327.86,'target_text'=>'old style with like beautiful colors and everything and it did look like a little run down but I think that just added to','source_text'=>'dengan warna-warni yang menawan, walaupun nampak agak usang tapi bagi saya itu menambah lagi','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>327.96,'end_time'=>331.54,'target_text'=>'the authenticity and like beauty of Georgetown.','source_text'=>'keaslian dan keindahan bandar Georgetown.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>331.64,'end_time'=>332.66,'target_text'=>'It was very nice.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat menarik.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>332.76,'end_time'=>334.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it was a nice town.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebuah bandar yang indah.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>334.6,'end_time'=>335.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but it was hot.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi cuacanya panas.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>335.56,'end_time'=>338.9,'target_text'=>'Did you notice when you walked out of the plane it was like hot?','source_text'=>'Perasan tak masa keluar dari kapal terbang tadi cuaca rasa berbahang panas?','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>339,'end_time'=>340.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it was seriously hot there.','source_text'=>'>> Memang panas betul kat sana.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>340.8,'end_time'=>343.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and you see in the video I have my hoodie on.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dan tengok dalam video tu saya masih pakai baju hoodie tebal.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>343.2,'end_time'=>344.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I wonder why.','source_text'=>'>> Pelik juga kenapa pakai baju tebal.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>344.6,'end_time'=>345.5,'target_text'=>'>> thick hoodie.','source_text'=>'>> hoodie tebal gila.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>345.6,'end_time'=>346.94,'target_text'=>'My really thick hoodie, yeah.','source_text'=>'Baju hoodie saya yang sangat tebal tu, ya.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>347.04,'end_time'=>347.7,'target_text'=>'It it hot.','source_text'=>'Memang panas berpeluh.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>347.8,'end_time'=>353.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, anyways, we took a grab from the airport to our hotel in pretty much the center of Georgetown.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, kami naik Grab dari lapangan terbang ke hotel kami di tengah-tengah bandar Georgetown.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>353.88,'end_time'=>355.62,'target_text'=>'Then we checked into our hotel.','source_text'=>'Kemudian kami daftar masuk ke hotel.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>355.72,'end_time'=>356.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>356.56,'end_time'=>359.66,'target_text'=>'>> How long did we stay in Penang?','source_text'=>'>> Berapa lama kita tinggal kat Pulau Pinang?','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>359.76,'end_time'=>361.7,'target_text'=>'>> We were there for 1 week.','source_text'=>'>> Kami berada di sana selama seminggu.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>361.8,'end_time'=>362.26,'target_text'=>'>> 1 week.','source_text'=>'>> Seminggu.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>362.36,'end_time'=>365.94,'target_text'=>'>> So, 7 days we stayed on Penang Island.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi 7 hari kami menetap di Pulau Pinang.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>366.04,'end_time'=>374.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so after we checked in, we left our bags and I remember when we were checking in, we had to go up one flight of stairs','source_text'=>'>> Ya, lepas daftar masuk kami letak beg, dan saya ingat masa nak masuk bilik kami kena panjat satu tingkat anak tangga','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>374.96,'end_time'=>377.78,'target_text'=>'and there was no elevator and my suitcase is so heavy.','source_text'=>'dan tak ada lif, padahal beg bagasi saya berat gila.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>377.88,'end_time'=>382.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s like 30 kg or 30 kg and I had both of them.','source_text'=>'Beratnya dalam 30 kg dan saya ada dua beg.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>383,'end_time'=>385.22,'target_text'=>'I think I carried them both up at the same time.','source_text'=>'Rasanya saya angkat dua-dua beg tu serentak.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>385.32,'end_time'=>385.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>385.84,'end_time'=>392.42,'target_text'=>'>> It was like low-key heavy and normally it wouldn\'t be like that big of a deal or that like difficult, but those stairs','source_text'=>'>> Berat juga sebenarnya dan biasanya tak ada masalah sangat, tapi tangga tu','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>392.52,'end_time'=>394.26,'target_text'=>'were very narrow, right?','source_text'=>'sangat sempit, kan?','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>394.36,'end_time'=>395.42,'target_text'=>'>> they were slippery, too.','source_text'=>'>> dahlah sempit, licin pula tu.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>395.52,'end_time'=>399.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they were like these like really glossy wood stairs, so it was narrow.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tangga kayu bergilap licin dan sempit.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>399.28,'end_time'=>408.34,'target_text'=>'I was like, \"Oh, man.\" Yeah, that was a slight inconvenience, but yeah, we checked in and after that, we wanted to just walk','source_text'=>'Saya macam, \"Aduh parah.\" Agak menyusahkan sikit, tapi lepas daftar masuk kami nak jalan-jalan','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>408.44,'end_time'=>412.22,'target_text'=>'around and explore because I was really craving like Indian food.','source_text'=>'meneroka kawasan sekitar sebab saya teringin sangat nak makan masakan India.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>412.32,'end_time'=>421.5,'target_text'=>'Like I love Indian food so much and I know there is like a really big Indian population in Malaysia and also in in Georgetown.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka sangat makanan India dan saya tahu ada komuniti masyarakat India yang ramai di Malaysia dan juga di Georgetown.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>421.6,'end_time'=>426.54,'target_text'=>'So, we went to Little India to look for some Indian food, right?','source_text'=>'Jadi kami terus pergi ke kawasan Little India untuk cari makanan India, kan?','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>426.64,'end_time'=>427.46,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s right.','source_text'=>'>> Betul tu.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>427.56,'end_time'=>433.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and then here you can see in this image, we have I believe chicken biryani, right?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, dan dalam gambar ni korang boleh nampak kami pesan nasi beriani ayam rasanya, kan?','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>433.44,'end_time'=>434.02,'target_text'=>'It was chicken.','source_text'=>'Ayam kan.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>434.12,'end_time'=>435.58,'target_text'=>'>> Uh >> You ordered that.','source_text'=>'>> Kau yang pesan tu.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>435.68,'end_time'=>436.26,'target_text'=>'>> mutton.','source_text'=>'>> daging kambing.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>436.36,'end_time'=>441.06,'target_text'=>'>> No, this one was mutton for sure cuz I ordered the mutton uh >> No, you ordered biryani.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan, yang ni kambing sebab saya pesan kambing >> Tak, kau pesan beriani.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>441.16,'end_time'=>445.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so I ordered mutton biryani and Leon ordered >> chicken curry.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya pesan beriani kambing dan Leon pesan >> kari ayam.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>445.44,'end_time'=>446.14,'target_text'=>'>> Chicken curry.','source_text'=>'>> Kari ayam.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>446.24,'end_time'=>446.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>446.92,'end_time'=>448.34,'target_text'=>'>> Which one was spicy again?','source_text'=>'>> Yang mana satu pedas hari tu?','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>448.44,'end_time'=>449.82,'target_text'=>'I think yours.','source_text'=>'Rasanya hidangan kau.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>449.92,'end_time'=>455.34,'target_text'=>'>> No, I\'m pretty sure I think it was yours cuz >> One of them was really spicy, the other one not so much.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya hidangan kau sebab >> Satu daripada lauk tu memang pedas betul, satu lagi biasa je.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>455.44,'end_time'=>460.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think it was yours cuz yours also came with a yogurt that was meant to cool it down a bit.','source_text'=>'>> Ya rasanya kau punya sebab ada dihidangkan sekali dengan yogurt untuk sejukkan rasa pedas.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>460.36,'end_time'=>466.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that makes sense, but uh yeah, we shared, so it was kind of like a good combo cuz you get that rice and then you','source_text'=>'>> Ya betul juga tu, tapi kami kongsi makan jadi gabungannya memang mantap bila ada nasi,','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>466.28,'end_time'=>468.06,'target_text'=>'get the curry and then also the mutton.','source_text'=>'dapat kuah kari dan juga daging kambing.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>468.16,'end_time'=>472.22,'target_text'=>'I like getting a biryani and then also like a curry cuz I feel like it goes good together.','source_text'=>'Saya suka pesan nasi beriani campur kari sebab rasanya sangat serasi.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>472.32,'end_time'=>473.58,'target_text'=>'And then also naan bread.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu ada roti naan juga.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>473.68,'end_time'=>478.38,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, this was our first meal in Malaysia and it was actually really really good.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, inilah hidangan pertama kami di Malaysia dan sejujurnya memang sangat sedap.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>478.48,'end_time'=>480.5,'target_text'=>'I remember this being very very good.','source_text'=>'Saya ingat lagi betapa lazatnya makanan ni.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>480.6,'end_time'=>481.5,'target_text'=>'I like this.','source_text'=>'Saya suka.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>481.6,'end_time'=>482.22,'target_text'=>'Good food.','source_text'=>'Makanan terbaik.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>482.32,'end_time'=>483.82,'target_text'=>'It was busting.','source_text'=>'Memang padu gila rasanya.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>483.92,'end_time'=>484.66,'target_text'=>'No cap.','source_text'=>'Tak tipu.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>484.76,'end_time'=>488.86,'target_text'=>'And then uh after we ate, I believe we went to this mall here.','source_text'=>'Dan lepas makan, rasanya kami pergi ke pusat beli-belah ni.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>488.96,'end_time'=>489.94,'target_text'=>'You can see it this video.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak dalam video ni.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>490.04,'end_time'=>491.98,'target_text'=>'I took just a quick video inside the mall.','source_text'=>'Saya rakam video pendek dalam pusat beli-belah tu.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>492.08,'end_time'=>496.02,'target_text'=>'We went to a mall to buy a phone plan because we didn\'t have any data.','source_text'=>'Kami pergi ke pusat beli-belah untuk beli pelan simkad sebab kami tiada data internet.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>496.12,'end_time'=>499.14,'target_text'=>'So, I think that\'s all we did in the mall, right?','source_text'=>'Itu je tujuan kami ke mall tu, kan?','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>499.24,'end_time'=>499.66,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s right.','source_text'=>'>> Betul tu.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>499.76,'end_time'=>502.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we walked around for a little bit, >> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Kami jalan sekejap, >> Oh ya.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>502.72,'end_time'=>506.58,'target_text'=>'>> we only bought the phone plan cuz we already ate.','source_text'=>'>> kami cuma beli simkad internet je sebab dah kenyang makan.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>506.68,'end_time'=>506.92,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>506.92,'end_time'=>509.42,'target_text'=>'>> We weren\'t hungry, so we just needed data.','source_text'=>'>> Kami tak lapar, cuma perlukan data internet.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>509.52,'end_time'=>511.74,'target_text'=>'But, to get there, we had to take the bus.','source_text'=>'Tapi untuk ke sana, kami kena naik bas.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>511.84,'end_time'=>512.74,'target_text'=>'Or did we take the bus?','source_text'=>'Atau kita naik bas?','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>512.84,'end_time'=>514.22,'target_text'=>'>> No, I think we took a Grab.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, saya rasa kita naik Grab.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>514.32,'end_time'=>517.58,'target_text'=>'Or we took a taxi there, but then we took a bus back.','source_text'=>'Atau kita naik teksi ke sana, tapi masa balik baru naik bas.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>517.68,'end_time'=>525.02,'target_text'=>'And uh I was reading online you need exact change to get on buses in Malaysia and Penang.','source_text'=>'Dan saya ada baca dalam internet yang kita kena sediakan wang kecil yang cukup untuk naik bas di Malaysia dan Pulau Pinang.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>525.12,'end_time'=>530.22,'target_text'=>'So, the bus was coming in a couple minutes, I remember, and I didn\'t have exact change.','source_text'=>'Saya ingat lagi masa tu bas dah nak sampai dalam beberapa minit, tapi saya tak ada duit kecil yang tepat.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>530.32,'end_time'=>537.54,'target_text'=>'So, we both went to a convenience store, bought something, got change, and then we managed to catch the bus because I think','source_text'=>'Jadi kami berdua cepat-cepat masuk ke kedai serbaneka, beli barang sikit untuk dapat duit baki, dan sempat kejar bas tu sebab saya rasa','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>537.64,'end_time'=>544.02,'target_text'=>'it came only like every 10 minutes, which isn\'t a long wait, but it\'s still a wait, you know?','source_text'=>'selang masanya dalam 10 minit sekali, taklah lama sangat tapi malas nak menunggu kan?','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>544.12,'end_time'=>546.74,'target_text'=>'And here you can see that this was later in the day.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini korang boleh nampak waktu dah lewat petang.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>546.84,'end_time'=>550.02,'target_text'=>'This is our first glimpse of uh Georgetown.','source_text'=>'Inilah pandangan pertama kami melihat bandar Georgetown.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>550.12,'end_time'=>550.62,'target_text'=>'on beautifully.','source_text'=>'dengan sangat indah.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>550.72,'end_time'=>552.86,'target_text'=>'You can see the architecture, the buildings.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak seni bina dan bangunan-bangunannya.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>552.96,'end_time'=>558.3,'target_text'=>'Most buildings were two stories and they all had this like very colonial style.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan bangunan dua tingkat dan semuanya ada gaya kolonial zaman dulu.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>558.4,'end_time'=>561.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it was really nice and well preserved.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, memang sangat cantik dan terpelihara dengan baik.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>561.48,'end_time'=>564.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, no, it was nice to walk around there and it felt like very safe.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, seronok dapat jalan-jalan kat situ dan rasa sangat selamat.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>565.08,'end_time'=>568.26,'target_text'=>'Everywhere in Asia we\'ve been quite safe, but it felt nice here.','source_text'=>'Semua tempat di Asia yang kami pergi agak selamat, tapi kat sini suasananya memang menyenangkan.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>568.36,'end_time'=>569.62,'target_text'=>'But, it was hot, dude.','source_text'=>'Tapi cuaca panas betul.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>569.72,'end_time'=>575.46,'target_text'=>'It was so hot, but at least at this time of day, the sun was kind of setting and it wasn\'t that bad.','source_text'=>'Panas sangat, tapi sekurang-kurangnya masa waktu macam ni matahari dah mula terbenam jadi taklah perit sangat.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>575.56,'end_time'=>581.54,'target_text'=>'So, the next day we went to go see uh Clan Jetty, which is kind of like a community on the water.','source_text'=>'Keesokan harinya kami pergi melawat Jeti Suku Kaum (Clan Jetty), iaitu perkampungan atas air.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>581.64,'end_time'=>585.62,'target_text'=>'So, everyone lives on the water in their homes.','source_text'=>'Semua penduduk tinggal di rumah atas air.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>585.72,'end_time'=>589.86,'target_text'=>'But, uh obviously it doesn\'t flood, so they are able to live on the water.','source_text'=>'Tapi sudah tentu tak banjir, jadi dorang boleh tinggal dengan aman atas air.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>589.96,'end_time'=>596.54,'target_text'=>'Their house is raised far above the sea level with stilts, so that uh water doesn\'t go into their home.','source_text'=>'Rumah dorang dibina tinggi atas tiang kayu melepasi paras laut, jadi air tak masuk ke dalam rumah.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>596.64,'end_time'=>599.78,'target_text'=>'But, it was very interesting to see these uh Clan Jetties.','source_text'=>'Sangat menarik dapat tengok perkampungan Jeti Suku Kaum ni.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>599.88,'end_time'=>600.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>600.4,'end_time'=>607.42,'target_text'=>'And it was like uh the community that lives there and that started it is the Hokkien Chinese Mhm.','source_text'=>'Dan komuniti yang tinggal dan mengasaskannya ialah orang Cina Hokkien.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>607.52,'end_time'=>610.82,'target_text'=>'that came from China 100 years ago or even longer.','source_text'=>'yang berhijrah dari China sejak 100 tahun lepas atau lebih lama lagi.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>610.92,'end_time'=>616.86,'target_text'=>'They came and then they settled there in Penang and built their community along the water like that.','source_text'=>'Dorang datang dan menetap di Pulau Pinang serta membina perkampungan di sepanjang persisiran pantai macam tu.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>616.96,'end_time'=>617.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>617.64,'end_time'=>618.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s very interesting.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat menarik.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>618.6,'end_time'=>623.62,'target_text'=>'It reminds me of a community on the water that I saw when I was in Thailand.','source_text'=>'Ia ingatkan saya pada perkampungan atas air yang saya pernah tengok masa kat Thailand dulu.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>623.72,'end_time'=>627.82,'target_text'=>'I forget what it was called and the name, but it was really similar to this.','source_text'=>'Saya dah lupa apa nama tempat tu, tapi lebih kurang sama macam ni.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>627.92,'end_time'=>634.7,'target_text'=>'But, the only way you could get to it is by boat, so you had to get like a tour and then go on a boat and then uh go out to','source_text'=>'Cuma satu-satunya cara nak ke sana adalah dengan naik bot, jadi kena ambil pakej lawatan dan naik bot untuk pergi ke','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>634.8,'end_time'=>635.5,'target_text'=>'this community.','source_text'=>'perkampungan tersebut.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>635.6,'end_time'=>636.18,'target_text'=>'It was pretty cool.','source_text'=>'Agak menarik juga.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>636.28,'end_time'=>641.1,'target_text'=>'This community, however, was just like on the island, so you could just walk there easily.','source_text'=>'Tapi perkampungan jeti ni bersambung dengan pulau, jadi korang boleh terus jalan kaki ke sana dengan mudah.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>641.2,'end_time'=>644.3,'target_text'=>'Here, you can see an image of kunafa.','source_text'=>'Kat sini korang boleh nampak gambar manisan kunafa.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>644.4,'end_time'=>649.66,'target_text'=>'This was my first time trying kunafa, and I have to say I really loved it.','source_text'=>'Ini kali pertama saya cuba kunafa, dan sejujurnya saya memang suka gila.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>649.76,'end_time'=>651.34,'target_text'=>'This was really, really good.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat sedap.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>651.44,'end_time'=>653.38,'target_text'=>'Like, genuinely I loved this.','source_text'=>'Ikhlas cakap saya memang terpikat betul.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>653.48,'end_time'=>654.14,'target_text'=>'>> Genuinely?','source_text'=>'>> Betul-betul ikhlas ke?','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>654.24,'end_time'=>655.56,'target_text'=>'>> Genuinely.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul-betul.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>655.66,'end_time'=>657.5,'target_text'=>'>> [snorts] >> Yeah, it\'s a really good dessert.','source_text'=>'>> [ketawa kecil] >> Ya, memang pencuci mulut yang sangat lazat.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>657.6,'end_time'=>662.22,'target_text'=>'My first time trying it, too, was it also in Malaysia last time I was there.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya mencubanya pun masa saya bercuti di Malaysia sebelum ni.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>662.32,'end_time'=>662.74,'target_text'=>'Okay.','source_text'=>'Okey.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>662.84,'end_time'=>669.58,'target_text'=>'So, the dough is made really, really thin, so you get crunch from the frying, and then they put some sort of topping.','source_text'=>'Dohnya dibuat sangat halus dan nipis, jadi rasa rangup bila digoreng, lepas tu dorang letak hiasan taburan kat atas.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>669.68,'end_time'=>671.7,'target_text'=>'In this case, it was pistachios.','source_text'=>'Dalam hidangan ni dorang tabur kacang pistachio.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>671.8,'end_time'=>672.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>672.16,'end_time'=>675.62,'target_text'=>'>> But, you can get chocolate or peanut butter or anything else.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi korang boleh pilih coklat, mentega kacang, atau perisa lain.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>675.72,'end_time'=>682.5,'target_text'=>'And then, on the side you have some clear syrup, and you pour that over, and you let it soak a little bit, and then you eat','source_text'=>'Dan di tepinya ada sirap jernih, korang tuangkan atas kunafa tu dan biar ia meresap sekejap sebelum makan','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>682.6,'end_time'=>683.18,'target_text'=>'it like that.','source_text'=>'macam tu.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>683.28,'end_time'=>687.34,'target_text'=>'So, you want to eat it straight after frying cuz it stays crispy.','source_text'=>'Kena makan terus panas-panas lepas goreng sebab masa tu ia paling rangup.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>687.44,'end_time'=>691.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I really like the texture, but how would you describe this texture?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya suka sangat teksturnya, tapi macam mana kau nak gambarkan tekstur ni?','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>691.36,'end_time'=>694.46,'target_text'=>'Like, the outside was like very crunchy, right?','source_text'=>'Bahagian luarnya sangat rangup, kan?','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>694.56,'end_time'=>697.66,'target_text'=>'>> It was like the crunchiest grilled cheese ever.','source_text'=>'>> Macam roti bakar keju yang paling rangup pernah ada.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>697.76,'end_time'=>702.82,'target_text'=>'Like, if you were to cut it in half and pull it apart, it would look like a grilled cheese on the inside.','source_text'=>'Bila potong dua dan tarik, rupa bahagian dalamnya macam keju cair meleleh roti bakar.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>702.92,'end_time'=>706.66,'target_text'=>'>> Like, cheese pull, double double cheese pull edge to edge.','source_text'=>'>> Tarikan keju meleleh dari hujung ke hujung.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>706.76,'end_time'=>707.62,'target_text'=>'>> Edge to edge.','source_text'=>'>> Menyeluruh dari tepi ke tepi.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>707.72,'end_time'=>716.26,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and really understand the English from this video, get the workbook on my website, bookaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih cepat dan faham bahasa Inggeris dalam video ni, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>716.36,'end_time'=>724.94,'target_text'=>'It goes into greater detail than the lesson and includes exercises to help you practice vocabulary, grammar, tenses, sentence','source_text'=>'Ia menerangkan dengan lebih mendalam dan dilengkapi latihan untuk bantu korang berlatih kosa kata, tatabahasa, tenses,','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>725.04,'end_time'=>727.22,'target_text'=>'structure, and comprehension.','source_text'=>'struktur ayat, dan pemahaman.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>727.32,'end_time'=>733.18,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos, so you can keep learning and reviewing anytime you want.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada buku latihan untuk video terdahulu supaya korang boleh terus belajar dan mengulang kaji pada bila-bila masa.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>733.28,'end_time'=>735.14,'target_text'=>'Get the workbooks in my description.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan buku latihan menerusi ruangan penerangan saya.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>735.24,'end_time'=>737.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but it was very crunchy, which I liked.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, tapi ia sangat rangup, itu yang saya suka.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>738,'end_time'=>739.5,'target_text'=>'I like crunchy things.','source_text'=>'Saya suka makanan yang rangup krup-krup.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>739.6,'end_time'=>741.46,'target_text'=>'This is why I love chips.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu saya suka makan kerepek kentang.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>741.56,'end_time'=>743.42,'target_text'=>'But, the crunch on the outside was really good.','source_text'=>'Kerangupan bahagian luar kunafa tu memang terbaik.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>743.52,'end_time'=>746.54,'target_text'=>'And then with the syrup on top of it, it was just amazing.','source_text'=>'Ditambah pula dengan curahan sirap manis kat atas, memang luar biasa sedap.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>746.64,'end_time'=>751.82,'target_text'=>'I love these kinds of desserts with like cheese and like sugar and crunch.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka pencuci mulut gabungan keju, manis, dan rangup macam ni.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>751.92,'end_time'=>753.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s like my favorite type of dessert.','source_text'=>'Itu jenis manisan kegemaran saya.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>753.6,'end_time'=>754.14,'target_text'=>'So good.','source_text'=>'Sedap sangat.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>754.24,'end_time'=>758.66,'target_text'=>'I really wanted to try this for the longest time cuz I always see it on my Instagram.','source_text'=>'Dah lama saya teringin nak cuba sebab selalu nampak lalu kat Instagram.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>758.76,'end_time'=>762.14,'target_text'=>'I always see kunafa all the time and it looks so good.','source_text'=>'Kerap sangat nampak kunafa kat media sosial dan nampak menggiurkan.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>762.24,'end_time'=>768.58,'target_text'=>'And one of the most famous dishes from Penang is nasi kandar, right?','source_text'=>'Dan antara hidangan paling popular dari Pulau Pinang ialah nasi kandar, kan?','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>768.68,'end_time'=>769.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s from there, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Berasal dari sana kan?','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>769.84,'end_time'=>774.5,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think it\'s from there, but it is super famous in Malaysia.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya bukan asal dari situ, tapi ia memang terkenal di serata Malaysia.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>774.6,'end_time'=>777.22,'target_text'=>'And it\'s kind of only a Malaysian thing.','source_text'=>'Dan hidangan ni macam cuma ada di Malaysia je.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>777.32,'end_time'=>780.82,'target_text'=>'I think there isn\'t that many other countries that actually do this as well.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa tak banyak negara lain yang hidangkan konsep macam ni.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>780.92,'end_time'=>781.58,'target_text'=>'But, what is it?','source_text'=>'Tapi apa sebenarnya nasi kandar tu?','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>781.68,'end_time'=>782.5,'target_text'=>'How would you describe it?','source_text'=>'Macam mana kau nak gambarkan?','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>782.6,'end_time'=>784.9,'target_text'=>'Like, basically it\'s like a buffet.','source_text'=>'Secara asasnya macam hidangan bufet.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>785,'end_time'=>792.78,'target_text'=>'Or not really a buffet, like um >> It kind of is like when you go to like Panda Express or Subway or like fast food restaurant','source_text'=>'Atau bukan bufet sangat, macam >> Lebih kurang macam pergi ke Panda Express, Subway, atau restoran makanan segera','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>792.88,'end_time'=>798.02,'target_text'=>'like that that makes your food for you, but you tell them what you want and they just make it for you real quick or put it','source_text'=>'di mana dorang sediakan makanan ikut apa yang kita minta, kita pilih lauk dan dorang cedokkan terus ke atas','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>798.12,'end_time'=>799.26,'target_text'=>'all on a plate and give it to you.','source_text'=>'pinggan dan serahkan pada kita.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>799.36,'end_time'=>803.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of like that, but way healthier, way more delicious, and >> healthier.','source_text'=>'Konsepnya macam tu, tapi jauh lebih sihat, jauh lebih sedap, dan >> lebih sihat.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>803.88,'end_time'=>804.9,'target_text'=>'>> Just way better.','source_text'=>'>> Jauh lebih mantap.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>805,'end_time'=>806.42,'target_text'=>'Honestly, way better in my opinion.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya pada pandangan saya ia jauh lebih hebat.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>806.52,'end_time'=>811.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the food is super delicious, but I don\'t know if I would call it healthy, cuz >> Oh, dude, look at how healthy that','source_text'=>'>> Ya memang sedap sangat, tapi saya tak pastilah nak kata ia sihat sebab >> Tengoklah betapa sihatnya lauk tu','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>811.36,'end_time'=>811.6,'target_text'=>'is.','source_text'=>'semua.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>811.6,'end_time'=>813.54,'target_text'=>'>> the calories in this are insane.','source_text'=>'>> kalori dalam sepinggan nasi kandar ni tinggi gila.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>813.64,'end_time'=>815.9,'target_text'=>'>> calories doesn\'t equate to health.','source_text'=>'>> kalori tak bermakna tak sihat.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>816,'end_time'=>816.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s healthy.','source_text'=>'Ia sihat.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>816.72,'end_time'=>819.58,'target_text'=>'>> If you eat too many calories, you\'re not going to be that healthy, anyway.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau makan terlebih kalori, tak sihat juga jadinya.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>819.68,'end_time'=>822.46,'target_text'=>'>> You\'re That\'s called nitpicking.','source_text'=>'>> Kau ni suka cari salah kecik jelah.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>822.56,'end_time'=>828.98,'target_text'=>'No, it\'s healthier compared to like an actual fast food place like Panda Express or Subway that does like a similar concept,','source_text'=>'Bukan, ia lebih sihat berbanding makanan segera macam Panda Express atau Subway yang guna konsep sama,','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>829.08,'end_time'=>832.98,'target_text'=>'because the ingredients are probably fresher, they don\'t use like chemicals and all this stuff.','source_text'=>'sebab bahan-bahannya lebih segar dan tak guna bahan kimia terproses.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>833.08,'end_time'=>835.46,'target_text'=>'So, I would assume this is probably healthier.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya anggap ia lebih berkhasiat.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>835.56,'end_time'=>839.06,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it might have more calories, but that\'s why you just eat once a day.','source_text'=>'Ya mungkin kalorinya tinggi, tapi sebab tu kita makan sekali je sehari.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>839.16,'end_time'=>841.26,'target_text'=>'But, I really like the vibe of this type of food.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya suka sangat suasana makan hidangan macam ni.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>841.36,'end_time'=>847.02,'target_text'=>'I like how at the very end, they take a couple big spoons of that curry sauce, and they just put it all over the rice.','source_text'=>'Saya suka bila bahagian akhir dorang cedok beberapa senduk besar kuah kari campur dan banjirkan atas nasi.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>847.12,'end_time'=>850.86,'target_text'=>'So, then the rice is just like soaked in curry sauce.','source_text'=>'Jadi nasi tu lencun dengan limpahan kuah kari banjir.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>850.96,'end_time'=>851.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s really good.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat padu.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>851.88,'end_time'=>853.54,'target_text'=>'My favorite is the beef.','source_text'=>'Lauk kegemaran saya ialah daging lembu.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>853.64,'end_time'=>855.62,'target_text'=>'The beef is really good.','source_text'=>'Dagingnya memang sedap sangat.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>855.72,'end_time'=>856.3,'target_text'=>'I like that.','source_text'=>'Saya suka yang tu.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>856.4,'end_time'=>856.8,'target_text'=>'What about you?','source_text'=>'Kau pula macam mana?','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>856.84,'end_time'=>859.54,'target_text'=>'What\'s your favorite Nasi Kandar combo?','source_text'=>'Apa kombinasi lauk nasi kandar kegemaran kau?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>859.64,'end_time'=>867.54,'target_text'=>'>> I like the fried chicken to get a little bit of crunch and meat, and then also beef or lamb rendang, as well.','source_text'=>'>> Saya suka ayam goreng untuk rasa rangup dan isi tebal, lepas tu rendang daging atau kambing juga.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>867.64,'end_time'=>872.22,'target_text'=>'>> And here you can see two huge inflatable people.','source_text'=>'>> Dan kat sini korang boleh nampak dua patung belon gergasi.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>872.32,'end_time'=>878.02,'target_text'=>'This, I believe, was for Chinese New Year, because we were in Penang the very beginning of February.','source_text'=>'Ini rasanya sempena sambutan Tahun Baru Cina, sebab kami berada di Pulau Pinang pada awal bulan Februari.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>878.12,'end_time'=>881.74,'target_text'=>'So, everyone was kind of getting ready, setting up stuff for Chinese New Year.','source_text'=>'Semua orang tengah bersiap sedia dan pasang hiasan untuk Tahun Baru Cina.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>881.84,'end_time'=>885.78,'target_text'=>'So, there was a lot of like things like these all over Penang.','source_text'=>'Jadi ada banyak hiasan macam ni di seluruh Pulau Pinang.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>885.88,'end_time'=>890.02,'target_text'=>'>> They had lanterns and a lot of red and gold decorations.','source_text'=>'>> Dorang pasang tanglung dan banyak hiasan warna merah dan emas.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>890.12,'end_time'=>894.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, because Malaysia has like a pretty big Chinese population, right?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sebab Malaysia ada populasi kaum Cina yang agak ramai, kan?','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>894.16,'end_time'=>894.44,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>894.44,'end_time'=>897.66,'target_text'=>'>> So, here you can see we went to visit the other side of the island.','source_text'=>'>> Kat sini korang boleh nampak kami pergi melawat sebelah lagi pulau.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>897.76,'end_time'=>899.46,'target_text'=>'This was in Penang National Park.','source_text'=>'Ini di Taman Negara Pulau Pinang.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>899.56,'end_time'=>902.02,'target_text'=>'In the video, we\'re walking to Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'Dalam video ni kami sedang berjalan ke Pantai Monkey Beach.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>902.12,'end_time'=>905.98,'target_text'=>'>> This was probably one of the hardest things I\'ve done in a while.','source_text'=>'>> Ini antara aktiviti paling mencabar yang saya buat sejak kebelakangan ni.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>906.08,'end_time'=>907.26,'target_text'=>'>> It is so hot.','source_text'=>'>> Cuacanya panas gila.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>907.36,'end_time'=>908.94,'target_text'=>'This is like Asia is so hot.','source_text'=>'Kawasan Asia ni memang sangat panas berbahang.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>909.04,'end_time'=>910.1,'target_text'=>'I\'m not used to this heat.','source_text'=>'Saya tak biasa dengan cuaca panas macam ni.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>910.2,'end_time'=>914.94,'target_text'=>'Well, neither of us are, because we\'re from Canada, and Canada does not get this hot.','source_text'=>'Kami berdua memang tak biasa sebab kami berasal dari Kanada, dan Kanada tak pernah sepanas ni.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>915.04,'end_time'=>917.7,'target_text'=>'And Canada, where we live, is not humid at all.','source_text'=>'Dan tempat kami tinggal di Kanada langsung tak ada kelembapan udara.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>917.8,'end_time'=>919.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s very, very, very dry.','source_text'=>'Udaranya sangat, sangat kering.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>919.36,'end_time'=>921.34,'target_text'=>'Dry in the winter, and it\'s dry in the summer.','source_text'=>'Kering masa musim sejuk dan kering masa musim panas.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>921.44,'end_time'=>925.46,'target_text'=>'But, in Asia it\'s just humid everywhere and it\'s so hot everywhere.','source_text'=>'Tapi kat Asia ni merata-rata terasa lembap dan panas terik.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>925.56,'end_time'=>933.1,'target_text'=>'So, this was a little bit of a hike because one, it was very far, two, it was very hot, and three, the terrain was like really','source_text'=>'Jadi perjalanan ni agak mencabar sebab pertamanya ia sangat jauh, keduanya sangat panas, dan ketiganya laluannya berbukit','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>933.2,'end_time'=>933.98,'target_text'=>'like uneven.','source_text'=>'dan tak rata.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>934.08,'end_time'=>938.02,'target_text'=>'So, it was a bit of a challenge, but we still did it quite easily.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia satu cabaran, tapi kami tetap berjaya redah dengan baik.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>938.12,'end_time'=>941.06,'target_text'=>'But, tell me, how did we get to the National Park?','source_text'=>'Tapi cuba cerita macam mana kita sampai ke Taman Negara tu?','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>941.16,'end_time'=>947.1,'target_text'=>'Because we were staying in Georgetown, but the National Park is literally on the opposite side of Georgetown.','source_text'=>'Sebab kami menginap di Georgetown, sedangkan Taman Negara tu terletak tepat di sebelah bertentangan pulau.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>947.2,'end_time'=>949.14,'target_text'=>'So, how did we get there?','source_text'=>'Macam mana kita ke sana?','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>949.24,'end_time'=>955.82,'target_text'=>'>> So, Penang is not that big of an island, but it was still too far to like walk there.','source_text'=>'>> Pulau Pinang taklah besar sangat, tapi masih terlalu jauh kalau nak jalan kaki.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>955.92,'end_time'=>965.26,'target_text'=>'So, we ended up renting a bike, two bikes for one day, and that is how we got from our accommodation to the Penang National','source_text'=>'>> Jadi kami buat keputusan sewa motosikal, dua buah motor untuk sehari, dan itulah cara kami pergi dari tempat penginapan ke Taman Negara','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>965.36,'end_time'=>965.82,'target_text'=>'Park.','source_text'=>'Pulau Pinang.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>965.92,'end_time'=>966.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>966.48,'end_time'=>972.58,'target_text'=>'And the bike rental shop was literally just steps away from our hotel.','source_text'=>'Dan kedai sewa motor tu hanya beberapa langkah je dari hotel kami.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>972.68,'end_time'=>978.66,'target_text'=>'So, we literally walked out in the morning, walked like a couple feet, and then rented the bikes for the day.','source_text'=>'Kami cuma keluar pagi tu, jalan beberapa tapak kaki, lepas tu terus sewa motor untuk sehari.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>978.76,'end_time'=>980.06,'target_text'=>'It was quite cheap, actually.','source_text'=>'Harganya pun agak murah.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>980.16,'end_time'=>987.5,'target_text'=>'Then we took the bikes and we drove all the way to the other side to Penang National Park, and then we walked the rest of','source_text'=>'Kemudian kami tunggang motor merentas pulau sampai ke Taman Negara Pulau Pinang, dan sambung berjalan kaki','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>987.6,'end_time'=>988.9,'target_text'=>'the way to Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'sepanjang laluan ke Pantai Monkey Beach.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>989,'end_time'=>992.34,'target_text'=>'And yes, we do have our motorcycle license.','source_text'=>'Dan ya, kami memang ada lesen motosikal yang sah.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>992.44,'end_time'=>1000.66,'target_text'=>'I know that majority of foreigners and tourists in Asia, they do not have their motorcycle license, but they still rent bikes','source_text'=>'Saya tahu kebanyakan pelancong asing kat Asia tak ada lesen motosikal, tapi dorang tetap sewa motor','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>1000.76,'end_time'=>1004.46,'target_text'=>'because, you know, people still rent them out even if you don\'t have a license.','source_text'=>'sebab kedai sewa tetap bagi sewa walaupun tak ada lesen.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>1004.56,'end_time'=>1006.3,'target_text'=>'But, we have a license, so >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Tapi kami ada lesen, jadi >> Ya.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>1006.4,'end_time'=>1006.94,'target_text'=>'>> don\'t worry.','source_text'=>'>> jangan risau.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>1007.04,'end_time'=>1008.1,'target_text'=>'We are safe.','source_text'=>'Kami pandu dengan selamat.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>1008.2,'end_time'=>1008.86,'target_text'=>'>> And legal.','source_text'=>'>> Dan sah di sisi undang-undang.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>1008.96,'end_time'=>1010.02,'target_text'=>'>> And legal.','source_text'=>'>> Dan mengikut undang-undang.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>1010.12,'end_time'=>1011.02,'target_text'=>'Very legal.','source_text'=>'Sangat patuh undang-undang.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>1011.12,'end_time'=>1014.14,'target_text'=>'We follow the law like good citizens.','source_text'=>'Kami ikut peraturan macam rakyat yang baik.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>1014.24,'end_time'=>1021.38,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, here you can see we are at Monkey Beach now, and uh here there are two monkeys very close to us.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, kat sini korang boleh nampak kami dah sampai ke Pantai Monkey Beach, dan ada dua ekor monyet dekat sangat dengan kami.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>1021.48,'end_time'=>1028.82,'target_text'=>'And it looks like they were fighting right before I took this video, but once I started recording, they just they\'re like','source_text'=>'Monyet-monyet tu nampak macam tengah bergaduh sebelum saya rakam video ni, tapi bila saya mula rakam dorang terus buat macam','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>1028.92,'end_time'=>1029.86,'target_text'=>'nothing to see here.','source_text'=>'tak ada apa-apa berlaku.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>1029.96,'end_time'=>1030.86,'target_text'=>'They were just chill.','source_text'=>'Dorang terus lepak santai.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>1030.96,'end_time'=>1032.78,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, this beach was actually very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, pantai ni memang sangat cantik pemandangannya.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>1032.88,'end_time'=>1040.7,'target_text'=>'You can see like the white sand, the nice blue water, and like the palm trees, and the vegetation behind us.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak pasir putih bersih, air laut biru yang jernih, pokok kelapa, dan kehijauan hutan kat belakang kami.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>1040.8,'end_time'=>1043.34,'target_text'=>'It was very beautiful, like very, very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat indah, tersangat cantik.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>1043.44,'end_time'=>1049.18,'target_text'=>'>> It was nice, but honestly, I don\'t know if the hike was worth it to get to this beach because How long did it take us?','source_text'=>'>> Memang cantik, tapi sejujurnya saya tak pasti berbaloi ke penat mendaki nak sampai ke pantai ni sebab berapa lama kita jalan tadi?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>1049.28,'end_time'=>1050.78,'target_text'=>'Like >> An hour and a half.','source_text'=>'Dalam >> Sejam setengah.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>1050.88,'end_time'=>1052.46,'target_text'=>'>> An hour and a half each way, right?','source_text'=>'>> Sejam setengah untuk perjalanan sehala, kan?','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>1052.56,'end_time'=>1053.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, 3 hours.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, 3 jam pergi balik.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>1053.56,'end_time'=>1056.9,'target_text'=>'>> So, 3 hours of hiking to get to this beach.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi 3 jam berjalan kaki semata-mata nak sampai ke pantai ni.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>1057,'end_time'=>1058.06,'target_text'=>'>> But, it was nice.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi seronok suasananya.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>1058.16,'end_time'=>1065.1,'target_text'=>'But, we didn\'t end up actually swimming once we got to Monkey Beach because I didn\'t want to get all wet because one, I didn\'t','source_text'=>'Tapi kami tak mandi laut pun bila sampai kat Monkey Beach sebab saya tak nak basah lencun, pertamanya saya tak','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>1065.2,'end_time'=>1071.38,'target_text'=>'have my swim trunks on me, and that means I would have to swim in my boxers, but then for the hike back, it would be very','source_text'=>'bawa seluar renang dan kalau nak mandi kena pakai seluar dalam, lepas tu bila nak jalan balik mendaki nanti rasa sangat','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>1071.48,'end_time'=>1078.66,'target_text'=>'uncomfortable because I would have salt everywhere, and I did have a towel, but I didn\'t have a bathing suit, so I would have','source_text'=>'tak selesa sebab badan berlendir dengan air masin, walaupun ada tuala tapi tiada baju ganti renang, jadi badan melekit','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>1078.76,'end_time'=>1083.54,'target_text'=>'salt everywhere, and I feel like I would get a rash walking back for an hour and a half.','source_text'=>'dengan garam laut dan saya rasa kulit boleh melecet kalau kena berjalan balik selama sejam setengah.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>1083.64,'end_time'=>1085.5,'target_text'=>'So, I decided not to.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya batalkan niat nak mandi.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>1085.6,'end_time'=>1089.06,'target_text'=>'I made that executive decision on my behalf.','source_text'=>'Saya buat keputusan mutlak tu bagi pihak diri saya.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>1089.16,'end_time'=>1092.42,'target_text'=>'And this right here is the Snake Temple, right?','source_text'=>'Dan tempat ni Tokong Ular (Snake Temple), kan?','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>1092.52,'end_time'=>1093.26,'target_text'=>'>> I think you\'re right.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya betul tu.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>1093.36,'end_time'=>1098.82,'target_text'=>'>> This is one of the coolest, most interesting temples I\'ve been to like ever.','source_text'=>'>> Ini antara tokong paling unik dan menarik pernah saya lawati seumur hidup.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>1098.92,'end_time'=>1101.54,'target_text'=>'Like, honestly, it was really, really, really interesting.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya memang sangat-sangat menarik.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>1101.64,'end_time'=>1108.9,'target_text'=>'I\'ve never been to a temple like this where they just have like very like venomous snakes, like pit vipers.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pernah pergi ke tokong macam ni di mana dorang ada ular yang sangat berbisa macam ular kapak.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>1109,'end_time'=>1113.18,'target_text'=>'Just like they\'re just out Well, they\'re in like a area, but they could get out like quite easily.','source_text'=>'Ular tu dibiarkan berlegar bebas... memang ada kawasan dia tapi ular tu boleh je menjalar keluar bila-bila masa.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>1113.28,'end_time'=>1113.94,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>1114.04,'end_time'=>1116.26,'target_text'=>'>> But, I was like, \"Ooh, man.\" I was like looking everywhere.','source_text'=>'>> Saya macam, \"Aduh seramnya.\" Saya asyik pandang sekeliling.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>1116.36,'end_time'=>1122.94,'target_text'=>'I was like making sure that no pit vipers bit me cuz what would happen if they bit me?','source_text'=>'Saya perhatikan betul-betul supaya tak dipatuk ular kapak sebab apa jadi kalau kena patuk?','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>1123.04,'end_time'=>1124.74,'target_text'=>'>> It would not be a good time.','source_text'=>'>> Memang buruk padahnya.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>1124.84,'end_time'=>1131.62,'target_text'=>'>> Is it like instant like >> No, you don\'t die, but you\'ll be in a lot of pain, and you have to get to the hospital very','source_text'=>'>> Adakah terus mati on the spot >> Taklah terus mati, tapi rasa sakit amat sangat dan kena kejarkan ke hospital dengan sangat','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>1131.72,'end_time'=>1133.54,'target_text'=>'quickly, or you will die.','source_text'=>'pantas, kalau lambat boleh bawa maut.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>1133.64,'end_time'=>1139.54,'target_text'=>'>> I assume that the temple has like some antidote or some like medication or something because they\'re not going to have','source_text'=>'>> Saya anggap tokong tu mesti ada penawar atau ubat kecemasan sebab takkanlah dorang buka','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>1139.64,'end_time'=>1146.02,'target_text'=>'a temple with pit vipers as a very popular tourist attraction, and then not have anything just in case someone gets bit.','source_text'=>'tokong penuh ular kapak sebagai tarikan pelancong terkenal tanpa ada sebarang persediaan kalau pelawat kena patuk.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>1146.12,'end_time'=>1149.02,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t think they would have antivenom because >> they would.','source_text'=>'>> Saya rasa dorang tak simpan antivenom sebab >> mesti dorang ada.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>1149.12,'end_time'=>1152.06,'target_text'=>'>> Most likely, they are or like authorized to administer it.','source_text'=>'>> Kemungkinan besar pihak hospital je yang dibenarkan untuk suntik antivenom tu.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>1152.16,'end_time'=>1159.94,'target_text'=>'They\'d have to have medical staff available at all times because I don\'t know how they antivenom goes into you, but I think','source_text'=>'Kena ada kakitangan perubatan terlatih setiap masa sebab saya tak pasti macam mana antivenom dimasukkan, tapi rasanya','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>1160.04,'end_time'=>1161.06,'target_text'=>'they have to inject it.','source_text'=>'dorang kena suntik masuk ke dalam badan.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>1161.16,'end_time'=>1166.78,'target_text'=>'But, there are hospitals close by, so I think it\'s maybe an hour or two, depending on which snake.','source_text'=>'Tapi ada hospital berhampiran, jadi ada masa sejam dua bergantung pada jenis ular yang mematuk.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>1166.88,'end_time'=>1171.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I feel like I never want to be in that situation ever.','source_text'=>'>> Memang saya minta jauhlah daripada kena situasi macam tu.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>1171.48,'end_time'=>1172.14,'target_text'=>'Like, woah.','source_text'=>'Menakutkan betul.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>1172.24,'end_time'=>1178.82,'target_text'=>'Yeah, that would be a scary situation, especially if you\'re like in Australia, somewhere in the back country with no one around,','source_text'=>'Ya, situasi yang sangat mencemaskan terutamanya kalau berada kat pedalaman Australia yang tiada orang langsung di sekeliling,','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1178.92,'end_time'=>1181.94,'target_text'=>'and then uh you get bit by like a rattlesnake or something.','source_text'=>'lepas tu kena patuk dengan ular berbisa.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1182.04,'end_time'=>1183.14,'target_text'=>'Rattlesnakes are venomous, right?','source_text'=>'Ular orok-orok berbisa kan?','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1183.24,'end_time'=>1184.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that actually almost happened to me.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, benda tu hampir terjadi kat saya sebenarnya.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1184.96,'end_time'=>1185.62,'target_text'=>'>> In Australia?','source_text'=>'>> Kat Australia ke?','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1185.72,'end_time'=>1189.42,'target_text'=>'>> Not in Australia, but in Ecuador, in the Amazon jungle.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan kat Australia, tapi kat Ecuador, dalam hutan belantara Amazon.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1189.52,'end_time'=>1192.86,'target_text'=>'I almost stepped on a bush master, I think they call it.','source_text'=>'Saya hampir terpijak ular bushmaster.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1192.96,'end_time'=>1193.54,'target_text'=>'>> Bush master?','source_text'=>'>> Ular bushmaster?','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1193.64,'end_time'=>1195.86,'target_text'=>'>> Which is an extremely venomous snake.','source_text'=>'>> Iaitu spesis ular yang teramat berbisa.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1195.96,'end_time'=>1196.74,'target_text'=>'>> Extremely.','source_text'=>'>> Sangat bahaya.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1196.84,'end_time'=>1199.82,'target_text'=>'>> And we were not close at all to any hospital.','source_text'=>'>> Dan masa tu kami memang jauh gila dari mana-mana hospital.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1199.92,'end_time'=>1203.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, I think we were we were as far away from a hospital as you could be.','source_text'=>'>> Kami berada sejauh-jauhnya dari perkhidmatan hospital.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1203.84,'end_time'=>1209.06,'target_text'=>'>> towards Yeah, we were basically at the end of the road going directly into the Amazon, so.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kami berada di penghujung jalan yang terus masuk ke dalam hutan Amazon.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1209.16,'end_time'=>1211.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, like you know how big the Amazon is?','source_text'=>'>> Korang tahu kan betapa luasnya hutan Amazon tu?','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1211.2,'end_time'=>1214.62,'target_text'=>'We were like in it at the very end of the road that goes in it.','source_text'=>'Kami berada di ceruk paling dalam di hujung jalan hutan tu.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1214.72,'end_time'=>1216.5,'target_text'=>'And uh the road was not good.','source_text'=>'Dan keadaan jalannya pula sangat teruk.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1216.6,'end_time'=>1219.5,'target_text'=>'The road was very like bad, like a dirt road.','source_text'=>'Jalan tanah merah yang berlubang-lubang dan berbatu.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1219.6,'end_time'=>1227.62,'target_text'=>'So, to get out would take a very long time, and if you get bit by a snake, there\'s no hospital within miles, hundreds of miles.','source_text'=>'Jadi nak keluar dari situ ambil masa sangat lama, dan kalau kena patuk ular, tiada hospital dalam jarak berbatu-batu jauhnya.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1227.72,'end_time'=>1230.1,'target_text'=>'Maybe not hundreds of miles, but >> Yeah, a long ways.','source_text'=>'Mungkin tak sampai ratusan batu, tapi >> ya memang jauh sangat.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1230.2,'end_time'=>1231.02,'target_text'=>'>> Dozens of miles.','source_text'=>'>> Berpuluh-puluh batu.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1231.12,'end_time'=>1233.58,'target_text'=>'>> You\'d have to get flown out if that is possible.','source_text'=>'>> Kena naik helikopter kecemasan kalau ada.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1233.68,'end_time'=>1235.9,'target_text'=>'>> You probably would not make that, I\'m going to be honest.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya peluang nak selamat memang tipis kalau jadi macam tu.','order'=>352],
