            ['start_time'=>1261.76,'end_time'=>1269.02,'target_text'=>'It was actually like so nice, but unfortunately, we got there 30 minutes after they closed, so we couldn\'t go inside, but','source_text'=>'Binaannya memang sangat mengagumkan, tapi malangnya kami sampai 30 minit selepas waktu tutup jadi kami tak dapat masuk, cuma','order'=>366],
