            ['start_time'=>1274.08,'end_time'=>1281.94,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly','source_text'=>'Kalau korang serius nak fasih bertutur bahasa Inggeris, saya dah bina kursus bertutur dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan kepada korang secara tepat','order'=>369],
