            ['start_time'=>1312.84,'end_time'=>1321.7,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking, so you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya kita fokus pada sebutan, loghat, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi supaya korang tak lagi teragak-agak, bertutur lebih bersahaja, dan','order'=>376],
