            ['start_time'=>94.32,'end_time'=>97.86,'target_text'=>'>> Anyways, guys, right now we are standing on the sidewalk.','source_text'=>'>> Apa-apa pun kawan-kawan, sekarang kami sedang berdiri di atas laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>97.96,'end_time'=>103.38,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to take a step down onto the road and make our way towards this square.','source_text'=>'Kami akan turun ke jalan raya dan menuju ke arah dataran bandar ini.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>103.48,'end_time'=>106.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, >> That bus almost hit me.','source_text'=>'>> Alamak, bas tu hampir terlanggar saya tadi.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>106.4,'end_time'=>106.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>107,'end_time'=>111.38,'target_text'=>'This is the bicycle lane, but I don\'t think a bicycle has ever been on here.','source_text'=>'Ini lorong basikal, tapi rasanya basikal tak pernah lalu pun kat sini.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>111.48,'end_time'=>112.26,'target_text'=>'>> Probably not.','source_text'=>'>> Kemungkinan besar tak pernah.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>112.36,'end_time'=>116.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s probably used more by uh scooters than by bicycles.','source_text'=>'Ia mungkin lebih banyak digunakan oleh penunggang skuter berbanding basikal.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>116.44,'end_time'=>116.84,'target_text'=>'Exactly.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>116.88,'end_time'=>123.22,'target_text'=>'you could see on this side there is a solid white line, although it is a bit faded.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak di sebelah sini ada garisan putih padu, walaupun dah agak pudar.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>123.32,'end_time'=>125.98,'target_text'=>'And on this side there is a dotted white line.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah sana pula ada garisan putih putus-putus.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>126.08,'end_time'=>129.34,'target_text'=>'So, there are spaces in between each white strip.','source_text'=>'Ada jarak ruang antara setiap garisan putih tu.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>129.44,'end_time'=>133.02,'target_text'=>'You can see all of these are stalls.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak semua ini ialah gerai jualan.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>133.12,'end_time'=>139.9,'target_text'=>'These are mobile stalls, so usually they can either pedal to move it or this one is on the back of a scooter.','source_text'=>'Ini gerai bergerak, biasanya penjual kayuh untuk tolak atau macam gerai ni dipasang kat belakang motosikal.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>140,'end_time'=>141.3,'target_text'=>'So, he could just drive away.','source_text'=>'Jadi peniaga tu boleh bawa gerainya pergi terus.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>141.4,'end_time'=>143.5,'target_text'=>'And this whole area is filled with stalls.','source_text'=>'Dan seluruh kawasan ni dipenuhi dengan gerai-gerai jualan.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>143.6,'end_time'=>145.42,'target_text'=>'We\'re on the sidewalk right now.','source_text'=>'Kami berada di laluan pejalan kaki sekarang.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>145.52,'end_time'=>150.06,'target_text'=>'Sidewalk is very big, very large, and there are many, many stalls.','source_text'=>'Laluan pejalan kakinya sangat luas dan ada banyak sangat gerai.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>150.16,'end_time'=>151.3,'target_text'=>'>> Are you going to eat something here?','source_text'=>'>> Kau nak makan apa-apa ke kat sini?','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>151.4,'end_time'=>152.38,'target_text'=>'Street snack?','source_text'=>'Makanan ringan tepi jalan?','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>152.48,'end_time'=>152.9,'target_text'=>'>> I should.','source_text'=>'>> Patut juga.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>153,'end_time'=>155.46,'target_text'=>'If I see something good, I think I\'ll get it.','source_text'=>'Kalau nampak makanan yang menarik, saya rasa saya nak beli.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>155.56,'end_time'=>156.54,'target_text'=>'I am hungry.','source_text'=>'Perut saya pun dah lapar.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>156.64,'end_time'=>157.94,'target_text'=>'>> What about this mango?','source_text'=>'>> Mangga ni macam mana?','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>158.04,'end_time'=>158.74,'target_text'=>'>> Low-key.','source_text'=>'>> Menarik juga.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>158.84,'end_time'=>160.26,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s kind of good, actually.','source_text'=>'>> Sebenarnya nampak sedap.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>160.36,'end_time'=>161.18,'target_text'=>'>> Kind of does.','source_text'=>'>> Memang nampak sedap pun.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>161.28,'end_time'=>164.54,'target_text'=>'So, these don\'t look like horses, they look like mules.','source_text'=>'Haiwan ni tak nampak macam kuda biasa, nampak macam baghal atau keldai.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>164.64,'end_time'=>167.62,'target_text'=>'Mules are like horses, very similar, but they\'re smaller.','source_text'=>'Baghal ni seakan-akan kuda, hampir serupa tapi saiznya lebih kecil.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>167.72,'end_time'=>172.58,'target_text'=>'Honestly, these are kind of like ponies, but ponies have very short, short legs.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya nampak macam kuda padi, tapi kuda padi kakinya sangat pendek.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>172.68,'end_time'=>173.62,'target_text'=>'These ones do not.','source_text'=>'Haiwan yang ni kakinya tak pendek.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>173.72,'end_time'=>180.46,'target_text'=>'So, these mules or horses, I\'m not a horse expert, but they\'re pulling the carriage.','source_text'=>'Jadi haiwan ni, saya bukanlah pakar kuda, sedang menarik kereta kuda.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>180.56,'end_time'=>182.26,'target_text'=>'And people can sit in the carriage.','source_text'=>'Dan orang ramai boleh duduk di dalam kereta kuda tersebut.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>182.36,'end_time'=>185.38,'target_text'=>'The part that they hold on with their hands is called the reins.','source_text'=>'Tali yang dipegang di tangan dipanggil tali kekang (reins).','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>185.48,'end_time'=>186.98,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s how they guide the horse.','source_text'=>'Begitulah cara dorang mengawal pergerakan kuda.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>187.08,'end_time'=>187.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>187.64,'end_time'=>191.62,'target_text'=>'But I think if we take that, they\'re going to charge the hell out of us.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau kita naik kereta kuda tu, dorang mesti caj kita mahal gila.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>191.72,'end_time'=>195.22,'target_text'=>'>> This building, how would you describe this building?','source_text'=>'>> Bangunan ni, macam mana kau nak gambarkan rupa dia?','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>195.32,'end_time'=>197.72,'target_text'=>'Give me three words.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya tiga perkataan.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>197.92,'end_time'=>199.54,'target_text'=>'Old, white.','source_text'=>'Lama, putih.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>199.64,'end_time'=>200.66,'target_text'=>'>> Colonial.','source_text'=>'>> Kolonial.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>200.76,'end_time'=>202.54,'target_text'=>'>> Colonial, that\'s a good word.','source_text'=>'>> Kolonial, itu perkataan yang tepat.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>202.64,'end_time'=>204.22,'target_text'=>'That\'s a new word as well, colonial.','source_text'=>'Itu pun perkataan baru juga, kolonial.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>204.32,'end_time'=>207.62,'target_text'=>'Also, you can see the paint is chipping there.','source_text'=>'Korang juga boleh nampak cat dindingnya dah terkopek kat situ.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>207.72,'end_time'=>208.3,'target_text'=>'>> Weathered.','source_text'=>'>> Lusuh dimakan cuaca.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>208.4,'end_time'=>209.38,'target_text'=>'>> Weathered.','source_text'=>'>> Lusuh.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>209.48,'end_time'=>210.34,'target_text'=>'Eroded.','source_text'=>'Terhakis.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>210.44,'end_time'=>213.18,'target_text'=>'The windows there, you can see the windows are barred.','source_text'=>'Tingkap-tingkap kat situ berjeriji besi.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>213.28,'end_time'=>214.66,'target_text'=>'The bars on the windows.','source_text'=>'Ada jeriji besi pada tingkap.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>214.76,'end_time'=>217.78,'target_text'=>'So, when there are bars in front of the window, you could just say it\'s barred.','source_text'=>'Bila ada besi penghadang depan tingkap, korang boleh panggil \'barred\' (berjeriji).','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>217.88,'end_time'=>219.58,'target_text'=>'So, the windows are barred.','source_text'=>'Jadi tingkap-tingkap itu berjeriji.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>219.68,'end_time'=>221.06,'target_text'=>'Kind of like a jail cell.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam sel penjara.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>221.16,'end_time'=>223.18,'target_text'=>'>> And you got your Tesla charger right here.','source_text'=>'>> Dan kat sini ada pengecas Tesla.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>223.28,'end_time'=>227.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, right here you can charge your electric vehicle.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kat sini korang boleh cas kenderaan elektrik korang.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>227.16,'end_time'=>229.86,'target_text'=>'But the thing is, are vehicles allowed to drive here?','source_text'=>'Tapi persoalannya, kenderaan dibenarkan masuk ke sini ke?','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>229.96,'end_time'=>232.98,'target_text'=>'>> I think when it\'s not a holiday, they\'re allowed to drive.','source_text'=>'>> Rasanya masa bukan hari cuti kenderaan dibenarkan lalu.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>233.08,'end_time'=>234.94,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s funny how they put it here though, eh?','source_text'=>'>> Kelakar juga dorang pasang tempat cas kat sini kan?','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>235.04,'end_time'=>236.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s true.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul juga tu.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>236.16,'end_time'=>238.98,'target_text'=>'>> These are electric vehicle chargers.','source_text'=>'>> Ini stesen pengecas kenderaan elektrik.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>239.08,'end_time'=>245.66,'target_text'=>'So, electric vehicles don\'t require fuel, so you don\'t need to fuel them up, but instead you need to charge them like you','source_text'=>'Kenderaan elektrik tak perlukan minyak petrol jadi tak perlu isi minyak, sebaliknya korang kena cas bateri macam','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>245.76,'end_time'=>247.46,'target_text'=>'charge your phone.','source_text'=>'cas telefon pintar korang.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>247.56,'end_time'=>252.7,'target_text'=>'You call this a phone, a smartphone, or a cell phone, but I just call it a phone.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh panggil telefon, telefon pintar, atau telefon bimbit, tapi saya cuma panggil telefon je.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>252.8,'end_time'=>253.9,'target_text'=>'Most people do.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan orang panggil macam tu.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>254,'end_time'=>258.22,'target_text'=>'>> How many of you want to improve your English, but feel like your schedule is already full?','source_text'=>'Berapa ramai antara korang yang nak tingkatkan bahasa Inggeris, tapi rasa jadual harian dah terlalu padat?','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>258.32,'end_time'=>265.18,'target_text'=>'Between school, work, commuting, and everything else, it\'s easy to say you\'ll study later, but then later never comes.','source_text'=>'Antara belajar, kerja, ulang-alik perjalanan, memang senang nak kata nanti belajar, tapi sudahnya masa tu tak pernah tiba.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>265.28,'end_time'=>269.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s exactly why I\'ve kept using Akiflow for months now.','source_text'=>'Itulah sebabnya saya terus guna aplikasi Akiflow selama berbulan-bulan.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>269.36,'end_time'=>272.82,'target_text'=>'It helps me turn good intentions into an actual plan.','source_text'=>'Ia bantu saya tukar niat baik menjadi pelan jadual yang nyata.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>272.92,'end_time'=>275.38,'target_text'=>'My favorite feature is time blocking.','source_text'=>'Fungsi kegemaran saya ialah pengagihan blok masa (time blocking).','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>275.48,'end_time'=>277.9,'target_text'=>'I can drag tasks straight into my calendar.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh seret tugasan terus ke dalam kalendar saya.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>278,'end_time'=>283.1,'target_text'=>'So, instead of just thinking I should study English today, I actually block the time and make it real.','source_text'=>'Jadi bukan sekadar berangan nak belajar bahasa Inggeris hari ni, saya tetapkan blok masa khusus supaya ia benar-benar terlaksana.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>283.2,'end_time'=>287.82,'target_text'=>'I also like that Akiflow brings everything together with its universal inbox.','source_text'=>'Saya juga suka Akiflow menggabungkan segalanya dalam satu peti masuk universal.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>287.92,'end_time'=>292.66,'target_text'=>'Emails, Notion tasks, to-do list reminders, it all shows up in one place.','source_text'=>'Emel, tugasan Notion, senarai peringatan, semuanya terpapar di satu tempat.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>292.76,'end_time'=>297.78,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m not jumping between a bunch of different apps trying to figure out what I need to do next.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak perlu melompat antara pelbagai aplikasi untuk fikir apa nak buat seterusnya.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>297.88,'end_time'=>300.38,'target_text'=>'And I really like the customization side of it, too.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga sangat suka bahagian penyesuaian paparannya.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>300.48,'end_time'=>306.54,'target_text'=>'I can color code tasks, set up simple rituals, and organize my day in a way that feels clean and easy to follow.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh warnakan kod tugasan, susun rutin ringkas, dan atur hari saya dengan kemas serta mudah diikut.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>306.64,'end_time'=>313.02,'target_text'=>'You\'ll also get access to a free one-on-one onboarding call to help you set everything up and start strong.','source_text'=>'Korang juga dapat sesi bimbingan permulaan percuma satu-lawan-satu untuk bantu atur semuanya dari awal.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>313.12,'end_time'=>318.78,'target_text'=>'So, if you\'re a student or busy professional trying to stay productive and make time for English, click my link below and','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang pelajar atau pekerja sibuk yang nak kekal produktif dan luangkan masa untuk bahasa Inggeris, klik pautan di bawah dan','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>318.88,'end_time'=>320.94,'target_text'=>'try Akiflow for free today.','source_text'=>'cubalah Akiflow secara percuma hari ini.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>321.04,'end_time'=>322.94,'target_text'=>'Thank you, Akiflow, for sponsoring this video.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih Akiflow kerana menaja video ini.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>323.04,'end_time'=>326.46,'target_text'=>'>> So, you can see this area is very crowded, very crowded.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi korang boleh nampak kawasan ni sangat padat, sesak dengan orang ramai.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>326.56,'end_time'=>327.82,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of people.','source_text'=>'Ramai sangat orang.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>327.92,'end_time'=>333.78,'target_text'=>'And on the side here, people are selling jewelry, bracelets, necklaces, but this is the square.','source_text'=>'Dan di tepinya orang menjual barang kemas, gelang, dan rantai leher, tapi inilah dataran bandarnya.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>333.88,'end_time'=>336.18,'target_text'=>'Dude, this reminds me so much of Quito.','source_text'=>'Tempat ni betul-betul ingatkan saya pada bandar Quito.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>336.28,'end_time'=>341.22,'target_text'=>'The rock they use for the floor, for the ground is like the same rock as in Ecuador.','source_text'=>'Batu yang dorang guna untuk lantai dataran ni sebiji macam batu jalanan kat Ecuador.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>341.32,'end_time'=>343.9,'target_text'=>'Honestly, most South American countries.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya kebanyakan negara Amerika Selatan macam ni.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>344,'end_time'=>349.98,'target_text'=>'Dude, this whole square really reminds me of the like historical center in Quito, Ecuador.','source_text'=>'Seluruh dataran ni sangat ingatkan saya pada pusat bersejarah di Quito, Ecuador.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>350.08,'end_time'=>352.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s got that colonial vibe.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, suasana dan aura kolonialnya memang kuat.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>352.24,'end_time'=>357.82,'target_text'=>'>> You look at this and then insert a picture of the Quito, Ecuador historical center and it looks very identical.','source_text'=>'>> Kalau tengok tempat ni dan bandingkan dengan gambar pusat bersejarah Quito di Ecuador, rupanya hampir serupa.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>357.92,'end_time'=>363.82,'target_text'=>'Like a big square with white buildings around and this same type of material used.','source_text'=>'Dataran besar dikelilingi bangunan putih dan jenis batuan yang sama digunakan.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>363.92,'end_time'=>365.22,'target_text'=>'And here they have cannons.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini ada meriam lama.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>365.32,'end_time'=>366.22,'target_text'=>'These are cannons.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah meriam.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>366.32,'end_time'=>370.18,'target_text'=>'Obviously these cannons do not work, but I am sure at one point these were authentic.','source_text'=>'Sudah tentu meriam ni dah tak berfungsi lagi, tapi saya pasti dulu ia meriam asli.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>370.28,'end_time'=>371.78,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you guys can see those bubbles.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti kalau korang nampak buih-buih sabun tu.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>371.88,'end_time'=>373.26,'target_text'=>'Look at those bubbles.','source_text'=>'Tengok buih-buih terapung tu.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>373.36,'end_time'=>375.3,'target_text'=>'The guy is trying to sell those bubbles.','source_text'=>'Ada orang tengah berniaga mainan buih sabun.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>375.4,'end_time'=>377.66,'target_text'=>'This is a tree in the middle of the square.','source_text'=>'Ini sebatang pokok besar di tengah-tengah dataran.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>377.76,'end_time'=>378.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually very random.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam pelik juga pokok tu ada kat situ.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>378.76,'end_time'=>380.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m surprised they left the tree there.','source_text'=>'Kagum juga dorang kekalkan pokok tu kat tengah dataran.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>380.28,'end_time'=>383.22,'target_text'=>'>> have that 360 camera rigged there.','source_text'=>'>> Kat situ ada pelantar kamera 360 darjah.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>383.32,'end_time'=>385.66,'target_text'=>'You put your phone there and it whips your phone around.','source_text'=>'Korang letak telefon kat situ dan palang tu akan pusing keliling telefon korang.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>385.76,'end_time'=>387.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s the thing Leo was talking about.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itulah benda yang Leo sebutkan tadi.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>387.24,'end_time'=>389.74,'target_text'=>'You could stand in the middle and it\'ll take a video of you.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh berdiri kat tengah dan ia akan rakam video korang.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>389.84,'end_time'=>391.5,'target_text'=>'A 360 video.','source_text'=>'Video putaran 360 darjah.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>391.6,'end_time'=>393.54,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this is actually a really nice area.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kawasan ni sebenarnya sangat menarik.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>393.64,'end_time'=>394.86,'target_text'=>'I was not expecting this.','source_text'=>'Saya tak sangka langsung.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>394.96,'end_time'=>397.78,'target_text'=>'I was not expecting it to be so similar to South America.','source_text'=>'Saya tak sangka tempat ni sangat mirip dengan Amerika Selatan.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>397.88,'end_time'=>402.22,'target_text'=>'Cuz every town in South America has a square like similar to this.','source_text'=>'Sebab setiap bandar di Amerika Selatan memang ada dataran macam ni.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>402.32,'end_time'=>405.5,'target_text'=>'>> Do you know who colonized Indonesia?','source_text'=>'>> Kau tahu tak siapa yang jajah Indonesia dulu?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>405.6,'end_time'=>406.14,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'>> Tak tahu.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>406.24,'end_time'=>407.06,'target_text'=>'>> Was the Dutch.','source_text'=>'>> Belanda.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>407.16,'end_time'=>408.26,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, the Dutch did.','source_text'=>'>> Oh, Belanda yang jajah.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>408.36,'end_time'=>408.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>408.92,'end_time'=>411.42,'target_text'=>'So I think you could see some Dutch words around.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu korang boleh nampak beberapa perkataan Belanda kat sekitar sini.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>411.52,'end_time'=>412.74,'target_text'=>'That might be Dutch, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Yang tu mungkin perkataan Belanda kot, entahlah.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>412.84,'end_time'=>413.94,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>414.04,'end_time'=>416.22,'target_text'=>'>> This architecture is Dutch architecture.','source_text'=>'>> Seni bina ni memang seni bina tinggalan Belanda.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>416.32,'end_time'=>419.74,'target_text'=>'>> Pretty similar to the Spanish architecture in South America.','source_text'=>'>> Agak serupa dengan seni bina Sepanyol di Amerika Selatan.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>419.84,'end_time'=>422.58,'target_text'=>'You can see this family right here is riding on a bike.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak keluarga ni sedang menunggang basikal.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>422.68,'end_time'=>425.18,'target_text'=>'That couple over there is they are a couple.','source_text'=>'Pasangan kat sana tu... dorang pasangan kekasih.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>425.28,'end_time'=>427.38,'target_text'=>'That means they are together, most likely dating.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya dorang berdua bersama, kemungkinan besar sedang bercinta.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>427.48,'end_time'=>430.58,'target_text'=>'There are many people actually riding bicycles along here.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya ramai orang sedang berbasikal di sepanjang jalan ini.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>430.68,'end_time'=>431.42,'target_text'=>'That\'s fun.','source_text'=>'Seronok tu.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>431.52,'end_time'=>433.9,'target_text'=>'And I think you could rent all of these bicycles here.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa korang boleh sewa semua basikal ni kat sini.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>434,'end_time'=>440.06,'target_text'=>'These bicycles are parked on the outside of the square so that you can rent them and ride in the square.','source_text'=>'Basikal-basikal ni diparkir kat luar dataran supaya korang boleh sewa dan kayuh dalam dataran ni.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>440.16,'end_time'=>444.26,'target_text'=>'And they come with a hat by the looks of it because today is very sunny.','source_text'=>'Dan nampaknya ia siap ada topi sekali sebab hari ni sangat panas terik.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>444.36,'end_time'=>445.26,'target_text'=>'Very sunny today.','source_text'=>'Sangat panas terik hari ni.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>445.36,'end_time'=>450.26,'target_text'=>'But we\'re going to go into the convenience store right there and get a drink because we are thirsty.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita akan masuk ke kedai serbaneka kat situ dan beli minuman sebab kita dahaga.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>450.36,'end_time'=>451.58,'target_text'=>'Convenience store.','source_text'=>'Kedai serbaneka.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>451.68,'end_time'=>454.7,'target_text'=>'Bro, look at the cat just on the outside eating his cat food.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah kucing tu kat luar tengah makan makanan kucing dia.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>454.8,'end_time'=>457.34,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m going to open the door.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan buka pintu.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>457.44,'end_time'=>458.9,'target_text'=>'Open the door.','source_text'=>'Buka pintu.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>459,'end_time'=>461.3,'target_text'=>'We\'re in the convenience store.','source_text'=>'Kita dah ada dalam kedai serbaneka.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>461.4,'end_time'=>462.66,'target_text'=>'Yo, what are you going to get?','source_text'=>'Weh, kau nak beli apa?','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>462.76,'end_time'=>463.38,'target_text'=>'>> Coffee.','source_text'=>'>> Kopi.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>463.48,'end_time'=>463.88,'target_text'=>'>> Coffee?','source_text'=>'>> Kopi?','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>463.96,'end_time'=>464.94,'target_text'=>'>> Black tea.','source_text'=>'>> Teh hitam.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>465.04,'end_time'=>469.86,'target_text'=>'I don\'t see any black coffee, but >> I think I\'m going to get uh just a Pocari Sweat again.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nampak kopi hitam, tapi >> saya rasa saya nak ambil Pocari Sweat lagi.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>469.96,'end_time'=>472.78,'target_text'=>'So, these are all different drinks you can get.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini semua pelbagai jenis minuman yang korang boleh dapatkan.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>472.88,'end_time'=>474.86,'target_text'=>'These drinks right here are coffee.','source_text'=>'Minuman kat sini semuanya kopi.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>474.96,'end_time'=>476.3,'target_text'=>'This looks like tea.','source_text'=>'Yang ni nampak macam teh.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>476.4,'end_time'=>479.1,'target_text'=>'>> Why don\'t you get some olive milk?','source_text'=>'>> Apa kata kau beli susu zaitun tu?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>479.2,'end_time'=>480.22,'target_text'=>'>> And here they have milk.','source_text'=>'>> Dan kat sini mereka ada susu.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>480.32,'end_time'=>484.14,'target_text'=>'Oh, they have the melon milk and strawberry milk from Korea.','source_text'=>'Oh, mereka ada susu tembikai susu dan susu strawberi dari Korea.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>484.24,'end_time'=>488.38,'target_text'=>'Material it\'s made out of it is cardboard and these are in a can.','source_text'=>'Bahannya diperbuat daripada kotak kadbod dan yang ni pula dalam tin.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>488.48,'end_time'=>489.1,'target_text'=>'Canned coffee.','source_text'=>'Kopi dalam tin.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>489.2,'end_time'=>490.98,'target_text'=>'On the bottom though it is plastic.','source_text'=>'Tapi bahagian bawahnya adalah plastik.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>491.08,'end_time'=>492.5,'target_text'=>'Here they have chips.','source_text'=>'Kat sini mereka ada kerepek.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>492.6,'end_time'=>493.58,'target_text'=>'Back there as well.','source_text'=>'Kat belakang sana pun ada juga.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>493.68,'end_time'=>495.1,'target_text'=>'There are cup noodles over there.','source_text'=>'Ada mi cawan kat sebelah sana.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>495.2,'end_time'=>497.14,'target_text'=>'This is my favorite drink when it\'s hot out.','source_text'=>'Ini minuman kegemaran saya bila cuaca panas kat luar.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>497.24,'end_time'=>500.1,'target_text'=>'The cat is guarding the entrance.','source_text'=>'Kucing tu tengah jaga pintu masuk.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>500.2,'end_time'=>502.1,'target_text'=>'What do you want, buddy?','source_text'=>'Kau nak apa, si comel?','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>502.2,'end_time'=>503.86,'target_text'=>'You look very chill.','source_text'=>'Kau nampak tenang sangat.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>503.96,'end_time'=>506.58,'target_text'=>'How would you guys describe this cat?','source_text'=>'Macam mana korang nak gambarkan kucing ni?','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>506.68,'end_time'=>512.82,'target_text'=>'This cat has white paws on all four legs and his tail is very short.','source_text'=>'Kucing ni ada tapak kaki putih kat keempat-empat kakinya dan ekornya sangat pendek.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>512.92,'end_time'=>513.82,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>513.92,'end_time'=>515.9,'target_text'=>'Yo, chill, bro.','source_text'=>'Tenanglah, kawan.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>516,'end_time'=>516.98,'target_text'=>'Looks like a chill cat.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam kucing yang santai.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>517.08,'end_time'=>519.94,'target_text'=>'Oh, the cat just went inside the convenience store.','source_text'=>'Oh, kucing tu baru je masuk ke dalam kedai serbaneka.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>520.04,'end_time'=>521.54,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just had our drink.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita baru je lepas minum.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>521.64,'end_time'=>525.86,'target_text'=>'That over there is the square and now we\'re going to walk this way towards the water.','source_text'=>'Kat sana tu dataran dan sekarang kita akan jalan ke arah sini menuju ke gigi air.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>525.96,'end_time'=>527.7,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think we can go to the water though.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa kita tak boleh pergi dekat dengan air tu.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>527.8,'end_time'=>528.34,'target_text'=>'>> Are you sure?','source_text'=>'>> Kau pasti ke?','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>528.44,'end_time'=>529.74,'target_text'=>'>> Not here.','source_text'=>'>> Bukan kat sini.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>529.84,'end_time'=>530.98,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s try.','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita cuba.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>531.08,'end_time'=>533.66,'target_text'=>'So, the bus right now is passing by me.','source_text'=>'Jadi, bas tu sekarang tengah melintas sebelah saya.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>533.76,'end_time'=>535.62,'target_text'=>'The bus just passed by me.','source_text'=>'Bas tu baru je melintas sebelah saya.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>535.72,'end_time'=>538.86,'target_text'=>'Now the bus is driving forward.','source_text'=>'Sekarang bas tu bergerak ke depan.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>538.96,'end_time'=>540.82,'target_text'=>'Oh, they have a KFC here?','source_text'=>'Oh, mereka ada KFC kat sini?','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>540.92,'end_time'=>541.82,'target_text'=>'You want that?','source_text'=>'Kau nak ke?','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>541.92,'end_time'=>543.82,'target_text'=>'>> I had KFC once here already.','source_text'=>'>> Aku dah pernah makan KFC sekali kat sini.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>543.92,'end_time'=>544.62,'target_text'=>'>> Was it good?','source_text'=>'>> Sedap tak?','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>544.72,'end_time'=>547.34,'target_text'=>'>> It was all right, but I think what I got was not good.','source_text'=>'>> Boleh tahanlah, tapi aku rasa apa yang aku pesan tu tak sedap sangat.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>547.44,'end_time'=>548.06,'target_text'=>'>> What did you get?','source_text'=>'>> Kau pesan apa?','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>548.16,'end_time'=>549.34,'target_text'=>'>> I got a chicken sandwich.','source_text'=>'>> Aku pesan sandwic ayam (burger ayam).','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>549.44,'end_time'=>549.72,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Okey.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>549.72,'end_time'=>551.5,'target_text'=>'>> And when I order they put lettuce in my chicken sandwich.','source_text'=>'>> Dan masa aku pesan, mereka letak salad dalam sandwic ayam aku.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>551.6,'end_time'=>554.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s always like the most wilted lettuce you could ever find.','source_text'=>'Salad tu selalu layu gila macam sayur paling layu pernah jumpa.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>554.76,'end_time'=>555.16,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>555.16,'end_time'=>555.82,'target_text'=>'>> Low-key pissed me off.','source_text'=>'>> Agak menyakitkan hati juga sebenarnya.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>555.92,'end_time'=>556.74,'target_text'=>'>> So, it wasn\'t good.','source_text'=>'>> Jadi, tak sedaplah kan.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>556.84,'end_time'=>557.78,'target_text'=>'What about the sauce?','source_text'=>'Macam mana dengan sos dia?','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>557.88,'end_time'=>558.9,'target_text'=>'Was the sauce good?','source_text'=>'Sos dia sedap tak?','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>559,'end_time'=>559.74,'target_text'=>'>> It was just mayonnaise.','source_text'=>'>> Ia cuma mayonis biasa.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>559.84,'end_time'=>566.1,'target_text'=>'I also got a small little rice bowl with it with some chicken in it and they give you a packet of KFC sambal.','source_text'=>'Aku pun ada beli mangkuk nasi kecil sekali dengan ayam, dan mereka bagi satu paket sambal KFC.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>566.2,'end_time'=>567.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s like chili sauce.','source_text'=>'Ia macam sos cili.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>567.36,'end_time'=>568.38,'target_text'=>'And it was actually really good.','source_text'=>'Dan sebenarnya ia sangat sedap.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>568.48,'end_time'=>569.62,'target_text'=>'The sambal I mean.','source_text'=>'Maksud aku sambal tu.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>569.72,'end_time'=>573.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I have personally not had KFC here yet.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, saya sendiri belum pernah makan KFC kat sini lagi.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>573.2,'end_time'=>574.74,'target_text'=>'I do really like KFC.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka sangat KFC.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>574.84,'end_time'=>579.06,'target_text'=>'I I KFC everywhere except for in Canada and America.','source_text'=>'Saya makan KFC di mana-mana kecuali di Kanada dan Amerika.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>579.16,'end_time'=>583.1,'target_text'=>'KFC there is really not good but everywhere else KFC is amazing.','source_text'=>'KFC kat sana memang tak sedap, tapi kat tempat lain KFC memang padu.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>583.2,'end_time'=>585.54,'target_text'=>'If I\'m in Canada, I like to get Mary Brown\'s.','source_text'=>'Kalau saya kat Kanada, saya suka makan Mary Brown\'s.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>585.64,'end_time'=>588.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s similar to KFC but in my opinion it\'s a lot better.','source_text'=>'Ia mirip KFC tapi pada pandangan saya jauh lebih sedap.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>588.8,'end_time'=>594.14,'target_text'=>'So, now we are back to the square but we\'re going to walk down this street here.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang kita dah kembali ke dataran, tapi kita nak jalan menyusuri jalan ni.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>594.24,'end_time'=>595.82,'target_text'=>'>> Want to go check out the main station.','source_text'=>'>> Nak pergi tengok stesen utama.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>595.92,'end_time'=>600.22,'target_text'=>'This is the station I took to go to Yogyakarta in the center of Java.','source_text'=>'Ini stesen yang saya naik untuk pergi ke Yogyakarta di bahagian tengah Jawa.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>600.32,'end_time'=>603.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s another big city in Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Ia satu lagi bandar besar di Indonesia.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>603.24,'end_time'=>607.98,'target_text'=>'Like the center of like a bunch of temples around it, a bunch of ancient massive temples.','source_text'=>'Macam pusat yang dikelilingi banyak kuil/candi purba yang besar.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>608.08,'end_time'=>609.5,'target_text'=>'They\'re actually really cool to see.','source_text'=>'Memang sangat menarik untuk dilihat.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>609.6,'end_time'=>610.66,'target_text'=>'What\'s the city called?','source_text'=>'Apa nama bandar tu?','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>610.76,'end_time'=>611.78,'target_text'=>'Yogyakarta.','source_text'=>'Yogyakarta.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>611.88,'end_time'=>612.46,'target_text'=>'So, the Y.','source_text'=>'Huruf Y.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>612.56,'end_time'=>615.62,'target_text'=>'I\'m probably saying that wrong but the train ride was super nice.','source_text'=>'Mungkin sebutan saya salah tapi perjalanan naik kereta api tu sangat best.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>615.72,'end_time'=>617.3,'target_text'=>'It goes through a bunch of rice fields.','source_text'=>'Ia melintasi banyak sawah padi.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>617.4,'end_time'=>621.74,'target_text'=>'You can see volcanoes along the way and it was maybe 7 hours.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak gunung berapi sepanjang jalan dan ia ambil masa kira-kira 7 jam.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>621.84,'end_time'=>622.54,'target_text'=>'From here?','source_text'=>'Dari sini?','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>622.64,'end_time'=>623.42,'target_text'=>'On train?','source_text'=>'Naik kereta api?','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>623.52,'end_time'=>624.38,'target_text'=>'On the train, yeah.','source_text'=>'Naik kereta api, ya.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>624.48,'end_time'=>628.46,'target_text'=>'This area is actually super busy today because today is public holiday.','source_text'=>'Kawasan ni sebenarnya sangat sibuk hari ni sebab hari ni cuti umum.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>628.56,'end_time'=>635.3,'target_text'=>'This Monday, today and tomorrow both public holidays and then not this Friday but next Friday it is also public holiday.','source_text'=>'Hari Isnin ni, hari ni dan esok dua-dua cuti umum, dan bukan Jumaat ni tapi Jumaat depan pun cuti umum juga.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>635.4,'end_time'=>636.58,'target_text'=>'But I like these vibes, dude.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya suka suasana ni, kawan.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>636.68,'end_time'=>637.54,'target_text'=>'This is nice.','source_text'=>'Ini memang best.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>637.64,'end_time'=>638.98,'target_text'=>'I was not expecting this.','source_text'=>'Saya tak sangka macam ni.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>639.08,'end_time'=>644.42,'target_text'=>'You know, I feel like if you know Indonesian, it should be easier for you to learn English, right?','source_text'=>'Korang tahu tak, saya rasa kalau korang tahu bahasa Indonesia, patutnya lebih mudah untuk belajar bahasa Inggeris, kan?','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>644.52,'end_time'=>646.86,'target_text'=>'Because there\'s so many similar words.','source_text'=>'Sebab ada banyak perkataan yang serupa.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>646.96,'end_time'=>651.06,'target_text'=>'Like I just saw the word for immigration in Indonesian it\'s like imigrasi.','source_text'=>'Macam saya baru nampak perkataan immigration dalam bahasa Indonesia ialah imigrasi.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>651.16,'end_time'=>652.02,'target_text'=>'Yeah, probably.','source_text'=>'Ya, mungkin juga.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>652.12,'end_time'=>653.82,'target_text'=>'You can put that together pretty easily.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh kaitkannya dengan agak mudah.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>653.92,'end_time'=>654.28,'target_text'=>'Probably.','source_text'=>'Mungkin.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>654.28,'end_time'=>659.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s why like Malay is similar to English and that\'s why most Malaysians speak English.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu bahasa Melayu mirip dengan bahasa Inggeris dan sebab tu kebanyakan orang Malaysia boleh berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>659.16,'end_time'=>661.02,'target_text'=>'Well, they get taught English in school.','source_text'=>'Yalah, mereka diajar bahasa Inggeris di sekolah.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>661.12,'end_time'=>663.34,'target_text'=>'In Indonesia a lot less Oh, really?','source_text'=>'Di Indonesia jauh lebih sedikit Oh, ya ke?','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>663.44,'end_time'=>669.98,'target_text'=>'speak English because they I don\'t think they get taught it in school or maybe certain schools only so Yeah, but I mean you','source_text'=>'boleh berbahasa Inggeris sebab mereka Saya rasa mereka tak diajar di sekolah atau mungkin sekolah tertentu je jadi Ya, tapi maksud saya korang','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>670.08,'end_time'=>672.06,'target_text'=>'could always learn it online.','source_text'=>'sentiasa boleh belajar secara dalam talian.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>672.16,'end_time'=>673.34,'target_text'=>'Yeah, exactly.','source_text'=>'Ya, tepat sekali.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>673.44,'end_time'=>674.58,'target_text'=>'8K?','source_text'=>'8 ribu?','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>674.68,'end_time'=>675.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s not a lot.','source_text'=>'Tu tak banyak mana.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>675.6,'end_time'=>676.42,'target_text'=>'I had 20K.','source_text'=>'Saya ada 20 ribu.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>676.52,'end_time'=>677.62,'target_text'=>'I had 20K on there.','source_text'=>'Saya ada 20 ribu dalam tu.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>677.72,'end_time'=>679.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we are at the station now.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita dah sampai kat stesen sekarang.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>679.32,'end_time'=>681.22,'target_text'=>'This is train station.','source_text'=>'Ini stesen kereta api.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>681.32,'end_time'=>684.78,'target_text'=>'8K can take you a lot though because I used it for the MRT.','source_text'=>'Tapi 8 ribu boleh bawa korang agak jauh sebab saya guna untuk naik MRT.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>684.88,'end_time'=>685.28,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>685.28,'end_time'=>690.14,'target_text'=>'And the initial tap in is 3,000 and then each extra station is 1,000.','source_text'=>'Dan sentuhan masuk pertama ialah 3,000 dan setiap stesen tambahan ialah 1,000.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>690.24,'end_time'=>692.34,'target_text'=>'So, you can go pretty far with not that much money.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh pergi agak jauh dengan duit yang tak seberapa banyak.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>692.44,'end_time'=>696.18,'target_text'=>'I think this is the cheapest MRT metro that I\'ve ever used.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini MRT metro paling murah yang pernah saya guna.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>696.28,'end_time'=>696.94,'target_text'=>'>> Really?','source_text'=>'>> Betul ke?','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>697.04,'end_time'=>698.26,'target_text'=>'Well, yeah, we\'re in the station now.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita dah ada dalam stesen sekarang.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>698.36,'end_time'=>701.46,'target_text'=>'This is what a train station looks like in Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Macam nilah rupa stesen kereta api di Indonesia.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>701.56,'end_time'=>708.98,'target_text'=>'If you want to build a strong English foundation fast, then get my 3,000 most common English words PDF.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin bina asas bahasa Inggeris yang kukuh dengan cepat, dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan saya.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>709.08,'end_time'=>718.02,'target_text'=>'You\'ll learn the most important words that cover up to 95% of everyday English with clear definitions, real examples, and','source_text'=>'Anda akan pelajari perkataan paling penting yang merangkumi hingga 95% bahasa Inggeris harian berserta definisi jelas, contoh sebenar, dan','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>718.12,'end_time'=>722.38,'target_text'=>'easy organization by topic and CEFR','source_text'=>'susunan mudah mengikut topik dan tahap CEFR','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>722.48,'end_time'=>722.88,'target_text'=>'level.','source_text'=>'anda.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>722.96,'end_time'=>724.58,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruang keterangan.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>724.68,'end_time'=>725.38,'target_text'=>'>> Jakarta.','source_text'=>'>> Jakarta.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>725.48,'end_time'=>727.66,'target_text'=>'Over there, you can kind of see the platforms.','source_text'=>'Kat sebelah sana, korang boleh nampak platformnya.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>727.76,'end_time'=>729.02,'target_text'=>'All the platforms are there.','source_text'=>'Semua platform ada kat situ.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>729.12,'end_time'=>731.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s where the trains come and pick the passengers up.','source_text'=>'Kat situlah kereta api sampai dan ambil penumpang.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>731.96,'end_time'=>734.02,'target_text'=>'Have you been to Jakarta before?','source_text'=>'Kau pernah pergi Jakarta sebelum ni?','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>734.12,'end_time'=>737.78,'target_text'=>'>> I have been one time before, about 2 years ago.','source_text'=>'>> Aku pernah pergi sekali sebelum ni, kira-kira 2 tahun lepas.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>737.88,'end_time'=>739.82,'target_text'=>'>> How long did you spend in Jakarta?','source_text'=>'>> Berapa lama kau luangkan masa kat Jakarta?','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>739.92,'end_time'=>745.22,'target_text'=>'>> I spent 1 week here, then I spent 1 week in Yogyakarta, and then 2 weeks in Bali.','source_text'=>'>> Aku luangkan 1 minggu kat sini, lepas tu 1 minggu kat Yogyakarta, dan kemudian 2 minggu kat Bali.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>745.32,'end_time'=>746.94,'target_text'=>'>> What was your favorite part of Indonesia?','source_text'=>'>> Apa bahagian kegemaran kau tentang Indonesia?','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>747.04,'end_time'=>749.78,'target_text'=>'>> I think it was the amount of temples that they have.','source_text'=>'>> Aku rasa jumlah kuil/candi yang mereka ada.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>749.88,'end_time'=>751.9,'target_text'=>'Like, massive and old, as well.','source_text'=>'Macam besar sangat dan juga sangat purba.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>752,'end_time'=>754.1,'target_text'=>'And the history here is really insane to see.','source_text'=>'Dan sejarah kat sini memang sangat luar biasa untuk disaksikan.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>754.2,'end_time'=>755.22,'target_text'=>'Also, the volcanoes.','source_text'=>'Selain tu, gunung berapi.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>755.32,'end_time'=>757.82,'target_text'=>'Like, there are so many volcanoes in this country.','source_text'=>'Macam banyak sangat gunung berapi kat negara ni.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>757.92,'end_time'=>759.26,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'>> Mhm.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>759.36,'end_time'=>761.16,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'>> Okey.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>761.56,'end_time'=>762.14,'target_text'=>'>> Anyways.','source_text'=>'>> Apa-apa pun.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>762.24,'end_time'=>762.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>762.76,'end_time'=>763.78,'target_text'=>'>> The guy just jacked this spot.','source_text'=>'>> Mamat tu baru je rembat tempat ni.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>763.88,'end_time'=>766.3,'target_text'=>'Have you guys seen any volcanoes yet in Indonesia?','source_text'=>'Korang pernah nampak sebarang gunung berapi ke kat Indonesia?','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>766.4,'end_time'=>767.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if we will see any.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada kita akan nampak ke tak.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>768.04,'end_time'=>770.78,'target_text'=>'I\'ll show you guys, but right now we are at a fountain.','source_text'=>'Nanti saya tunjuk kat korang, tapi sekarang kita ada kat air pancut.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>770.88,'end_time'=>771.94,'target_text'=>'This is a fountain.','source_text'=>'Ini ialah air pancut.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>772.04,'end_time'=>774.94,'target_text'=>'The water is actually surprisingly blue, right?','source_text'=>'Air dia sebenarnya sangat membiru kan?','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>775.04,'end_time'=>776.74,'target_text'=>'>> The bottom is probably blue color.','source_text'=>'>> Dasar dia mungkin warna biru kot.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>776.84,'end_time'=>777.3,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, do you think so?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, kau rasa macam tu ke?','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>777.4,'end_time'=>779.94,'target_text'=>'But this water looks like It looks like juice, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Tapi air ni nampak macam Nampak macam jus kan?','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>780.04,'end_time'=>781.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, maybe it\'s dyed, actually.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, mungkin sebenarnya diwarnakan.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>781.68,'end_time'=>783.02,'target_text'=>'>> Looks like they put something in it.','source_text'=>'>> Nampak macam mereka letak sesuatu dalam tu.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>783.12,'end_time'=>784.02,'target_text'=>'Very blue water.','source_text'=>'Air yang sangat biru.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>784.12,'end_time'=>788.22,'target_text'=>'But usually, the fountains here I\'ve noticed don\'t actually have water that come out of them.','source_text'=>'Tapi selalunya air pancut kat sini saya perasan tak ada air pun yang keluar daripadanya.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>788.32,'end_time'=>789.3,'target_text'=>'But this one does.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang ni ada air keluar.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>789.4,'end_time'=>791.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this looks like a main one.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, yang ni nampak macam yang utama.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>791.12,'end_time'=>792.26,'target_text'=>'>> How how how much?','source_text'=>'>> Ber- ber- berapa harga?','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>792.36,'end_time'=>794.98,'target_text'=>'>> Leon is buying snacks from this lady.','source_text'=>'>> Leon tengah beli snek daripada makcik ni.','order'=>307],
