            ['start_time'=>803,'end_time'=>807.82,'target_text'=>'As Leon\'s buying the snacks, I\'ll describe a little bit of what\'s around us.','source_text'=>'Sementara Leon tengah beli snek, saya akan terangkan serba sedikit apa yang ada di sekeliling kita.','order'=>312],
