            ['start_time'=>984.2,'end_time'=>990.92,'target_text'=>'Okay, this is the first Milo I\'ve ever had, and I decided to get it after eating that very spicy food.','source_text'=>'Okey, ini Milo pertama yang pernah saya minum seumur hidup, dan saya beli selepas makan snek yang sangat pedas tadi.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>991.32,'end_time'=>999.18,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly','source_text'=>'Jika anda serius ingin fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya telah cipta kursus bertutur dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan kepada anda secara tepat','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>999.28,'end_time'=>1001.3,'target_text'=>'what to do step by step.','source_text'=>'apa yang perlu dilakukan langkah demi langkah.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1001.4,'end_time'=>1009.34,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to 80 plus video lessons right away, and I add three to five brand new lessons every week, so you can','source_text'=>'Anda dapat akses segera ke 80 lebih pelajaran video sekarang juga, dan saya tambah 3 hingga 5 pelajaran baharu setiap minggu supaya anda boleh','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1009.44,'end_time'=>1011.54,'target_text'=>'keep improving consistently.','source_text'=>'terus meningkat secara konsisten.','order'=>393],
