            ['start_time'=>1015.12,'end_time'=>1023.74,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get an exclusive ChatGPT prompt that allows you to master the pronunciation of any word, plus a clear practice structure,','source_text'=>'Anda akan dapat prompt ChatGPT eksklusif yang membolehkan anda kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan, ditambah struktur latihan yang jelas,','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1023.84,'end_time'=>1029.98,'target_text'=>'so you always know exactly how to study, what to focus on, and how to make real progress.','source_text'=>'supaya anda sentiasa tahu cara belajar, apa yang perlu difokuskan, dan bagaimana mencapai kemajuan sebenar.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1030.08,'end_time'=>1038.98,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking, so you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and','source_text'=>'Di dalamnya, kita latih sebutan, aksen, ritma, dan pertuturan semula jadi, supaya anda tidak lagi ragu-ragu, kedengaran lebih natural, dan','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1039.08,'end_time'=>1041.9,'target_text'=>'speak English with real confidence.','source_text'=>'bercakap bahasa Inggeris dengan penuh yakin.','order'=>398],
