        foreach ([
            ['start_time'=>0,'end_time'=>6.18,'target_text'=>'Do you want to start thinking in English faster instead of translating everything in your head?','source_text'=>'Korang nak mula berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris dengan lebih cepat tanpa perlu terjemah semuanya dalam kepala?','order'=>1],
            ['start_time'=>6.28,'end_time'=>13.9,'target_text'=>'In this video, you are going to shadow a real story written the way native English speakers actually talk.','source_text'=>'Dalam video ni, korang akan buat \'shadowing\' cerita sebenar yang ditulis mengikut cara penutur jati bercakap.','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>14,'end_time'=>23.1,'target_text'=>'This helps you connect English directly to meaning so you can stop translating so much and start understanding naturally.','source_text'=>'Ini membantu korang hubungkan bahasa Inggeris terus kepada maksudnya supaya korang tak lagi asyik menterjemah dan mula faham secara semula jadi.','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>23.2,'end_time'=>32.1,'target_text'=>'Shadowing also improves your pronunciation, speaking rhythm, accent, confidence, and speaking because you are copying real','source_text'=>'Shadowing juga memperbaiki sebutan, ritma pertuturan, aksen, keyakinan, dan cara bercakap korang sebab korang meniru bahasa Inggeris','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>32.2,'end_time'=>34.5,'target_text'=>'English in real time.','source_text'=>'sebenar secara masa nyata.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>34.6,'end_time'=>42.18,'target_text'=>'And through the story, you will also learn new vocabulary, natural expressions, and sentence patterns that native English','source_text'=>'Dan melalui cerita ni, korang juga akan pelajari kosa kata baharu, ungkapan semula jadi, dan pola ayat yang penutur jati','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>42.28,'end_time'=>44.86,'target_text'=>'speakers actually use.','source_text'=>'bahasa Inggeris benar-benar gunakan.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>44.96,'end_time'=>50.78,'target_text'=>'So, read with me, shadow out loud, and train your brain to think in English.','source_text'=>'Jadi, baca bersama saya, sebut kuat-kuat secara shadowing, dan latih otak korang untuk berfikir dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>50.88,'end_time'=>59.14,'target_text'=>'And if you want to get my 3,000 most common English words designed to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English, then','source_text'=>'Dan kalau korang nak dapatkan 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan yang saya reka untuk bantu faham hingga 95% perbualan harian, maka','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>59.24,'end_time'=>61.22,'target_text'=>'you can get it in the description.','source_text'=>'korang boleh dapatkannya di ruangan keterangan.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>61.32,'end_time'=>62.1,'target_text'=>'Let\'s begin.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>62.2,'end_time'=>64.1,'target_text'=>'The first story.','source_text'=>'Cerita pertama.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>64.2,'end_time'=>70.22,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for selling my boyfriend\'s Xbox / games to pay his rent?','source_text'=>'Adakah aku yang jahat sebab jual Xbox / permainan video teman lelaki aku untuk bayar sewa rumah dia?','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>70.32,'end_time'=>72.1,'target_text'=>'Right off the bat, yes and no.','source_text'=>'Secara dasarnya, ya dan tidak.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>72.2,'end_time'=>77.82,'target_text'=>'If he\'s not paying rent, then he has to pay it somehow, so by selling those things, he can pay it.','source_text'=>'Kalau dia tak bayar sewa, dia kena cari jalan untuk bayar juga, jadi dengan menjual barang-barang tu, dia bolehlah bayar.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>77.92,'end_time'=>83.7,'target_text'=>'So, it makes sense, but on the other hand, you can\'t just take someone else\'s stuff and sell it.','source_text'=>'Jadi ada logiknya, tapi dari sudut lain, kau tak boleh sesuka hati ambil barang orang lain dan jual.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>83.8,'end_time'=>85.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s kind of like theft.','source_text'=>'Itu dah macam mencuri.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>85.64,'end_time'=>92.02,'target_text'=>'Last week, I sold my boyfriend\'s Xbox and six of his games for 400 pounds.','source_text'=>'Minggu lepas, saya jual Xbox teman lelaki saya beserta enam permainan videonya dengan harga 400 paun.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>92.12,'end_time'=>100.42,'target_text'=>'I did this because for the last 2 months, he has been depending on me financially despite the fact that I, 20 female, am a','source_text'=>'Saya buat macam ni sebab sejak 2 bulan lepas, dia asyik bergantung duit pada saya walaupun hakikatnya saya, perempuan berumur 20 tahun, hanyalah seorang','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>100.52,'end_time'=>103.94,'target_text'=>'student who can hardly provide for herself.','source_text'=>'pelajar yang nak sara diri sendiri pun cukup-cukup makan.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>104.04,'end_time'=>111.22,'target_text'=>'I work a part-time job while studying because my student loans don\'t cover the cost of living.','source_text'=>'Saya kerja sambilan sambil belajar sebab pinjaman pelajaran saya tak cukup untuk tampung kos sara hidup.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>111.32,'end_time'=>119.1,'target_text'=>'Meanwhile, my boyfriend, 22 male, has been out of a job for 2 months and lives in a flat by himself.','source_text'=>'Sementara teman lelaki saya, lelaki berumur 22 tahun, dah menganggur selama 2 bulan dan tinggal seorang diri di sebuah flat.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>119.2,'end_time'=>124.38,'target_text'=>'In those 2 months, he has put almost no effort into finding a new job.','source_text'=>'Sepanjang 2 bulan tu, dia langsung tak berusaha nak cari kerja baru.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>124.48,'end_time'=>131.34,'target_text'=>'Instead, he was spending all his time playing on his Xbox, literally depending on me for money.','source_text'=>'Sebaliknya, dia habiskan masa main Xbox dan betul-betul bergantung duit pada saya.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>131.44,'end_time'=>138.58,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and go deeper than the video, then get the workbook on my website, vocaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang nak belajar lebih cepat dan lebih mendalam, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>138.68,'end_time'=>147.42,'target_text'=>'The workbook explains everything in greater detail and comes with exercises to help you learn new vocabulary, grammar, tenses,','source_text'=>'Buku latihan ni menerangkan segalanya dengan lebih terperinci berserta latihan untuk bantu korang pelajari kosa kata baru, tatabahasa, bentuk masa (tenses),','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>147.52,'end_time'=>153.18,'target_text'=>'sentence patterns, comprehension, and real English you can actually use.','source_text'=>'pola ayat, kefahaman, dan bahasa Inggeris sebenar yang boleh korang gunakan.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>153.28,'end_time'=>156.1,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada buku latihan untuk video-video yang lepas.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>156.2,'end_time'=>159.66,'target_text'=>'So, you can keep practicing and improving every lesson.','source_text'=>'Jadi korang boleh terus berlatih dan bertambah mahir setiap sesi.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>159.76,'end_time'=>162.82,'target_text'=>'Click the link in my description to get the workbooks.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan keterangan saya untuk dapatkan buku latihan tersebut.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>162.92,'end_time'=>165.18,'target_text'=>'Last week, I just kind of lost it.','source_text'=>'Minggu lepas, saya betul-betul hilang sabar.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>165.28,'end_time'=>172.06,'target_text'=>'I was fed up with him putting no effort into getting money, and I didn\'t want to pay for another month\'s rent.','source_text'=>'Saya dah muak tengok dia langsung tak usaha cari duit, dan saya tak nak bayarkan sewa rumah dia untuk sebulan lagi.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>172.16,'end_time'=>178.62,'target_text'=>'So, I instead sold his Xbox and games without his consent in order to pay his rent.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya ambil keputusan jual Xbox dan permainannya tanpa keizinan dia untuk bayar sewa rumah tu.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>178.72,'end_time'=>186.42,'target_text'=>'By the sounds of it, she does recognize what she did was wrong because it was without his consent, and she is being very honest','source_text'=>'Nampaknya wanita ni sedar apa yang dia buat tu salah sebab ia dibuat tanpa izin, dan dia sangat jujur','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>186.52,'end_time'=>187.02,'target_text'=>'about that.','source_text'=>'tentang hal itu.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>187.12,'end_time'=>190.22,'target_text'=>'So, maybe this story is just to vent her frustration.','source_text'=>'Jadi mungkin cerita ni sekadar untuk dia luahkan rasa geram dia.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>190.32,'end_time'=>192.62,'target_text'=>'I do feel guilty, okay?','source_text'=>'Saya memang rasa serba salah, faham tak?','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>192.72,'end_time'=>196.66,'target_text'=>'But, I\'m hoping at least someone understands my reasoning.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya harap sekurang-kurangnya ada yang faham sebab apa saya buat macam tu.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>196.76,'end_time'=>198.58,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole?','source_text'=>'Adakah saya yang bersalah?','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>198.68,'end_time'=>200.02,'target_text'=>'We have some edits.','source_text'=>'Ada beberapa kemas kini maklumat tambahan.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>200.12,'end_time'=>201.02,'target_text'=>'Edit one.','source_text'=>'Kemas kini pertama.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>201.12,'end_time'=>203.98,'target_text'=>'Why didn\'t I communicate like an adult?','source_text'=>'Kenapa saya tak berbincang secara matang macam orang dewasa?','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>204.08,'end_time'=>209.18,'target_text'=>'I tried talking things through with him like an adult on numerous occasions.','source_text'=>'Saya dah banyak kali cuba berbincang elok-elok dengan dia secara matang.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>209.28,'end_time'=>218.18,'target_text'=>'I tried explaining that I can\'t afford to keep paying for his food, bills, rent, and everything else he needs to get by.','source_text'=>'Saya cuba terangkan yang saya tak mampu nak terus bayar makan minum, bil, sewa, dan segala keperluan hidup dia.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>218.28,'end_time'=>221.62,'target_text'=>'He has borderline nothing in his bank account.','source_text'=>'Duit dalam akaun bank dia dah hampir sifar.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>221.72,'end_time'=>230.1,'target_text'=>'Every single time I talked to him about his job search or tried talking to him, he would shrug it off.','source_text'=>'Setiap kali saya ungkit fasal cari kerja atau cuba ajak berbincang, dia buat acuh tak acuh je.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>230.2,'end_time'=>233.66,'target_text'=>'He never put any effort into conversations.','source_text'=>'Dia langsung tak acuh masa berbual.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>233.76,'end_time'=>238.7,'target_text'=>'It was always a case of yeah, yeah, I\'ll start looking tomorrow.','source_text'=>'Dia selalu beralasan, \'Ya, ya, esok aku mulalah cari kerja.\'','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>238.8,'end_time'=>240.78,'target_text'=>'Or yeah, I know, yeah.','source_text'=>'Atau \'Ya, aku tahulah, ya.\'','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>240.88,'end_time'=>244.7,'target_text'=>'He never started looking for a job as far as I know.','source_text'=>'Setahu saya, dia langsung tak pernah mula cari kerja.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>244.8,'end_time'=>257.1,'target_text'=>'I felt like him being on his Xbox was the sole reason wasting all his time on that instead of productively searching for jobs.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa asyik hadap Xbox itulah satu-satunya punca dia buang masa dan bukannya cari kerja dengan betul.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>257.2,'end_time'=>263.66,'target_text'=>'I did use the money for rent because it was due and he would have had nothing to pay for it.','source_text'=>'Saya memang guna duit tu untuk bayar sewa sebab dah sampai tarikh akhir dan dia tak ada duit langsung nak bayar.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>263.76,'end_time'=>270.18,'target_text'=>'But also because I thought it would be good to have that distraction out of his life.','source_text'=>'Tapi juga sebab saya rasa elok kalau gangguan tu dihapuskan dari hidup dia.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>270.28,'end_time'=>271.98,'target_text'=>'I would like to add something.','source_text'=>'Saya nak tambah sikit pandangan saya.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>272.08,'end_time'=>276.86,'target_text'=>'I feel like you definitely enabled this behavior by paying for his things.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa awak sendiri yang membiasakan perangai dia macam tu sebab asyik tolong bayarkan barang dia.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>276.96,'end_time'=>279.5,'target_text'=>'I would not have paid for it, maybe for one month.','source_text'=>'Saya takkan tolong bayarkan, mungkin setakat sebulan bolehlah.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>279.6,'end_time'=>286.46,'target_text'=>'But if I can clearly see they\'re not putting any effort into finding a job and they\'re just start to depend on me and mooch,','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau dah nampak terang-terang dia tak usaha cari kerja dan mula jadi parasit menumpang hidup pada saya,','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>286.56,'end_time'=>289.66,'target_text'=>'then like if I was in her situation, then I would just stop.','source_text'=>'kalau saya di tempat perempuan tu, saya akan terus berhenti menolong.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>289.76,'end_time'=>291.22,'target_text'=>'I\'d be like, you need to find a job now.','source_text'=>'Saya akan kata, \'Kau kena cari kerja sekarang juga.\'','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>291.32,'end_time'=>294.5,'target_text'=>'I helped you for a month and you literally haven\'t done anything.','source_text'=>'\'Aku dah tolong kau sebulan dan kau langsung tak buat apa-apa.\'','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>294.6,'end_time'=>295.54,'target_text'=>'That\'s the end of my help.','source_text'=>'\'Cukuplah setakat ni aku tolong.\'','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>295.64,'end_time'=>301.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m not going to continue helping you, especially if I don\'t have money because I\'m a student and I have to work just to support','source_text'=>'\'Aku takkan terus tolong kau, apatah lagi aku sendiri tak ada duit sebab aku pelajar dan kena kerja semata-mata nak sara\'','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>301.68,'end_time'=>305.94,'target_text'=>'myself and now you want me to support you, too, when you\'re not doing anything.','source_text'=>'\'diri sendiri, dan sekarang kau nak aku tanggung kau sekali sedangkan kau goyang kaki.\'','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>306.04,'end_time'=>311.5,'target_text'=>'So, you kind of did enable this behavior cuz he felt like he doesn\'t have to do anything because you will pay for it.','source_text'=>'Jadi awak memang menyumbang kepada perangai dia sebab dia rasa dia tak perlu buat apa-apa memandangkan awak yang akan bayarkan.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>311.6,'end_time'=>314.98,'target_text'=>'Edit two, why didn\'t you just let him get evicted?','source_text'=>'Kemas kini kedua, \'Kenapa kau tak biarkan je dia kena halau dari rumah tu?\'','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>315.08,'end_time'=>317.66,'target_text'=>'Facts, I didn\'t want him to become homeless.','source_text'=>'Hakikatnya, saya tak sampai hati tengok dia jadi gelandangan.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>317.76,'end_time'=>323.1,'target_text'=>'He isn\'t that close to his parents and so cannot rely on moving into their home.','source_text'=>'Hubungan dia dengan mak ayah dia tak berapa rapat jadi dia tak boleh nak tumpang duduk rumah mereka.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>323.2,'end_time'=>328.02,'target_text'=>'I think losing an Xbox is way better than becoming homeless, I guess.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa hilang Xbox jauh lebih baik daripada jadi gelandangan tanpa tempat tinggal.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>328.12,'end_time'=>331.82,'target_text'=>'Edit three, I know what I did was illegal and theft.','source_text'=>'Kemas kini ketiga, \'Saya tahu perbuatan saya ni salah di sisi undang-undang dan dikira mencuri.\'','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>331.92,'end_time'=>340.14,'target_text'=>'So, the last point from edit two, my boyfriend was furious when he found out I sold his Xbox, but he never brought up charges.','source_text'=>'Menyambung poin kemas kini kedua tadi, teman lelaki saya mengamuk bila dapat tahu saya jual Xbox dia, tapi dia tak pernah buat laporan polis.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>340.24,'end_time'=>343.22,'target_text'=>'He never said he would sue or report it to the police.','source_text'=>'Dia tak pernah cakap nak saman atau repot polis.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>343.32,'end_time'=>346.34,'target_text'=>'He knows that he depends on me financially.','source_text'=>'Dia tahu dia bergantung harap pada wang saya.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>346.44,'end_time'=>349.58,'target_text'=>'Edit four, yes, I understand this is theft.','source_text'=>'Kemas kini keempat, \'Ya, saya faham ini memang perbuatan mencuri.\'','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>349.68,'end_time'=>353.62,'target_text'=>'No need to keep repeating it in every single comment.','source_text'=>'\'Tak payahlah asyik ulang benda yang sama kat setiap komen.\'','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>353.72,'end_time'=>356.94,'target_text'=>'That being said, I think I will break up with him soon.','source_text'=>'Walau bagaimanapun, saya rasa saya akan putus dengan dia tak lama lagi.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>357.04,'end_time'=>361.26,'target_text'=>'I say this because so many of these comments have been saying dump him.','source_text'=>'Saya kata macam ni sebab ramai sangat komen suruh tinggalkan dia.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>361.36,'end_time'=>364.1,'target_text'=>'I feel like that was pretty obvious to anyone reading this.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa perkara tu memang dah terang lagi bersuluh bagi sesiapa yang baca cerita ni.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>364.2,'end_time'=>367.14,'target_text'=>'He is depending on you and he\'s not helping you in any way.','source_text'=>'Dia cuma menumpang hidup pada awak dan langsung tak membantu awak dalam apa cara sekalipun.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>367.24,'end_time'=>370.58,'target_text'=>'The best thing to do would just be to separate yourself and cut him off.','source_text'=>'Perkara terbaik untuk dibuat ialah angkat kaki dan putuskan hubungan dengan dia.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>370.68,'end_time'=>375.06,'target_text'=>'Edit five, my last edit sounded way worse than I intended.','source_text'=>'Kemas kini kelima, \'Kemas kini saya yang lepas bunyinya jauh lebih kasar daripada yang saya maksudkan.\'','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>375.16,'end_time'=>376.82,'target_text'=>'I said I think I will.','source_text'=>'Saya kata saya \'rasa\' saya akan putus.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>376.92,'end_time'=>378.7,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t say when.','source_text'=>'Saya tak cakap bila.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>378.8,'end_time'=>383.3,'target_text'=>'I don\'t mean right now, this very second, and leave him with nothing.','source_text'=>'Bukannya maksud saya saat ni juga saya nak tinggalkan dia sehelai sepinggang.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>383.4,'end_time'=>390.7,'target_text'=>'I read pretty much every single comment on this post and a lot of things mentioned made me realize I can\'t keep on living','source_text'=>'Saya baca hampir semua komen pada hantaran ni dan banyak perkara yang disebut buat saya sedar saya tak boleh terus hidup','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>390.8,'end_time'=>394.62,'target_text'=>'with someone literally leeching off me.','source_text'=>'dengan orang yang terang-terang menghisap darah saya.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>394.72,'end_time'=>395.46,'target_text'=>'Very true.','source_text'=>'Betul sangat tu.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>395.56,'end_time'=>399.86,'target_text'=>'I\'ll end up just as broke as him if I continue at this rate.','source_text'=>'Saya pun akan papa kedana macam dia kalau berterusan macam ni.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>399.96,'end_time'=>405.34,'target_text'=>'I have already spent near 2K on him in the last few months.','source_text'=>'Saya dah habiskan dekat 2,000 paun untuk dia sejak beberapa bulan kebelakangan ni.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>405.44,'end_time'=>411.34,'target_text'=>'Digging through the little I have saved since I started working part-time at age 14.','source_text'=>'Sampai terpaksa korek duit simpanan yang saya kumpul sejak mula kerja sambilan dari umur 14 tahun.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>411.44,'end_time'=>414.86,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this relationship really does not sound good for you.','source_text'=>'Ya, hubungan ni memang langsung tak membawa kebaikan pada awak.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>414.96,'end_time'=>421.06,'target_text'=>'I think he will just use you and take everything he can until you can\'t offer anything else and then he\'ll leave you and look','source_text'=>'Saya rasa dia cuma gunakan awak dan kikis apa yang ada sampai awak dah tak ada apa-apa lagi, lepas tu dia akan tinggalkan awak dan cari','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>421.16,'end_time'=>422.94,'target_text'=>'for someone else to mooch off of.','source_text'=>'mangsa lain untuk ditumpangi.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>423.04,'end_time'=>424.02,'target_text'=>'So, am I the a-hole?','source_text'=>'Jadi, adakah saya yang bersalah?','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>424.12,'end_time'=>425.02,'target_text'=>'Yep, I am.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang saya salah.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>425.12,'end_time'=>427.86,'target_text'=>'Taking someone\'s things and selling it is an a-hole move.','source_text'=>'Ambil barang orang dan jual memang perangai tak elok.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>427.96,'end_time'=>432.62,'target_text'=>'Your boyfriend\'s also an a-hole taking over $2,000 from you in the past few months.','source_text'=>'Teman lelaki awak pun tak guna juga sebab ambil lebih 2,000 dolar daripada awak sejak beberapa bulan ni.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>432.72,'end_time'=>434.38,'target_text'=>'So, I guess you guys are both a-holes.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya rasa dua-dua pun ada salah masing-masing.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>434.48,'end_time'=>436.26,'target_text'=>'You need to leave him by the sounds of it.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya awak memang patut tinggalkan dia.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>436.36,'end_time'=>438.74,'target_text'=>'I think that would be better for you specifically.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu jauh lebih baik untuk diri awak sendiri.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>438.84,'end_time'=>443.46,'target_text'=>'Remember guys, I want you to take your phone and give me a summary of the story you just read.','source_text'=>'Ingat kawan-kawan, saya nak korang ambil telefon dan berikan rumusan tentang cerita yang baru kita baca ni.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>443.56,'end_time'=>450.26,'target_text'=>'It only has to be one or two sentences and this is just to have a video of your pronunciation and accent so in a couple months','source_text'=>'Cukup sekadar satu atau dua ayat sahaja untuk rakam video sebutan dan aksen korang supaya dalam masa beberapa bulan lagi','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>450.36,'end_time'=>453.74,'target_text'=>'you can look back on this video and see how much you have improved.','source_text'=>'korang boleh tonton semula video ni dan tengok berapa banyak kemajuan yang korang dah capai.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>453.84,'end_time'=>455.7,'target_text'=>'Try to do this for every story.','source_text'=>'Cuba buat macam ni untuk setiap cerita.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>455.8,'end_time'=>461.82,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole for throwing away my husband\'s Xbox after he refused to look for our lost dog.','source_text'=>'Adakah aku yang jahat sebab buang Xbox suami aku lepas dia enggan cari anjing kami yang hilang?','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>461.92,'end_time'=>463.42,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this one she didn\'t sell it.','source_text'=>'Okey, yang ni dia tak jual.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>463.52,'end_time'=>464.26,'target_text'=>'He threw it away.','source_text'=>'Dia buang terus ke tong sampah.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>464.36,'end_time'=>464.76,'target_text'=>'Interesting.','source_text'=>'Menarik.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>464.84,'end_time'=>466.74,'target_text'=>'This is going to be a little long.','source_text'=>'Cerita ni agak panjang sikit.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>466.84,'end_time'=>470.3,'target_text'=>'Please try to bear with me and understand my situation.','source_text'=>'Tolonglah bersabar dan fahami situasi saya.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>470.4,'end_time'=>470.8,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>470.84,'end_time'=>474.3,'target_text'=>'For starters, I\'m a nurse, 35 female.','source_text'=>'Sebagai permulaan, saya seorang jururawat, wanita berumur 35 tahun.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>474.4,'end_time'=>477.46,'target_text'=>'I have been extremely busy these past 3 months.','source_text'=>'Saya tersangatlah sibuk sejak 3 bulan kebelakangan ni.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>477.56,'end_time'=>483.1,'target_text'=>'Even writing this post is a privilege and I\'m having to do this in bits and pieces.','source_text'=>'Dapat luangkan masa tulis hantaran ni pun satu rezeki dan saya terpaksa taip sikit demi sikit.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>483.2,'end_time'=>486.86,'target_text'=>'I also gave birth to my daughter 6 months ago.','source_text'=>'Saya juga baru je melahirkan anak perempuan saya 6 bulan lepas.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>486.96,'end_time'=>488.78,'target_text'=>'I have an 8-year-old son as well.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada anak lelaki berumur 8 tahun.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>488.88,'end_time'=>491.9,'target_text'=>'When I am not working, I take care of my children.','source_text'=>'Bila saya tak bekerja, saya akan jaga anak-anak saya.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>492,'end_time'=>499.42,'target_text'=>'If you want to build a strong English foundation fast, then get my 3,000 most common English words PDF.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin bina asas bahasa Inggeris yang mantap dengan cepat, dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan saya.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>499.52,'end_time'=>508.42,'target_text'=>'You\'ll learn the most important words that cover up to 95% of everyday English with clear definitions, real examples, and','source_text'=>'Anda akan pelajari perkataan paling penting yang merangkumi hingga 95% bahasa Inggeris harian berserta definisi jelas, contoh sebenar, dan','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>508.52,'end_time'=>513.3,'target_text'=>'easy organization by topic and C E F R level.','source_text'=>'susunan mudah mengikut topik dan tahap CEFR.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>513.4,'end_time'=>515.1,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruang keterangan.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>515.2,'end_time'=>522.14,'target_text'=>'In January 2019, my son suddenly developed this strong desire to have a dog.','source_text'=>'Pada bulan Januari 2019, anak lelaki saya tiba-tiba teringin sangat nak bela anjing.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>522.24,'end_time'=>526.66,'target_text'=>'He begged and begged for a puppy from my husband, 35 male.','source_text'=>'Dia merayu berkali-kali minta anak anjing daripada suami saya, lelaki berumur 35 tahun.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>526.76,'end_time'=>531.98,'target_text'=>'I protested against that because I had just found out that I was pregnant.','source_text'=>'Saya membantah sekeras-kerasnya sebab masa tu saya baru dapat tahu saya mengandung.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>532.08,'end_time'=>539.98,'target_text'=>'My husband said that we should let our son have a puppy to teach him some responsibility and that he would have some practice','source_text'=>'Suami saya kata patut bagi anak kami bela anak anjing untuk ajar dia rasa tanggungjawab dan sebagai latihan awal','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>540.08,'end_time'=>542.3,'target_text'=>'taking care of his baby sibling.','source_text'=>'sebelum menjaga adik bayinya nanti.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>542.4,'end_time'=>546.3,'target_text'=>'He also promised that he would help our son take care of the dog.','source_text'=>'Dia juga berjanji yang dia akan bantu anak kami jaga anjing tu.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>546.4,'end_time'=>554.78,'target_text'=>'I was absolutely unconvinced, but I had to give in eventually because my husband had already agreed and I didn\'t want to cause','source_text'=>'Saya memang langsung tak yakin, tapi akhirnya terpaksa beralah juga sebab suami saya dah setuju dan saya tak nak timbulkan','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>554.88,'end_time'=>555.98,'target_text'=>'further fights.','source_text'=>'perbalahan yang berpanjangan.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>556.08,'end_time'=>561.18,'target_text'=>'This is interesting because in my experience, because usually it\'s the mom that says, \"Oh, just let them have a puppy.','source_text'=>'Ini menarik sebab menurut pengalaman saya, biasanya si ibu yang akan cakap, \'Alah, bagilah mereka bela anak anjing tu.\'','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>561.28,'end_time'=>568.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s okay.\" And it\'s usually the dad that says, \"No, I don\'t want a dog or a puppy at all.\" But in this situation, it\'s reversed.','source_text'=>'\'Tak apa.\' Dan selalunya si ayah yang kata, \'Tak boleh, aku tak nak sebarang anjing langsung.\' Tapi dalam situasi ni, ia terbalik.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>568.36,'end_time'=>575.98,'target_text'=>'5 days ago, my son had accidentally left the back door of our house open and the dog ran away.','source_text'=>'5 hari lepas, anak lelaki saya tak sengaja biarkan pintu belakang rumah terbuka dan anjing tu terlepas lari.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>576.08,'end_time'=>585.06,'target_text'=>'These 5 days were also some of the busiest, most grueling days of my work, and I had to take up night shifts because a colleague','source_text'=>'5 hari ni juga merupakan hari-hari paling sibuk dan paling meletihkan kat tempat kerja saya, sampai saya kena ambil syif malam sebab rakan sekerja','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>585.16,'end_time'=>586.58,'target_text'=>'had fallen sick.','source_text'=>'jatuh sakit.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>586.68,'end_time'=>588.82,'target_text'=>'Our son first went to my husband for help.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula anak kami pergi minta tolong pada suami saya.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>588.92,'end_time'=>597.58,'target_text'=>'He refused to help him and said that it was his, my son\'s, responsibility to care for the dog, and he has to do something','source_text'=>'Dia enggan tolong dan kata itu tanggungjawab anak saya untuk jaga anjing tu, jadi dia kena selesaikan','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>597.68,'end_time'=>599.18,'target_text'=>'about it himself.','source_text'=>'masalah tu sendiri.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>599.28,'end_time'=>602.34,'target_text'=>'My husband has the privilege of working from home.','source_text'=>'Suami saya bernasib baik sebab boleh bekerja dari rumah.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>602.44,'end_time'=>604.1,'target_text'=>'He works at a law firm.','source_text'=>'Dia bekerja di sebuah firma guaman.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>604.2,'end_time'=>612.94,'target_text'=>'He works for maybe 3 to 4 hours a day and plays Xbox the entire time and sometimes gets up to check up on our daughter.','source_text'=>'Dia kerja mungkin 3 hingga 4 jam sehari je dan selebihnya main Xbox sepanjang masa, cuma kadang-kadang bangun jenguk anak perempuan kami.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>613.04,'end_time'=>616.18,'target_text'=>'He literally has no added pressures.','source_text'=>'Dia langsung tak ada sebarang tekanan kerja yang berat.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>616.28,'end_time'=>624.1,'target_text'=>'5 days ago, when our son told me in tears that dad won\'t look for Tippy, I talked to my husband, who said that it would teach','source_text'=>'5 hari lepas, bila anak lelaki kami menangis teresak-esak bagi tahu ayah tak nak cari Tippy, saya berbincang dengan suami, tapi dia kata kononnya itu akan mengajar','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>624.2,'end_time'=>633.5,'target_text'=>'our son some responsibility to take care of things in the future, which I found very callous since a dog is a living, sentient','source_text'=>'anak kami bertanggungjawab jaga barang pada masa depan, suatu alasan yang saya rasa sangat kejam sebab anjing ialah makhluk hidup bernyawa','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>633.6,'end_time'=>635.94,'target_text'=>'being and not a thing.','source_text'=>'dan bukannya barang mainan.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>636.04,'end_time'=>636.7,'target_text'=>'That is very true.','source_text'=>'Itu betul sangat.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>636.8,'end_time'=>637.62,'target_text'=>'A dog is alive.','source_text'=>'Anjing itu bernyawa.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>637.72,'end_time'=>643.18,'target_text'=>'You can\'t just lose it and then be like, \"Oh, well, I\'ll get another one.\" No, it\'s alive.','source_text'=>'Tak bolehlah bila hilang kita cakap, \'Alah, nanti belilah yang lain.\' Tak boleh, ia bernyawa.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>643.28,'end_time'=>646.98,'target_text'=>'He was playing Xbox when I was talking to him as well.','source_text'=>'Masa saya tengah cakap dengan dia pun dia masih ralit main Xbox.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>647.08,'end_time'=>650.18,'target_text'=>'He also said he won\'t look for the dog or anything.','source_text'=>'Dia pun berkeras kata dia takkan cari anjing tu atau buat apa-apa.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>650.28,'end_time'=>657.82,'target_text'=>'Yesterday, after coming home at night, the first thing I did was unplug the Xbox console and controller and throw them in','source_text'=>'Semalam, lepas balik kerja waktu malam, benda pertama yang saya buat ialah cabut palam konsol Xbox serta alat kawalannya dan campak ke dalam','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>657.92,'end_time'=>659.22,'target_text'=>'the trash can.','source_text'=>'tong sampah.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>659.32,'end_time'=>666.14,'target_text'=>'This morning, before going to work, my husband threw a fit when he didn\'t find his Xbox in the living room.','source_text'=>'Pagi tadi, sebelum saya pergi kerja, suami saya mengamuk sakan bila tengok Xbox dia tak ada kat ruang tamu.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>666.24,'end_time'=>675.14,'target_text'=>'I told him that I\'d thrown it away because he was so addicted to it that he couldn\'t even get up and help our distressed son.','source_text'=>'Saya bagi tahu saya dah buang sebab dia terlampau ketagih sampai tak boleh bangun nak tolong anak kami yang tengah bersedih.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>675.24,'end_time'=>683.06,'target_text'=>'When I came back from work, he told me he had found his Xbox in the trash since the garbage truck hadn\'t arrived yet.','source_text'=>'Bila saya balik kerja, dia bagi tahu yang dia dah pungut balik Xbox dia dari tong sampah memandangkan lori sampah belum sampai lagi.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>683.16,'end_time'=>691.7,'target_text'=>'Now, he\'s being incredibly snarky, giving me the cold shoulder, and he\'s angry because his controller isn\'t working.','source_text'=>'Sekarang dia asyik menyindir, layan saya acuh tak acuh, dan dia marah sebab alat kawalan Xbox dia dah rosak.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>691.8,'end_time'=>700.34,'target_text'=>'He also hasn\'t taken any measures to look for our dog and our mutual best friend called and said my reaction was incredibly','source_text'=>'Dia langsung tak ambil sebarang langkah untuk cari anjing kami, dan kawan baik kami berdua pula telefon kata tindakan saya melampau dan','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>700.44,'end_time'=>701.26,'target_text'=>'childish.','source_text'=>'kebudak-budakan.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>701.36,'end_time'=>710.62,'target_text'=>'Now I\'m spending my free day calling every neighbor of ours, making internet posters, contacting animal shelters, and animal','source_text'=>'Sekarang pada hari cuti saya, saya habiskan masa telefon semua jiran tetangga, buat poster dalam talian, hubungi pusat perlindungan haiwan, dan bahagian','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>710.72,'end_time'=>716.7,'target_text'=>'control to see if Tippy had turned up anywhere, and consoling my heartbroken son.','source_text'=>'kawalan haiwan untuk semak kalau ada sesiapa jumpa Tippy, sambil memujuk anak lelaki saya yang sedang patah hati.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>716.8,'end_time'=>717.74,'target_text'=>'Am I the a-hole?','source_text'=>'Adakah saya yang bersalah?','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>717.84,'end_time'=>720.26,'target_text'=>'Edit: My husband is a lawyer.','source_text'=>'Kemas kini: Suami saya seorang peguam.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>720.36,'end_time'=>723.9,'target_text'=>'A lawyer\'s job depends on how many clients he has.','source_text'=>'Tugas peguam bergantung pada berapa ramai anak guam yang dia ada.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>724,'end_time'=>728.5,'target_text'=>'My husband currently has almost no clients due to obvious reasons.','source_text'=>'Suami saya sekarang hampir tiada anak guam langsung atas sebab yang semua sedia maklum.','order'=>162],
