            ['start_time'=>763.8,'end_time'=>771.58,'target_text'=>'>> serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly what','source_text'=>'>> serius ingin fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya telah bina kursus pertuturan dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan secara tepat apa','order'=>173],
