            ['start_time'=>40.96,'end_time'=>41.86,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>41.96,'end_time'=>42.36,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Okey, kawan-kawan.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>42.36,'end_time'=>51.9,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re in Vietnam and let\'s describe everything around us with comprehensible input with very clear, natural English.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita berada di Vietnam dan jom kita terangkan semua di sekeliling kita dengan kaedah input mudah faham menggunakan bahasa Inggeris yang sangat jelas dan semula jadi.','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>52,'end_time'=>53.82,'target_text'=>'What are these called right here?','source_text'=>'Benda kat sini ni dipanggil apa?','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>53.92,'end_time'=>56.36,'target_text'=>'What are these called?','source_text'=>'Apa nama benda ni?','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>56.8,'end_time'=>58.66,'target_text'=>'These are stools.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah kerusi bangku.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>58.76,'end_time'=>59.74,'target_text'=>'These are stools.','source_text'=>'Ini kerusi bangku tanpa sandar.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>59.84,'end_time'=>66.46,'target_text'=>'The stools I am used to are about this tall and usually you sit on them when you are at a counter.','source_text'=>'Kerusi bangku yang biasa saya duduk tingginya kira-kira macam ni dan biasanya korang duduk atasnya bila berada di kaunter.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>66.56,'end_time'=>73.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s very common to have stools in bars or in your kitchen around the counter.','source_text'=>'Ia sangat biasa ada di bar atau di dapur korang di sekeliling kaunter pulau.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>73.24,'end_time'=>75.26,'target_text'=>'However, these stools are very short.','source_text'=>'Namun, bangku-bangku kat sini sangat rendah.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>75.36,'end_time'=>79.54,'target_text'=>'You can see how much shorter they are compared to a regular size stool.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak betapa rendahnya ia berbanding bangku saiz biasa.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>79.64,'end_time'=>85.7,'target_text'=>'So, in my experience in Asia, the stools are a lot smaller cuz people just sit very low to the ground.','source_text'=>'Jadi, berdasarkan pengalaman saya di Asia, kerusi bangkunya jauh lebih kecil sebab orang kat sini biasa duduk sangat rendah ke lantai.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>85.8,'end_time'=>88.34,'target_text'=>'They sit very low to the ground.','source_text'=>'Mereka duduk sangat rapat ke paras lantai.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>88.44,'end_time'=>91.58,'target_text'=>'In the West, we do not sit that low to the ground at all.','source_text'=>'Di negara Barat, kami langsung tak duduk serendah macam tu.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>91.68,'end_time'=>99.58,'target_text'=>'So, it is like a little uncomfortable to sit like that for extended periods of time, but it\'s not too bad if I\'m being honest.','source_text'=>'Jadi rasa agak kurang selesa sikit kalau duduk macam tu untuk tempoh yang lama, tapi sejujurnya tak adalah teruk sangat.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>99.68,'end_time'=>106.42,'target_text'=>'So, if you look over here, this is, I guess, what typical area in District 1 looks like in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau korang tengok kat sini, macam nilah agaknya rupa kawasan biasa di Daerah 1 di Vietnam.','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>106.52,'end_time'=>111.86,'target_text'=>'Currently, we are in District 1, which is the most famous district for tourists in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di Daerah 1, iaitu daerah paling terkenal dalam kalangan pelancong di Vietnam.','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>111.96,'end_time'=>114.78,'target_text'=>'You can see many vehicles here, which is surprising.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak banyak kenderaan kat sini, satu perkara yang agak mengejutkan.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>114.88,'end_time'=>120.22,'target_text'=>'Usually, you see a lot more scooters, but inside this area right here, there are just scooters.','source_text'=>'Biasanya korang akan nampak jauh lebih banyak skuter, tapi dalam kawasan ni memang penuh dengan skuter je.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>120.32,'end_time'=>121.82,'target_text'=>'Oh yeah, they just have scooters there.','source_text'=>'Haah, mereka memang ada skuter je kat situ.','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>121.92,'end_time'=>126.62,'target_text'=>'Over here, we have a tree and there are many trees along this road.','source_text'=>'Kat sebelah sini ada sebatang pokok dan ada banyak pokok di sepanjang jalan ni.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>126.72,'end_time'=>132.22,'target_text'=>'And here, we have cardboard boxes that have been opened up and flattened and placed on this cart.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini ada kotak-kotak kadbod yang dah dibuka, diratakan, dan diletakkan di atas kereta tolak ni.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>132.32,'end_time'=>134.46,'target_text'=>'The person that owns this will probably sell it later.','source_text'=>'Orang yang empunya barang ni mungkin akan jual nanti.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>134.56,'end_time'=>137.66,'target_text'=>'But if you go over here, you can see the cafe apartments.','source_text'=>'Tapi kalau korang pergi sebelah sini, korang boleh nampak pangsapuri kafe.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>137.76,'end_time'=>144.1,'target_text'=>'The cafe apartments and we\'re about to go over there and uh check out the view and drink a coffee.','source_text'=>'Pangsapuri kafe, dan kita nak pergi ke sana untuk nikmati pemandangan sambil minum kopi.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>144.2,'end_time'=>145.98,'target_text'=>'This is not our first day in Ho Chi Minh.','source_text'=>'Ini bukan hari pertama kami di Ho Chi Minh.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>146.08,'end_time'=>152.5,'target_text'=>'We\'ve been here for a few days, but this is the first time we\'re filming and uh we\'re just going to explore all the tourist','source_text'=>'Kami dah berada kat sini beberapa hari, tapi ini kali pertama kami merakam dan kami cuma nak terokai semua tempat','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>152.6,'end_time'=>156.06,'target_text'=>'sites and just explore Ho Chi Minh City in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'tumpuan pelancong dan meneroka Bandar Ho Chi Minh di Vietnam.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>156.16,'end_time'=>158.1,'target_text'=>'This is our second time in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Ini kali kedua kami datang ke Vietnam.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>158.2,'end_time'=>160.58,'target_text'=>'The last time I was here was with my younger brother.','source_text'=>'Kali terakhir saya ke sini dulu bersama adik lelaki saya.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>160.68,'end_time'=>161.9,'target_text'=>'That was 3 years ago.','source_text'=>'Itu 3 tahun yang lalu.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>162,'end_time'=>164.62,'target_text'=>'This time I\'m here with my older brother 3 years later.','source_text'=>'Kali ni saya datang dengan abang saya 3 tahun kemudian.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>164.72,'end_time'=>166.62,'target_text'=>'But uh I am excited to be in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya memang teruja dapat berada di Vietnam.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>166.72,'end_time'=>173.74,'target_text'=>'Vietnamese food is some of my favorite food and we have been indulging heavily in that food, haven\'t we?','source_text'=>'Makanan Vietnam adalah antara makanan kegemaran saya dan kami dah melantak puas-puas makanan tu, kan?','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>173.84,'end_time'=>174.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we have.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, memang betul.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>174.6,'end_time'=>177.78,'target_text'=>'We had some good Vietnamese hamburgers last night.','source_text'=>'Malam tadi kita makan burger Vietnam yang sedap.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>177.88,'end_time'=>178.62,'target_text'=>'>> Look up there, dude.','source_text'=>'>> Tengok atas tu, bro.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>178.72,'end_time'=>181.54,'target_text'=>'To me, that looks like uh the Avengers tower.','source_text'=>'Bagi aku, bangunan tu nampak macam menara Avengers.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>181.64,'end_time'=>186.5,'target_text'=>'If you put like an A on it, like the Avengers logo, dude, that would literally look like the Avengers tower.','source_text'=>'Kalau letak huruf A macam logo Avengers kat situ, sumpah nampak sebiji macam menara Avengers.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>186.6,'end_time'=>192.06,'target_text'=>'Anyways, today we\'ll be talking at a normal, natural English pace, but we\'ll be talking clearly.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, hari ini kita akan bercakap pada kelajuan bahasa Inggeris biasa yang semula jadi, tapi dengan sebutan yang jelas.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>192.16,'end_time'=>200.02,'target_text'=>'So, try your best to follow along and shadow and if there are moments you don\'t understand something, just rewind a few seconds.','source_text'=>'Jadi cuba sebaik mungkin untuk ikut dan buat shadowing, dan kalau ada masa korang tak faham, undur je beberapa saat ke belakang.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>200.12,'end_time'=>208.62,'target_text'=>'You can also turn on captions in the corner by clicking the CC button and you can follow along there as well if you want captions.','source_text'=>'Korang juga boleh hidupkan sari kata di penjuru dengan menekan butang CC dan korang boleh ikut dari situ jika mahukan teks.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>208.72,'end_time'=>212.62,'target_text'=>'But anyways, we are walking on the sidewalk here in Ho Chi Minh City.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa pun, sekarang kita tengah berjalan di atas laluan pejalan kaki di Bandar Ho Chi Minh.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>212.72,'end_time'=>217.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s not too hot today, but it still is hot compared to Canada.','source_text'=>'Hari ni taklah terlalu panas, tapi masih panas kalau nak dibandingkan dengan Kanada.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>217.56,'end_time'=>225.62,'target_text'=>'So, I just opened up my weather app and it\'s currently 30° C in Ho Chi Minh City, but it feels like 34°.','source_text'=>'Saya baru buka aplikasi cuaca dan sekarang suhu 30° C di Bandar Ho Chi Minh, tapi rasa berbahang macam 34°.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>225.72,'end_time'=>227.66,'target_text'=>'But it\'s only 11:00 a.m.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang baru pukul 11:00 pagi.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>227.76,'end_time'=>230.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s not the hottest time of day yet.','source_text'=>'Belum sampai waktu paling terik lagi hari ni.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>230.12,'end_time'=>235.34,'target_text'=>'Around noon, 1:00 p.m., 2:00 p.m., That is when it will be the hottest.','source_text'=>'Sekitar tengah hari, pukul 1:00 petang, 2:00 petang, waktu itulah cuaca akan paling membakar.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>235.44,'end_time'=>239.5,'target_text'=>'And today there is a high of 35°, so it will be very hot today.','source_text'=>'Dan hari ni suhu maksimum mencecah 35°, jadi memang akan sangat panas hari ni.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>239.6,'end_time'=>240.62,'target_text'=>'>> What about rain?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana dengan hujan?','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>240.72,'end_time'=>242.46,'target_text'=>'>> Rain, no rain.','source_text'=>'>> Hujan, langsung tak ada hujan.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>242.56,'end_time'=>243.66,'target_text'=>'But it is very sunny.','source_text'=>'Tapi matahari sangat terik.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>243.76,'end_time'=>245.46,'target_text'=>'I wish I brought my umbrella.','source_text'=>'Kalaulah saya bawa payung tadi.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>245.56,'end_time'=>246.54,'target_text'=>'I low-key need it.','source_text'=>'Memang betul-betul perlukan payung sekarang ni.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>246.64,'end_time'=>248.18,'target_text'=>'Look at the sidewalk here.','source_text'=>'Tengok kaki lima jalan ni.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>248.28,'end_time'=>250.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s very stained, eh?','source_text'=>'Penuh dengan kotoran bertompok, kan?','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>250.28,'end_time'=>250.68,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Ya.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>250.76,'end_time'=>252.06,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s very, very stained.','source_text'=>'>> Banyak sangat tompokan kotoran.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>252.16,'end_time'=>253.98,'target_text'=>'It\'s like stained like black almost.','source_text'=>'Kotoran dia dah bertukar jadi hitam legam.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>254.08,'end_time'=>255.26,'target_text'=>'I wonder what that is.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya kotoran apa tu.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>255.36,'end_time'=>256.54,'target_text'=>'Do you have any guesses?','source_text'=>'Kau ada tekaan tak?','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>256.64,'end_time'=>257.9,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Sejujurnya aku tak tahu.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>258,'end_time'=>259.26,'target_text'=>'>> Like it\'s not sticky.','source_text'=>'>> Macam tak melekit pun.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>259.36,'end_time'=>261.14,'target_text'=>'>> I think it\'s from food.','source_text'=>'>> Aku rasa daripada sisa makanan.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>261.24,'end_time'=>262.78,'target_text'=>'Like cooking oil maybe.','source_text'=>'Macam minyak masak mungkin.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>262.88,'end_time'=>263.54,'target_text'=>'>> Oil?','source_text'=>'>> Minyak?','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>263.64,'end_time'=>263.8,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Haah.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>263.8,'end_time'=>264.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, okay, oil.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, betul, minyak.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>264.8,'end_time'=>266.02,'target_text'=>'Cuz it\'s kind of like darker.','source_text'=>'Sebab warna dia nampak gelap sikit.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>266.12,'end_time'=>268.22,'target_text'=>'And that\'s what oil looks when it stains something.','source_text'=>'Dan macam tulah rupa minyak bila terkena dan meninggalkan kesan tompok.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>268.32,'end_time'=>272.72,'target_text'=>'Anyways, can you guys tell me why this wall is here?','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, boleh tak korang bagi tahu saya kenapa dinding penghadang ni diletakkan kat sini?','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>273.84,'end_time'=>280.9,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and go deeper than the video, then get the workbook on my website, volkaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Jika anda ingin belajar lebih cepat dan mendalam, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>281,'end_time'=>289.86,'target_text'=>'The workbook explains everything in greater detail and comes with exercises to help you learn new vocabulary, grammar, tenses,','source_text'=>'Buku latihan menerangkan segala-galanya dengan lebih terperinci berserta latihan untuk bantu anda pelajari kosa kata baharu, tatabahasa, bentuk masa,','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>289.96,'end_time'=>295.58,'target_text'=>'sentence patterns, comprehension, and real English you can actually use.','source_text'=>'pola ayat, kefahaman, dan bahasa Inggeris sebenar yang boleh anda gunakan.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>295.68,'end_time'=>301.98,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos, so you can keep practicing and improving every lesson.','source_text'=>'Saya juga ada buku latihan untuk video terdahulu supaya anda boleh terus berlatih dan berkembang setiap sesi.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>302.08,'end_time'=>305.02,'target_text'=>'Click the link in my description to get the workbooks.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruang keterangan untuk dapatkan buku latihan.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>305.12,'end_time'=>309.06,'target_text'=>'This wall is to hide the construction on the other side.','source_text'=>'Dinding penghadang ni dibina untuk menutup kerja-kerja pembinaan di sebalik sana.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>309.16,'end_time'=>314.94,'target_text'=>'So, currently they are probably building something on the other side of this, and they put this wall here to hide it.','source_text'=>'Jadi buat masa ni mereka mungkin sedang membina sesuatu di sebalik ni, dan mereka pasang dinding ni untuk lindunginya.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>315.04,'end_time'=>319.9,'target_text'=>'I guess this is what they\'re building, a mall with a pool, a like a rooftop pool.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa inilah yang mereka tengah bina, pusat beli-belah dengan kolam renang, macam kolam di atas bumbung.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>320,'end_time'=>321.02,'target_text'=>'That\'s what they\'re building here.','source_text'=>'Itulah yang mereka bina di sini.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>321.12,'end_time'=>324.26,'target_text'=>'But I do really like the vibe in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya memang suka suasana di Vietnam.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>324.36,'end_time'=>325.06,'target_text'=>'I love it.','source_text'=>'Saya sangat sukakannya.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>325.16,'end_time'=>325.56,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice.','source_text'=>'Memang best.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>325.6,'end_time'=>326.42,'target_text'=>'Like look, just look.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah, lihat sendiri.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>326.52,'end_time'=>328.18,'target_text'=>'I just like looking out at stuff.','source_text'=>'Saya suka perhatikan suasana sekeliling.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>328.28,'end_time'=>332.82,'target_text'=>'Although, I will say one thing, there is a lot of noise pollution.','source_text'=>'Walaupun begitu, satu perkara yang saya nak sebut, kat sini banyak sangat pencemaran bunyi.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>332.92,'end_time'=>339.42,'target_text'=>'Noise pollution is a term that refers to honking, like you hear all that honking, the sounds of vehicles, the sound of people','source_text'=>'Pencemaran bunyi adalah istilah bagi bunyi hon bertalu-talu, bunyi deruman kenderaan, dan bunyi bising orang','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>339.52,'end_time'=>341.14,'target_text'=>'working, noise pollution.','source_text'=>'bekerja, itulah pencemaran bunyi.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>341.24,'end_time'=>344.26,'target_text'=>'There is a lot of noise pollution that you have to get used to.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak pencemaran bunyi yang korang kena biasakan diri.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>344.36,'end_time'=>347.18,'target_text'=>'And in Vietnam, people park their scooters everywhere.','source_text'=>'Dan di Vietnam, orang letak skuter mereka merata-rata tempat.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>347.28,'end_time'=>349.5,'target_text'=>'All along the sidewalks you\'ll see scooters parked.','source_text'=>'Sepanjang laluan pejalan kaki korang akan nampak skuter diparkir.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>349.6,'end_time'=>350.18,'target_text'=>'Like look at this.','source_text'=>'Macam tengok yang ni.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>350.28,'end_time'=>353.42,'target_text'=>'Everywhere you look there are scooters parked.','source_text'=>'Ke mana saja korang pandang, mesti ada skuter diparkir.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>353.52,'end_time'=>358.02,'target_text'=>'Isn\'t there a stat that there are more scooters than people in Vietnam?','source_text'=>'Bukan ke ada statistik kata jumlah skuter lebih banyak daripada orang di Vietnam?','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>358.12,'end_time'=>360.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s like two to one or something.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, rasanya nisbah dua skuter bagi seorang penduduk atau macam tu lah.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>360.12,'end_time'=>361.46,'target_text'=>'>> We should low-key eat something, eh?','source_text'=>'>> Rasa macam nak cari makan sikitlah, kan?','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>361.56,'end_time'=>361.96,'target_text'=>'You hungry?','source_text'=>'Kau lapar ke?','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>362.04,'end_time'=>364.22,'target_text'=>'>> I thought I thought you said you weren\'t hungry today.','source_text'=>'>> Aku ingatkan kau kata kau tak lapar hari ni.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>364.32,'end_time'=>365.58,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh, I\'m hungry every day.','source_text'=>'>> Ooh, aku setiap hari pun lapar.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>365.68,'end_time'=>366.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m not hungry for dinner though.','source_text'=>'Tapi bukan lapar nak makan malamlah.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>367,'end_time'=>368.82,'target_text'=>'>> anything good along this street.','source_text'=>'>> apa-apa yang sedap sepanjang jalan ni.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>368.92,'end_time'=>371.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, if we see something good we\'ll definitely stop by.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, kalau kita nampak sesuatu yang sedap kita mesti singgah.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>371.52,'end_time'=>374.26,'target_text'=>'>> What about the Sony Fujifilm Nikon Canon store?','source_text'=>'>> Macam mana dengan kedai Sony, Fujifilm, Nikon, Canon tu?','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>374.36,'end_time'=>375.82,'target_text'=>'Oh, I think this whole street is cameras.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya rasa seluruh deretan jalan ni kedai kamera.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>375.92,'end_time'=>377.06,'target_text'=>'>> What do you think they sell there?','source_text'=>'>> Kau rasa apa yang mereka jual kat situ?','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>377.16,'end_time'=>380.3,'target_text'=>'>> I think they sell Canon, Nikon, Fujifilm, and Sony.','source_text'=>'>> Aku rasa mereka jual Canon, Nikon, Fujifilm, dan Sony.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>380.4,'end_time'=>381.38,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm, are you sure?','source_text'=>'>> Mhm, kau pasti ke?','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>381.48,'end_time'=>382.58,'target_text'=>'What makes you say that?','source_text'=>'Apa yang buat kau cakap macam tu?','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>382.68,'end_time'=>383.04,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'>> Entahlah.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>383.04,'end_time'=>383.98,'target_text'=>'I just got a hunch.','source_text'=>'Aku cuma ada firasat je.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>384.08,'end_time'=>384.7,'target_text'=>'>> A hunch.','source_text'=>'>> Firasat ya.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>384.8,'end_time'=>386.7,'target_text'=>'He has a hunch that they sell cameras.','source_text'=>'Dia ada firasat yang kedai tu jual kamera.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>386.8,'end_time'=>387.2,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>387.24,'end_time'=>388.58,'target_text'=>'I would bet they don\'t.','source_text'=>'Aku berani bertaruh mereka tak jual.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>388.68,'end_time'=>391.54,'target_text'=>'If I bet you $100 they don\'t, would you take that bet?','source_text'=>'Kalau aku bertaruh 100 dolar yang mereka tak jual, kau sanggup sahut pertaruhan tu?','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>391.64,'end_time'=>393.02,'target_text'=>'>> I would take that bet.','source_text'=>'>> Aku sahut pertaruhan tu.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>393.12,'end_time'=>394.06,'target_text'=>'>> You would?','source_text'=>'>> Kau sanggup?','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>394.16,'end_time'=>395.26,'target_text'=>'>> I would.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, sanggup.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>395.36,'end_time'=>396.38,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh, confidence.','source_text'=>'>> Wah, yakin betul.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>396.48,'end_time'=>401.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we are now at 7-Eleven and we just came here to get something to drink since it\'s so hot out.','source_text'=>'Okey, sekarang kita ada di 7-Eleven dan kami singgah sini semata-mata nak beli minuman sebab cuaca panas sangat kat luar.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>402.08,'end_time'=>406.58,'target_text'=>'And to also cool down cuz these stores are always cool cuz they have the AC running.','source_text'=>'Dan juga untuk sejukkan badan sebab kedai macam ni sentiasa sejuk dengan penyaman udara.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>406.68,'end_time'=>408.66,'target_text'=>'But I think I\'ll get a Pocari Sweat.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa saya nak beli Pocari Sweat.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>408.76,'end_time'=>410.14,'target_text'=>'I think electrolytes are good.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa minuman elektrolit bagus untuk badan.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>410.24,'end_time'=>411.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s just kind of small though.','source_text'=>'Cuma botol dia agak kecil sikit.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>411.56,'end_time'=>413.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s like really >> Do you think these are good?','source_text'=>'Botol dia memang betul-betul >> Kau rasa air ni sedap tak?','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>413.8,'end_time'=>415.62,'target_text'=>'>> Those are electrolytes, too.','source_text'=>'>> Yang tu pun ada elektrolit juga.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>415.72,'end_time'=>417.62,'target_text'=>'>> Is it Revive zero calorie?','source_text'=>'>> Air Revive tanpa kalori ke tu?','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>417.72,'end_time'=>421.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, I\'ll get two of these then and then we\'ll get a third one.','source_text'=>'Okey, kalau macam tu saya ambil dua botol yang ni dan kita tambah sebotol lagi.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>421.12,'end_time'=>422.18,'target_text'=>'Hopefully these taste good.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap rasa dia sedap.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>422.28,'end_time'=>426.38,'target_text'=>'As you guys know, I love trees and this is a really cool tree.','source_text'=>'Macam yang korang tahu, saya memang suka pokok dan pokok ni sangat menarik.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>426.48,'end_time'=>429.3,'target_text'=>'This is low-key a perfect tree for an urban area, is it not?','source_text'=>'Pokok macam ni memang sangat sesuai untuk kawasan bandar, kan?','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>429.4,'end_time'=>430.9,'target_text'=>'Because it gives you shade.','source_text'=>'Sebab ia memberi teduhan.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>431,'end_time'=>432.98,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m pretty sure this is called the shade tree.','source_text'=>'>> Aku cukup yakin pokok ni dipanggil pokok teduhan.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>433.08,'end_time'=>433.62,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, really?','source_text'=>'>> Oh, ya ke?','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>433.72,'end_time'=>436.66,'target_text'=>'Cuz this is literally like an umbrella, a natural umbrella.','source_text'=>'Sebab pokok ni memang sebiji macam payung, payung semula jadi.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>436.76,'end_time'=>442.66,'target_text'=>'And here you can see the tree is supported by this metal so that it grows straight directly upwards.','source_text'=>'Dan kat sini korang boleh nampak pokok ni disokong dengan kerangka besi supaya ia tumbuh tegak lurus ke atas.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>442.76,'end_time'=>445.1,'target_text'=>'So this is used as support and it\'s actually quite nice.','source_text'=>'Jadi besi ni digunakan sebagai sokongan dan ia nampak sangat kemas.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>445.2,'end_time'=>447.38,'target_text'=>'It has a bed around the tree trunk.','source_text'=>'Ada batas tanah di sekeliling pangkal batang pokok.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>447.48,'end_time'=>447.88,'target_text'=>'Quite nice.','source_text'=>'Boleh tahan cantik.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>447.88,'end_time'=>449.46,'target_text'=>'They should put flowers in here though.','source_text'=>'Tapi mereka patut tanam bunga kat dalam ni.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>449.56,'end_time'=>453.7,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if they planted these or these are just natural, but they should put flowers.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu sama ada mereka yang tanam atau ia tumbuh sendiri, tapi mereka patut tanam pokok bunga.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>453.8,'end_time'=>456.66,'target_text'=>'Maybe during spring there are flowers.','source_text'=>'Mungkin waktu musim bunga nanti ada bunga kembang.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>456.76,'end_time'=>457.26,'target_text'=>'Maybe.','source_text'=>'Mungkin juga.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>457.36,'end_time'=>458.66,'target_text'=>'Anyways, let\'s keep going.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, jom kita teruskan perjalanan.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>458.76,'end_time'=>466.86,'target_text'=>'Okay guys, for this next part I\'m going to put a full paragraph of text on screen and I want you guys to shadow me as I read','source_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan, untuk bahagian seterusnya saya akan paparkan satu perenggan penuh teks di skrin dan saya nak korang buat \'shadowing\' ikut bacaan saya','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>466.96,'end_time'=>467.36,'target_text'=>'this.','source_text'=>'bila saya baca teks ni.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>467.44,'end_time'=>471.22,'target_text'=>'I really, really want you to focus on pronunciation in this part.','source_text'=>'Saya betul-betul nak korang fokus pada sebutan dalam bahagian ini.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>471.32,'end_time'=>475.86,'target_text'=>'That is the number one focus, pronunciation and accent.','source_text'=>'Itulah fokus utama nombor satu, sebutan dan aksen.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>475.96,'end_time'=>478.94,'target_text'=>'This is a modern street in the city.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah sebatang jalan raya moden di bandar.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>479.04,'end_time'=>484.3,'target_text'=>'There are many tall buildings here and the area looks clean, bright, and busy.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak bangunan tinggi di sini dan kawasannya nampak bersih, cerah, serta sibuk.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>484.4,'end_time'=>490.14,'target_text'=>'In the middle, there is a narrow building with many cafes, restaurants, and signs on it.','source_text'=>'Di bahagian tengah, terdapat sebuah bangunan sempit dengan deretan kafe, restoran, dan papan tanda.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>490.24,'end_time'=>494.5,'target_text'=>'Around it, there are large glass buildings that look very modern.','source_text'=>'Di sekelilingnya, terdapat bangunan kaca besar yang kelihatan sangat moden.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>494.6,'end_time'=>498.7,'target_text'=>'The sky is clear and blue and the weather looks hot and sunny.','source_text'=>'Langit cerah membiru dan cuaca nampak panas terik.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>498.8,'end_time'=>502.18,'target_text'=>'On the road, I can see a few cars and motorbikes.','source_text'=>'Di atas jalan raya, saya dapat lihat beberapa buah kereta dan motosikal.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>502.28,'end_time'=>507.06,'target_text'=>'There are also some trees which make the street look more relaxing.','source_text'=>'Terdapat juga pepohon yang menjadikan jalan ini kelihatan lebih mendamaikan.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>507.16,'end_time'=>511.26,'target_text'=>'This place feels lively, urban, and interesting.','source_text'=>'Tempat ini terasa meriah, moden seperti kota metropolitan, dan menarik.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>511.36,'end_time'=>517.48,'target_text'=>'I like this scene because it shows a mix of modern city life and local character.','source_text'=>'Saya suka pemandangan ini kerana ia memaparkan gabungan antara kehidupan bandar moden dan ciri-ciri tempatan.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>517.6,'end_time'=>521.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, what did you guys think of that pronunciation and accent training?','source_text'=>'Okey, apa pendapat korang tentang latihan sebutan dan aksen tadi?','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>521.32,'end_time'=>522.22,'target_text'=>'Was that helpful?','source_text'=>'Bermanfaat tak?','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>522.32,'end_time'=>525.94,'target_text'=>'You want to see more of that in my videos or was it not helpful?','source_text'=>'Korang nak tengok lagi latihan macam tu dalam video saya atau rasa macam tak membantu sangat?','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>526.04,'end_time'=>527.34,'target_text'=>'Let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Beri tahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>527.44,'end_time'=>529.74,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s go visit the cafe apartments.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita pergi melawat pangsapuri kafe.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>529.84,'end_time'=>536.5,'target_text'=>'We\'ll try to go up as high as we can and get a nice view cuz I want to sit on the balcony so we could just look out at uh','source_text'=>'Kita akan cuba naik setinggi yang boleh untuk nikmati pemandangan indah sebab saya nak duduk di balkoni sambil menikmati pemandangan','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>536.6,'end_time'=>539.66,'target_text'=>'Ho Chi Minh City or some people call it Saigon.','source_text'=>'Bandar Ho Chi Minh atau sesetengah orang panggil Saigon.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>539.76,'end_time'=>540.34,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pergi.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>540.44,'end_time'=>545.62,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, we have made it to one of the main squares here in Ho Chi Minh.','source_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan, kita dah sampai ke salah satu dataran utama di Ho Chi Minh.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>545.72,'end_time'=>550.34,'target_text'=>'I think this is the most famous place to come in Saigon.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini tempat paling terkenal untuk dikunjungi di Saigon.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>550.44,'end_time'=>557.64,'target_text'=>'It\'s a square like a big rectangle walkway but you can see it\'s just huge from all the way down there.','source_text'=>'Ia sebuah dataran berbentuk laluan pejalan kaki segi empat tepat yang besar tapi korang boleh nampak ia sangat luas dari hujung sana.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>558.8,'end_time'=>560.66,'target_text'=>'All the way up there.','source_text'=>'Sampai ke hujung atas sana.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>560.76,'end_time'=>563.02,'target_text'=>'And at the end is the palace, right?','source_text'=>'Dan di penghujungnya ialah istana, kan?','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>563.12,'end_time'=>564.26,'target_text'=>'Independence Palace.','source_text'=>'Istana Kemerdekaan (Independence Palace).','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>564.36,'end_time'=>569.3,'target_text'=>'>> of reminds me of that walkway in Busan that goes all the way through the ocean.','source_text'=>'>> mengingatkan aku pada laluan pejalan kaki di Busan yang terus menuju ke laut.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>569.4,'end_time'=>571.2,'target_text'=>'>> Haeundae','source_text'=>'>> Haeundae','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>571.56,'end_time'=>573.7,'target_text'=>'Haeundae, something beach, something like that.','source_text'=>'Pantai Haeundae ke apa, macam tu lah rasanya.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>573.8,'end_time'=>574.86,'target_text'=>'Something like that.','source_text'=>'Lebih kurang macam tu lah.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>574.96,'end_time'=>576.22,'target_text'=>'>> in Busan.','source_text'=>'>> di Busan.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>576.32,'end_time'=>582.42,'target_text'=>'>> In Busan, yeah, there\'s a big, big like I mean that cars can still drive just like this, but it\'s like a big walkway like','source_text'=>'>> Di Busan, haah, ada laluan yang besar maksud saya kereta masih boleh lalu macam ni, tapi ada laluan pejalan kaki luas macam','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>582.52,'end_time'=>584.5,'target_text'=>'this heading to the beach in Busan.','source_text'=>'ni yang menghala terus ke pantai di Busan.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>584.6,'end_time'=>585.46,'target_text'=>'It is actually similar.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya memang serupa.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>585.56,'end_time'=>587.22,'target_text'=>'It does give similar vibes.','source_text'=>'Suasana dia memang lebih kurang sama.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>587.32,'end_time'=>591.6,'target_text'=>'But to my left, you can see the cafe apartments.','source_text'=>'Tapi di sebelah kiri saya, korang boleh nampak pangsapuri kafe.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>591.84,'end_time'=>601.5,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95% of everyday English.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan bahasa Inggeris paling kerap digunakan saya dan pelajari perkataan yang akan bantu anda faham hingga 95% perbualan harian.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>601.6,'end_time'=>611.86,'target_text'=>'It includes real definitions, real example sentences for every meaning, and everything is organized by CEFR level and topic.','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi definisi sebenar, contoh ayat untuk setiap makna, dan semuanya disusun mengikut tahap CEFR serta topik.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>611.96,'end_time'=>614.02,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruang keterangan untuk dapatkannya.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>614.12,'end_time'=>617.22,'target_text'=>'How would you describe those cafe apartments?','source_text'=>'Macam mana kau nak gambarkan pangsapuri kafe tu?','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>617.32,'end_time'=>621.98,'target_text'=>'>> The building feels a lot bigger in person than it does in pictures.','source_text'=>'>> Bangunan tu rasa jauh lebih besar bila tengok depan mata berbanding dalam gambar.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>622.08,'end_time'=>624.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, in pictures it definitely looks smaller, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'>> Haah, dalam gambar nampak lebih kecil kan?','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>624.72,'end_time'=>631.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it feels a lot more grand and we could probably easily calculate how many different stores there are in there, right?','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia kelihatan lebih gah dan kita boleh kira dengan mudah berapa banyak kedai berbeza dalam tu, kan?','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>631.96,'end_time'=>632.86,'target_text'=>'Just by counting.','source_text'=>'Cuma dengan mengira je.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>632.96,'end_time'=>633.04,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'>> Haah.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>633.04,'end_time'=>634.42,'target_text'=>'But good thing we won\'t do that.','source_text'=>'Tapi nasib baik kita tak buat kerja mengira tu.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>634.52,'end_time'=>640.3,'target_text'=>'But I really do love like all the signs and especially at night, I\'m pretty sure it\'s all like lit up.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya memang suka deretan papan tanda tu terutamanya waktu malam, saya pasti semuanya bergemerlapan berlampu.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>640.4,'end_time'=>642.94,'target_text'=>'So it looks super good, honestly.','source_text'=>'Jadi sejujurnya nampak sangat cantik.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>643.04,'end_time'=>645.82,'target_text'=>'>> I recognize that percentage sign.','source_text'=>'>> Aku cam simbol peratus tu.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>645.92,'end_time'=>647.26,'target_text'=>'That\'s for >> That\'s Arabica.','source_text'=>'Itu untuk >> Itu kopi Arabica.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>647.36,'end_time'=>648.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that\'s Arabica.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, itu Arabica.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>648.44,'end_time'=>651.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s a really popular coffee coffee chain.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, itu rangkaian kedai kopi yang sangat popular.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>651.2,'end_time'=>651.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>651.84,'end_time'=>653.98,'target_text'=>'>> I thought Arabica was like a type of coffee.','source_text'=>'>> Aku ingatkan Arabica tu jenis biji kopi.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>654.08,'end_time'=>658.26,'target_text'=>'>> No, Arabica is also a chain cuz there are some in Kuala Lumpur, Arabica.','source_text'=>'>> Tak, Arabica pun nama jenama kafe sebab kat Kuala Lumpur pun ada cawangan Arabica.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>658.36,'end_time'=>660.74,'target_text'=>'Arabica percentage, that\'s that\'s what it\'s called.','source_text'=>'Arabica simbol peratus, itulah nama jenama dia.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>660.84,'end_time'=>664.66,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys, now how would you describe this area we\'re standing on?','source_text'=>'Okey kawan-kawan, sekarang macam mana korang nak terangkan kawasan tempat kita berdiri ni?','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>664.76,'end_time'=>665.66,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this?','source_text'=>'Macam mana korang nak gambarkan tempat ni?','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>665.76,'end_time'=>670.36,'target_text'=>'Give me three words in the comments to describe this area.','source_text'=>'Berikan saya tiga patah perkataan di ruangan komen untuk gambarkan kawasan ini.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>675.2,'end_time'=>681.5,'target_text'=>'So, if I were to describe this area, the place we\'re standing on, I would say it\'s not very busy and not crowded.','source_text'=>'Jadi kalau saya nak gambarkan kawasan tempat kami berdiri ni, saya akan kata ia tak terlalu sibuk dan tidak sesak.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>681.6,'end_time'=>683.62,'target_text'=>'Usually it\'s a quite crowded.','source_text'=>'Biasanya tempat ni agak sesak.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>683.72,'end_time'=>688.02,'target_text'=>'We came here at night yesterday and the day before and this place was really crowded.','source_text'=>'Kami datang sini waktu malam semalam dan kelmarin, tempat ni memang tersangat padat dengan orang.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>688.12,'end_time'=>689.74,'target_text'=>'There were so many people.','source_text'=>'Ramai gila orang.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>689.84,'end_time'=>691.02,'target_text'=>'But now it\'s kind of quiet.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang agak sunyi dan lengang.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>691.12,'end_time'=>692.98,'target_text'=>'I think it\'s cuz it\'s almost noon.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sebab dah hampir tengah hari.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>693.08,'end_time'=>694.1,'target_text'=>'People are at work.','source_text'=>'Orang tengah sibuk bekerja.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>694.2,'end_time'=>697.42,'target_text'=>'People are at home and it is the hottest time of day, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Orang duduk dalam rumah dan sekarang waktu paling panas membakar, kan?','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>697.52,'end_time'=>703.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s way too hot to be enjoying >> Yeah, like the the sun is almost at its peak.','source_text'=>'>> Haah, terlalu panas untuk bersiar-siar >> Ya, matahari dah hampir tegak di atas kepala.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>703.28,'end_time'=>704.86,'target_text'=>'So it\'s just cooking out here, dude.','source_text'=>'Memang macam terpanggang kat luar ni, bro.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>704.96,'end_time'=>705.42,'target_text'=>'We\'re boiling.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam mendidih.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>705.52,'end_time'=>707.06,'target_text'=>'>> But it does get nice at night.','source_text'=>'>> Tapi bila waktu malam memang seronok.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>707.16,'end_time'=>708.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice to go out.','source_text'=>'Best bila keluar jalan-jalan.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>708.44,'end_time'=>710.46,'target_text'=>'>> At night >> The weather is more comfortable at night.','source_text'=>'>> Waktu malam >> Cuaca lebih selesa dan nyaman waktu malam.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>710.56,'end_time'=>713.5,'target_text'=>'>> No, the weather is a lot more bearable at night.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, cuaca jauh lebih redup dan boleh tahan waktu malam.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>713.6,'end_time'=>715.86,'target_text'=>'So that\'s one word, not crowded and not busy.','source_text'=>'Jadi itu satu huraian, tak sesak dan tak sibuk.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>715.96,'end_time'=>717.86,'target_text'=>'We\'ll put that in the same department.','source_text'=>'Kita gabungkan dalam satu kategori.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>717.96,'end_time'=>718.42,'target_text'=>'Two more.','source_text'=>'Lagi dua perkataan.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>718.52,'end_time'=>721.86,'target_text'=>'The second word I would use to describe this is just big.','source_text'=>'Perkataan kedua yang saya nak guna untuk gambarkan ialah luas.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>721.96,'end_time'=>723.42,'target_text'=>'And the third, flat.','source_text'=>'Dan yang ketiga, rata.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>723.52,'end_time'=>726.78,'target_text'=>'Very simple words, but it\'s big, it\'s flat, and it\'s not crowded.','source_text'=>'Perkataan yang ringkas, tapi memang ia luas, rata, dan tak sesak.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>726.88,'end_time'=>735.3,'target_text'=>'But one thing I do really like about this is uh I like the row of trees on each side of this square, this rectangle thing.','source_text'=>'Tapi satu benda yang saya betul-betul suka kat sini ialah barisan pepohon di setiap sisi dataran segi empat tepat ni.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>735.4,'end_time'=>737.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s super super nice, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Memang sangat-sangat cantik, kan?','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>737.4,'end_time'=>739.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s really pleasing to the eyes.','source_text'=>'>> Ya, memang sedap mata memandang.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>740,'end_time'=>745.78,'target_text'=>'>> Let\'s walk down here, I think towards Independence Palace, and then let\'s walk back and finish off the video at the Cafe','source_text'=>'>> Jom kita jalan ke sana, rasanya menghala ke Istana Kemerdekaan, lepas tu kita patah balik dan tamatkan video di Pangsapuri','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>745.88,'end_time'=>746.38,'target_text'=>'Apartment.','source_text'=>'Kafe.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>746.48,'end_time'=>750.86,'target_text'=>'So you guys, if you want to see the view from up there and also see us drink our first egg coffee.','source_text'=>'Jadi untuk korang, kalau nak tengok pemandangan dari atas sana dan tonton kami rasa kopi telur buat kali pertama.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>750.96,'end_time'=>752.38,'target_text'=>'I haven\'t had an egg coffee yet.','source_text'=>'Saya belum pernah cuba kopi telur lagi.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>752.48,'end_time'=>752.98,'target_text'=>'>> Me either.','source_text'=>'>> Aku pun belum pernah cuba lagi.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>753.08,'end_time'=>755.46,'target_text'=>'>> We\'ll do that uh at the end of the video, so stick around.','source_text'=>'>> Kita akan buat macam tu kat hujung video nanti, jadi teruskan menonton.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>755.56,'end_time'=>757.58,'target_text'=>'But I\'m pretty sure that\'s the Independence Palace.','source_text'=>'Tapi aku cukup pasti bangunan tu ialah Istana Kemerdekaan.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>757.68,'end_time'=>759.46,'target_text'=>'I will just double-check myself first.','source_text'=>'Biar saya semak semula dulu untuk kepastian.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>759.56,'end_time'=>761.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t want to give you guys false information.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak beri maklumat yang salah kepada korang.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>762.04,'end_time'=>764.94,'target_text'=>'Oh, but there is a statue of Ho Chi Minh down there.','source_text'=>'Oh, tapi ada tugu patung Ho Chi Minh kat hujung sana.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>765.04,'end_time'=>767.58,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you can see it on camera, but Ho Chi Minh is down there.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti kalau korang boleh nampak dalam kamera, tapi tugu Ho Chi Minh ada kat bawah sana.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>767.68,'end_time'=>770.26,'target_text'=>'So that is who this city is named after.','source_text'=>'Jadi sempena nama beliaulah bandar ini dinamakan.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>770.36,'end_time'=>773.74,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we have a quick fact I want to read to everyone.','source_text'=>'Okey, ada satu fakta ringkas yang saya nak bacakan untuk semua.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>773.84,'end_time'=>778.78,'target_text'=>'If you\'re Vietnamese, you\'ll obviously know this, but I\'ll read it for everyone else that doesn\'t know.','source_text'=>'Kalau korang orang Vietnam, korang mesti dah tahu, tapi saya bacakan untuk orang lain yang belum tahu.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>778.88,'end_time'=>782.7,'target_text'=>'So Ho Chi Minh City was renamed from Saigon to Ho Chi Minh City.','source_text'=>'Jadi Bandar Ho Chi Minh asalnya dinamakan semula daripada Saigon kepada Bandar Ho Chi Minh.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>782.8,'end_time'=>784.5,'target_text'=>'That\'s why some people still call it Saigon.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu ada orang masih panggil bandar ni Saigon.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>784.6,'end_time'=>787.78,'target_text'=>'Even right there that says Royal Hotel Saigon.','source_text'=>'Malah kat situ pun ada tertulis Hotel Royal Saigon.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>787.88,'end_time'=>797.02,'target_text'=>'It was renamed to Ho Chi Minh City in 1976 to honor the late communist revolutionary leader and first president of North Vietnam,','source_text'=>'Ia dinamakan semula sebagai Bandar Ho Chi Minh pada tahun 1976 bagi memperingati mendiang pemimpin revolusi komunis dan presiden pertama Vietnam Utara,','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>797.12,'end_time'=>797.7,'target_text'=>'Ho Chi Minh.','source_text'=>'iaitu Ho Chi Minh.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>797.8,'end_time'=>800.34,'target_text'=>'So it\'s named after this person in front of us.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia dinamakan sempena tokoh di hadapan kita ni.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>800.44,'end_time'=>801.66,'target_text'=>'You can see the statue of him.','source_text'=>'Korang boleh nampak tugu patung beliau.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>801.76,'end_time'=>803.78,'target_text'=>'So yeah, that\'s why it\'s named this.','source_text'=>'Jadi itulah sebabnya ia diberi nama begini.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>803.88,'end_time'=>806.34,'target_text'=>'>> Have you been to his mausoleum in Hanoi?','source_text'=>'>> Kau pernah pergi ke makam beliau di Hanoi?','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>806.44,'end_time'=>807.06,'target_text'=>'>> No, I haven\'t.','source_text'=>'>> Belum, saya belum pernah pergi.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>807.16,'end_time'=>807.74,'target_text'=>'Have you been?','source_text'=>'Kau dah pernah pergi ke?','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>807.84,'end_time'=>809.7,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s like a big >> Is it nice?','source_text'=>'>> Haah, tempat tu macam kawasan luas >> Cantik tak?','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>809.8,'end_time'=>816.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s a big garden area and park area and there\'s me couple museums there and then there\'s a big building made out','source_text'=>'>> Ya, ia kawasan taman yang sangat luas, ada beberapa muzium kat situ, dan ada sebuah bangunan batu yang besar','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>816.52,'end_time'=>818.3,'target_text'=>'of stone that\'s his mausoleum.','source_text'=>'yang merupakan bangunan makam beliau.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>818.4,'end_time'=>822.14,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ve never been there, but we are going to be going to Hanoi, so I think we\'ll go visit that.','source_text'=>'>> Saya tak pernah ke sana, tapi kami akan pergi ke Hanoi nanti, jadi saya rasa kami akan melawat tempat tu.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>822.24,'end_time'=>827.92,'target_text'=>'But something else I really want to do is go on this double decker bus.','source_text'=>'Tapi ada satu lagi aktiviti yang saya teringin sangat nak buat iaitu naik bas dua tingkat ni.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>828.6,'end_time'=>834.58,'target_text'=>'I really want to go on that double decker bus at night though because at night the whole city lights up and then it\'s just','source_text'=>'Saya teringin sangat naik bas dua tingkat tu waktu malam sebab bila malam seluruh bandar akan bercahaya dan suasananya sangat','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>834.68,'end_time'=>840.82,'target_text'=>'beautiful to go around and it\'s not too hot, so you can sit on top and not burn to a crisp cuz I don\'t know if you guys can','source_text'=>'indah untuk bersiar-siar sambil cuaca pun tak panas, jadi korang boleh duduk di tingkat atas tanpa kulit terbakar rentung sebab saya tak tahu kalau korang boleh','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>840.92,'end_time'=>843.34,'target_text'=>'tell, but my face has gotten more tan.','source_text'=>'perasan, tapi muka saya dah makin gelap berjemur.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>843.44,'end_time'=>849.1,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you can tell on camera though, but I have gotten more tan and my arms too, so I need to wear long clothes','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti kalau nampak jelas dalam kamera, tapi kulit saya makin gelap dan lengan saya pun sama, jadi saya kena pakai baju lengan panjang','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>849.2,'end_time'=>850.06,'target_text'=>'so I don\'t burn.','source_text'=>'supaya kulit tak terbakar sinar matahari.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>850.16,'end_time'=>853.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and then you could get skin cancer and stuff like that too, right?','source_text'=>'>> Betul, nanti boleh dapat kanser kulit dan sebagainya juga kan?','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>853.72,'end_time'=>855.7,'target_text'=>'>> already burned a lot when I was younger.','source_text'=>'>> dah banyak kali kulit terbakar matahari masa zaman muda dulu.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>855.8,'end_time'=>862.62,'target_text'=>'Now that I\'m older, I want to be, you know, more conscious of my health and body since I\'m not young anymore.','source_text'=>'Bila dah makin berusia ni, saya nak lebih peka tentang kesihatan tubuh badan sebab kita dah bukan muda lagi.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>862.72,'end_time'=>870.02,'target_text'=>'Okay, so to get to the Ho Chi Minh statue and that palace, we can\'t go through this roundabout since roundabouts are only','source_text'=>'Okey, untuk sampai ke tugu Ho Chi Minh dan istana tu, kita tak boleh melintas ikut bulatan jalan ni sebab bulatan jalan hanya','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>870.12,'end_time'=>870.74,'target_text'=>'for vehicles.','source_text'=>'untuk kenderaan.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>870.84,'end_time'=>875.34,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to have to cross this crosswalk and then that one and then that one and then that one.','source_text'=>'Kita kena lintas lintasan pejalan kaki yang ni, lepas tu yang sana, lepas tu yang itu, dan kemudian yang sebelah sana pula.','order'=>282],
