            ['start_time'=>1107.88,'end_time'=>1115.42,'target_text'=>'and asked some male friends that he doesn\'t know to go to my Instagram and write some comments like they are flirting with','source_text'=>'dan meminta beberapa kawan lelaki yang dia tak kenal tinggalkan komen mengusik di Instagram saya seolah-olah mereka cuba mengurat','order'=>254],
