            ['start_time'=>1165.16,'end_time'=>1170.9,'target_text'=>'This community is also great and now I have a job, so it wasn\'t all bad.','source_text'=>'Komuniti ini pun hebat dan sekarang saya dah dapat kerja baharu, jadi tak adalah semuanya buruk.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>1171,'end_time'=>1175.3,'target_text'=>'Well, overall, I personally think she did the right thing by leaving him.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhannya, saya secara peribadi rasa tindakan dia tinggalkan lelaki tu memang tepat.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>1175.4,'end_time'=>1180.26,'target_text'=>'By the sounds of it, she was kind of just a replacement for the person he originally wanted.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya dia cuma dijadikan pengganti sementara kepada wanita yang sebenarnya lelaki tu idamkan.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>1180.36,'end_time'=>1183.78,'target_text'=>'And if he had the chance, he would probably choose that other girl.','source_text'=>'Dan kalau ada peluang terhidang, lelaki tu pasti akan pilih perempuan yang satu lagi.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>1183.88,'end_time'=>1189.22,'target_text'=>'So, I think in the long run, this was the right decision to make and she has good friends, so that\'s a bonus.','source_text'=>'Jadi bagi jangka masa panjang, ini keputusan yang terbaik dan dia ada kawan-kawan yang setia, satu kelebihan besar.','order'=>270],
