            ['start_time'=>147.8,'end_time'=>150.98,'target_text'=>'This park is a lot more peaceful than the city.','source_text'=>'Taman ini jauh lebih mendamaikan berbanding bandar.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>151.08,'end_time'=>154.1,'target_text'=>'This park is a lot more green than the city.','source_text'=>'Taman ini jauh lebih hijau dan segar berbanding bandar.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>154.2,'end_time'=>160.86,'target_text'=>'The city is like a concrete jungle, but this park is beautiful, green, and it\'s in nature.','source_text'=>'Bandar itu ibarat hutan batu, tapi taman ini sungguh cantik, menghijau, dan dekat dengan alam.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>160.96,'end_time'=>168.98,'target_text'=>'Okay, so now we\'re going to just show you quickly what is around us before I ask Leon those four steps.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kami nak tunjuk sekilas pandang kawasan sekeliling sebelum saya uji Leon dengan empat langkah tadi.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>169.08,'end_time'=>172.02,'target_text'=>'So, let\'s show you guys around here.','source_text'=>'Mari kami tunjukkan suasana di sekitar sini.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>172.12,'end_time'=>176.56,'target_text'=>'So, take a good look at everything you can see around us.','source_text'=>'Perhatikan betul-betul apa saja yang ada di sekeliling kami.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>177.92,'end_time'=>181.66,'target_text'=>'So, I want you guys to answer as well cuz you saw everything around us.','source_text'=>'Saya nak anda semua pun cuba jawab juga memandangkan anda dah tengok sekeliling kami.','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>181.76,'end_time'=>183.14,'target_text'=>'Now I want you to answer.','source_text'=>'Sekarang giliran anda untuk jawab.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>183.24,'end_time'=>185.26,'target_text'=>'What do you see?','source_text'=>'Apa yang anda nampak?','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>185.36,'end_time'=>187.94,'target_text'=>'I see a lot of green around me.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak banyak tumbuhan hijau di sekeliling saya.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>188.04,'end_time'=>194.08,'target_text'=>'So, there are a lot of green leaves, green grass, and','source_text'=>'Banyak dedaun hijau, rumput hijau, dan','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>194.32,'end_time'=>195.62,'target_text'=>'a green t-shirt.','source_text'=>'baju-T warna hijau.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>195.72,'end_time'=>200.02,'target_text'=>'Yes, there\'s someone over there wearing a green t-shirt.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada seseorang di sebelah sana memakai baju-T hijau.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>200.12,'end_time'=>201.62,'target_text'=>'He works at this park.','source_text'=>'Dia bekerja di taman ini.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>201.72,'end_time'=>205.14,'target_text'=>'Step two, how does it feel?','source_text'=>'Langkah dua: apa rasa suasananya?','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>205.24,'end_time'=>211.78,'target_text'=>'It feels relaxing and rejuvenating to be sitting in a park.','source_text'=>'Duduk bersantai di taman ini rasa sangat menenangkan dan menyegarkan fikiran.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>211.88,'end_time'=>216.7,'target_text'=>'So, if you feel like you\'re relaxing, but also you\'re like getting energy back.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya anda rasa relaks, di samping dapat memulihkan kembali tenaga.','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>216.8,'end_time'=>222.98,'target_text'=>'So, maybe after a long day at work, you need a break and you come to the park, then you\'ll feel rejuvenated.','source_text'=>'Contohnya lepas seharian penat bekerja, anda rehat di taman dan rasa bertenaga semula.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>223.08,'end_time'=>228.06,'target_text'=>'Exactly, cuz the air is fresher here with all the plants around.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali, sebab udara di sini lebih segar dengan bermacam pokok di sekeliling.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>228.16,'end_time'=>229.62,'target_text'=>'Yep, very true.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul sangat tu.','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>229.72,'end_time'=>233.42,'target_text'=>'Third step, what do you hear?','source_text'=>'Langkah ketiga: apa yang anda dengar?','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>233.52,'end_time'=>235.58,'target_text'=>'What do you hear?','source_text'=>'Apa yang anda dengar?','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>235.68,'end_time'=>237.78,'target_text'=>'I hear birds chirping.','source_text'=>'Saya dengar burung berkicau.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>237.88,'end_time'=>244.1,'target_text'=>'I also hear a leaf blower cuz you did see there was a lot of dead leaves on the ground.','source_text'=>'Saya juga dengar bunyi mesin penghembus daun sebab memang banyak daun kering gugur.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>244.2,'end_time'=>247.38,'target_text'=>'So, I can assume that they\'re pushing them off the path.','source_text'=>'Jadi rasanya mereka sedang hembus daun-daun itu keluar dari laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>247.48,'end_time'=>247.98,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>248.08,'end_time'=>252.66,'target_text'=>'And I could also hear the wind going through the trees.','source_text'=>'Dan saya juga boleh dengar angin bertiup menerusi celah-celah pokok.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>252.76,'end_time'=>253.5,'target_text'=>'Yep, very good.','source_text'=>'Ya, bagus sekali.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>253.6,'end_time'=>256.14,'target_text'=>'I hear the exact same things as you.','source_text'=>'Saya pun dengar perkara yang sama macam anda.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>256.24,'end_time'=>259.5,'target_text'=>'Now, step four, add a comparison.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, langkah empat: buat perbandingan.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>259.6,'end_time'=>264.62,'target_text'=>'Compare one of the things you mentioned to something else.','source_text'=>'Bandingkan salah satu perkara tadi dengan benda lain.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>264.72,'end_time'=>273.62,'target_text'=>'If I had to compare what I hear, instead of hearing birds chirping or the wind going through the trees, if I was a kilometer','source_text'=>'Kalau saya bandingkan apa yang didengar, daripada kicauan burung atau deruan angin celah pokok, andai saya berada satu kilometer','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>273.72,'end_time'=>282.94,'target_text'=>'north in the middle of the city, I would hear cars on the road, people honking, and maybe some construction noises or something','source_text'=>'ke utara di tengah-tengah bandar, saya akan dengar deruman kereta, orang membunyikan hon, dan mungkin bunyi tapak pembinaan atau sebagainya.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>283.04,'end_time'=>283.58,'target_text'=>'similar.','source_text'=>'yang seumpamanya.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>283.68,'end_time'=>284.08,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>284.16,'end_time'=>290.74,'target_text'=>'So, compared to the city, there are not a lot of artificial, man-made noises.','source_text'=>'Jadi berbanding di bandar, di sini hampir tiada bunyi bising buatan manusia.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>290.84,'end_time'=>291.9,'target_text'=>'Exactly.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>292,'end_time'=>292.9,'target_text'=>'Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>293,'end_time'=>300.66,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s go over some very common mistakes people make when describing things in nature and scenery.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita lihat beberapa kesilapan lazim yang orang selalu buat bila menggambarkan alam dan pemandangan.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>300.76,'end_time'=>307.9,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and go deeper than the video, then get the workbook on my website, vocaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda nak belajar dengan lebih mendalam dan cepat, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>308,'end_time'=>316.78,'target_text'=>'The workbook explains everything in greater detail and comes with exercises to help you learn new vocabulary, grammar, tenses,','source_text'=>'Buku kerja ini menerangkan semuanya secara terperinci beserta latihan untuk bantu kuasai kosa kata, tatabahasa, bentuk masa (tenses),','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>316.88,'end_time'=>322.54,'target_text'=>'sentence patterns, comprehension, and real English you can actually use.','source_text'=>'pola ayat, pemahaman, serta bahasa Inggeris praktikal yang boleh digunakan terus.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>322.64,'end_time'=>329.02,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos, so you can keep practicing and improving every lesson.','source_text'=>'Saya juga sediakan buku kerja untuk video-video lepas supaya anda boleh terus berlatih dan berkembang maju.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>329.12,'end_time'=>332.14,'target_text'=>'Click the link in my description to get the workbooks.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk dapatkan buku kerja tersebut.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>332.24,'end_time'=>335.1,'target_text'=>'There is versus there are.','source_text'=>'Perbezaan antara \'there is\' dan \'there are\'.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>335.2,'end_time'=>340.06,'target_text'=>'So, which one would you use if, for example, you see three birds?','source_text'=>'Jadi, yang mana satu anda guna jika contohnya anda nampak tiga ekor burung?','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>340.16,'end_time'=>343.9,'target_text'=>'Would you say there are birds or there is birds?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda kata \'there are birds\' atau \'there is birds\'?','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>344,'end_time'=>344.74,'target_text'=>'What would you say?','source_text'=>'Apa yang anda akan sebut?','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>344.84,'end_time'=>349.94,'target_text'=>'You you say there are birds.\" Because there are is plural.','source_text'=>'Anda kata \'there are birds\'. Sebab \'there are\' adalah untuk kata jamak (plural).','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>350.04,'end_time'=>352.06,'target_text'=>'There is is singular.','source_text'=>'\'There is\' pula untuk tunggal (singular).','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>352.16,'end_time'=>354.3,'target_text'=>'So, there is a bird, one bird.','source_text'=>'Jadi, \'there is a bird\', seekor burung.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>354.4,'end_time'=>355.94,'target_text'=>'There are birds.','source_text'=>'\'There are birds\'.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>356.04,'end_time'=>358.9,'target_text'=>'There are three birds.','source_text'=>'\'There are three birds\', ada tiga ekor burung.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>359,'end_time'=>360.06,'target_text'=>'Plural.','source_text'=>'Kata jamak.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>360.16,'end_time'=>364.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know why Leon just showed one bird when I was saying plural, but that is one bird.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kenapa Leon tunjuk seekor burung masa saya sebut jamak, tapi itu memang seekor burung.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>364.84,'end_time'=>366.82,'target_text'=>'So, there is a bird.','source_text'=>'Jadi, gunalah \'there is a bird\'.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>366.92,'end_time'=>370.46,'target_text'=>'Mistake number two, peaceful verse peacefully.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan kedua: \'peaceful\' lawan \'peacefully\'.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>370.56,'end_time'=>373.06,'target_text'=>'Peaceful is the adjective.','source_text'=>'\'Peaceful\' ialah kata sifat (adjective).','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>373.16,'end_time'=>375.58,'target_text'=>'Peacefully is the adverb.','source_text'=>'\'Peacefully\' ialah kata keterangan (adverb).','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>375.68,'end_time'=>382.94,'target_text'=>'So, you would say to describe this place, \"It feels peaceful.\" Not, \"It feels peacefully.\" That is incorrect.','source_text'=>'Jadi untuk gambarkan tempat ini, sebutlah \'It feels peaceful\'. Bukannya \'It feels peacefully\', itu salah.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>383.04,'end_time'=>386.86,'target_text'=>'It is \"It feels peaceful.\" The adjective.','source_text'=>'Yang betulnya \'It feels peaceful\', guna kata sifat.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>386.96,'end_time'=>390.58,'target_text'=>'Mistake three, quiet verse quite.','source_text'=>'Kesilapan ketiga: \'quiet\' lawan \'quite\'.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>390.68,'end_time'=>393.5,'target_text'=>'Quiet means there is not a lot of noise.','source_text'=>'\'Quiet\' bermaksud senyap, tidak bising.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>393.6,'end_time'=>394.34,'target_text'=>'Quiet.','source_text'=>'Senyap (Quiet).','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>394.44,'end_time'=>396.78,'target_text'=>'Quite means very.','source_text'=>'\'Quite\' pula bermaksud agak atau sangat.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>396.88,'end_time'=>399.5,'target_text'=>'So, they mean two different things.','source_text'=>'Jadi kedua-duanya membawa maksud yang berbeza.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>399.6,'end_time'=>403.3,'target_text'=>'The park is quiet, that means there\'s not a lot of sound.','source_text'=>'\'The park is quiet\', bermakna taman itu sunyi dan tak banyak bunyi bising.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>403.4,'end_time'=>411.02,'target_text'=>'And the other word is used for example, \"The park is quite peaceful.\" You can\'t say the park is quiet peaceful.','source_text'=>'Dan satu lagi perkataan digunakan contohnya, \'The park is quite peaceful\'. Tak boleh kata \'quiet peaceful\'.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>411.12,'end_time'=>411.7,'target_text'=>'Doesn\'t make sense.','source_text'=>'Tak masuk akal langsung.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>411.8,'end_time'=>416.14,'target_text'=>'The park is quite peaceful, or you can say the park is quiet.','source_text'=>'\'The park is quite peaceful\' (agak tenang), atau anda boleh kata \'the park is quiet\' (sunyi).','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>416.24,'end_time'=>417.66,'target_text'=>'There\'s not a lot of noise.','source_text'=>'Tidak banyak bunyi bising.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>417.76,'end_time'=>420.34,'target_text'=>'Watch out for those two, they\'re very, very, very similar.','source_text'=>'Berhati-hati dengan dua perkataan ini, bunyinya sangat mirip.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>420.44,'end_time'=>422.02,'target_text'=>'Quiet, not a lot of noise.','source_text'=>'\'Quiet\', sunyi tanpa banyak bunyi.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>422.12,'end_time'=>423.26,'target_text'=>'Quite, very.','source_text'=>'\'Quite\', agak atau sangat.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>423.36,'end_time'=>424.1,'target_text'=>'Remember that.','source_text'=>'Ingat perbezaan itu.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>424.2,'end_time'=>428.1,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s practice the pronunciation of some difficult words.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, mari kita latih sebutan beberapa perkataan yang agak sukar.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>428.2,'end_time'=>431.14,'target_text'=>'How do you pronounce this word?','source_text'=>'Macam mana anda sebut perkataan ini?','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>431.24,'end_time'=>432.14,'target_text'=>'Scenery.','source_text'=>'Pemandangan (Scenery).','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>432.24,'end_time'=>434.04,'target_text'=>'Sce-na-ry.','source_text'=>'Sce-na-ry.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>434.48,'end_time'=>435.46,'target_text'=>'Scenery.','source_text'=>'Scenery.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>435.56,'end_time'=>436.3,'target_text'=>'Scenery.','source_text'=>'Scenery.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>436.4,'end_time'=>438.14,'target_text'=>'Sce-na-ry.','source_text'=>'Sce-na-ry.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>438.24,'end_time'=>440.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s see if you can get them all right.','source_text'=>'Mari tengok sama ada anda boleh sebut semuanya dengan betul.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>440.16,'end_time'=>442.58,'target_text'=>'How do you pronounce this word?','source_text'=>'Macam mana nak sebut perkataan ini?','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>442.68,'end_time'=>443.14,'target_text'=>'Peaceful.','source_text'=>'Damai (Peaceful).','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>443.24,'end_time'=>444.5,'target_text'=>'Peace-ful.','source_text'=>'Peace-ful.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>444.6,'end_time'=>445.54,'target_text'=>'Peaceful.','source_text'=>'Peaceful.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>445.64,'end_time'=>446.18,'target_text'=>'Peaceful.','source_text'=>'Peaceful.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>446.28,'end_time'=>448.42,'target_text'=>'How do you pronounce this word?','source_text'=>'Macam mana sebutan perkataan ini?','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>448.52,'end_time'=>449.9,'target_text'=>'Breeze.','source_text'=>'Bayu (Breeze).','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>450,'end_time'=>451.22,'target_text'=>'Breeze.','source_text'=>'Breeze.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>451.32,'end_time'=>452.34,'target_text'=>'Breeze.','source_text'=>'Breeze.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>452.44,'end_time'=>454.86,'target_text'=>'How do you pronounce this word?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana nak sebut perkataan ini?','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>454.96,'end_time'=>456.5,'target_text'=>'Quiet.','source_text'=>'Sunyi (Quiet).','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>456.6,'end_time'=>457.38,'target_text'=>'Quiet.','source_text'=>'Quiet.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>457.48,'end_time'=>458.98,'target_text'=>'Qui-et.','source_text'=>'Qui-et.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>459.08,'end_time'=>459.94,'target_text'=>'Quiet.','source_text'=>'Quiet.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>460.04,'end_time'=>466.46,'target_text'=>'Now, here are some extra useful lines you can use next time if you just need some inspiration.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, ini beberapa frasa tambahan yang sangat berguna kalau anda perlukan idea nanti.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>466.56,'end_time'=>468.7,'target_text'=>'The air feels fresh.','source_text'=>'Udara terasa begitu segar.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>468.8,'end_time'=>471.02,'target_text'=>'The sunlight is soft.','source_text'=>'Cahaya matahari lembut menyinari.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>471.12,'end_time'=>473.06,'target_text'=>'The water is calm.','source_text'=>'Airnya tenang mengalir.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>473.16,'end_time'=>476.26,'target_text'=>'The path is shaded.','source_text'=>'Laluan ini redup berpayung pokok.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>476.36,'end_time'=>478.78,'target_text'=>'It\'s a great place to relax.','source_text'=>'Tempat yang sangat sesuai untuk berehat.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>478.88,'end_time'=>479.66,'target_text'=>'It really is.','source_text'=>'Memang betul pun.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>479.76,'end_time'=>484.02,'target_text'=>'These lines make your descriptions sound more natural.','source_text'=>'Ayat-ayat ini akan buat penerangan anda kedengaran jauh lebih bersahaja.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>484.12,'end_time'=>485.78,'target_text'=>'Now, it\'s time for the quiz.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, masa untuk kuiz ringkas.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>485.88,'end_time'=>490.38,'target_text'=>'I want you guys to answer the question before I say the answer.','source_text'=>'Saya nak anda semua cuba jawab soalan sebelum saya beri jawapannya.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>490.48,'end_time'=>491.06,'target_text'=>'Are you ready?','source_text'=>'Dah sedia?','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>491.16,'end_time'=>495.22,'target_text'=>'Say one sentence about what you see behind me.','source_text'=>'Bina satu ayat tentang apa yang anda nampak di belakang saya.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>495.32,'end_time'=>497.4,'target_text'=>'One sentence.','source_text'=>'Satu ayat sahaja.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>497.96,'end_time'=>502.74,'target_text'=>'I can see tall trees and a lot of dead leaves.','source_text'=>'Saya nampak pokok-pokok tinggi dan banyak daun kering.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>502.84,'end_time'=>503.98,'target_text'=>'Second question.','source_text'=>'Soalan kedua.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>504.08,'end_time'=>509.2,'target_text'=>'Say one sentence about how it feels and why.','source_text'=>'Bina satu ayat tentang apa yang dirasakan dan sebabnya.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>509.48,'end_time'=>516.34,'target_text'=>'It feels very peaceful because there aren\'t a lot of people and there isn\'t a lot of noise.','source_text'=>'Suasananya sangat tenang sebab tak ramai orang dan tak ada banyak bunyi bising.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>516.44,'end_time'=>517.46,'target_text'=>'Third question.','source_text'=>'Soalan ketiga.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>517.56,'end_time'=>520.28,'target_text'=>'Make one comparison.','source_text'=>'Buat satu perbandingan.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>520.44,'end_time'=>522.64,'target_text'=>'One comparison.','source_text'=>'Satu perbandingan.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>522.92,'end_time'=>525.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s a lot quieter than the city.','source_text'=>'Di sini jauh lebih sunyi berbanding di bandar.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>525.44,'end_time'=>527.86,'target_text'=>'You remember the difference between quite and quiet?','source_text'=>'Anda masih ingat beza antara \'quite\' dan \'quiet\'?','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>527.96,'end_time'=>531.74,'target_text'=>'It is quite peaceful and it is a lot quieter than the city.','source_text'=>'Di sini agak tenang (quite peaceful) dan jauh lebih sunyi (quieter) daripada bandar.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>531.84,'end_time'=>532.7,'target_text'=>'Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Baiklah semua.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>532.8,'end_time'=>535.1,'target_text'=>'Now, we finished that framework.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, kita dah selesai dengan empat langkah tadi.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>535.2,'end_time'=>540.02,'target_text'=>'Remember, what you see, what you feel, what you hear, and then a comparison.','source_text'=>'Ingat ya: apa yang dilihat, dirasa, didengar, dan kemudian perbandingan.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>540.12,'end_time'=>547.42,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s walk around this beautiful park in nature and uh let\'s use that framework and talk about nature.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita pusing-pusing taman yang indah ini dan amalkan panduan tadi untuk bercerita tentang alam.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>547.52,'end_time'=>550.1,'target_text'=>'What I see right now is a path.','source_text'=>'Apa yang saya nampak sekarang ialah sebuah laluan.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>550.2,'end_time'=>551.38,'target_text'=>'A walking path.','source_text'=>'Laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>551.48,'end_time'=>553.14,'target_text'=>'The path feels old.','source_text'=>'Laluan ini nampak macam dah lama.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>553.24,'end_time'=>554.38,'target_text'=>'It looks very cracked.','source_text'=>'Nampak banyak rekahan di sana sini.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>554.48,'end_time'=>557.42,'target_text'=>'There\'s moss growing in the cracks.','source_text'=>'Ada lumut tumbuh di celah-celah rekahan.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>557.52,'end_time'=>560.66,'target_text'=>'I hear the sounds of nature like birds and insects.','source_text'=>'Saya dengar bunyi alam seperti unggas dan serangga.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>560.76,'end_time'=>564.66,'target_text'=>'Compared to the sidewalk on a busy street, this path isn\'t very nice.','source_text'=>'Berbanding kaki lima di jalan yang sibuk, laluan ini tak berapa elok keadaannya.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>564.76,'end_time'=>566.38,'target_text'=>'You can see it\'s all broken apart.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak laluannya pecah-pecah bersepah.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>566.48,'end_time'=>567.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s very old.','source_text'=>'Memang dah agak uzur.','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>567.32,'end_time'=>570.58,'target_text'=>'I would say it\'s in need of a new path here.','source_text'=>'Boleh dikatakan laluan ini perlu diturap baru.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>570.68,'end_time'=>572.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s how I would describe this.','source_text'=>'Begitulah cara saya menggambarkannya.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>572.4,'end_time'=>575.74,'target_text'=>'And it\'s also quite hot, so I do need a use use fan.','source_text'=>'Cuaca pun agak panas sekarang, jadi saya terpaksa guna kipas kecil ini.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>575.84,'end_time'=>577.42,'target_text'=>'Oh, what are these?','source_text'=>'Oh, apa benda ni?','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>577.52,'end_time'=>578.54,'target_text'=>'Do you know what those are, Leon?','source_text'=>'Awak tahu ke buah apa tu, Leon?','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>578.64,'end_time'=>579.86,'target_text'=>'I think those are jackfruit.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu buah cempedak atau nangka.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>579.96,'end_time'=>581.26,'target_text'=>'Why are they on the ground here?','source_text'=>'Kenapa boleh bersepah atas tanah ni?','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>581.36,'end_time'=>583.66,'target_text'=>'That might be monkey food.','source_text'=>'Mungkin makanan monyet kut.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>583.76,'end_time'=>586.34,'target_text'=>'They might have brought it here and then they might be eating it.','source_text'=>'Monyet mungkin bawa ke sini dan makan buah tu.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>586.44,'end_time'=>590.3,'target_text'=>'>> It definitely looks like some sort of animal opened up the fruit to eat the inside of it.','source_text'=>'Memang nampak macam haiwan yang koyakkan buah tu untuk makan isinya.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>590.4,'end_time'=>592.26,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t look like a human opened it.','source_text'=>'Bukan manusia yang kopek rasanya.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>592.36,'end_time'=>593.58,'target_text'=>'No, I don\'t think so.','source_text'=>'Tak, saya rasa pun macam tu.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>593.68,'end_time'=>598.26,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but this park is very, very, very beautiful, honestly, but it\'s just it\'s just so hot.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi taman ini memang sangat cantik sebenarnya, cuma cuaca saja terlampau panas.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>598.36,'end_time'=>599.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s so hot and humid.','source_text'=>'Cuaca panas dan berkuap sungguh.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>599.6,'end_time'=>601.14,'target_text'=>'What kind of bug is that on you?','source_text'=>'Serangga apa yang melekat dekat baju awak tu?','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>601.24,'end_time'=>602.42,'target_text'=>'On me?','source_text'=>'Dekat saya?','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>602.52,'end_time'=>602.92,'target_text'=>'Where?','source_text'=>'Kat mana?','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>602.92,'end_time'=>604.74,'target_text'=>'>> a green spider-looking thing.','source_text'=>'Macam labah-labah warna hijau.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>604.84,'end_time'=>605.82,'target_text'=>'Oh, man.','source_text'=>'Alamak.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>605.92,'end_time'=>607.1,'target_text'=>'Super green.','source_text'=>'Warna hijau pekat betul.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>607.2,'end_time'=>608.22,'target_text'=>'So, you got to be careful.','source_text'=>'Kena hati-hati sikit.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>608.32,'end_time'=>609.98,'target_text'=>'>> But I think it Oh, no, that\'s a spider.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya rasa... Eh betul, itu labah-labah.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>610.08,'end_time'=>612.32,'target_text'=>'It has eight legs.','source_text'=>'Ada lapan kaki.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>612.56,'end_time'=>613.34,'target_text'=>'Can you get it off?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong tepis buang?','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>613.44,'end_time'=>614.46,'target_text'=>'Shake it off.','source_text'=>'Kibas bagi jatuh.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>614.56,'end_time'=>615.02,'target_text'=>'Is it off?','source_text'=>'Dah jatuh ke?','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>615.12,'end_time'=>616.18,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it went on the ground there.','source_text'=>'Dah, dah jatuh atas tanah tu.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>616.28,'end_time'=>618.5,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, there was just a spider on me.','source_text'=>'Fuh, tadi memang ada labah-labah atas badan saya.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>618.6,'end_time'=>625.42,'target_text'=>'Personally, I\'m not really scared of any like small bugs and stuff, but what I don\'t like is like snakes or like an animal','source_text'=>'Secara peribadi, saya tak takut sangat serangga kecil, tapi apa yang saya paling tak suka ialah ular atau binatang','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>625.52,'end_time'=>629.58,'target_text'=>'like that because in my mind snakes are venomous.','source_text'=>'seumpamanya, sebab dalam fikiran saya ular ini ada bisa.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>629.68,'end_time'=>635.54,'target_text'=>'Not every snake, obviously, but when I see a snake, I just think instantly it\'s venomous, which is probably, you know, a good','source_text'=>'Bukan semua ular berbisa tentunya, tapi bila nampak ular, saya terus anggap ia berbisa, yang mana itu langkah yang bagus','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>635.64,'end_time'=>638.3,'target_text'=>'thing rather than than assuming it\'s not venomous.','source_text'=>'berbanding kita buat andaian ia tak ada bisa.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>638.4,'end_time'=>643.94,'target_text'=>'Can you guys tell me what\'s the difference between venomous and poisonous?','source_text'=>'Boleh anda beritahu apa beza antara \'venomous\' dan \'poisonous\'?','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>644.04,'end_time'=>649.86,'target_text'=>'Venomous means it injects toxins into you either by biting or stinging you.','source_text'=>'\'Venomous\' bermaksud ia menyuntik racun ke dalam badan anda sama ada melalui gigitan atau sengatan.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>649.96,'end_time'=>655.38,'target_text'=>'For example, snakes, spiders, scorpions, things like that.','source_text'=>'Contohnya ular, labah-labah, kala jengking dan sebagainya.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>655.48,'end_time'=>659.66,'target_text'=>'And poisonous means you\'re harmed by touching it or eating it.','source_text'=>'Manakala \'poisonous\' pula bermaksud racun terkena bila disentuh atau dimakan.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>659.76,'end_time'=>661.26,'target_text'=>'They\'re very similar, but they\'re not the same.','source_text'=>'Bunyinya serupa, tetapi maksudnya berbeza.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>661.36,'end_time'=>665.34,'target_text'=>'The method of getting poisoned or the method of getting harmed is different.','source_text'=>'Cara racun itu masuk atau mencederakan adalah berbeza.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>665.44,'end_time'=>669.14,'target_text'=>'One has to bite you, the other one is just by touch or by you consuming it.','source_text'=>'Satu kena gigit atau sengat, manakala satu lagi melalui sentuhan atau termakan.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>669.24,'end_time'=>669.94,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>670.04,'end_time'=>672.42,'target_text'=>'Does this type of weather make you lazy?','source_text'=>'Cuaca macam ni buat anda rasa malas tak?','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>672.52,'end_time'=>674.34,'target_text'=>'Ooh, good question.','source_text'=>'Ooh, soalan yang menarik.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>674.44,'end_time'=>676.34,'target_text'=>'I think yes, it does.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ya, memang rasa malas.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>676.44,'end_time'=>679.18,'target_text'=>'You don\'t want to work hard when it\'s so hot out.','source_text'=>'Rasa tak ada mood nak buat kerja berat bila cuaca terlampau panas.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>679.28,'end_time'=>679.68,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Betul tu.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>679.68,'end_time'=>681.86,'target_text'=>'>> So, I would say yes, it does make you lazy.','source_text'=>'Jadi bagi saya, memang ia buat kita rasa malas.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>681.96,'end_time'=>685.62,'target_text'=>'Yeah, for me, I think extreme weather makes me like lazy.','source_text'=>'Ya, bagi saya cuaca melampau memang buat diri jadi malas.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>685.72,'end_time'=>688.42,'target_text'=>'Like I just want to like not exert myself too much.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam tak nak guna banyak tenaga sangat.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>688.52,'end_time'=>693.5,'target_text'=>'For example, back in Canada, I don\'t really want to even leave my bed cuz it\'s so cold.','source_text'=>'Contohnya masa di Kanada dulu, saya malas nak bangun dari katil sebab sejuk sangat.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>693.6,'end_time'=>694.38,'target_text'=>'So then I get lazy.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu mula lah rasa malas.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>694.48,'end_time'=>698.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m like, \"Oh.\" And I really don\'t want to go outside cuz say for example it\'s minus 40.','source_text'=>'Saya jadi macam mengeluh, dan memang malas nak keluar rumah kalau suhu sampai negatif 40.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>698.68,'end_time'=>699.7,'target_text'=>'Why do I want to go outside?','source_text'=>'Buat apa saya nak keluar dalam sejuk macam tu?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>699.8,'end_time'=>702.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s freezing, minus 40° C.','source_text'=>'Tersangat sejuk beku, tolak 40 darjah Celsius.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>702.56,'end_time'=>703.5,'target_text'=>'That makes me lazy.','source_text'=>'Itu buat saya jadi malas.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>703.6,'end_time'=>705.74,'target_text'=>'Another thing is extreme heat.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi hal ialah panas terik yang melampau.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>705.84,'end_time'=>708.1,'target_text'=>'Like I think right now it\'s like 35°.','source_text'=>'Macam sekarang rasanya suhu sekitar 35 darjah.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>708.2,'end_time'=>709.42,'target_text'=>'Probably feels like close to 40.','source_text'=>'Tapi terasa bahangnya dekat 40 darjah.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>709.52,'end_time'=>712.1,'target_text'=>'Extremely hot, so that makes me lazy as well.','source_text'=>'Terlampau panas, jadi itu pun buat saya rasa lesu dan malas.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>712.2,'end_time'=>715.18,'target_text'=>'So I prefer like cooler climate.','source_text'=>'Sebab tu saya lebih suka iklim yang sejuk sikit.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>715.28,'end_time'=>720.06,'target_text'=>'So for me the ideal temperature is around 20 to 25°.','source_text'=>'Bagi saya suhu yang paling ideal sekitar 20 hingga 25 darjah.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>720.16,'end_time'=>720.78,'target_text'=>'20 to 25.','source_text'=>'20 hingga 25 darjah.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>720.88,'end_time'=>725.46,'target_text'=>'If it was like that all year round where I live, I would be very happy.','source_text'=>'Kalau tempat tinggal saya bersuhu macam tu sepanjang tahun, alangkah seronoknya.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>725.56,'end_time'=>727.7,'target_text'=>'There are some places in the world like that.','source_text'=>'Ada beberapa tempat di dunia yang berkeadaan begitu.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>727.8,'end_time'=>734.42,'target_text'=>'For example, one that I\'m thinking off the top of my head is in Ecuador, there\'s a city called Cuenca, which is known for','source_text'=>'Contohnya yang terlintas di fikiran saya ialah di Ecuador, ada sebuah bandar bernama Cuenca yang terkenal','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>734.52,'end_time'=>738.62,'target_text'=>'having very steady climate throughout the whole year because of the place it\'s situated.','source_text'=>'dengan cuacanya yang sangat stabil sepanjang tahun kerana kedudukan geografinya.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>738.72,'end_time'=>741.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s in the mountains high up, but it\'s also on the equator.','source_text'=>'Ia terletak tinggi di kawasan pergunungan, tapi pada masa sama di garisan khatulistiwa.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>741.2,'end_time'=>743.06,'target_text'=>'So it\'s not cold, but it\'s not very hot.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia tak terlalu sejuk, dan tak terlalu panas.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>743.16,'end_time'=>745.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s around that 20 to 25°.','source_text'=>'Suhunya sekadar sekitar 20 hingga 25 darjah.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>745.24,'end_time'=>749.98,'target_text'=>'Also, I\'ve heard in China there\'s a city, I believe it\'s called Kunming, something like that.','source_text'=>'Selain itu, saya dengar di China ada bandar namanya Kunming kalau tak silap.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>750.08,'end_time'=>755.9,'target_text'=>'And I believe they call that city like the city of like eternal spring or something because the weather is like springtime','source_text'=>'Dan rasanya mereka gelar bandar itu \'kota musim bunga abadi\' sebab cuacanya sentiasa macam musim bunga.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>756,'end_time'=>756.36,'target_text'=>'weather.','source_text'=>'yang nyaman.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>756.36,'end_time'=>757.22,'target_text'=>'That\'s what I like.','source_text'=>'Itulah cuaca kegemaran saya.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>757.32,'end_time'=>758.58,'target_text'=>'Spring and fall weather.','source_text'=>'Cuaca musim bunga dan musim luruh.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>758.68,'end_time'=>761.1,'target_text'=>'That\'s like Da Lat in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Macam Da Lat di Vietnam.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>761.2,'end_time'=>762.22,'target_text'=>'Oh, no, no.','source_text'=>'Oh, tak tak tak.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>762.32,'end_time'=>763.66,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been to Da Lat, Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Saya pernah pergi Da Lat, Vietnam.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>763.76,'end_time'=>765.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s cold in the morning, dude.','source_text'=>'Pagi-pagi sejuk gila kawan.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>765.24,'end_time'=>766.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s so cold.','source_text'=>'Tersangat sejuk.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>766.4,'end_time'=>769.98,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but the average temperature is 20 to 25.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi purata suhunya 20 hingga 25 darjah.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>770.08,'end_time'=>771.98,'target_text'=>'>> I did not think it would be that cold in Vietnam.','source_text'=>'Saya tak sangka pula Vietnam boleh sesejuk macam tu.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>772.08,'end_time'=>773.1,'target_text'=>'This is a story for you guys.','source_text'=>'Ini satu cerita untuk anda semua.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>773.2,'end_time'=>775.7,'target_text'=>'First time I was ever in Vietnam, I went to Da Lat.','source_text'=>'Pertama kali saya jejak kaki ke Vietnam, saya pergi ke Da Lat.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>775.8,'end_time'=>778.26,'target_text'=>'Took a bus, night bus from Ho Chi Minh to Da Lat.','source_text'=>'Naik bas malam dari bandar Ho Chi Minh ke Da Lat.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>778.36,'end_time'=>781.5,'target_text'=>'When I arrived in the morning, I didn\'t have any long-sleeve shirts.','source_text'=>'Bila sampai waktu pagi, saya tak ada sehelai pun baju lengan panjang.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>781.6,'end_time'=>785.62,'target_text'=>'All I had was shorts and t-shirts because I thought it\'s Vietnam, it\'s going to be warm.','source_text'=>'Semua yang saya bawa cuma seluar pendek dan baju-T sebab ingat cuaca Vietnam sentiasa panas.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>785.72,'end_time'=>789.74,'target_text'=>'But when I got off the bus in Da Lat, it was very cold.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila turun saja dari bas di Da Lat, sejuknya bukan main.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>789.84,'end_time'=>791.86,'target_text'=>'I was not expecting it to be that cold, you know?','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak jangkakan ia sesejuk itu, tahu tak?','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>791.96,'end_time'=>793.42,'target_text'=>'Like below 10°?','source_text'=>'Bawah 10 darjah ke?','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>793.52,'end_time'=>794.86,'target_text'=>'I am not actually sure.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sangat.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>794.96,'end_time'=>799.3,'target_text'=>'I don\'t remember exactly, but all I know is I got off the bus and I was like shaking.','source_text'=>'Tak ingat tepat berapa suhunya, tapi apa yang saya tahu saya turun bas sambil menggigil.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>799.4,'end_time'=>803.18,'target_text'=>'I was like I was like I was like, \"What the heck?\" Cuz it was like 6:00 a.m.','source_text'=>'Saya terpinga-pinga, \"Biar betul?\" Sebab masa tu sekitar pukul 6 pagi.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>803.28,'end_time'=>808.06,'target_text'=>'It was so, so cold and I couldn\'t check into my hotel yet and a lot of the stores were closed.','source_text'=>'Sangat-sangat sejuk, hotel pun belum boleh daftar masuk dan kebanyakan kedai masih tutup.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>808.16,'end_time'=>813.42,'target_text'=>'So, I was literally just looking around somewhere I could go in, and I saw a restaurant, and I ordered like a bowl of pho,','source_text'=>'Jadi saya melilau cari tempat untuk berteduh, ternampak kedai makan dan pesan semangkuk mi sup pho panas,','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>813.52,'end_time'=>814.86,'target_text'=>'and it was so warm.','source_text'=>'dan ia sangat menyelesakan badan.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>814.96,'end_time'=>815.78,'target_text'=>'But, uh now I know.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang saya dah tahu.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>815.88,'end_time'=>820.3,'target_text'=>'Now I travel with a rain jacket and long pants, just in case it gets too cold.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kalau melancong saya bawa jaket kalis air dan seluar panjang, untuk persediaan kalau terlampau sejuk.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>820.4,'end_time'=>820.9,'target_text'=>'So, now I know.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya dah beringat.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>821,'end_time'=>822.18,'target_text'=>'Do you have any stories like that?','source_text'=>'Awak ada pengalaman macam tu juga ke?','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>822.28,'end_time'=>823.58,'target_text'=>'Of super cold?','source_text'=>'Pasal cuaca sejuk melampau ke?','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>823.68,'end_time'=>827.9,'target_text'=>'Yeah, just like being somewhere and you don\'t expect the weather and you\'re just not prepared.','source_text'=>'Ya, macam pergi suatu tempat tanpa jangka cuacanya dan langsung tak bersedia.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>828,'end_time'=>829.1,'target_text'=>'Ooh.','source_text'=>'Ooh.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>829.2,'end_time'=>831.3,'target_text'=>'Honestly, probably from Malaysia.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, mungkin masa di Malaysia.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>831.4,'end_time'=>836.58,'target_text'=>'Like, the first time I came here was like around this time, and I didn\'t know it would be super rainy.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya datang sini dulu sekitar waktu begini, dan saya tak tahu pula musim hujan lebat.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>836.68,'end_time'=>843.66,'target_text'=>'So, I went out on like one of the first days, and it just started pouring, and I tried making my way back to the hotel, and','source_text'=>'Jadi pada hari-hari awal saya keluar jalan-jalan, tiba-tiba hujan turun mencurah-curah, saya cuba patah balik ke hotel dan','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>843.76,'end_time'=>844.9,'target_text'=>'I got soaking wet.','source_text'=>'habis basah lencun.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>845,'end_time'=>845.66,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, man.','source_text'=>'Alamak, kesian betul.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>845.76,'end_time'=>851.66,'target_text'=>'I was just caught off guard, and I bought an umbrella like the next day to have with me all the time because that sucked.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tak bersedia langsung, terus keesokan harinya saya beli payung untuk dibawa ke mana-mana sebab serik.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>851.76,'end_time'=>853.46,'target_text'=>'I did not like being wet like that.','source_text'=>'Rimas bila basah kuyup macam tu.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>853.56,'end_time'=>855.06,'target_text'=>'Does it like flash rain here?','source_text'=>'Hujan dekat sini jenis turun tiba-tiba ke?','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>855.16,'end_time'=>857.66,'target_text'=>'Like, 1 second it\'s sunny, and then boom, rain.','source_text'=>'Sesaat tadi panas terik, lepas tu boom, terus hujan lebat.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>857.76,'end_time'=>859.06,'target_text'=>'So, that\'s exactly how it is here.','source_text'=>'Ha, memang macam tu lah keadaannya di sini.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>859.16,'end_time'=>865.5,'target_text'=>'Like, you\'ll notice the clouds coming in, and then before you can even react, it\'s like a bucket is dropped on you.','source_text'=>'Nampak awan gelap datang, belum sempat buat apa-apa, rasa macam kena curah sebaldi air.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>865.6,'end_time'=>866.86,'target_text'=>'There\'s puddles everywhere.','source_text'=>'Air bertakung di merata-rata tempat.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>866.96,'end_time'=>870.46,'target_text'=>'The water comes down faster than the drains can handle here.','source_text'=>'Air hujan turun terlalu lebat sampai longkang tak sempat nak salurkan.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>870.56,'end_time'=>871.78,'target_text'=>'I think you noticed.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa awak pun perasan benda ni.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>871.88,'end_time'=>877.62,'target_text'=>'Well, I noticed that yesterday cuz it rained yesterday, and the water just starts piling up because it just comes down so','source_text'=>'Ya, saya perasan benda tu semalam sebab semalam hujan, air mula bertakung laju sangat sebab curahan air begitu','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>877.72,'end_time'=>878.58,'target_text'=>'hard.','source_text'=>'lebat.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>878.68,'end_time'=>883.7,'target_text'=>'So, would you say it rains for like a long time, or is it just a couple minutes?','source_text'=>'Jadi pada pandangan awak, adakah hujan di sini turun lama, atau cuma beberapa minit saja?','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>883.8,'end_time'=>890.74,'target_text'=>'I think right now, every time it\'s rained here, it hasn\'t been for more than like an hour or max an hour or two, and then','source_text'=>'Saya rasa buat masa ni, setiap kali hujan di sini biasanya tak lebih sejam, atau paling lama pun satu ke dua jam, lepas tu','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>890.84,'end_time'=>891.34,'target_text'=>'it\'s done.','source_text'=>'terus reda.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>891.44,'end_time'=>893.74,'target_text'=>'So, it hasn\'t been more than a day or anything.','source_text'=>'Jadi ia tak adalah berlarutan sampai sehari suntuk ke apa.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>893.84,'end_time'=>896.82,'target_text'=>'Uh and there\'s been really short rains, too, like 15 minutes, maybe.','source_text'=>'Dan ada juga hujan sekejap saja, dalam 15 minit mungkin.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>896.92,'end_time'=>897.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>897.72,'end_time'=>898.98,'target_text'=>'Or shorter than that.','source_text'=>'Atau lagi singkat daripada tu.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>899.08,'end_time'=>903.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I\'ve noticed too, it just rains like really, really, really hard for a couple minutes, and then it like just drizzles','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pun perasan juga, ia turun tersangatlah lebat beberapa minit, lepas tu bertukar renyai-renyai','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>903.68,'end_time'=>905.02,'target_text'=>'a little bit, and then it goes away.','source_text'=>'sedikit, dan kemudian berhenti terus.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>905.12,'end_time'=>907.34,'target_text'=>'But, it also rains like this.','source_text'=>'Tapi, ada juga hujan jenis macam ni.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>907.44,'end_time'=>912.54,'target_text'=>'One 1 second it\'s not raining, the next it\'s like >> You look outside your window, and it\'s just white.','source_text'=>'Sesaat tadi tak hujan langsung, tup-tup... >> Tengok luar tingkap, pemandangan terus jadi putih kelam dek hujan lebat.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>912.64,'end_time'=>913.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s just white, man.','source_text'=>'Memang kelam putih semuanya, kawan.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>913.84,'end_time'=>915.82,'target_text'=>'>> got caught again this time, too.','source_text'=>'Terkena lagi kali ini juga.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>915.92,'end_time'=>916.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, did you?','source_text'=>'Oh, ya ke?','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>916.48,'end_time'=>922.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, when I went to get my haircut, like I left the apartment, and it did not look that bad, and then the moment I stepped','source_text'=>'Ya, masa saya keluar nak pergi gunting rambut tadi, masa turun dari apartmen cuaca tak nampak teruk pun, tapi sebaik saja saya melangkah','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>922.44,'end_time'=>928.5,'target_text'=>'off the train, it\'s it was raining already, and it was coming down so heavy that the roads were starting to fill up, and it','source_text'=>'turun dari tren, hujan dah mula lebat mencurah-curah sampai jalan raya mula digenangi air, dan jarak','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>928.6,'end_time'=>934.26,'target_text'=>'was like maybe a 5-minute walk to the hairdresser, so I\'m like, \"Okay, maybe I can run to it.\" But, I was soaking wet when','source_text'=>'ke kedai gunting tu cuma dalam 5 minit jalan kaki, jadi saya fikir, \'Okeylah, boleh kot lari sekejap.\' Tapi bila sampai','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>934.36,'end_time'=>934.76,'target_text'=>'I got there.','source_text'=>'di sana, saya dah basah kuyup.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>934.84,'end_time'=>941.98,'target_text'=>'Like, my shoes were wet, shirt was all wet, so Have you ever watched that MythBusters episode saying that running in the rain','source_text'=>'Kasut basah, baju lencun... Pernah tengok tak episod rancangan MythBusters yang kata berlari dalam hujan','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>942.08,'end_time'=>943.9,'target_text'=>'actually makes you more wet than just walking?','source_text'=>'sebenarnya buat kita lagi basah berbanding jalan biasa?','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>944,'end_time'=>944.46,'target_text'=>'Really?','source_text'=>'Biar betul?','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>944.56,'end_time'=>945.66,'target_text'=>'Have you watched that episode?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah tengok ke episod tu?','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>945.76,'end_time'=>946.12,'target_text'=>'>> seen that.','source_text'=>'Pernah tengok.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>946.12,'end_time'=>946.44,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, really?','source_text'=>'Oh, ya ke?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>946.44,'end_time'=>948.22,'target_text'=>'Do I feel like that\'s like a universal experience?','source_text'=>'Rasa macam itu satu perkara yang ramai orang lalui kan?','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>948.32,'end_time'=>949.74,'target_text'=>'There\'s like this MythBusters episode.','source_text'=>'Ada episod MythBusters tu.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>949.84,'end_time'=>955.7,'target_text'=>'MythBusters was this super, super popular TV show like back in the day when I was growing up, and they did a test, will you','source_text'=>'MythBusters ini rancangan TV yang sangat popular masa zaman saya membesar dulu, dan mereka buat ujian saintifik: adakah anda','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>955.8,'end_time'=>959.54,'target_text'=>'get more wet running through the rain or walking through the rain?','source_text'=>'akan lebih basah bila berlari meredah hujan atau bila berjalan santai meredah hujan?','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>959.64,'end_time'=>963.98,'target_text'=>'And it turns out you get more wet running through the rain because this was the logic, and they tested it.','source_text'=>'Dan keputusannya mendapati anda jadi lebih basah bila berlari, sebab logiknya begini, dan mereka dah uji:','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>964.08,'end_time'=>968.06,'target_text'=>'When you run, you not only get hit by the rain falling, but you\'re running into rain.','source_text'=>'Bila anda berlari, anda bukan sekadar kena titisan hujan yang turun dari atas, tapi badan anda sendiri melanggar titisan hujan di hadapan.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>968.16,'end_time'=>969.98,'target_text'=>'So, you\'re running into rain, so the rain\'s hitting you.','source_text'=>'Jadi anda merempuh air hujan ke hadapan, dan titisan hujan menghentam tubuh anda.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>970.08,'end_time'=>974.66,'target_text'=>'But, when you walk, you\'re walking, so it\'s mainly just the rain from up top hitting you, so you get less wet.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila berjalan, anda cuma melangkah perlahan, jadi hanya hujan dari bahagian atas saja menimpa anda, maka kuranglah basah.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>974.76,'end_time'=>978.46,'target_text'=>'But, I feel like when you run, you think you\'ll get less wet, but it\'s actually not like that.','source_text'=>'Tapi bila kita lari, fikiran kita ingat akan kurang basah, padahal hakikatnya tidak begitu.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>978.56,'end_time'=>980.18,'target_text'=>'>> I might have seen it, but I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Saya mungkin pernah tengok, tapi tak pasti sangat.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>980.28,'end_time'=>984.06,'target_text'=>'It was raining so hard that it didn\'t matter what you did, you were still going to get super wet.','source_text'=>'Tadi tu hujan terlalu lebat sampai tak kira apa pun yang awak buat, tetap akan basah kuyup juga.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>984.16,'end_time'=>984.56,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>984.56,'end_time'=>986.02,'target_text'=>'I bought a little umbrella, too.','source_text'=>'Saya pun ada beli payung kecil juga.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>986.12,'end_time'=>990.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s a super tiny umbrella that I can just put in my crossbody bag if I have to.','source_text'=>'Payung bersaiz comel yang mudah saya selit dalam beg silang bila-bila masa.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>990.28,'end_time'=>990.32,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>990.32,'end_time'=>994.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I have a very small umbrella, too, cuz I\'m not going to carry around a big umbrella, right?','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pun ada payung kecil macam tu sebab saya malas nak bawa payung besar ke sana ke mari, kan?','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>994.32,'end_time'=>998.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s just so inconvenient, so I\'ll carry around like a small umbrella, yeah.','source_text'=>'Menyusahkan nak usung payung besar, jadi bawa payung lipat kecil lebih senang, ya.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>998.12,'end_time'=>999.34,'target_text'=>'So, how would you describe that?','source_text'=>'Jadi, macam mana anda nak gambarkan suasana itu?','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>999.44,'end_time'=>1000.02,'target_text'=>'What is it?','source_text'=>'Apakah ia?','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>1000.12,'end_time'=>1000.74,'target_text'=>'>> Pouring.','source_text'=>'\'Pouring\' (hujan mencurah-curah).','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>1000.84,'end_time'=>1001.94,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s pouring rain.','source_text'=>'Hujan lebat mencurah-curah.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>1002.04,'end_time'=>1003.62,'target_text'=>'Raining cats and dogs.','source_text'=>'\'Raining cats and dogs\' (hujan lebat bagai nak rak).','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>1003.72,'end_time'=>1007.38,'target_text'=>'>> Raining cats and dogs, that\'s a very common expression in English.','source_text'=>'\'Raining cats and dogs\', itu simpulan bahasa yang sangat lazim dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>1007.48,'end_time'=>1015.38,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you exactly','source_text'=>'Kalau anda serius nak fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya dah bina kursus pertuturan dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan kepada anda','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>1015.48,'end_time'=>1017.5,'target_text'=>'what to do step by step.','source_text'=>'apa yang perlu dibuat langkah demi langkah.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>1017.6,'end_time'=>1025.54,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to 80-plus video lessons right away, and I add three to five brand new lessons every week, so you can','source_text'=>'Anda dapat akses segera ke 80 lebih video pelajaran, dan saya tambah tiga hingga lima pelajaran baru setiap minggu supaya anda','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>1025.64,'end_time'=>1027.74,'target_text'=>'keep improving consistently.','source_text'=>'terus berkembang secara konsisten.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>1027.84,'end_time'=>1031.26,'target_text'=>'And this is not just a course full of random videos.','source_text'=>'Dan ini bukan sekadar kursus dengan video rawak.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>1031.36,'end_time'=>1039.98,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get an exclusive ChatGPT prompt that allows you to master the pronunciation of any word plus a clear practice structure','source_text'=>'Anda akan dapat prompt khas ChatGPT untuk kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan serta struktur latihan yang jelas','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>1040.08,'end_time'=>1046.22,'target_text'=>'so you always know exactly how to study, what to focus on, and how to make real progress.','source_text'=>'supaya anda sentiasa tahu cara belajar, apa yang perlu difokuskan, dan capai kemajuan yang ketara.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>1046.32,'end_time'=>1055.22,'target_text'=>'Inside we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking so you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and','source_text'=>'Di dalam kursus ini kita asah sebutan, intonasi, rentak, dan pertuturan semula jadi supaya anda tak teragak-agak lagi, kedengaran lebih bersahaja, dan','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>1055.32,'end_time'=>1058.1,'target_text'=>'speak English with real confidence.','source_text'=>'bercakap bahasa Inggeris dengan penuh yakin.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>1058.2,'end_time'=>1059.86,'target_text'=>'Join today in the description.','source_text'=>'Sertai hari ini melalui pautan di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>1059.96,'end_time'=>1062.3,'target_text'=>'That just means it\'s raining very heavily.','source_text'=>'Ungkapan itu bermaksud hujan turun dengan sangat lebat.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>1062.4,'end_time'=>1067.54,'target_text'=>'So, next time it\'s raining very, very, very hard say it\'s raining cats and dogs.','source_text'=>'Jadi, lain kali kalau hujan teramat lebat sebutlah \'it\'s raining cats and dogs\'.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>1067.64,'end_time'=>1068.58,'target_text'=>'So, what is it?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa benda tu?','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>1068.68,'end_time'=>1069.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s rain.','source_text'=>'Itu hujan.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>1069.8,'end_time'=>1070.74,'target_text'=>'And it\'s raining.','source_text'=>'Dan hari sedang hujan.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>1070.84,'end_time'=>1072.5,'target_text'=>'How does it feel?','source_text'=>'Macam mana rasanya?','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>1072.6,'end_time'=>1075.02,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t feel very good because you feel wet.','source_text'=>'Rasa tak berapa selesa sebab badan basah.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>1075.12,'end_time'=>1077.66,'target_text'=>'So, it feels uncomfortable and wet.','source_text'=>'Jadi, rasanya rimas dan basah.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>1077.76,'end_time'=>1078.5,'target_text'=>'What do you hear?','source_text'=>'Apa yang anda dengar?','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>1078.6,'end_time'=>1081.54,'target_text'=>'All you hear is just the sound of rain when it\'s raining.','source_text'=>'Bila hujan, apa yang anda dengar cuma deruan bunyi hujan.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>1081.64,'end_time'=>1084.62,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of hard to hear anything else, especially when it\'s pouring rain.','source_text'=>'Agak susah nak dengar bunyi lain, terutamanya bila hujan mencurah-curah lebat.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>1084.72,'end_time'=>1086.94,'target_text'=>'As we walk over here, you\'ll be able to see the city.','source_text'=>'Bila kita jalan ke sebelah sini, anda akan dapat lihat pemandangan bandar.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>1087.04,'end_time'=>1089.98,'target_text'=>'So, right now we\'re in a park in the middle of the city.','source_text'=>'Sekarang ini kita berada di taman rekreasi di tengah-tengah pusat bandar.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>1090.08,'end_time'=>1095.06,'target_text'=>'Just over there, you can see very tall office buildings and apartment buildings.','source_text'=>'Tepat di sebelah sana, anda boleh nampak bangunan pejabat dan blok pangsapuri yang amat tinggi.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>1095.16,'end_time'=>1098.9,'target_text'=>'Well, that\'s Central Building is the main train station here.','source_text'=>'Bangunan stesen Sentral di sana itu stesen kereta api utama di sini.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>1099,'end_time'=>1099.62,'target_text'=>'Oh, is it?','source_text'=>'Oh, ya ke?','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>1099.72,'end_time'=>1100.66,'target_text'=>'Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>1100.76,'end_time'=>1102.02,'target_text'=>'So, is that where we arrived?','source_text'=>'Maksudnya di situlah tempat kita sampai dulu?','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>1102.12,'end_time'=>1103.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s where we arrived, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, di situlah kita mula-mula tiba.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>1103.76,'end_time'=>1105.74,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, you can see some banks.','source_text'=>'Jadi di sana anda boleh nampak beberapa buah bank.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>1105.84,'end_time'=>1108.06,'target_text'=>'That building, I believe, is a bank, CIMB.','source_text'=>'Bangunan itu saya rasa bangunan bank, bank CIMB.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>1108.16,'end_time'=>1110.3,'target_text'=>'There\'s also Hilton, which is a hotel [music] chain.','source_text'=>'Ada juga hotel Hilton, iaitu sebuah rangkaian hotel antarabangsa.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>1110.4,'end_time'=>1113.18,'target_text'=>'And to the left there, it looks like there are some apartments.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah kiri sana, kelihatan beberapa bangunan pangsapuri.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>1113.28,'end_time'=>1119.34,'target_text'=>'So, it would kind of be nice to stay in this area because you have this beautiful, beautiful park just very close to where','source_text'=>'Memang seronok kalau dapat tinggal di kawasan ini sebab taman yang begitu indah ini terletak betul-betul dekat dengan tempat','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>1119.44,'end_time'=>1120.02,'target_text'=>'you\'re staying.','source_text'=>'anda menginap.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>1120.12,'end_time'=>1126.38,'target_text'=>'And if you work in one of those buildings, you have a nice view and you could come and relax after hard day\'s work or you','source_text'=>'Dan kalau anda bekerja di salah satu menara itu, anda dapat pemandangan cantik dan boleh datang berehat selepas seharian penat bekerja, atau','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>1126.48,'end_time'=>1129.02,'target_text'=>'can just come during your break and relax.','source_text'=>'anda boleh datang santai-santai semasa waktu rehat.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>1129.12,'end_time'=>1130.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it\'s a nice area to stay.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang kawasan yang menarik untuk didiami.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>1130.84,'end_time'=>1132.98,'target_text'=>'I think there are a lot of apartments, too.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa memang banyak unit pangsapuri di sekitar sini.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>1133.08,'end_time'=>1135.74,'target_text'=>'Yeah, it feels a lot, lot cooler here now.','source_text'=>'Ya, sekarang suasana di sini terasa jauh lebih sejuk dan nyaman.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>1135.84,'end_time'=>1136.74,'target_text'=>'I like this.','source_text'=>'Saya suka suasana macam ni.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>1136.84,'end_time'=>1139.62,'target_text'=>'I always like coming to parks in different cities.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka berkunjung ke taman-taman rekreasi di pelbagai bandar.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>1139.72,'end_time'=>1145.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s a nice experience to see see how people enjoy nature even while living in a city.','source_text'=>'Satu pengalaman menarik melihat bagaimana penduduk menikmati alam semula jadi walaupun menetap di kota metropolitan.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1145.6,'end_time'=>1147.34,'target_text'=>'Here we have some boats you can rent.','source_text'=>'Di sini ada bot-bot yang boleh anda sewa.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1147.44,'end_time'=>1148.38,'target_text'=>'Woah.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1148.48,'end_time'=>1149.66,'target_text'=>'Look at all these fish.','source_text'=>'Tengoklah ikan-ikan ni semua.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1149.76,'end_time'=>1151.26,'target_text'=>'And there are some fish.','source_text'=>'Dan ada banyak ikan di sini.','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1151.36,'end_time'=>1152.5,'target_text'=>'So, what would you say?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa yang anda akan katakan?','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1152.6,'end_time'=>1157.34,'target_text'=>'Would you say there are fish in the water or there is fish in the water?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda kata \'there are fish in the water\' atau \'there is fish in the water\'?','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1157.44,'end_time'=>1158.1,'target_text'=>'What would you say?','source_text'=>'Mana satu yang anda sebut?','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1158.2,'end_time'=>1160.18,'target_text'=>'There are fish in the water.','source_text'=>'\'There are fish in the water\'.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1160.28,'end_time'=>1160.68,'target_text'=>'Correct.','source_text'=>'Tepat sekali.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1160.72,'end_time'=>1162.38,'target_text'=>'There are fish in the water.','source_text'=>'\'There are fish in the water\'.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1162.48,'end_time'=>1167.74,'target_text'=>'If you wanted to emphasize even more, you can say there are a lot of fish in the water.','source_text'=>'Kalau nak tekankan jumlahnya dengan lebih jelas, anda boleh kata \'there are a lot of fish in the water\'.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1167.84,'end_time'=>1169.58,'target_text'=>'I wonder if you\'re allowed to fish in here.','source_text'=>'Saya tertanya-tanya boleh ke memancing ikan dekat sini.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1169.68,'end_time'=>1172.98,'target_text'=>'Uh I haven\'t seen any signs that say no fishing.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nampak pula apa-apa papan tanda larangan memancing.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1173.08,'end_time'=>1175.34,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s end this video with some speaking practice.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, mari kita akhiri video ini dengan sedikit latihan bertutur.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1175.44,'end_time'=>1179.98,'target_text'=>'Look out on this lake and the park and I will ask you questions.','source_text'=>'Pandang ke arah tasik dan taman ini, dan saya akan ajukan beberapa soalan kepada anda.','order'=>393],
