            ['start_time'=>1238.84,'end_time'=>1241.38,'target_text'=>'But what I don\'t like [music] is like snakes.','source_text'=>'Tapi apa yang saya tak suka adalah haiwan seperti ular.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1241.48,'end_time'=>1245.98,'target_text'=>'I just think instantly it\'s venomous, which is probably, you know, cuz it\'s so cold.','source_text'=>'Saya terus fikir ia berbisa... sebab cuaca sangat sejuk.','order'=>418],
