        foreach ([
            ['start_time'=>0,'end_time'=>1.74,'target_text'=>'Welcome back to a new video, guys.','source_text'=>'Selamat kembali ke video baru semua.','order'=>1],
            ['start_time'=>1.84,'end_time'=>5.26,'target_text'=>'Today, we have another slow English vlog.','source_text'=>'Hari ini kita ada lagi satu vlog bahasa Inggeris perlahan (slow English).','order'=>2],
            ['start_time'=>5.36,'end_time'=>8.66,'target_text'=>'I\'ll be describing everything I see and hear today.','source_text'=>'Saya akan ceritakan semua yang saya lihat dan dengar sepanjang hari ini.','order'=>3],
            ['start_time'=>8.76,'end_time'=>16.9,'target_text'=>'We\'ll be visiting the National Museum here in Jakarta, Indonesia, and we\'ll also be having conversations in slow English so','source_text'=>'Kita akan melawat Muzium Nasional di Jakarta, Indonesia, dan berbual santai dalam bahasa Inggeris perlahan supaya','order'=>4],
            ['start_time'=>17,'end_time'=>19.02,'target_text'=>'you guys can understand everything.','source_text'=>'anda semua boleh faham setiap butir perkataan.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>19.12,'end_time'=>28.62,'target_text'=>'This video is part of my 3,000 most common English words series designed to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Video ini adalah sebahagian siri 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya untuk bantu anda faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian.','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>28.72,'end_time'=>32.42,'target_text'=>'If you guys want to get the PDF with all 3,000 words, it\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda nak dapatkan PDF senarai 3,000 perkataan itu, pautannya ada di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>32.52,'end_time'=>35.86,'target_text'=>'Whirlpool, old, exhibition, carpet, marble, right?','source_text'=>'Pusaran air, lama, pameran, karpet, marmar, kan?','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>35.96,'end_time'=>43.94,'target_text'=>'However, tombstones, texture, hot, watering, skull, herbs, mud, tall, rug is Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Walau bagaimanapun, batu nisan, tekstur, panas, menyiram, tengkorak, herba, lumpur, tinggi, permaidani... Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>44.04,'end_time'=>47.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, so this is the entrance of the museum right there.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, jadi inilah pintu masuk muzium di sebelah sana.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>47.32,'end_time'=>51.82,'target_text'=>'You can see that is an underground car park, and over here is the entrance.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak itu tempat letak kereta bawah tanah, dan di sebelah sini pula pintu masuknya.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>51.92,'end_time'=>53.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, what do you call that?','source_text'=>'Ya, apa yang anda panggil benda tu?','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>54.04,'end_time'=>58.38,'target_text'=>'So this is called a column, and those right there are also called columns.','source_text'=>'Yang ini dipanggil tiang (column), dan tiang-tiang di sebelah sana pun dipanggil benda yang sama.','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>58.48,'end_time'=>61.06,'target_text'=>'That\'s just kind of support the structure above it.','source_text'=>'Fungsinya adalah untuk menyokong struktur binaan di atasnya.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>61.16,'end_time'=>64.9,'target_text'=>'So in this case, it\'s like a roof, and in this case, it\'s also kind of like a roof.','source_text'=>'Macam dalam situasi ini ia sokong bumbung, dan di sebelah sini pun nampaknya sokong bumbung juga.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>65,'end_time'=>70.22,'target_text'=>'What if they had columns like that, but they didn\'t lift anything, or they weren\'t structural?','source_text'=>'Macam mana pula kalau ada binaan tiang begitu tapi tak sokong apa-apa beban, cuma untuk hiasan?','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>70.32,'end_time'=>73.06,'target_text'=>'If it\'s more for like design and looks, a better term would be a pillar.','source_text'=>'Kalau ia lebih kepada rekaan dan rupa estetik, istilah yang lebih tepat ialah \'pillar\' (tiang seri/hiasan).','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>73.16,'end_time'=>78.46,'target_text'=>'But columns and pillars are both that vertical structure that supports something.','source_text'=>'Tapi kedua-dua \'column\' dan \'pillar\' adalah struktur tegak yang menyokong sesuatu binaan.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>78.56,'end_time'=>80.14,'target_text'=>'Columns and pillars.','source_text'=>'\'Columns\' dan \'pillars\'.','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>80.24,'end_time'=>87.34,'target_text'=>'If you want to learn faster and go deeper than the video, then get the workbook on my website, vulcaenglish.com.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda nak belajar lebih cepat dan mendalam, dapatkan buku latihan di laman web saya, vocaenglish.com.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>87.44,'end_time'=>96.22,'target_text'=>'The workbook explains everything in greater detail and comes with exercises to help you learn new vocabulary, grammar, tenses,','source_text'=>'Buku latihan ini menghuraikan semuanya secara terperinci bersama latihan untuk kuasai kosa kata, tatabahasa, bentuk masa (tenses),','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>96.32,'end_time'=>101.98,'target_text'=>'sentence patterns, comprehension, and real English you can actually use.','source_text'=>'pola ayat, pemahaman, serta bahasa Inggeris praktikal yang boleh digunakan terus.','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>102.08,'end_time'=>108.42,'target_text'=>'I also have workbooks for past videos, so you can keep practicing and improving every lesson.','source_text'=>'Saya juga sediakan buku latihan untuk video-video sebelum ini supaya anda boleh terus mengulang kaji dan maju.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>108.52,'end_time'=>111.5,'target_text'=>'Click the link in my description to get the workbooks.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk dapatkan buku-buku latihan tersebut.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>111.6,'end_time'=>115.34,'target_text'=>'But now we\'re going to head into the entrance of the museum to buy our tickets.','source_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita melangkah ke pintu masuk muzium untuk beli tiket.','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>115.44,'end_time'=>117.54,'target_text'=>'We\'re going to walk down these stairs.','source_text'=>'Kita akan menuruni anak tangga ini.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>117.64,'end_time'=>120.82,'target_text'=>'We are not walking fast and we are not walking slow.','source_text'=>'Kita tak jalan laju, dan kita pun tak jalan terlalu perlahan.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>120.92,'end_time'=>123.42,'target_text'=>'We\'re walking at a normal pace.','source_text'=>'Kita melangkah pada kelajuan biasa yang santai.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>123.52,'end_time'=>127,'target_text'=>'How would you describe these stairs?','source_text'=>'Macam mana anda nak gambarkan tangga ini?','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>127.28,'end_time'=>130.18,'target_text'=>'To me, look a little bit old, don\'t they?','source_text'=>'Bagi saya, nampak macam dah agak lama, kan?','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>130.28,'end_time'=>132.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they\'ve definitely been here for a couple years.','source_text'=>'Ya, tangga ini memang dah bertahun-tahun lamanya di sini.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>133.08,'end_time'=>134.54,'target_text'=>'>> How else would you describe them?','source_text'=>'Macam mana lagi awak nak gambarkannya?','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>134.64,'end_time'=>135.78,'target_text'=>'What\'s one other thing?','source_text'=>'Apa lagi satu ciri dia?','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>135.88,'end_time'=>138.18,'target_text'=>'>> I would describe these as textured.','source_text'=>'Saya akan gambarkan permukaannya bertekstur (textured).','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>138.28,'end_time'=>144.9,'target_text'=>'They are not slippery and even if it rains, you won\'t slip on them because they are textured.','source_text'=>'Ia tak licin, dan walaupun hujan turun, anda takkan tergelincir sebab permukaannya bertekstur kasar.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>145,'end_time'=>146.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they are textured.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang ada tekstur kasar.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>146.4,'end_time'=>148.54,'target_text'=>'They\'re not completely smooth and they\'re not perfect.','source_text'=>'Permukaannya tak rata licin dan ada sedikit kecacatan.','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>148.64,'end_time'=>152.14,'target_text'=>'There are grooves in them, bumps and other imperfections.','source_text'=>'Ada lurah, bonggol-bonggol kecil dan permukaan yang tak sekata.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>152.24,'end_time'=>157.86,'target_text'=>'I would also say they\'re a little dirty because of the bird poop, but it doesn\'t really matter since these stairs are outdoors.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia agak kotor sedikit sebab ada tahi burung, tapi tak kisah sangat sebab tangga ini di luar bangunan.','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>157.96,'end_time'=>162.38,'target_text'=>'So, doesn\'t matter if they are dirty because you\'ll be only standing on them with your outdoor shoes.','source_text'=>'Jadi tak mengapa kalau kotor sedikit pun sebab kita cuma pijak dengan kasut luar kita.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>162.48,'end_time'=>168.06,'target_text'=>'However, some people might sit down on them and then get their butt dirty, but that\'s not a big deal.','source_text'=>'Walau bagaimanapun, kalau ada yang duduk di atas tangga ni seluar mereka boleh kotor, tapi tiada masalah besar.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>168.16,'end_time'=>170.86,'target_text'=>'But now, we\'re walking into the entrance of the museum.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita melangkah masuk ke pintu masuk muzium.','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>170.96,'end_time'=>172.5,'target_text'=>'Hopefully, they let us film.','source_text'=>'Harap-harap mereka benarkan kita rakam video.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>172.6,'end_time'=>174.66,'target_text'=>'If not, we\'ll just have to go somewhere else.','source_text'=>'Kalau tak boleh, terpaksa lah kita pergi ke tempat lain.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>174.76,'end_time'=>175.9,'target_text'=>'>> Are we getting the tickets now?','source_text'=>'Kita nak beli tiket sekarang ke?','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>176,'end_time'=>179.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so now I\'m going to purchase the tickets at this kiosk.','source_text'=>'Ya, sekarang saya nak beli tiket di mesin kios ini.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>179.44,'end_time'=>181.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to select English.','source_text'=>'Saya akan pilih bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>181.76,'end_time'=>183.5,'target_text'=>'Uh It\'s not in English.','source_text'=>'Eh, tak keluar bahasa Inggeris pun.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>183.6,'end_time'=>185.7,'target_text'=>'Oh, foreign tourist.','source_text'=>'Oh, pelancong asing (foreign tourist).','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>185.8,'end_time'=>186.38,'target_text'=>'Foreign tourist.','source_text'=>'Pelancong asing.','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>186.48,'end_time'=>188.18,'target_text'=>'That\'s like 20 bucks.','source_text'=>'Kira-kira 20 dolar tu.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>188.28,'end_time'=>190.06,'target_text'=>'>> 12 12 each?','source_text'=>'12 dolar seorang?','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>190.16,'end_time'=>190.82,'target_text'=>'>> 12 each?','source_text'=>'12 dolar seorang?','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>190.92,'end_time'=>194.64,'target_text'=>'Okay, we bought two tickets, foreigners.','source_text'=>'Okey, kita dah beli dua keping tiket untuk warga asing.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>194.76,'end_time'=>201.3,'target_text'=>'>> This is pretty normal in uh like Southeast Asia and South America where they have local pricing and tourist pricing, right?','source_text'=>'Benda ni perkara biasa di Asia Tenggara dan Amerika Selatan, ada harga warga tempatan dan harga pelancong kan?','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>201.4,'end_time'=>202.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I mean it mean it makes sense.','source_text'=>'Ya, memang logik pun.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>202.96,'end_time'=>208.94,'target_text'=>'Like, tourists usually have like a higher ability to pay, but yeah, that\'s like 24.20 Canadian dollars.','source_text'=>'Pelancong biasanya ada kemampuan membayar yang lebih tinggi, jumlahnya sekitar 24.20 dolar Kanada.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>209.04,'end_time'=>209.78,'target_text'=>'>> Successful?','source_text'=>'Berjaya ke?','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>209.88,'end_time'=>211.1,'target_text'=>'>> Sir.','source_text'=>'Encik.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>211.2,'end_time'=>213.16,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>213.68,'end_time'=>214.3,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>214.4,'end_time'=>214.94,'target_text'=>'Okay, perfect.','source_text'=>'Okey, terbaik.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>215.04,'end_time'=>215.44,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>215.48,'end_time'=>216.54,'target_text'=>'Thank you very much.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih banyak-banyak.','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>216.64,'end_time'=>217.74,'target_text'=>'>> Just happened.','source_text'=>'Apa yang berlaku tadi.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>217.84,'end_time'=>221.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so they just put these bracelets on us so that they know we paid.','source_text'=>'Ya, mereka pakaikan gelang tangan ini supaya mereka tahu kita dah bayar.','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>221.72,'end_time'=>222.98,'target_text'=>'>> And they gave us a guidebook.','source_text'=>'Dan mereka beri kita buku panduan.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>223.08,'end_time'=>228.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and this uh QR code on this receipt is used to scan into the gates here.','source_text'=>'Ya, dan kod QR pada resit ini digunakan untuk imbas masuk di pintu pagar sini.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>228.28,'end_time'=>230.46,'target_text'=>'So, we scan in and then we can see the museum.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita imbas dulu, lepas tu barulah boleh tengok muzium.','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>230.56,'end_time'=>233.02,'target_text'=>'It\'s surprising cuz the one in Korea free.','source_text'=>'Menarik juga sebab muzium di Korea masuk percuma.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>233.12,'end_time'=>233.32,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>233.32,'end_time'=>234.86,'target_text'=>'>> And that\'s a huge museum, too.','source_text'=>'Padahal muzium di Korea tu sangat besar saiznya.','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>234.96,'end_time'=>237.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I\'ll give you yours and I\'ll scan it here.','source_text'=>'Ya, nah ambil tiket awak dan saya imbas di sini.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>237.32,'end_time'=>241.26,'target_text'=>'All right, so we just scanned in with this QR code and now we\'re going to go see the museum.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kita baru lepas imbas kod QR dan sekarang kita nak pergi teroka muzium.','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>241.36,'end_time'=>247.26,'target_text'=>'I think this museum is big, but as I was saying right out there, the National Museum of Korea is actually free, which is surprising','source_text'=>'Saya rasa muzium ini luas, tapi macam yang saya sebut di luar tadi, Muzium Negara Korea masuk percuma, agak mengejutkan','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>247.36,'end_time'=>250.42,'target_text'=>'cuz when we went there I was expecting to pay, but it was free.','source_text'=>'sebab masa kami pergi sana saya sangka kena bayar, rupa-rupanya percuma.','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>250.52,'end_time'=>252.14,'target_text'=>'This one makes sense, $12.','source_text'=>'Yang ini berpatutanlah, 12 dolar.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>252.24,'end_time'=>254.54,'target_text'=>'>> Korea is like a different country, too, cuz >> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Korea negara yang berbeza persekitarannya juga >> Ya.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>254.64,'end_time'=>259.22,'target_text'=>'>> Actually, now that I think about it, most national museums I\'ve had to pay, even in like Japan.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya bila fikir balik, kebanyakan muzium negara memang kena bayar tiket, termasuklah di Jepun.','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>259.32,'end_time'=>259.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah.','source_text'=>'Oh, ya betul.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>259.84,'end_time'=>261.5,'target_text'=>'>> In Canada you have to pay everywhere, dude.','source_text'=>'Di Kanada di mana-mana pun kena bayar, kawan.','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>261.6,'end_time'=>262.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so >> None of that\'s free.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul >> Tak ada satu pun yang percuma.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>262.68,'end_time'=>264.86,'target_text'=>'>> Korea is just like a exception.','source_text'=>'Korea tu sekadar pengecualian saja.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>264.96,'end_time'=>265.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>265.52,'end_time'=>267.42,'target_text'=>'Well, it\'s nice and that museum is really nice, too.','source_text'=>'Memang bagus, dan muzium di sana pun sangat cantik.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>267.52,'end_time'=>272.5,'target_text'=>'People that are from here, it\'s only like three, four dollars, four dollars, so not that bad.','source_text'=>'Bagi penduduk tempatan sini tiketnya cuma tiga empat dolar saja, jadi taklah mahal.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>272.6,'end_time'=>272.96,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>272.96,'end_time'=>274.46,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, where do we want to go first?','source_text'=>'Okey, kita nak pergi mana dulu?','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>274.56,'end_time'=>276.38,'target_text'=>'Early history, that shoe box.','source_text'=>'Sejarah awal, bilik macam kotak kasut tu.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>276.48,'end_time'=>278.62,'target_text'=>'>> Early history is usually some of the nicer stuff.','source_text'=>'Bahagian sejarah awal biasanya ada barang-barang yang paling menarik.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>278.72,'end_time'=>281.02,'target_text'=>'>> an immersive experience, immersify.','source_text'=>'Pengalaman mengasyikkan, \'immersify\'.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>281.12,'end_time'=>283.78,'target_text'=>'That was There was this in Kuala Lumpur as well.','source_text'=>'Benda ni ada juga di Kuala Lumpur dulu.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>283.88,'end_time'=>288.82,'target_text'=>'>> No, that\'s the word for immersive in uh Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Bukan, itu perkataan untuk \'imersif\' dalam bahasa Indonesia.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>288.92,'end_time'=>290.3,'target_text'=>'>> Cut that out, cut that out.','source_text'=>'Potong babak tu, potong babak tu.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>290.4,'end_time'=>292.22,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, they have some guided tours as well.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada juga lawatan berpandu disediakan.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>292.32,'end_time'=>292.72,'target_text'=>'>> Really?','source_text'=>'Betul ke?','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>292.72,'end_time'=>295.58,'target_text'=>'>> But there\'s only a few in English and two in Japanese.','source_text'=>'Tapi cuma ada beberapa dalam bahasa Inggeris dan dua sesi dalam bahasa Jepun.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>295.68,'end_time'=>298.1,'target_text'=>'>> This is the days of the week and then they\'re only at 10:00 a.m.','source_text'=>'Ini hari-harinya dan jadualnya cuma pada pukul 10 pagi.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>298.2,'end_time'=>299.34,'target_text'=>'>> Except for this one.','source_text'=>'Kecuali yang ini.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>299.44,'end_time'=>300.3,'target_text'=>'>> Well, that one\'s at 1:30.','source_text'=>'Yang tu pula pukul 1:30 petang.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>300.4,'end_time'=>300.8,'target_text'=>'Oh, wait.','source_text'=>'Eh, sekejap.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>300.84,'end_time'=>301.78,'target_text'=>'>> No, today\'s Wednesday.','source_text'=>'Eh, hari ini hari Rabu.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>301.88,'end_time'=>302.54,'target_text'=>'>> Wednesday.','source_text'=>'Hari Rabu.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>302.64,'end_time'=>312.26,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95% of everyday English.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya dan pelajari kosa kata yang bantu anda faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>312.36,'end_time'=>322.66,'target_text'=>'It includes real definitions, real example sentences for every meaning, and everything is organized by CEFR level and topic.','source_text'=>'Ia mengandungi maksud sebenar, contoh ayat untuk setiap maksud, dan disusun rapi mengikut tahap CEFR serta topik.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>322.76,'end_time'=>324.7,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk memilikinya.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>324.8,'end_time'=>328.58,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this museum so far, like this big area?','source_text'=>'Macam mana awak nak gambarkan muzium ini setakat ni, terutamanya kawasan lapang yang besar ni?','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>328.68,'end_time'=>332.66,'target_text'=>'>> Honestly, this center area feels super grand.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, ruang tengah ini terasa sangat megah dan gah.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>332.76,'end_time'=>333.62,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s huge, isn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Sangat besar, kan?','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>333.72,'end_time'=>336.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s like the ceiling is very, very high.','source_text'=>'Silingnya sangat-sangat tinggi.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>336.36,'end_time'=>337.22,'target_text'=>'Very high ceilings.','source_text'=>'Siling yang amat tinggi.','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>337.32,'end_time'=>338.26,'target_text'=>'You could look up.','source_text'=>'Bila dongak ke atas nampak saujana.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>338.36,'end_time'=>343.7,'target_text'=>'>> But I was a little confused because that white building with the pillars, I thought that that was the main entrance to','source_text'=>'Tapi tadi saya agak keliru sebab bangunan putih bertiang tu, saya sangka itulah pintu masuk utama ke','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>343.8,'end_time'=>344.42,'target_text'=>'the museum.','source_text'=>'dalam muzium.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>344.52,'end_time'=>345.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, me too.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pun sama.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>345.24,'end_time'=>348.42,'target_text'=>'I guess that\'s like an area of the museum.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu salah satu bahagian dalam kawasan muzium ini.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>348.52,'end_time'=>352.3,'target_text'=>'This the type of floor that we\'re standing on, this is called carpet.','source_text'=>'Jenis lantai yang kita sedang pijak ini dipanggil karpet (carpet).','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>352.4,'end_time'=>353.26,'target_text'=>'This is carpet.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah karpet.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>353.36,'end_time'=>354.58,'target_text'=>'Carpet is just a material.','source_text'=>'Karpet ialah sejenis bahan pelapik lantai.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>354.68,'end_time'=>357.86,'target_text'=>'There are different types of materials you can use as flooring.','source_text'=>'Ada bermacam jenis bahan yang boleh digunakan untuk lantai.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>357.96,'end_time'=>360.46,'target_text'=>'For example, there you can see it\'s stone.','source_text'=>'Contohnya, di sebelah sana anda boleh nampak ia daripada batu.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>360.56,'end_time'=>361.74,'target_text'=>'Stone.','source_text'=>'Batu (Stone).','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>361.84,'end_time'=>367.58,'target_text'=>'But you can also have hardwood floors or tiles, carpet, stone, cement.','source_text'=>'Tapi anda juga boleh guna lantai kayu keras, jubin, karpet, batu atau simen.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>367.68,'end_time'=>371.86,'target_text'=>'There are a lot of different types of materials, but this specifically is carpet.','source_text'=>'Banyak jenis bahan yang ada, tetapi yang ini khususnya ialah karpet.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>371.96,'end_time'=>378.34,'target_text'=>'And a rug is similar to a carpet, but a rug is usually a smaller piece that you can move around and put wherever you want.','source_text'=>'Dan \'rug\' (permaidani kecil) serupa macam karpet, tapi ia kepingan kecil yang boleh dialih ke mana-mana saja.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>378.44,'end_time'=>382.3,'target_text'=>'But a carpet is usually wall-to-wall or covers the entire surface of the floor.','source_text'=>'Tetapi karpet biasanya dipasang dari dinding ke dinding menutupi seluruh lantai.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>382.4,'end_time'=>383.42,'target_text'=>'A rug doesn\'t.','source_text'=>'\'Rug\' pula tidak menutupi seluruh ruang.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>383.52,'end_time'=>385.26,'target_text'=>'Carpet and rug.','source_text'=>'\'Carpet\' dan \'rug\'.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>385.36,'end_time'=>387.66,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s go into the museum and check it out.','source_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita masuk ke dalam muzium dan lihat apa yang ada.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>387.76,'end_time'=>391.22,'target_text'=>'Okay, this is a mammoth skeleton a skeleton.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, ini rangka mamot, sebuah rangka fosil (skeleton).','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>391.32,'end_time'=>395.02,'target_text'=>'And this right here and that one behind it, those are the skulls.','source_text'=>'Dan bahagian di sini serta di belakangnya itu adalah tengkorak (skulls).','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>395.12,'end_time'=>395.7,'target_text'=>'The skull.','source_text'=>'Tengkorak (skull).','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>395.8,'end_time'=>398.86,'target_text'=>'The skull is >> Look at this animal.','source_text'=>'Tengkorak ialah >> Tengok binatang ini.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>398.96,'end_time'=>402.02,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the skull is this part of a person\'s skeleton.','source_text'=>'Ya, tengkorak ialah bahagian kepala dalam rangka seseorang.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>402.12,'end_time'=>402.98,'target_text'=>'This part right here.','source_text'=>'Bahagian di kepala sini.','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>403.08,'end_time'=>403.9,'target_text'=>'So that\'s a skull.','source_text'=>'Itulah tengkorak.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>404,'end_time'=>406.98,'target_text'=>'And you can see the huge horns of that animal.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak tanduk haiwan itu yang sangat besar.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>407.08,'end_time'=>411.38,'target_text'=>'It looks like some sort of buffalo or or >> that\'s correct.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam sejenis kerbau atau >> ya tepat sekali.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>411.48,'end_time'=>412.26,'target_text'=>'A bison.','source_text'=>'Seekor bison.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>412.36,'end_time'=>413.06,'target_text'=>'>> A water buffalo.','source_text'=>'Kerbau air.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>413.16,'end_time'=>413.58,'target_text'=>'Okay, yeah.','source_text'=>'Okey, ya betul.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>413.68,'end_time'=>417.1,'target_text'=>'So this was a water buffalo back in prehistoric times.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini kerbau air pada zaman prasejarah dahulu.','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>417.2,'end_time'=>418.78,'target_text'=>'This isn\'t in English, eh?','source_text'=>'Penerangan ni bukan dalam bahasa Inggeris ya?','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>418.88,'end_time'=>420.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, none of this is in English.','source_text'=>'Ya, tiada satu pun dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>420.68,'end_time'=>423.26,'target_text'=>'I guess not a lot of English-speaking tourists come here.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya tak ramai pelancong berbahasa Inggeris datang sini.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>423.36,'end_time'=>424.82,'target_text'=>'But you can see the small one.','source_text'=>'Tapi anda boleh lihat tengkorak yang kecil ini.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>424.92,'end_time'=>429.54,'target_text'=>'This looks to be the skull of a deer cuz you can see its antlers.','source_text'=>'Ini nampaknya macam tengkorak rusa sebab ada tanduk bercabang.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>429.64,'end_time'=>431.22,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m trying to figure out what that is.','source_text'=>'Saya sedang cuba teka binatang apa tu.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>431.32,'end_time'=>431.82,'target_text'=>'>> This?','source_text'=>'Yang ini ke?','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>431.92,'end_time'=>432.32,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>432.32,'end_time'=>435.14,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a big horn, so I would assume it\'s like a hippo.','source_text'=>'Tanduknya besar, jadi saya sangka mungkin badak air.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>435.24,'end_time'=>435.94,'target_text'=>'>> No way.','source_text'=>'Mana mungkin.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>436.04,'end_time'=>437.34,'target_text'=>'>> Well, you can see it\'s it\'s mouth.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak bahagian mulutnya.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>437.44,'end_time'=>438.5,'target_text'=>'Oh no, not a horn, sorry.','source_text'=>'Oh bukan tanduk, maaf.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>438.6,'end_time'=>439.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s a tooth.','source_text'=>'Rupa-rupanya itu sebatang gigi.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>439.56,'end_time'=>440.78,'target_text'=>'I would say this is a hippo.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini badak air.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>440.88,'end_time'=>441.7,'target_text'=>'What do you guys think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat anda semua?','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>441.8,'end_time'=>443.5,'target_text'=>'Now let\'s see who is right.','source_text'=>'Sekarang jom kita tengok siapa yang betul.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>443.6,'end_time'=>443.92,'target_text'=>'Yeah, bro.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul kawan.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>443.92,'end_time'=>446.94,'target_text'=>'This is this is definitely a hippopotamus, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ini memang sah seekor badak air (hippopotamus), ya.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>447.04,'end_time'=>449.92,'target_text'=>'Ancient ancient hippopotamus.','source_text'=>'Badak air purba zaman kuno.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>451.28,'end_time'=>451.82,'target_text'=>'>> Interesting.','source_text'=>'Menarik sungguh.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>451.92,'end_time'=>459.38,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just entered another exhibition room, but you can see here this looks like stone and it\'s meant to look like stone.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kita baru saja masuk ke satu lagi bilik pameran, dan di sini nampak macam batu dan memang direka supaya nampak macam batu.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>459.48,'end_time'=>464.14,'target_text'=>'Like this is kind of reminding me of like ancient Egypt and pyramids, but it\'s not.','source_text'=>'Ia mengingatkan saya kepada tamadun Mesir purba dan piramid, tapi sebenarnya bukan.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>464.24,'end_time'=>466.82,'target_text'=>'This is like Styrofoam or some sort of like cardboard.','source_text'=>'Ini cuma macam polisterin atau sejenis kadbod.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>466.92,'end_time'=>467.66,'target_text'=>'>> Feels like foam.','source_text'=>'Terasa macam span busa.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>467.76,'end_time'=>469.3,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s not actually stone.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya bukan batu betul pun.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>469.4,'end_time'=>471.34,'target_text'=>'It just is meant to look like stone.','source_text'=>'Ia cuma dibuat supaya kelihatan macam batu.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>471.44,'end_time'=>472.46,'target_text'=>'It\'s very similar.','source_text'=>'Rupa bentuknya amat mirip.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>472.56,'end_time'=>478.02,'target_text'=>'Here we have some skulls of prehistoric humans, Homo Erectus.','source_text'=>'Di sini kita ada beberapa tengkorak manusia prasejarah, Homo Erectus.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>478.12,'end_time'=>480.54,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, now we know what this means, right?','source_text'=>'Oh, sekarang kita dah tahu apa maksud nombor ni kan?','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>480.64,'end_time'=>481.14,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>481.24,'end_time'=>484.02,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s the volume of the of the skull.','source_text'=>'Ia isi padu ruang tengkorak itu.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>484.12,'end_time'=>485.5,'target_text'=>'>> In cubic centimeters.','source_text'=>'Dalam ukuran sentimeter padu.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>485.6,'end_time'=>486.86,'target_text'=>'>> Cubic centimeters.','source_text'=>'Sentimeter padu.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>486.96,'end_time'=>489.58,'target_text'=>'I I I did not know that.','source_text'=>'Saya... saya langsung tak tahu sebelum ni.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>489.68,'end_time'=>490.66,'target_text'=>'I did not know that.','source_text'=>'Saya memang tak tahu menahu pasal tu.','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>490.76,'end_time'=>493.18,'target_text'=>'This is the skull of a child.','source_text'=>'Ini tengkorak seorang kanak-kanak.','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>493.28,'end_time'=>494.22,'target_text'=>'This is a child\'s skull.','source_text'=>'Ini tengkorak kanak-kanak.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>494.32,'end_time'=>494.68,'target_text'=>'>> Is it?','source_text'=>'Ya ke?','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>494.68,'end_time'=>495.94,'target_text'=>'>> It says child\'s skull.','source_text'=>'Di sini tertulis tengkorak kanak-kanak.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>496.04,'end_time'=>496.98,'target_text'=>'>> How do you What\'s it called?','source_text'=>'Apa nama dia dipanggil?','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>497.08,'end_time'=>500.7,'target_text'=>'The Mojo >> Mojo Kerato child\'s skull.','source_text'=>'Tengkorak kanak-kanak Mojokerto.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>500.8,'end_time'=>501.26,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>501.36,'end_time'=>503.26,'target_text'=>'>> This looks like an adult skull.','source_text'=>'Yang ini nampak macam tengkorak orang dewasa.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>503.36,'end_time'=>503.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s a lot bigger.','source_text'=>'Saiznya jauh lebih besar.','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>503.96,'end_time'=>506.86,'target_text'=>'And you can see the eyebrow like the eyebrow bones.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak tulang keningnya.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>506.96,'end_time'=>511.3,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know the correct term for the bone right where your eyebrow is, but those are huge.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu istilah saintifik untuk tulang kening tu, tapi memang tebal dan besar.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>511.4,'end_time'=>513.3,'target_text'=>'Imagine getting head butted by that.','source_text'=>'Bayangkan kalau kena tanduk kepala dengan orang macam ni.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>513.4,'end_time'=>515.42,'target_text'=>'That thing is big.','source_text'=>'Tulang itu memang besar.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>515.52,'end_time'=>516.58,'target_text'=>'>> sunshade.','source_text'=>'Macam pelindung cahaya matahari.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>516.68,'end_time'=>518.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s like a little little lip.','source_text'=>'Ya, macam bibir bonjolan kecil.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>518.52,'end_time'=>521.78,'target_text'=>'Yeah, but these skulls, how would you describe them?','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi tengkorak-tengkorak ini, macam mana anda nak gambarkannya?','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>521.88,'end_time'=>529.26,'target_text'=>'I would describe these as ancient, delicate, brittle, old, interesting, and one more word.','source_text'=>'Saya akan gambarkannya sebagai purba (ancient), halus, rapuh (brittle), lama, menarik, dan satu lagi perkataan.','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>529.36,'end_time'=>530.42,'target_text'=>'>> Brown.','source_text'=>'Warna perang (brown).','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>530.52,'end_time'=>531.34,'target_text'=>'>> And brown.','source_text'=>'Dan berwarna perang.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>531.44,'end_time'=>532.9,'target_text'=>'Some of them are brown, correct.','source_text'=>'Sebahagian daripadanya berwarna perang, betul.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>533,'end_time'=>536.14,'target_text'=>'How would you guys describe these sculls?','source_text'=>'Macam mana anda semua nak gambarkan tengkorak-tengkorak ini?','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>536.24,'end_time'=>540.54,'target_text'=>'Do you have any other words to describe them with?','source_text'=>'Ada perkataan lain lagi ke yang anda nak guna untuk menggambarkannya?','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>540.64,'end_time'=>544.54,'target_text'=>'At first, I thought these were tombstones, but these are actually just inscriptions.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula tadi saya sangka ini batu nisan, tapi rupa-rupanya ini prasasti (inscriptions).','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>544.64,'end_time'=>547.38,'target_text'=>'So, these are just tablets with writing in them.','source_text'=>'Jadi ini hanyalah batu bersurat yang ada tulisan padanya.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>547.48,'end_time'=>549.18,'target_text'=>'>> So, that\'s what they used before paper?','source_text'=>'Jadi inilah yang mereka guna sebelum wujudnya kertas?','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>549.28,'end_time'=>553.62,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they like carved like writing into these stones, so inscriptions.','source_text'=>'Ya, mereka pahat tulisan ke atas batu, jadi dipanggil prasasti batu bersurat.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>553.72,'end_time'=>556.06,'target_text'=>'But they look very similar to tombstones, don\'t they?','source_text'=>'Tapi rupanya sangat mirip macam batu nisan, kan?','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>556.16,'end_time'=>558.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, especially like the ones that are standing straight up.','source_text'=>'Ya, terutamanya batu yang terpacak tegak macam tu.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>558.32,'end_time'=>561.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, the C 1 get her inscription.','source_text'=>'Ya, Prasasti Ciaruteun.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>562,'end_time'=>564.94,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this literally looks very similar to a tombstone, but it\'s not.','source_text'=>'Ya, batu ini memang nampak macam batu nisan, tapi sebenarnya bukan.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>565.04,'end_time'=>566.86,'target_text'=>'You can see the writing on there.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak ada tulisan terpahat di situ.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>566.96,'end_time'=>568.7,'target_text'=>'>> Well, tombstones have writing on them, too.','source_text'=>'Batu nisan pun ada tulisan juga.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>568.8,'end_time'=>574.9,'target_text'=>'>> But this has like a lot like they\'re trying to like tell you something, you know, like the 10 Commandments or something.','source_text'=>'Tapi yang ini tulisannya banyak, macam cuba sampaikan perutusan penting macam Sepuluh Perintah Tuhan ke apa.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>575,'end_time'=>582.9,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we just left the first few exhibition halls and here you can see this is where the rest of the halls are and this','source_text'=>'Baiklah, kita baru saja keluar dari beberapa dewan pameran pertama dan di sini anda boleh lihat sambungan dewan-dewan lain, dan di sebelah','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>583,'end_time'=>586.42,'target_text'=>'right here is just a sign of things that you can do and can\'t do.','source_text'=>'sini pula ada papan tanda peraturan perkara yang boleh dan tidak boleh dibuat.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>586.52,'end_time'=>589.98,'target_text'=>'And you can see there are a lot more things you cannot do.','source_text'=>'Dan anda boleh nampak jauh lebih banyak larangan berbanding kebenaran.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>590.08,'end_time'=>596.18,'target_text'=>'For example, can\'t touch anything, you can\'t smoke obviously, and you can\'t use flash which honestly makes sense.','source_text'=>'Contohnya dilarang sentuh bahan pameran, dilarang merokok, dan tak boleh guna denyar kamera yang mana memang logik pun.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>596.28,'end_time'=>600.9,'target_text'=>'But over here we have a map of Indonesia Indonesia and we are right here.','source_text'=>'Dan di sebelah sini kita ada peta negara Indonesia, dan kedudukan kita sekarang betul-betul di sini.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>601,'end_time'=>602.1,'target_text'=>'>> Jakarta.','source_text'=>'Di Jakarta.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>602.2,'end_time'=>607.82,'target_text'=>'>> Another very popular place to go in Indonesia is around around here and oh right there, Bali.','source_text'=>'Satu lagi tempat percutian yang sangat popular di Indonesia terletak di sekitar sini, dan oh di situ, Bali.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>607.92,'end_time'=>608.46,'target_text'=>'>> Bali.','source_text'=>'Pulau Bali.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>608.56,'end_time'=>611.14,'target_text'=>'>> What most people think of as Indonesia is Bali.','source_text'=>'Kebanyakan orang bila sebut Indonesia mereka terus teringat Bali.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>611.24,'end_time'=>615.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, most people think of Bali, Indonesia because that\'s just the most popular and famous part.','source_text'=>'Ya, ramai orang cuma kenal Bali, Indonesia sebab itulah tempat yang paling masyhur dan terkenal.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>615.92,'end_time'=>619.9,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s always funny to see people comparing Bali to other beach countries.','source_text'=>'Kelakar juga bila tengok orang bandingkan Bali dengan negara pantai yang lain.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>620,'end_time'=>625.66,'target_text'=>'So they would be like, \"Where do you guys think I should go, Bali or Thailand?\" It\'s like saying, \"Should I go to Bangkok','source_text'=>'Ada yang tanya, \"Korang rasa patut pergi mana, Bali ke Thailand?\" Macam tanya, \"Patut saya pergi Bangkok','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>625.76,'end_time'=>627.06,'target_text'=>'or the Philippines?\" Right?','source_text'=>'atau Filipina?\" kan?','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>627.16,'end_time'=>630.34,'target_text'=>'Like it\'s like comparing a city to a whole country.','source_text'=>'Macam bandingkan sebuah pulau atau bandar dengan sebuah negara penuh.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>630.44,'end_time'=>631.18,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s true.','source_text'=>'Betul juga tu.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>631.28,'end_time'=>631.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s true.','source_text'=>'Memang betul.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>632,'end_time'=>637.5,'target_text'=>'But right now my friend is on this island, Lombok, and he\'s doing a bike tour, 4 days around the whole island.','source_text'=>'Tapi kawan saya sekarang ada di pulau ini, Lombok, dan dia tengah buat jelajah basikal 4 hari pusing seluruh pulau.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>637.6,'end_time'=>639.54,'target_text'=>'Dude, but Indonesia is so big.','source_text'=>'Kawan, hakikatnya Indonesia ini tersangatlah luas.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>639.64,'end_time'=>640.5,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually so big.','source_text'=>'Memang besar gila saiz dia.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>640.6,'end_time'=>644.18,'target_text'=>'Have you seen it like people take Indonesia and put it over like North America?','source_text'=>'Pernah tengok tak orang letak peta Indonesia ditindih atas peta Amerika Utara?','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>644.28,'end_time'=>645.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s like it\'s wider than the states.','source_text'=>'Keluasannya dari hujung ke hujung lebih lebar daripada Amerika Syarikat.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>645.92,'end_time'=>647.02,'target_text'=>'The whole size of North America.','source_text'=>'Hampir menyamai saiz Amerika Utara.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>647.12,'end_time'=>648.14,'target_text'=>'Yeah, even bigger.','source_text'=>'Ya, malah lagi luas.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>648.24,'end_time'=>650.74,'target_text'=>'And the scale is 1 to 1 million.','source_text'=>'Dan skala peta ini 1 nisbah 1 juta.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>650.84,'end_time'=>654.18,'target_text'=>'So time this by a million, that\'s the size of Indonesia.','source_text'=>'Jadi darabkan ukuran ini dengan satu juta, itulah saiz sebenar Indonesia.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>654.28,'end_time'=>657.26,'target_text'=>'Okay, so you can see all these pillars here, all these pillars.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, anda boleh nampak deretan tiang seri di sini, semua tiang-tiang ini.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>657.36,'end_time'=>660.02,'target_text'=>'And when we came in, we came in through there, that was the entrance.','source_text'=>'Dan masa kita masuk tadi, kita masuk ikut sebelah sana, itu pintu masuknya.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>660.12,'end_time'=>665.22,'target_text'=>'But this part\'s blocked off so we can\'t go in here, but this is like a very nice entrance.','source_text'=>'Tapi laluan bahagian ini ditutup jadi kita tak boleh masuk ke sini, walaupun pintu gerbang ini sangat cantik.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>665.32,'end_time'=>666.34,'target_text'=>'Unfortunately, it\'s closed.','source_text'=>'Sayangnya ia ditutup buat masa ini.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>666.44,'end_time'=>670.7,'target_text'=>'Over here, here you can take a closer look at the pillar or the column and it\'s a little dirty.','source_text'=>'Di sini anda boleh lihat tiang ini dari jarak dekat dan ia nampak agak kotor sedikit.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>670.8,'end_time'=>671.82,'target_text'=>'Actually, the whole thing is dirty.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya seluruh tiang ini kotor.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>671.92,'end_time'=>676.86,'target_text'=>'Usually, it\'s just the bottom part that\'s dirty because people touch it all the time, but this one is just dirty from top','source_text'=>'Biasanya bahagian bawah saja yang kotor sebab orang selalu pegang, tapi yang ini kotor dari atas','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>676.96,'end_time'=>677.36,'target_text'=>'to bottom.','source_text'=>'sampai ke bawah.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>677.44,'end_time'=>679.14,'target_text'=>'Or maybe that was the way it was painted.','source_text'=>'Atau mungkin memang catnya dibuat corak begitu.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>679.24,'end_time'=>679.86,'target_text'=>'But let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita teruskan.','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>679.96,'end_time'=>681.66,'target_text'=>'These floors are marble, right?','source_text'=>'Lantai ini dibuat daripada marmar, kan?','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>681.76,'end_time'=>688.1,'target_text'=>'These are marble >> This is another type of material you can use for floors and this material is expensive, marble.','source_text'=>'Ini lantai marmar >> Ini satu lagi jenis bahan untuk lantai dan bahan marmar ini agak mahal.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>688.2,'end_time'=>690.18,'target_text'=>'Here we have wood, wood floors.','source_text'=>'Di sini pula lantai kayu.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>690.28,'end_time'=>693.7,'target_text'=>'This is a statue, statue of >> Ganesh.','source_text'=>'Ini patung arca, arca dewa >> Ganesha.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>693.8,'end_time'=>695.26,'target_text'=>'Ganesha is a Hindu god.','source_text'=>'Ganesha ialah salah satu dewa dalam agama Hindu.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>695.36,'end_time'=>695.9,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>696,'end_time'=>698.46,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really too familiar with the Hindu gods.','source_text'=>'Saya tak berapa mahir sangat dengan dewa-dewa Hindu.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>698.56,'end_time'=>702.54,'target_text'=>'This whole part is uh like Hindu gods or Hindu related.','source_text'=>'Seluruh bahagian pameran ini berkaitan dengan dewa Hindu dan artifak agama Hindu.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>702.64,'end_time'=>703.3,'target_text'=>'>> only recently.','source_text'=>'Cuma kebelakangan ini.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>703.4,'end_time'=>710.38,'target_text'=>'Like in the past, I\'m pretty sure the majority was like Hindu cuz a lot of temples are like Hindu related or a different religion','source_text'=>'Zaman dulu saya rasa sebahagian besar rantau ini beragama Hindu sebab banyak candi bersejarah dibina mengikut tradisi Hindu atau agama lain,','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>710.48,'end_time'=>710.9,'target_text'=>'maybe.','source_text'=>'mungkin Buddha.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>711,'end_time'=>712.54,'target_text'=>'I have to fact check that.','source_text'=>'Saya kena semak fakta sejarah tu balik.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>712.64,'end_time'=>714.26,'target_text'=>'>> Statue of a queen.','source_text'=>'Arca seorang permaisuri.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>714.36,'end_time'=>714.68,'target_text'=>'Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>714.68,'end_time'=>715.3,'target_text'=>'>> Mhm.','source_text'=>'Mhm.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>715.4,'end_time'=>716.58,'target_text'=>'Maybe we should censor that.','source_text'=>'Mungkin bahagian tu kita patut kaburkan.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>716.68,'end_time'=>717.9,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, close your eyes.','source_text'=>'Ya, tutup mata korang.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>718,'end_time'=>721.86,'target_text'=>'You can see these these uh skulls on the bottom of this statue.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak ukiran tengkorak-tengkorak di bahagian bawah arca ini.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>721.96,'end_time'=>725.62,'target_text'=>'This is like kind of giving like god of like death vibes.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam ada kaitan dengan dewa kematian suasananya.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>725.72,'end_time'=>727.82,'target_text'=>'>> Well, it should say somewhere now.','source_text'=>'Mesti ada penerangan bertulis di situ.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>727.92,'end_time'=>730.3,'target_text'=>'>> Says Buddha.','source_text'=>'Tertulis arca Buddha.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>730.4,'end_time'=>733.5,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s talk about how we can describe something.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, mari kita bincangkan bagaimana cara menggambarkan sesuatu benda.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>733.6,'end_time'=>734.66,'target_text'=>'I\'ll start with this.','source_text'=>'Saya mulakan dengan tiang ini.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>734.76,'end_time'=>736.78,'target_text'=>'First, you can say what it is.','source_text'=>'Pertama, sebut apa benda itu.','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>736.88,'end_time'=>738.7,'target_text'=>'This is a pillar.','source_text'=>'\'This is a pillar\' (Ini adalah sebatang tiang).','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>738.8,'end_time'=>741.98,'target_text'=>'Then, you can add some basic details.','source_text'=>'Kemudian, tambahkan butiran asas.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>742.08,'end_time'=>744.46,'target_text'=>'This pillar is white and tall.','source_text'=>'\'This pillar is white and tall\' (Tiang ini berwarna putih dan tinggi).','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>744.56,'end_time'=>746.26,'target_text'=>'It is white and tall.','source_text'=>'Ia putih dan tinggi.','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>746.36,'end_time'=>754.14,'target_text'=>'Some other details you can add are color, size, shape, number, age, and material.','source_text'=>'Butiran lain yang boleh ditambah termasuklah warna, saiz, bentuk, bilangan, usia, dan bahan buatannya.','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>754.24,'end_time'=>757.22,'target_text'=>'The next thing you can do is say where it is.','source_text'=>'Langkah seterusnya ialah nyatakan di mana kedudukannya.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>757.32,'end_time'=>760.94,'target_text'=>'This pillar is on the outside of this square.','source_text'=>'\'This pillar is on the outside of this square\' (Tiang ini berada di luar dataran ini).','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>761.04,'end_time'=>764.46,'target_text'=>'And there are many pillars on the outside of the square.','source_text'=>'Dan ada banyak tiang di bahagian luar dataran.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>764.56,'end_time'=>767.5,'target_text'=>'In some cases, you can say what it is doing.','source_text'=>'Dalam sesetengah keadaan, anda boleh sebut apa fungsinya.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>767.6,'end_time'=>770.42,'target_text'=>'This pillar is just supporting the structure.','source_text'=>'\'This pillar is just supporting the structure\' (Tiang ini menyokong struktur binaan).','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>770.52,'end_time'=>773.86,'target_text'=>'If it was an animal, you can say what the animal is doing.','source_text'=>'Kalau seekor haiwan, anda boleh terangkan apa yang haiwan itu sedang buat.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>773.96,'end_time'=>776.9,'target_text'=>'Then, you can say how it looks or feels.','source_text'=>'Lepas tu, anda boleh sebut rupa atau apa rasa suasananya.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>777,'end_time'=>779.58,'target_text'=>'This pillar feels very stable.','source_text'=>'\'This pillar feels very stable\' (Tiang ini terasa sangat kukuh dan stabil).','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>779.68,'end_time'=>780.54,'target_text'=>'Very stable.','source_text'=>'Sangat kukuh.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>780.64,'end_time'=>783.42,'target_text'=>'So, to describe things, you can just remember this.','source_text'=>'Jadi untuk gambarkan sesuatu, anda cuma perlu ingat formula ini:','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>783.52,'end_time'=>790.82,'target_text'=>'What it is, what does it look like, where it is, what it\'s doing, and what does it feel like or seem like.','source_text'=>'Apakah ia, apa rupanya, di mana kedudukannya, apa yang dibuatnya, dan apa rasa atau gambarannya.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>790.92,'end_time'=>791.58,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>791.68,'end_time'=>797.18,'target_text'=>'Okay, so we\'re in another exhibition hall, and these right here are herbs and spices.','source_text'=>'Baiklah, sekarang kita berada di sebuah lagi dewan pameran, dan di hadapan ini ialah herba dan rempah-ratus.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>797.28,'end_time'=>800.7,'target_text'=>'This is ginger, very popular cooking ingredient.','source_text'=>'Ini halia, bahan masakan yang amat popular.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>800.8,'end_time'=>801.5,'target_text'=>'>> What\'s this?','source_text'=>'Ini apa pula?','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>801.6,'end_time'=>802.74,'target_text'=>'>> Uh root.','source_text'=>'Sejenis akar herba.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>802.84,'end_time'=>809.34,'target_text'=>'And in English, depending on what country you live in and what country you\'re from, you say this word differently.','source_text'=>'Dan dalam bahasa Inggeris, bergantung pada negara mana anda tinggal dan asal usul anda, perkataan ini disebut berbeza.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>809.44,'end_time'=>815.18,'target_text'=>'In some countries, I believe Australia, the UK, and even some parts of Canada, people say herbs.','source_text'=>'Di sesetengah negara seperti Australia, UK, malah sebahagian Kanada, orang sebut \'herbs\' dengan huruf H berbunyi.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>815.28,'end_time'=>817.06,'target_text'=>'They pronounce the whole word herbs.','source_text'=>'Mereka bunyikan huruf H sepenuhnya: \'herbs\'.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>817.16,'end_time'=>817.62,'target_text'=>'Herbs.','source_text'=>'\'Herbs\'.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>817.72,'end_time'=>821.42,'target_text'=>'But, in America and some places in Canada, we say herbs.','source_text'=>'Tetapi di Amerika dan beberapa kawasan di Kanada, kami sebut \'erbs\' tanpa membunyikan huruf H.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>821.52,'end_time'=>822.74,'target_text'=>'So, we don\'t pronounce the H.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami tak bunyikan huruf H.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>822.84,'end_time'=>823.5,'target_text'=>'I\'m not really sure why.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sangat kenapa begitu.','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>823.6,'end_time'=>825.14,'target_text'=>'It\'s kind of weird, but herbs.','source_text'=>'Agak unik bunyinya, disebut \'erbs\'.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>825.24,'end_time'=>826.18,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s new to me.','source_text'=>'Baru saya tahu hari ni.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>826.28,'end_time'=>829.9,'target_text'=>'>> But, you can just say whatever you remember and whatever you\'re comfortable with.','source_text'=>'Tapi anda boleh sebut saja mana-mana yang anda ingat dan selesa.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>830,'end_time'=>831.18,'target_text'=>'Herbs or herbs.','source_text'=>'\'Herbs\' atau \'erbs\'.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>831.28,'end_time'=>832.74,'target_text'=>'People will understand you either way.','source_text'=>'Orang tetap akan faham kedua-dua cara sebutan itu.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>832.84,'end_time'=>833.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s the same word.','source_text'=>'Ia perkataan yang sama.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>833.92,'end_time'=>839.26,'target_text'=>'So, we have now entered another exhibition that is showing us jewelry and gold.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita dah masuk ke pameran lain yang mempamerkan barang kemas dan emas permata.','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>839.36,'end_time'=>843.54,'target_text'=>'Here you can see different types of necklaces that they used to wear.','source_text'=>'Di sini anda boleh lihat pelbagai jenis rantai leher yang pernah dipakai orang zaman dahulu.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>843.64,'end_time'=>847.1,'target_text'=>'This one appears to be gold, but I don\'t think it is actually real gold.','source_text'=>'Yang ini nampak macam emas, tapi saya rasa bukan emas tulen.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>847.2,'end_time'=>848.7,'target_text'=>'Maybe it\'s just gold plated.','source_text'=>'Mungkin cuma saduran emas.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>848.8,'end_time'=>849.82,'target_text'=>'>> It could be real gold.','source_text'=>'Boleh jadi emas tulen.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>849.92,'end_time'=>851.42,'target_text'=>'>> Like, does it look real?','source_text'=>'Pada pandangan awak nampak tulen ke?','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>851.52,'end_time'=>853.38,'target_text'=>'>> But, that looks like a different shade of gold, too.','source_text'=>'Tapi warnanya nampak tona emas yang berbeza sedikit.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>853.48,'end_time'=>853.94,'target_text'=>'So, I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Jadi saya tak tahu lah.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>854.04,'end_time'=>855.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this or that?','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ini atau yang itu?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>855.52,'end_time'=>856.54,'target_text'=>'Those crowns?','source_text'=>'Mahkota-mahkota tu ke?','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>856.64,'end_time'=>858.06,'target_text'=>'That one right there really looks fake.','source_text'=>'Yang sebelah sana tu nampak sangat macam replika tiruan.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>858.16,'end_time'=>860.5,'target_text'=>'That one on the right-hand side, that could look real.','source_text'=>'Yang di sebelah kanan tu nampak macam asli.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>860.6,'end_time'=>861.46,'target_text'=>'>> What about this one?','source_text'=>'Yang ini pula macam mana?','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>861.56,'end_time'=>863.94,'target_text'=>'>> That looks like bronze or like brass.','source_text'=>'Yang tu nampak macam gangsa atau loyang tembaga.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>864.04,'end_time'=>865.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, it is in English, too.','source_text'=>'Oh, ada penerangan bahasa Inggeris juga rupanya.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>865.68,'end_time'=>868.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, it doesn\'t say what it\'s made of.','source_text'=>'Oh, tapi tak ada tulis diperbuat daripada bahan apa.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>868.36,'end_time'=>870.22,'target_text'=>'>> Look at the details on this headpiece.','source_text'=>'Tengok perincian pada hiasan kepala ini.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>870.32,'end_time'=>870.72,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>870.76,'end_time'=>873.74,'target_text'=>'>> There are like many flowers and like different types of ornaments.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak corak bunga dan pelbagai jenis hiasan halus.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>873.84,'end_time'=>876.26,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s got to make a noise when you walk having that.','source_text'=>'Mesti bergemerincing bunyinya bila berjalan pakai mahkota tu.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>876.36,'end_time'=>878.34,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s like a like a crown, no?','source_text'=>'Nampak macam sejenis mahkota kan?','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>878.44,'end_time'=>880.82,'target_text'=>'But, it looks like something a woman would wear, no?','source_text'=>'Tapi rupanya macam perhiasan untuk wanita kan?','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>880.92,'end_time'=>881.98,'target_text'=>'A bride\'s new life.','source_text'=>'\'A bride\'s new life\' (Kehidupan baru pengantin perempuan).','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>882.08,'end_time'=>883.18,'target_text'=>'So, it is for a woman.','source_text'=>'Sah, ia memang untuk wanita.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>883.28,'end_time'=>885.62,'target_text'=>'Kind of has like a feminine feel to it.','source_text'=>'Memang nampak sangat ciri-ciri kewanitaan pada rekaannya.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>885.72,'end_time'=>889.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, all the flowers and >> Yeah, just in the way it like comes down and like earrings.','source_text'=>'Ya, banyak bunga dan >> Ya, cara juntaiannya ke bawah macam anting-anting.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>889.92,'end_time'=>891.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it makes it look like hair.','source_text'=>'Ya, nampak seolah-olah rambut ikal.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>891.6,'end_time'=>892.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya betul.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>892.52,'end_time'=>894.02,'target_text'=>'We are outside of the museum now.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di luar muzium.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>894.12,'end_time'=>897.22,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this area outside the museum, Leon?','source_text'=>'Macam mana awak nak gambarkan kawasan luar muzium ini, Leon?','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>897.32,'end_time'=>901.34,'target_text'=>'>> So, first of all, I don\'t know if you can see on my face, but it is hot out here.','source_text'=>'Pertama sekali, saya tak tahu kalau awak boleh nampak muka saya, tapi cuaca di luar ni panas betul.','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>901.44,'end_time'=>902.22,'target_text'=>'I\'m sweating.','source_text'=>'Peluh saya dah menitik-nitik.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>902.32,'end_time'=>904.42,'target_text'=>'It was a little cloudy when we came in, right?','source_text'=>'Masa kita masuk tadi agak mendung berawan kan?','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>904.52,'end_time'=>905.82,'target_text'=>'But, now it\'s clear.','source_text'=>'Tapi sekarang langit dah cerah terang.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>905.92,'end_time'=>909.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, now there are only a few clouds in the sky, but not very many.','source_text'=>'Ya, sekarang cuma ada beberapa tompok awan di langit, tak banyak pun.','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>910.04,'end_time'=>911.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so it\'s hot out here.','source_text'=>'Ya, jadi di luar ini memang terasa panas terik.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>911.96,'end_time'=>913.06,'target_text'=>'The sky is blue.','source_text'=>'Langit cerah membiru.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>913.16,'end_time'=>916.62,'target_text'=>'There\'s a few clouds, and it is a little bit windy, actually.','source_text'=>'Ada sedikit gumpalan awan, dan sebenarnya ada angin bertiup perlahan.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>916.72,'end_time'=>919.1,'target_text'=>'If we get out of this uh pit area.','source_text'=>'Kalau kita keluar dari kawasan cerun lekuk ini.','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>919.2,'end_time'=>920.66,'target_text'=>'>> There is a slight breeze.','source_text'=>'Ada tiupan angin sepoi-sepoi bahasa.','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>920.76,'end_time'=>923.06,'target_text'=>'But, yeah, Leon was just saying the sky is blue.','source_text'=>'Tapi macam yang Leon katakan tadi, langit cerah membiru.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>923.16,'end_time'=>924.82,'target_text'=>'There are some clouds over there.','source_text'=>'Ada beberapa tompok awan di sebelah sana.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>924.92,'end_time'=>929.14,'target_text'=>'Behind Leon, there are a bunch of trees, and there are also buses.','source_text'=>'Di belakang Leon ada deretan pokok, dan ada juga bas lalu-lalang.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>929.24,'end_time'=>932.22,'target_text'=>'That right there is a bus stop, so there are buses over there.','source_text'=>'Di sana ada perhentian bas, jadi banyak bas berhenti di situ.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>932.32,'end_time'=>941.22,'target_text'=>'This right here on the ground, this part, that is a great a great Here you have a path with stone, and right beside it, you','source_text'=>'Di atas tanah ini, bahagian ini ialah jeriji penutup longkang, di sini laluan berturap batu, dan betul-betul di sebelahnya anda','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>941.32,'end_time'=>943.54,'target_text'=>'can just see grass and a lot of mud.','source_text'=>'boleh nampak rumput dan banyak tompokan selut lumpur.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>943.64,'end_time'=>944.86,'target_text'=>'It\'s very wet here.','source_text'=>'Keadaan di sini agak becak dan basah.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>944.96,'end_time'=>946.62,'target_text'=>'You can see this is mud.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak ini lumpur (mud).','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>946.72,'end_time'=>947.22,'target_text'=>'Mud.','source_text'=>'Lumpur.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>947.32,'end_time'=>950.14,'target_text'=>'This right here is the entrance to the museum.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sini ialah pintu masuk ke muzium.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>950.24,'end_time'=>951.02,'target_text'=>'This is kind of cool.','source_text'=>'Binaan ini nampak menarik dan unik.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>951.12,'end_time'=>953.58,'target_text'=>'It kind of looks like uh >> Like a black hole.','source_text'=>'Rupa bentuknya macam... >> Macam lohong hitam (black hole).','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>953.68,'end_time'=>956.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, like something >> Like uh whirlpool?','source_text'=>'Ya, macam sesuatu >> Macam pusaran air (whirlpool) ke?','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>956.4,'end_time'=>957.5,'target_text'=>'>> Whirlpool, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, pusaran air.','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>957.6,'end_time'=>957.8,'target_text'=>'>> All right.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>957.8,'end_time'=>959.38,'target_text'=>'Sure, I think that\'s probably what it is.','source_text'=>'Betul, saya rasa itulah gambaran konsep arca ini.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>959.48,'end_time'=>959.94,'target_text'=>'>> You think so?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa begitu ke?','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>960.04,'end_time'=>961.66,'target_text'=>'Cuz it looks like they\'re swimming.','source_text'=>'Sebab arca orang tu nampak macam tengah berenang.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>961.76,'end_time'=>963.34,'target_text'=>'>> Or it doesn\'t say whirlpool.','source_text'=>'Pada papan tanda tak tulis perkataan pusaran air pun.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>963.44,'end_time'=>968.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, it\'s like uh something metaphorical, but literally it looks like a whirlpool and people swimming in it.','source_text'=>'Oh, mungkin makna simbolik, tapi secara harfiahnya ia nampak macam pusaran air dengan orang berenang di dalamnya.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>968.68,'end_time'=>973.5,'target_text'=>'>> That reminds me of that uh that ride at West Edmonton Mall water park, the toilet bowl.','source_text'=>'Mengingatkan saya pada permainan air \'mangkuk tandas\' di taman tema West Edmonton Mall.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>973.6,'end_time'=>974.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, yeah, the toilet bowl.','source_text'=>'Oh ya, gelongsor \'toilet bowl\'.','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>974.68,'end_time'=>976.62,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s what the toilet bowl feels like going down.','source_text'=>'Macam tu lah rasa bila meluncur turun dalam mangkuk tu.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>976.72,'end_time'=>978.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s like you\'re being sucked into the middle.','source_text'=>'Rasa macam disedut masuk terus ke tengah pusaran.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>978.36,'end_time'=>978.9,'target_text'=>'>> Literally.','source_text'=>'Sebiji macam tu rasanya.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>979,'end_time'=>981.18,'target_text'=>'And over here, we have the museum.','source_text'=>'Dan di sini kita ada bangunan muzium.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>981.28,'end_time'=>984.26,'target_text'=>'So, this whole part on the outside is the museum.','source_text'=>'Jadi seluruh bahagian luar ini kawasan muzium.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>984.36,'end_time'=>986.26,'target_text'=>'You could see there are some benches there.','source_text'=>'Boleh nampak ada beberapa bangku rehat di situ.','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>986.36,'end_time'=>992.34,'target_text'=>'Right beside the benches, there is a trash bin, a recycling bin, and an organic bin.','source_text'=>'Bersebelahan bangku itu ada tong sampah am, tong kitar semula, dan tong sampah sisa organik.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>992.44,'end_time'=>994.06,'target_text'=>'>> You know what I think that is right there?','source_text'=>'Awak tahu tak pokok apa tu pada pandangan saya?','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>994.16,'end_time'=>995.58,'target_text'=>'I think that\'s a bonsai tree.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa itu pokok bonsai.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>995.68,'end_time'=>996.78,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, you think so?','source_text'=>'Oh, ya ke?','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>996.88,'end_time'=>997.28,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>997.36,'end_time'=>997.76,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe.','source_text'=>'Boleh jadi juga.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>997.84,'end_time'=>1003.22,'target_text'=>'>> It doesn\'t look that well taken care of, but it might just be the species of plant that just grows like that.','source_text'=>'Nampak macam kurang dijaga rapi, tapi mungkin memang spesies tumbuhan itu yang tumbuh macam tu.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>1003.32,'end_time'=>1003.74,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>1003.84,'end_time'=>1010.94,'target_text'=>'>> If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking and pronunciation course that shows you','source_text'=>'Kalau anda serius nak bertutur lancar dalam bahasa Inggeris, saya sediakan kursus pertuturan dan sebutan lengkap yang tunjukkan','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>1011.04,'end_time'=>1013.78,'target_text'=>'exactly what to do step by step.','source_text'=>'dengan tepat apa yang perlu anda buat langkah demi langkah.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>1013.88,'end_time'=>1021.86,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to 80-plus video lessons right away, and I add three to five brand new lessons every week, so you can','source_text'=>'Anda dapat akses serta-merta ke 80 lebih video pelajaran, dan saya tambah tiga hingga lima pelajaran baru setiap minggu supaya anda','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>1021.96,'end_time'=>1024.02,'target_text'=>'keep improving consistently.','source_text'=>'terus konsisten meningkat maju.','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>1024.12,'end_time'=>1027.58,'target_text'=>'And this is not just a course full of random videos.','source_text'=>'Dan kursus ini bukan sekadar lambakan video rawak.','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>1027.68,'end_time'=>1036.22,'target_text'=>'You\'ll get an exclusive ChatGPT prompt that allows you to master the pronunciation of any word, plus a clear practice structure,','source_text'=>'Anda akan dapat prompt khas ChatGPT untuk kuasai sebutan mana-mana perkataan berserta jadual latihan yang jelas,','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>1036.32,'end_time'=>1042.58,'target_text'=>'so you always know exactly how to study, what to focus on, and how to make real progress.','source_text'=>'supaya anda sentiasa tahu cara berlatih, apa nak difokuskan, dan capai kemajuan sebenar.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>1042.68,'end_time'=>1047.9,'target_text'=>'Inside, we work on pronunciation, accent, rhythm, and natural speaking.','source_text'=>'Di dalam kursus ini kita asah sebutan, aksen, intonasi, dan pertuturan semula jadi.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>1048,'end_time'=>1054.42,'target_text'=>'So, you can stop hesitating, sound more natural, and speak English with real confidence.','source_text'=>'Supaya anda tak teragak-agak lagi, bercakap lebih bersahaja dan yakin berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>1054.52,'end_time'=>1056.18,'target_text'=>'Join today in the description.','source_text'=>'Sertai hari ini melalui pautan di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>1056.28,'end_time'=>1059.82,'target_text'=>'And over there, you can see they have a sprinkler going.','source_text'=>'Dan di sana anda boleh nampak mereka pasang pemercik air (sprinkler).','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>1059.92,'end_time'=>1065.14,'target_text'=>'So, they are watering the lawn here, the lawn at the front of the museum with the sprinkler.','source_text'=>'Jadi mereka sedang menyiram rumput di halaman depan muzium ini menggunakan pemercik air.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>1065.24,'end_time'=>1071.26,'target_text'=>'So, I\'m not sure if you guys remember from one of my previous videos, but uh this is how you ask someone politely to take','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada anda masih ingat video lepas saya, tapi begini cara sopan minta tolong orang ambilkan','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>1071.36,'end_time'=>1071.94,'target_text'=>'a photo of you.','source_text'=>'gambar anda.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>1072.04,'end_time'=>1075.86,'target_text'=>'Yo, can you please take a photo of me as I stand in front of this vortex?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong tangkap gambar saya berdiri di depan pusaran ini?','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>1075.96,'end_time'=>1076.9,'target_text'=>'>> No problem.','source_text'=>'Tiada masalah.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>1077,'end_time'=>1079.34,'target_text'=>'>> Get me flicked up for that thumbnail.','source_text'=>'Ambil gambar elok-elok untuk gambar depan video nanti.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>1079.44,'end_time'=>1082.66,'target_text'=>'>> I should zoom in to get the optimal focal length.','source_text'=>'Saya patut zum dekat sikit untuk dapat sudut fokus terbaik.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>1082.76,'end_time'=>1084.46,'target_text'=>'>> So, now I am posing.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya tengah buat gaya.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>1084.56,'end_time'=>1085.74,'target_text'=>'I\'m posing.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah bergaya posing.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>1085.84,'end_time'=>1087.94,'target_text'=>'>> Why don\'t you smile?','source_text'=>'Kenapa awak tak senyum?','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1088.04,'end_time'=>1090.46,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t smile, but I\'m posing.','source_text'=>'Saya memang jarang senyum, tapi saya tengah bergaya.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1090.56,'end_time'=>1093.18,'target_text'=>'I\'m just changing my position, and I\'m sweating.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma tukar-tukar posisi, dan peluh dah membasahi dahi.','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1093.28,'end_time'=>1095.66,'target_text'=>'Dude, it it has gotten a lot hotter.','source_text'=>'Kawan, cuaca makin lama makin panas terik.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1095.76,'end_time'=>1097.38,'target_text'=>'I should have brought my umbrella.','source_text'=>'Kalaulah saya bawa payung tadi.','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1097.48,'end_time'=>1098.5,'target_text'=>'>> What time is it right now?','source_text'=>'Pukul berapa sekarang?','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1098.6,'end_time'=>1100.98,'target_text'=>'>> It is 1:00 p.m.','source_text'=>'Sekarang dah pukul 1 petang.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1101.08,'end_time'=>1106.78,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, after someone takes a photo for you, something nice you could say or offer is, \"Would you like a photo?\" So, someone','source_text'=>'Lepas orang tolong ambilkan gambar kita, ucapan berbudi bahasa yang boleh kita tawarkan ialah, \"Awak nak saya tolong ambilkan gambar juga?\" Jadi lepas orang','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1106.88,'end_time'=>1111.3,'target_text'=>'takes a photo, then I\'ll ask, \"Oh, would you like a photo?\" And if they say no, you can just say, \"Okay, thank you very much.\"','source_text'=>'ambil gambar kita, kita tawarkan balik. Kalau mereka tolak, cukup sekadar ucapkan, \"Okey, terima kasih banyak-banyak.\"','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1111.4,'end_time'=>1113.98,'target_text'=>'Take your phone back, and then go on your way.','source_text'=>'Ambil telefon semula dan teruskan langkah anda.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1114.08,'end_time'=>1118.02,'target_text'=>'Anyways, that was just a quick tip on how to be polite in English.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, itu tip ringkas cara bertutur dengan sopan dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1118.12,'end_time'=>1120.46,'target_text'=>'Always say please, always say thank you.','source_text'=>'Sentiasa sebut tolong (please) dan terima kasih (thank you).','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1120.56,'end_time'=>1122.82,'target_text'=>'Canadians say please, thank you a lot.','source_text'=>'Orang Kanada memang sangat kerap ucap \'please\' dan \'thank you\'.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1122.92,'end_time'=>1126.1,'target_text'=>'I assume most people do, although I\'m not sure about Americans.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kebanyakan orang pun macam tu, walaupun saya tak pasti tentang orang Amerika.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1126.2,'end_time'=>1127.46,'target_text'=>'What did you guys think of the museum?','source_text'=>'Apa pandangan anda tentang muzium ini?','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1127.56,'end_time'=>1128.18,'target_text'=>'Did you like it?','source_text'=>'Anda suka ke?','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1128.28,'end_time'=>1129.18,'target_text'=>'Did you not like it?','source_text'=>'Atau anda rasa biasa saja?','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1129.28,'end_time'=>1131.58,'target_text'=>'In my opinion, it was a little small.','source_text'=>'Pada pendapat saya, muziumnya agak kecil sedikit.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1131.68,'end_time'=>1132.38,'target_text'=>'The museum was small.','source_text'=>'Muzium ini bersaiz agak terhad.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1132.48,'end_time'=>1133.66,'target_text'=>'There wasn\'t a lot to see.','source_text'=>'Tak banyak sangat bahan pameran untuk dilihat.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1133.76,'end_time'=>1137.98,'target_text'=>'I felt like we could have seen everything in like 20 minutes, like max.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita boleh habis pusing semuanya dalam masa 20 minit saja, paling lama pun.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1138.08,'end_time'=>1138.74,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pandangan awak?','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1138.84,'end_time'=>1139.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think so, too.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya pun berpandangan macam tu.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1139.64,'end_time'=>1144.34,'target_text'=>'For a national museum, it was a little underwhelming, but >> Yeah, a little bit, but it wasn\'t bad.','source_text'=>'Untuk sebuah muzium peringkat kebangsaan agak kurang menyerlah, tapi >> Ya, ada betulnya, cuma tidaklah mengecewakan sangat.','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1144.44,'end_time'=>1149.98,'target_text'=>'I liked the prehistoric section, where you saw the mammoth skeleton.','source_text'=>'Saya suka seksyen prasejarah tadi, tempat kita tengok rangka fosil mamot.','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1150.08,'end_time'=>1151.22,'target_text'=>'That was really beautiful.','source_text'=>'Bahagian itu memang sangat mengagumkan.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1151.32,'end_time'=>1154.46,'target_text'=>'It reminded me of the one we saw in uh Drumheller.','source_text'=>'Mengingatkan saya kepada rangka yang kita lihat di Drumheller dulu.','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1154.56,'end_time'=>1155.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s in Drumheller, right?','source_text'=>'Di Drumheller kan namanya?','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1155.8,'end_time'=>1157.42,'target_text'=>'In Drumheller, Alberta, Canada.','source_text'=>'Di Drumheller, wilayah Alberta, Kanada.','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1157.52,'end_time'=>1161.58,'target_text'=>'It\'s one of the largest collections of dinosaur fossils in the world.','source_text'=>'Itu salah satu muzium dengan koleksi fosil dinosaur terbesar di dunia.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1161.68,'end_time'=>1163.66,'target_text'=>'So, we saw many, many mammoths there.','source_text'=>'Jadi kami nampak banyak rangka mamot di sana.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1163.76,'end_time'=>1164.9,'target_text'=>'And really big ones, too.','source_text'=>'Dan saiznya sangat-sangat besar.','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1165,'end_time'=>1166.58,'target_text'=>'Overall, though, not bad.','source_text'=>'Secara keseluruhannya, boleh tahan menarik.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1166.68,'end_time'=>1170.42,'target_text'=>'If I had to summarize it, I would say if you like museums, definitely come and check it out.','source_text'=>'Kalau nak buat kesimpulan, saya kata kalau anda peminat muzium, datanglah melawat tempat ini.','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1170.52,'end_time'=>1174.78,'target_text'=>'If you don\'t, you don\'t really need to, but uh I would come again if I never came before.','source_text'=>'Kalau tak minat, tak datang pun tak apa, tapi kalau belum pernah sampai elok juga singgah sekali.','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1174.88,'end_time'=>1178.66,'target_text'=>'Now, we\'re going to go ahead somewhere else, probably head to grab a bite to eat, have some lunch.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kami nak bergerak ke tempat lain, mungkin cari kedai makan untuk makan tengah hari.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1178.76,'end_time'=>1186.42,'target_text'=>'Remember, guys, the framework on how to describe things in English, and use that next time you want to describe something.','source_text'=>'Ingat panduan cara menggambarkan benda dalam bahasa Inggeris tadi, dan gunakannya bila anda nak bercerita nanti.','order'=>436],
            ['start_time'=>1186.52,'end_time'=>1188.9,'target_text'=>'And you could even use it right now in your room.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh cuba praktikkannya sekarang di dalam bilik anda sendiri.','order'=>437],
            ['start_time'=>1189,'end_time'=>1198.66,'target_text'=>'Get my 3,000 most common English words PDF and learn the words that will help you understand up to 95% of everyday English.','source_text'=>'Dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya dan kuasai perkataan yang bantu anda faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian.','order'=>438],
            ['start_time'=>1198.76,'end_time'=>1209.02,'target_text'=>'It includes real definitions, real example sentences for every meaning, and everything is organized by CEFR level and topic.','source_text'=>'Ia merangkumi maksud sebenar, contoh ayat dan disusun kemas mengikut tahap CEFR dan topik.','order'=>439],
            ['start_time'=>1209.12,'end_time'=>1211.22,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description to get it.','source_text'=>'Tekan pautan di ruangan penerangan untuk memilikinya.','order'=>440],
            ['start_time'=>1211.32,'end_time'=>1214.34,'target_text'=>'Describe these as textured outdoor shoes.','source_text'=>'Gambarkan ini sebagai kasut luar bertekstur kasar.','order'=>441],
            ['start_time'=>1214.44,'end_time'=>1216.74,'target_text'=>'However, some people might sit down on them.','source_text'=>'Walau bagaimanapun, mungkin ada orang duduk di situ.','order'=>442],
            ['start_time'=>1216.84,'end_time'=>1218.74,'target_text'=>'This is called carpet.','source_text'=>'Ini dipanggil karpet.','order'=>443],
            ['start_time'=>1218.84,'end_time'=>1219.66,'target_text'=>'This is carpet.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah karpet.','order'=>444],
            ['start_time'=>1219.76,'end_time'=>1222.94,'target_text'=>'A rug is usually a smaller piece that you can move around.','source_text'=>'\'Rug\' biasanya kepingan kecil yang boleh dialihkan.','order'=>445],
            ['start_time'=>1223.04,'end_time'=>1225.7,'target_text'=>'So, we just entered another exhibition room.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita baru saja masuk ke satu lagi bilik pameran.','order'=>446],
            ['start_time'=>1225.8,'end_time'=>1228.22,'target_text'=>'This is the skull of a child.','source_text'=>'Ini tengkorak seorang kanak-kanak.','order'=>447],
            ['start_time'=>1228.32,'end_time'=>1230.18,'target_text'=>'This is a child\'s Is it old?','source_text'=>'Ini kanak-kanak... Adakah ia purba?','order'=>448],
            ['start_time'=>1230.28,'end_time'=>1231.06,'target_text'=>'Interesting.','source_text'=>'Menarik.','order'=>449],
            ['start_time'=>1231.16,'end_time'=>1232.74,'target_text'=>'And one more word.','source_text'=>'Dan satu lagi perkataan.','order'=>450],
            ['start_time'=>1232.84,'end_time'=>1236.1,'target_text'=>'I thought these were tombstones, but these are actually just inscriptions.','source_text'=>'Saya sangka ini batu nisan, tetapi sebenarnya ini prasasti batu bersurat.','order'=>451],
            ['start_time'=>1236.2,'end_time'=>1237.9,'target_text'=>'These floors are marble, right?','source_text'=>'Lantai ini dibuat daripada marmar, kan?','order'=>452],
            ['start_time'=>1238,'end_time'=>1239.3,'target_text'=>'These are marble floors.','source_text'=>'Ini ialah lantai marmar.','order'=>453],
            ['start_time'=>1239.4,'end_time'=>1241.7,'target_text'=>'This pillar is white and tall.','source_text'=>'Tiang ini berwarna putih dan tinggi.','order'=>454],
            ['start_time'=>1241.8,'end_time'=>1243.3,'target_text'=>'It is white and tall.','source_text'=>'Ia putih dan tinggi.','order'=>455],
            ['start_time'=>1243.4,'end_time'=>1244.62,'target_text'=>'People say herbs.','source_text'=>'Orang sebut \'herbs\'.','order'=>456],
            ['start_time'=>1244.72,'end_time'=>1247.66,'target_text'=>'They spell the whole word or they pronounce the whole word herbs.','source_text'=>'Mereka bunyikan sepenuhnya perkataan \'herbs\'.','order'=>457],
            ['start_time'=>1247.76,'end_time'=>1250.5,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know if you can see it on my face, but it is hot out here.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kalau nampak pada muka saya, tapi cuaca di luar ini memang panas.','order'=>458],
            ['start_time'=>1250.6,'end_time'=>1252.9,'target_text'=>'You can just see grass and a lot of mud.','source_text'=>'Cuma nampak rumput dan banyak selut lumpur.','order'=>459],
            ['start_time'=>1253,'end_time'=>1254.26,'target_text'=>'It\'s very wet here.','source_text'=>'Di sini sangat becak dan basah.','order'=>460],
            ['start_time'=>1254.36,'end_time'=>1255.78,'target_text'=>'Like uh whirlpool?','source_text'=>'Macam pusaran air?','order'=>461],
            ['start_time'=>1255.88,'end_time'=>1256.82,'target_text'=>'Whirlpool, yeah.','source_text'=>'Pusaran air, ya.','order'=>462],
            ['start_time'=>1256.92,'end_time'=>1259.82,'target_text'=>'So, they are watering the lawn here.','source_text'=>'Jadi mereka sedang menyiram rumput di halaman ini.','order'=>463],
            ['start_time'=>1259.92,'end_time'=>1263.28,'target_text'=>'You will become fluent in English.','source_text'=>'Anda pasti akan fasih bertutur dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>464],
