            ['start_time'=>1119.96,'end_time'=>1123.82,'target_text'=>'wants a beach wedding and the style of the dress doesn\'t match.','source_text'=>'dia nak majlis tepi pantai dan gaya gaun ini langsung tak sesuai.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>1123.92,'end_time'=>1130.9,'target_text'=>'After that I sent a text to my aunt saying I spoke to my cousin and that she didn\'t want the dress and that I also wanted','source_text'=>'Selepas itu saya hantar mesej kepada ibu saudara beritahu saya dah bincang dengan sepupu dan dia tak perlukan gaun tu, serta saya juga','order'=>236],
