            ['start_time'=>19.84,'end_time'=>27.22,'target_text'=>'And then the second way, I will ask you the questions, and you will read the yellow caption to answer the question.','source_text'=>'Dan cara kedua pula: saya akan ajukan soalan kepada anda, dan anda baca sari kata warna kuning untuk menjawabnya.','order'=>5],
            ['start_time'=>27.32,'end_time'=>35.66,'target_text'=>'This will help you practice your pronunciation, accent, and confidence when speaking and answering questions in English.','source_text'=>'Ini akan bantu anda latih sebutan, aksen, dan keyakinan bila bertutur serta menjawab soalan dalam bahasa Inggeris.','order'=>6],
            ['start_time'=>35.76,'end_time'=>45.5,'target_text'=>'This video is part of my 3,000 most common English words series designed to help you understand up to 95% of spoken English.','source_text'=>'Video ini adalah sebahagian daripada siri 3,000 perkataan lazim bahasa Inggeris saya untuk bantu anda faham sehingga 95% perbualan harian.','order'=>7],
            ['start_time'=>45.6,'end_time'=>50.5,'target_text'=>'If you want to get the 3,000 most common English words PDF, it\'s in the description.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda nak dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim itu, pautannya ada di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>8],
            ['start_time'=>50.6,'end_time'=>51.34,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>9],
            ['start_time'=>51.44,'end_time'=>55.82,'target_text'=>'Part one will just be me and Leon answering and asking these questions.','source_text'=>'Bahagian pertama cuma saya dan Leon yang akan bersoal jawab soalan-soalan ini.','order'=>10],
            ['start_time'=>55.92,'end_time'=>60.58,'target_text'=>'So, just listen to how a native English speaker would answer these questions.','source_text'=>'Jadi dengarkan bagaimana penutur jati menjawab soalan-soalan ini secara bersahaja.','order'=>11],
            ['start_time'=>60.68,'end_time'=>64.42,'target_text'=>'We\'ll first start by introductions and basic information.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula kita mulakan dengan sesi perkenalan dan maklumat asas.','order'=>12],
            ['start_time'=>64.52,'end_time'=>66.9,'target_text'=>'First question, what\'s your name?','source_text'=>'Soalan pertama: Siapa nama awak? (What\'s your name?)','order'=>13],
            ['start_time'=>67,'end_time'=>68.3,'target_text'=>'My name is Leon.','source_text'=>'Nama saya Leon.','order'=>14],
            ['start_time'=>68.4,'end_time'=>69.82,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.','source_text'=>'Selamat berkenalan.','order'=>15],
            ['start_time'=>69.92,'end_time'=>71.82,'target_text'=>'Where are you from?','source_text'=>'Awak berasal dari mana? (Where are you from?)','order'=>16],
            ['start_time'=>71.92,'end_time'=>73.42,'target_text'=>'I\'m from Mexico.','source_text'=>'Saya berasal dari Mexico.','order'=>17],
            ['start_time'=>73.52,'end_time'=>75.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s a nice and hot country.','source_text'=>'Negara yang menarik dan beriklim panas.','order'=>18],
            ['start_time'=>75.52,'end_time'=>76.9,'target_text'=>'Where do you live?','source_text'=>'Di mana awak tinggal? (Where do you live?)','order'=>19],
            ['start_time'=>77,'end_time'=>79.34,'target_text'=>'I live in Mexico City.','source_text'=>'Saya tinggal di Mexico City.','order'=>20],
            ['start_time'=>79.44,'end_time'=>81.66,'target_text'=>'It\'s the capital of Mexico.','source_text'=>'Ia ibu negara Mexico.','order'=>21],
            ['start_time'=>81.76,'end_time'=>83.42,'target_text'=>'What do you do?','source_text'=>'Awak kerja apa? (What do you do?)','order'=>22],
            ['start_time'=>83.52,'end_time'=>85.46,'target_text'=>'I work as an accountant.','source_text'=>'Saya bekerja sebagai akauntan.','order'=>23],
            ['start_time'=>85.56,'end_time'=>88.1,'target_text'=>'I\'ve only been doing it for 2 years now.','source_text'=>'Baru 2 tahun saya buat kerja ni.','order'=>24],
            ['start_time'=>88.2,'end_time'=>89.66,'target_text'=>'How old are you?','source_text'=>'Berapa umur awak? (How old are you?)','order'=>25],
            ['start_time'=>89.76,'end_time'=>92.14,'target_text'=>'I\'m 25 years old.','source_text'=>'Umur saya 25 tahun.','order'=>26],
            ['start_time'=>92.24,'end_time'=>94.18,'target_text'=>'I will turn 26 this year.','source_text'=>'Tahun ini genap 26 tahun.','order'=>27],
            ['start_time'=>94.28,'end_time'=>101.74,'target_text'=>'If you want to build a strong English foundation fast, then get my 3,000 most common English words PDF.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda nak bina asas bahasa Inggeris yang kukuh dengan cepat, dapatkan PDF 3,000 perkataan lazim saya.','order'=>28],
            ['start_time'=>101.84,'end_time'=>110.7,'target_text'=>'You\'ll learn the most important words that cover up to 95% of everyday English with clear definitions, real examples, and','source_text'=>'Anda akan pelajari perkataan penting yang merangkumi 95% bahasa Inggeris harian berserta maksud jelas, contoh situasi sebenar, dan','order'=>29],
            ['start_time'=>110.8,'end_time'=>115.14,'target_text'=>'easy organization by topic and CEFR','source_text'=>'disusun kemas mengikut topik serta tahap CEFR','order'=>30],
            ['start_time'=>115.24,'end_time'=>115.64,'target_text'=>'level.','source_text'=>'yang bersesuaian.','order'=>31],
            ['start_time'=>115.68,'end_time'=>117.5,'target_text'=>'Click the link in the description.','source_text'=>'Klik pautan di ruangan penerangan.','order'=>32],
            ['start_time'=>117.6,'end_time'=>120.22,'target_text'=>'Do you have any brothers or sisters?','source_text'=>'Awak ada adik-beradik ke? (Do you have any brothers or sisters?)','order'=>33],
            ['start_time'=>120.32,'end_time'=>121.42,'target_text'=>'Yes, I do.','source_text'=>'Ya, ada.','order'=>34],
            ['start_time'=>121.52,'end_time'=>124.18,'target_text'=>'I have two brothers and one sister.','source_text'=>'Saya ada dua orang abang/adik lelaki dan seorang kakak/adik perempuan.','order'=>35],
            ['start_time'=>124.28,'end_time'=>128.1,'target_text'=>'Now we\'ll move on to the questions about daily conversations.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita beralih ke soalan-soalan perbualan seharian.','order'=>36],
            ['start_time'=>128.2,'end_time'=>129.3,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'Apa khabar? (How are you?)','order'=>37],
            ['start_time'=>129.4,'end_time'=>132.9,'target_text'=>'I\'m doing well, but I wish it was a little bit sunnier today.','source_text'=>'Khabar baik, cuma harapnya hari ini cerah sikit.','order'=>38],
            ['start_time'=>133,'end_time'=>134.34,'target_text'=>'What are you doing?','source_text'=>'Awak tengah buat apa tu? (What are you doing?)','order'=>39],
            ['start_time'=>134.44,'end_time'=>136.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m enjoying my weekend right now.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah bersantai nikmati hujung minggu sekarang.','order'=>40],
            ['start_time'=>136.68,'end_time'=>138.86,'target_text'=>'I\'m not looking forward to go back to work.','source_text'=>'Rasa malas betul nak masuk kerja balik.','order'=>41],
            ['start_time'=>138.96,'end_time'=>140.38,'target_text'=>'What time is it?','source_text'=>'Pukul berapa sekarang? (What time is it?)','order'=>42],
            ['start_time'=>140.48,'end_time'=>142.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s almost 5:00.','source_text'=>'Dah hampir pukul 5:00.','order'=>43],
            ['start_time'=>142.8,'end_time'=>144.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s almost time to eat.','source_text'=>'Dah nak masuk waktu makan.','order'=>44],
            ['start_time'=>144.32,'end_time'=>146.38,'target_text'=>'What\'s the weather like?','source_text'=>'Macam mana cuaca hari ni? (What\'s the weather like?)','order'=>45],
            ['start_time'=>146.48,'end_time'=>149.62,'target_text'=>'Today it\'s cloudy and it feels like it wants to rain.','source_text'=>'Hari ini mendung dan rasa macam nak hujan.','order'=>46],
            ['start_time'=>149.72,'end_time'=>150.62,'target_text'=>'What\'s wrong?','source_text'=>'Ada apa-apa masalah ke? (What\'s wrong?)','order'=>47],
            ['start_time'=>150.72,'end_time'=>153.3,'target_text'=>'My back has been giving me problems lately.','source_text'=>'Kebelakangan ini pinggang saya kerap buat hal.','order'=>48],
            ['start_time'=>153.4,'end_time'=>154.9,'target_text'=>'It\'s starting to hurt a lot.','source_text'=>'Dah mula rasa sakit sangat.','order'=>49],
            ['start_time'=>155,'end_time'=>156.46,'target_text'=>'Can you repeat that?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong ulang semula? (Can you repeat that?)','order'=>50],
            ['start_time'=>156.56,'end_time'=>157.5,'target_text'=>'Of course.','source_text'=>'Boleh, tentu sekali.','order'=>51],
            ['start_time'=>157.6,'end_time'=>159.94,'target_text'=>'My back has been giving me problems lately.','source_text'=>'Kebelakangan ini pinggang saya kerap buat hal.','order'=>52],
            ['start_time'=>160.04,'end_time'=>162.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s starting to hurt a lot.','source_text'=>'Dah mula rasa sakit sangat.','order'=>53],
            ['start_time'=>162.2,'end_time'=>165.54,'target_text'=>'Now the questions about shopping and getting around.','source_text'=>'Sekarang soalan tentang membeli-belah dan mencari jalan.','order'=>54],
            ['start_time'=>165.64,'end_time'=>166.98,'target_text'=>'How much is this?','source_text'=>'Berapa harga barang ni? (How much is this?)','order'=>55],
            ['start_time'=>167.08,'end_time'=>168.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s not too expensive.','source_text'=>'Tak mahal sangat pun.','order'=>56],
            ['start_time'=>168.48,'end_time'=>171.7,'target_text'=>'For you, I can sell it for $20.','source_text'=>'Khas untuk awak, saya boleh jual 20 dolar.','order'=>57],
            ['start_time'=>171.8,'end_time'=>172.94,'target_text'=>'Can you help me?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong saya? (Can you help me?)','order'=>58],
            ['start_time'=>173.04,'end_time'=>174.14,'target_text'=>'Yes, of course.','source_text'=>'Ya, boleh saja.','order'=>59],
            ['start_time'=>174.24,'end_time'=>175.62,'target_text'=>'What are you looking for?','source_text'=>'Awak tengah cari apa?','order'=>60],
            ['start_time'=>175.72,'end_time'=>177.42,'target_text'=>'Where is the supermarket?','source_text'=>'Di mana pasar raya? (Where is the supermarket?)','order'=>61],
            ['start_time'=>177.52,'end_time'=>182.02,'target_text'=>'The main supermarket is 500 m down the street.','source_text'=>'Pasar raya utama ada 500 meter di hujung jalan ini.','order'=>62],
            ['start_time'=>182.12,'end_time'=>183.7,'target_text'=>'You\'ll see it on your left.','source_text'=>'Nanti awak akan nampak di sebelah kiri.','order'=>63],
            ['start_time'=>183.8,'end_time'=>185.14,'target_text'=>'What would you like?','source_text'=>'Awak nak pesan apa? (What would you like?)','order'=>64],
            ['start_time'=>185.24,'end_time'=>189.66,'target_text'=>'I would like a large pizza with extra pepperoni, please.','source_text'=>'Saya nak piza saiz besar dengan lebihan pepperoni.','order'=>65],
            ['start_time'=>189.76,'end_time'=>191.46,'target_text'=>'What are you looking for?','source_text'=>'Awak sedang cari apa? (What are you looking for?)','order'=>66],
            ['start_time'=>191.56,'end_time'=>195.98,'target_text'=>'I\'m looking for a new pair of shoes, something I can go running with.','source_text'=>'Saya tengah cari sepasang kasut baru, yang sesuai untuk buat berjoging.','order'=>67],
            ['start_time'=>196.08,'end_time'=>201.18,'target_text'=>'Now we\'ll go on to the last set of questions about socializing and communication.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita ke kumpulan soalan terakhir tentang bergaul dan komunikasi.','order'=>68],
            ['start_time'=>201.28,'end_time'=>203.38,'target_text'=>'Do you speak English?','source_text'=>'Awak boleh cakap bahasa Inggeris? (Do you speak English?)','order'=>69],
            ['start_time'=>203.48,'end_time'=>204.38,'target_text'=>'Yes, I do.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya boleh.','order'=>70],
            ['start_time'=>204.48,'end_time'=>206.78,'target_text'=>'I am fluent in English.','source_text'=>'Saya fasih berbahasa Inggeris.','order'=>71],
            ['start_time'=>206.88,'end_time'=>209.62,'target_text'=>'What do you like to do in your free time?','source_text'=>'Apa yang awak suka buat masa lapang? (What do you like to do in your free time?)','order'=>72],
            ['start_time'=>209.72,'end_time'=>214.5,'target_text'=>'In my free time, I like to visit the park and sometimes I like to go swimming.','source_text'=>'Masa lapang, saya suka pergi ke taman dan kadang-kadang suka pergi berenang.','order'=>73],
            ['start_time'=>214.6,'end_time'=>216.7,'target_text'=>'What kind of music do you like?','source_text'=>'Muzik jenis apa yang awak suka? (What kind of music do you like?)','order'=>74],
            ['start_time'=>216.8,'end_time'=>221.22,'target_text'=>'I like country music the most, but I listen to almost everything.','source_text'=>'Saya paling minat muzik \'country\', tapi hampir semua genre saya layan.','order'=>75],
            ['start_time'=>221.32,'end_time'=>223.46,'target_text'=>'Do you like playing sports?','source_text'=>'Awak suka bersukan ke? (Do you like playing sports?)','order'=>76],
            ['start_time'=>223.56,'end_time'=>224.5,'target_text'=>'Yes, I do.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya suka.','order'=>77],
            ['start_time'=>224.6,'end_time'=>227.66,'target_text'=>'I really enjoy playing hockey and basketball.','source_text'=>'Saya memang suka main hoki dan bola keranjang.','order'=>78],
            ['start_time'=>227.76,'end_time'=>230.22,'target_text'=>'Have you been to India?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah pergi ke India tak? (Have you been to India?)','order'=>79],
            ['start_time'=>230.32,'end_time'=>233.66,'target_text'=>'No, I haven\'t been there yet, but I really want to go.','source_text'=>'Belum pernah sampai lagi, tapi saya memang teringin nak pergi.','order'=>80],
            ['start_time'=>233.76,'end_time'=>235.98,'target_text'=>'How do you spell that?','source_text'=>'Macam mana nak eja perkataan tu? (How do you spell that?)','order'=>81],
            ['start_time'=>236.08,'end_time'=>242.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s spelled t i r e, tire, like on a car.','source_text'=>'Dieja t-i-r-e, \'tire\' (tayar), macam tayar pada kereta.','order'=>82],
            ['start_time'=>242.16,'end_time'=>244.78,'target_text'=>'What does valuable mean?','source_text'=>'Apa maksud perkataan \'valuable\'? (What does valuable mean?)','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>244.88,'end_time'=>250.42,'target_text'=>'It can mean something very expensive or meaningful to you.','source_text'=>'Ia boleh bermaksud sesuatu yang sangat mahal harganya atau amat bermakna bagi anda.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>250.52,'end_time'=>251.58,'target_text'=>'How\'s it going?','source_text'=>'Macam mana keadaan sekarang? (How\'s it going?)','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>251.68,'end_time'=>253.06,'target_text'=>'It\'s going pretty well.','source_text'=>'Semuanya berjalan lancar dan baik.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>253.16,'end_time'=>255.06,'target_text'=>'I\'ve been enjoying my weekend.','source_text'=>'Saya seronok bersantai hujung minggu ini.','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>255.16,'end_time'=>261.94,'target_text'=>'So that was the first round of the 25 questions where I asked Leon and Leon answered the questions.','source_text'=>'Itulah pusingan pertama 25 soalan tadi di mana saya menyoal dan Leon menjawab soalan-soalan tersebut.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>262.04,'end_time'=>267.62,'target_text'=>'Now I will ask you guys and you have to read the yellow caption, okay?','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya akan tanya anda semua dan anda perlu baca sari kata kuning di skrin, okey?','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>267.72,'end_time'=>268.62,'target_text'=>'Let\'s get started.','source_text'=>'Jom kita mulakan.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>268.72,'end_time'=>271.48,'target_text'=>'What\'s your name?','source_text'=>'Siapa nama awak? (What\'s your name?)','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>273.16,'end_time'=>276.08,'target_text'=>'Where are you from?','source_text'=>'Awak berasal dari mana? (Where are you from?)','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>277.52,'end_time'=>280.56,'target_text'=>'Where do you live?','source_text'=>'Di mana awak tinggal? (Where do you live?)','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>281.6,'end_time'=>284.6,'target_text'=>'What do you do?','source_text'=>'Awak bekerja sebagai apa? (What do you do?)','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>285.96,'end_time'=>289.4,'target_text'=>'How old are you?','source_text'=>'Berapa umur awak? (How old are you?)','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>290.72,'end_time'=>294.36,'target_text'=>'Do you have any brothers or sisters?','source_text'=>'Awak ada adik-beradik ke? (Do you have any brothers or sisters?)','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>296.08,'end_time'=>299.1,'target_text'=>'Now on to the daily conversation questions.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita beralih ke soalan perbualan harian.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>299.2,'end_time'=>301.6,'target_text'=>'How are you?','source_text'=>'Apa khabar? (How are you?)','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>303.12,'end_time'=>305.92,'target_text'=>'What are you doing?','source_text'=>'Awak tengah buat apa tu? (What are you doing?)','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>307.72,'end_time'=>311.4,'target_text'=>'What time is it?','source_text'=>'Pukul berapa sekarang? (What time is it?)','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>311.6,'end_time'=>314.72,'target_text'=>'What\'s the weather like?','source_text'=>'Macam mana cuaca hari ni? (What\'s the weather like?)','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>316.44,'end_time'=>318.72,'target_text'=>'What\'s wrong?','source_text'=>'Ada apa-apa yang tak kena ke? (What\'s wrong?)','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>320.76,'end_time'=>324.08,'target_text'=>'Can you repeat that?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong ulang semula? (Can you repeat that?)','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>326.76,'end_time'=>329.82,'target_text'=>'Now on to the shopping and getting around questions.','source_text'=>'Sekarang soalan beli-belah dan mencari arah perjalanan.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>329.92,'end_time'=>332.8,'target_text'=>'How much is this?','source_text'=>'Berapa harga barang ni? (How much is this?)','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>334.04,'end_time'=>336.84,'target_text'=>'Can you help me?','source_text'=>'Boleh tolong saya? (Can you help me?)','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>337.96,'end_time'=>341.32,'target_text'=>'Where is the post office?','source_text'=>'Di mana pejabat pos? (Where is the post office?)','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>343.16,'end_time'=>345.88,'target_text'=>'What would you like?','source_text'=>'Awak nak pesan apa? (What would you like?)','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>347,'end_time'=>350.6,'target_text'=>'What are you looking for?','source_text'=>'Awak sedang mencari apa? (What are you looking for?)','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>351.8,'end_time'=>355.38,'target_text'=>'Now on to the socializing and communication questions.','source_text'=>'Sekarang soalan bergaul dan komunikasi sosial.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>355.48,'end_time'=>358.68,'target_text'=>'Do you speak English?','source_text'=>'Awak boleh bertutur bahasa Inggeris? (Do you speak English?)','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>360.88,'end_time'=>365.32,'target_text'=>'What do you like to do in your free time?','source_text'=>'Apa yang awak suka buat masa lapang? (What do you like to do in your free time?)','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>366.44,'end_time'=>370.6,'target_text'=>'What kind of music do you like?','source_text'=>'Muzik jenis apa yang awak suka? (What kind of music do you like?)','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>371.56,'end_time'=>374.6,'target_text'=>'Do you like football?','source_text'=>'Awak suka bola sepak ke? (Do you like football?)','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>376.24,'end_time'=>379.16,'target_text'=>'Have you been to China?','source_text'=>'Awak pernah pergi ke China tak? (Have you been to China?)','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>381.04,'end_time'=>383.96,'target_text'=>'How do you spell that?','source_text'=>'Macam mana nak eja perkataan tu? (How do you spell that?)','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>386.2,'end_time'=>390.32,'target_text'=>'What does valuable mean?','source_text'=>'Apa maksud \'valuable\'? (What does valuable mean?)','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>392.44,'end_time'=>394.6,'target_text'=>'How\'s it going?','source_text'=>'Macam mana keadaan hidup sekarang? (How\'s it going?)','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>397.32,'end_time'=>401.18,'target_text'=>'So you guys have just practiced answering those 25 questions.','source_text'=>'Jadi anda semua baru saja berlatih menjawab 25 soalan tadi.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>401.28,'end_time'=>404.18,'target_text'=>'Now I want you to do one last thing.','source_text'=>'Sekarang saya nak anda buat satu latihan terakhir.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>404.28,'end_time'=>412.94,'target_text'=>'I want you to ask me the question now because it\'s important to also learn how to ask questions, not just answer questions.','source_text'=>'Saya nak anda pula yang ajukan soalan kepada saya sebab penting juga untuk tahu cara bertanya soalan, bukan sekadar menjawab.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>413.04,'end_time'=>417.14,'target_text'=>'So ask me these five next questions and I will answer you.','source_text'=>'Jadi tanyakan lima soalan seterusnya ini kepada saya, dan saya akan jawab.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>417.24,'end_time'=>419.92,'target_text'=>'Read the yellow caption.','source_text'=>'Baca sari kata berwarna kuning.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>421.12,'end_time'=>421.94,'target_text'=>'My name is Volka.','source_text'=>'Nama saya Volka.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>422.04,'end_time'=>423.22,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.','source_text'=>'Selamat berkenalan.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>423.32,'end_time'=>427.98,'target_text'=>'Or if you want to sound more like a native English speaker, you could say, \"My name\'s Volka.','source_text'=>'Atau kalau anda nak kedengaran lebih macam penutur jati, anda boleh sebut, \"My name\'s Volka.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>428.08,'end_time'=>429.18,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.','source_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>429.28,'end_time'=>430.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.','source_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>430.8,'end_time'=>434.72,'target_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.\" Ask me the next question.','source_text'=>'It\'s nice to meet you.\" Sekarang ajukan soalan seterusnya kepada saya.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>435.76,'end_time'=>436.66,'target_text'=>'I\'m from Canada.','source_text'=>'Saya berasal dari Kanada.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>436.76,'end_time'=>442.8,'target_text'=>'It\'s the second biggest country in the world and in my opinion, it\'s the most beautiful.','source_text'=>'Ia negara kedua terbesar di dunia dan pada pandangan saya, antara yang paling indah pemandangannya.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>444.44,'end_time'=>451.7,'target_text'=>'Right now, I live in Asia since I\'m traveling, but my permanent home is in Canada.','source_text'=>'Buat masa sekarang saya menetap di Asia sebab sedang melancong, tapi rumah tetap saya di Kanada.','order'=>132],
