            ['start_time'=>555.76,'end_time'=>563.02,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking, shadowing, and pronunciation course you can','source_text'=>'Jika anda serius ingin fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya telah bina kursus pertuturan, shadowing, dan sebutan lengkap yang anda boleh','order'=>205],
