            ['start_time'=>261.6,'end_time'=>268.74,'target_text'=>'So, it feels refreshing to go underground in the underpass and be protected from the elements.','source_text'=>'Jadi, rasa sangat menyegarkan apabila masuk ke bawah tanah di laluan bawah ini dan terlindung daripada panas cuaca.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>268.84,'end_time'=>271.9,'target_text'=>'This right here looks like the main gate, doesn\'t it?','source_text'=>'Yang di sebelah sini kelihatan seperti pintu pagar utama, bukan?','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>272,'end_time'=>274.34,'target_text'=>'Or maybe not the main gate, but a gate.','source_text'=>'Atau mungkin bukan pintu utama, tetapi sejenis pintu pagar.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>274.44,'end_time'=>275.34,'target_text'=>'>> This is a gate, yep.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini memang pintu pagar.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>275.44,'end_time'=>279.14,'target_text'=>'We\'re going into the botanical gardens.','source_text'=>'Kita sedang masuk ke dalam taman botani.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>279.24,'end_time'=>283.14,'target_text'=>'>> And you can actually see right on the path there, there are monkeys.','source_text'=>'Dan anda sebenarnya boleh nampak betul-betul di atas laluan sana, ada monyet-monyet.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>283.24,'end_time'=>285.58,'target_text'=>'I did not know there were monkeys here.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu pula ada monyet di sini.','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>285.68,'end_time'=>286.26,'target_text'=>'Did you?','source_text'=>'Awak tahu ke?','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>286.36,'end_time'=>288.02,'target_text'=>'>> I had no idea.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tiada idea.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>288.12,'end_time'=>290.58,'target_text'=>'>> They look mischievous, do they not?','source_text'=>'Mereka nampak nakal, bukan?','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>290.68,'end_time'=>294.82,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t want to get close to them because they will try to steal my backpack.','source_text'=>'Saya tak nak pergi dekat dengan mereka sebab mereka akan cuba curi beg galas saya.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>294.92,'end_time'=>298.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, these ones look worse than the ones we saw at Monkey Beach.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ini nampak lebih liar daripada yang kita nampak di Monkey Beach.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>298.44,'end_time'=>301.1,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, these ones definitely have more human contact.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ini jelas sekali sudah lebih biasa berdamping dengan manusia.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>301.2,'end_time'=>303.46,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, but this is where we are.','source_text'=>'Ya, tapi di sinilah kita berada sekarang.','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>303.56,'end_time'=>305.9,'target_text'=>'We are at the botanical gardens.','source_text'=>'Kita berada di taman botani.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>306,'end_time'=>308.42,'target_text'=>'This right here is a map.','source_text'=>'Yang di sebelah sini ini adalah sebuah peta.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>308.52,'end_time'=>309.1,'target_text'=>'A map.','source_text'=>'Sebuah peta.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>309.2,'end_time'=>311.9,'target_text'=>'On the side here, we call this a legend.','source_text'=>'Di bahagian tepi sini, kita panggil ini petunjuk peta (legend).','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>312,'end_time'=>312.78,'target_text'=>'A legend.','source_text'=>'Petunjuk peta (legend).','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>312.88,'end_time'=>319.66,'target_text'=>'Legend has multiple meanings in English, but in this case, it is just a place that has all the items on the map listed.','source_text'=>'\"Legend\" ada banyak maksud dalam bahasa Inggeris, tapi dalam kes ini, ia cuma senarai yang memaparkan semua tempat pada peta.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>319.76,'end_time'=>324.42,'target_text'=>'So, you can see number 22 and number 22, edible garden.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda boleh nampak nombor 22 dan nombor 22, taman tanaman makan (edible garden).','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>324.52,'end_time'=>325.42,'target_text'=>'A legend.','source_text'=>'Petunjuk peta.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>325.52,'end_time'=>326.3,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>326.4,'end_time'=>328.06,'target_text'=>'>> You can see the monkeys over there.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak monyet-monyet di sebelah sana.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>328.16,'end_time'=>329.82,'target_text'=>'The monkey just climbed up that tree.','source_text'=>'Monyet itu baru saja memanjat pokok itu.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>329.92,'end_time'=>332.62,'target_text'=>'>> You got a hold onto that camera tight.','source_text'=>'Awak kena pegang kamera itu kuat-kuat.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>332.72,'end_time'=>333.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, I know.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya tahu.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>333.8,'end_time'=>335.5,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, that one there is eyeing you up.','source_text'=>'Oh, yang seekor di sana itu sedang memerhatikan awak.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>335.6,'end_time'=>337.82,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, look at the monkey.','source_text'=>'Oh, tengok monyet itu.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>337.92,'end_time'=>338.9,'target_text'=>'Look at them.','source_text'=>'Tengok mereka semua.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>339,'end_time'=>339.54,'target_text'=>'Look at all of them.','source_text'=>'Tengok betapa banyaknya mereka.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>339.64,'end_time'=>340.34,'target_text'=>'>> one up there.','source_text'=>'Ada seekor lagi di atas sana.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>340.44,'end_time'=>341.58,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, look at that guy.','source_text'=>'Oh, tengok yang itu.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>341.68,'end_time'=>347.02,'target_text'=>'I\'m going to take out my phone, open up my camera, and I\'m going to take a video of the monkeys.','source_text'=>'Saya akan keluarkan telefon saya, buka kamera, dan saya akan rakam video monyet-monyet ini.','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>347.12,'end_time'=>348.06,'target_text'=>'Can you see them?','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak mereka?','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>348.16,'end_time'=>350.1,'target_text'=>'>> I\'m mostly going to take a video of the monkey.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih nak rakam video monyet ini.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>350.2,'end_time'=>353.02,'target_text'=>'>> They look kind of chill now that we\'re closer to them.','source_text'=>'Mereka nampak agak tenang sekarang bila kita sudah berada lebih dekat dengan mereka.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>353.12,'end_time'=>354.46,'target_text'=>'But, look at this tree.','source_text'=>'Tapi, tengok pokok ini.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>354.56,'end_time'=>359.7,'target_text'=>'Those look like roots, but I\'m pretty sure that\'s just the way the tree is, but those all look like roots.','source_text'=>'Yang itu nampak macam akar, tapi saya agak pasti memang begitu rupa pokok ini, tapi semuanya nampak macam akar.','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>359.8,'end_time'=>361.3,'target_text'=>'That\'s a cool tree, actually.','source_text'=>'Pokok yang sangat menarik, sebenarnya.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>361.4,'end_time'=>362.9,'target_text'=>'Now, a question for you.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, satu soalan untuk anda.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>363,'end_time'=>367.02,'target_text'=>'What is the difference between that green part and this paved part?','source_text'=>'Apakah perbezaan antara bahagian hijau itu dengan bahagian berturap ini?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>367.12,'end_time'=>368.06,'target_text'=>'What is the difference?','source_text'=>'Apakah perbezaannya?','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>368.16,'end_time'=>370.7,'target_text'=>'Can you give me three differences?','source_text'=>'Boleh anda berikan tiga perbezaan?','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>370.8,'end_time'=>374.5,'target_text'=>'And you guys, too, in the comments, give me three differences.','source_text'=>'Dan anda semua juga, di ruangan komen, berikan saya tiga perbezaan.','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>374.6,'end_time'=>375,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>375,'end_time'=>376.38,'target_text'=>'Three differences.','source_text'=>'Tiga perbezaan.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>376.48,'end_time'=>384.5,'target_text'=>'The first and most obvious, in my opinion, is this is organic and this is inorganic.','source_text'=>'Yang pertama dan paling ketara, pada pandangan saya, bahagian ini organik dan bahagian ini bukan organik.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>384.6,'end_time'=>386.98,'target_text'=>'>> What is another way to say that?','source_text'=>'Apa cara lain untuk sebutkan perkara itu?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>387.08,'end_time'=>388.74,'target_text'=>'This is natural.','source_text'=>'Bahagian ini semula jadi.','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>388.84,'end_time'=>390.14,'target_text'=>'This forms naturally.','source_text'=>'Ini terbentuk secara semula jadi.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>390.24,'end_time'=>393.82,'target_text'=>'So, grass just grows without you needing to do anything.','source_text'=>'Jadi, rumput membesar begitu saja tanpa anda perlu buat apa-apa.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>393.92,'end_time'=>395.3,'target_text'=>'Grass is natural.','source_text'=>'Rumput adalah semula jadi.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>395.4,'end_time'=>397.38,'target_text'=>'This, however, is not natural.','source_text'=>'Manakala yang ini, bukan semula jadi.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>397.48,'end_time'=>399.18,'target_text'=>'This is unnatural.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah buatan manusia (tidak semula jadi).','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>399.28,'end_time'=>404.78,'target_text'=>'It is not naturally formed in nature, especially in a perfect path like this.','source_text'=>'Ia tidak terbentuk sendiri di alam semula jadi, terutamanya dalam laluan yang sempurna begini.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>404.88,'end_time'=>405.38,'target_text'=>'>> Second.','source_text'=>'Yang kedua.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>405.48,'end_time'=>407.94,'target_text'=>'>> This grass is colorful.','source_text'=>'Rumput ini berwarna-warni.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>408.04,'end_time'=>411.26,'target_text'=>'>> This This just looks gray and dead.','source_text'=>'Yang ini pula hanya nampak kelabu dan kaku mati.','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>411.36,'end_time'=>413.26,'target_text'=>'>> The last one.','source_text'=>'Yang terakhir.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>413.36,'end_time'=>415.78,'target_text'=>'This is a living organism.','source_text'=>'Ini adalah organisma hidup.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>415.88,'end_time'=>416.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s alive.','source_text'=>'Ia bernyawa.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>416.84,'end_time'=>418.42,'target_text'=>'This is not alive.','source_text'=>'Yang ini tidak hidup.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>418.52,'end_time'=>420.14,'target_text'=>'There is no life in this.','source_text'=>'Tiada kehidupan pada benda ini.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>420.24,'end_time'=>420.64,'target_text'=>'>> Yep.','source_text'=>'Betul.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>420.68,'end_time'=>422.86,'target_text'=>'So, grass is alive, that\'s why it can grow.','source_text'=>'Jadi, rumput itu hidup, sebab itulah ia boleh membesar.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>422.96,'end_time'=>424.34,'target_text'=>'Even if you cut it, it\'ll grow.','source_text'=>'Walaupun anda memotongnya, ia akan tetap tumbuh.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>424.44,'end_time'=>427.14,'target_text'=>'However, pavement and cement is not alive.','source_text'=>'Namun begitu, laluan berturap dan simen tidak bernyawa.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>427.24,'end_time'=>429.9,'target_text'=>'This right here is a gazebo.','source_text'=>'Yang di sebelah sini pula adalah sebuah gazebo.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>430,'end_time'=>438.34,'target_text'=>'A gazebo is an open-air structure like this, usually where you can eat and have barbecues or just sit and relax like this','source_text'=>'Gazebo ialah struktur terbuka seperti ini, biasanya tempat anda boleh makan dan buat barbeku atau sekadar duduk santai seperti','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>438.44,'end_time'=>438.72,'target_text'=>'one.','source_text'=>'yang ini.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>438.72,'end_time'=>442.9,'target_text'=>'It is a lot cooler in the shade of this gazebo.','source_text'=>'Suasananya jauh lebih nyaman dan redup di bawah teduhan gazebo ini.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>443,'end_time'=>444.26,'target_text'=>'It is a lot cooler.','source_text'=>'Ia jauh lebih nyaman.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>444.36,'end_time'=>448.06,'target_text'=>'And up top there, you can see an LED light.','source_text'=>'Dan di bahagian atas sana, anda boleh nampak lampu LED.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>448.16,'end_time'=>451.7,'target_text'=>'Tell me, guys, is the light on or off?','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya kawan-kawan, adakah lampu itu menyala atau terpadam?','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>451.8,'end_time'=>455.2,'target_text'=>'The light is off.','source_text'=>'Lampu itu terpadam.','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>460,'end_time'=>463.1,'target_text'=>'Over there, in the lake, what do you guys see?','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana, di dalam tasik, apa yang anda nampak?','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>463.2,'end_time'=>464.18,'target_text'=>'What is that?','source_text'=>'Apakah benda itu?','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>464.28,'end_time'=>465.74,'target_text'=>'That is a fountain.','source_text'=>'Itu adalah pancutan air (fountain).','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>465.84,'end_time'=>466.74,'target_text'=>'A fountain.','source_text'=>'Pancutan air.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>466.84,'end_time'=>471.72,'target_text'=>'How many fountains are in this shot?','source_text'=>'Berapakah bilangan pancutan air dalam paparan ini?','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>472.36,'end_time'=>478.9,'target_text'=>'There appears to be 1 2 3 4 5 6 fountains.','source_text'=>'Kelihatan ada 1 2 3 4 5 6 pancutan air.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>479,'end_time'=>481.78,'target_text'=>'I am not sure if you can see them all on your screen.','source_text'=>'Saya tidak pasti sama ada anda boleh nampak kesemuanya pada skrin anda.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>481.88,'end_time'=>490.26,'target_text'=>'So, if there is more than one of something, whether it\'s an object, a person, or anything, you say there are fountains.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jika terdapat lebih daripada satu benda, sama ada objek, orang, atau apa-apa sahaja, anda sebut \"there are fountains\".','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>490.36,'end_time'=>494.5,'target_text'=>'If there was just one fountain, you would say there is a fountain.','source_text'=>'Kalau hanya ada satu pancutan air, anda sebut \"there is a fountain\".','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>494.6,'end_time'=>497.5,'target_text'=>'So, plural, there are fountains.','source_text'=>'Jadi, jamak (plural), \"there are fountains\".','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>497.6,'end_time'=>500.82,'target_text'=>'Singular, there is a fountain.','source_text'=>'Tunggal (singular), \"there is a fountain\".','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>500.92,'end_time'=>502.22,'target_text'=>'Time for a quick quiz.','source_text'=>'Masanya untuk kuiz pantas.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>502.32,'end_time'=>505.72,'target_text'=>'What do you call this part of the tree?','source_text'=>'Apakah panggilan untuk bahagian pokok ini?','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>506.24,'end_time'=>507.53,'target_text'=>'The tree trunk.','source_text'=>'Batang pokok (tree trunk).','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>507.63,'end_time'=>511.92,'target_text'=>'>> [music] >> What do you call the part of the tree that is underground?','source_text'=>'[muzik] Apakah panggilan untuk bahagian pokok yang berada di bawah tanah?','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>512.4,'end_time'=>513.54,'target_text'=>'The roots.','source_text'=>'Akar (roots).','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>513.64,'end_time'=>519.7,'target_text'=>'What do you call the part of the tree that grows out of the tree and usually has these small green things on them?','source_text'=>'Apakah panggilan untuk bahagian pokok yang tumbuh keluar dari pokok dan biasanya mempunyai benda hijau kecil padanya?','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>519.8,'end_time'=>521.9,'target_text'=>'What do you call that?','source_text'=>'Apa yang anda panggil itu?','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>522,'end_time'=>525.02,'target_text'=>'The branches and the leaves.','source_text'=>'Dahan dan daun-daun.','order'=>188],
            ['start_time'=>525.12,'end_time'=>529.26,'target_text'=>'This lake looks to be naturally formed.','source_text'=>'Tasik ini nampaknya terbentuk secara semula jadi.','order'=>189],
            ['start_time'=>529.36,'end_time'=>532.78,'target_text'=>'The color of the lake is green.','source_text'=>'Warna tasik ini adalah hijau.','order'=>190],
            ['start_time'=>532.88,'end_time'=>534.34,'target_text'=>'The lake is green.','source_text'=>'Tasik ini berwarna hijau.','order'=>191],
            ['start_time'=>534.44,'end_time'=>537.18,'target_text'=>'It is not blue, it is green.','source_text'=>'Ia bukan warna biru, warnanya hijau.','order'=>192],
            ['start_time'=>537.28,'end_time'=>540.54,'target_text'=>'There is a lot of wildlife in this park.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak hidupan liar di taman ini.','order'=>193],
            ['start_time'=>540.64,'end_time'=>547.14,'target_text'=>'When we were walking here, we saw about four or five monkeys, right?','source_text'=>'Semasa kita berjalan ke sini, kita nampak sekitar empat atau lima ekor monyet, betul tak?','order'=>194],
            ['start_time'=>547.24,'end_time'=>548.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yes.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>195],
            ['start_time'=>548.32,'end_time'=>550.42,'target_text'=>'They were kind of big, too.','source_text'=>'Saiznya agak besar juga.','order'=>196],
            ['start_time'=>550.52,'end_time'=>554.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they were running across the path, the monkeys.','source_text'=>'Ya, monyet-monyet itu sedang berlari melintas laluan pejalan kaki.','order'=>197],
            ['start_time'=>554.48,'end_time'=>558.7,'target_text'=>'But, they seemed pretty calm, and I think they might be scared of people.','source_text'=>'Tapi, mereka nampak agak tenang, dan saya rasa mereka mungkin takut pada orang.','order'=>198],
            ['start_time'=>558.8,'end_time'=>565.02,'target_text'=>'And another thing, right on the ground here, you guys, you can see all these rocks.','source_text'=>'Dan satu lagi perkara, betul-betul di atas tanah ini, anda semua boleh nampak banyak batu-batu ini.','order'=>199],
            ['start_time'=>565.12,'end_time'=>565.74,'target_text'=>'All these rocks.','source_text'=>'Semua batu-batu ini.','order'=>200],
            ['start_time'=>565.84,'end_time'=>567.7,'target_text'=>'These rocks are very smooth.','source_text'=>'Batu-batu ini sangat licin.','order'=>201],
            ['start_time'=>567.8,'end_time'=>571.34,'target_text'=>'You can see the rocks are very smooth and shiny.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh nampak batu-batu ini sangat licin dan berkilat.','order'=>202],
            ['start_time'=>571.44,'end_time'=>573.14,'target_text'=>'But, this is uneven.','source_text'=>'Tapi, permukaannya tidak rata.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>573.24,'end_time'=>574.3,'target_text'=>'It\'s uneven.','source_text'=>'Ia tidak rata.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>574.4,'end_time'=>580.54,'target_text'=>'So, if you\'re walking, it doesn\'t feel that comfortable to walk on since it is uneven.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau anda berjalan, tidak berapa selesa untuk dipijak memandangkan ia beralun dan tidak rata.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>580.64,'end_time'=>585.06,'target_text'=>'These benches are made of very tiny rocks and cement.','source_text'=>'Bangku-bangku ini diperbuat daripada batu-batu yang sangat kecil dan simen.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>585.16,'end_time'=>591.02,'target_text'=>'The floor is made of bigger sized rocks and also cement, but it is not smooth.','source_text'=>'Lantainya pula diperbuat daripada batu yang bersaiz lebih besar serta simen, tetapi permukaannya tidak licin.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>591.12,'end_time'=>592.98,'target_text'=>'So, you can really see the difference.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda betul-betul boleh nampak perbezaannya.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>593.08,'end_time'=>595.54,'target_text'=>'These rocks are tiny.','source_text'=>'Batu-batu ini kecil.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>595.64,'end_time'=>596.9,'target_text'=>'These rocks are tiny.','source_text'=>'Batu-batu ini kecil.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>597,'end_time'=>599.7,'target_text'=>'Those rocks are about normal size.','source_text'=>'Batu-batu di sana itu bersaiz biasa.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>599.8,'end_time'=>603.58,'target_text'=>'They\'re not very big, but they\'re also not tiny.','source_text'=>'Ia tidaklah terlalu besar, tetapi tidak juga terlalu kecil.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>603.68,'end_time'=>608.62,'target_text'=>'And as you guys can see, the ceiling of the gazebo is broken.','source_text'=>'Dan seperti yang anda semua boleh nampak, siling gazebo ini telah rosak.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>608.72,'end_time'=>611.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s broken or it is damaged.','source_text'=>'Ia pecah atau ia rosak.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>611.48,'end_time'=>613.58,'target_text'=>'The gazebo ceiling is damaged.','source_text'=>'Siling gazebo ini telah rosak.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>613.68,'end_time'=>619.7,'target_text'=>'The inside part here is the ceiling and the outside you would call the roof.','source_text'=>'Bahagian dalam di sini dipanggil siling (ceiling) dan bahagian luar anda panggil bumbung (roof).','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>619.8,'end_time'=>622.34,'target_text'=>'The roof and the ceiling.','source_text'=>'Bumbung dan siling.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>622.44,'end_time'=>627.7,'target_text'=>'What material does it look like this ceiling is made out of?','source_text'=>'Agak-agak bahan apa yang digunakan untuk buat siling ini?','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>627.8,'end_time'=>630.54,'target_text'=>'I will give you a hint.','source_text'=>'Saya akan beri anda satu petunjuk.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>630.64,'end_time'=>635.48,'target_text'=>'It\'s made out of the same material as this pillar.','source_text'=>'Ia diperbuat daripada bahan yang sama seperti tiang ini.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>635.88,'end_time'=>636.78,'target_text'=>'Wood.','source_text'=>'Kayu.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>636.88,'end_time'=>638.26,'target_text'=>'It is made out of wood.','source_text'=>'Ia diperbuat daripada kayu.','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>638.36,'end_time'=>640.78,'target_text'=>'The ceiling is made out of wood.','source_text'=>'Siling ini diperbuat daripada kayu.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>640.88,'end_time'=>643.62,'target_text'=>'The roof is made out of clay tiles.','source_text'=>'Bumbungnya pula diperbuat daripada jubin tanah liat.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>643.72,'end_time'=>647.98,'target_text'=>'As you guys can see there, there are a lot of pigeons just chilling.','source_text'=>'Seperti yang anda semua boleh nampak di sana, ada banyak burung merpati sedang berehat santai.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>648.08,'end_time'=>649.46,'target_text'=>'Like another one flew down.','source_text'=>'Ada seekor lagi baru terbang turun.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>649.56,'end_time'=>653.34,'target_text'=>'Pigeons, in my opinion, are a kind of like a dirty animal.','source_text'=>'Burung merpati, pada pandangan saya, adalah sejenis haiwan yang agak kotor.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>653.44,'end_time'=>664.66,'target_text'=>'A lot of people refer to pigeons as rats that can fly or rats of the sky because they are kind of like a dirty animal, a dirty','source_text'=>'Ramai orang menggelar burung merpati sebagai tikus yang boleh terbang atau \"tikus langit\" kerana ia seperti haiwan yang kotor, haiwan','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>664.76,'end_time'=>665.16,'target_text'=>'animal.','source_text'=>'yang kotor.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>665.24,'end_time'=>666.06,'target_text'=>'I agree with that.','source_text'=>'Saya setuju dengan pandangan itu.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>666.16,'end_time'=>670.18,'target_text'=>'They are always digging through garbage and there are a lot of them.','source_text'=>'Mereka selalu menyelongkar sisa sampah dan jumlah mereka sangat banyak.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>670.28,'end_time'=>673.54,'target_text'=>'So, it makes sense why people call them rats of the sky.','source_text'=>'Jadi, memang masuk akal mengapa orang memanggil mereka tikus langit.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>673.64,'end_time'=>681.1,'target_text'=>'But, there is a nice breeze where we\'re standing, so I could just feel the nice cool breeze just hit me.','source_text'=>'Tapi, ada angin sepoi-sepoi yang nyaman di tempat kita berdiri, jadi saya dapat rasa angin sejuk yang nyaman menyapa saya.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>681.2,'end_time'=>683.02,'target_text'=>'And it\'s very relaxing.','source_text'=>'Dan ia sangat menenangkan.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>683.12,'end_time'=>685.02,'target_text'=>'Cuz it is hot.','source_text'=>'Sebab cuaca memang panas.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>685.12,'end_time'=>688.62,'target_text'=>'I\'m sure you guys have heard me say that about a million times.','source_text'=>'Saya pasti anda semua dah dengar saya sebut perkara itu sejuta kali.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>688.72,'end_time'=>693.7,'target_text'=>'That right there is an exaggeration, an mean, I was exaggerating.','source_text'=>'Apa yang saya sebut tadi adalah keterlaluan (exaggeration), maksudnya saya sekadar melebih-lebihkan kata.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>693.8,'end_time'=>697.02,'target_text'=>'I didn\'t actually say it a million times, but it\'s an exaggeration.','source_text'=>'Saya tak adalah betul-betul sebut sejuta kali, tapi ia satu gaya bahasa melebih-lebihkan (exaggeration).','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>697.12,'end_time'=>703.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s a very normal in any language, I believe, to exaggerate a fact or to exaggerate what you\'re saying.','source_text'=>'Ini perkara yang sangat biasa dalam mana-mana bahasa saya rasa, untuk melebih-lebihkan fakta atau kata-kata anda.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>703.8,'end_time'=>705.62,'target_text'=>'But, that breeze feels very nice.','source_text'=>'Tapi, angin itu terasa sangat nyaman.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>705.72,'end_time'=>707.34,'target_text'=>'Just hit me.','source_text'=>'Baru sahaja menyapa saya.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>707.44,'end_time'=>710.9,'target_text'=>'We are currently at the very beginning of the park.','source_text'=>'Sekarang kita berada di bahagian paling awal taman ini.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>711,'end_time'=>717.34,'target_text'=>'So, you can walk around this whole lake, and if you go further that way, you will find more lakes.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda boleh berjalan mengelilingi keseluruhan tasik ini, dan jika anda pergi lebih jauh ke arah sana, anda akan jumpa lebih banyak tasik.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>717.44,'end_time'=>720.54,'target_text'=>'So, there are more lakes in that direction as well.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ada lebih banyak tasik di arah sebelah sana juga.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>720.64,'end_time'=>724.42,'target_text'=>'So, what do you guys call this?','source_text'=>'Jadi, apa yang anda panggil benda ini?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>724.52,'end_time'=>726.76,'target_text'=>'What do you call this?','source_text'=>'Apa anda panggil benda ini?','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>727.24,'end_time'=>730.86,'target_text'=>'You can call that dirt or soil.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh panggil tanah (dirt atau soil).','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>730.96,'end_time'=>734.86,'target_text'=>'Or, you can call it the earth, but people mostly call it dirt or soil.','source_text'=>'Atau, anda boleh panggil bumi (earth), tetapi kebanyakan orang panggil tanah (dirt atau soil).','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>734.96,'end_time'=>739.22,'target_text'=>'Here, I would just call it soil since it\'s beneath the tree, but you can also call it dirt.','source_text'=>'Di sini, saya hanya panggil ia tanih (soil) kerana ia di bawah pokok, tetapi anda juga boleh panggil tanah (dirt).','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>739.32,'end_time'=>742.94,'target_text'=>'They pretty much mean the exact same thing, dirt and soil.','source_text'=>'Maksudnya lebih kurang sama sahaja, dirt dan soil.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>743.04,'end_time'=>745.9,'target_text'=>'Or, if you want to get fancy, earth.','source_text'=>'Atau, kalau nak nampak lebih puitis, panggil \"earth\".','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>746,'end_time'=>752.58,'target_text'=>'When you walk through a park, you can either say you\'re going for a walk or it sounds a little bit better if you say you\'re','source_text'=>'Apabila anda bersiar-siar di taman, anda boleh sebut \"going for a walk\" atau bunyinya lebih menarik kalau sebut \"going for','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>752.68,'end_time'=>753.9,'target_text'=>'going for a stroll.','source_text'=>'a stroll\".','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>754,'end_time'=>757.98,'target_text'=>'A stroll is similar to walking, but it\'s just like a relaxed form of walking.','source_text'=>'\"Stroll\" serupa dengan berjalan kaki, cuma ia versi berjalan yang lebih santai.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>758.08,'end_time'=>762.1,'target_text'=>'You\'re not really walking anywhere particular, you\'re just going for a stroll.','source_text'=>'Anda bukan berjalan menuju ke tempat tertentu, anda cuma bersiar-siar santai (going for a stroll).','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>762.2,'end_time'=>763.62,'target_text'=>'You\'re just walking around the park.','source_text'=>'Anda cuma berjalan-jalan mengelilingi taman.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>763.72,'end_time'=>766.26,'target_text'=>'Oh, I\'m going to go for a stroll in the park.','source_text'=>'Oh, saya nak pergi bersiar-siar santai di taman.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>766.36,'end_time'=>770.74,'target_text'=>'It\'s more for a pleasure rather than specifically going somewhere.','source_text'=>'Ia lebih kepada tujuan rekreasi dan hiburan berbanding hendak pergi ke tempat tertentu.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>770.84,'end_time'=>776.9,'target_text'=>'So, you can see this small little ditch here, ditch for water.','source_text'=>'Jadi, anda boleh nampak parit kecil di sini, parit untuk aliran air.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>777,'end_time'=>782.9,'target_text'=>'So, when it rains, the ditch will fill up, and the water will flow into the lake instead of flowing onto the path where people','source_text'=>'Jadi, apabila hujan, parit akan dipenuhi air, dan air akan mengalir masuk ke dalam tasik berbanding melimpah ke atas laluan pejalan kaki','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>783,'end_time'=>783.5,'target_text'=>'are walking.','source_text'=>'orang ramai.','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>783.6,'end_time'=>786.94,'target_text'=>'And right now, I want you guys to guess what I\'m doing.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang, saya mahu anda semua teka apa yang sedang saya lakukan.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>787.04,'end_time'=>788.42,'target_text'=>'Tell me what action this is.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya apa perbuatan ini.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>788.52,'end_time'=>793.48,'target_text'=>'There are a couple correct answers, but I just want you guys to give me one.','source_text'=>'Ada beberapa jawapan yang betul, tapi saya cuma nak anda berikan satu.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>794.16,'end_time'=>795.9,'target_text'=>'What did I just do?','source_text'=>'Apa yang baru saya buat tadi?','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>796,'end_time'=>798.66,'target_text'=>'You can say I jumped cuz I did.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh cakap saya melompat (jumped), memang saya buat begitu.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>798.76,'end_time'=>800.98,'target_text'=>'I jumped or I hopped.','source_text'=>'Saya melompat atau saya meloncat (hopped).','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>801.08,'end_time'=>804.7,'target_text'=>'I just hopped over this ditch.','source_text'=>'Saya baru sahaja meloncat melintasi parit ini.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>804.8,'end_time'=>805.58,'target_text'=>'I hopped.','source_text'=>'Saya meloncat (hopped).','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>805.68,'end_time'=>812.9,'target_text'=>'So, instead of saying, \"Oh, he jumped.\" you could say, \"He hopped.\" which uh is like either just small hops like this or what','source_text'=>'Jadi, selain cakap \"Oh, he jumped\", anda boleh cakap \"He hopped\", iaitu loncatan kecil seperti ini atau apa','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>813,'end_time'=>813.74,'target_text'=>'I just did there.','source_text'=>'yang baru saya buat tadi.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>813.84,'end_time'=>819.78,'target_text'=>'A jump, you can refer to that as a jump as well, but also you can use jump when you jump higher.','source_text'=>'\"Jump\", anda boleh rujuk perbuatan itu sebagai melompat juga, tetapi anda juga gunakan \"jump\" apabila anda melompat lebih tinggi.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>819.88,'end_time'=>825.9,'target_text'=>'So, if I jumped really high, like if I ran and then jumped, then you would say jumped cuz that\'s not really a hop.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau saya melompat sangat tinggi, contohnya jika saya berlari dan kemudian melompat, maka anda guna \"jumped\" sebab itu bukan lagi loncatan kecil (hop).','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>826,'end_time'=>829.3,'target_text'=>'A hop is not as high as a jump.','source_text'=>'Loncatan (hop) tidak setinggi lompatan (jump).','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>829.4,'end_time'=>829.98,'target_text'=>'Let\'s continue.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>830.08,'end_time'=>831.86,'target_text'=>'How would you describe this right here?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana anda gambarkan yang di sebelah sini ini?','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>831.96,'end_time'=>834.18,'target_text'=>'>> Uh the path is blocked.','source_text'=>'Laluan ini terhalang.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>834.28,'end_time'=>834.7,'target_text'=>'>> So, yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>834.8,'end_time'=>838.82,'target_text'=>'>> You can >> say the path is blocked or you could say the path is overgrown.','source_text'=>'Anda boleh cakap laluan ini terhalang, atau anda boleh cakap laluan ini ditumbuhi semak-samun (overgrown).','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>838.92,'end_time'=>840.74,'target_text'=>'So, this bush is overgrown.','source_text'=>'Jadi, semak ini tumbuh meliar berlebihan.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>840.84,'end_time'=>843.7,'target_text'=>'So, now it\'s blocking the path, so we have to go around.','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang ia menghalang laluan pejalan kaki, jadi kita kena pusing ikut jalan lain.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>843.8,'end_time'=>846.42,'target_text'=>'And this path, I don\'t think it\'s used very much.','source_text'=>'Dan laluan ini, saya rasa ia jarang digunakan.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>846.52,'end_time'=>847.1,'target_text'=>'What do you think?','source_text'=>'Apa pendapat awak?','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>847.2,'end_time'=>848.98,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe just by the monkeys.','source_text'=>'Mungkin hanya monyet yang lalu sini.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>849.08,'end_time'=>850.42,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe just by the monkeys.','source_text'=>'Mungkin hanya digunakan oleh monyet.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>850.52,'end_time'=>852.86,'target_text'=>'But yeah, it looks like some people put sticks there.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, nampaknya ada orang letak ranting-ranting kayu di situ.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>852.96,'end_time'=>854.9,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t look like that\'s naturally there.','source_text'=>'Tidak nampak seperti ia jatuh secara semula jadi di situ.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>855,'end_time'=>855.86,'target_text'=>'Why do you think that?','source_text'=>'Kenapa awak rasa begitu?','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>855.96,'end_time'=>859.62,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe to defend themselves or clean up.','source_text'=>'Mungkin untuk pertahankan diri atau untuk bersihkan kawasan.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>859.72,'end_time'=>860.18,'target_text'=>'>> From what?','source_text'=>'Daripada apa?','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>860.28,'end_time'=>860.98,'target_text'=>'>> The monkeys.','source_text'=>'Daripada monyet-monyet.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>861.08,'end_time'=>861.86,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe.','source_text'=>'Mungkin juga.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>861.96,'end_time'=>865.1,'target_text'=>'Now on this side, I don\'t even see the paved path anymore.','source_text'=>'Sekarang di sebelah sini, saya langsung tak nampak lagi laluan berturap.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>865.2,'end_time'=>867.38,'target_text'=>'I just see like a dirt trail now.','source_text'=>'Saya cuma nampak seperti denai tanah merah sahaja sekarang.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>867.48,'end_time'=>869.5,'target_text'=>'Yeah, I think it ended over there.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya rasa laluannya tamat di sebelah sana tadi.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>869.6,'end_time'=>873.02,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this is part of the trail, but it looks like it continues up over there.','source_text'=>'Ya, ini sebahagian daripada denai, tetapi nampaknya ia bersambung naik ke atas sebelah sana.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>873.12,'end_time'=>879.22,'target_text'=>'Yeah, the initial stretch was like nice and paved, but then it went overgrown, and now it looks like the sand from the top','source_text'=>'Ya, laluan awal tadi sangat elok berturap, tapi kemudian ia mula ditumbuhi semak, dan sekarang nampaknya pasir dari puncak','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>879.32,'end_time'=>883.78,'target_text'=>'of this small hill has come down and completely covered the paved trail.','source_text'=>'bukit kecil ini meluncur turun dan menutupi laluan berturap sepenuhnya.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>883.88,'end_time'=>887.46,'target_text'=>'So, we\'re kind of like Bear Grylls out here in the wild.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita dah macam Bear Grylls di alam liar sekarang ini.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>887.56,'end_time'=>893.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this looks a little wet, so I think when it rains, cuz it just rained yesterday, it brings this all down and covers','source_text'=>'Ya, kawasan ini nampak agak basah, jadi saya rasa bila hujan, lagipun semalam baru hujan, ia menghanyutkan semua tanah ini turun dan menutupi','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>893.96,'end_time'=>894.32,'target_text'=>'it.','source_text'=>'laluan.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>894.32,'end_time'=>899.1,'target_text'=>'>> Is it normal for it to be raining this much this time of the year in KL?','source_text'=>'Adakah ini normal untuk hujan lebat sebegini pada waktu begini sepanjang tahun di KL?','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>899.2,'end_time'=>901.9,'target_text'=>'Like the past week or two, it\'s been raining every day.','source_text'=>'Seminggu dua kebelakangan ini, hujan turun hampir setiap hari.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>902,'end_time'=>904.58,'target_text'=>'At night usually, but yeah, is that normal?','source_text'=>'Biasanya waktu malam, tapi ya, adakah itu perkara biasa?','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>904.68,'end_time'=>907.9,'target_text'=>'>> Well, from what I understand, monsoon season is right away.','source_text'=>'Mengikut pemahaman saya, musim monsun akan tiba tak lama lagi.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>908,'end_time'=>910.06,'target_text'=>'I think it starts in March.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ia bermula pada bulan Mac.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>910.16,'end_time'=>913.06,'target_text'=>'So, this is the beginning of the monsoon season.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ini adalah permulaan musim monsun.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>913.16,'end_time'=>916.66,'target_text'=>'And then when it\'s monsoon season, it\'s going to rain every day.','source_text'=>'Dan bila tiba musim monsun, hujan akan turun setiap hari.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>916.76,'end_time'=>919.26,'target_text'=>'>> From my understanding, it starts in April.','source_text'=>'Dari pemahaman saya pula, ia bermula pada bulan April.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>919.36,'end_time'=>925.1,'target_text'=>'And from what I\'ve heard from people, they said it is very unusual for it to be raining this time of the year.','source_text'=>'Dan daripada apa yang saya dengar daripada orang ramai, mereka kata sangat luar biasa untuk hujan lebat pada waktu begini dalam setahun.','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>925.2,'end_time'=>927.54,'target_text'=>'This time of the year is supposed to be dry and hot.','source_text'=>'Waktu-waktu begini sepatutnya cuaca kering dan panas.','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>927.64,'end_time'=>931.7,'target_text'=>'When does the rainy season start in Kuala Lumpur?','source_text'=>'Bilakah musim hujan bermula di Kuala Lumpur?','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>931.8,'end_time'=>935.06,'target_text'=>'The wettest months are October, November, and April.','source_text'=>'Bulan paling basah ialah Oktober, November, dan April.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>935.16,'end_time'=>939.7,'target_text'=>'We\'re currently, according to this, in monsoon season, November to March.','source_text'=>'Menurut maklumat ini, sekarang kita berada dalam musim monsun, iaitu dari November hingga Mac.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>939.8,'end_time'=>941.78,'target_text'=>'I thought it was dry season, I might be tripping.','source_text'=>'Saya ingatkan sekarang musim kering, mungkin saya tersilap.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>941.88,'end_time'=>946.7,'target_text'=>'Let\'s keep going and walking down this big, heavy, overgrown path.','source_text'=>'Jom kita teruskan perjalanan menyusuri laluan bersemak tebal ini.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>946.8,'end_time'=>948.58,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure if you guys can hear that.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada anda semua boleh dengar bunyi itu.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>948.68,'end_time'=>952.02,'target_text'=>'If not, insert some uh bird audio.','source_text'=>'Kalau tak dengar, nanti selitkan sedikit audio burung.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>952.12,'end_time'=>955.12,'target_text'=>'But, the birds are chirping.','source_text'=>'Tetapi, burung-burung sedang berkicau.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>955.4,'end_time'=>956.66,'target_text'=>'The birds are chirping.','source_text'=>'Burung-burung sedang berkicau (chirping).','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>956.76,'end_time'=>958.54,'target_text'=>'Or, you could say the birds are singing.','source_text'=>'Atau, anda boleh sebut burung-burung sedang menyanyi.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>958.64,'end_time'=>961.58,'target_text'=>'Birds are singing, or they are chirping, which is very beautiful.','source_text'=>'Burung sedang menyanyi, atau mereka sedang berkicau, bunyinya sangat merdu.','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>961.68,'end_time'=>969.22,'target_text'=>'If you guys liked this slow English podcast, and you want to see more videos like these, let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Jika anda semua sukakan podcast bahasa Inggeris santai ini, dan ingin tonton lebih banyak video seperti ini, beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>969.32,'end_time'=>974.5,'target_text'=>'Also, let me know how long you want these type of vlogs to be, the slow English vlogs.','source_text'=>'Juga, beritahu saya berapa panjang durasi yang anda mahukan untuk vlog santai sebegini.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>974.6,'end_time'=>978.98,'target_text'=>'Do you want them around 10 minutes, 15 minutes, or 20 minutes plus?','source_text'=>'Adakah anda mahukan sekitar 10 minit, 15 minit, atau lebih 20 minit?','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>979.08,'end_time'=>986.3,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking, shadowing, and pronunciation course you can','source_text'=>'Jika anda serius ingin fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya telah bina kursus pertuturan, teknik shadowing, dan sebutan yang lengkap yang anda boleh','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>986.4,'end_time'=>988.22,'target_text'=>'follow step-by-step.','source_text'=>'ikuti langkah demi langkah.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>988.32,'end_time'=>997.22,'target_text'=>'You get instant access to over 60 video lessons right away, and I add three to five brand new lessons every week to keep the','source_text'=>'Anda dapat akses serta-merta kepada lebih 60 video pelajaran sekarang, dan saya menambah tiga hingga lima pelajaran baharu setiap minggu untuk memastikan','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>997.32,'end_time'=>998.98,'target_text'=>'content fresh.','source_text'=>'kandungannya sentiasa terkini.','order'=>329],
