            ['start_time'=>167.6,'end_time'=>168.78,'target_text'=>'This is also a pomelo.','source_text'=>'Ini pun limau bali juga.','order'=>83],
            ['start_time'=>168.88,'end_time'=>170.7,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, dude, that\'s huge.','source_text'=>'Oh kawan, besarnya buah itu.','order'=>84],
            ['start_time'=>170.8,'end_time'=>173.26,'target_text'=>'>> They get really massive, but you got to remember the skin is thick.','source_text'=>'Saiznya memang sangat besar, tapi awak kena ingat kulitnya tebal.','order'=>85],
            ['start_time'=>173.36,'end_time'=>177.34,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, and this is the vegetable area, so there are a lot of vegetables here.','source_text'=>'Ya, dan ini bahagian sayur-sayuran, jadi ada banyak sayur di sini.','order'=>86],
            ['start_time'=>177.44,'end_time'=>179.26,'target_text'=>'>> Are you planning to do much cooking?','source_text'=>'Awak bercadang nak banyak memasak ke?','order'=>87],
            ['start_time'=>179.36,'end_time'=>183.3,'target_text'=>'>> No, that\'s why I just bought bananas and the rest of the stuff on my list.','source_text'=>'Tak, sebab itulah saya cuma beli pisang dan selebihnya barang dalam senarai saya.','order'=>88],
            ['start_time'=>183.4,'end_time'=>188.34,'target_text'=>'The rest of the stuff, toilet paper, toothpaste, soap, none of these are ingredients for cooking.','source_text'=>'Barang yang lain seperti tisu tandas, ubat gigi, sabun, tiada satu pun daripadanya bahan untuk memasak.','order'=>89],
            ['start_time'=>188.44,'end_time'=>192.34,'target_text'=>'So, I won\'t be doing any cooking, but let\'s add banana to the list.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya takkan memasak apa-apa, tapi jom masukkan pisang ke dalam senarai.','order'=>90],
            ['start_time'=>192.44,'end_time'=>196.42,'target_text'=>'>> You know we\'re in a Chinese grocery when you have gluten balls.','source_text'=>'Awak tahu kita berada di kedai runcit Cina bila ada bebola gluten.','order'=>91],
            ['start_time'=>196.52,'end_time'=>199.34,'target_text'=>'>> And dude, look at those Look at the size of those peppers.','source_text'=>'Dan kawan, tengok saiz lada-lada itu.','order'=>92],
            ['start_time'=>199.44,'end_time'=>202.02,'target_text'=>'>> But, I can guarantee that those are not very spicy.','source_text'=>'Tapi, saya boleh jamin lada itu tak berapa pedas.','order'=>93],
            ['start_time'=>202.12,'end_time'=>203.5,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, let\'s get the toilet paper, toothpaste.','source_text'=>'Ya, jom kita ambil tisu tandas, ubat gigi.','order'=>94],
            ['start_time'=>203.6,'end_time'=>206.14,'target_text'=>'We got to go outside the produce area.','source_text'=>'Kita kena keluar dari kawasan hasil segar ini.','order'=>95],
            ['start_time'=>206.24,'end_time'=>208.38,'target_text'=>'Here is the fish area.','source_text'=>'Di sini ialah kawasan ikan.','order'=>96],
            ['start_time'=>208.48,'end_time'=>209.9,'target_text'=>'There are a bunch of fish here.','source_text'=>'Ada banyak ikan di sini.','order'=>97],
            ['start_time'=>210,'end_time'=>211.34,'target_text'=>'>> This almost looks like a piranha.','source_text'=>'Yang ini nampak hampir macam ikan piranha.','order'=>98],
            ['start_time'=>211.44,'end_time'=>212.5,'target_text'=>'>> Like a piranha, yeah.','source_text'=>'Macam piranha, ya.','order'=>99],
            ['start_time'=>212.6,'end_time'=>214.1,'target_text'=>'Those look like kind of like >> Those are mackerel.','source_text'=>'Yang itu pula nampak macam Ikan itu ikan tenggiri (mackerel).','order'=>100],
            ['start_time'=>214.2,'end_time'=>214.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>101],
            ['start_time'=>214.96,'end_time'=>217.06,'target_text'=>'Let\'s go around this area.','source_text'=>'Jom kita pusing keliling kawasan ini.','order'=>102],
            ['start_time'=>217.16,'end_time'=>219.06,'target_text'=>'Here is just a lot more produce.','source_text'=>'Di sini cuma ada lebih banyak hasil segar.','order'=>103],
            ['start_time'=>219.16,'end_time'=>224.02,'target_text'=>'And right now, I\'m pushing this shopping cart through the grocery store.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang, saya sedang tolak troli beli-belah ini merentasi kedai runcit.','order'=>104],
            ['start_time'=>224.12,'end_time'=>227.7,'target_text'=>'And I guess this is where you pay, or no, that\'s where you weigh your goods.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa di sini tempat bayar, eh bukan, itu tempat timbang barang.','order'=>105],
            ['start_time'=>227.8,'end_time'=>228.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, maybe you got to weigh there.','source_text'=>'Oh, mungkin kena timbang dekat sana.','order'=>106],
            ['start_time'=>229.04,'end_time'=>231.98,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, do you want to go weigh these bananas?','source_text'=>'Ya, awak nak pergi timbang pisang ini ke?','order'=>107],
            ['start_time'=>232.08,'end_time'=>233.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I\'ll weigh them.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya tolong timbangkan.','order'=>108],
            ['start_time'=>233.4,'end_time'=>234.78,'target_text'=>'>> I\'ll go to the side here.','source_text'=>'Saya pergi ke tepi sini.','order'=>109],
            ['start_time'=>234.88,'end_time'=>237.7,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, Leon is just weighing the bananas.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ya, Leon sedang timbang pisang tersebut.','order'=>110],
            ['start_time'=>237.8,'end_time'=>238.3,'target_text'=>'>> What do you say?','source_text'=>'Awak cakap apa tadi?','order'=>111],
            ['start_time'=>238.4,'end_time'=>239.94,'target_text'=>'>> You pointed me that way.','source_text'=>'Awak tunjuk saya ke arah sana.','order'=>112],
            ['start_time'=>240.04,'end_time'=>242.18,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so that is a fruit weighing station.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi itu tempat menimbang buah.','order'=>113],
            ['start_time'=>242.28,'end_time'=>244.66,'target_text'=>'So, Leon needs to first go and weigh his fruit.','source_text'=>'Jadi, Leon perlu pergi timbang buahnya dahulu.','order'=>114],
            ['start_time'=>244.76,'end_time'=>251.64,'target_text'=>'Usually in Canada, they do this when you get to the cash register, but here it looks like they do it here.','source_text'=>'Kebiasaannya di Kanada, mereka buat ini bila sampai di kaunter bayaran, tapi nampaknya di sini dibuat di kaunter timbang khas.','order'=>115],
            ['start_time'=>252.12,'end_time'=>252.86,'target_text'=>'Thank you.','source_text'=>'Terima kasih.','order'=>116],
            ['start_time'=>252.96,'end_time'=>254.38,'target_text'=>'Bro, 420.','source_text'=>'Bro, empat ringgit dua puluh sen.','order'=>117],
            ['start_time'=>254.48,'end_time'=>258.82,'target_text'=>'That\'s like a dollar 50 cents Canadian.','source_text'=>'Itu lebih kurang satu dolar lima puluh sen Kanada.','order'=>118],
            ['start_time'=>258.92,'end_time'=>263.38,'target_text'=>'So, they weighed our bananas at the fruit weighing station and then put a price tag on it.','source_text'=>'Jadi, mereka dah timbang pisang kita di kaunter timbang buah dan kemudian lekatkan tanda harga padanya.','order'=>119],
            ['start_time'=>263.48,'end_time'=>266.38,'target_text'=>'So, when we go to check out, they\'ll scan this barcode.','source_text'=>'Jadi, bila kita pergi ke kaunter bayaran nanti, mereka cuma akan imbas kod bar ini.','order'=>120],
            ['start_time'=>266.48,'end_time'=>269.1,'target_text'=>'And I guess that one was the vegetable area.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa yang tadi itu kawasan sayur-sayuran.','order'=>121],
            ['start_time'=>269.2,'end_time'=>271.7,'target_text'=>'>> think they the signs say vegetable, too.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa papan tanda itu pun tulis sayur-sayuran juga.','order'=>122],
            ['start_time'=>271.8,'end_time'=>274.42,'target_text'=>'>> Here we have some frozen meats.','source_text'=>'Di sini kita ada daging sejuk beku.','order'=>123],
            ['start_time'=>274.52,'end_time'=>275.86,'target_text'=>'Looks like yeah, beef feet.','source_text'=>'Kelihatan seperti ya, kaki lembu.','order'=>124],
            ['start_time'=>275.96,'end_time'=>277.18,'target_text'=>'Oh, they have Brazilian beef.','source_text'=>'Oh, mereka ada daging lembu dari Brazil.','order'=>125],
            ['start_time'=>277.28,'end_time'=>278.66,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you\'re from Brazil.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya jika anda berasal dari Brazil.','order'=>126],
            ['start_time'=>278.76,'end_time'=>279.98,'target_text'=>'Over here they have mutton.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sini pula mereka ada daging kambing (mutton).','order'=>127],
            ['start_time'=>280.08,'end_time'=>285.58,'target_text'=>'Do you think we should buy like condiments like ketchup or barbecue sauce or something?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa kita patut beli sos pencicah macam sos tomato atau sos barbeku ke?','order'=>128],
            ['start_time'=>285.68,'end_time'=>287.22,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I think ketchup would be good.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya rasa sos tomato bagus juga.','order'=>129],
            ['start_time'=>287.32,'end_time'=>288.02,'target_text'=>'>> I think so.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa begitu juga.','order'=>130],
            ['start_time'=>288.12,'end_time'=>289.58,'target_text'=>'Oh, eggs.','source_text'=>'Oh, telur.','order'=>131],
            ['start_time'=>289.68,'end_time'=>290.7,'target_text'=>'You think we should buy some eggs?','source_text'=>'Awak rasa kita patut beli telur ke?','order'=>132],
            ['start_time'=>290.8,'end_time'=>291.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they\'re not bad.','source_text'=>'Ya, elok juga.','order'=>133],
            ['start_time'=>291.68,'end_time'=>292.82,'target_text'=>'11 per packet.','source_text'=>'Sebelas ringgit satu pek.','order'=>134],
            ['start_time'=>292.92,'end_time'=>293.78,'target_text'=>'11 is what?','source_text'=>'Sebelas ringgit itu berapa?','order'=>135],
            ['start_time'=>293.88,'end_time'=>295.78,'target_text'=>'>> 11 is like $4.','source_text'=>'Sebelas ringgit lebih kurang empat dolar.','order'=>136],
            ['start_time'=>295.88,'end_time'=>296.28,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>137],
            ['start_time'=>296.28,'end_time'=>296.82,'target_text'=>'>> Should we buy?','source_text'=>'Patut kita beli ke?','order'=>138],
            ['start_time'=>296.92,'end_time'=>298.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, these ones look popular.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ini nampak paling laris.','order'=>139],
            ['start_time'=>298.4,'end_time'=>299.54,'target_text'=>'We\'ll just get these ones.','source_text'=>'Kita ambil yang ini sahaja.','order'=>140],
            ['start_time'=>299.64,'end_time'=>301.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I guess we could go with that one.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya rasa kita boleh ambil yang itu.','order'=>141],
            ['start_time'=>301.48,'end_time'=>302.5,'target_text'=>'So, how many are these?','source_text'=>'Jadi, ada berapa biji ini?','order'=>142],
            ['start_time'=>302.6,'end_time'=>303.3,'target_text'=>'Three dozen?','source_text'=>'Tiga dozen ke?','order'=>143],
            ['start_time'=>303.4,'end_time'=>304.38,'target_text'=>'Oh, 30.','source_text'=>'Oh, tiga puluh biji.','order'=>144],
            ['start_time'=>304.48,'end_time'=>305.54,'target_text'=>'30 eggs.','source_text'=>'Tiga puluh biji telur.','order'=>145],
            ['start_time'=>305.64,'end_time'=>310.38,'target_text'=>'Now, I\'m going to take the carton of eggs and place it into the shopping cart.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, saya akan ambil sarang telur ini dan letakkannya ke dalam troli beli-belah.','order'=>146],
            ['start_time'=>310.48,'end_time'=>313.7,'target_text'=>'I\'ve just placed the eggs into the shopping cart.','source_text'=>'Saya baru saja letakkan telur ke dalam troli beli-belah.','order'=>147],
            ['start_time'=>313.8,'end_time'=>317.7,'target_text'=>'Here we have packaged goods, a lot of packaged goods.','source_text'=>'Di sini kita ada barang berbungkus, banyak barang berbungkus.','order'=>148],
            ['start_time'=>317.8,'end_time'=>321.78,'target_text'=>'I think we\'ve added more things that aren\'t from our list than from our actual list.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita dah tambah lebih banyak barang yang tiada dalam senarai berbanding senarai asal kita.','order'=>149],
            ['start_time'=>321.88,'end_time'=>326.34,'target_text'=>'Toothpaste, soap, detergent, toilet paper, water, and soda.','source_text'=>'Ubat gigi, sabun, sabun pencuci, tisu tandas, air, dan air bikarbonat.','order'=>150],
            ['start_time'=>326.44,'end_time'=>327.7,'target_text'=>'Oh, water is over here.','source_text'=>'Oh, air ada di sebelah sini.','order'=>151],
            ['start_time'=>327.8,'end_time'=>333.54,'target_text'=>'Should we just buy a big water and then we could refill it at the or should we buy like something like this?','source_text'=>'Patutkah kita beli air botol besar saja dan kemudian kita boleh isi semula, atau patut kita beli yang macam ini?','order'=>152],
            ['start_time'=>333.64,'end_time'=>334.98,'target_text'=>'>> Nah, let\'s just take a big one.','source_text'=>'Tak perlulah, kita ambil botol besar saja.','order'=>153],
            ['start_time'=>335.08,'end_time'=>337.1,'target_text'=>'>> Or actually, I think this would be a better deal.','source_text'=>'Atau sebenarnya, saya rasa yang ini lebih berbaloi.','order'=>154],
            ['start_time'=>337.2,'end_time'=>339.18,'target_text'=>'>> You have to get natural mineral water.','source_text'=>'Awak kena ambil air mineral semula jadi.','order'=>155],
            ['start_time'=>339.28,'end_time'=>340.14,'target_text'=>'That\'s what you want to look for.','source_text'=>'Itu yang patut awak cari.','order'=>156],
            ['start_time'=>340.24,'end_time'=>341.62,'target_text'=>'>> same brand, Nestle.','source_text'=>'Jenama yang sama, Nestle.','order'=>157],
            ['start_time'=>341.72,'end_time'=>343.5,'target_text'=>'>> And we\'re going to carry this all the way back.','source_text'=>'Dan kita kena angkat benda ini sepanjang jalan balik nanti.','order'=>158],
            ['start_time'=>343.6,'end_time'=>344.22,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s true.','source_text'=>'Betul juga itu.','order'=>159],
            ['start_time'=>344.32,'end_time'=>345.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s low-key kind of heavy.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya agak berat juga.','order'=>160],
            ['start_time'=>345.52,'end_time'=>346.7,'target_text'=>'Maybe we\'ll get a grab then.','source_text'=>'Mungkin kita naik Grab sajalah nanti.','order'=>161],
            ['start_time'=>346.8,'end_time'=>348.6,'target_text'=>'>> Ooh.','source_text'=>'Ooh.','order'=>162],
            ['start_time'=>349.68,'end_time'=>350,'target_text'=>'>> Okay.','source_text'=>'Baiklah.','order'=>163],
            ['start_time'=>350,'end_time'=>351.66,'target_text'=>'>> we got our drinking water there.','source_text'=>'Kita dah dapat air minuman kita di sana.','order'=>164],
            ['start_time'=>351.76,'end_time'=>355.06,'target_text'=>'I think we\'ll probably have to take a taxi back since that\'s going to be really heavy.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita mungkin kena naik teksi balik nanti sebab barang ini akan jadi sangat berat.','order'=>165],
            ['start_time'=>355.16,'end_time'=>356.46,'target_text'=>'It shouldn\'t be too much.','source_text'=>'Tambangnya tak mahal sangat rasanya.','order'=>166],
            ['start_time'=>356.56,'end_time'=>357.06,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Tak mahal.','order'=>167],
            ['start_time'=>357.16,'end_time'=>357.7,'target_text'=>'>> Pocari Sweat.','source_text'=>'Pocari Sweat.','order'=>168],
            ['start_time'=>357.8,'end_time'=>359.14,'target_text'=>'Where is Pocari Sweat from?','source_text'=>'Pocari Sweat ini dari mana?','order'=>169],
            ['start_time'=>359.24,'end_time'=>360.02,'target_text'=>'>> Japan.','source_text'=>'Jepun.','order'=>170],
            ['start_time'=>360.12,'end_time'=>360.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, is it?','source_text'=>'Oh, ya ke?','order'=>171],
            ['start_time'=>360.84,'end_time'=>361.16,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>172],
            ['start_time'=>361.16,'end_time'=>363.82,'target_text'=>'>> First time I saw it, I saw it in Korea, so I thought it was Korean.','source_text'=>'Kali pertama saya nampak, saya jumpa di Korea, jadi saya ingatkan ia produk Korea.','order'=>173],
            ['start_time'=>363.92,'end_time'=>365.74,'target_text'=>'Soda should be around here somewhere.','source_text'=>'Air berkarbonat sepatutnya ada di sekitar sini.','order'=>174],
            ['start_time'=>365.84,'end_time'=>366.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, right here.','source_text'=>'Ya, betul-betul di sini.','order'=>175],
            ['start_time'=>366.68,'end_time'=>369.22,'target_text'=>'>> But uh yeah, I guess cans are all right.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, saya rasa jenis tin pun okey juga.','order'=>176],
            ['start_time'=>369.32,'end_time'=>371.22,'target_text'=>'Or do you want like still small bottles?','source_text'=>'Atau awak nak botol kecil biasa?','order'=>177],
            ['start_time'=>371.32,'end_time'=>377.02,'target_text'=>'You could buy like a big thing of soda, a liter and a half, but I don\'t think we\'ll drink this much soda in one sitting, so','source_text'=>'Awak boleh beli botol air bikarbonat yang besar, satu liter setengah, tapi saya rasa kita takkan minum sebanyak itu sekali hadap, jadi','order'=>178],
            ['start_time'=>377.12,'end_time'=>379.46,'target_text'=>'I think the cans would be better to buy.','source_text'=>'saya rasa lebih elok beli jenis tin.','order'=>179],
            ['start_time'=>379.56,'end_time'=>380.54,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s the only packet.','source_text'=>'Itu satu-satunya pek.','order'=>180],
            ['start_time'=>380.64,'end_time'=>381.86,'target_text'=>'Everything else is individual.','source_text'=>'Yang lain semua dijual satu-satu.','order'=>181],
            ['start_time'=>381.96,'end_time'=>384.54,'target_text'=>'Although they got more packets up here, but it\'s the same.','source_text'=>'Walaupun ada lebih banyak pek di bahagian atas ini, tapi jenamanya sama.','order'=>182],
            ['start_time'=>384.64,'end_time'=>386.42,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, those comes in packets of four.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang itu datang dalam pek empat tin.','order'=>183],
            ['start_time'=>386.52,'end_time'=>386.92,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>184],
            ['start_time'=>387,'end_time'=>388.14,'target_text'=>'>> I guess let\'s get those.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa jom kita ambil yang itu.','order'=>185],
            ['start_time'=>388.24,'end_time'=>389.26,'target_text'=>'>> What about up there?','source_text'=>'Bagaimana dengan yang di atas sana?','order'=>186],
            ['start_time'=>389.36,'end_time'=>394.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, they have more sodas on the top shelf, and there are many shelves here.','source_text'=>'Ya, mereka ada lebih banyak air bikarbonat di rak atas, dan ada banyak rak di sini.','order'=>187],
            ['start_time'=>394.64,'end_time'=>397.46,'target_text'=>'And all these shelves are filled with sodas.','source_text'=>'Dan semua rak ini dipenuhi dengan minuman berkarbonat.','order'=>188],
