            ['start_time'=>420.76,'end_time'=>424.54,'target_text'=>'They don\'t have a zero sugar, though, but and then we can grab an A&W.','source_text'=>'Tapi mereka tiada jenis sifar gula, dan kemudian kita boleh ambil satu A&W.','order'=>203],
            ['start_time'=>424.64,'end_time'=>428.02,'target_text'=>'So there we got three sodas, so we can check that off the list.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita dah dapat tiga botol minuman bikarbonat, bolehlah kita tanda selesai pada senarai.','order'=>204],
            ['start_time'=>428.12,'end_time'=>430.54,'target_text'=>'I think the detergent will be there.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa sabun pencuci baju ada dekat sana.','order'=>205],
            ['start_time'=>430.64,'end_time'=>431.54,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s on this aisle here.','source_text'=>'Ada di lorong sebelah sini.','order'=>206],
            ['start_time'=>431.64,'end_time'=>436.82,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, so I think we\'re going to get uh liquid detergent since we don\'t see any pods.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi saya rasa kita akan ambil sabun pencuci jenis cecair memandangkan kita tak nampak jenis \'pod\'.','order'=>207],
            ['start_time'=>436.92,'end_time'=>440.78,'target_text'=>'So we\'re going to get this liquid detergent for our washing machine.','source_text'=>'Jadi kita akan ambil cecair pencuci ini untuk mesin basuh kita.','order'=>208],
            ['start_time'=>440.88,'end_time'=>443.42,'target_text'=>'I think all we need is one of these bags.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita cuma perlukan satu daripada beg isian semula ini.','order'=>209],
            ['start_time'=>443.52,'end_time'=>445.22,'target_text'=>'We don\'t need a solid container.','source_text'=>'Kita tak perlukan bekas botol keras.','order'=>210],
            ['start_time'=>445.32,'end_time'=>446.38,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, this will work for us.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ini dah memadai untuk kita.','order'=>211],
            ['start_time'=>446.48,'end_time'=>447.3,'target_text'=>'>> Okay, perfect.','source_text'=>'Okey, terbaik.','order'=>212],
            ['start_time'=>447.4,'end_time'=>451.06,'target_text'=>'There is also powder, washing powder, powder.','source_text'=>'Ada juga jenis serbuk, serbuk pencuci pakaian, serbuk.','order'=>213],
            ['start_time'=>451.16,'end_time'=>457.74,'target_text'=>'But uh sometimes powder leaves stains on your clothes, so that\'s why I prefer to use liquid.','source_text'=>'Tapi kadang-kadang serbuk meninggalkan kesan tompok pada pakaian, sebab itulah saya lebih suka guna jenis cecair.','order'=>214],
            ['start_time'=>457.84,'end_time'=>460.37,'target_text'=>'We can check that off the list, detergent.','source_text'=>'Kita boleh tanda selesai dalam senarai, sabun pencuci baju.','order'=>215],
            ['start_time'=>460.47,'end_time'=>463.86,'target_text'=>'[music] Okay, guys, we finished doing all our shopping.','source_text'=>'[muzik] Baiklah semua, kita dah selesai membeli-belah.','order'=>216],
            ['start_time'=>463.96,'end_time'=>467.5,'target_text'=>'We got a 12 pack of water, but each bottle is 1 and 1/2 L.','source_text'=>'Kita dapat satu pek 12 botol air, dan setiap botol berukuran 1.5 liter.','order'=>217],
            ['start_time'=>467.6,'end_time'=>469.46,'target_text'=>'We also got three bottles of soda.','source_text'=>'Kita juga dapat tiga botol air bikarbonat.','order'=>218],
            ['start_time'=>469.56,'end_time'=>471.26,'target_text'=>'I got toothpaste cuz I need it.','source_text'=>'Saya beli ubat gigi sebab saya memang perlukannya.','order'=>219],
            ['start_time'=>471.36,'end_time'=>475.38,'target_text'=>'And we also got laundry detergent and some eggs and some bananas.','source_text'=>'Dan kita juga dapat sabun pencuci baju, telur, dan sedikit pisang.','order'=>220],
            ['start_time'=>475.48,'end_time'=>477.58,'target_text'=>'So, we managed to get almost everything.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita berjaya dapatkan hampir semua barang.','order'=>221],
            ['start_time'=>477.68,'end_time'=>479.54,'target_text'=>'What\'s the two things we couldn\'t get?','source_text'=>'Apa dua barang yang kita tak dapat beli tadi?','order'=>222],
            ['start_time'=>479.64,'end_time'=>482.94,'target_text'=>'>> Well, they did have toilet paper, but we don\'t need a 12 pack.','source_text'=>'Mereka sebenarnya ada tisu tandas, tapi kita tak perlukan pek 12 gulung.','order'=>223],
            ['start_time'=>483.04,'end_time'=>484.86,'target_text'=>'That\'s way too much toilet paper per month.','source_text'=>'Itu terlalu banyak tisu tandas untuk sebulan.','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>484.96,'end_time'=>486.58,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we need like half of that.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita cuma perlukan separuh daripada itu.','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>486.68,'end_time'=>487.94,'target_text'=>'We just need six.','source_text'=>'Kita cuma perlukan enam gulung.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>488.04,'end_time'=>489.42,'target_text'=>'>> Maybe a six pack.','source_text'=>'Mungkin pek enam gulung.','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>489.52,'end_time'=>491.78,'target_text'=>'And then we also need a bar of soap.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian kita juga perlukan sabun buku.','order'=>228],
            ['start_time'=>491.88,'end_time'=>495.22,'target_text'=>'I don\'t know why they didn\'t sell it here, but we\'ll go to Watsons for that.','source_text'=>'Saya tak tahu kenapa mereka tak jual di sini, tapi kita akan pergi ke Watsons untuk cari sabun itu.','order'=>229],
            ['start_time'=>495.32,'end_time'=>496.86,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, we need a bar of soap.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita perlukan seketul sabun buku.','order'=>230],
            ['start_time'=>496.96,'end_time'=>505.22,'target_text'=>'I like using a bar of soap to either wash my hands or to lather up my hands to wash my body or to lather up my washcloth.','source_text'=>'Saya suka guna sabun buku untuk cuci tangan atau berbuihkan tangan untuk mandi atau sabunkan kain basuh badan saya.','order'=>231],
            ['start_time'=>505.32,'end_time'=>509.78,'target_text'=>'So, yeah, this is all the stuff we bought and now we\'re waiting for our taxi.','source_text'=>'Jadi, ya, inilah semua barang yang kita beli dan sekarang kita sedang menunggu teksi.','order'=>232],
            ['start_time'=>509.88,'end_time'=>512.54,'target_text'=>'Yeah, we booked a Grab and now we\'re just waiting for it to come.','source_text'=>'Ya, kita dah tempah Grab dan sekarang kita cuma tunggu ia sampai.','order'=>233],
            ['start_time'=>512.64,'end_time'=>516.94,'target_text'=>'It\'s 5 minutes away now, so he should be here soon and then he\'ll bring us to where we\'re staying.','source_text'=>'Lagi 5 minit pemandu akan sampai, jadi sekejap lagi dia sampai dan bawa kita balik ke tempat penginapan kita.','order'=>234],
            ['start_time'=>517.04,'end_time'=>521.9,'target_text'=>'Normally, we could just walk back, but this is way too heavy to carry for over a kilometer.','source_text'=>'Biasanya, kita boleh saja jalan kaki balik, tapi barang ini terlalu berat untuk diangkat lebih satu kilometer.','order'=>235],
            ['start_time'=>522,'end_time'=>525.74,'target_text'=>'I mean, we could probably do it, but it\'s just more convenient to just get a taxi.','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, kita mungkin boleh larat bawa, tapi jauh lebih mudah kalau naik teksi saja.','order'=>236],
            ['start_time'=>525.84,'end_time'=>527.02,'target_text'=>'>> We\'re in the elevator.','source_text'=>'Kita berada di dalam lif.','order'=>237],
            ['start_time'=>527.12,'end_time'=>528.5,'target_text'=>'I got the shopping.','source_text'=>'Saya pegang barang beli-belah.','order'=>238],
            ['start_time'=>528.6,'end_time'=>531.3,'target_text'=>'Leon has the eggs and water.','source_text'=>'Leon bawa telur dan air.','order'=>239],
            ['start_time'=>531.4,'end_time'=>536.5,'target_text'=>'I kind of started unpacking the stuff already, but yeah, we got the toothpaste, bunch of water.','source_text'=>'Saya dah mula buka bungkusan barang-barang ini sedikit, ya, kita ada ubat gigi, banyak botol air.','order'=>240],
            ['start_time'=>536.6,'end_time'=>542.46,'target_text'=>'We put the eggs here and I already put the soda in the fridge just because I didn\'t want it out.','source_text'=>'Kita letakkan telur di sini dan saya dah pun masukkan air bikarbonat ke dalam peti sejuk sebab saya tak nak biarkan ia di luar.','order'=>241],
            ['start_time'=>542.56,'end_time'=>544.26,'target_text'=>'>> But these bags feel like Feel that.','source_text'=>'Tapi beg plastik ini terasa Rasa benda ini.','order'=>242],
            ['start_time'=>544.36,'end_time'=>545.82,'target_text'=>'Tell me that does not feel different.','source_text'=>'Cuba rasa, takkan awak kata ia tak rasa berbeza.','order'=>243],
            ['start_time'=>545.92,'end_time'=>549.3,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I know these aren\'t like regular shopping bags, but these are recycled, that\'s why.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya tahu ini bukan beg beli-belah biasa, tapi ini diperbuat daripada bahan kitar semula, sebab itulah.','order'=>244],
            ['start_time'=>549.4,'end_time'=>549.98,'target_text'=>'>> Recycled?','source_text'=>'Kitar semula?','order'=>245],
            ['start_time'=>550.08,'end_time'=>551.26,'target_text'=>'>> They\'re 100% recycled.','source_text'=>'100% bahan kitar semula.','order'=>246],
            ['start_time'=>551.36,'end_time'=>552.78,'target_text'=>'This is why they feel like this.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah teksturnya terasa begini.','order'=>247],
            ['start_time'=>552.88,'end_time'=>555.14,'target_text'=>'They\'re 100% compostable.','source_text'=>'Ia 100% boleh dikomposkan.','order'=>248],
            ['start_time'=>555.24,'end_time'=>555.82,'target_text'=>'It says right here.','source_text'=>'Ada tertulis betul-betul di sini.','order'=>249],
            ['start_time'=>555.92,'end_time'=>556.32,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>250],
            ['start_time'=>556.32,'end_time'=>558.38,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, \"I\'m not a plastic bag.','source_text'=>'\"Saya bukan beg plastik. Saya 100% boleh dikomposkan.\" Ini boleh terurai secara biologi (biodegradable), jadi kalau dibiarkan, lama-kelamaan ia akan hancur','order'=>251],
            ['start_time'=>558.48,'end_time'=>565.94,'target_text'=>'I\'m 100% compostable.\" This is biodegradable, so you can leave this and eventually it\'ll just, you know, degrade compared','source_text'=>'berbanding plastik biasa yang langsung tidak terurai.','order'=>252],
            ['start_time'=>566.04,'end_time'=>568.54,'target_text'=>'to plastic which like never decomposes.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kalau awak biarkan sahaja beg ini, ia akan terurai akhirnya, tetapi plastik biasa tidak akan terurai.','order'=>253],
            ['start_time'=>568.64,'end_time'=>574.1,'target_text'=>'So, if you just leave this, it\'ll decompose eventually, but regular plastic wouldn\'t decompose.','source_text'=>'Ia akan kekal sebagai plastik selama mungkin 1,000 tahun.','order'=>254],
            ['start_time'=>574.2,'end_time'=>578.1,'target_text'=>'It would stay as plastic for, I don\'t know, 1,000 years.','source_text'=>'Wah.','order'=>255],
            ['start_time'=>578.2,'end_time'=>578.6,'target_text'=>'>> Wow.','source_text'=>'Selama mana plastik boleh bertahan.','order'=>256],
            ['start_time'=>578.6,'end_time'=>579.54,'target_text'=>'>> However long plastic lasts.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah ia terasa sangat berbeza bila dipegang, saya macam hairan rasa beg ini lain macam.','order'=>257],
            ['start_time'=>579.64,'end_time'=>582.78,'target_text'=>'That\'s why it feels so different cuz I I was like this feels really different.','source_text'=>'Ia tidak rasa seperti plastik.','order'=>258],
            ['start_time'=>582.88,'end_time'=>584.22,'target_text'=>'It doesn\'t feel like plastic.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>259],
            ['start_time'=>584.32,'end_time'=>584.72,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Dan saya rasa itulah sebabnya.','order'=>260],
            ['start_time'=>584.76,'end_time'=>585.78,'target_text'=>'>> And I guess that\'s why.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa mereka lebih peka terhadap alam sekitar di Malaysia, sebab straw minuman pun mereka masih guna straw kertas','order'=>261],
            ['start_time'=>585.88,'end_time'=>592.1,'target_text'=>'>> Well, I think they\'re more environmentally conscious in Malaysia cuz even the straws and stuff, they\'re still on the paper','source_text'=>'di mana-mana sahaja awak pergi.','order'=>262],
            ['start_time'=>592.2,'end_time'=>593.54,'target_text'=>'straws everywhere you go.','source_text'=>'Dan sekarang beg yang boleh dikomposkan sepenuhnya.','order'=>263],
            ['start_time'=>593.64,'end_time'=>595.9,'target_text'=>'And now the fully compostable bags.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>264],
            ['start_time'=>596,'end_time'=>596.54,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Itu sangat bagus.','order'=>265],
            ['start_time'=>596.64,'end_time'=>597.74,'target_text'=>'That\'s cool.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa kita buang sahaja beg-beg ini.','order'=>266],
            ['start_time'=>597.84,'end_time'=>598.7,'target_text'=>'I guess we\'ll just throw these away.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti sama ada kita ada kegunaan lain untuknya, tapi ya.','order'=>267],
            ['start_time'=>598.8,'end_time'=>601.94,'target_text'=>'I don\'t really know if we have any use for them, but uh yeah.','source_text'=>'Selain itu, kita cuma ada banyak botol air.','order'=>268],
            ['start_time'=>602.04,'end_time'=>604.1,'target_text'=>'Besides that, we just have a bunch of water.','source_text'=>'Jom kita masukkan semua ini ke dalam peti sejuk, ya?','order'=>269],
            ['start_time'=>604.2,'end_time'=>606.26,'target_text'=>'Let\'s just uh put this in the fridge, eh?','source_text'=>'Ya, elok juga.','order'=>270],
            ['start_time'=>606.36,'end_time'=>607.18,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, might as well.','source_text'=>'Jadi, Leon baru saja koyakkan plastik bungkusan botol air ini, dan sekarang dia sedang masukkan semua botol air ke dalam peti sejuk.','order'=>271],
            ['start_time'=>607.28,'end_time'=>614.7,'target_text'=>'>> So, Leon just tore open this water bottle plastic here, and now he\'s putting them in the fridge, all the water bottles.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita dapat banyak bekalan air di sini.','order'=>272],
            ['start_time'=>614.8,'end_time'=>616.54,'target_text'=>'So, we got a lot of water here.','source_text'=>'Agak-agak berapa lama bekalan ini boleh bertahan?','order'=>273],
            ['start_time'=>616.64,'end_time'=>619.1,'target_text'=>'How long do you think this will last?','source_text'=>'Maksud saya, saya biasanya minum sebotol sehari, jadi Okey, kita bahagikan separuh, dan bila air ini habis, awak kena','order'=>274],
            ['start_time'=>619.2,'end_time'=>625.18,'target_text'=>'>> Uh I mean, I usually drink one a day, so >> Okay, we\'ll divide it in half, and then if these are up, you\'re going to have','source_text'=>'pergi isi semula botol-botol ini sebab ada tempat isi air di tingkat atas.','order'=>275],
            ['start_time'=>625.28,'end_time'=>632.26,'target_text'=>'to go and fill these up cuz we do have a area to fill up the water bottles up a couple floors.','source_text'=>'Jadi, kita tidak semestinya perlu pergi beli lagi.','order'=>276],
            ['start_time'=>632.36,'end_time'=>634.62,'target_text'=>'So, we don\'t necessarily need to go buy more.','source_text'=>'Kita cuma boleh naik ke atas dan isi semula botol-botol ini.','order'=>277],
            ['start_time'=>634.72,'end_time'=>637.54,'target_text'=>'We can just go upstairs and refill these.','source_text'=>'Bayangkan kalau rasa air ini macam Dasani.','order'=>278],
            ['start_time'=>637.64,'end_time'=>640.98,'target_text'=>'>> Imagine if these waters tasted like Dasani.','source_text'=>'Sebab kita belum cuba lagi jenama yang ini.','order'=>279],
            ['start_time'=>641.08,'end_time'=>643.14,'target_text'=>'Cuz we haven\'t tried this one yet.','source_text'=>'Ya, itu memang tak seronok.','order'=>280],
            ['start_time'=>643.24,'end_time'=>643.94,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, that would suck.','source_text'=>'Tapi sejujurnya, asalkan air sejuk, rasanya tidaklah teruk sangat.','order'=>281],
            ['start_time'=>644.04,'end_time'=>647.46,'target_text'=>'But honestly, as long as water\'s cold, it\'s not that bad.','source_text'=>'Jadi, sekarang saya akan hulurkan botol ini kepada Leon.','order'=>282],
            ['start_time'=>647.56,'end_time'=>650.38,'target_text'=>'So, now I\'m going to pass this bottle to Leon.','source_text'=>'Jadi sekarang saya akan hulurkan botol ini kepada Leon.','order'=>283],
            ['start_time'=>650.48,'end_time'=>653.38,'target_text'=>'I\'ll pass this one to Leon as well.','source_text'=>'Saya hulurkan yang ini kepada Leon juga.','order'=>284],
            ['start_time'=>653.48,'end_time'=>656.04,'target_text'=>'And then the last two.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian dua botol yang terakhir.','order'=>285],
            ['start_time'=>656.76,'end_time'=>657.9,'target_text'=>'There you go.','source_text'=>'Nah, ambil ini.','order'=>286],
            ['start_time'=>658,'end_time'=>659.34,'target_text'=>'Throw that away.','source_text'=>'Buang yang itu.','order'=>287],
            ['start_time'=>659.44,'end_time'=>660.74,'target_text'=>'We\'ll throw that out later.','source_text'=>'Kita buang benda itu nanti.','order'=>288],
            ['start_time'=>660.84,'end_time'=>662.22,'target_text'=>'This is where we put our shoes.','source_text'=>'Di sinilah tempat kita letak kasut.','order'=>289],
            ['start_time'=>662.32,'end_time'=>665.74,'target_text'=>'The shoes aren\'t really organized, but it\'s not that messy, either.','source_text'=>'Kasut-kasut ini tidaklah begitu tersusun, tapi tidaklah juga berselerak sangat.','order'=>290],
            ['start_time'=>665.84,'end_time'=>667.46,'target_text'=>'But yeah, this is our apartment.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, inilah apartmen kami.','order'=>291],
            ['start_time'=>667.56,'end_time'=>668.9,'target_text'=>'That\'s my room over there.','source_text'=>'Itu bilik saya di sebelah sana.','order'=>292],
            ['start_time'=>669,'end_time'=>670.3,'target_text'=>'Leon\'s room is over there.','source_text'=>'Bilik Leon di sebelah sana.','order'=>293],
            ['start_time'=>670.4,'end_time'=>673.66,'target_text'=>'Leon\'s washroom\'s here, and my washroom is inside the room.','source_text'=>'Tandas Leon di sini, dan tandas saya ada di dalam bilik.','order'=>294],
            ['start_time'=>673.76,'end_time'=>675.38,'target_text'=>'This right here is our living room.','source_text'=>'Yang di sebelah sini pula ialah ruang tamu kami.','order'=>295],
            ['start_time'=>675.48,'end_time'=>678.98,'target_text'=>'We have a TV, and this is our dining table.','source_text'=>'Kami ada televisyen, dan ini meja makan kami.','order'=>296],
            ['start_time'=>679.08,'end_time'=>684.94,'target_text'=>'So, this is where we\'ll eat, and this is our kitchen area, where we will be doing a lot of cooking, eh?','source_text'=>'Jadi, di sinilah tempat kami makan, dan ini bahagian dapur kami, tempat kita akan banyak memasak nanti, kan?','order'=>297],
            ['start_time'=>685.04,'end_time'=>689.06,'target_text'=>'So much Oh, we didn\'t buy oil or butter for the eggs.','source_text'=>'Banyak sangat Oh, kita terlupa beli minyak atau mentega untuk masak telur tadi.','order'=>298],
            ['start_time'=>689.16,'end_time'=>689.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, that\'s right.','source_text'=>'Oh, betul juga itu.','order'=>299],
            ['start_time'=>690.04,'end_time'=>692.66,'target_text'=>'I don\'t even know what kind of pans and stuff we have here.','source_text'=>'Saya langsung tak tahu kuali atau periuk jenis apa yang ada di sini.','order'=>300],
            ['start_time'=>692.76,'end_time'=>694.86,'target_text'=>'>> I guess we\'ll just have to boil the eggs.','source_text'=>'Nampaknya kita terpaksa rebus sajalah telur itu.','order'=>301],
            ['start_time'=>694.96,'end_time'=>695.54,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s fine.','source_text'=>'Okey sahaja itu.','order'=>302],
            ['start_time'=>695.64,'end_time'=>696.66,'target_text'=>'>> And eat boiled eggs.','source_text'=>'Dan makan telur rebus.','order'=>303],
            ['start_time'=>696.76,'end_time'=>698.22,'target_text'=>'>> Do we even have salt and pepper?','source_text'=>'Kita ada garam dan lada sulah ke?','order'=>304],
            ['start_time'=>698.32,'end_time'=>699.18,'target_text'=>'>> No idea.','source_text'=>'Entahlah, tiada idea.','order'=>305],
            ['start_time'=>699.28,'end_time'=>702.42,'target_text'=>'>> Uh but we have a lot of utensils here, so >> Okay, guys.','source_text'=>'Tapi kita ada banyak perkakas dapur di sini, jadi Okey, kawan-kawan.','order'=>306],
            ['start_time'=>702.52,'end_time'=>706.94,'target_text'=>'So, Leon asked me if this water tastes like Dasani.','source_text'=>'Tadi Leon tanya saya adakah air ini rasanya macam Dasani.','order'=>307],
            ['start_time'=>707.04,'end_time'=>717.06,'target_text'=>'This water brand is Dessa, but uh there is a water brand in North America called Dasani, which is the worst water ever.','source_text'=>'Jenama air ini ialah Dessa, tapi ada satu jenama air di Amerika Utara bernama Dasani, yang merupakan air paling teruk pernah ada.','order'=>308],
            ['start_time'=>717.16,'end_time'=>722.42,'target_text'=>'It\'s owned by uh the Coca-Cola company, but Dasani, no one buys that.','source_text'=>'Ia dimiliki oleh syarikat Coca-Cola, tapi Dasani, tiada siapa yang beli.','order'=>309],
            ['start_time'=>722.52,'end_time'=>731.02,'target_text'=>'Recently, there was a There was a big snowstorm that went through America, and I saw videos on TikTok of like grocery stores','source_text'=>'Baru-baru ini, ada ribut salji besar yang melanda Amerika, dan saya tengok video di TikTok memaparkan kedai-kedai runcit','order'=>310],
            ['start_time'=>731.12,'end_time'=>738.82,'target_text'=>'completely empty because people were stocking up on different products and different uh essentials so that they could wait','source_text'=>'kosong sepenuhnya sebab orang ramai membeli stok pelbagai produk dan barang keperluan untuk bertahan','order'=>311],
            ['start_time'=>738.92,'end_time'=>741.9,'target_text'=>'out the snowstorm without worrying about supplies.','source_text'=>'sepanjang ribut salji tanpa bimbang kehabisan bekalan.','order'=>312],
            ['start_time'=>742,'end_time'=>748.94,'target_text'=>'And then they were showing the water section, and the only water brand that no one bought was Dasani.','source_text'=>'Dan kemudian mereka tunjukkan bahagian air minuman, dan satu-satunya jenama air yang tiada siapa beli langsung ialah Dasani.','order'=>313],
            ['start_time'=>749.04,'end_time'=>750.9,'target_text'=>'The whole aisle was cleared.','source_text'=>'Keseluruhan lorong air habis licin.','order'=>314],
            ['start_time'=>751,'end_time'=>757.54,'target_text'=>'There were no other water brands on the water aisle because everyone bought them all.','source_text'=>'Tiada jenama air lain langsung di lorong air itu sebab semua orang beli habis.','order'=>315],
            ['start_time'=>757.64,'end_time'=>761.82,'target_text'=>'All the other brands were sold out at this particular grocery store.','source_text'=>'Semua jenama lain habis terjual di kedai runcit tersebut.','order'=>316],
            ['start_time'=>761.92,'end_time'=>765.74,'target_text'=>'The only brand that was still full was Dasani.','source_text'=>'Satu-satunya jenama yang masih tersusun penuh di rak ialah Dasani.','order'=>317],
            ['start_time'=>765.84,'end_time'=>769.54,'target_text'=>'That just shows you how much people hate Dasani.','source_text'=>'Itu membuktikan betapa orang ramai benci jenama Dasani.','order'=>318],
            ['start_time'=>769.64,'end_time'=>772.7,'target_text'=>'They really do not like the taste of Dasani, and I agree.','source_text'=>'Mereka memang langsung tak suka rasa Dasani, dan saya setuju.','order'=>319],
            ['start_time'=>772.8,'end_time'=>775.5,'target_text'=>'Dasani tastes like chlorinated water.','source_text'=>'Rasa Dasani macam air klorin.','order'=>320],
            ['start_time'=>775.6,'end_time'=>776.42,'target_text'=>'It tastes terrible.','source_text'=>'Rasanya sangat teruk.','order'=>321],
            ['start_time'=>776.52,'end_time'=>783.18,'target_text'=>'It tastes like you took a bottle, and you went to your pool, and you filled it up with water, and then you just started drinking','source_text'=>'Rasanya macam awak ambil botol, pergi ke kolam renang awak, isi penuh dengan air, dan kemudian awak minum','order'=>322],
            ['start_time'=>783.28,'end_time'=>783.64,'target_text'=>'that.','source_text'=>'air itu.','order'=>323],
            ['start_time'=>783.64,'end_time'=>789.1,'target_text'=>'And all of a sudden, this video is turning into like me roasting Dasani, but I\'m just telling you guys the facts.','source_text'=>'Dan tiba-tiba video ini bertukar jadi sesi saya membahan Dasani, tapi saya cuma beritahu anda semua fakta sebenar.','order'=>324],
            ['start_time'=>789.2,'end_time'=>791.9,'target_text'=>'Dasani does not taste good in North America.','source_text'=>'Dasani memang tak sedap di Amerika Utara.','order'=>325],
            ['start_time'=>792,'end_time'=>796.5,'target_text'=>'But here, we had Dasani in Malaysia, and it wasn\'t that bad, actually.','source_text'=>'Tapi di sini, kami pernah minum Dasani di Malaysia, dan rasanya tidaklah teruk sebenarnya.','order'=>326],
            ['start_time'=>796.6,'end_time'=>803.98,'target_text'=>'It tasted completely different than the Dasani in North America, obviously, because they have different bottling facilities.','source_text'=>'Rasanya berbeza sama sekali dengan Dasani di Amerika Utara, tentulah kerana kilang pembotolannya berbeza.','order'=>327],
            ['start_time'=>804.08,'end_time'=>806.38,'target_text'=>'So, the water doesn\'t come from the same place.','source_text'=>'Jadi punca airnya bukan dari tempat yang sama.','order'=>328],
            ['start_time'=>806.48,'end_time'=>808.7,'target_text'=>'That\'s why it probably tastes different.','source_text'=>'Sebab itulah rasanya berbeza.','order'=>329],
            ['start_time'=>808.8,'end_time'=>810.38,'target_text'=>'Anyways, I tried this water.','source_text'=>'Apa-apa pun, saya dah rasa air ini.','order'=>330],
            ['start_time'=>810.48,'end_time'=>813.44,'target_text'=>'Let me try it again for you guys.','source_text'=>'Biar saya rasa sekali lagi untuk anda semua.','order'=>331],
            ['start_time'=>815.56,'end_time'=>816.38,'target_text'=>'It\'s actually not bad.','source_text'=>'Sebenarnya tidaklah teruk.','order'=>332],
            ['start_time'=>816.48,'end_time'=>820.86,'target_text'=>'It kind of has like a little little little bit of sweetness to it.','source_text'=>'Ia ada sedikit rasa manis yang sangat halus.','order'=>333],
            ['start_time'=>820.96,'end_time'=>823.7,'target_text'=>'But besides that, it tastes great and it\'s warm.','source_text'=>'Tapi selain itu, rasanya sedap dan suhunya biasa (tidak sejuk).','order'=>334],
            ['start_time'=>823.8,'end_time'=>828.66,'target_text'=>'Usually warm water doesn\'t taste as good, but this water tastes perfectly fine.','source_text'=>'Biasanya air suam rasanya tak berapa sedap, tapi air ini rasanya elok sahaja.','order'=>335],
            ['start_time'=>828.76,'end_time'=>829.58,'target_text'=>'Nothing wrong with it.','source_text'=>'Tiada masalah langsung dengannya.','order'=>336],
            ['start_time'=>829.68,'end_time'=>836.18,'target_text'=>'But yeah, I just wanted to give you guys that history and little bit of information on Dasani.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, saya cuma nak kongsikan sejarah dan sedikit maklumat tentang Dasani kepada anda.','order'=>337],
            ['start_time'=>836.28,'end_time'=>844.18,'target_text'=>'The other thing I noticed is that these bananas, this bunch of bananas, look completely different than the bananas that we','source_text'=>'Satu lagi perkara yang saya perasan ialah pisang-pisang ini, sesikat pisang ini, nampak berbeza sama sekali dengan pisang yang kami','order'=>338],
            ['start_time'=>844.28,'end_time'=>845.58,'target_text'=>'get in North America.','source_text'=>'dapat di Amerika Utara.','order'=>339],
            ['start_time'=>845.68,'end_time'=>850.94,'target_text'=>'In Canada and the United States, we only get Cavendish bananas.','source_text'=>'Di Kanada dan Amerika Syarikat, kami cuma dapat pisang Cavendish.','order'=>340],
            ['start_time'=>851.04,'end_time'=>853.46,'target_text'=>'I believe they are called Cavendish bananas.','source_text'=>'Saya percaya namanya pisang Cavendish.','order'=>341],
            ['start_time'=>853.56,'end_time'=>856.14,'target_text'=>'Yo, Leon, what are the bananas we get in Canada called?','source_text'=>'Leon, apa nama pisang yang kita selalu dapat di Kanada?','order'=>342],
            ['start_time'=>856.24,'end_time'=>857.86,'target_text'=>'Cavendish bananas, eh?','source_text'=>'Pisang Cavendish, kan?','order'=>343],
            ['start_time'=>857.96,'end_time'=>858.82,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah.','source_text'=>'Ya.','order'=>344],
            ['start_time'=>858.92,'end_time'=>861.26,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, so they are called Cavendish bananas.','source_text'=>'Ya, namanya pisang Cavendish.','order'=>345],
            ['start_time'=>861.36,'end_time'=>864.62,'target_text'=>'These ones are definitely not Cavendish bananas.','source_text'=>'Yang ini pasti bukan pisang Cavendish.','order'=>346],
            ['start_time'=>864.72,'end_time'=>867.54,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure what these bananas are called.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti apa nama pisang ini.','order'=>347],
            ['start_time'=>867.64,'end_time'=>869.38,'target_text'=>'But let\'s try them.','source_text'=>'Tapi jom kita cuba rasa.','order'=>348],
            ['start_time'=>869.48,'end_time'=>872.34,'target_text'=>'I do love love love bananas.','source_text'=>'Saya memang sangat-sangat sukakan pisang.','order'=>349],
            ['start_time'=>872.44,'end_time'=>875.5,'target_text'=>'Truly, bananas are one of my favorite fruit.','source_text'=>'Sejujurnya, pisang adalah antara buah kegemaran saya.','order'=>350],
            ['start_time'=>875.6,'end_time'=>876.54,'target_text'=>'I love bananas.','source_text'=>'Saya suka pisang.','order'=>351],
            ['start_time'=>876.64,'end_time'=>881.34,'target_text'=>'They just have like this creaminess to them that really makes it like enjoyable to eat.','source_text'=>'Ia ada tekstur berkrim yang membuatkannya sangat sedap untuk dimakan.','order'=>352],
            ['start_time'=>881.44,'end_time'=>883.82,'target_text'=>'And they especially go well in smoothies.','source_text'=>'Dan ia sangat sesuai dimasukkan ke dalam smoothie.','order'=>353],
            ['start_time'=>883.92,'end_time'=>891.38,'target_text'=>'I love putting a banana, just one, in my fruit smoothie and it makes it like a lot thicker and creamier.','source_text'=>'Saya suka letak pisang, sebiji sahaja, dalam smoothie buah saya dan ia menjadikannya jauh lebih pekat dan berkrim.','order'=>354],
            ['start_time'=>891.48,'end_time'=>894.72,'target_text'=>'Now, let\'s try the banana.','source_text'=>'Sekarang, jom kita rasa pisang ini.','order'=>355],
            ['start_time'=>896.76,'end_time'=>900.38,'target_text'=>'I feel like the Cavendish banana is sweeter and creamier.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa pisang Cavendish lebih manis dan berkrim.','order'=>356],
            ['start_time'=>900.48,'end_time'=>901.38,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s not a Cavendish?','source_text'=>'Yang itu bukan Cavendish ke?','order'=>357],
            ['start_time'=>901.48,'end_time'=>903.14,'target_text'=>'>> Does this look like a Cavendish to you?','source_text'=>'Ini nampak macam Cavendish ke pada pandangan awak?','order'=>358],
            ['start_time'=>903.24,'end_time'=>906.46,'target_text'=>'>> Dude, like 99% of the bananas that are sold >> No.','source_text'=>'Kawan, hampir 99% pisang yang dijual Bukan.','order'=>359],
            ['start_time'=>906.56,'end_time'=>907.66,'target_text'=>'>> in supermarkets are Cavendish.','source_text'=>'di pasar raya adalah Cavendish.','order'=>360],
            ['start_time'=>907.76,'end_time'=>909.58,'target_text'=>'Yeah, this is a short >> America.','source_text'=>'Ya, yang ini pendek Amerika.','order'=>361],
            ['start_time'=>909.68,'end_time'=>910.7,'target_text'=>'>> No, in the world.','source_text'=>'Bukan, di seluruh dunia.','order'=>362],
            ['start_time'=>910.8,'end_time'=>911.22,'target_text'=>'>> No.','source_text'=>'Tidak.','order'=>363],
            ['start_time'=>911.32,'end_time'=>914.54,'target_text'=>'I guarantee you that no Cavendish will have a bottom like this.','source_text'=>'Saya boleh jamin pada awak yang tiada pisang Cavendish akan ada bahagian hujung bawah macam ini.','order'=>364],
            ['start_time'=>914.64,'end_time'=>920.42,'target_text'=>'You know, I\'m not a banana expert, so I could be wrong, but if I was a betting man, I would not bet that this is a Cavendish','source_text'=>'Awak tahu, saya bukanlah pakar pisang, jadi saya mungkin silap, tapi kalau saya kena bertaruh, saya takkan bertaruh bahawa ini pisang','order'=>365],
            ['start_time'=>920.52,'end_time'=>920.84,'target_text'=>'banana.','source_text'=>'Cavendish.','order'=>366],
            ['start_time'=>920.84,'end_time'=>921.34,'target_text'=>'>> me take a picture.','source_text'=>'Biar saya ambil gambar.','order'=>367],
            ['start_time'=>921.44,'end_time'=>926.7,'target_text'=>'>> There are >> literally hundreds, if not thousands, of species of bananas.','source_text'=>'Terdapat secara harfiahnya beratus-ratus, jika bukan beribu-ribu, spesies pisang.','order'=>368],
            ['start_time'=>926.8,'end_time'=>929.5,'target_text'=>'So, I highly doubt that these are Cavendish.','source_text'=>'Jadi, saya sangat ragu bahawa pisang ini jenis Cavendish.','order'=>369],
            ['start_time'=>929.6,'end_time'=>931.74,'target_text'=>'>> I know, but like I think the stat is like crazy.','source_text'=>'Saya tahu, tapi statistik itu memang luar biasa.','order'=>370],
            ['start_time'=>931.84,'end_time'=>933.7,'target_text'=>'It\'s like 99.9%','source_text'=>'Sekitar 99.9%','order'=>371],
            ['start_time'=>933.8,'end_time'=>934.42,'target_text'=>'are Cavendish.','source_text'=>'adalah Cavendish.','order'=>372],
            ['start_time'=>934.52,'end_time'=>939.26,'target_text'=>'And the only place you can really buy other species is like local markets or you grow it yourself.','source_text'=>'Dan satu-satunya tempat awak boleh beli spesies lain adalah seperti pasar tempatan atau awak tanam sendiri.','order'=>373],
            ['start_time'=>939.36,'end_time'=>939.76,'target_text'=>'>> I don\'t know.','source_text'=>'Entahlah.','order'=>374],
            ['start_time'=>939.76,'end_time'=>942.74,'target_text'=>'Here, I imagine they have a lot of banana production here.','source_text'=>'Di sini, saya bayangkan mereka ada banyak pengeluaran pisang tempatan.','order'=>375],
            ['start_time'=>942.84,'end_time'=>943.74,'target_text'=>'I don\'t think it\'s a Cavendish.','source_text'=>'Saya rasa ini bukan Cavendish.','order'=>376],
            ['start_time'=>943.84,'end_time'=>945.74,'target_text'=>'I could be wrong, but it\'s not bad.','source_text'=>'Saya mungkin silap, tapi rasanya tidaklah teruk.','order'=>377],
            ['start_time'=>945.84,'end_time'=>946.34,'target_text'=>'It\'s not bad.','source_text'=>'Rasanya tidaklah teruk.','order'=>378],
            ['start_time'=>946.44,'end_time'=>949.1,'target_text'=>'It\'s not as sweet and as creamy >> Oh.','source_text'=>'Cuma tak semanis dan sekrim Oh.','order'=>379],
            ['start_time'=>949.2,'end_time'=>950.14,'target_text'=>'>> as they are in Canada.','source_text'=>'macam yang ada di Kanada.','order'=>380],
            ['start_time'=>950.24,'end_time'=>951.78,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s called a baby banana.','source_text'=>'Ini dipanggil baby banana.','order'=>381],
            ['start_time'=>951.88,'end_time'=>952.62,'target_text'=>'>> A baby banana?','source_text'=>'Pisang \'baby banana\'?','order'=>382],
            ['start_time'=>952.72,'end_time'=>955.18,'target_text'=>'>> Or lady finger banana.','source_text'=>'Atau pisang \'lady finger\' (pisang emas).','order'=>383],
            ['start_time'=>955.28,'end_time'=>955.98,'target_text'=>'>> See guys?','source_text'=>'Tengok kawan-kawan?','order'=>384],
            ['start_time'=>956.08,'end_time'=>957.9,'target_text'=>'What did I tell you?','source_text'=>'Kan saya dah kata?','order'=>385],
            ['start_time'=>958,'end_time'=>960.62,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s a variation of a Cavendish.','source_text'=>'Ia sejenis variasi pisang Cavendish.','order'=>386],
            ['start_time'=>960.72,'end_time'=>961.74,'target_text'=>'>> But it\'s not.','source_text'=>'Tapi sebenarnya bukan.','order'=>387],
            ['start_time'=>961.84,'end_time'=>964.74,'target_text'=>'>> Oh, in Malaysia it it\'s called the pisang mas.','source_text'=>'Oh, di Malaysia ia dipanggil pisang mas.','order'=>388],
            ['start_time'=>964.84,'end_time'=>969.66,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, I was telling them about Dasani and how no one in North America drinks Dasani.','source_text'=>'Ya, saya baru ceritakan pada mereka tentang Dasani dan bagaimana tiada siapa di Amerika Utara minum Dasani.','order'=>389],
            ['start_time'=>969.76,'end_time'=>971.7,'target_text'=>'Or if they do, it\'s cuz they have to.','source_text'=>'Or kalau mereka minum pun, sebab mereka terpaksa.','order'=>390],
            ['start_time'=>971.8,'end_time'=>974.06,'target_text'=>'>> Yeah, it\'s not good stuff.','source_text'=>'Ya, itu memang bukan air yang sedap.','order'=>391],
            ['start_time'=>974.16,'end_time'=>975.18,'target_text'=>'>> It\'s not.','source_text'=>'Memang tak sedap.','order'=>392],
            ['start_time'=>975.28,'end_time'=>979.62,'target_text'=>'And I forgot to mention we also bought this laundry detergent.','source_text'=>'Dan saya terlupa nak sebut kita ada beli sabun pencuci baju ini juga.','order'=>393],
            ['start_time'=>979.72,'end_time'=>982.3,'target_text'=>'This is liquid laundry detergent.','source_text'=>'Ini cecair pencuci pakaian.','order'=>394],
            ['start_time'=>982.4,'end_time'=>987.06,'target_text'=>'You can also get pods, laundry pods, or powder.','source_text'=>'Anda juga boleh dapatkan jenis pod pencuci pakaian, atau serbuk.','order'=>395],
            ['start_time'=>987.16,'end_time'=>988.46,'target_text'=>'It comes in powder form as well.','source_text'=>'Ia juga ada dalam bentuk serbuk.','order'=>396],
            ['start_time'=>988.56,'end_time'=>989.78,'target_text'=>'I prefer pods.','source_text'=>'Saya lebih suka guna jenis pod.','order'=>397],
            ['start_time'=>989.88,'end_time'=>995.82,'target_text'=>'Those are the easiest cuz you just grab one pod and you throw it in with your clothes and you don\'t worry.','source_text'=>'Pod itu paling mudah sebab anda cuma ambil satu pod dan campak masuk bersama baju anda tanpa perlu pening kepala.','order'=>398],
            ['start_time'=>995.92,'end_time'=>999.06,'target_text'=>'This one you got to like pour it in, sometimes measure it out.','source_text'=>'Yang ini anda kena tuang masuk, kadang-kadang kena sukat dahulu.','order'=>399],
            ['start_time'=>999.16,'end_time'=>1002.26,'target_text'=>'So, it\'s like one more step, but it\'s really not a big deal.','source_text'=>'Jadi, macam ada satu langkah tambahan, tapi tidaklah jadi masalah besar pun.','order'=>400],
            ['start_time'=>1002.36,'end_time'=>1004.26,'target_text'=>'But yeah, we got this as well.','source_text'=>'Tapi ya, kita beli ini juga.','order'=>401],
            ['start_time'=>1004.36,'end_time'=>1005.5,'target_text'=>'>> Are you going to wash some clothes?','source_text'=>'Awak nak basuh baju ke?','order'=>402],
            ['start_time'=>1005.6,'end_time'=>1009.06,'target_text'=>'>> I have a lot of laundry from Penang that I need to wash.','source_text'=>'Saya ada banyak pakaian kotor dari Pulau Pinang yang saya perlu basuh.','order'=>403],
            ['start_time'=>1009.16,'end_time'=>1011.94,'target_text'=>'So, >> going to dry it cuz we don\'t have a dryer?','source_text'=>'Jadi, Macam mana nak keringkan sebab kita tiada mesin pengering (dryer)?','order'=>404],
            ['start_time'=>1012.04,'end_time'=>1013.34,'target_text'=>'>> That\'s a washer and dryer.','source_text'=>'Itu mesin basuh sekali pengering.','order'=>405],
            ['start_time'=>1013.44,'end_time'=>1013.94,'target_text'=>'>> Oh.','source_text'=>'Oh.','order'=>406],
            ['start_time'=>1014.04,'end_time'=>1017.94,'target_text'=>'>> But I will wash there, but I\'ll air dry outside.','source_text'=>'Tapi saya basuh di situ, dan saya jemur di luar bagi kering sendiri.','order'=>407],
            ['start_time'=>1018.04,'end_time'=>1019.18,'target_text'=>'Let me just show you our view.','source_text'=>'Biar saya tunjukkan pemandangan dari rumah kami.','order'=>408],
            ['start_time'=>1019.28,'end_time'=>1023.22,'target_text'=>'I am going to maybe do a full tour of our apartment.','source_text'=>'Saya mungkin akan buat jelajah penuh apartmen kami.','order'=>409],
            ['start_time'=>1023.32,'end_time'=>1026.3,'target_text'=>'If you guys want to see that, let me know in the comments if you want to see that.','source_text'=>'Jika anda semua nak tengok, beritahu saya di ruangan komen jika anda berminat.','order'=>410],
            ['start_time'=>1026.4,'end_time'=>1029.98,'target_text'=>'But for now, I\'ll just show you our beautiful view.','source_text'=>'Tapi buat masa ini, saya tunjukkan dulu pemandangan indah kami.','order'=>411],
            ['start_time'=>1030.08,'end_time'=>1033.66,'target_text'=>'First, let me put this filter on because it will be too bright.','source_text'=>'Mula-mula, biar saya pasang penapis ini sebab nanti cahaya terlalu terang.','order'=>412],
            ['start_time'=>1033.76,'end_time'=>1039.14,'target_text'=>'Okay, so I\'m going to open the door to our balcony and I\'ll show you the view here.','source_text'=>'Okey, jadi saya akan buka pintu balkoni dan saya tunjukkan pemandangan di sini.','order'=>413],
            ['start_time'=>1039.24,'end_time'=>1041.46,'target_text'=>'Look at that view.','source_text'=>'Tengok pemandangan itu.','order'=>414],
            ['start_time'=>1041.56,'end_time'=>1045.42,'target_text'=>'Over there we can see the five main towers of Kuala Lumpur.','source_text'=>'Di sebelah sana kita boleh nampak lima menara utama Kuala Lumpur.','order'=>415],
            ['start_time'=>1045.52,'end_time'=>1049.98,'target_text'=>'There you have arguably the most famous of them all, the Petronas Twin Towers.','source_text'=>'Di situ ada menara yang boleh dikatakan paling terkenal antara semua, Menara Berkembar Petronas.','order'=>416],
            ['start_time'=>1050.08,'end_time'=>1051.26,'target_text'=>'There is another one right there.','source_text'=>'Ada satu lagi betul-betul di situ.','order'=>417],
            ['start_time'=>1051.36,'end_time'=>1057.26,'target_text'=>'I\'m not sure the name and there is another one right there which is one of the tallest buildings in the world.','source_text'=>'Saya tak pasti namanya dan ada satu lagi di sana yang merupakan antara bangunan tertinggi di dunia.','order'=>418],
            ['start_time'=>1057.36,'end_time'=>1058.78,'target_text'=>'So yeah, that\'s our view.','source_text'=>'Jadi ya, itulah pemandangan kami.','order'=>419],
            ['start_time'=>1058.88,'end_time'=>1060.26,'target_text'=>'Let me know what you guys think.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya apa pendapat anda semua.','order'=>420],
            ['start_time'=>1060.36,'end_time'=>1067.22,'target_text'=>'I said in a previous video that I really want to have a balcony with a nice view and uh that\'s why we decided to rent this','source_text'=>'Saya pernah cakap dalam video sebelum ini yang saya sangat mahukan balkoni dengan pemandangan cantik dan sebab itulah kami sewa','order'=>421],
            ['start_time'=>1067.32,'end_time'=>1069.78,'target_text'=>'place for the month because it has a nice view.','source_text'=>'tempat ini untuk sebulan sebab ada pemandangan yang memukau.','order'=>422],
            ['start_time'=>1069.88,'end_time'=>1072.46,'target_text'=>'Let me know guys, what do you think of the POV?','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya kawan-kawan, apa pendapat anda tentang sudut pandang kamera (POV) ini?','order'=>423],
            ['start_time'=>1072.56,'end_time'=>1074.66,'target_text'=>'Because for the POV','source_text'=>'Sebab untuk sudut pandang POV','order'=>424],
            ['start_time'=>1074.76,'end_time'=>1078.18,'target_text'=>'I use this camera and I mount it onto my chest.','source_text'=>'saya guna kamera ini dan lekatkan pada dada saya.','order'=>425],
            ['start_time'=>1078.28,'end_time'=>1080.34,'target_text'=>'So then you guys can see my POV.','source_text'=>'Jadi anda semua boleh nampak pandangan dari sudut mata saya (POV).','order'=>426],
            ['start_time'=>1080.44,'end_time'=>1082.54,'target_text'=>'So this is essentially what I\'m looking at.','source_text'=>'Jadi inilah apa yang saya sedang lihat secara langsung.','order'=>427],
            ['start_time'=>1082.64,'end_time'=>1090.14,'target_text'=>'So let me know, do you guys want to see more videos with that camera from my POV and then explaining stuff in English using','source_text'=>'Jadi beritahu saya, adakah anda nak tonton lebih banyak video menggunakan kamera itu dari POV saya sambil menerangkan sesuatu dalam bahasa Inggeris menggunakan','order'=>428],
            ['start_time'=>1090.24,'end_time'=>1095.14,'target_text'=>'comprehensible input and also talking clearly and slowly.','source_text'=>'kaedah input mudah difahami dan bercakap secara perlahan serta jelas.','order'=>429],
            ['start_time'=>1095.24,'end_time'=>1098.22,'target_text'=>'If you want more videos like that, let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'Kalau anda mahukan lebih banyak video seperti itu, beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>430],
            ['start_time'=>1098.32,'end_time'=>1105.38,'target_text'=>'If not, then I\'ll stick to using this camera and uh it\'ll be like this, more like Leon holding the camera or me holding the','source_text'=>'Kalau tidak, saya akan kekal guna kamera ini dan ia akan jadi begini, lebih kepada Leon pegang kamera atau saya pegang','order'=>431],
            ['start_time'=>1105.48,'end_time'=>1107.78,'target_text'=>'camera and talking like this.','source_text'=>'kamera dan bercakap seperti ini.','order'=>432],
            ['start_time'=>1107.88,'end_time'=>1109.1,'target_text'=>'Or do you like the POV?','source_text'=>'Or adakah anda lebih suka format POV?','order'=>433],
            ['start_time'=>1109.2,'end_time'=>1116.62,'target_text'=>'The whole video doesn\'t have to be POV, but maybe portions like the grocery store or doing something else can be POV cuz sometimes','source_text'=>'Keseluruhan video tak semestinya POV, tapi mungkin sebahagian babak seperti di kedai runcit atau buat aktiviti lain boleh dibuat POV sebab kadang-kadang','order'=>434],
            ['start_time'=>1116.72,'end_time'=>1119.02,'target_text'=>'it\'s easier to go film with that small camera.','source_text'=>'lebih mudah untuk merakam dengan kamera kecil itu.','order'=>435],
            ['start_time'=>1119.12,'end_time'=>1122.3,'target_text'=>'Let me know if you guys liked it or not and I\'ll see you guys in the next video.','source_text'=>'Beritahu saya sama ada anda suka atau tidak dan jumpa anda semua dalam video seterusnya.','order'=>436],
