            ['start_time'=>680.16,'end_time'=>686.7,'target_text'=>'I\'m a bit lost.\" The third question, how can you refuse someone politely?','source_text'=>'I\'m a bit lost.\" Soalan ketiga, bagaimana cara menolak permintaan seseorang secara sopan?','order'=>224],
            ['start_time'=>686.8,'end_time'=>694.06,'target_text'=>'\"Sorry, not right now.\" If you guys liked this video and you want to see more videos like these where it\'s a mix of talking','source_text'=>'\"Sorry, not right now.\" Jika anda semua sukakan video ini dan mahu lihat lebih banyak video seperti ini iaitu gabungan bercakap','order'=>225],
            ['start_time'=>694.16,'end_time'=>699.98,'target_text'=>'to the camera but also live comprehensible input vlogs, then let me know in the comments.','source_text'=>'ke kamera dan juga vlog input mudah difahami secara langsung, beritahu saya di ruangan komen.','order'=>226],
            ['start_time'=>700.08,'end_time'=>707.3,'target_text'=>'If you\'re serious about becoming fluent in English, I\'ve built a full speaking, shadowing, and pronunciation course you can','source_text'=>'Jika anda serius ingin fasih berbahasa Inggeris, saya telah membina kursus pertuturan, teknik shadowing, dan sebutan yang lengkap yang anda boleh','order'=>227],
            ['start_time'=>707.4,'end_time'=>709.26,'target_text'=>'follow step-by-step.','source_text'=>'ikuti langkah demi langkah.','order'=>228],
